{"id": "21123", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21123", "title": "Cerebral(company)", "text": "Cerebral Inc. ni isosiyete y'Abanyamerika ikorera mu rwego rwa telehealth, itanga serivisi z'ubuzima bwo mu mutwe hifashishijwe ikoranabuhanga, zirimo ubujyanama, ibiganiro na muganga (therapy), ndetse no gucunga imiti ikoreshwa mu kuvura indwara zitandukanye zo mu mutwe. \nAmateka.\nCerebral yashinzwe mu 2020 na Kyle Robertson na Ho Anh. Isosiyete yahise igabanya ibikorwa byayo muri Amerika yose kandi ikura urusobe rwayo irimo abaganga babarirwa mu bihumbi babifitemo uruhushya. \nKera, Cerebral yafatanije na gymnast hamwe n'uwatsindiye umudari wa zahabu mu mikino Olempike Simone Biles nk'umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019ingaruka. \nMuri Kamena 2021, isosiyete yakusanyije miliyoni 127 z'amadolari, ifite agaciro ka miliyari 1.2. Mu Kuboza 2021, Cerebral yakusanyije miliyoni 300 z'amadolari mu cyiciro cy\u2019inkunga ya Series C iyobowe na SoftBank Vision Fund 2, bituma igiciro cy\u2019isosiyete kigera kuri miliyari 4.8. Muri iki cyiciro harimo abashoramari nka Prysm Capital, Access Industries, na WestCap Group. \nMu 2022, Ubwonko bwaragenzuwe kubera imikorere yabugenewe, cyane cyane ku bintu bigenzurwa nka Adderall. Minisiteri y'Ubutabera yo muri Amerika (DOJ) yatangiye gukora iperereza ku kurenga ku itegeko rigenga ibiyobyabwenge. Mu gusubiza, Cerebral yatangaje ko izahagarika imiti myinshi yandikiwe ibintu. \nNyuma yo gusohoka kwa Kyle Robertson, muri Gicurasi 2022, Ubwonko bwaragize ibibazo bikomeye, harimo ku gabanya abakozi no guhindura ingamba, mu gihe hagenzuwe amabwiriza ndetse n\u2019ingutu z\u2019amafaranga. Kyle Robertson kuva ubwo yasanze Zealthy, isosiyete ikora imiti. David Mou, yinjiye kuba umuyobozi mukuru hagati ya 2022, wahoze ari umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019ikigo.\nUgushyingo 2024, Cerebral yaje kwemera kwishyura miliyoni 3.65 z'amadolari kugira ngo ikemure iperereza rya DOJ. \nMou yeguye ku mirimo ye mu Kuboza 2024. Brian Reinken wahoze mu bagize inama y'ubutegetsi, kuva yatangira kuba umuyobozi mukuru w'agateganyo. \nMuri Kanama 2025, Cerebral yatangaje ko yaguze Resilience Lab, isosiyete y\u2019ubuzima y\u2019imyitwarire yibanda ku guhugura abaganga b\u2019ubuzima bwo mu mutwe hakiri kare no kugabanya umuriro w\u2019abaganga no gucuruza.\nCerebral yavuze ko iteganya kwagura urugero rw\u2019amahugurwa ya Resilience Lab hamwe na protocole ku rubuga rwayo kugira ngo hongerwe ireme ry'ubuvuzi, ibisubizo by'abakiriya, ndetse n'ibisubizo bifatika ku bishyura ubwishingizi. \nSerivisi.\nCerebral itanga serivisi zo gufasha mu buzima bwo mu mutwe hifashishijwe internet,zirimo ubuvuzi bwo mu buryo bw'ibiganiro (therapy), issuzuma rikorwa n'abaganga b'inzobere mu mutwe (psychiatrist evaluations), gucunga imikoreshereze y'imiti (medication management), ndetse no gutanga ubufasha buhoraho (ongoing support). Ihuriro rikoresha uburyo bwo kwiyandikisha kandi rikoresha ikoranabuhanga rya telehealth kugirango rihuze abakoresha nabavuzi babifitemo uruhushya. "}
{"id": "21124", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21124", "title": "LifeMD", "text": "LifeMD, Inc. ni sosiyete ya Amerika ikorera mu rwego rwa telehealth, kandi icuruza ku isoko ry'imari rusange (publicly traded company). Iyi serivisi ituma abakiriya babona abagnga n'abaforomo b'inzobere (nurse practitioners) kugira ngo bagirirwe inama z'ubuvuzi hifashishijwe ikoranabuhanga (virtual medical consultations) ndetse banahabwe ubuvuzi hakoreshejwe imiti yanditswe n'umuganga (prescription medications). \nAmateka.\nIsosiyete yashinzwe nka ImmuDyne, Inc. mu 1994 kandi yakoze igurishwa ry'imigabane rya mbere ku isoko rusange (IPO) muri 2001. Mu mwaka 2018, yahinduriye izina ikitwa Convesion Labs,Inc, aho Justin Schreiber yashyizwe ku mwanya w'Umuyobozi Mukuru (Chief Executive Officer) Isosiyete yahinduye izina yitwa LifeMD muri 2020 itangira gukoresha izina rya ticker LFMD. \nMu gihembwe cya mbere cya 2025, LifeMD yatangaje ko amafaranga yinjije yiyongereyeho 49% YoY agera kuri miliyoni 65.7. \nSerivisi.\nMuri Nzeri 2022, LifeMD yahaye Bobby Jindal wahoze ari guverineri wa Louisiana mu nama y'ubuyobozi. \nMuri kamena 2023, LifeMD yatangaje gahunda yo gucunga ibiro kugirango yandike imiti ya GLP-1 yujuje ibisabwa mugihe cyo kubonana na muganga. Yatangiye gahunda yicyitegererezo hamwe na Medifast, nyuma itangaza ubufatanye hagati yamasosiyete kugirango ihuze abakiriya bayo. LifeMD kandi yakiriye ishoramari rya miliyoni 20 z'amadolari ya Medifast muri kiriya gihe. \nIsosiyete yashyizeho ubwishingizi bw\u2019ubuzima bwigenga mu \nMuri Werurwe 2025, LifeMD yashyize umukono ku masezerano yo guha Eli Zilly imiti igabanya ibiro Zepbound ku barwayi bishyura. By'umwihariko, amasezerano yasinywe n\u2019umufatanyabikorwa wa farumasi ya LillyDirect, aho ibicuruzwa bya Zepbound bigurishwa ku giciro ku bakiriya bishyura amafaranga. Ububiko bwa LifeMD bwazamutse mu 2025 nyuma y\u2019amasezerano yagiranye na Novo Nordisk yo guha Wegovy binyuze kuri platform ya LifeMD ku giciro gito. \nMuri Mata 2025, LifeMD yaguze ubuvuzi bw\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019umugore Optimal Human Health MD, kugira ngo bushinge umusingi w\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019imisemburo, metabolisme, n\u2019ubucucike bw\u2019amagufwa kuri platifomu. "}
{"id": "21125", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21125", "title": "Itangazo rya Cairo ku burenganzira bwa muntu muri Islamu", "text": "Itangazo rya Cairo ryerekeye uburenganzira bwa muntu muri Islamu (CDHRI) ry\u2019ibihugu bigize Umuryango w\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubufatanye bwa kisilamu (OIC) mbere i Cairo, mu Misiri, ku ya 5 Kanama 1990, Inyandiko ya 1990 yemeza ko shariya ya kisilamu ari yo soko yonyine, mu gihe verisiyo ya 2020 idasaba shariya.\nCDHRI yatangaje ko intego yayo ari \"ubuyobozi rusange ku bihugu bigize Umuryango [OIC] mu bijyanye n'uburenganzira bwa muntu\". Iri tangazo ryemerwa cyane nk'igisubizo cya kisilamu ku itangazo ry\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ryita ku burenganzira bwa muntu (UDHR), ryemejwe mu 1948. Riremeza ko bamwe, ariko atari bose, ba UDHR kandi rikaba ari inyandiko nzima y\u2019amabwiriza y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu yashyizweho n\u2019abanyamuryango ba OIC gukurikiza, ariko akababuza ku buryo bugaragara imipaka yashyizweho na shariya. Kubera iyi mipaka, CDHRI yanenzwe nkugerageza gukingira ibihugu bigize OIC kunengwa n\u2019amahanga kubera ihohoterwa ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu, ndetse no kutubahiriza ubwisanzure bw\u2019amadini, bifite ishingiro ku gihano cy\u2019umubiri no kwemerera ivangura ridafite abayisilamu n\u2019abagore.\nAmateka.\nIbihugu bitandukanye by\u2019abayisilamu byari binenze Itangazo mpuzamahanga ry\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu ryo mu 1948 kubera ko rititaye ku bijyanye n\u2019umuco n\u2019idini by\u2019ibihugu bitari Iburengerazuba. Mu 1981, Said Rajaie-Khorassani - uhagarariye Irani nyuma y\u2019impinduramatwara muri Loni - yavuze uko igihugu cye gihagaze ku bijyanye na UDHR, avuga ko ari \"imyumvire idahwitse y\u2019imyumvire y\u2019umuco wa gikirisitu ya gikirisitu \", idashobora gushyirwa mu bikorwa n\u2019abayisilamu batanyuranyije n\u2019amategeko ya kisilamu. \nCDHRI yemejwe mu 1990 n\u2019abanyamuryango b\u2019umuryango w\u2019inama ya kisilamu. Kugeza mu mwaka wa 2012, yari yarasinywe n'ibihugu 45. Mu 1992, CDHRI yashyikirijwe Komisiyo y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ishinzwe uburenganzira bwa muntu, aho yamaganwe cyane na komisiyo mpuzamahanga y\u2019abahanga mu mategeko.\nIri tangazo ritangira rivuga ngo \"Abantu bose bagize umuryango umwe abayoboke bahujwe no kugandukira Allah no gukomoka kuri Adamu\", kandi bibuza \"ivangura rishingiye ku bwoko, ibara, ururimi, imyizerere, igitsina, idini, amashyaka ya politiki, imibereho cyangwa ibindi bitekerezo\". Ikomeza itangaza ko ubuzima bwera, ikanatangaza ko \"kubungabunga ubuzima bwa muntu\" ari \"inshingano yashyizweho na Shariya\". CDHRI iremeza kandi abadafite intambara - nk'abasaza, abagore n'abana, inkomere n'abarwayi, n'imfungwa z'intambara - uburenganzira bwo kurya, aho kuba, no kubona umutekano no kwivuza mu gihe cy'intambara. \nCDHRI iha abagore \"icyubahiro cya muntu kimwe\", \"uburenganzira bwabo bwo kwishimira\", \"inshingano zo gukora\", \"umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta\", \"ubwigenge bw\u2019amafaranga\", n \"\" uburenganzira bwo kugumana izina rye n\u2019umuryango \". Abagabo n'abagore bombi bahabwa \"uburenganzira bwo gushyingirwa\" batitaye ku bwoko bwabo, ibara ryabo, cyangwa ubwenegihugu. Iri tangazo rituma ababyeyi bombi bagomba kurinda umwana, haba mbere na nyuma yo kuvuka, mu gihe ashimangira ko umugabo afite inshingano zo kurengera imibereho n'imibereho y'umuryango we, harimo abana ndetse n'abagore. \nItangazo ryemera uburenganzira ku mutungo n\u2019ibanga ku bantu ku giti cyabo. Ingingo ya 18 (b) ivuga ko \"Umuntu wese afite uburenganzira bwo kwiherera mu bikorwa by\u2019ibikorwa bye bwite, mu rugo rwe, mu muryango we, ku bijyanye n\u2019umutungo we n\u2019umubano we. Ntabwo byemewe kuneka maneko, kumukurikirana cyangwa kumutesha izina ryiza. Leta izamurinda kwivanga ku bushake\". Irabuza gusenya no kwambura inzu iyo ari yo yose no kwirukana umuryango. Byongeye kandi, umuryango uramutse utandukanijwe mugihe, ni inshingano za leta \"gutegura gusura cyangwa guhurira mumiryango\". \nIngingo ya 10 y\u2019iryo tangazo igira iti: \"Islamu ni idini ry\u2019imiterere idahumanye. Birabujijwe gukoresha umuntu uwo ari we wese ku gahato cyangwa gukoresha ubukene bwe cyangwa ubujiji bwe kugira ngo amuhindure mu rindi dini cyangwa kutemera Imana.\" Kubera ko muri societe ya kisilamu impamvu zose zituma abantu bava mubuyisilamu bafatwa nk\u2019agahato cyangwa ubujiji, ibi birabuza rwose kuva mu idini ya Islam. \nIri tangazo ririnda buri muntu gufatwa atabishaka, iyicarubozo, gufatwa nabi, cyangwa uburakari. Byongeye kandi, ntamuntu numwe ugomba gukoreshwa mubushakashatsi bwubuvuzi cyangwa siyanse atabanje kubiherwa uruhushya cyangwa ibyago byubuzima bwe cyangwa ubuzima bwe. Irabuza kandi gufata bugwate umuntu uwo ari we wese \"ku ntego iyo ari yo yose\". Byongeye kandi, CDHRI yemeza ko ari umwere; icyaha kigomba kugaragazwa gusa binyuze mu rubanza \"aho [uregwa] azahabwa ingwate zose zo kwiregura\". Iri tangazo ribuza kandi gutangaza \"amategeko yihutirwa yatanga ubuyobozi bukuru ku bikorwa nk'ibyo\". Ingingo ya 19 iteganya ko nta bindi byaha cyangwa ibihano uretse ibivugwa muri shariya. Shariya yemerera igihano cyumubiri (gukubita, gutemwa) nigihano cyo kwicwa no gutera amabuye cyangwa gucibwa umutwe. Uburenganzira bwo gukora imirimo ya gukoreshwa gusa hakurikijwe shariya\nIri tangazo ryibanda kandi ku \"burenganzira busesuye bwo kwishyira ukizana no kwishyira ukizana \", no kurwanya ubucakara, gukandamizwa, gukoreshwa, no gukolonizwa. CDHRI itangaza ko kugendera ku mategeko, ishyiraho \"uburinganire n'ubutabera kuri bose\", hamwe n'imbogamizi ziteganijwe n'amategeko ya kisilamu. CDHRI yizeza kandi abantu bose \"uburenganzira bwo kugira uruhare mu buryo butaziguye cyangwa butaziguye mu micungire y\u2019ibikorwa rusange by\u2019igihugu cye\". CDHRI irabuza kandi gukoresha nabi ububasha \"bugengwa na Shariya ya Kisilamu.\" \nIngingo ya 22 (a) y\u2019iri tangazo igira iti: \"Umuntu wese afite uburenganzira bwo gutanga igitekerezo cye mu bwisanzure ku buryo butanyuranyije n\u2019amahame ya Shariya.\" Ingingo ya 22 (b) ivuga ko \"Umuntu wese afite uburenganzira bwo kunganira icyiza, no kwamamaza icyiza, no kuburira icyiza n'ikibi akurikije amahame ya Shariya ya Islamu.\" Ingingo ya 22 (c) igira iti: \"Amakuru ni ngombwa cyane muri sosiyete. Ntishobora gukoreshwa cyangwa gukoreshwa nabi ku buryo ishobora guhungabanya ubutagatifu n\u2019icyubahiro cy\u2019abahanuzi, gutesha agaciro indangagaciro mbwirizamuco cyangwa imyitwarire, gusenya, kwangiza cyangwa kwangiza sosiyete, cyangwa guca intege kwizera kwayo.\" Iri ni ukubuza mu buryo bweruye umudendezo wo kuvuga icyo ari cyo cyose gishobora gufatwa nk'igitutsi, igihano cyo gukora gishobora kuba urupfu kandi nk'amagambo y'iyi ngingo yemerera igihano cy'urupfu cyo gutukana binyuranyije na UDHR. Ingingo ya 22 (d) ivuga ko \"Ntabwo byemewe gukangura urwango rushingiye ku gukunda igihugu cyangwa ku nyigisho cyangwa gukora ikintu icyo ari cyo cyose gishobora gukangurira ivangura iryo ari ryo ryose.\" \nIbiranga idini.\nCDHRI ikoresha imvugo yisi yose isa n\u2019itangazo rusange ry\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu, ryakozwe mu buryo bwa kisilamu. Ijambo ryibanze ahanini ni amagambo y\u2019amadini, kandi umwihariko wa CDHRI urimo imirongo myinshi yerekeza kuri Korowani, shariya, hamwe n\u2019imyemerere y\u2019ubuyisilamu igaragara ku rundi rutonde mpuzamahanga rusa. CDHRI yanzuye mu ngingo ya 24 n'iya 25 ko uburenganzira n'ubwisanzure byose bivugwa bigengwa na shariya ya kisilamu, ari nayo nkomoko y'iryo tangazo. CDHRI itangaza ko idini ry'ukuri ari \"ingwate yo kuzamura icyubahiro nk'iki mu nzira igana ku butungane bwa muntu Ishyira kandi inshingano zo kurengera ubwo burenganzira kuri Umma yose. \nKunegura.\nCDHRI yanenzwe kuba yarashyizwe mu bikorwa n\u2019ibihugu byinshi bifite politiki n\u2019imigenzo itandukanye cyane by\u2019amadini bari bafite \"inyungu rusange mu kwambura intwaro mpuzamahanga kunenga uburenganzira bwabo mu gihugu.\" Ingingo ya 24 y\u2019iri tangazo igira iti: \"Uburenganzira n\u2019ubwisanzure byose biteganijwe muri iri tangazo bigengwa na Shariya ya Kisilamu.\" Ingingo ya 19 nayo igira iti: \"Nta cyaha cyangwa igihano kizabaho keretse ibiteganijwe muri Shariya.\" \nCDHRI yanenzwe n\u2019iburengerazuba kuba yarananiwe kwemerera Abayisilamu ubuhakanyi, nk \"\" uburenganzira bw\u2019ibanze kandi budasuzuguritse \". Mu itangazo ryanditse ryatanzwe n\u2019umuryango mpuzamahanga wita ku bantu n\u2019imyitwarire (IHEU), umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta mu rwego rw\u2019ubujyanama bwihariye, Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019uburezi ku isi (AWE) n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abaturage ku isi (AWC), hagaragaye impungenge nyinshi zerekana ko CDHRI igabanya uburenganzira bwa muntu, ubwisanzure mu idini, n\u2019ubwisanzure mu gutanga ibitekerezo. Iri tangazo ryanzuye rivuga ko \"Itangazo ry\u2019i Cairo ry\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu muri Islamu bigaragara ko ari ukugerageza kugabanya uburenganzira buvugwa muri UDHR n\u2019amasezerano mpuzamahanga. Ntabwo bushobora kubonwa ko bwuzuzanya n\u2019Itangazo Mpuzamahanga.\" \n2020 CDHRI.\nMuri Nzeri 2008, mu kiganiro yagejeje ku Muryango w'Abibumbye, Ikigo cy\u2019iperereza cyanditse ko CDHRI \"ibangamira uburinganire bw\u2019abantu n\u2019ubwisanzure mu gutanga ibitekereCDHRI yavuguruwe mu 2020 kandi yemezwa ku ya 28 Ugushyingo 2020 n'Inama y'Abaminisitiri y'Ububanyi n'Amahanga mu nama ya 47 yabereye i Niamey, muri Nijeriya. Inyandiko ya 1990 yemeza ko shariya ya kisilamu ari yo soko yonyine, mu gihe verisiyo ya 2020 itabaza shariya.zo n\u2019amadini ishyiraho amategeko abuza uburenganzira bwa muntu hafi ya bwose bushingiye ku mategeko ya Shariya ya Islamu.\" Ikirego cyabo no kunegura kwabo kwari gushingiye ku kuba barwanya kwinjiza \"gusebya amadini\" mu mategeko mpuzamahanga n\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu. Rhona Smith yanditse ko, kubera CDHRI yerekeza kuri Shariya, bisobanura urwego rwihariye rwo hejuru rwabagabo. "}
{"id": "21126", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21126", "title": "Urubyiruko rufite ubumuga mu bukorikori", "text": "Abafite ubumuga Bishimira politike y'urwanda yo kudaheza no guha Amahirwe buri munyarwanda wese yo gukora icyaricyo cyose Amategeko y'urwanda yemera.\nUburezi.\nAfite ubumuga cyane cyane urubyiruko ruhabwa Amahirwe yo kwiga mushuri yose harimo nayubumenyangiro.ahobigira imyuga itandukanye Izabateza imbere bihangira imirimo Binyuze muri gahunda y'igihugu.\nIbirushijeho.\nhttps://m.imvahonshya.co.rw?p=66224\nhttps://radiotv10.rw/inkuru-yurubyiruko-rufite-ubumuga-rukora-ibikora-ku-mutima-benshi-ariko-babitangiye-bacibwa-intege/\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20220629200912/https://www.ngororero.gov.rw/news-detail-1/urubyiruko-rufite-ubumuga-rugiye-kwigishwa-imyuga"}
{"id": "21127", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21127", "title": "Ababyeyi Bateganijwe Bitaziguye", "text": "Planned Parenthood Direct ni porogaramu ya telephone igenewe gutanga serivisi z'ubuzima bw'imyororokere ikoresheje icyitegererezo cyangwa uburyo bwa telehealth. Itangazwa n'ishyirahamwe ryita ku buzima ry'izina rimwe.\nPlanned Parenthood Direct Yatangije serivisi muri 2015, ubwo yatangizaga porogaramu iteganijwe kubyara muri Californiya. Muri kiriya gihe, imikorere ya porogaramu igamije cyane gupima indwara zandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina (STD). Ibikoresho byo kwipimisha byoherezwa mu mazu y'abarwayi, hanyuma umurwayi asubiza ibikoresho inyuma, kandi ibisubizo bigezwa k'umurwayi binyuze muri porogaramu. \nKugeza muri 2019, Gahunda iteganijwe kubyara yatangaga serivisi muri leta 27 na Washington DC. Serivisi yibanze ku gutanga ibinini byo kuboneza urubyaro, no gutanga ubuvuzi bwanduza inkari (UTI). Muri, mu rwego rwo gusubiza gahunda za leta zo kugabanya inkunga y\u2019ubuzima ku babyeyi bateganijwe, Gahunda yo Kubyara Directeur yashyizeho gahunda yo kwagura kugera muri leta zose uko ari mirongo itanu. \nMuri 2024, Planned Parenthood Direct Yaguye serivisi yaguye kugirango ibone imiti ikuramo imiti ku barwayi bo muri leta zimwe na zimwe. Abarwayi basaba ibinini byo gukuramo inda bitangwa kugeza ibyumweru 10 batwite, kandi bisaba ubuvuzi bwateganijwe kubuvuzi (umuganga cyangwa umuforomo wimenyereza umwuga) kugirango bandike imiti. Niba byemejwe n'ushinzwe ubuvuzi, imiti yoherezwa murugo rw'umurwayi. Iyi serivisi iraboneka gusa kubarwayi baba muri leta aho gukuramo imiti byemewe. \nSerivisi n'ibicuruzwa.\nIbicuruzwa byibanze byateganijwe kubabyeyi ni porogaramu za porogaramu zikoresha kuri iPhone, terefone ya Android, PC, na mudasobwa ya Mac, Porogaramu zisangiye izina rimwe na sosiyete, gahunda iteganijwe yo kubyara. \u200b\u200b \nPorogaramu n'urubuga rutanga serivisi z'ubuzima bw'imyororokere hakoreshejwe icyitegererezo cya telehealth, cyemerera abakoresha kubona serivisi z'ubuzima ziva mu rugo, batiriwe basura ibiro bya muganga. Serivisi zitangwa ziratandukanye bitewe na leta, bitewe n'amategeko ya leta. \nSerivisi ziratandukanye bitewe na leta, ariko zirashobora kubamo uburyo bwo kuringaniza imbyaro byihutirwa, gupima indwara zandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina, ibinini byo kuboneza urubyaro, no gukuramo imiti. "}
{"id": "21128", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21128", "title": "Thriveworks", "text": "Thriveworks ni kompanyi yo muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika itanga serivisi zubujyanama n'ubuvuzi bw'indwara zo mu mutwe haba mu buryo bwo guhura imbonankubone ndetse no hifashishijwe ikoranabuhanga (online). Yashinzwe mu 2008 i Cambridge, muri Massachusetts. \nIsosiyete ifite ibiro birenga 330 kandi ikoresha abaganga barenga 2200. \nAmateka.\nThriveworks yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2008. \nMuri Gashyantare 2022, Will Furness yagizwe Umuyobozi mukuru (CEO) \nMu Ugushyingo 2022, Thriveworks yafunguye ibigo 18 byo kuvura, kubana bafite imyaka 12 na munsi yayo. \nMuri Mata 2024, Dan Frogel yagizwe Umuyobozi mukuru. \nUbufatanye.\nMuri Nyakanga 2022, Thriveworks yafatanije n'Umujyi wa Joliet, Illinois gutanga serivisi z'ubuzima bwo mu mutwe ku baturage badafite ubwishingizi budahagje. Umujyi wa Joliet wijeje 400.000 $ yo gutera inkunga iyi gahunda. \nMuri Nyakanga 2024, abatanga ubuvuzi bw\u2019ibiyobyabwenge, Eleanor Health, na Thriveworks bashizeho ubufatanye mu gufasha abarwayi mu kuvura indwara ziterwa n\u2019ibiyobyabwenge muri Louisiana, Massachusetts, New Jersey, Carolina y'Amajyaruguru, Ohio, Texas na Washington. \nMuri Nyakanga 2024, Ophelia, utanga imiti ivura ibiyobyabwenge, na Thriveworks bafatanije kwagura ubuvuzi bw'abarwayi kubera indwara ya opioide. \nMu Kwakira 2024, Thriveworks yaguze Synchronous Health, isosiyete ishingiye kuri Nashville. "}
{"id": "21129", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21129", "title": "TiLR", "text": "TiLR ni robot ya mbere ku isi yo mu rwego rw'ibigo ikora uburyo bwa telepresence, yakozwe na kompanyi yitwa RoboDynamics Corporation. Telepresence ya enterineti ihujwe na robot ihendutse (TiLR) ituma uyikoresha ahita atwara ahantu kure aho robot yaba ikubiyemo umukoresha ahantu kure. Ibyiza bya robotic telepresence bigabanya ingendo n'igihe cyo gutaha kimwe no kongera ibicuruzwa n'ubufatanye.\nInyandiko.\nTiLR mu byukuri sisitemu yo guteranya amashusho kumuziga. Umukoresha ashoboye kuyobora robot mu gucunga kure, gutwara robot no kugenzura imikorere ya pan / tilt / zoom ya kamera ya robo. Nka TiLR itanga uburyo bwo guterana amagambo \"ad hoc imbona nkubone\" kimwe no kurebera amajwi n'amashusho.\nIbikorwa.\nHariho ibice bibiri kuri sisitemu ya TiLR ya telepresence. Imashini ya TiLR ihagaze ku rubuga rwa kure. Igice cya kabiri ni software ya TiLR Command Centre (TCC) ishyira kuri PC iyariyo yose hamwe na web kamera hamwe n'umuyoboro mugari. Umukoresha atangiza gusa TiLR Command Centre hanyuma yinjira muri TiLR. Iyo winjiye, hariho amashusho-yerekana amashusho / amajwi hagati ya robo na TCC. Umukoresha noneho arashobora kuyobora robot kuva kure, gufata amashusho, ndetse no kwandika isomo kugirango turebe nyuma. Ubuyobozi bwa TiLR bushyigikiwe gusa kuri Windows XP / Vista. Kwishushanya gukurikira kwa TiLR Command Centre bizaba bishingiye ku buhanga bwa Flash aho abakoresha bazashobora kwinjira muri TiLR no kuyobora robot kuva kurubuga rwisi.\nIterambere.\nTiLR yatangijwe mu mpera za 2007 na RoboDynamics ikurikira porogaramu ya MILO ya telepresence yatangijwe mu 2004. Ibi bituma TiLR igira robot ya telepresence yakozwe na RoboDynamics. Muri Kanama 2008 RoboDynamics yatangije gahunda yabo ya Beta ishyira robot mu miryango itandukanye kugirango bungurane ibitekerezo. Abitabiriye gahunda ya mbere cyane ni itsinda rya Google Lunar X Igihembo cya X Award Foundation. RoboDynamics yateganyaga gukomeza gahunda ya TiLR Beta kugeza mu mpera za 2008."}
{"id": "21130", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21130", "title": "UWA Telerobot", "text": "UWA telerobot ni robo igenzurwa hakoreshejwe ikoranabuhanga rya kure,ibarizwa mu ishuri ry'ubuhanga mu by'imashini n'ubwubatsi (Mechanical and Civil Engineering) muri kaminuza yuburengerazuba bwa Ositaraliya.\nIterambere.\nUWA telerobot ni ikimenyetso cy'amateka kuri interineti na kaminuza yo mu burengerazuba bwa Ositaraliya. Nicyo gikoresho cya mbere cya telerobot cyabonetse kugirango gikoreshwe muri rusange muri 1994. Telerobot ya UWA yakozwe bwa mbere mu rwego rwa PhD na Kenneth Taylor kandi yaje gukorerwa impamyabumenyi ya PhD na Barney Dalton. \nImashini ya mbere kuri interineti, robot ikinisha plastike ifite ubwisanzure bwa dogere 2 gusa, yashyizwe k'umurongo ni tsinda riyobowe na Ken Goldberg muri kaminuza y'amajyepfo ya Californiya ibyumweru bitatu gusa mbere yuko ikipe ya UWA isohora urubuga rwabo. Imashini ya USC yamaze amezi arindwi gusa. Imashini ya UWA iracyari k'umurongo uyu munsi, nubwo robot y'umwimerere yasimbuwe mu mwaka wa 1996 kandi robot ntikiboneka kugirango abantu babone imbogamizi, nubwo ababishaka bashobora gusaba uruhushya. \nGushyira mu bikorwa.\nKugeza ubu televiziyo ya UWA ni moderi ya ABB IRB1400 ya 6 ya robot ya seriveri ya DOF yashyizweho na pneumatic gripper attachment. Imashini ikora kuri ABB S4 isanzwe igenzura imashini ihujwe na seriveri ya Linux kandi nayo ikavugana na seriveri ya kabiri ikoresha porogaramu ya RobComm ya ABB hamwe na porogaramu ya National Instruments Labview yari isanzwe yandikiwe icyo gikorwa na James Trevelyan abifashijwemo na Perth ishingiye kuri Icon Technologies hamwe n\u2019abanyeshuri. igice cyumushinga UWA telelabs. \nTelerobot yagize impinduka nyinshi muburyo bwo kugenzura igihe. Ubusanzwe wagenzuwe ukoresheje paji y'urubuga ya HTML ihagaze ukoresheje CGI, umurimo wa Dalton wabonye itangizwa ryukuri ryagutse Java -ishingiye kuri interineti yahuye nubutsinzi buke. Igenzura ubu nuburyo bwo gukuramo porogaramu ya LabVIEW ishobora gukururwa ikubiyemo amashusho yigihe-gihe, hamwe nubugenzuzi butangwa na sisitemu ya Telelabs. \nImiterere y'ubu.\nImashini ikomeje kuba ishingiro ry'ubushakashatsi n'imishinga yitsinda ryakozwe n'abanyeshuri ba Mechatronics Engineering hamwe nabakozi muri UWA, Byibanze birimo kongeramo ibintu bishya cyangwa ubushobozi muri sisitemu. Imashini ikoreshwa kandi nk'imfashanyo yo kwigisha mu masomo ya sisitemu na sisitemu nyinshi ikoreshwa na Karol Miller."}
{"id": "21131", "revid": "16839", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21131", "title": "The Croods", "text": "The Croods ni filime yo muri Amerika yo muri 2013 yayobowe na Chris Sanders na Kirk DeMicco. Muriyi filime hagaragaramo amajwiya Nicolas Cage, Emma Stone, Ryan Reynolds, Catherine Keener, Clark Duke na Cloris Leachman."}
{"id": "21133", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21133", "title": "Yale Child Studay Center", "text": "Ikigo cyiga abana Yale ni ishami ryishuri ryubuvuzi rya Yale. Ikigo gikora ubushakashatsi kandi gitanga serivisi zamavuriro namahugurwa yubuvuzi ajyanye nabana nimiryango. Ingingo ziperereza zirimo autism nindwara ziterwa nayo, Syndrome de Tourette, izindi mpungenge zubuzima bwo mumutwe bwabana bato, kurera, na neurobiology. \nInshingano.\nIkigo gikora ubushakashatsi kandi gitanga serivisi zamavuriro namahugurwa yubuvuzi ajyanye nabana nimiryango. Ingingo ziperereza zirimo indwara ziterwa na autism, Syndrome ya Tourette, izindi mpungenge z\u2019ubuzima bwo mu mutwe bw\u2019abana, kurera, na neurobiology. \nAmateka.\nIkigo cyatangiye mu mwaka wa 1911 nka Yale Clinic yiterambere ry\u2019abana na Arnold Gesell. Dr. Gesell ufatwa nku umusingi w\u2019iterambere ry\u2019abana muri Amerika, yayoboye iki kigo kugeza mu mwaka wa 1948. Abayobozi bakurikira ni: "}
{"id": "21134", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21134", "title": "Uruguay at the Deaflympics", "text": "Uruguay yitabiriye imikino yo kutumva ku nshuro ya mbere mu mwaka wa 2001, ubwo boherezaga intumwa zigizwe n'umukinnyi umwe gusa muri ibyo birori. Ku nshuro ya kabiri mu batumva ni imikino mukwaka wa 2022 yabereye i Caxias do Sul, muri Burezili, hamwe n'abakinnyi batatu. Uruguay itarabona umudari muri Deaflympics. "}
{"id": "21135", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21135", "title": "Cane gun", "text": "A cane gun n'inkoni yo kugendana irimo imbunda ihishemo. Imbunda za keni rimwe na rimwe zifatwa nk'imbunda zisa na zo zifashishwa nabahigi b'inyamaswa mu buryo bunyuranye n'amategeko.\nUbusanzwe akenshi ni verisiyo zoroshye gutwara kandi zoroshye guhisha z'imbunda zisanzwe zikoreshwa mu mikino yo kurasa, cyane cyane imbunda ifite umuyongo umwe cyangwa ibiri, ishingiye ku buryo bwa Leclercq bwakorewe mu Bubiligi butahenze cyane. \nHamwe nibi bishushanyo bisa, imbunda ndende igufi ishobora gukorwa kugirango isubire inyuma kugeza iryamye munsi y'ububiko, kugirango itwarwe munsi yikoti. Ubundi buryo ni muburyo bwa pistolet ndende cyane yashizwemo itandukanijwe, rimwe na rimwe bita \"kumanura\", cyangwa ububiko bwa skeleton, nubwo intwaro iyo ari yo yose ya siporo isaba guterana ifite ibibi bigaragara mu murima.\nMu magambo afatika gusa, itandukaniro ni uko imbunda y\u2019ibiti, ihenze cyane kuyibyaza umusaruro, kandi muri rusange, ingaruka, bigaragara ko yatwawe n'abagabo bifuzaga, igihe cyose, kuba bashobora gufata \"intego z'amahirwe\", bari curio, aho bavugira, cyangwa intwaro yihishe, imwe ishobora guhunga bitamenyekanye keretse iyo usuzumye neza. Usibye inkoni ya nyakubahwa, imbunda nazo zagiye zihishwa mubindi bintu bisanzwe nk'umutaka n'inkoni zo kugenda.\nIbinyuranye n'ibyo, imbunda ya ba rushimusi biragaragara ko ari imbunda, nubwo imwe yahishwa mu buryo bworoshye n\u2019abajya mu cyaro mu buryo butemewe n'amategeko, bitwaje imbunda yo guhiga inkono idasanzwe cyangwa kwirwanaho, bitandukanye n\u2019imbunda idashobora kwerekanwa cyane, y\u2019imikino yuzuye, nubwo aba bambuka mu cyiciro cyo kurokoka.\nCne guns ubu ni gake cyane kandi kuyibona biragoye kuyibona, kubera ko amategeko menshi arenga ku mategeko abuza gutwara intwaro zihishe, n'ingero z'igihe, aho byemewe, muri rusange, ni mu maboko y'abikorera ku giti cyabo n'inzu ndangamurage.\nImbunda ya kijyambere, ubwoko bwa karitsiye isanzwe ishyirwa mu kurasa amakarito manini y\u2019umuvuduko ukabije cyangwa.410 yatwaye ibisasu bigera kuri 12 bipima imbunda, byombi bikwiranye neza nintwaro ifite ingunguru gusa ifite urugereko rwuzuye, gusohora intoki, uburyo bwo kurasa butandukanye, gufata ibyemezo, kandi rimwe na rimwe bikagaragara.\nUbundi bwoko bwimbunda zinkoni zakozwe nkintwaro zo mu kirere, muri rusange hakoreshejwe uburyo bumwe na bumwe bwikigega cy\u2019ikirere gishobora gutandukana (intwaro yo mu kirere ya pneumatike) mu buryo bwa flask, cyangwa cyinjijwe mu buryo bw\u2019inkoni igereranijwe cyane, nka shillelagh gakondo. Bimwe muburyo bwiza bwo kurasa, byoroshye cyane kwiyoberanya, kuba bike cyane kuruta umuyoboro. Iyi ntwaro yakoreshejwe mu gihe cy'ubujura bwa banki mu rubanza rwa Pizza Bomber.\nNk\u2019uko byatangajwe na ATF, imbunda z'inkoni, imbunda z'inkota, n'imbunda z'umutaka zashyizwe mu rwego rwa AOW (izindi ntwaro zose). \nMu bihimbano.\nImbunda ya kane ifite umwanya uhoraho mu muco wubutasi; urugero ruzwi rwagaragaye mu gitabo cya Ian Fleming cyo mu 1953 cyitwa \"Casino Royale\", aho James Bond yugarijwe n'umwe mu gihe yarushanwaga ku meza y'imikino na Le Chiffre. Imbunda y'inkoni igaragara no muri tereviziyo yakozwe kuri televiziyo ihuza izina rimwe mu 1954 ndetse no muri filime ya Bond yo mu 1999 \"Isi Ntihagije.\" Kurasa umupira, kurasa-imbere, imbunda yuburyo bwa musketi urashobora kubisanga muri \"Abraham Lincoln: Umuhigi wa Vampire\". [\"citation ikenewe\"]"}
{"id": "21136", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21136", "title": "JS Academy", "text": "JS Academy for abatumva ni umuryango udaharanira inyungu i Karachi, muri Pakisitani, ihagaze ku kwigisha abana bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva gusoma no kwandika. Yashinzwe na Laila Dossa mu 2004. Kugeza ubu niwe muyobozi. \nAbaterankunga nyamukuru ba JS Academy ni Fondasiyo ya Mahvash &amp; Jahangir Siddiqui.\nIri shuri ryakira imiryango 150 ifite abana bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva no kutabona. Ifite isomero, uburezi bw'umubiri, ubuhanzi, siyanse, kudoda.."}
{"id": "21137", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21137", "title": "Illinois School for the Deaf", "text": "The Illinois School for the Deaf (ISD), riherereye i Jacksonville, muri Leta ya Illinois, ni ishuri ryigenga na leta rikorerwa ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva, kutabona, rikaba rifite amashami ya mbere y'incuke (pre-kindergarten), amashuri abanza (elementary), n'ayisumbuye (high school). [\u200b\u200b ISD ikoresha icyongereza hamwe na American Sign Language (ASL), ifite politiki ishingiye ku ishuri rya Wisconsin ry'abana b'impumyi y'amatwi.\nISD yashinzwe mu 1839 mu cyicaro cy'intara ya Morgan. \nIri shuri ririmo amacumbi y'abanyeshuri baryo. "}
{"id": "21138", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21138", "title": "Hungarian Association of the Deaf and Hard of Hearing", "text": "The Hungarian Association of the Deaf and Hard of Hearing (Hungarian Orsz\u00e1gos Sz\u00f6vets\u00e9ge, SINOSZ) yashinzwe mu 1907. Icyicaro cyayo giherereye i Budapest, muri Hongiriya. Intego y'iyi sosiyete ni guteza imbere imibereho no korohereza ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva no kutabona ba Hongiriya \nSINOSZ itanga serivisi zitandukanye kubabana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva no kutabona ndetse n'imiryango yabo, nko kugisha inama amategeko, amasomo yitumanaho, ibigo byita ku majwi, no gufasha impapuro / gusaba. \nSINOSZ ni umunyamuryango w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abatumva (WFD), Umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019abatumva (EUD), ihuriro mpuzamahanga ry\u2019abantu batumva (IFHOH), hamwe n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019ibihugu by\u2019i Burayi ryumva abantu (EFHOH). "}
{"id": "21139", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21139", "title": "Dummy,the Witch of Sible Hedingham", "text": "Dummy, Umurozi wa Sible Hedingham (c.\u20091788 - 4 Nzeri 1863) ni izina ry'irihimbano ry'umusaza utazwi wari umwe mu bantu ba nyuma bashinjwaga kuroga mu Bwongereza mu kinyejana cya 19. Yapfuye nyuma yo gukubitwa akajugunywa mu ruzi n'abahigi.\nUmaze igihe kinini atuye i Sible Hedingham, Essex, umudugudu muto w'ubuhinzi mu cyaro cy'Ubwongereza, yari afite ubumuga bwo kutumva-kutavuga yinjiza amaramuko nk'umupfumu waho. Muri Nzeri 1863, Dummy yashinjwaga na Emma Smith wo muri Ridgewell ko 'yamututse,yamuvumye'kugira indwara, maze akurwa mu kabari \"ka Swan\" n\u2019agatsiko k\u2019abasinzi. Yategetswe 'gukuraho umuvumo'. Igihe Dummy atabikoze, yajugunywe mu mugezi uri hafi nk '\" ibigeragezo n'amazi \". Yakubiswe kandi inkoni mbere yuko ajyanwa mu kazi i Halstead ari naho yapfiriye umusonga. Nyuma y\u2019iperereza ryakozwe n\u2019ubuyobozi, Emma Smith na Samuel Stammers, wari umubaji w'ubuhanga ndetse akaba n'inshuti na Smith, bashinjwaga \"gukubita mu buryo butemewe n\u2019umufaransa umusaza bakunze kwita Dummy, bityo bikamuviramo urupfu.\" (Icyifuzo cy'uko Dummy yari Umufaransa cyari gisanzwe mu mudugudu, ariko nya bimenyetso byinshi byari bihari byerekana niba ari ukuri.) Bageragejwe mu Rukiko rwa Chelmsford Assizes,aho ku itariki ya 8 Werurwe 1864 bahamijwe igihano cy'amezi atandatu y'akazi gakomeye."}
{"id": "21140", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21140", "title": "British Columbia School for the Deaf", "text": "The British Columbia School for the Deaf ni ishuri ry\u2019intara i Burnaby, muri Columbiya y\u2019Abongereza rifite gahunda z\u2019umunsi zikorera abanyeshuri bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva. Ishuri ryigisha abanyeshuri bo mumashuri yisumbuye. Ikorera abanyeshuri bagera kuri 50 kandi igabana ikigo na Burnaby South Secondary School yo kumva abanyeshuri. \nAmashuri abanza.\n\"The Britsish Columbia School for the Deaf\" n\u2019ishuri ryibanze rikora i Burnaby, muri Columbiya y\u2019Ubwongereza, rikorera abanyeshuri kuva mu ishuri ry\u2019incuke kugeza mu cyiciro cya 7.\nAmashuri abanza asangiye ikigo n\u2019ishuri ribanza rya Slope y'Amajyepfo, kugira ngo yumve abanyeshuri, yakira abanyeshuri bagera ku 100.\nAbanyeshuri bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva bo muri Kanada bakunze kwiga muri kaminuza ya Gallaudet cyangwa VCC muri gahunda z'inyuma yisumbuye."}
{"id": "21141", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21141", "title": "Keyboard y'inzozi", "text": "Inzozi za keyboard ni porogaramu ya Sinhala y'ububiko bwa Android. Ubusanzwe yatunganijwe nuwashizeho porogaramu yo muri Sri Lankan yitwa Malith Dasanayaka kandi yasohotse bwa mbere kuri Android mu Ugushyingo 2020. Nyuma yaje gukorerwa mu Ububiko bwa Huawei. Ni porogaramu ishobora kwandika ururimi rwa Sinhala ukoresheje uburyo bwa Wijesekara hamwe n'uburyo bwa Singlish buzwi cyane muri Sri Lanka.\nSinhala nimwe mundimi zikoreshwa cyane kwisi kandi porogaramu nyinshi za clavier kwisi ntizizishyigikira. "}
{"id": "21142", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21142", "title": "Carlotta Adele Anderson", "text": "Carlotta Adele Anderson (Madamu J. Scott Anderson) (Ku ya 18 Werurwe 1876 - Ku ya 6 Werurwe 1956) yari umwarimu w\u2019umunyamerika, cyane cyane ashishikajwe n\u2019uburyo bwa Montessori ndetse no kwigisha abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva no kutavuga.\nYavukiye mu mujyi wa New York, umukobwa wa Newell Willard Bloss na Emma C. Jones, kandi yize muri kaminuza n'amashuri makuru atandukanye, muri bo harimo ishuri rya Wright Humason ryigisha abadafite ubumuga bwo kutumva, na kaminuza y'abarimu, kaminuza ya Columbiya. Yize uburyo bwa Montessori i Roma. We ubwe umwarimu ufite ubumuga bwo kutumva imyaka itari mike, yabaye kuva 1903 kugeza 1915 nyiri amashuri yiminwa y'abatumva ndetse n\u2019ishuri ryigisha abarimu i New York na Pennsylvania. Yamaze imyaka myinshi ashishikajwe no kugeza uburyo bwa Montessori mu mashuriy'imyigire rusange. Yari ashinzwe guhugura abarimu b'abumvise bucyeye muri ishuri risanzwe rya Leta ya New Jersey i Trenton (1918\u20131921). Yabaye intumwa z\u2019Amerika muri Kongere mpuzamahanga ya gatatu y\u2019uburezi bwo mu rugo i Buruseli mu 1910 kandi yari umunyamabanga mukuru wa Kongere mpuzamahanga ya kane."}
{"id": "21143", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21143", "title": "American Annals of the Deaf", "text": "The A merican Annals of the Deaf ni urungano rwasuzumwe n\u2019ikinyamakuru cyigisha amasomo gisohoka buri gihembwe hamwe numero imwe yumwaka. n\u2019itangazamakuru rya kaminuza ya Gallaudet i Washington, DC. Ryashinzwe bwa mbere mu 1847 nka \"American Annals of Abatumva n\u2019ibiragi\". Izina ry'icyo kinyamakuru ryahinduwe mu 1886 ubwo hasohokaga umubare wa 31,igice cya 4. The Journey yasohotse ikomeza gucicikana kuva yatangizwa, uretse igihe cy'imyaka irindwi kuva mu 1861 kubera intambara ya sivile y'abanyamerika. \nThe journal \"ni urwego rwemewe rw\u2019Inama y\u2019Abanyamerika bigisha abadafite ubumuga bwo kutumva (CAID) n\u2019inama y\u2019abayobozi bashinzwe uburezi mu mashuri na gahunda z\u2019abatumva (CEASD).\" "}
{"id": "21144", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21144", "title": "World Association of Sign Language Interpreters", "text": "The World Association of Sign Language Interpreters (WASLI) ni umuryango mpuzamahanga ugamije guteza imbere umwuga wo gusobanura ururimi rw'amarenga.\nWASLI yashinzwe ku wa 23 Nyakanga 2003 muri gihe cy'Inteko Nkuru ya 14 y'Umuryango Mpuzamahanga w'Abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva yabereye i Montreal, muri Kanada. Ibiro byayo biherereye i Geneve mu Busuwisi. "}
{"id": "21145", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21145", "title": "Silence (charity)", "text": "Silence (Chinese) Ni umuryango utabara imbabare wa Hong Kong, wibanda ku bantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva no kutavuga bakoresha ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Hong Kong n'imiryango yabo n'inshuti zabo, kandi akaba n'umwe mu bagize akanama gashinzwe imibereho myiza ya Hong Kong."}
{"id": "21146", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21146", "title": "Signmark (album)", "text": "Signmark ni alubumu ya mbere kuva y'umuraperi w'umunyafinilandi ubana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva witwa Signmark. Iyi Album yasohotse mu 2006, ikaba ari DVD ya mbere ya hip-hop yanditswe mu rurimi rw'amarenga. "}
{"id": "21147", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21147", "title": "See What I'm Saying: The Deaf Entertainers Documentary", "text": "See What I'm Saying: The Deaf Entertainers Documentary ni documentaire ya 2009 yakozwe kandi iyobowe na Hilari Scarl. [Igaruka ku buzima bw'abasusurutsa rubanda babana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva nka Bob Hiltermann, TL Forseberg, CJ Jones, na Robert Demayo n'uburyo bagerageza kugera ku bantu bose muri rusange. \u200bAba bafite imyidagaduro bafite impano batsinze ibibazo bikomeye munzira zabo zo gutsinda no gutsinda kwumwuga. \nKwakira.\nFilime yavuzwe nko 'kureba nkenerwa kwisi yabafiteubumuga bwo kutumva. \nIyi filime yatsindiye ibihembo mu birori bitanu bya firime (Newport Beach, Philadelphia International, Jury Award mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya DC Deaf ryitwa Jury, Sinema y\u2019abatumva ku isi na Perspektiva Moscow Festival Festival) ryatoranijwe ku mugaragaro mu bindi birori byinshi bya firime. Iyi mu mijyi 800 yo mu bihugu 19 kandi yari no mu imurikagurisha ryabereye mu nzu ndangamurage y\u2019ubuhanzi y\u2019Abanyamerika yo mu Bwongereza yibanze ku muco w\u2019ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva. "}
{"id": "21148", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21148", "title": "Pierre P\u00e9lissier", "text": "Pierre P\u00e9lissier (22 Nzeri 1814 - 30 Mata 1863) yari intangarugero mu burezi bw'abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva mu Bufaransa hagati mu kinyejana cya 19. Yavukiye i Gourdon, muri Loti, yari umwarimu w\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva kandi yandika inkoranyamagambo y\u2019ururimi rw\u2019amarenga rw\u2019igifaransa mu 1856.Yize mbere i Rodez na Toulouse, iyobowe na Abbot Chazottes. Nyuma yabaye umwarimu mu Ishuri ry\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva rya Toulouse. Yabaye umunyamabanga wungirije wa Sosiyete Nkuru ishinzwe ubumuga bwo kutumva i Paris mu 1842. Mu 1843, afite imyaka 29, yagiye i Paris kwigisha mu ishuri rya Imperial School for Deaf Mutes, aho yigisha kugeza apfuye.\nAzwiho kandi kuba yarabaye umusizi. Ibikurikira ni igice cyakuwe mu gisigo cye:\nDans l'\u0153il tu mis tous les dons de l'oreille,\nAux mains, la voix, dans le corps, des spirits:\nEt, par leur chant, couronnant ta merveille,\nLes sourds-muets se proclament tes fils."}
{"id": "21149", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21149", "title": "Karim Raeisinia", "text": "Karim Raeisinia (Persian ; wavutse 1 Mutarama 1930 muri Tehran Ni umukinnyi w'umunya Irani ufite ubumuga bwo kutumva ndetse akaba n'utsindiye umudali wa zahabu muri Deaflympics. \u200bYatsindiye imidali ine muri freestyle no muri Greco-Roman Wrestling muri Deaflympics mu cyiciro cya 62-67 kg mu mikino yabereye i Milan mu 1957 ni i Helsinki mu 1961. Ariko, ntiyashoboye kubona umudari muri 73\u201379\u00a0kg icyiciro cy'imikino ya Washington DC yo mu 1965 kubera imvune kandi yashyizwe ku mwanya wa 4 muri Freestyle na Greco-Roman. Yari inshuti ya Abolhassan Ilchi Kabir na Gholamreza Takhti. Mansour Raeisi na mubyara we. "}
{"id": "21150", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21150", "title": "South African Deaf Sport Federation", "text": "Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imikino y\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva yo muri Afurika yepfo (SADSF) n\u2019urwego nyobozi rwemewe rwa siporo y\u2019abatumva muri Afurika yepfo ishinzwe kohereza, gutera inkunga, gutera inkunga amakipe ahagarariye Afurika yepfo hamwe n\u2019abakinnyi b\u2019ibipfamatwi mu birori by\u2019abatumva, Shampiyona y\u2019abatumva. Uyu muryango wafashe inshingano zo kohereza abadafite ubumuga bwo kutumva mu mikino y\u2019abatumva kuva mu \nSADSF yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 1981 ikaba ifitanye isano na Comite International des Sports des Sourds (CISS), akaba ari urwego ruyobora isi ya siporo y\u2019abatumva. \nIshyirahamwe ry\u2019imikino y\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva yo muri Afurika yepfo naryo ryifatanije n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imikino muri Afurika yepfo na Komite Olempike (SASCOC), akaba ari urwego nyobozi rw\u2019igihugu muri Afurika yepfo rushinzwe imikino Olempike na Paralympike.\nIshyirahamwe ry\u2019imikino muri Afurika yepfo na komite olempike ryakusanyije inkunga ihagije mu kwemeza ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imikino y\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva bo muri Afurika yepfo igihe ryahuye n\u2019ibibazo by\u2019amafaranga ryo kohereza abakinnyi b\u2019ibipfamatwi mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi ya 2013 yabereye i Sofiya, muri Bulugariya. "}
{"id": "21151", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21151", "title": "Newfoundland School for the Deaf", "text": "Ishuri rya Newfoundland ryigisha ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva ryari ishuri ry'intara muri St. John's, Newfoundland na Labrador hamwe na gahunda yo gutura kw'ishuri ndetse no gutaha zigenewe abanyeshuri babana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva neza cyangwa batanumva na gato. \nIshuri ryigishaga abanyeshuri bo mu mashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye. Umubare w'abanyeshuri wari abanyeshuri 10 mu mashuri makuru na 20 mu mashuri abanza, bose hamwe ni 30.\nAbanyeshuri babana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva bo muri Kanada bakunze kwiga muri kaminuza ya Gallaudet i Washington, DC, n\u2019ishuri ry\u2019ikoranabuhanga rya Rochester i Rochester, muri New York.\nMuri Kanama 2010, hatangajwe ko ishuri rizafunga kuko nta banyeshuri bazitabira umwaka w'amashuri utaha, kandi nta n'umwe wari uteganijwe mu myaka itanu iri imbere; abanyeshuri bose bo mu ntara baba n'ubumuga bwo kutumva neza cyangwa kutumva na gato bari muri sisitemu ya mashuri ya Leta. "}
{"id": "21152", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21152", "title": "Jean Massieu", "text": "Jean Massieu (; 1772 \u2013 21 Nyakanga 1846) yari umurezi w'intangarugero ufite ubumuga bwo kutumva. Umwe mu bavandimwe batandatu babana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva, yangiwe kwiga kugeza afite imyaka cumi n'itatu ubwo yahuraga na Abb\u00e9 Sicard, wamwandikishije mu kigo cy\u2019igihugu des jeunes sourds de Bordeaux-Gradignan, Ishuri rya Bordeaux ry\u2019abana babana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva. Agezeyo, yize gusoma no kwandika igifaransa, nyuma afasha guteza imbere ururimi rw'amarenga rw'igifaransa rwa mbere rwemewe. Uru rurimi rw'amarenga rw'igifaransa nyuma rwahinduwe mu rurimi rw'amarenga rw'Abanyamerika. Yigishaga ku ishuri rizwi cyane ryababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva i Paris aho Laurent Clerc yari umwe mu banyeshuri be. Yatangiye akazi nyuma y'igitutsi cyabereye i Paris muri Rodez kandi yitangiye ubuzima bwe kwigisha abana batumva. Nyuma yaje gushinga ishuri ryabafite ubumuga bwo kutumva i Lille, mu Bufaransa.\nFilime.\nJean Massieu agaragara muri filime y'impimbano \"yitwa Sign Gene\", filime y'ibihangange ivuga ku bahindutse bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva bafite imbaraga z\u2019ibihangange binyuze mu gukoresha ururimi rw'amarenga, nka sekuru wa kane wa sekuru wa Kate Massieu (wakinnye na Carola Insolera) umukobwa w'inshuti y'umuntu ukomeye Tom Clerc, ukomoka kuri Laurent Clerc. Iyi filime yanditswe kandi ikorwa na Emilio Insolera kandi yerekanwe muri sinema muri Nzeri 2017. "}
{"id": "21153", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21153", "title": "Singing Space", "text": "Singing Space ni umwanya ukoreshwa nuwasinye ukoresheje ururimi rwamarenga. Numwanya wibice bitatu imbere yumukono, kuva mukibuno ukageza ku gahanga no kuva kuruhande rumwe rwumubiri kugeza kurundi, aho ibimenyetso bishobora kugaragara. Abasinya bakoresha uyu mwanya kugirango bagaragaze umwanya wumubiri no kwerekana imiterere yibitekerezo. Ibibanza mumwanya wo gusinya byashizwe ahantu mumwanya nyawo. Byakoreshejwe mugutanga amakuru adafatika nkigihe na gahunda. Uwasinye kandi akoresha uyu mwanya kugirango ashyireho ibice byavuzwe mu nteruro (urugero abantu, ibintu, inyubako n\u2019ahantu) no kwerekana isano yabo. Ibi byitwa gushyira. Umukono arashobora kwinjiza abantu mubiganiro basinya amazina yabo, hanyuma akabashyira mumwanya wo gusinya. Arashobora noneho kubasubiza kuri 'we' cyangwa 'we' yerekana gusa aho yabashyize aho kongera gusinya izina ryabo. Ibi byitwa syntactique. Imikoreshereze yo gusinya umwanya kugirango yerekane aho ahantu cyangwa ibintu biherereye muburyo bumwe byitwa topografiya. \nIndimi.\nIndimi z'amarenga zikoresha umwanya wibice bitatu kuri byinshi zifashishwa mabafite ubumuga bwo kutumva. Uyu mwanya ukoreshwa mukwerekeza kubitabiriye ibiganiro, kwerekana uruhare rw'ikibonezamvugo cy'abitabiriye ibirori cyangwa kwerekana amakuru ajyanye n'ubwoko butandukanye bwibikorwa. \nIkoreshwa ryihariye\nIndimi z'amarenga zifite uburyo bumwe bwo kwerekeza kubitabiriye ibiganiro (urugero: umukono, uwandikiwe, utabarizwa). Izi fomu zirimo gukoresha cyane umwanya wo gusinya. Mu kwerekeza mu gituza cye, uwasinye yivugiye ubwe. Mu mico imwe n'imwe aho abavuga ururimi bavuga berekeza ku mazuru kugirango berekane ubwabo, izuru ryerekanwa aho. Kwerekeza kuri aderesi cyangwa kubataba bikorwa bikorwa kumwereka. Urutoki rwerekana ibimenyetso bikoreshwa muribi bihe. Mugihe cyo kuvuga abitabiriye ubwinshi, indimi zimwe z amarenga zishobora gukoresha usibye urutoki. \nIngano yo yindimi z'amarenga.\nSize of Singing Space uva hejuru yumutwe wuwasinye kugeza mukibuno uhagaritse kandi kuva mukibero kugera kunkokora. Ibimenyetso bivuzwe hejuru cyangwa imbere yumubiri. Umwanya urashobora kwaguka nkumubiri wose mururimi rwamarenga rusangiwe kandi ibimenyetso bishobora gushiramo ninyuma yumukono. "}
{"id": "21154", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21154", "title": "Sign Assisted Instruction Programme", "text": "The Sign Assisted instruction Programme (Chinese) Bikorwa n'ishuri rya Lutherani ry'abatumva guhera muri Gashyantare 2012 ku nkunga yatanzwe n'ikigega cy'uburezi bufite ireme. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nAbanyeshuri benshi bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva bafite infashanyo ya cochlear yatewe inkunga nikigo cy'igihugu ndetse na guverinoma ya Hong Kong yashyizweho, ariko umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe itumanaho muri komisiyo ishinzwe amahirwe angana, Chen Jie-zhen, yagaragaje ko ubushobozi bwo gutera inkunga cochlear ari buke. Hariho raporo z\u2019abanyeshuri zivuga ko amajwi yoroheje gusa ashobora kumvikana igihe kinini kandi uwatewe ntashobora gukemura ibibazo byo kwiga. Ishuri rya Lutherani ryabatumva ryigisha mu magambo, rifashwa nururimi rw'amarenga kugirango abanyeshuri bashobore kwiga byoroshye. \nAriko, Hong Kong ibuze ururimi rw'amarenga rukoreshwa cyane cyane nabafite ubumuga bwo kutumva ruhuriweho kandi rwuzuye. z amarenga zakozwe nimiryango itandukanye yabatumva kugirango amagambo ashobore kugira imvugo nyinshi. Byongeye kandi, amagambo menshi yerekeye ubuzima bwa buri munsi kandi amagambo yihariye ajyanye n'uburezi ntabwo ahagije. \nIntego.\nKuva muri Gashyantare mu mwaka wa 2012 kugeza Mutarama mu mwaka wa 2015, gahunda yimyaka itatu irakorwa. Intego ni: \nKuva muri Gashyantare mu mwaka wa 2015 kugeza Nyakanga mu mwaka wa 2017, gahunda yimyaka ibiri irakorwa. Intego ni: \nKwakira.\nuwashinje umuryango wa silent cyangwa guceceka mukinyarwanda, Polly Lam, yavuze ko umubare w\u2019amashuri yihariye y\u2019abatumva muri Hong Kong wagabanutse uva kuri atatu ujya ku umwe. Yagaragaje kandi ko amashuri yihariye yabanjirije atigisha ururimi rw'amarenga ku buryo abanyeshuri bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva bahatirwa kumva bafite ubushobozi buke bwo kumva cyangwa gusoma iminwa. Nkigisubizo, abanyeshuri ntibashobora kwiga byuzuye. Nubwo umuryango ushobora kwigurira uburezi, bitakaza igihe. Bituma abanyeshuri batakaza ubushake bwo kwiga kandi bakumva bababaye. "}
{"id": "21155", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21155", "title": "James Platt Barrett", "text": "James Platt Barrett (29 Kamena mu mwaka wa 1838-27 Ukuboza 1916) yari umwarimu wicyongereza kubatumva na lepidopteriste wikunda. Yari umwe mu banyamuryango bashinze umuryango w\u2019amateka y\u2019amateka ya Londere y\u2019amajyepfo ya Londres kandi yigisha mu ishuri ry\u2019ibwami ry\u2019abana batumva n\u2019ibiragi i Margate imyaka igera kuri mirongo itanu.\nPlatt-Barrett ashobora kuba yari ubumuga bwo kutumva mu busore bwe kuko yize mu kigo cyabafite ubumuga bw'okutumva ndetse nabafite ubumuga bwo kutavuga i Yorkshire. Nyuma yaje kumenyekana ko ashoboye gushyikirana nta kibazo. Yabaye umwarimu w'abatumva n'ibiragi. Bikekwa ko ashobora kuba yarahumekewe no kwiga ikinyugunyugu na Charles Baker wari umwarimu w\u2019abana batumva basohoye igitabo \"cyitwa Ikinyugunyugu cyo mu Bwongereza\" (1828) cyerekanwe n\u2019abanyeshuri be mu kigo cya Edgbaston. Platt-Barrett yagiye mu Butaliyani inshuro nyinshi. Ku ya 28 Ukuboza mu mwaka wa1908, yarokotse gato umutingito wabereye i Messina ariko umukazana we n'umwana we bishwe n'inzu yaguye maze ingero n'inoti kuva mu mezi yakusanyije birasenywa. Yatorewe kuba Umunyamuryango wa Sosiyete Entomologiya mu mu mwaka wa 1911. Yashyinguwe i Birchington iruhande rw\u2019umugore we wari wamubanjirije. "}
{"id": "21156", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21156", "title": "Norwegian Association of the Deaf", "text": "Ishyirahamwe ry' abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva mu gihugu cya Noruveje (NDF ; Norwegian) ni umuryango wigihugu kubakoresha ururimi rwabatumva n\u2019amarenga muri Noruveje.\nIfatanije n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abatumva (WFD). Yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 1918. Icyicaro cyayo kiri Oslo. Ururimi rwemewe rw'iryo shyirahamwe ni ururimi rw'amarenga rwo muri Noruveje. NDF yifatanije n\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019i Burayi by\u2019abatumva kuva mu 1995. Iri shyirahamwe ni umwe mu bagize akanama k\u2019abatumva bo mu majyaruguru. "}
{"id": "21157", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21157", "title": "National Deaf Federation Nepal", "text": "Ihuriro ry\u2019igihugu cy\u2019abatumva Nepal (NDFN ; Nepali (ne)) ni umuryango utegamiye kuri leta washyizweho kandi uyobora nkumuryango w\u2019umuryango w\u2019akarere ka Nepal n\u2019amashyirahamwe yabafite ubumuga bwo kutumva. Mbere yari izwi nka federasiyo yigihugu yabafite ubumuga bwokutumva (NFDH). Ni umunyamuryango w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abatumva ku isi (WFD) kandi akora nk'umuvugizi uharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019abatumva, ndetse anayobora gahunda nyinshi mu gihugu hose hagamijwe kuzamura imibereho y\u2019abatumva bo muri Nepal.\nTwo of core ni agace gakorerwamo ndetse ni ururimi rw'amarenga no kwigisha abatumva. NDFN yakoze ibishoboka ngo isohore \"Inkoranyamagambo y'ururimi rw'amarenga rwo muri Nepali\", kandi ikomeza gukusanya no gukora ibimenyetso by'inyongera kuri iyi nkoranyamagambo. Yahuguye kandi yohereza abigisha ururimi rw'amarenga batumva kwigisha ururimi rw'amarenga rwo muri Nepali abatumva ubundi badafite ururimi rw'amarenga. Mu rwego rwo kwigisha abatumva, ikorana cyane na Minisiteri y\u2019Uburezi, Ishami ry\u2019Uburezi, Ikigo Gishinzwe Guteza Imbere Gahunda, n\u2019Amashuri atandukanye y\u2019abatumva mu rwego rwo kuzamura ireme ry\u2019uburezi bw\u2019abatumva muri Nepal.\nAbanyamuryango baho amashyirahamwe yabatumva.\nKugeza ubu, abanyamuryango b\u2019amashyirahamwe y\u2019abatumva barimo:"}
{"id": "21158", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21158", "title": "Metro Toronto School for the Deaf", "text": "Ishuri rya Metropolitan Toronto ry\u2019abafite ubumuga bwokutumva ni ishuri ahitwa igabana Davisville junior Republic rya Leta, riherereye ahitwa Metropolitan Toronto, i Toronto, muri Ontario hamwe na gahunda y\u2019umunsi ikorera abanyeshuri bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva no kutumva kuva mu ishuri ry\u2019incuke kugeza mu wa munani. Muri iki gice, Ururimi rw'amarenga rw'Abanyamerika hamwe n'Icyongereza kivugwa hifashishijwe icyongereza cyashyizweho umukono neza nk'ururimi rw'itumanaho. \nMu 1962, Ubuyobozi bw\u2019ishuri ry\u2019akarere ka Toronto bwimuye amashuri yombi, Ishuri rya Metropolitan Toronto ry\u2019abatumva na Davisville Junior School, mu nyubako imwe y\u2019ishuri. Kugeza mu mwaka wa 2002, amashuri yombi yakoraga ukwayo. Mu mwaka w\u2019amashuri wo mu 2009-10, abanyeshuri umunani bariyandikishije muri iryo tsinda. \nIshuri rya Metro Toronto ryigisha abanyeshuri bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva ryimukiye mu ishuri rya Faywood Arts-Curriculum School mu majyaruguru ya York. Kwimuka kwatewe kubera gahunda yo kutumva igabanuka (bitewe no gukoresha imiti ya cochlear yatewe no kutumva kwinshi mu bigo byumva) hamwe na gahunda yo kwibiza mu gifaransa. Umuyobozi wa Faywood ABC ni Elizabeth Schaeffer."}
{"id": "21159", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21159", "title": "Manitoba School of the Deaf", "text": "Monitoba ishuri byababana nabafite ubumuga ni ishuri ryintara i Winnipeg, muri Manitoba rifite gahunda yo gutura ndetse n\u2019umunsi ikorera abanyeshuri batumva kandi batumva.\nIshuri ryigisha abanyeshuri bo mu mashuri abanza ndetse nayisumbuye, bakoresheje uburyo Bilingual-Bicultural method. \nUmubare wabanyeshuri ni abanyeshuri bagera kuri 40 baboneka mumashuri makuru na 60 baboneka mumashuri abanza.\nAbanyeshuri batumva bo muri Kanada bakunze kwiga muri kaminuza ya Gallaudet i Washington DC kuri porogaramu yisumbuye. Bamwe mu banyeshuri batumva biga muri kaminuza ya Manitoba kuri porogaramu yisumbuye"}
{"id": "21160", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21160", "title": "Mackay School for the Deaf", "text": "Ikigo cya MacKay, cyahoze ari ishuri rya MacKay ry\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva n\u2019ikigo cya Mackay gishinzwe abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva bw\u2019abaprotestanti (Protestant Deaf Mutes) ni ishuri riherereye muntara ya Montreal, muri Qu\u00e9bec, muri Kanada rifite gahunda y\u2019umunsi ikorera abanyeshuri batumva kandi batumva cyane bo mu muryango wa Anglophone wo muri Qu\u00e9bec. Yashinzwe na Thomas Widd mu 1869 kandi yitirirwa icyubahiro Joseph Mackay. Mu 1960, ikigo cyahujwe n\u2019ishuri ry\u2019abana bafite ubumuga kandi kikaba ari cyo cyongeye guhuzwa n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abatabona rya Montreal mu 2006. \nIshuri ryigisha abanza kandi umubare wabanyeshuri batumva bagera kuri 30 mumashuri abanza."}
{"id": "21161", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21161", "title": "Ko Taku Reo: Deaf Education New", "text": "Ko Taku Reo: Uburezi bw'abafite ubumuga bwokutumva muri Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande iherereye mu muhanda wa Archibald, New Lynn, Auckland, New Zealand. Ni ishuri ryihariye ryo guturamo ry\u2019abana bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva, ndetse n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019ibikoresho gitanga serivisi n\u2019inkunga ku banyeshuri biga muri rusange, abanyeshuri mu byokurya, ndetse n\u2019abarimu bo muri Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande.\nIshuri rya Kelston ry\u2019abafite ubumuga bwokutumva ryashinzwe mu mwaka wo mu 1958, nk'ishuri rya Kelston ryita ku bafite ubumuga bwokutumva. ryasimbuye amashuri yabatumva kumusozi Wellington na Lopdell House muri Titirangi. Yahinduye izina ayita ikigo cya Kelston Deaf Education Centre mu 1991 kugirango kigaragaze neza serivisi zitandukanye zatanze. Mu ntangiriro za manda ya gatatu ya 2020 ishuri ryahujwe n\u2019ikigo cyigisha ubumuga bwo kutumva cya Van Asch bashinga Ko Taku Reo, ishuri ry\u2019igihugu ryigisha ubumuga bwo kutumva."}
{"id": "21162", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21162", "title": "Lesotho Sign Language", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Lesotho ni ururimi rw'amarenga rukoreshwa n'umuryango w'ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva muri Lesotho. Ni Ururimi rutandukanye rwo muri Afrika yepfo."}
{"id": "21163", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21163", "title": "Mardin Sign Language", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Mardin ni ururimi rw'amarenga rwo muri Turukiya. Byabanje kuvugwa mu mujyi wa Mardin, guhera mu bihe byibuze bitanu mu muryango mugari. Abavuga rikijyana bose baba muri \u0130zmir cyangwa Istanbul, kandi abakiri bato cg urubyiruko rw'ubu rwimukiye ku rurimi rw'amarenga rwo muri Turukiya."}
{"id": "21164", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21164", "title": "Maldives Ururimi rw'amarenga", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwo muri Maldiviya (MvSL ; Dhivehi) ni ururimi rw'amarenga rwatejwe imbere, ahanini ku bushake, n\u2019abana babana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva bo mu mashuri menshi yo muri Malidiya mu 2000. Ibi birashimishije cyane abahanga mu by'indimi babyiga kuko bitanga uburyo budasanzwe bwo kwiga ku kintu bemera ko ari ivuka ry'ururimi rushya. \nInkoranyamagambo ikubiyemo ibimenyetso by'amagambo agera kuri 650 ashyigikiwe n'icyongereza na Dhivehi asobanura imiterere y'intoki n'igikorwa kizakoreshwa mugihe wasinyiye ijambo runaka. "}
{"id": "21166", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21166", "title": "Kathmandu Association of the Deaf", "text": "Kathmandu Associatiion of the Deaf (KAD) n\u2019umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta uhagarariye ishyirahamwe ry'abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva ba Kathmandu, kandi ni ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abanyamuryango b\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019igihugu ry\u2019abatumva bo muri Nepal. Niryo shyirahamwe ryambere ryashinzwe, kandi mubyukuri ishyirahamwe ryambere ryubwoko ubwo aribwo bwose muri Nepal ryashyizweho nabafite ubumuga ubwabo kandi riyobowe nubuyobozi bwabo. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nAbasore 13 bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva ba Kathmandu (itsinda rya mbere ry\u2019abanyeshuri barangije icyagombaga kuba ishuri rya Naxal ry\u2019abatumva) bashinze iterambere ry\u2019ibipfamatwi, nyuma yaje kwitwa Ishyirahamwe igihe iryo tsinda ryasabaga kwiyandikisha muri guverinoma mu 1980.\nImwe mu ntego nyamukuru za KAD kwari ugutanga serivisi zita ku buzima busanzwe n\u2019imyidagaduro ku bantu batumva, no guteza imbere imyumvire y\u2019abatumva mu baturage muri rusange. KAD yagize uruhare runini mubikorwa byambere byo guteza imbere no guteza imbere ururimi rwamarenga. KAD yafashijwe n\u2019amahoro Corps yo gukora inkoranyamagambo ya mbere y\u2019ururimi rw\u2019amarenga rwo muri Nepali, kandi, ku nkunga ya UNICEF, nayo yagize uruhare runini mu iterambere rya sisitemu yo gutunga intoki imwe ya devanagari. [\"citation ikenewe\"]"}
{"id": "21168", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21168", "title": "Institut National de Jeunes Sourds de Paris", "text": " (\u00a0, \"National Institute for Deaf Youth of Paris\") is a school for the deaf founded by Charles-Michel de l'\u00c9p\u00e9e, in stages, between 1750 and 1760 in Paris, France.\nNyuma y'urupfu rwa P\u00e8re Vanin rwabaye mu mwaka wa 1759, Abb\u00e9 de l'\u00c9p\u00e9e yamenyeshejwe abakobwa babiri bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva bari bakeneye umwigisha mushya. Iri shuri ryatangiye mu mwaka wa 1760 hanyuma nyuma yaho gato rifungurirwa ku mugaragaro maze riba ishuri rya mbere ku isi ku batumva. Ubusanzwe yari iherereye munzu iri kuri 14 rue des Moulins, butte Saint-Roch, hafi ya Louvre i Paris. Ku ya 29 Nyakanga mu mwaka wa 1791, inteko ishinga amategeko y\u2019Ubufaransa yemeje inkunga ya leta muri iryo shuri maze ryitwa: \" \".\" \nProsper Meni\u00e8re yari umuganga kuva mu 1838 kugeza apfuye mu mwaka wa 1862. Mu mwaka wa 1861, Meni\u00e8re yagejeje kuri Acad\u00e9mie Nationale de M\u00e9decine kuri bamwe mu barwayi be bo muri iryo shuri bahuye na vertigo ifitanye isano no kutumva kwabo, bikaba ari byo byashingiweho bivuguruzanya ku gitekerezo cye cy'uko ugutwi kw'imbere ari yo nkomoko ya vertigo. \nNyuma y\u2019ubwami bwa Esipanye bukuweho mu mwaka wa 1931, umuryango w\u2019ibwami wa Esipanye wabaga mu buhungiro i Fontainebleau. Infante Jaime, Duke wa Segoviya, umuhungu wa kabiri w'umwami Alfonso XIII, yarangije amashuri ye muri Institut National de Jeunes Sourds de Paris. Duke wa Segoviya yari igipfamatwi afite imyaka 4 biturutse ku kwandura ugutwi imbere akiri umwana. "}
{"id": "21169", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21169", "title": "Malawian Sign Language", "text": "Malawian Sign Language ni ururimi rw'umuryango w'ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva bo muri Malawi."}
{"id": "21170", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21170", "title": "Yugoslav Manual Alphabet", "text": "Inyuguti za Alphabet ni intoki zibiri zikoreshwa mu kwandika mu rurimi rw'amarenga rwa Yugosilaviya. Ibimenyetso bimwe byagereranijwe nyuma zitwa Cyrillic Seribiya, ibindi nyuma yinyuguti ya Gaj y'Ikilatini, cyangwa bituruka ahandi akaba ari inyuguti zifasha ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva."}
{"id": "21171", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21171", "title": "Amabwiriza ya Maastricht ku ihohoterwa ry'uburenganzira mu by'ubukungu, imibereho myiza n'umuco", "text": "Amabwiriza ya Maastricht yo mu 1997 yerekeye ihohoterwa ry'uburenganzira bw\u2019ubukungu, imibereho myiza n\u2019umuco yubakiye ku mahame ya Limburg yo mu 1987 yerekeye ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry\u2019amasezerano mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ubukungu, imibereho myiza n\u2019umuco no kwerekana ingaruka zemewe n\u2019amategeko n\u2019ibikorwa bitubahirizwa n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ubukungu, imibereho myiza n\u2019umuco. Amabwiriza yemejwe nitsinda ryinzobere zirenga mirongo itatu zateranye kuva 22-26 Mutarama 1997 i mugihe cyo kwizihiza isabukuru yimyaka 10 ya Limburg. Nyuma yimyaka itatu, Amabwiriza ya Maastricht hamwe n\u2019amahame ya Limburg yasubiwemo nk\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye E / C.12 / 2000/13 (CESCR). \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nMu 1997, ikigo cya Urban Morgan gishinzwe uburenganzira bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu, n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu cy\u2019ishami ry\u2019amategeko muri bateraniye mu yandi mahugurwa ku isabukuru yimyaka 10 y\u2019amahame ya Limburg agerageza kumenya uburyo bwo gukoresha \"ihohoterwa\" kugira ngo rifashe gukurikirana (ICESCR). Inteko yari ifite intego eshatu: kumva neza igitekerezo cyo guhonyora uburenganzira bw\u2019ubukungu, imibereho myiza n\u2019umuco; gukusanya no gutondekanya ubwoko bw'ihohoterwa ry'uburenganzira; no gushyiraho umurongo ngenderwaho wafasha ibigo mugukurikirana uburenganzira bwubukungu, imibereho myiza n\u2019umuco. \nIbirimo.\nMuri rusange, amabwiriza 32 yashyizwe mu byiciro bitanu agize Amabwiriza ya Maastricht. Aya mabwiriza yemejwe ku bwumvikane n\u2019abari bitabiriye aya mahugurwa, kandi yumvikanye ko agaragaza iterambere ry\u2019amategeko kuva mu 1986. Igice cya 1 gishimangira akamaro k\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ubukungu, imibereho myiza n\u2019umuco; Igice cya 2 gisuzuma inshingano Leta ibereyemo mu guharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019ubukungu, imibereho myiza n\u2019umuco, ikanagaragaza urutonde rw\u2019ibikorwa ndetse n\u2019ibitagenda neza bikabije; Igice cya 3 gitangaza ko ihohoterwa iryo ari ryo ryose ryatewe na Leta kandi ko rigomba kureba niba abahohotewe bashobora gukemura ibibazo; Igice cya 4 cyibanda ku bahohotewe kubera ko uburenganzira bwabo butubahirijwe, kurindwa no kubahirizwa, binyuranye na ICESCR; Igice cya 5 kirimo gusa ibisubizo nibindi bisubizo bishoboka kubangamira uburenganzira. \nReferences"}
{"id": "21172", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21172", "title": "Location (Sign language)", "text": "In sign languages, ahantu, cyangwa tab, bivuga ahantu nyirizina amaboko ziba ziri igihe zikoreshwa mu gukora ibimenyetso. Muri terminologiya ya Stokoe izwi nka TAB, impfunyapfunyo ya \"tabula\". Ikibanza ni kimwe mu bice bitanu, cyangwa ibipimo, by'ikimenyetso, hamwe nigishusho cyamaboko (DEZ), icyerekezo (ORI), kugenda (SIG), nibintu bidasanzwe. Ibisobanuro byihariye byahantu, nk'igituza cyangwa urusengero rw'umutwe, birashobora gufatwa nka foneme. Indimi zitandukanye z'amarenga zirashobora gukoresha ahantu hatandukanye. Muyandi magambo, indimi z'amarenga zitandukanye zishobora kugira ibarura ritandukanye rya fonema.\nIbibanza mu rurimi rw'amarenga rw'abanyamerika.\nUrurimi rw'amarenga rw'Abanyamerika rukoresha ahantu 12 ukuyemo amaboko ubwayo: isura yose / umutwe; agahanga cyangwa umusatsi; amaso cyangwa izuru; umunwa cyangwa umunwa; urusengero, umusaya cyangwa ugutwi (uruhande rw'umutwe); ijosi; umutiba (ibitugu kugeza mu kibuno); ukuboko hejuru; inkokora cyangwa ukuboko, inyuma yintoki, imbere imbere. Mubyongeyeho, mu bimenyetso simusiga by'amaboko abiri, ikiganza cyiganje gikorana n'ikiganza kitiganje, hanyuma kikaba nk'ikimenyetso. Ikimenyetso gishobora kandi kuvugwa mu mwanya udafite aho ubogamiye, ufatwa nk'ahantu hatagaragara muri moderi zimwe na zimwe z'ururimi rw'amarenga. "}
{"id": "21173", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21173", "title": "Keresan Sign Language", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Keresan, ruzwi kandi ku izina rya Keresan Pueblo Ururimi rw'amarenga rw'Abahinde (KPISL) cyangwa Keresign, ni ururimi rw'amarenga rwo mu mudugudu ruvugwa na benshi mu baturage ba pereblo ya Keresan, aho haboneka abantu benshi bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva kuva bavuka (iyo pueblo ntivugwa mu bitabo by'inkomoko, ariko abaturage bavugwa bemeza ko ari Zia pueblo yo muri New Mexico).\nUrurimi rw'amarenga rwa Keresan rwateye imbere mu karere, kandi ntaho ruhuriye n'ururimi rw'ubucuruzi Ibibaya Ururimi rw'amarenga rw'Abahinde."}
{"id": "21174", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21174", "title": "Kazakh Sign Language", "text": "Kazakh Sign Language (KSL) cyangwa Kazakh-Russian Sign Language (KRSL) ni imvugo y'ururimi rw'amarenga rw'ikirusiya rukoreshwa muri Qazaqistan. "}
{"id": "21175", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21175", "title": "Kajana Sign Language", "text": "Kajana Sign Language (Dutch) ni ururimi rw'amarenga rw'umudugudu wa Suriname. ruvugwa muri Kajana, umudugudu ugizwe n'imiryango itatu gusa."}
{"id": "21176", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21176", "title": "Catalina Devandas Aguilar", "text": "Catalina Devandas Aguilar ni umunyamategeko wa Kosta Rika wabaye ku burenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga kuva mu 2014 kugeza 2020. Muri Gicurasi 2024, yagizwe umuyobozi mukuru mu biro by\u2019ubufatanye, ubuvugizi n\u2019itumanaho n\u2019umuryango mpuzamahanga w\u2019abinjira n\u2019abinjira (IOM UN Migration). Mbere, yahoze ahagarariye Costa Rica mu Muryango w\u2019abibumbye i Geneve. Yakoze kandi muri Banki y'Isi kandi agira uruhare mu ishyirwaho ry'amasezerano n'Ubunyamabanga. Arwaye spina bifida kandi akoresha igare ryibimuga. \nUmwuga.\nYabanje kugisha inama Banki y'isi kandi yari mu bunyamabanga bw'Umuryango w'Abibumbye bwashyizeho. Mu 2009, Madamu Devandas Aguilar yatangiye gukorera mu kigega cyo guharanira uburenganzira bw'abafite ubumuga n'ikigega. Mu 2014, Aguilar yagizwe umunyamabanga wa mbere w\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ku burenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga. \nAho yasuye.\nKuva ku ya 3 kugeza ku ya 17 Ukwakira 2017, Devandas-Aguilar yasuye Ubufaransa maze atanga raporo imbere y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye, ku bijyanye n\u2019ibibazo bijyanye no kubahiriza uburenganzira bwa muntu. \nReferances"}
{"id": "21177", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21177", "title": "Disabled Peoples\u2019 International (DPI)", "text": "DPI) (INGO) ufite icyicaro i, hamwe n\u2019ibiro by\u2019akarere muri Aziya-Pasifika, Uburasirazuba bwo hagati, Uburayi, Afurika, Amerika y'Epfo, na Amerika y'Amajyaruguru na Karayibe. DPI ni ihuriro ry\u2019imiryango cyangwa inteko z\u2019abafite ubumuga, ryashinzwe mu 1980\u201381 hagamijwe guteza imbere uburenganzira bwa muntu bw\u2019abafite ubumuga binyuze mu ruhare rwuzuye, kunganya amahirwe n\u2019iterambere. DPI ifasha amashyirahamwe yo mu bihugu birenga 152 ibibazo bya buri munsi byo gufasha abamugaye. Bakira kandi inteko hamwe ninama nyunguranabitekerezo kwisi yose hamwe namashami yabo atandukanye. \nImishinga.\nAbaharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nAbaharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu batangijwe na DPI mu 2011 kugira ngo bafashe ababana n'ubumuga mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere. Bashaka kunoza ibibazo byemewe n'amategeko, imibereho myiza, nubukungu bigira ingaruka kubantu bafite ubumuga. Kugeza mu 2013, abaharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu bashizeho imiyoboro ibiri y\u2019abagore ku isi iteza imbere uburenganzira bw\u2019abagore bafite ubumuga. Bashyizeho kandi umuryango w\u2019urubyiruko hagamijwe guteza imbere uburenganzira bw\u2019urubyiruko rufite ubumuga. Umushinga wafunzwe mu 2013. \nReferances"}
{"id": "21178", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21178", "title": "Disability Rights International (DRI)", "text": "DRI Wahoze ari Uburenganzira bw\u2019ababana nubumuga bwo mu mutwe, ni Washington, DC bushingiye ku guharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu bugamije guteza imbere uburenganzira bwa muntu no kugira uruhare rugaragara muri sosiyete y\u2019abafite ubumuga ku isi. DRI ibyangombwa bisabwa, itangaza raporo, kandi iteza imbere kugenzura mpuzamahanga uburenganzira bwabafite ubumuga.\nDRI yashinzwe mu 1993 n\u2019avoka kandi yashinzwe n\u2019ishuri ryita ku burenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019ikigo cya Bazelon gishinzwe ubuzima bwo mu mutwe. Kuva mu 1993, DRI yaguye ibiro mu bihugu bitatu birimo Seribiya, Mexico, na Ukraine.\nIbihembo.\nDRI yahawe igihembo cya Charles Bronfman ishimira ibikorwa bya DRI mu gukangurira umutimanama w\u2019isi kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu bw\u2019abana n\u2019abakuze bafite ubumuga; kwerekana amacakubiri no gufata nabi ababana n'ubumuga mu bihugu byinshi; amahugurwa no gutera inkunga ubumuga n'abaharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu; no guhamagarira guverinoma n'inzego z'isi kurinda abaturage batishoboye kandi birengagijwe. "}
{"id": "21179", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21179", "title": "Kailge Sign Language", "text": "Kailge Sign Language ni ururimi rw'amarenga rwateye imbere mu Ntara ya Western Highlands, Papouasie-Nouvelle-Guin\u00e9e. Bivugwa mu karere kanini k'uduce duto dukikije umujyi wa Kailge, ndetse no muri Kailge nyine, mu gace ka Ku Waru - kavuga. Rushobora gusobanurwa nk'urusobe rw'ibimenyetso byo mu ngo aho kuba ururimi rumwe rusobanutse. Ishobora Gukoresha umwanya wo gusinya birasa cyane nu rurimi rw'amarenga rw'abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva-ururimi rw'ururimi rw'amarenga rw'imidugudu rusangiwe n'abumva. \nKSL ifite amagambo asa n'urundi rurimi rw'amarenga rw'umudugudu mu karere, ururimi rw'amarenga Sinasina."}
{"id": "21180", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21180", "title": "Kafr Qasem Sign Language", "text": "Kafr Qasem Sign Language (\u0644\u063a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0625\u0634\u0627\u0631\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0641\u0631 \u0642\u0627\u0633\u0645\u00a0(Icyarabu) Lughat il-Ish\u0101rah il-Kafr Qasim) ni ururimi rw'amarenga rwo mu mudugudu muri Isiraheli. \nUrurimi ruri mu nzira zo kwandikwa, cyane cyane muri kaminuza ya Haifa. Kafr Qasem irangwa n'ijanisha ryinshi ry'abantu babana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva, kandi uko bigaragara, ururimi rwabo rw'amarenga rwateye imbere mu buryo bwihuse uko imyaka yagiye ihita, kabone niyo rwaba rwaratewe n\u2019ururimi rw'amarenga rwo muri Isiraheli ndetse n'indimi z'amarenga zo muri ako karere. \nIntangiriro y\u2019umuryango w\u2019ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva muri Kafr Qasem yatangiye mu ntangiriro y'ikinyejana cya 20, ubwo umuturage yashakanye n\u2019umugore ubana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva ukomoka muri Mazraa. Abashakanye babyaranye abana bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva, na bo barashyingiranwa kandi bafite abana bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva benshi. Mu 1951, i Kafr Qasem hari abaturage 1800, 12 muri bo bakaba bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva. Gukenera kuvugana nabo byatumye habaho iterambere ry'ururimi rw'amarenga rusangiwe na benegihugu - bafite ubwo bumuga kandi bumva. "}
{"id": "21181", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21181", "title": "Inmaculada Sign Language", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Inmaculada ni ururimi rw'amarenga rw'abatumva- ibisekuru by'ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva bya Lima, muri Peru. Ifitanye isano neza n'ururimi rw'amarenga rwo muri Peru (LSP), ariko iratandukanye bihagije ku buryo byafatwa nk'ururimi rutandukanye.\nUrurimi rukoreshwa n\u2019abantu biga mu ishuri ry\u2019abatumva, CEBE La Inmaculada de Barranco, mbere y\u20191960, igihe LSP yashingwa nk'ururimi rw\u2019igihugu cy\u2019ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva. Iri shuri ryari ryarafunguwe mu 1939. Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Inmaculada rufite hafi igice cy'ingaruka zituruka ku rurimi rw'ibimenyetso rw'Abanyamerika (ASL) ugereranyije n'ururimi rwa LSP, kandi inyuguti zikorwa n'intoki zarwo ziratandukanye cyane. "}
{"id": "21182", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21182", "title": "Hungarian manual alphabet", "text": "Imyandikire y'intoki ya Hongiriya (cyangwa magyar ujj\u00e1b\u00e9c\u00e9 mu gihongiriya) Rukoreshwa mu kwandika amagambo hifashishijwe intoki mu rurimi rw'amarenga rw'Abahungariya. Bikunze kugaragara cyane ni inyuguti imwe y'intoki hafi yisura, ariko imiterere ya LSF -imiterere y'imyandikire rimwe na rimwe ikoreshwa."}
{"id": "21183", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21183", "title": "Iterambere ry\u2019Uburenganzira bwa Muntu mu Kinyejana cya 21", "text": "Isesengura ry\u2019Iterambere ry\u2019Uburenganzira bwa Muntu mu Kinyejana cya 21 ni inyandiko isobanura uburyo uburenganzira bwa muntu bwahindutse, bwatera imbere, ndetse n\u2019ingorane bwahurijeho muri iki gihe cy\u2019ikoranabuhanga n\u2019isi ihinduka buri munsi. Uburenganzira bwa muntu ni ihame ryemewe mpuzamahanga rivuga ko buri muntu afite agaciro, ubwigenge n\u2019uburenganzira budashobora kumwamburwa.\nAmavu n\u2019amavuko y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nInkomoko y\u2019inyigisho z\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu ishobora gukururwa mu mateka y\u2019abahanga nka Aristote na Cicero, ariko yaje kugirwa ihame mpuzamahanga mu myaka ya nyuma y\u2019intambara ya kabiri y\u2019isi yose. Icyo gihe, isi yari imaze kubona ingaruka z\u2019urwango, jenosidi n\u2019icuraburindi ry\u2019ubuyobozi bubi. Ibi byatumye habaho itangazwa ry\u2019itangazo mpuzamahanga ry\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu ku wa 10 Ukuboza 1948.\nUburenganzira bwa muntu mu kinyejana cya 21.\nMu kinyejana cya 21, iterambere ry\u2019ikoranabuhanga, imiyoborere n\u2019ubukungu ryazanye impinduka nini mu buryo abantu babona uburenganzira bwabo. Ubu burenganzira ntibukiri gusa ijambo ryanditse mu masezerano, ahubwo buba bugomba kugaragara mu bikorwa by\u2019ubuyobozi, uburezi, ubucuruzi n\u2019imibanire y\u2019abantu.\nKugeza ubu, inzego zitandukanye z\u2019abaharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu (nka Amnesty International na Human Rights Watch) zakomeje kugaragaza imbogamizi zishingiye ku kurenga ku burenganzira mu bihugu bitandukanye, cyane cyane mu birebana n\u2019ubwisanzure bwo gutanga ibitekerezo, uburenganzira bw\u2019abagore n\u2019ubw\u2019abana.\nImpinduka zatewe n\u2019ikoranabuhanga.\nIkoranabuhanga ryatumye isi iba umudugudu umwe, ariko rinazana ibibazo bishya ku burenganzira bwa muntu. Urugero, gukusanya amakuru ku mbuga nkoranyambaga bishobora gukoresha nabi uburenganzira bw\u2019abantu ku buzima bwite. Nubwo iri koranabuhanga rifasha mu guhanahana amakuru, rishobora no kuba intwaro yo kugenzura abaturage.\nAbahanga bavuga ko icyuho kiri hagati y\u2019uburenganzira bwo kubona amakuru n\u2019uburenganzira bwo kugira ibanga gikwiye gucungirwa hafi. Kumenya uko ikoranabuhanga rikwiye gukoreshwa mu nyungu z\u2019abantu bose ni kimwe mu bibazo bikomeye mu kinyejana cya 21.\nImbogamizi n\u2019intambwe imaze guterwa.\nMu myaka 20 ishize, hari intambwe nyinshi zatewe mu kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu. Mu Rwanda n\u2019ahandi muri Afurika, hashyizweho amategeko arengera abana, abagore n\u2019abafite ubumuga. Ariko nanone, haracyari ibibazo by\u2019ubukene, ubusumbane n\u2019ihohoterwa rikorerwa mu ngo n\u2019ahandi hatandukanye.\nHari kandi ikibazo cy\u2019uko uburenganzira bwa muntu bwakomeje gufatwa nk\u2019intwaro ya politiki aho kuba ishingiro ry\u2019ubumuntu. Abashakashatsi bamwe bavuga ko ibihugu bimwe bikoresha ijambo \"uburenganzira bwa muntu\" nk\u2019intwaro yo gushyira igitutu ku bindi bihugu.\nIki gice cya mbere kigaragaza uko uburenganzira bwa muntu bwahindutse kuva ku rwego rw\u2019inyigisho za filozofiya bugera ku rwego rw\u2019amategeko mpuzamahanga. Mu gice gikurikira, tuzasuzuma uko ihindagurika ry\u2019ikirere, ubuhunzi, n\u2019ubukungu mpuzamahanga bigira uruhare mu kurengera cyangwa kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu mu kinyejana cya 21.\nUburenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019ubukungu.\nMu myaka ya vuba, ubusumbane mu bukungu bwabaye kimwe mu bibazo bikomeye bigira ingaruka ku burenganzira bwa muntu. Iyo abaturage batabona amahirwe angana mu burezi, ubuzima n\u2019imibereho myiza, bibangamira ihame ry\u2019uko buri wese afite uburenganzira bungana imbere y\u2019amategeko.\nMu bihugu byinshi byo muri Afurika, harimo no mu Rwanda, hakomeje gushyirwaho gahunda zigamije kugabanya icyuho cy\u2019ubukene binyuze mu guteza imbere uburezi, uburinganire n\u2019imibereho myiza. Ariko, abahanga bavuga ko uburenganzira bwo kubona akazi kiza n\u2019ifunguro rihagije bugikomeje kuba inzozi kuri benshi.\nUburenganzira ku kazi si uguhabwa akazi gusa, ahubwo ni no kuba ako kazi gatanga agaciro n\u2019ubwigenge ku muntu. Gushyiraho politiki zishingiye ku burenganzira bwa muntu mu rwego rw\u2019ubukungu ni imwe mu nzira zo kurwanya ubusumbane n\u2019ubukene.\nImpinduka z\u2019ikirere n\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nImpinduka z\u2019ikirere zigaragara cyane mu kinyejana cya 21 zifite ingaruka zikomeye ku burenganzira bwa muntu. Iyo amazi, imyaka cyangwa ubutaka bitakiboneka neza, bibangamira uburenganzira ku biribwa, ku buzima, ndetse no ku mutekano.\nAbantu bagera kuri miliyoni 20 buri mwaka baba bahunze kubera ibiza, imyuzure, n\u2019amapfa. Ibyo bituma ubuhunzi butakiri ikibazo cya politiki gusa, ahubwo buba ikibazo cy\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nIshyirahamwe mpuzamahanga ryita ku burenganzira bwa muntu (UNHRC) ryemeza ko kurengera abahungabijwe n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere bigomba kuba igice cy\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019isi yose. Abahanga bemeza ko politiki zose zijyanye n\u2019ibidukikije zigomba gushingira ku mahame y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu kugira ngo zigere ku ntego z\u2019iterambere rirambye.\nUburenganzira bw\u2019abagore n\u2019urubyiruko.\nMu kinyejana cya 21, abagore n\u2019urubyiruko bifashishije ikoranabuhanga mu guharanira uburenganzira bwabo. Uko isi irushaho kuba nyabagendwa, niko n\u2019ubutumwa bw\u2019uburinganire bugera ku bantu benshi.\nUrugero, ubukangurambaga nka *#MeToo* bwafashije mu kugaragaza ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina, bityo bukazamura ibiganiro ku burenganzira bw\u2019abagore n\u2019ubw\u2019abakobwa. Mu bihugu byinshi, harimo n\u2019u Rwanda, hashyizweho amategeko arengera abagore mu kazi, mu muryango no mu miyoborere.\nUrubyiruko narwo rwagize uruhare rukomeye mu bikorwa by\u2019ubukangurambaga bijyanye n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu, cyane cyane mu bijyanye n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere no kurwanya ivangura. Uruhare rwabo rwerekana ko uburenganzira bwa muntu ari urusobe rw\u2019abantu bose, aho buri wese agira uruhare mu kuburinda.\nUburenganzira mu bihe by\u2019intambara n\u2019umutekano.\nIntambara n\u2019ibibazo bya politiki bikomeje kuba imbogamizi ikomeye mu kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu. Aho hose habaye intambara, uburenganzira bwo kubaho, kubaho mu mahoro no kubona ubuvuzi buba bugeze ku iherezo.\nAmategeko mpuzamahanga avuga ko n\u2019igihe cy\u2019intambara, uburenganzira bw\u2019ibanze bugomba kubahirizwa. Ariko, hari aho ibyo bidashyirwa mu bikorwa kubera ubushobozi buke, politiki mbi cyangwa kutagira ubushake bwa politiki.\nIbi byose bigaragaza ko kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu bisaba imbaraga zifatanyije z\u2019amahanga yose, inzego za leta, n\u2019imiryango itari iya leta.\nUburenganzira bwa muntu mu gihe cy\u2019ikoranabuhanga.\nIterambere ry\u2019ikoranabuhanga ryahinduye uburyo abantu babaho, bakorana, banavugana. Ubu, amakuru agezweho, ubutumwa n\u2019ubuvugizi bishobora gukwirakwira ku isi yose mu isegonda rimwe. Ariko, uko iterambere rizamuka, niko n\u2019ibibazo bishya bijyanye n\u2019uburenganzira byiyongera.\nUrugero, uburyo bwo gukusanya amakuru ku bantu (data collection) bukomeje kuba ikibazo gikomeye mu kurengera uburenganzira ku buzima bwite. Ibigo bikomeye by\u2019ikoranabuhanga bikusanya amakuru menshi y\u2019abantu, bikayakoresha mu bucuruzi cyangwa politiki, rimwe na rimwe bitabanje gusaba uruhushya.\nUbumenyi bw\u2019ubukorano (AI) n\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nUbumenyi bw\u2019ubukorano (Artificial Intelligence \u2013 AI) buragenda bufata umwanya ukomeye mu buzima bwa buri munsi. Ikoreshwa mu butabera, ubuvuzi, uburezi n\u2019imiyoborere, ariko nanone rifite ingaruka zishobora kurengera cyangwa kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nAbashakashatsi bavuga ko AI ishobora gutuma habaho ivangura rishingiye ku buryo porogaramu zayo zitozwa. Urugero, porogaramu zimwe zishobora gukoresha amakuru atuzuye bigatera gufata ibyemezo bitaboneye, nko gufata abantu batabigizemo uruhare cyangwa kubima amahirwe mu kazi.\nUbwisanzure bwo gutanga ibitekerezo kuri murandasi.\nMurandasi yabaye urubuga rw\u2019ibitekerezo n\u2019ubwisanzure, ariko nanone igenda iba isoko y\u2019ivangura, urwango n\u2019ibihuha.\nIbihugu bimwe byashyizeho amategeko abuza gukwirakwiza amakuru y\u2019ibinyoma, ariko rimwe na rimwe ayo mategeko akoreshwa nabi mu guhagarika abavuga ibyo leta itishimiye.\nAbaharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu bavuga ko hakenewe itandukaniro rigaragara hagati yo kurwanya urwango no gukumira ubwisanzure bw\u2019ibitekerezo. Uburenganzira bwo gutanga ibitekerezo bugomba guharanirwa, ariko bukubahirizwa mu buryo butabangamira abandi.\nEjo hazaza h\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nUburenganzira bwa muntu bugomba gukomeza guhindukana n\u2019isi, kuko ibibazo by\u2019uyu munsi bitandukanye n\u2019iby\u2019imyaka 50 ishize.\nHari ibintu bitatu bizaba ingenzi mu kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu mu bihe biri imbere:\nMu gihe isi ihura n\u2019ikibazo cy\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere, intambara, n\u2019ubusumbane, uburenganzira bwa muntu bugomba gufatwa nk\u2019umusingi w\u2019amahoro n\u2019iterambere rirambye.\nUmusozo w\u2019inyandiko.\nIsesengura ryerekanye ko uburenganzira bwa muntu mu kinyejana cya 21 butakiri igitekerezo cy\u2019inyandiko gusa, ahubwo ari ubuzima bwose bw\u2019umuntu mu buryo bwagutse. Iterambere ry\u2019ikoranabuhanga, impinduka z\u2019ikirere, ubusumbane n\u2019ubukene byose bigira uruhare mu buryo uburenganzira bugaragara n\u2019uko burengerwa.\nKubaka ejo hazaza heza bisaba ko buri gihugu, buri sosiyete n\u2019umuntu ku giti cye ashyira uburenganzira bwa muntu ku isonga, kuko ari bwo bushingiyeho ubumwe, amahoro n\u2019iterambere rirambye.\nInama n\u2019Ibisubizo Bitangwa (Recommendations).\nMu rwego rwo gukomeza guteza imbere uburenganzira bwa muntu mu kinyejana cya 21, hari ibyemezo n\u2019ingamba by\u2019ingenzi byashobora gufasha isi yose kugira iterambere rirambye n\u2019ubumwe mu burenganzira:\nIzi nama zifasha mu kubaka isi igendera ku mahame y\u2019uburinganire, amahoro, n\u2019ubwubahane, aho uburenganzira bwa muntu buba umusingi w\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019abantu bose."}
{"id": "21184", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21184", "title": "Uruhare rw\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye mu Kurengera Uburenganzira bwa Muntu\u201d", "text": "Uruhare rw\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye mu Kurengera Uburenganzira bwa Muntu ni inyandiko isesengura uburyo ONU yashyizweho, intego zayo, inzego zayo zishinzwe uburenganzira bwa muntu, ndetse n\u2019uko yagiye ikora ibikorwa byo kurengera uburenganzira bw\u2019abantu ku isi yose.\nInkomoko y\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye.\nUmuryango w\u2019Abibumbye washyizweho ku wa 24 Ukwakira 1945, nyuma y\u2019intambara ya kabiri y\u2019isi yose, kugira ngo habeho uburyo bw\u2019ibanze bwo kubungabunga amahoro ku isi no gukumira intambara n\u2019ihohoterwa rikabije ku bantu.\nIshyirwaho ry\u2019ONU ryari rigamije guhangana n\u2019ingorane zagiye zigaragara mu gihe cy\u2019intambara: jenoside, ivangura, gukandamiza abaturage no kwica amategeko mpuzamahanga.\nIntego z\u2019ONU mu burenganzira bwa muntu.\nAmasezerano y\u2019ishyirwaho ry\u2019ONU ashyira imbere ibintu bitatu by\u2019ingenzi:\nMuri aya mahame, kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu ni kimwe mu by\u2019ingenzi byubakiyeho imiyoborere y\u2019isi. ONU yemeje ko buri muntu afite agaciro kandi ko uburenganzira bwe butagomba kwangizwa n\u2019umuntu cyangwa igihugu icyo ari cyo cyose.\nAmasezerano n\u2019inzego z\u2019ONU zishinzwe uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nONU yashyizeho amasezerano n\u2019inzego zigamije gukurikirana no gushyigikira uburenganzira bwa muntu ku isi yose. Inzego zikomeye z\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu muri ONU ni izi:\nAmateka y\u2019ingenzi y\u2019ONU mu burenganzira bwa muntu.\nONU yagiye igira uruhare mu bikorwa byinshi byo kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu:\nAya mateka agaragaza ko ONU itari gusa ishyiraho amategeko, ahubwo inagira uruhare mu gukurikirana ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry\u2019ayo mategeko ku isi.\nInzego z\u2019ONU zishinzwe uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nONU yashyizeho inzego nyinshi zigamije gukurikirana no kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu ku isi yose. Izi nzego zifite inshingano zitandukanye: zishinzwe gukurikirana ibikorwa, gushyiraho amabwiriza, gutanga amahugurwa, no gufasha ibihugu gushyira mu bikorwa amategeko mpuzamahanga.\nUN Human Rights Council (UNHRC).\nUNHRC yashyizweho mu 2006 isimbura Komisiyo ya mbere y\u2019Uburenganzira bwa Muntu. Intego yayo nyamukuru ni:\nUNHRC ikoresha uburyo bwo kohereza abagenzuzi ku bihugu, gukurikirana ihohoterwa, no gutanga raporo z\u2019imikorere y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu ku Nteko rusange y\u2019ONU.\nOffice of the High Commissioner for Human Rights (OHCHR).\nOHCHR ifasha ibihugu gushyira mu bikorwa amategeko mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu. Ibikorwa byayo birimo:\nUN Women na UNICEF.\nIzi nzego zombi zifasha mu gushyiraho amategeko, amahugurwa, gahunda z\u2019uburezi, no kurwanya ihohoterwa rikorerwa abagore n\u2019abana.\nIbikorwa by\u2019ONU ku Isi hose.\nONU ikora ibikorwa byinshi bigamije kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu:\nUrugero, mu bihugu byibasiwe n\u2019intambara cyangwa ihohoterwa rya politiki, UNHRC ikora raporo zisesengura uburenganzira bw\u2019abaturage n\u2019ibyemezo byo kubungabunga amahoro. OHCHR nayo igafasha mu gushyiraho amategeko n\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019imbere mu gihugu.\nImbogamizi ONU ihura nazo.\nN\u2019ubwo ONU ifite intego nyinshi, hari imbogamizi ikomeye:\nIngero z\u2019Ubwirinzi bw\u2019Uburenganzira bwa Muntu n\u2019Ibikorwa by\u2019ONU.\nUmuryango w\u2019Abibumbye ukora ibikorwa byinshi byo kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu ku isi hose. Ibikorwa by\u2019ingenzi birimo kohereza abagenzuzi mu bihugu byugarijwe n\u2019intambara cyangwa ihohoterwa, gutanga raporo zisesengura uko uburenganzira bushyirwa mu bikorwa, no gushyigikira gahunda z\u2019uburezi n\u2019ubuzima ku bana n\u2019abagore.\nImbogamizi z\u2019Ibikorwa.\nN\u2019ubwo hari intambwe zatewe, ONU ihura n\u2019imbogamizi zikomeye:\nImbogamizi ku rwego rw\u2019Imiyoborere n\u2019Imikoranire.\nUbubasha bwa ONU burangwa n\u2019imiyoborere y\u2019amahanga n\u2019ubufatanye bw\u2019ibihugu. Hari ibibazo bikurikira:\nIterambere rishya mu burenganzira bwa muntu.\nMu kinyejana cya 21, uburenganzira bwa muntu buhura n\u2019ihindagurika ry\u2019isi ryihuse, irimo ikoranabuhanga, imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere, n\u2019ubusumbane bw\u2019ubukungu. ONU yashyizeho gahunda nshya zo kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu no gushyigikira ibihugu mu guhangana n\u2019izi ngorane.\nkoranabuhanga rihindura uburyo abantu bavugana, bakora, kandi bakora ubuvugizi. Gusa rifite ingaruka ku burenganzira bw\u2019abantu:\nUbufatanye bw\u2019Imiryango y\u2019ibihugu n\u2019iyigenga.\nONU ikorana n\u2019imiryango y\u2019ibihugu, imiryango itari iya leta (NGOs), n\u2019ibigo mpuzamahanga mu kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu. Ubufatanye bukorwa mu buryo bukurikira:\nIngaruka z\u2019izi gahunda.\nUbufatanye bw\u2019ONU n\u2019imiryango butanga umusaruro mu buryo bukurikira:\nImbogamizi z\u2019Iterambere rishya.\nN\u2019ubwo hari intambwe, hari imbogamizi zikomeye:\nInama n\u2019Recommendations ku kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nMu rwego rwo gukomeza guteza imbere uburenganzira bwa muntu ku isi, inama zikurikira zifite akamaro:"}
{"id": "21185", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21185", "title": "Indangagaciro y\u2019Umuco n\u2019Uburenganzira bwo Kwiyumva mu Itsinda", "text": "Indangagaciro y\u2019Umuco n\u2019Uburenganzira bwo Kwiyumva mu Itsinda ni inyandiko isesengura uburyo umuco w\u2019abantu, indangagaciro zabo, n\u2019imiryango bifitanye isano n\u2019uburenganzira bwo kwiyumvamo agace cyangwa itsinda, kandi igahabwa agaciro n\u2019amategeko mpuzamahanga.\nInkomoko y\u2019Indangagaciro y\u2019Umuco.\nUmuco ni uburyo abantu bahurira ku myemerere, imigenzo, amateka, ubuvanganzo, n\u2019imyitwarire. Kwiyumva mu itsinda ni kimwe mu by\u2019ingenzi byo kubaka umuryango w\u2019abantu ndetse n\u2019iterambere ryabo.\nAbahanga mu by\u2019ubumenyi bw\u2019umuco bavuga ko indangagaciro y\u2019umuco igira uruhare mu:\nAgaciro k\u2019Uburenganzira bwo Kwiyumva mu Itsinda.\nUburenganzira bwo kwiyumva mu itsinda cyangwa mu muco wihariye burengera:\nAmategeko Mpuzamahanga arengera Umuco.\nUburenganzira bwo kwiyumva mu itsinda bufitanye isano n\u2019amategeko mpuzamahanga arengera indangagaciro z\u2019umuco. Aya mategeko agenga uburenganzira bwo kubaho no kugaragaza umuco, kandi akurikirana ko abantu bose bashobora kwishyira hamwe mu matsinda y\u2019umuco n\u2019imiryango yabo.\nUniversal Declaration of Human Rights (UDHR).\nIngingo ya 27: Umuntu wese afite uburenganzira bwo kwitabira ubuzima bw\u2019umuco w\u2019abantu, kuryoherwa n\u2019ubuhanzi, no kugira uruhare mu bikorwa by\u2019ubumenyi n\u2019ubuhanzi by\u2019umuco.\nInternational Covenant on Economic, Social and Cultural Rights (ICESCR).\nIngingo ya 15: Abaturage bose bafite uburenganzira bwo kugaragaza no kubungabunga umuco wabo, gufata gahunda z\u2019uburezi zishingiye ku muco, no gukoresha ururimi kavukire mu myigire yabo.\nUNESCO Convention on the Protection and Promotion of the Diversity of Cultural Expressions (2005).\n- Intego nyamukuru ni ugushyigikira uburenganzira bwo kugaragaza umuco n\u2019ubuhanzi, kurengera umwihariko w\u2019ibihugu n\u2019imiryango, no guteza imbere imiryango y\u2019umuco.\nIngero z\u2019Isi Hose ku Burenganzira bwo Kwiyumva mu Itsinda n\u2019Umuco.\nUburenganzira bwo kwiyumva mu itsinda bugenda buterwa imbere mu bihugu bitandukanye, hakurikijwe amategeko mpuzamahanga, ubuyobozi bw\u2019imbere mu gihugu, n\u2019imiryango yigenga.\nUburenganzira bwo Kwiyumva mu Itsinda muri Canada.\nCanada ifite amategeko arengera indangagaciro z\u2019abo mu bihugu byabo kavukire n\u2019abimukira. Itegeko ry\u2019Uburinganire n\u2019Uburenganzira bwa muntu ryemerera buri wese kwiyumva mu itsinda ry\u2019umuco we, kwitabira imihango, no gukoresha ururimi kavukire.\nUburenganzira bwo Kwiyumva mu Itsinda muri Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande (Aotearoa).\nItegeko rya Waitangi rifasha abanya-M\u0101ori kubungabunga umuco wabo, indimi zabo, n\u2019imigenzo y\u2019umuco. Abaturage bose bafite uburenganzira bwo kugaragaza indangagaciro z\u2019umuco wabo mu mashuri, ibikorwa by\u2019ubuhanzi, n\u2019imihango.\nUburenganzira bwo Kwiyumva mu Itsinda muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo.\nItegeko nshinga rya Afurika y\u2019Epfo rishyiraho uburyo bwo kurengera indangagaciro z\u2019amoko atandukanye. Abaturage bafite uburenganzira bwo kugaragaza imyemerere yabo, kwambara imyambaro y\u2019umuco, no gutanga uburezi bushingiye ku muco wabo.\nImbogamizi n\u2019Ihohoterwa ku Bumenyi bw\u2019Umuco.\nN\u2019ubwo hari amategeko mpuzamahanga n\u2019imbere mu bihugu arengera indangagaciro z\u2019umuco, hari ibibazo byinshi bikigaragara mu isi yose. Izi mbogamizi zirimo:\nUruhare rw\u2019Imiryango Mpuzamahanga n\u2019Amabwiriza ya ONU.\nImiryango mpuzamahanga nka UNESCO, OHCHR, na UNDP ifite uruhare rukomeye mu kurengera indangagaciro z\u2019umuco no gushyigikira uburenganzira bwo kwiyumva mu itsinda. Iyi miryango ishyiraho gahunda, raporo, n\u2019ingamba zo gukurikirana ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019umuco ku isi yose.\nInama n\u2019Recommendations ku Kurengera Uburenganzira bwo Kwiyumva mu Itsinda.\nMu rwego rwo guteza imbere uburenganzira bwo kwiyumva mu itsinda no kurengera indangagaciro z\u2019umuco, inama zikurikira zirakenewe:"}
{"id": "21186", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21186", "title": "Uburenganzira ku Buzima bw\u2019Iganga mu Ikoranabuhanga (Right to Privacy in the Digital Age)", "text": "Uburenganzira ku Buzima bw\u2019Iganga mu Ikoranabuhanga ni uburenganzira bw\u2019umuntu bwo kugira amakuru ye bwite, uburyo asangirwa, n\u2019uko akoreshwa n\u2019abakoresha ikoranabuhanga ku isi yose.\nInkomoko y\u2019Uburenganzira ku Buzima bw\u2019Iganga.\nUburenganzira ku buzima bwite bw\u2019umuntu (privacy) bufite inkomoko mu mategeko mpuzamahanga arengera uburenganzira bwa muntu, nk\u2019UDHR Ingingo ya 12 n\u2019ICESCR Ingingo ya 17. Mu gihe cy\u2019ikoranabuhanga, ubu burenganzira bwiyongereye kubera:\nAgaciro k\u2019Uburenganzira ku Buzima bw\u2019Iganga.\nUburenganzira ku buzima bwite mu ikoranabuhanga burimo:\nAmategeko Mpuzamahanga arengera Uburenganzira ku Buzima bw\u2019Iganga.\nUburenganzira ku buzima bwite (privacy) mu ikoranabuhanga burengerwa n\u2019amategeko mpuzamahanga atandukanye, arimo:\nUniversal Declaration of Human Rights (UDHR).\n-Ingingo ya 12: Ntihagomba guhonyorwa ubuzima bwite bw\u2019umuntu, urugo rwe, amakuru ye bwite cyangwa ibaruwa ze. Uburenganzira bwo kurindwa gucibwa bugufi bwubahirizwa kandi bufatwa nk\u2019ingenzi mu isi yose.\nInternational Covenant on Civil and Political Rights (ICCPR).\nIngingo ya 17:Ntihagomba guhonyorwa ubuzima bwite cyangwa amakuru bwite y\u2019umuntu. Buri gihugu gifite inshingano zo kubahiriza no kurengera ubuzima bwite bw\u2019abaturage bacyo, harimo no mu ikoranabuhanga.\nEuropean General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).\n- Itegeko ry\u2019Uburayi ryo kurengera amakuru y\u2019abaturage ku murandasi, rikubiyemo uburenganzira bwo kumenya, kugenzura, no gusaba ko amakuru yawe bwite asibwa cyangwa ahindurwe.\nIngero z\u2019Isi Hose ku Buzima bw\u2019Iganga mu Ikoranabuhanga.\nUburenganzira ku buzima bwite mu ikoranabuhanga burakurikiranwa mu bihugu bitandukanye, hifashishijwe amategeko n\u2019inzego zishinzwe kurengera amakuru y\u2019abaturage.\nUburenganzira bwa Privacy muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika (USA).\nMu USA, amategeko nka California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) arengera ubuzima bwite bw\u2019abaturage, ndetse no kugenzura amakuru y\u2019abakoresha urubuga. Abaturage bafite uburenganzira bwo kumenya, gusaba gusibanganya cyangwa guhindura amakuru yabo bwite.\nUburenganzira bwa Privacy mu Burayi.\nItegeko rya GDPR ryo mu Burayi ritanga uburenganzira ku makuru bwite, rituma abaturage bamenya neza amakuru abacisha bugufi, uburyo akoreshwa, n\u2019uburenganzira bwo kuyasiba cyangwa kuyahindura.\nUburenganzira bwa Privacy muri Koreya y\u2019Epfo.\nKoreya y\u2019Epfo ifite amategeko akomeye yo kurengera amakuru y\u2019abaturage ku murandasi (Personal Information Protection Act, PIPA). Abaturage bafite uburenganzira bwo kumenya uburyo amakuru yabo akoreshwa, kandi ibigo bigomba gukurikiza amabwiriza akomeye yo kubika amakuru.\nImbogamizi n\u2019Inzitizi mu Kurengera Uburenganzira ku Buzima bw\u2019Iganga.\nN\u2019ubwo hari amategeko arengera ubuzima bwite mu bihugu byinshi, hari ibibazo bikomeye bikigaragara mu isi yose:\nUruhare rw\u2019Imiryango Mpuzamahanga mu Kurengera Uburenganzira bwa Privacy.\nImiryango mpuzamahanga nka OHCHR, UNESCO, na Internet Governance Forum (IGF) ifite uruhare rukomeye mu gukurikirana no gushyigikira uburenganzira ku buzima bwite mu ikoranabuhanga. Iyi miryango ishyiraho amategeko, raporo, n\u2019ingamba zo kurengera amakuru y\u2019abantu ku isi yose."}
{"id": "21187", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21187", "title": "Kurwanya Ubukene Biciye mu Buryo bwo Kurengera Uburenganzira bwa Muntu", "text": "Kurwanya Ubukene Biciye mu Buryo bwo Kurengera Uburenganzira bwa Muntu ni uburyo bwo gukoresha amahame y\u2019Uburinganire, Uburenganzira bwa Muntu, n\u2019amategeko mpuzamahanga mu guhangana n\u2019ubukene no guteza imbere imibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage bose.\nInkomoko y\u2019Uburyo Bushingiye ku Burenganzira bwa Muntu.\nUburyo bushingiye ku burenganzira bwa muntu (Human Rights-Based Approach, HRBA) bufite inkomoko mu mategeko mpuzamahanga arengera uburenganzira bwa muntu, nk\u2019 UDHR (1948), ICESCR (1966), na gahunda za UNDP zo guteza imbere imibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage.\n=== Agaciro k\u2019Uburyo Bushingiye ku Burenganzira bwa Muntu mu Kurwanya Ubukene Uburyo bushingiye ku burenganzira bwa muntu bufasha:\n=== Imbonerahamwe: Ingingo Z\u2019ingenzi za HRBA mu Kurwanya Ubukene\nAmategeko Mpuzamahanga n\u2019Uburyo Bushingiye ku Burenganzira bwa Muntu mu Kurwanya Ubukene.\nUburyo bushingiye ku burenganzira bwa muntu bukurikiza amahame n\u2019amategeko mpuzamahanga agamije guteza imbere imibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage, kurwanya ubukene, no kurengera abagore, abana, n\u2019abandi bantu bafite intege nke.\nAmasezerano Mpuzamahanga arengera Iterambere.\n - Ingingo ya 22 na 25 zerekana ko abantu bose bafite uburenganzira ku mibereho iboneye, harimo ubuzima, uburezi, ibiribwa bihagije, amazu, n\u2019imyambaro.\n - Iri tegeko ryongera kurengera uburenganzira ku buzima, uburezi, serivisi z\u2019imibereho myiza, ndetse n\u2019amahirwe angana ku baturage bose, bikaba intambwe ikomeye mu kurwanya ubukene.\n - Ibi bigamije kugabanya ubukene ku isi yose, guteza imbere imibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage, no kurengera uburenganzira bw\u2019abantu bose mu buryo burambye.\nUburyo Bushingiye ku Burenganzira bwa Muntu mu Iterambere.\n - UNDP na OHCHR bashyiraho HRBA aho buri wese afatwa nk\u2019ufite uburenganzira bungana bwo kubona serivisi, amahirwe y\u2019uburezi, ubuzima, n\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019iterambere. Uburyo bushingiye ku burenganzira bwa muntu bugamije guhuza gahunda z\u2019iterambere n\u2019amategeko mpuzamahanga.\nUmwanzuro.\nKurwanya ubukene biciye mu buryo bwo kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu ni ngombwa kugira ngo iterambere rirambye rigerweho. Uburyo bushingiye ku burenganzira bwa muntu bufasha:\nIbihugu, imiryango mpuzamahanga, n\u2019abikorera mu iterambere bagomba gukorana kugira ngo uburenganzira bwa muntu bugere ku bantu bose, bigafasha kugabanya ubukene ku isi yose."}
{"id": "21188", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21188", "title": "Uburenganzira karemano n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019amategeko", "text": "Uburenganzira karemano n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019amategeko ni ibitekerezo bibiri by\u2019ingenzi mu mategeko n\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu. Bamwe mu batekereza ku mategeko n\u2019uburenganzira batangaza ko hariho ubwoko bubiri bw\u2019uburenganzira: uburenganzira karemano (natural rights) n\u2019 uburenganzira bw\u2019amategeko (legal rights).\nUburenganzira Karemano.\nUburenganzira karemano ni uburenganzira umuntu afite atari ukubwe ku mategeko cyangwa imigenzo y\u2019umuco runaka cyangwa leta. Ni uburenganzira buhoraho, bw\u2019ingenzi, kandi budashobora guhabwa cyangwa gukurwaho n\u2019abantu. Nubwo amategeko ashobora kutubahiriza, umuntu ashobora kubuhomba bitewe n\u2019imyitwarire ye, urugero nko guhonyora uburenganzira bw\u2019undi.\nUburenganzira bw\u2019Amategeko.\nUburenganzira bw\u2019amategeko ni uburenganzira umuntu ahabwa n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019amategeko runaka. Ubu burenganzira bushobora guhinduka, gukurwaho cyangwa kugenzurwa n\u2019amategeko y\u2019abantu. Ibi bihuza n\u2019icyitwa amategeko yemewe (positive law).\nAmateka y\u2019Uburenganzira Karemano.\nUburenganzira karemano bufite inkomoko mu mitekerereze ya kera kandi bukomeje kugira uruhare mu mategeko n\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu kugeza n\u2019ubu.\nFilozofe n\u2019Abategetsi Bagaragaje Uburenganzira Karemano.\nUburenganzira karemano bwagiye burushaho gusobanurwa no guhabwa agaciro n\u2019abafilozofe, abategetsi, n\u2019abanditsi b\u2019amateka mu bihe bitandukanye.\nThomas Hobbes na Social Contract.\nThomas Hobbes (1588\u20131679) yatanze igitekerezo cy\u2019uburenganzira karemano mu bitekerezo bye ku mategeko n\u2019ubutegetsi, agashimangira ko abantu bavukana uburenganzira bwo gukoresha imbaraga zabo kugira ngo barinde ubuzima bwabo."}
{"id": "21189", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21189", "title": "Uburenganzira bw\u2019Abaturage (Civil Liberties)", "text": "Uburenganzira bw'abaturage ni uburenganzira n\u2019ubwisanzure bw'ibanze buri ku rwego rw\u2019umuntu, aho leta yemera kutabuhungabanya, haba binyuze mu Itegeko Nshinga, amategeko asanzwe, cyangwa ibisobanuro by\u2019imanza, kandi hatabayeho gukurikiza amategeko agenga imikorere y\u2019ubutabera.\nBuri gihugu kigira uburyo bwacyo bwo gusobanura uburenganzira bw\u2019abaturage, ariko akenshi harimo:\nInyito Rusange n\u2019Amateka.\nUburenganzira bw\u2019abaturage bushobora kugaragarira mu Itegeko Nshinga, ibikubiye mu mategeko y\u2019ibanze, cyangwa mu masezerano mpuzamahanga nka:\nIgitekerezo cya civil liberties gishobora gusubizwa inyuma kugeza ku Itegeko rya Magna Carta ryashyizweho mu Bwongereza muri 1215, rikaba ryari ishingiro ry\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abaturage n\u2019ubwisanzure bw\u2019ibanze.\nUburenganzira bw\u2019abaturage buracyari ikibazo mu bihugu byinshi bitewe n\u2019ingaruka z\u2019intambara, iterabwoba, n\u2019icyemezo cyo gusubika uburenganzira bwihariye mu bihe byihutirwa.\nUburenganzira bw\u2019Abaturage mu Bihugu Bitandukanye.\nUbushinwa.\nItegeko Nshinga rya Repubulika y\u2019Ubushinwa rirengera uburenganzira bw\u2019abaturage ku rwego runaka, cyane cyane Ingingo z\u2019Iburenganzira n\u2019Inshingano z\u2019Abaturage. Ariko, mu bikorwa bya politiki, leta ikoresha amategeko yiswe \"subversion of state power\" na \"protection of state secrets\" mu gufunga abagaragaje ibitekerezo bibangamiye ishyaka rya Communist Party n\u2019abayobozi b\u2019igihugu.\nUbuhinde.\nItegeko Nshinga ry\u2019Ubuhinde (Part III) rirengera uburenganzira bw\u2019ibanze (Fundamental Rights) burimo uburinganire, ubwigenge, uburenganzira bwo kurengera umutungo, ubwisanzure bw\u2019iyobokamana, n\u2019uburenganzira ku bucuruzi n\u2019uburezi.\nUbuyapani.\nItegeko Nshinga ry\u2019Ubuyapani rya 1947, rizwi nka \"Postwar Constitution\" cyangwa \"Peace Constitution\", rirengera uburenganzira bw\u2019abaturage cyane mu bice 10\u201340, harimo n\u2019Ingingo ya 25 ishyiraho uburenganzira bwo kugira imibereho iboneye."}
{"id": "21190", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21190", "title": "Honduran Sign Language", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Honduran (Spanish, LESHO) ni ururimi rw'amarenga rwiganje rukoreshwa muri Honduras. Ururimi rw'amarenga rw'Abanyamerika rukunze gukoreshwa; kandi zombi ntabwo bifitanye isano."}
{"id": "21191", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21191", "title": "Hanoi Sign Language", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Hanoi ni ururimi rw'amarenga rw'ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva- umujyi wa Hanoi muri Vietnam. Hafi ya 50% hamwe n'izindi ndimi z'amarenga zo muri Vietnam, kandi amagambo yayo yagiye agira uruhare runini mu rurimi rw'amarenga rw'igifaransa rwigeze kwigishwa mu mashuri yo muri Vietnam yo ku ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva."}
{"id": "21192", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21192", "title": "Guyanase Sign Language", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwo muri Giyane ni ururimi rw'amarenga rw'ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva rwa Guyana. Amakuru make ahari. Kubera ko Ururimi rw'amarenga rw'Abanyamerika rukoreshwa mu burezi muri Guyana, \"Ururimi rw'amarenga rwo muri Giyane\" rushobora kuba izina ryaho rya ASL."}
{"id": "21193", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21193", "title": "Guinea-Bissau Sign Language", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Gineya-Bissau (Portuguese cyangwa L\u00edngua de sinais guineense.\u200b\u200bNi ururimi rw'amarenga ruri mu rugendo rwo gukura, rukomoka ku ishuri rimwe ry'abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva ryo muri Gineya-Bisawu, ryashinzwe i Bissau mu mwaka wa 2003. Mu 2005, umunyalinguist n'umwarimu w'ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Porutugali basanze GBSL (Guinea-Bissau Sign Language) ikiri ururimi rudateye imbere cyane, ariko ifite ubusugire bumwe hagati y'abnyeshuri mu ishuri no mu buryo bakoreshaga amarenga mu miryango yabo iyo basubiye mu rugo.\nNtabwo bifitanye isano itaziguye n'ururimi rw'amarenga rw'igiportigale, nubwo rwatije inyuguti. "}
{"id": "21194", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21194", "title": "Gambian Sign Language", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Gambiya ni ururimi rw'amarenga rw'igihugu rukoreshwa n'umuryango w'abatumva muri Gambiya. Ishuri ryonyine ry\u2019ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva bo muri Gambiya, Ishuri rya St John ry\u2019ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva, ryashinzwe n\u2019umupadiri gatolika ukomoka muri Irilande. Ururimi rw'amarenga rwo mu Buholandi rwinjijwe muri iryo shuri hamwe n'ururimi rw'amarenga rwo mu Bwongereza rwateye imbere mu rurimi rw'amarenga rwo muri Gambiya, rurimo ibimenyetso bimwe na bimwe kavukire byakoreshwaga n'abaturage muri rusange. \"Bitandukanye\" [] y\u2019iburengerazuba, Ururimi rw'amarenga rw'Abanyamerika ntirwigeze rwinjizwa muri Gambiya kugeza nyuma yaho bityo umuryango w'ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva utamenyereye ururimi rw'amarenga rw'Abanyamerika."}
{"id": "21195", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21195", "title": "Expression (sign language)", "text": "Mu ndimi z'amarenga, imvugo ni imiterere yihariye y'umubiri hamwe no mu maso bijyana n'amarenga, kandi bikenewe mu gukora amagambo neza. Imvugo ni kimwe mu bintu bitanu bigize ikimenyetso, hamwe na handhape (DEZ), icyerekezo (ORI), ahantu (TAB), no kugenda (SIG). Ikintu cy'ingenzi kigaragaza imvugo ni umunwa. Ariko kandi, si ibimenyetso byose bifite imvugo yihariye isanzwe ibiranga. [\"citation ikenewe\"]"}
{"id": "21196", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21196", "title": "European Sign Language Centre", "text": "Ikigo cy\u2019ururimi rw\u2019amarenga mu Burayi (ESC) n\u2019umuryango udaharanira inyungu, ukorera mu rwego rwo guteza imbere no kongera kumenyekanisha no gukoresha ururimi rw\u2019amarenga."}
{"id": "21197", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21197", "title": "Ethiopian sign languages", "text": "Indimi nyinshi z\u2019amarenga zo muri Etiyopiya zagiye zikoreshwa mu mashuri atandukanye ya Etiyopiya y\u2019ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva kuva mu 1971, ndetse no ku rwego rw\u2019ibanze kuva 1956. Ururimi rw\u2019amarenga rwo muri Etiyopiya, rushobora kuba ari urwego rw\u2019igihugu, rukoreshwa mu mashuri abanza, ayisumbuye, ndetse no muri kaminuza ya Addis Abeba - amashuri makuru, ndetse na televiziyo y'igihugu. [\"citation ikenewe\"]"}
{"id": "21198", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21198", "title": "Enga Sign Language", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Enga ni ururimi rw'amarenga rugaragara mu baturage ba Tato Enga mu ntara ya Enga, Papouasie-Nouvelle-Guin\u00e9e. Byatangajwe mu 1980 mu ngingo eshatu zanditswe na Adam Kendon, zishingiye kuri filime zishingiye ku moko y\u2019abasinyiye batatu (umwe ntiyumva, babiri bumva) mu kibaya cyo hejuru cy\u2019umugezi wa Lagaip, ariko havugwa amakuru avuga ko akoreshwa cyane mu karere gakikije. Amakuru ajyanye n'aho ihagaze ubu ntaramenyekana, kuko nta makuru mashya ahari."}
{"id": "21199", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21199", "title": "Signed Dutch", "text": "Nederland yahuye na Gebaren (NmG), cyangwa Ikimenyetso cyashyizweho umukono n\u2019Ubuholandi, ni uburyo bwandikishijwe intoki bw\u2019Abadage, bukoresheje ibimenyetso by\u2019ururimi rw\u2019amarenga rw\u2019Ubuholandi, bukoreshwa mu kwigisha mu Buholandi izondimi kandi zigafasha cyane ababana nubumuga bwo kutumva."}
{"id": "21200", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21200", "title": "Sign-Language Media", "text": "Sign-Language Media ni itangazamakuru rishingiye kuri sisitemu y'itangazamakuru ry'indimi z'amarenga. Ihuriro byubatswe kumiterere yikibonezamvugo igoye ikozwe muzindi ndimi z amarenga. Mubisanzwe itangazamakuru ryubatswe mundimi cyangwa indimi zanditse, kandi akenshi ntizihuza nururimi rwamarenga.\nItangazamakuru ryururimi rwamarenga rifite ibintu byihariye:"}
{"id": "21201", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21201", "title": "Douentza Sign Language", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Douentza, cyangwa ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Dogon ni ururimi rw'amarenga rw'abaturage ruvugwa muri Douentza ndetse n'abaturage baturanye bo mu gihugu cya Dogon muri Mali. Ntibizwi ukuntu bishobora kuba bisa n'ururimi rw'amarenga rwo mu mudugudu hafi, Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Tebul, ariko rushobora kuba ntaho ruhuriye n'urundi rurimi rw'amarenga rwo mu karere ka Dogon, Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Berbey. Kugeza mu 2013, nta shuri ry\u2019ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva muri ako karere, ariko harateganijwe; itangizwa ry'ururimi rw'amarenga rw'abanyamerika nk'ururimi rw'inyigisho rushobora kugira ingaruka kubimenyetso bya Douentza. Ikusanyamakuru ryakusanyirijwe hamwe n'ikigo cya Max Planck Institute for Psycholinguistics kugirango cyandike urupapuro rwabanjirije ururimi."}
{"id": "21202", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21202", "title": "Sign Language System", "text": "Sisitemu ry'ururimi rw'amarenga, [a] izwi kandi ku rurimi rwasinywe [b] cyangwa Igipolonye cyasinywe, ni uburyo bwandikishijwe intoki bw'igipolonye bukoresha ibimenyetso by'ururimi rw'amarenga rw'igipolonye. Bikunze gukoreshwa icyarimwe \"ubusemuzi\" bw'igipolonye mukimenyetso. kandi bigafasha cyane abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona\nMuri 2011, Sisitemu y'ururimi rw'amarenga rwo muri Polonye yemerewe n'amategeko."}
{"id": "21203", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21203", "title": "Czech Sign Language", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwo muri Ceki (Czech, \u010cZJ) ni ururimi rw'amarenga rw'ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva muri Repubulika ya Ceki. Birashoboka ko byagaragaye mu gihe cy'ishuri rya mbere ry'abana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva muri Bohemia (1786). N'umuryango w'ururimi rw'amarenga rw'igifaransa kandi urumva igice hamwe n'ururimi rw'amarenga rw'igifaransa. Nubwo imvugo yo muri Tch\u00e8que na Slovakiya isa, ntabwo yegereye cyane ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Silovakiya. [\"citation ikenewe\"]"}
{"id": "21204", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21204", "title": "Cypriot Sign Language", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Kupuro cyangwa Sipiriyani (Greek) ni ururimi rw'amarenga rudasanzwe rwa Kupuro. Bigaragara ko ari pidgin y'ururimi rw'amarenga rw'Abanyamerika n'ururimi rw'amarenga rw'ikigereki, rutaragera ku rurimi rwuzuye. Umuryango w'ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva bo mu Bugereki Sipiriyani ukoresha ururimi rw'amarenga rw'ikigereki. "}
{"id": "21205", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21205", "title": "Chiriqui Sign Language", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Chiriqui (Icyesipanyoli: \"Lengua de Se\u00f1as de Chiriqu\u00ed\", LSCH) ni rwo rurimi rw'amarenga rw'ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva rwo mu ntara ya Chiriqu\u00ed muri Panama. Ntabwo byumvikana niba bifitanye isano n'ururimi rw'amarenga rwo muri Panamani, rutumvikana neza na rwo; niba aribyo, byanaba bifitanye isano n'ururimi rw'amarenga rw'abanyamerika."}
{"id": "21206", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21206", "title": "Chilean manual alphabet", "text": "Imyandikire y'intoki ya Chili ikoreshwa n'umuryango w'abana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva bo muri Chili gusinya amagambo y'Icyesipanyoli kandi yinjijwe mu rurimi rw'amarenga rwo muri Chili. N'inyuguti imwe kandi isa cyane n'inyuguti z'intoki z'Abanyamerika, kimwe n'Igifaransa, Berezile na Espagne. "}
{"id": "21207", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21207", "title": "Central Taurus Sign Language", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Taurus rwagati (CTSL; Turkish) ni ururimi rw'amarenga rwo muri Turukiya. Bivugwa mu midugudu itatu yo mu misozi ya Taurus rwagati. Yamenyekanishijwe ku isi na Rabia Ergin, wagiye ayimenyeraho akura."}
{"id": "21208", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21208", "title": "Sign Language Glove", "text": "Sign language Glove ni igikoresho cya elegitoroniki kigerageza guhindura icyerekezo cy'ururimi rw'amarenga mu magambo yanditse cyangwa avugwa. Bamwe mu banenga ubwo buhanga bavuze ko ubushobozi bwa gants zifashishwa na sensor zo gukora ibi bikunze kuvugwa cyane cyangwa kutumva nabi, kubera ko indimi nyinshi z'amarenga zifite ikibonezamvugo kigoye gikubiyemo gukoresha ibimenyetso byerekana ibimenyetso no mu maso (ibintu bitari intoki).\niyi sisitemu ishobora kwambarwa irimo sensor zikoresha intoki enye nintoki kugirango umenye buri jambo, interuro cyangwa inyuguti nkuko bikozwe mururimi rwamarenga. \nIbyo bimenyetso noneho byoherezwa bidasubirwaho kuri terefone igendanwa, ikabihindura mumagambo yavuzwe ku kigero cyijambo rimwe kumasegonda hakoreshejwe iyo sisitemu. \nAbashakashatsi bongeyeho kandi ibyuma bifata bifata mu maso abantu bakoresheje mu gupima icyo gikoresho - hagati y'ijisho ryabo no ku ruhande rumwe rw'akanwa kabo - kugira ngo bafate ibintu bitaranga ururimi."}
{"id": "21209", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21209", "title": "Catalan manual alphabet", "text": "Imyandikire y'intoki ya Catalone ikoreshwa mu rurimi rw'amarenga rw'Igikatalani ariko ntiyemerwa ku mugaragaro nk'imwe mu ndimi zemewe za Cataloniya kugeza ku ya 3 Kamena 2010 igihe itegeko ryo kuwa 17/2010 ry\u2019ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Catalonike (LSC) ryemejwe na guverinoma. Imyandikire y'intoki ya Catalonike ni ukuboko kumwe kandi irasa cyane n'inyuguti ya Espagne. Kubera iyo mpamvu, abantu bakoresha ururimi rw'amarenga rw'Icyesipanyolio bashobora gusobanukirwa hafi 80% by'ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Cataliane. "}
{"id": "21210", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21210", "title": "Carhuahuaran Sign Language", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Carhuahuaran ni ururimi rw'amarenga rw'imiryango myinshi yo mu karere kavuga Quechua muri Peru."}
{"id": "21211", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21211", "title": "Brunca Sign Language", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Brunca ni ururimi rw'amarenga rw'umudugudu w'abasangwabutaka ba Brunca mu majyepfo ya Kosta Rika. Ntahantu ruhuriye n'ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Costa Rika."}
{"id": "21212", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21212", "title": "Bribri Sign Language", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Bribri rwari ururimi rw'amarenga rw'umudugudu w'abasangwabutaka ba Bribri mu majyepfo ya Kosta Rika. Ntahantu ruhuriye n'ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Costa Rika."}
{"id": "21213", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21213", "title": "Bouakako Sign Language", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Bouakako cyangwa LaSiBo (French) ni ururimi rw'amarenga rugaragara mu mudugudu wa Bouakako, mu burengerazuba bw'umujyi wa Hir\u00e9 mu majyepfo ya Coryte d'Ivoire. LaSiBo yakoreshejwe n'ibisekuru byinshi by'ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva, benshi muri bo bakaba bafitanye isano. Benshi mu baturage bumva, bavuga Yocobou\u00e9 Dida, hari icyo bazi m'ururimi, kandi bamwe bavuga neza. Amagambo aratandukanye hagati y'abavuga, byerekana ko ururimi rukiri ruto. Ukurikije imyaka y'abasinyaga babana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva cyane, birashoboka ko byibuze ifite imyaka 50 (as of 2016). \nLaSiBo isa n'ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Nanabin muri Gana, ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Mardin muri Turukiya n'izindi ndimi z'amarenga zo mu mudugudu zibanze mu miryango imwe cyangwa mike."}
{"id": "21214", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21214", "title": "Berbey Sign Language", "text": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwa Berbey ni ururimi rw'amarenga rw'umuryango w'umudugudu wa Berbey mu karere ka Hombori muri Mali. Ururimi rwaho ni Humburi Senni. Kuri ubu ururimi ruvugwa n'abavandimwe babiri (umwe muri bo akaba abana n'ubumuga bwo kutavuga) n'imiryango yabo, barimo abana bane babana nubwo bumuga. Mu gisekuru cya benewabo, abakoresha ibimenyetso bose bari abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva."}
{"id": "21215", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21215", "title": "Uburezi Bushyira Bose hamwe muri Eswatini", "text": "Ibarura rusange ryakozwe na Eswatini ryo mu 2017, ababana n'ubumuga bagera kuri 176.184, bangana na 16.1% by'abatuye igihugu. Icyorezo kiri hejuru cyane mu dore ko 82% by\u2019abafite ubumuga baba mu cyaro mu gihe 18% basigaye ari abo. mu 2017 ku rundi ruhande, ryerekana ko 52% by\u2019abafite ubumuga muri Eswatini nta mashuri bafite. Mu bitabira ishuri, 22,3% bahabwa impamyabumenyi y'amashuri abanza, mu gihe 9,6% bafite impamyabumenyi y'abato. Byongeye kandi, Ibarura rusange ry\u2019umwaka wa 2019 ryerekana ko mu gihugu hari abanyeshuri 41.565 bafite ibibazo by\u2019ubumuga n\u2019ubumuga bwihariye mu mashuri abanza (adasanzwe kandi asanzwe), muri bo 54% ni abagabo naho 45% ni ab'igitsina gore. \u200b\u200b\u200b\nAmashuri yihariye muri Eswatini.\nMinisiteri y\u2019Uburezi n\u2019Amahugurwa Itangazo ryihariye rya y\u2019uburezi, iteganya ko Eswatini ifite amashuri menshi yakira abantu bafite ibibazo byihariye (PSN) mu turere tune. Muri byo harimo:\nInzitizi.\nNubwo hashyizweho ingufu muri gahunda yuburezi burimo ibibazo byinshi. Ubwa mbere, gahunda yo kumenyekanisha hakiri kare abana bafite ibibazo byihariye byuburezi ntibibaho muri Eswatini, abarimu bigisha, cyane cyane kurwego, mubisanzwe bashinzwe umurimo utoroshye wo kumenya abanyeshuri bashobora gukenera Uburezi bwihariye, no kwagura SNE. Icya kabiri, hariho iterambere rito ry'abarimu kuko ababyeyi bananiwe kumenya ibimenyetso byambere abarimu bakeneye kongerera ubushobozi guhoraho mbere nakazi. Rimwe na rimwe iyo guverinoma ya Eswatini yohereje ibikoresho by\u2019ishuri kugirango bikoreshwe mu burezi bw\u2019abana bafite ubumuga n\u2019abafite ubumuga, ubusanzwe ni ibikoresho bijyanye n\u2019uburezi rusange. Abarimu n'abayobozi muri aya mashuri bakora cyane kugirango bahuze ibikoresho nibisabwa byihariye, kuburyo rimwe na rimwe bagomba kwishingikiriza ku baterankunga, badashobora guhora banyuze mubufasha. "}
{"id": "21216", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21216", "title": "Villaney &quot;Lany&quot; Remengesau", "text": "Villaney \"Lany\" Remengesau (wavutse 30 Werurwe 1985) numuntu uharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu muri Palau. Azwiho ubuvugizi ku Babana nubumuga muri Palau no mu karere kagari ka Aziya-Pasifika, ibyo bikaba byaratumye agirwa umuntu ukomeye cyane muri Palau mu 2024 n'ikigo cy'itangazamakuru cya Palau. \nUbuzima.\nRemengesau yavukiye i, muri Palau, mu murage wa Palauan na Aziya. Afite ubumuga bw'umubiri kandi akoresha igare ry'abamugaye. Yize imicungire yubucuruzi muri kaminuza, arubatse afite umwana. \nRemengesau yagize uruhare runini mubuyobozi no gutanga inama mugutezimbere amashyirahamwe nabafite ubumuga muri Palau. Yagize uruhare mu kubyutsa OMEKESANG, umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta uharanira uburenganzira bw'abafite ubumuga muri Palau, kandi wabaye umuyobozi wacyo kuva mu 2011 kugeza mu 2020. Ku buyobozi bwe, OMEKESANG yabonye ubunyamuryango bwuzuye bw\u2019imishinga mpuzamahanga iharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga, harimo ihuriro ry\u2019abafite ubumuga bwa pasifika, Aziya ya Pasifika DPO United, n\u2019abafite ubumuga mpuzamahanga. Remengesau yabaye kandi perezida w\u2019ishyirahamwe rya Belau ry\u2019imiryango itegamiye kuri Leta hagati ya 2018 na 2020. \nReferances"}
{"id": "21217", "revid": "2001", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21217", "title": "Hamisa Zaja", "text": "Hamisa Zaja (c.1972 -) numunyakenya uha imbaraga ababana nubumuga. Yashinze ishyirahamwe ry\u2019inyanja ry\u2019abafite ubumuga. Mu 2024 yabaye uwanyuma mu (USIP) Igihembo mpuzamahanga cy\u2019abagore bubaka amahoro.\nUbuzima.\nZaja yavutse ahagana mu 1972 mu ya Kenya. Yavuwe kugira umuriro igihe yari akiri umwana, kubera iyo mpamvu afite ukuguru kumugaye. Yagiye mu ishuri rya Port Ritz ry\u2019abafite ubumuga nyuma y\u2019ishuri ryisumbuye rya Mama Ngina. Yari azi ko umuryango we wateguye ubukwe bw'abana babo, ariko nta mukandida wamenyekanye. Yakomeje arangiza amashuri yubuyobozi. \nZaja yashinze ishyirahamwe ry\u2019inyanja ry\u2019abafite ubumuga. Yatorewe kuba muri ya. "}
{"id": "21218", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21218", "title": "Ola Abu Al Ghaib", "text": "Ola Abu Al Ghaib cyangwa Ola Abualghaib (Arabic) ni umuvugizi uharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga ku isi. Muri Kanama 2019, yagizwe Umuyobozi w\u2019Ubunyamabanga bwa Tekinike bw\u2019ikigega cy\u2019abafite ubumuga ku isi, ahahoze ari Umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ku burenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga (UNPRPD).\nDr. Abualghaib yayoboye iterambere ry\u2019uyu muryango no gushyira mu bikorwa ingamba z\u2019ibikorwa (SOF) muri 2020\u20132025 na 2025-2030, avuga ko Ikigega ari umufatanyabikorwa w\u2019isi ku isi uteza imbere ubumuga. Ku buyobozi bwe, miliyoni zisaga 100 USD zashowe mu bihugu birenga 100 byo mu turere dutanu.\nAbualghaib yagaragaye muri Apolitical's Gender Equality Urutonde 100 rwabantu bakomeye muri politiki yisi yose muri 2019.\nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nAbu Al Ghaib yavukiye i Nablus, ku nkombe y\u2019Iburengerazuba, yari afite imyaka cumi n'ibiri ubwo yaburaga gukoresha amaguru. Kubera ibyo bihe byahinduye ubuzima, yahatiwe kuguma mu rugo imyaka itatu atize. Igihe amashuri yari hafi yanze kumwandikisha kubera ubuzima bwe, yimukiye i, ari naho yiyandikishije mu. Ku ikubitiro umunyeshuri witegereza, yemerewe kumugaragaro nyuma yo kubona amanota menshi mwishuri rye.\nUmwuga.\nAbu Al Ghaib yatangiye umwuga we uharanira uburenganzira bwe ku kigo mu gihe cya kaminuza. Imbaraga zamuhesheje umwanya muri komite ishinzwe kubaka ikigo, aho yahinduye ikigo cya kaminuza n\u2019abanyeshuri bamugaye.\nMuri Palesitine, Abu Al Ghaib yashinze umuryango wa Stars of Hope Society, umuryango ugamije gukemura ibibazo by\u2019abagore bafite ubumuga no kubashyigikira mu kubahiriza uburenganzira bwabo."}
{"id": "21219", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21219", "title": "Mental Disability Advocacy Center (MDAC)", "text": "Ikigo gishinzwe ubuvugizi cy\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe (MDAC) ni umuryango washinzwe muri Hongiriya mu 2002. Icyicaro cyayo i Budapest. \nUbisobanuro.\nIkigo gishinzwe ubuvugizi cy\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe (MDAC) n\u2019umuryango mpuzamahanga uharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu uteza imbere uburenganzira bw\u2019abana n\u2019abantu bakuru bafite ubumuga bwo kwiga, ubwenge n\u2019ubwenge-bw\u2019imibereho (ubuzima bwo mu mutwe).MDAC ikoresha amategeko mu guteza imbere uburinganire no binyuze mu manza zifatika, ubuvugizi, ubushakashatsi no gukurikirana no kongerera ubushobozi.MDAC ikorera ku rwego rw'isi kimwe n'akarere ndetse n'imbere mu Burayi no muri Afurika. \nIbyagezweho.\nKuva mu 2002, MDAC yageze kuri ibi bikurikira:"}
