{"id": "21221", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21221", "title": "Ishyirahamwe ryabanyamerika bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva", "text": "Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Abanyamerika bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva (AHIHA) ryashinzwe mu 1973 na Stan Mikita, umukinnyi wa Chicago Blackhawks, hamwe na Irv Tiahnybik, umucuruzi wo muri ako karere. Iri shyirahamwe ryaje gushingwa nyuma y\u2019uko Irv Tiahnybik abonye ingorane umuhungu we utumva neza yari afite hamwe n\u2019abandi bana bumva. Inkambi ya Hockey yahise ikura vuba ikurura abakinyi ba ruhago batumva kandi bigoye kumva baturutse mu mpande zose zigihugu.\nIri shyirahamwe ritegura Inkambi ya Hockey ya Stan Mikita, imara icyumweru buri mwaka, ibera muri Woodridge, Illinois, mu Seven Bridges Ice Arena. Iyo nkambi ubwayo ni ubuntu, nubwo abakinnyi bagomba kwishyurira ibikoresho byabo no kwishyura icumbi ry\u2019amahoteli.\nUretse gutera inkunga iyo nkambi, AHIHA inafasha mu gushyigikira abakinnyi bayo, itanga bourse/inkunga y\u2019ishuri, kandi igafasha abana kubona ibikoresho byo kumva hearing aids. Ikipe ya Deaflympics mu mukino wa hockey ku mucanga w\u2019amazi ikunze gukorwa ahanini n\u2019abakinnyi ba AHIHA, kandi yahagarariye Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu mwaka wa 2007 muri Salt Lake CityIn addition to sponsoring th"}
{"id": "21222", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21222", "title": "Doug Alker", "text": "Doug Alker (1940 - 2025) yahoze ayobora ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abatumva bo mu Bwongereza n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019Ubwami cyita ku Batumva. \"\u200b\", igitabo cye yasohoye mu buryo bwe bwite mu mwaka wa 2000, \"Really Not Interested in the Deaf?\", gikubiyemo kunenga Ikigo cy\u2019Ubwami cyita ku Batumva (RNID) ndetse n\u2019inkuru y\u2019uko yasezeye muri icyo kigo.\nAmaze kuva muri RNID yashinze umutwe w\u2019igitutu cya politiki Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abatumva (FDP) mu mwaka wa 1997. Nka perezida, we na FDP bashinzwe cyane cyane guhatira leta y\u2019Ubwongereza kwemeza ku mugaragaro ururimi rw\u2019amarenga rw\u2019Abongereza. Ku wa 18 Werurwe 2003 guverinoma y'Ubwongereza yemeye ku mugaragaro ko BSL ari ururimi rwonyine. \nYabanje gukora nk'umushakashatsi kuri gahunda ya tereviziyo ya BBC \"Reba Umva\". "}
{"id": "21223", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21223", "title": "Yooralla", "text": "Yooralla (ku mugaragaro umuryango wa Yooralla wa Victoria) ni umuryango utanga serivisi Zababana nubumuga muri Ositaraliya, utera inkunga abatsinze 30.000 babana n\u2019ubumuga. \nHistory.\nUmuryango wa Yooralla wa Victoria washinzwe mu 1977 mu rwego rwo guhuza ishuri ry\u2019ibitaro bya Yooralla na Sosiyete ya Victorian y\u2019abana bafite ubumuga.\nIshuri ryibitaro bya Yooralla (1918\u20131977).\nu 1918, Evangeline Irlande yashinze rya Yooralla ry\u2019abana bafite ubumuga, ishuri ry\u2019abana bamugaye. Yatewe inkunga no kuvumbura umwana wamugaye ababyeyi be bamusize mu kiraro cyinkoko mugihe bakoraga.] \u200b Mu Ntambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose, iryo shuri ryimuriwe ku musozi wa Makedoniya. Amaherezo yaje kubona indi mitungo myinshi. \nUmuryango wa Victorian kubana bamugaye (1935\u20131977).\nSosiyete ya Victorian y'abana bamugaye yashinzwe mu 1935 na, umugore w'umucamanza mukuru. Byari bifitanye isano rya bugufi n\u2019ishuri ry\u2019ibitaro bya Yooralla n\u2019ibitaro. Nyuma y'Intambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose yiswe Umuryango wa Victorian Society w'abana bamugaye n'abantu bakuru. Yakoraga amacumbi menshi yo guturamo abamugaye, hamwe n\u2019imyidagaduro hamwe n\u2019ibigo byigisha. "}
{"id": "21224", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21224", "title": "Treloar School", "text": "shuri rya Treloar n'Ishuri Rikuru ni inzu idatunganijwe ituwe kandi umunsi ku munsi ishuri rikuru na kaminuza by\u2019abana Babana ubumuga n\u2019urubyiruko, kuva ku myaka 2 kugeza kuri 25 i hafi ya, mu Bwongereza.\nIntego n'imiyoborere.\nIshuri na kaminuza bigamije gutanga uburezi bushoboza abamugaye, hifashishijwe uburyo bwo kwigisha, kwita, kuvura akazi, no. Bayoborwa na Treloar Trust, umugiraneza wanditswe. Ishuri, kaminuza, hamwe nicyizere bakunze kwita umwe cyangwa hamwe nka \"Treloar\". Icivugo cyemewe ni \"Treloar's: Gushoboza Uburezi\".\nAmateka.\nMu 1907, icyo gihe, yashyizeho 'Ikigega cy\u2019abamugaye' nk'ubujurire bwe. Intego ye kwari ukubaka ibitaro n\u2019ishuri hanze yumujyi kubana barwaye igituntu kitari ibihaha. Ku ya 13 Kamena 1907 yanditse mu gitabo cye ko Nyiricyubahiro 'yaje mu nzu ya Mansion kugira ngo afungure Fete y'umwamikazi mu rwego rwo gufasha ikigega cyanjye cy'abamugaye. Mu 1908, ishuri ry\u2019indaro n\u2019ibitaro byafunguwe muri Alton, nk\u2019ibitaro na College bya Lord Mayor Treloar Cripples. \nMu 1948, Ikigo cy\u2019igihugu cy\u2019ubuzima cyafashe ibitaro, maze ishuri rikuru rya Lord Mayor Treloar ryimukira i Alton, ryimukira mu kibanza gishya cyaguzwe na Trust mu 1949 mu mudugudu uri hafi ya. Mu 1965, ishuri ry\u2019abakobwa rya Florence Treloar ryafunguwe mu mudugudu wa Holybourne. Mu 1978, ayo mashuri yombi yahujwe ku izina rya Lord Mayor Treloar College, hamwe n'Ishuri Rito ryacumbikiwe muri Froyle n'Ishuri Rikuru rya Holybourne. "}
{"id": "21225", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21225", "title": "Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abatumva bo mu Bwongereza", "text": "Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Abatavuga n\u2019Abatumva mu Bwongereza (BDA) ni umuryango w\u2019ubugiraneza uyoborwa n\u2019abatavuga n\u2019abatumva ubwabo, ukaba urwanya akarengane kandi uvuganira abantu batumva bakoresha ururimi rw\u2019amarenga rwo mu Bwongereza.\nAmateka.\nIri shyirahamwe ryabanjeho ryari Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Igihugu ry\u2019Abatavuga n\u2019Abatumva (National Association for the Deaf and Dumb, NADD), ryashinzwe n\u2019abantu batumva mu mwaka wa 1886. Ishyirwaho rya NADD ryaturutse ku kibazo cy\u2019uko habonekaga ibimenyetso by\u2019ihungabanywa ry\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abatavuga n\u2019abatumva ku bijyanye n\u2019ururimi no ku burezi, byatewe n\u2019ibyemezo byafashwe mu nama yabereye i Milan mu mwaka wa 1880. Iyo nama mpuzamahanga, aho abenshi mu bitabiriye bari abarimu bigishaga abana batumva uburyo bwo kumva, yafashe umwanzuro wo guhagarika ikoreshwa ry\u2019indimi z\u2019amaboko ku isi yose. Nyuma y\u2019iyo nama, abitabiriye basubiye mu bihugu byabo bafite intego yo guca burundu ikoreshwa ry\u2019abarimu batumva ndetse n\u2019ikoreshwa ry\u2019ururimi rw\u2019amaboko mu mashuri. Banashakaga kandi gukomeza kugabanya ubwinshi bw\u2019abanyeshuri mu ishuri, kugira ngo abarimu bumva babashe kubagenzura neza.\nKomisiyo y\u2019umwami ishinzwe uburezi bw\u2019abana bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva yatangijwe mu mwaka wa 1889 ariko ntiyabasha kugisha inama abatumva kandi ishyigikira ishyirwaho ry\u2019imvugo itanduye bityo guhagarika ururimi rw\u2019amarenga; mu gusubiza ikinyamakuru \"Deaf Mute\" yashishikarije abatumva kwishyira hamwe kurengera inyungu zabo bwite. \nMu 1889, NADD yaretse kubaho bityo abagabo bane batumva, barimo Francis Maginn na George Healey, bategura inama muri Mutarama 1890 ku rusengero rwitiriwe Mutagatifu Saviour rw\u2019abatumva, Umuhanda wa Oxford, London, ku buryo bise \"Inama y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Imiryango n\u2019Ubukangurambaga by\u2019Abakuze Batavuga n\u2019Abatumva\". Iyi nama yasuzumye ishingwa ry\u2019umuryango w\u2019igihugu kugira ngo \"uzamure uburezi n\u2019imibereho y\u2019abatumva n\u2019ibiragi mu Bwongereza\" bituma havuka ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abatumva n\u2019ibiragi ry\u2019Abongereza (BDDA) i Leeds ku ya 1890. Mu mwaka wa 1971, BDDA yakuyemo ijambo \u201cDumb\u201d mu izina ryayo. Ntibyageze mu myaka ya 1970 ari bwo amashuri yatangiye kongera gusuzuma no kwakira ikoreshwa ry\u2019ururimi rw\u2019amaboko.\nKuza kw'ururimi rw'amarenga no kwemerwa na rubanda rusanzwe byatumye abayobozi b'ibipfamatwi bagaruka ku mwanya wa mbere guhera kuri Jock Young nk'intebe ya mbere y'abatumva mu 1983, kandi hagati mu myaka ya za 90, umuyobozi mukuru wa mbere w'abatumva, Jeff McWhinney.\nMu myaka ya za 90 BDA yabaye umuryango uyobowe n\u2019abatumva kandi ubukangurambaga bwo kumenyekanisha ururimi rw amarenga nabwo kugeza ubu intego nyamukuru yibikorwa byabo. Intebe ni Dr. Robert Adam. Intebe zabanjirije iyi zirimo nyakwigendera Terry Riley, umwanditsi wa gahunda ya BBC ' \"Reba Umva\". [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nIntebe.\nJock Young (1983-) \nMurray Holmes \nAmasezerano.\nMu mwaka wa 2003, BDA yasohoye inyandiko isobanura intambwe zitandukanye serivisi z\u2019abaturage zigomba gufata kugira ngo zorohereze abantu batumva n\u2019abakoresha Ururimi rw\u2019Amaboko rw\u2019Abongereza (BSL), iyo nyandiko bayise \u2018BSL Charter\u2019.\nMu mwaka wa 2017, BDA yasohoye verisiyo ivuguruye y\u2019iyo nyandiko, bayita Charter for British Sign Language. \nImikono.\nUmuyobozi w'i Londere, Sadiq Khan, yashyize umukono masezerano mu Gushyingo 2023."}
{"id": "21226", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21226", "title": "Rosewood Centre", "text": "kigo cya Rosewood cyari ikigo Cyiterambere ry\u2019ababana n' ubumuga giherereye ahitwa muri, \nAmateka.\nMuri Werurwe 1888, Inteko ishinga amategeko ya Maryland yemeje \"Itegeko ryo gushyiraho no gushyiramo ishuri ry\u2019ubuhungiro n\u2019amahugurwa ya Feeble Minded of the State of Maryland\" (Umutwe 183, Ibyakozwe na 1888) ryahaye ububasha Inama y\u2019abashyitsi cumi na barindwi yo kuyobora ikibanza cy\u2019ishuri \"kizakira, cyita kandi cyigisha abantu bose badafite ubwenge, badafite ubwenge n\u2019abatagira ubwenge. N'ubwo iri tegeko rikomeye, amadolari ibihumbi icumi yonyine niyo yagenewe ubutaka n\u2019inyubako, nyuma y\u2019amafaranga ibihumbi bitanu by\u2019amadolari nyuma y\u2019umwaka. Ubuhungiro bwagombaga kuba ubuntu kubana bose batishoboye bafite hagati yimyaka irindwi na cumi nirindwi, bishyuza amadorari magana abiri na mirongo itanu kubandi bana bose.\nKubera amazu adahagije hamwe n\u2019amafaranga yatanzwe hamwe n\u2019umubare w\u2019abasaba kwemererwa (ugereranyije n\u2019inama y\u2019ubuzima ya Leta mu 1884 kuri 1,319) Inama y\u2019abashyitsi yagombaga gushyiraho politiki ibuza kwinjira. Byashyizweho n'Inama y'Ubutegetsi mu 1899, politiki yo kwinjira yagarukiye gusa ku \"bashobora guhura n'amahugurwa runaka hagamijwe ko batezwa imbere mu buryo bw'ingirakamaro no kwibeshaho, mu yandi magambo ni ishuri ryigisha kandi ntirigumane.\nGusa abana b'abazungu bari hagati yimyaka irindwi na cumi n'irindwi. Abahungu bigishijwe guhinga, guhinga no kubaza mu gihe abakobwa bize ubudozi, gukaraba, amata n'imboga, ndetse n'amahugurwa ya serivisi zo mu rugo. Hamwe nubu buhanga, twizeraga ko abagororwa bari kwibeshaho nibarekurwa bafite imyaka cumi nirindwi\nAmahugurwa yagize indi ntego nayo, kubera ko Inama y'Ubutegetsi yakunze kwerekana icyifuzo giteye isoni cyo gusaba ubuhungiro kwibeshaho. Ibyinshi mu biryo byakuze cyangwa byororerwa mu murima ukikije kandi hafi imyenda yose hamwe nimyenda yo kumeza byakozwe nabakobwa. Imyenda yose hamwe nogukora isuku byakozwe nabagororwa ndetse nakazi kabo ndetse gakoreshwa mugihe cyo gucukura inyubako nshya mumwaka wa 1892 na 1900.Umurima wakomeje gukora kugeza muri za 1960.\nIkinyejana cya 20.\nMu 1900, Inama y'Ubutegetsi yasabye ko hubakwa ishuri ryihariye ry '\"ibara ry\u2019ibara rifite intege nke\" ndetse n\u2019inyubako y\u2019inyongera ku bana b'igicuri. Ibyiringiro byanyuma byagezweho mugihe Thom Cottage yubatswe mu 1896 binyuze mubuterankunga. Ikindi cyizere cyagaragaye igihe mu 1894 na 1907 Inteko ishinga amategeko ya Maryland yemeje umushinga w'itegeko ryo kwimurira abarwayi bose b'abasazi kandi bafite ibitekerezo bidafite imbaraga kuva mu nyubako z\u2019intara mu bigo bya Leta. Mugihe ibi byateje igitutu ku gihingwa gifatika kuri Rosewood, cyanatumye inkunga ya leta ikomeza.\nKuva mu 1911 kugeza 1933, abarwayi 166, cyane cyane abagore n\u2019abakobwa, basize Rosewood munsi yanditswe na habeas corpus; bakorewe icuruzwa ryabantu, ryaguzwe nabakire nkabakozi batewe inkunga nabakozi badahembwa, bakunze kuvurwa kandi akenshi bagatereranwa n \"abarezi babo.\" Leo Kanner yamaganye aya mahano imbere y\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abanyamerika ryita ku barwayi bo mu mutwe mu 1937. \nMu muco uzwi.\nFilime ishimishije ya 2017 \"Ikigo\" gishingiye kubigo bya Rosewood. Filime yavuzwe nabayikora kugirango bashingire kubyabaye. "}
{"id": "21227", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21227", "title": "Imikino y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Abatumva m\u2019Ubushuhe ya 1989", "text": "Imikino y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Abatumva y\u2019Ubushuhe ya 1989, izwi ku izina rya 16 ry\u2019abatumva mu birori, ni imikino mpuzamahanga ya siporo myinshi yabaye kuva ku wa 7 kugeza ku wa 17 Mutarama 1989 muri Parike y\u2019umwamikazi Elizabeth II i Christchurch, muri Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande. "}
{"id": "21228", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21228", "title": "Ubushakashatsi bwo kutumva mu Bwongereza", "text": "Ubushakashatsi bwo kutumva mu Bwongereza (The Hearing Research Trust) bwari bumwe mu buyobozi bukomeye bw\u2019ubushakashatsi bw\u2019ubuvuzi bw\u2019Abongereza bukora mu rwego rwo kutumva. Ibikorwa byayo byingenzi ni ubushakashatsi bw'ubuvuzi n'uburezi.\nYashinzwe mu Gutsinda Ubumuga bwo kutumva mu 1985 n\u2019umudepite w\u2019Ubwongereza witwaga Jack Ashley n\u2019umugore we Pauline.\nYabaye igice cy'urukundo Igikorwa cyo Gutakaza Kumva muri 2013."}
{"id": "21229", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21229", "title": "Walter E. Fernald Developmental Center", "text": "Walter E. Fernald giteza imbere, nicyo kigo cya kera byatewe inkunga na leta bikorera ababana. Ku buyobozi bwa gatatu, Walter Fernald, byabaye icyitegererezo ku bigo bya Leta ku bamugaye mu iterambere. Nyuma niho habaye mu kinyejana cya 20. Iperereza kuri ubu bushakashatsi ryatumye amabwiriza mashya yerekeye ubushakashatsi bwabantu mu bana.\nIshuri rifite umutungo uri kumuhanda wa Trapelo muri.\nAmateka.\nIkigo cya Fernald, ubusanzwe cyiswe Ishuri Rikuru ryigisha kwigisha no guhugura abana ba Idiotic, ryashinzwe i Boston n\u2019umuvugurura mu 1848 hamwe n\u2019amadolari 2,500 yatanzwe n\u2019inteko ishinga amategeko ya Massachusetts. Ishuri ryagiye buhoro buhoro ryimukira ahitwa Waltham hagati ya 1888 na 1891. Amaherezo ryarimo inyubako 72 kuri. Igihe cyo hejuru, ishuri ryafunze abantu bagera ku 2500, abenshi muri bo bakaba ari \"abahungu batagira ubwenge \".\nUbushakashatsi bwubuvuzi bwa kirimbuzi mubana.\nIshuri rya Fernald niryo ryakorewe ubushakashatsi bwakozwe na 1946\u201353 bwakozwe na kaminuza ya Harvard na MIT bwerekanaga abana bato b'abahungu kwanduza dosiye ya isotopi ya radio. Inyandiko zabonetse mu 1994 n\u2019ishami ry\u2019ingufu muri Amerika zagaragaje ibisobanuro bikurikira:"}
{"id": "21230", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21230", "title": "Umuyoboro w\u2019itumanaho w\u2019abatumva", "text": "Deafnet (cyangwa DEAFNET) yashizweho nkumushinga wo kwerekana mu 1978 na SRI International (yahoze yitwa Stanford Research Institute) muri kaminuza ya Gallaudet ya Washington kubatumva. Yatewe inkunga n\u2019ishami ry\u2019ubuzima, uburezi, n\u2019imibereho myiza y\u2019Amerika kugira ngo yerekane ibyiza bya e-mail ku batumva.\nDeafnet yari yo yabayeho bwa mbere mu gukoresha koko icyuma cy\u2019itumanaho cyabugenewe ku batumva. Deafnet yatanze uburyo ku bantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva, abafite imiyoboro y\u2019itumanaho yari yaragabanijwe, bwo kuganira no kungukira mu muryango mushya w\u2019itumanaho. Deafnet yashyizweho nka Sisitemu ya Mudasobwa, ikomatanya ibikoresho byagenewe abakoresha bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva hamwe na terminal zisanzwe za mudasobwa. DEAFNET yanashyizeho kandi uburyo bwo kuganira mu gihe nyacyo (\u2018real-time chat\u2019) aho abakoresha bashoboraga kuganira ako kanya bakoresheje inyandiko.\nIbikoresho bisanzwe byakoreshwaga byari bigizwe na terminal ya Zenith ZT-1, Superphone (terminal ifite coupler yubatse imbere yemera guhuza na Baudot cyangwa ASCII ndetse ifite buffer y\u2019inyuguti 1000), hamwe na printer ya Epson. Igikoresho cya Superphone cyagurishwaga ku $495 mu mwaka wa 1981.\nDEAFNET yafatwa nk\u2019uburyo bwiza bwo kugabanya ikiguzi mu itumanaho ku batumva, ariko itangira ry\u2019ama-terminal akorana na ASCII ndetse na Internet nyuma yaho byasimbuje icyo gikeneye."}
{"id": "21231", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21231", "title": "Florida Kwiyandikisha kubasobanuzi kubatumva", "text": "Florida yandika abasemuzi batumva (FRID) ni umuryango udaharanira inyungu ugamije gufasha abasemuzi kubatumva kandi bafite ikibazo cyo kutumva baba muri leta ya Florida. FRID ni leta ifatanya na rejisitiri yabasobanuzi kubatumva. FRID ifite abanyamuryango barenga 950 guhera 2009. \nSisitemu yo Kugenzura Ubwiza bwa Floride.\n\"Sisitemu yo Kugenzura Ireme ry\u2019Ubunyamwuga muri Florida (Florida Quality Assurance Screening System) iyoborwa na FRID igamije gukora isuzuma ry\u2019\" abasobanurira abatumva bakoresha ururimi rw\u2019amaboko muri Florida. Isuzuma rigabanyijemo ibice bibiri: Icyanditse (Written) na Icyerekanwa mu bikorwa (Performance). Florida Registry of Interpreters for the Deaf (FRID) ntikigikora isuzuma ry\u2019ireme ry\u2019ubunyamwuga ryo mu gihugu imbere (in-state quality assurance screenings) kubera amasezerano bagiranye na Registry of Interpreters of the Deaf (RID).\nIsuzuma ryabasobanuzi ba Florida.\n\"Isuzuma ry\u2019Abasobanurira mu Mashuri rya Florida (Florida Educational Interpreter Evaluation) riyoborwa na FRID rigamije gukora isuzuma ry\u2019abasobanurira abatumva bakoresha ururimi rw\u2019amaboko muri Florida bakorera mu mashuri y\u2019incuke kugeza ku mwaka wa 12 (K\u201312). Isuzuma rigabanyijemo ibice bitatu: Icyanditse (Written), Ikiganiro (Interview), n\u2019Icyerekanwa mu bikorwa (Performance).\"\n\"Florida Registry of Interpreters for the Deaf (FRID) ntikigikora isuzuma ry\u2019abasobanurira mu mashuri ryo mu gihugu imbere (in-state educational interpreter screenings) kubera amasezerano bagiranye na Registry of Interpreters of the Deaf (RID).\""}
{"id": "21232", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21232", "title": "Afuganistani mu Mikino y\u2019Abatumva", "text": "Afuganisitani yitabiriye Imikino y\u2019Abatumva bwa mbere mu mwaka wa 2017 mu mikino y\u2019Ubushuhe yabereye i Samsun, muri Turukiya. Ikipe yohereje intumwa zigizwe n\u2019abantu batanu mu birori by\u2019abatumva byabaye mu 2017, kikaba ari cyo gikorwa cyonyine cy\u2019abatumva aho Afuganisitani yitabiriye. Abanyamuryango batanu bari: Ahmad Reshad Azizi (400m), Faiz Ahmad Faizi (Taekwondo -68\u00a0kg), Ekilil Khaliqyar (200m), Payman Noori (100m) na Ahman Fawad Sultani (100m). Afuganisitani ntirabona umudari muri Deaflympique."}
{"id": "21233", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21233", "title": "Florida Kwiyandikisha kubasobanuzi ku ababana n'ubumuga byo kutumva", "text": "Florida yandika abasemuzi batumva (FRID) ni umuryango udaharanira inyungu ugamije gufasha abasemuzi kubabana nabafite ubumuga bwo kutumva kandi bafite ikibazo cyo kutumva baba muri leta ya Florida. FRID ni leta ifatanya na rejisitiri yabasobanuzi kubatumva. FRID ifite abanyamuryango barenga 950 mu mwaka 2009. \nSisitemu yo Kugenzura Ubwiza bwa Floride.\n\"Sisitemu yo Kugenzura Ubwiza bwa Floride\" iyobowe na FRID hagamijwe gusuzuma abasemuzi b'ururimi rw'amarenga muri Floride. Ikizamini kigabanyijemo ibice bibiri: Byanditswe na Performance. Florida Kwiyandikisha kw'abasobanuzi babana nabafite ubumuga bwo kutumva (FRID) ntikigitanga ibipimo byerekana ubuziranenge muri leta nkuko byumvikanyweho na Registry of Interpreters ya ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva (RID).\nIsuzuma ry\u2019Abasobanura mu Burezi muri Florida.\n\"Isuzuma ry\u2019Abasobanurira mu Mashuri rya Florida (Florida Educational Interpreter Evaluation) riyoborwa na FRID rigamije gukora isuzuma ry\u2019abasobanurira abatumva bakoresha ururimi rw\u2019amaboko muri Florida bakorera mu mashuri y\u2019incuke kugeza ku mwaka wa 12 (K\u201312). Isuzuma rigabanyijemo ibice bitatu: Icyanditse (Written), Ikiganiro (Interview), n\u2019Icyerekanwa mu bikorwa (Performance).\"\n\"Florida Registry of Interpreters for the Deaf (FRID) ntikigikora isuzuma ry\u2019abasobanurira mu mashuri ryo mu gihugu imbere (in-state educational interpreter screenings) kubera amasezerano bagiranye na Registry of Interpreters of the Deaf (RID).\""}
{"id": "21234", "revid": "16886", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21234", "title": "Abacuruzi batumva", "text": "Abacuruzi batumva; ni abatumva bagurisha ku makarita manini y\u2019inyuguti rusange, mfunguzo, imashini zometseho imisumari, kereyo n'amakaramu, ibendera ry\u2019igihugu, cyangwa inyemezabwishyu ku buryo butandukanye, bakaba baracapuye ubwabo. Muri uku gucuruza, abagurisha bavuga ko batumva, gukoresha cyangwa gushyira igitutu ku baguzi. Bamwe mu bacuruza \"] [\"bahimba\" ubumuga bwo kutumva kugira ngo bashuke abantu. \nAmerika.\nMuri Amerika, Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abatumva ryakoze ubukangurambaga ku bacuruza batumva, hagamijwe kuzamura urwego rw\u2019abatumva nk\u2019abanyamerika babishoboye mu mubiri no mu bitekerezo. "}
{"id": "21235", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21235", "title": "TASH", "text": "TASH ni ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga ryunganira ababana babana nubumuga, abo mu miryango yabo, abandi bunganira, n'abantu bakora mu rwego rw'abafite ubumuga. TASH ni uguteza imbere uruhare rw\u2019abana n\u2019abakuze bafite ubumuga bukomeye mu bice byose bigize umuryango wabo, no gukuraho akarengane k\u2019abaturage kagabanya uburenganzira bwa muntu. TASH ikora nkumuryango udaharanira inyungu 501 (c) (3). Ifite ibice, imiterere ya komite (urugero, gutura mu baturage, hamwe na komite ishinzwe imiturire) hamwe n\u2019abanyamuryango mu bihugu 34 n\u2019intara kandi ifite icyicaro gikuru kuri 2013 H Street NW, Suite 715, Washington, DC 20006.\nAmateka.\nTASH yashinzwe mu 1975 ku izina rya \"Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Abanyamerika rishinzwe uburezi bw\u2019abafite ubumuga bukomeye / bafite ubumuga bukomeye\" (\"AAESPH\"). Izina ryahinduwe ryitwa \"Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abafite ubumuga bukomeye\" (TASH) mu 1980, ryongera kwitwa Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abantu bafite ubumuga bukomeye mu 1983. Mu 1995, inama y\u2019ubuyobozi yafashe icyemezo cyo kureka iryo zina, kubera ko ridahuye n\u2019indangagaciro zigezweho. Izina TASH riracyakoreshwa kubera kumenyekana kwayo kwinshi. "}
{"id": "21236", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21236", "title": "Anna Fedulova", "text": "Anna Yuryevna Fedulova (yavutse ku itariki ya 19 Nyakanga 1978) ni umukinnyi w\u2019umurusiya w\u2019imikino ya cross-country skiing ufite ubumuga bwo kutumva. Yagaragaye bwa mbere mu mikino ya Deaflympics ahagarariye Uburusiya mu birori byo kutumva mu 1999. Mu mikino Olempike yo mu mwaka wa 2019, Yarengeje amajwi ya Tone Tangen Myrvoll kugira ngo abe umukinnyi w\u2019umukino wo gusiganwa ku magare watsinze ibihugu byinshi mu mateka ya Deaflympics asaba umudari amanota 18 harimo imidari 13 ya zahabu.Yitabiriye Deaflympics ku nshuro ya gatanu ahagarariye Uburusiya mu mikino ya 2019 Winter Deaflympics."}
{"id": "21237", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21237", "title": "Gutangiza Ed Roberts (activist)", "text": "Edward Verne Roberts (23 Mutarama 1939 - 14 Werurwe 1995) yari umunyamerika uharanira inyungu. Niwe muntu wa mbere ukoresha igare ry\u2019ibimuga yize muri. Yari umuyobozi wambere wumuryango uharanira uburenganzira bwabafite ubumuga. \nAmateka.\nRoberts yanduye indwara y\u2019igicuri afite imyaka cumi nine mu 1953, imyaka ibiri mbere yuko urukingo rwa Salk rurangiza iki cyorezo. Yamaze amezi mu bitaro asubira mu rugo amugaye kuva ku ijosi hasi usibye intoki ebyiri ku kuboko kumwe n'amano menshi. Yararaga mu bihaha by'icyuma nijoro kandi akenshi yaruhukiraga ku manywa. Iyo avuye mu bihaha yarokotse \" guhumeka ibikeri,\" tekinike yo guhatira umwuka mu bihaha ukoresheje imitsi yo mu maso no mu ijosi.\nUmuryango.\nEd Roberts yashakanye na Catherine Dugan mu 1976, ariko bombi baratandukana mu 1982. Basangiye kurera umuhungu wabo Lee. "}
{"id": "21238", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21238", "title": "Patrisha Wright", "text": "Patrisha Wright numunyamerika uharanira uburenganzira bwababana n'ubumuga. Ni impumyi byemewe n'amategeko. Yagize uruhare runini mu gushyiraho. \nGukora.\nYari mu cyicaro cya San Francisco kugira ngo ashyigikire ingingo ya 504 y'itegeko ryerekeye gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe muri Mata 1977, nk'umufasha bwite wa Judy Heumann. Mu 1979, yashinze ikigega cy\u2019uburenganzira n\u2019ubumuga bw\u2019ubumuga (DREDF) hamwe na Mary Lou Breslin na Robert Funk. Kuva 1979 kugeza 2005 yakoraga nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe ibibazo bya DREDF. Yaharaniye ko hashyirwaho itegeko rirengera abana bafite ubumuga ryo mu 1986 no guhindura itegeko rigenga imiturire ryerekeye ababana n'ubumuga. impungenge z\u2019ubumuga mu ihuriro ry\u2019imiryango iharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu bose bakoraga kugira ngo bemeze itegeko ryo gusubiza uburenganzira bwa muntu mu 1987.\nNa none mu myaka ya za 1980, ubwo ubuyobozi bwa Reagan bwatinyaga guhindura cyangwa gukuraho amabwiriza ashyira mu bikorwa ingingo ya 504 y\u2019itegeko ryita ku buzima busanzwe (Abanyamerika) ryo mu 1973 hamwe n\u2019amategeko agenga uburezi bw\u2019abana bose bafite ubumuga bwo mu 1975, Wright na Evan Kemp (wo mu kigo cy\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga) bayoboye ubukangurambaga mu nzego z\u2019ibanze no guharanira kurwanya aya makarita arenga 40.000. Mu 1984, ubuyobozi bwahagaritse kugerageza guhindura cyangwa gukuraho ayo mabwiriza; icyakora, barangije inyungu zubwiteganyirize bwibihumbi magana nabahawe ubumuga. "}
{"id": "21239", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21239", "title": "Arijantine mu Mikino y\u2019Abatumva", "text": "Arijantine yitabiriye bwa mbere kandi itsindira igihembo cyayo cya mbere muri Deaflympics mu mwaka wa 1965. Guhera icyo gihe, Arijantine yagiye itabira Deaflympics kenshi. Arijantine ntiyigeze yitabira imikino yo kutumva."}
{"id": "21240", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21240", "title": "Ositiriya mu Mikino y\u2019Abatumva", "text": "Ositiriya yitabiriye imikino y\u2019abatumva kuva mu 1931 kandi imaze kubona imidari 78 yose. "}
{"id": "21241", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21241", "title": "Henri Viscardi Jr.", "text": "Henry Viscardi Jr. (1912-2004) yari umunyamerika uharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga baharanira inyungu z\u2019uburinganire n\u2019akazi k\u2019abafite ubumuga mu bakozi. Mu 1952, abifashijwemo na Eleanor Roosevelt, yashinze Ubushobozi Kugira ngo abana bafite ubumuga bafite amahirwe angana yo kwiga, yashinze ishuri ryita ku bakozi i Albertson, mu 1952, nyuma ryitwa ishuri rya Henry Viscardi mu cyubahiro. Yabaye umujyanama wa ba perezida benshi bo muri Amerika bazana impinduka nyinshi za politiki mu rwego rw\u2019abafite ubumuga. Ni n'umwanditsi w'igitabo \"Duhe ibikoresho\". Mu cyubahiro cye, ikigo cya Viscardi mu 2013 cyatangije ibihembo bya Henry Viscardi Achievement Awards kugira ngo bamenye kandi bamenye abayobozi b'intangarugero bo mu muryango w'abafite ubumuga. "}
{"id": "21242", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21242", "title": "Belarus mu Mikino y\u2019Abatumva", "text": "Biyelorusiya yitabiriye imikino y\u2019abatumva kuva mu mwaka wa 1993 kugeza igihe yabujijwe mu mwaka wa 2022, kandi yegukana imidari 87. Nyuma y\u2019Uburusiya bwateye muri Ukraine mu 2022, Komite mpuzamahanga ya siporo ishinzwe ubumuga bwo kutumva (ICSD) yabujije abakinnyi bava muri Belarus kwitabira imikino y\u2019abatumva muri uwo mwaka i Caxias do Sul, muri Burezili. \nBelarus ntirarushanwa mu mikino yo kutumva."}
{"id": "21243", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21243", "title": "Ububiligi mu Mikino y\u2019Abatumva", "text": "Ububiligi bwitabiriye imikino y\u2019abatumva kuva bwashingwa mu mwaka wa 1924 kandi bwabonye imidari 85 yose. \nUbubiligi ntirigeze yitabira imikino yo kutumva."}
{"id": "21244", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21244", "title": "Zaruhi Valeriani Batoyan", "text": "Zaruhi Valeriani Batoyan (Armenian ; wavutse 29 Nzeri 1979), ni umunyapolitiki wo muri Arumeniya, umunyamakuru uharanira uburenganzira bwababana n'ubumuga yahoze ari Minisitiri w\u2019umurimo n\u2019imibereho myiza muri guverinoma ya kabiri ya Pashinyan. \nUbuzima.\nZaruhi Batoyan yavutse 1979 muri Yerevan. Mu 2008, yarangije mu ishami ry'itangazamakuru muri. Mu mwaka wa 2012, yitabiriye gahunda y\u2019amahugurwa y\u2019abagore bashinzwe kuyobora n\u2019ubumuga (WILD) yatanzwe na Mobility International USA muri \nUmwuga wa politiki.\nKu ya 30 Ukwakira 2016, yatorewe kuba umwe mu bagize Inama y\u2019ishyaka rya sosiyete sivile. Muri 2017 yatorewe kuba umunyamuryango w\u2019inama y\u2019abasaza ya Yerevan for Way Out Alliance. Ku Kamena 2018, yagizwe Minisitiri wungirije w\u2019umurimo n\u2019imibereho myiza [ya 18 Mutarama 2019. Ni umukoresha w\u2019ibimuga. "}
{"id": "21245", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21245", "title": "Burezili mu Mikino y\u2019Abatumva", "text": "Burezili yitabiriye imikino y\u2019abatumva ku nshuro ya mbere mu 1993. Guhera icyo gihe, Brezile yagiye itabira Deaflympics kenshi. Burezili yatsindiye igihembo cyayo cya mbere mu mikino y'abatumva mu mwaka wa 2009. Brezile kandi yitabiriye Imikino y\u2019Abatumva y\u2019Ubukonje bwa mbere mu mikino yo mu mwaka wa 2019 yabereye muri Sondrio Province, mu Butaliyani."}
{"id": "21246", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21246", "title": "Kolombiya mu Mikino y\u2019Abatumva", "text": "Kolombiya yitabiriye imikino y\u2019abatumva mu mpeshyi ku nshuro ya mbere mu mwaka wa 1969 kandi yegukana umudari wonyine w\u2019abatumva muri uwo mwaka. Kolombiya ntabwo yigeze yitabira imikino yo kutumva."}
{"id": "21247", "revid": "13150", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21247", "title": "Robert Sampson", "text": "Robert Sampson (4 Werurwe 1925 - 3 Ukuboza 2006) yari visi perezida muri. Yasuzumwe indwara ya afite imyaka 5, kandi akoresha igare ubuzima bwe bwose.\nSampson, umunyamategeko, yari umwunganira abamugaye. Yakoreye Komisiyo ya Perezida ishinzwe umurimo w'abafite ubumuga iyobowe na ba perezida batanu b'Abanyamerika. Imbaraga ze zamufashije kuganisha ku myubakire mu kugera ku bamugaye, nk'ibimuga by'ibimuga.\nSampson yafatanije na gukusanya amafaranga yo kuvura indwara y'imitsi., umurizo numero N116UA, bamwitiriwe."}
{"id": "21248", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21248", "title": "Danemarke mu Mikino y\u2019Abatumva", "text": "Danemari yitabiriye Deaflympics guhera mu mwaka wa 1931 kandi yatsindiye ibihembo byose hamwe 139. \nDanemari ntiyigeze yitabira Imikino y\u2019Abatumva y\u2019Ubukonje.\nIhuza ryo hanze.\nNations at the Deaflympics"}
{"id": "21249", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21249", "title": "Ecuador mu batumva", "text": "Muri uquateur bwa mbere yitabiriye imikino ya abatumva ku nshuro ya mbere mu 2013 ndetse akomeza no kwitabira imikino y\u2019Abatumva y\u2019Ubushuhe ya 2017, yegukana umudari wa silver muri 2017. \nEcuador itaritabira imikino y'ubumuga bwo kutumva."}
{"id": "21250", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21250", "title": "Lauren Weibert", "text": "Lauren Weibert (yavutse ku ya 17 Kamena mu 1988) ni umunyamerika utumva urubura. Yitabiriye amarushanwa ya Deaflympique ya 2015 amarushanwa ya shelegi y'abagore bafite ubumuga. wa zahabu mu birori byo gusiganwa ku maguru mu bagore ndetse na feza mu birori byo kwambuka urubura.] \u200b\nYemerewe kandi guhagararira Amerika mu mikino Olempike yo mu mwaka wa 2011, ariko amaherezo ibirori byaje guhagarikwa kubera ibirego bya ruswa byashinjwaga umuyobozi wa siporo w\u2019ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutumva bo muri Silovakiya bigatuma habaho kunanirwa mu muteguro. "}
{"id": "21251", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21251", "title": "Venezuela at the Deaflympics", "text": "Venezuwela yitabiriye imikino yabafite ubumuga bwo yo kutumva kuva mu 1969 kandi imaze kubona imidari 54 yose.\nVenezuwela itarahatanira imikino yimikino yabatumva."}
{"id": "21252", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21252", "title": "Uzbekistan at the Deaflympics", "text": "Uzubekisitani yitabiriye imikino yo kutumva kuva mu 1997. Uzubekisitani yatsindiye umudari wa mbere w\u2019abatumva mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi ya 2009 yabereye i Taekwondo, ari nawo mudari wabo rukumbi mu mateka bafite mukiciro cyabafite ubumuga bwo y\u2019abatumva. \nImidari.\nInkomoko: "}
{"id": "21269", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21269", "title": "Indorerwamo", "text": "Indorerwamo ni icyuma cyangwa igikoresho gikoreshwa mu kugaragaza ishusho y'abantu cyangwa ibintu.\nIndorerwamo ya mbere yageze mu Rwanda mu 1986,uruganda rwa mbere rwazitunganyije rwitwa Anik Industries."}
{"id": "21271", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21271", "title": "Treasures of Ikoro", "text": "Treasures of Ikoro Restaurant, iherereye Kimihurura mu mujyi wa Kigali, izwi cyane kubera imiterere yayo idasanzwe ikoresha ibikoresho by\u2019umwimerere nk\u2019amabuye ya lava azwi mu Kinyarwanda nka amakoro. Uru rugo rw\u2019ubucuruzi rwubakiye ku ndangagaciro zo guhuza ikoranabuhanga rigezweho n\u2019umuco nyarwanda, binyuze mu gukoresha ibikoresho by\u2019umutungo kamere.Amabuye ya lava aboneka cyane mu majyaruguru ya Rwanda, hafi y\u2019imisozi y\u2019ibirunga, akaba yarakunze gukoreshwa mu bwubatsi bwa kera kubera imbaraga n\u2019ubwiza bwayo.Ubu, ikoreshwa ryayo rigaragara nk\u2019ikimenyetso cy\u2019ubwubatsi burengera ibidukikije no kubungabunga umuco.\nAmateka y\u2019Amakoro mu Muco Nyarwanda.\nMu turere tw\u2019amajyaruguru y\u2019igihugu, cyane cyane hafi y\u2019Ibirunga bya Virunga, amakoro amaze imyaka myinshi akoreshwa mu bwubatsi bw\u2019amazu, insengero, n\u2019ibindi bikorwa by\u2019umuco. Aya mabuye agaragazwa n\u2019imiterere ifite utwenge twinshi n\u2019amabara y\u2019isi, asobanura imbaraga no guhangana n\u2019ibihe.Mu muco wa kera, gukoresha amakoro byafatwaga nk\u2019ikimenyetso cy\u2019ubukorikori n\u2019imbaraga z\u2019abanyarwanda mu kubaka. Ubu noneho, mu bwubatsi bugezweho, akomeza gukoreshwa mu buryo bushimangira isano hagati y\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019abantu n\u2019ubutaka bubatunze.\nImiterere n\u2019Igishushanyo muri Treasures of Ikoro.\nMuri Treasures of Ikoro, amakoro si ishusho gusa ni igice cy\u2019ingenzi cy\u2019ubuzima n\u2019umwuka wa resitora. Imiyaga, inzira, n\u2019ameza byubatswe cyangwa byambitswe amakoro, bitanga itoto n\u2019ituze mu mwanya wose.Itara ryoroheje rikubita ku buso bw\u2019amabuye, ritanga umucyo n\u2019ubushyuhe byumvikana n\u2019umwuka karemano w\u2019ahantu. Ibi byose bigaragaza uburyo bwo guhanga inyubako zitajegajega ku ndangagaciro zo kubungabunga ibidukikije.\nUmuco n\u2019Imikino Igisoro mu Mugususurutsa Abashyitsi.\nTreasures of Ikoro kandi ishimangira umuco w\u2019imikino y\u2019Abanyarwanda nka Igisoro. amwe mu meza ahari yakozwe mu buryo bushya, yifiteho ikibuga cy gukinira igisoro, aho abashyitsi bashobora gukina mu buryo bushimishije mu gihe bari ku meza baryoshywa n\u2019amafunguro.Ibi byahinduye amafunguro si ukwiyumvamo ibyokurya gusa, ahubwo byabaye uburyo bwo gusabana no gusangira umuco n\u2019inshuti.\nKurengera Ibidukikije n\u2019Ikoreshwa Rirambye.\nGukoresha amabuye ya lava muri Treasures of Ikoro ni igikorwa cy\u2019ubwubatsi burengera ibidukikije. Amabuye akurwaho mu buryo butabangamira ubutaka, hagamijwe kubungabunga aho aturuka. Ibi bihura n\u2019icyerekezo cya Leta y\u2019u Rwanda mu guteza imbere ubwubatsi burambye, nk\u2019uko biteganywa muri Green Building Minimum Compliance System na Vision 2050 by\u2019Igihugu. Uyu murongo w\u2019ubwubatsi uhuza iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu n\u2019ubusugire bw\u2019ibidukikije.\nIbituma Abashyitsi bahakunda.\nUwo winjira muri Treasures of Ikoro ahora yumva ari hafi y\u2019ibidukikije. Ubushegeshagi bw\u2019amabuye, itara rituje, n\u2019ubushyuhe bitanga amarangamutima y\u2019ituze n\u2019ubusabane n\u2019ubuzima kamere.Ni ahantu hatanga uburambe bwo gusabana n\u2019umutuzo, aho ubwiza n\u2019ubwitonzi bigaragarira mu mico no mu bidukikije.\nUbusigire n\u2019Icyo Byungura.\nTreasures of Ikoro igaragaza icyitegererezo cy\u2019uko umuco, ibidukikije n\u2019ubucuruzi bishobora kubana mu buryo bwuzuzanya. Ibi byahinduye uburyo bwo kureba ubukorikori nyarwanda, bituma amabuye ya lava (amakoro) aba ikimenyetso cy\u2019ubuhanzi, uburambe, n\u2019umuco nyarwanda w\u2019iki gihe."}
{"id": "21276", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21276", "title": "Https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki/AMIS (ubuhinzi)", "text": "AMIS (ubuhinzi) &lt;mark&gt;ni ishyirahamwe rishinzwe amakuru ajyanye n'ubuhinzi, ni urubuga n'ikoranabuhanga rihuza amakuru atandukanye ku bijyanye n'ubuhinzi no gutangaza amakuru ku bantu bose bari mu buhinzi&lt;/mark&gt;. Iryo shyirahamwe ryihariye kurusha izindi kuko rifungura amakuru y'ubuhinzi, ariko rikanatangaza amakuru yose bifuza kumenya ku buryo burambuye.Iryo shyirahamwe ryihariye kurusha izindi kuko rifungura amakuru y'ubuhinzi, ariko rikanatangaza amakuru yose bifuza kumenya ku buryo burambuye. \nInyandiko.\n1,https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv=84f78223e416b16a&amp;rlz=1C1CHBD_enRW1029RW1029&amp;sxsrf=AE3TifN4cgVhuJsF_q37h0Igtotp3bzTsw:1762599126978&amp;q=AMIS+(ubuhinzi)&amp;source=lnms&amp;fbs=AIIjpHxU7SXXniUZfeShr2fp4giZ1Y6MJ25_tmWITc7uy4KIeuYzzFkfneXafNx6OMdA4MQSBVctRys_GZriRO39Kwt_UnAXltWoMba0YL6wApUN8svMkd6oba5WMDL8r_LBDprerL2bGwkTqXOCoYJufhjI4iyDS-qsmTnwU86tmoGqFCNTcwhQQ-q4JrfGD7hDPmcKTArAHemgdhI0sgteo8Y1n8IHGw&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwj7heG2seKQAxWCY0EAHbkyNDQQ0pQJegQIDhAB&amp;biw=911&amp;bih=427&amp;dpr=1.5"}
{"id": "21284", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21284", "title": "Alma Thomas", "text": "Alma Woodsey Thomas (22 Nzeri 1891 - 24 Gashyantare 1978) yari umuhanzi n\u2019umwalimu w\u2019umunyafurika n\u2019umunyamerika yaratuye kandi agakorera i Washington, DC, ubu akaba azwi nk\u2019umunyamerika ukomeye w\u2019umuhazi mubyo gusiga amarangi wo mu kinyejana cya 20. Niwe mugore wa mbere w\u2019umunyafurika akaba n\u2019umunyamerika winjijwe krurtonde rwi cyegeranyo cy\u2019ubuhanzi bwo gusiga amarangi gihoraho mubiro bya reta zunze ubumwe bwa amerika buzwi nka white house. Thomas azwi cyane kubera ubuhanga bwe mugukora ibihangano by'amashusho y'amabara, ndetse yatangiye no gukora ibihangano byamashusho adasobanutse ariko arimo ubuhanga, yayakoze nyuma yo kujya mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru cy'imyaka 35 yigisha ibihangano mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Shaw Junior rya Washington.\nThomas, usanzwe ufatwa nk'umunyamuryango w\u2019ishuri ry\u2019ubuhanzi rya Washington Color school Art ariko ubundi agashyirwa mu majwi na bamwe nkumuhanzi wumuhanga mubyo gukurura amarangamutima y'abantu / cyangwa nkumwirabura wambere ubayeho wabayeho uzi kuvanga amarangi bikurura amarangamutima y'abantu, yabonye impamyabumenyi ye yo kwigisha yakuye muri kaminuza y\u2019akarere ka Columbiya (izwi ku izina rya Miner Normal School icyo gihe). Yabaye uwa mberewabonye impamyabumenyi mu ishami ry\u2019ubuhanzi rya kaminuza ya Howard, kandi akomeza umubano mwiza niyo kaminuza mu buzima bwe. Yageze ku ntsinzi nkumuhanzi wumugore wumunyafurika n\u2019umunyamerika nubwo amacakubiri n\u2019urwikekwe byariho icyogihe.\nThomas yamenyekanye cyane nyma y'urupfu rwe. Igishushanyo cye cyerekanwe mu ngoro ndangamurage no mu byegeranyo kandi byagiye byibandwaho mu bitabo byinshi ndetse n\u2019imurikagurisha ry\u2019umurage wubuhanzi bwo gushushanya. Inzu Ndangamurage y'Abanyamerika ya Smithsonian ikomeza gukusanya ibikorwa bye kwisi hose. Mu 2021, inzu ndangamurage yagurishije ishusho ya Thomas \"Alma's Flower Garden\" mu bucuruzi bwihariye ku madolari 2.8\u00a0miliyoni.\nUbuzima n'akazi.\nUbwana, uburezi, n'imyanya yo kwigisha akiri muto..\nAlma Thomas yavutse ku ya 22 Nzeri 1891, avukira i Columbus, Jeworujiya, avuka ariwe mukobwa mukuru(ari imfura) mu bakobwa bane, se yitwa John Harris Thomas, umucuruzi, na Nyina Amelia Cantey Thomas, wari umuhanzi mugushushanya no kudoda imyenda.\u200aNyina na nyirasenge, nyuma baje kwandikwa nk'abarimu ndetse n\u2019abanyeshuri barangije muri Tuskegee.Yagaragaje ubuhanga akiri umwana, nubwo umwuga we wubuhanzi yawutangiye nyuma amaze gukura. Igihe Tomasi yari amaze gukura, yerekanaga ubuhanga bwe mu buhanzi, kandi yishimira gukora uduce duto duto duto nk'ibipupe, ibishushanyo n'amasahani abumbye, cyane cyane mu ibumba ku mugezi wari uri inyuma y'iwabo. Nubwo yari ashishikajwe n\u2019ubuhanzi, Thomas \"ntiyari yemerewe\" kujya mu nzu ndangamurage y\u2019ubuhanzi akiri umwana. Yahawe amasomo yumuziki, kuko nyina yacurangaga inanga.\nMu 1907, igihe Thomas yari afite imyaka 16, umuryango we wimukiye mu gace ka Logan Circle gaherereye i Washington, DC Mu gusobanura uko umuryango wimutse, nyuma yaranditse ati: \"Ndangije amashuri yisumbuye i Columbus, nta hantu na hamwe nashoboraga gukomereza amashuri yanjye, bityo ababyeyi banjye bahitamo kwimurira umuryango i Washington.\":\u200a3\u200aTomasi yashoboye kandi kubona uko ajya mu masomero y'i Washington, bitandukanye na Columbus. \":\u200a3\u200aAbabyeyi be bafashe iki cyemezo nubwo byamanuye umuryango mu mibereho no mubukungu, bituma bava mumubare wabari mucyiciro cya kabiri cy'ubukungu bari bafite bakiba muri Jeworujiya. Abandi banditsi bagaragaje ko imvururu z\u2019amoko ya Atlanta n'ubwicanyi bushingiye ku moko bwo mu 1906 ari impamvu zishobora kuba zaratumye bava muri Jeworujiya. [3] Urundi rugero rw\u2019ihohoterwa rishingiye ku moko umuryango we wahuye naryo muri Jeworujiya, ise wa Alma yahuye n\u2019agatsiko ka lynch mbere gato yuko Alma avuka, umuryango we wavuze ko kutumva kwe kwatewe n'imirwano yagiranye nabari bagize ako gatsiko. Nubwo byari bitandukanye, umurwa mukuru w\u2019igihugu wari uzwiho guha amahirwe Abirabura benshi kurusha indi mijyi myinshi. Nkuko yabyanditse mu myaka ya za 70, \"Nibura amasomero ya Washington yakinguriwe nabanyafrika cyangwa abirabura bari barahawe izina rya Negro, mu gihe Columbus yo yari yarakumiriye abirabura(Negro) mu isomero ryayo.\" [4] I Washington, Thomas yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya tekinike rya Armstrong, aho yakuye umwanya wa mbere mu masomo y\u2019ubuhanzi. [3] Kuri bo, yagize ati \"Ninjiye mu cyumba cy'ubuhanzi, byari nko kwinjira mu ijuru... Ishuri ryisumbuye rya Armstrong ryashizeho urufatiro rw'ubuzima bwanjye.\" Mu mashuri yisumbuye, yari umuhanga mu mibare na siyansi, kandi ubwubatsi bwibihangano bwaramushishikazaga cyane. Ibikorwa bye by'ubuhanzi yakoreye i Armstrong byerekanwe muri Smithsonian mu 1912. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nNyuma yo kurangiza amashuri yisumbuye ya Armstrong \":\u200a4\u200amu 1911, yize amashuri yakaminuza mu ishuri risanzwe rya Miner (ubu rizwi nka kaminuza y'akarere ka Columbiya), ahabwa impamyabumenyi yo kwigisha mu 1913. [3]:\u200a19\u200aMu 1914, yabonye umwanya wo kwigisha mu mashuri ya Princess Anne ku nkombe y'Iburasirazuba bwa Maryland, aho yigishije amezi ane. [3]:\u200a19\u200aMu 1915, yatangiye kwigisha mw'ishuri ryari mu nzu ya Thomas Garrett i Wilmington, muri Delaware, kugeza mu 1921. [3] \nThomas yinjiye muri kaminuza ya Howard mu 1921, afite imyaka 30, yinjirira ku masomo yibanze kubera amahugurwa yabanjemo y'abarimu. Yatangiye ari umunyeshuri wiga ibijyanye n'ubukungu bwurugo, ateganya kuba inzobere mu gushushanya imyambarire, gusa nyuma aza guhindura ajya mu buhanzi bwubwiza. [3]:\u200a19-20\u200aUbuhanzi bwe yibanze kuri Howard bwari ku gishushanyo; Romare Bearden na Henry Henderson bavuze ko amashusho yakoze mu gihe cyo kwiga kaminuza ari \"amasomo kandi atamenyekanye.\" [13] Yabonye impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor of Science mu buhanzi Bwiza mu 1924 yakuye muri Howard, abaye umunyeshuri wa mbere muri gahunda y\u2019ubugeni bwa kaminuza. Hasabwe ko hashobora kuba umugore wa mbere w\u2019umunyafurika-Umunyamerika cyangwa Umunyamerika wabonye impamyabumenyi y\u2019ubuhanzi, [3] icyakora Mary Jane Patterson yakiriye impamyabumenyi ye, mu 1862, hashize imyaka 60 mbere.\nIn 1924, Thomas began teaching art at Shaw Junior High School, a Black school in the then-segregated public schools of Washington, D.C., where she worked until her retirement in 1960; she wrote, \"I was there for thirty-five years and occupied the same classroom.\"[4]:\u200a13\u200a She taught alongside fellow artist Malkia Roberts.:\u200a43\u200a While at Shaw Junior High, she started a community arts program that encouraged student appreciation of fine art. The program supported marionette performances and the distribution of student designed holiday cards which were given to soldiers at the Tuskegee Veterans Administration Medical Center. Also, according to her reminiscences, \"At Shaw, I organized the first art gallery in the D.C. public schools in 1938, securing paintings by outstanding Negro artists from the Howard Gallery of Art.\"[3]:\u200a23\u200a[4]:\u200a4\u200a\nImyaka mirongo itatu nigice y\u2019umwuga wa Tomasi wigisha, kuva 1924 kugeza 1960, bavuzwe na Thurlow Tibbs, umucuruzi w\u2019ubuhanzi w\u2019umunyafurika n\u2019umunyamerika DC (n\u2019umwuzukuru w\u2019inshuti ya Tomasi Lillian Evans, umuririmbyi wa opera) nk '\"igihe cyo gusembura;\" [3] muri bo yakuyemo ibitekerezo byinshi ningaruka, hanyuma nyuma ya 1960 ahereye kuri ibyo bitekerezo n'ingaruka azarema ibihangano bye byihariye. Mu gihe yigishaga muri Shaw Junior High, Thomas yakomeje gukurikirana ibihangano bye, amashuri ye asanzwe kandi adasanzwe, ndetse n\u2019ibikorwa yakoranye n\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubuhanzi wa Washington, DC, aba nyuma bakunze kubikora mu buryo bujyanye na kaminuza ya Howard.\nMuri kiriya gihe, Thomas yashushanyije, cyane cyane mu mazi; mu gihe injyana ye mu myaka ya za 1930 yari ikiri \"gakondo gakondo\" kandi karemano, yiswe \"amabara meza cyane.\" [13] Mu mpeshyi, yajyaga mu mujyi wa New York gusura ingoro ndangamurage z'ubuhanzi, harimo inzu ndangamurage ya Metropolitan, hamwe na galeries. [13]:\u200a448\u200a\nMu mpeshyi yo mu 1930 kugeza 1934, yize muri kaminuza y\u2019abarimu ya kaminuza ya Columbia, abona impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bijyanye n\u2019ubuhanzi mu 1934; ubushakashatsi bwe bwibanze ku bishushanyo, maze yandika igitabo cye ku ikoreshwa rya marionettes. [3]:\u200a11,23\u200a [13] \nMu ci ryo mu 1935, yize marionettes mu mujyi wa New York hamwe n\u2019umupupe w\u2019umudage w\u2019umudage n\u2019umunyamerika Tony Sarg, se w\u2019ibikinisho bigezweho muri Amerika. [3]:\u200a23\u200a\nMu 1936, yashinze umuryango witwa umushinga w\u2019ishuri ry\u2019ubuhanzi, kugira ngo uzane abana amahirwe y\u2019ubuhanzi. [3]:\u200a22\u200a [4] \nMu 1943, Thomas yafashije James W. Herring, wahoze ari umwarimu muri Howard, na Alonzo J. Aden babonye ububiko bwa Barnett-Aden, ububiko bwa mbere bw\u2019abirabura bwigenga bw\u2019abirabura muri Amerika.:\u200a2\u200aYabaye visi perezida mukuru. Kuba Thomas yarafatanije n\u2019Ingoro ya Barnett-Aden byasobanuwe ko ari \"ingenzi kuri\" kandi, nk'uko byatangajwe n\u2019umuyobozi ushinzwe amasomo, Adelyn Dohme Breeskin, iterambere rya \"pivotal\" mu iterambere rye nk\u2019umuhanzi wabigize umwuga. \"Byamuteye guhura n\u2019abahanzi bakomeye bo mu gihugu cya none,\" byatumye arushaho kumenya ibijyanye n\u2019ubuhanzi n\u2019icyerekezo, \"kandi bituma abahanzi [\" bamurwanya kandi bamutera imbaraga. [13] \nMu myaka ya za 1940, Thomas yinjiye kandi mu muryango w\u2019abahanzi ba Lois Mailou Jones, \"Itsinda Rito rya Paris (cyangwa\" Itsinda Rito rya Paris, \"cyangwa\" Itsinda rya Studio rya Paris \") Iri tsinda ry\u2019abahanzi ba Black Washington ryashinzwe na Jones na C\u00e9line Marie Tabary, abahanzi ndetse n\u2019abanyamuryango b\u2019ishami ry\u2019ubuhanzi rya kaminuza ya Howard (Jones kuva 1930 kugeza 1977, na Tabary guhera mu). \"mu mpera za 1940,\" [3] 1945, 1946, cyangwa 1948. Yateranye haba buri cyumweru cyangwa kabiri mu cyumweru, [3] muri studio ya Jones, \"Sitidiyo Nto ya Paris,\" mu rugo rwe kuri 1220 Quincy Street NE, mu gace ka Washington ka Brookland. Yabayeho. [3] Yahaye abahanzi bateye imbere amahirwe yo gushushanya kuri moderi, kunoza ubuhanga bwabo - \"guteza imbere ubuhanga nuburyo,\" na \"gutezimbere ubuhanga bwabo no kungurana ibitekerezo\", kimwe na salon, cyangwa ihuriro ryibiganiro - \"kuvuga kubyagezweho mubuhanzi bugezweho, cyane cyane ko byari bishingiye i Paris.\" Abandi bagize iryo tsinda usibye Jones na Tabary barimo Delilah Pierce na Thomas, ndetse na Bruce Brown, Ruth Brown, Richard Dempsey, Barbara Linger, Don Roberts, Desdemona Wade, Frank West, na Elizabeth Williamson. Ifoto, yo mu bubiko bwa Thomas, y\u2019iteraniro ry\u2019itsinda ryo mu 1948 ryerekana abahanzi cumi na batatu n\u2019umunyamideli w\u2019umugabo. \nMu 1958, Thomas yasuye ibigo by\u2019ubuhanzi byo mu Burayi bw\u2019iburengerazuba hamwe n\u2019abanyeshuri ba kaminuza ya Temple mu ruzinduko runini rwateguwe n\u2019iryo shuri ry\u2019ubuhanzi rya Tyler. [3]:\u200a25\u200a[13] \nUruhare rwe mu itsinda rito rya Paris bivugwa ko rwashishikarije Thomas gushaka andi masomo muri kaminuza ya Amerika. Igitabo kimwe kivuga ko mu ntangiriro ya za 1950, \"ishami ry\u2019ubuhanzi rya AU ryafatwaga mu bice byinshi nk 'ishami ry\u2019ubuhanzi rya avant-garde mu gihugu.\" Kubera iyo mpamvu, mu 1950, afite imyaka 59, yatangiye imyaka icumi yiga muri iyo kaminuza, yiga amasomo nijoro na wikendi, yiga ubuhanzi, harimo amateka yubuhanzi no gushushanya. [13]:\u200a449\u200a Muri kaminuza y'Abanyamerika yize gushushanya hamwe na Robert Franklin Gates na Ben \"Joe\" Summerford. Ariko Jacob Kainen yari umwarimu we ukomeye cyane, kandi yari kuba inshuti magara ubuzima bwe bwose. Igihe Thomas yigana na Kainen mu gatasi 1957, yamufata nk'umuhanzi mugenzi we aho kuba umunyeshuri. [3]:\u200a11\u200aKainen yari yarahuye na Thomas mu 1934, mu nzu mberabyombi ya Barnet-Aden, maze mu 1957, yemera gutangira kwigisha icyiciro cya AU cy\u2019umwaka wose cy\u2019abanyeshuri batandatu batoranijwe bashushanyije, barimo na Thomas, ariko ubuyobozi bwemerera abanyeshuri 32, benshi muri bo bakaba batangiye, kwiga ishuri maze Kainen areka gucika intege nyuma ya manda imwe. [3]:\u200a30\u200a\nIgihe Thomas yatangiraga amasomo ye yisumbuye muri kaminuza y'Abanyamerika mu 1950, yari akiri amarangi y'ikigereranyo. Mu myaka ya za 1950, uburyo bwe bwahindutse muburyo butandukanye, kuva gushushanya kwishusho kugeza kubisimu no kwerekana imvugo idasobanutse, hamwe n \"\" urwibutso \", amashusho yijimye ahanini yambaye amajwi yubururu nubururu, atangira kwakira amabara meza yakoreshaga nyuma muburyo bwe bwo gusinya. [3]:\u200a25, 30-31\u200a\nUmwuga w'ubuhanzi.\n\" \"Ubuhanzi bwo guhanga ni ubw'igihe cyose bityo bukaba butigenga ku gihe. Ni mu myaka yose, mu bihugu byose, kandi niba bivuze ko dushaka kuvuga umwuka wo guhanga umuntu ukora ishusho cyangwa igishusho uhuriweho n'isi yose y\u2019umuco, utitaye ku myaka, ubwoko ndetse n'ubwenegihugu; aya magambo ashobora guhagarara nta nkomyi.\" \" -Alma Thomas, 1970 Mu 1960, Thomas yavuye mu kwigisha maze aba umuhanzi wigihe cyose wabigize umwuga afite imyaka 68 cyangwa 69.\nMu myaka ya za 1960, yatangiye gukora amashusho y\u2019amabara, ahumekewe nakazi k\u2019ishuri rya New York na Abstract Expressionism. \nThomas yari azwiho gukorera muri sitidiyo y'urugo (icyumba gito cyo kubamo), akora ibishushanyo bye \"asunika canvas ku bibero bye kandi abinganya na sofa.\" Yakoraga mu gikoni mu nzu ye, ahimba imirimo nka \"Watusi (Hard Edge)\" (1963), manipulation ya Cutis ya Matisse \"The Snail\", aho Thomas yahinduye imiterere ahindura amabara Matisse yakoresheje, maze ayita indirimbo ya Chubby Checker. \nMu buryo butandukanye n\u2019abandi banyeshuri benshi bo mu ishuri ry\u2019amabara rya Washington, ntabwo yakoresheje kaseti kugira ngo agaragaze imiterere y\u2019amashusho ye. [13]:\u200a451\u200aUbuhanga bwe bwarimo gushushanya imirongo yamakaramu yoroheje hejuru ya canvas kugirango akore imiterere nishusho, no kuzuza amarangi irangi nyuma. Imirongo yikaramu ye igaragara mubice byinshi yarangije, ntabwo yabisibye. \nIbikorwa bya Tomasi nyuma yizabukuru byari byibanze cyane kubitekerezo byamabara. Ibikorwa bye muri kiriya gihe byumvikanaga n\u2019ibya Vasily Kandinsky (wari ushishikajwe n\u2019ubushobozi bw\u2019amarangamutima y\u2019amabara) ndetse n\u2019i Washington Color Field Painters, \"ikintu cyamushimishije abamunenga... ariko nanone cyibajije ibibazo byerekeranye n '\" umwirabura \"mu gihe abahanzi bato bo muri Afurika n\u2019Abanyamerika bakoraga ibikorwa byo kwigaragambya bishingiye ku moko.\" Yavuze ati: \"Gukoresha ibara mu mashusho yanjye ni iby'ingenzi kuri njye. Nkoresheje ibara nagerageje kwibanda ku bwiza n'ibyishimo mu gishushanyo cyanjye aho kwibanda ku buntu bwa muntu ku muntu.\" [4] Yongeye kuvuga ku bijyanye no gukoresha ibara yagize ati: \"Ibara ni ubuzima, kandi umucyo ni nyina w'amabara.\" \nImurikagurisha rye rya mbere ryasubiye mu 1966 (24 Mata - 17 Gicurasi) mu Ngoro y\u2019ubuhanzi muri kaminuza ya Howard, ryateguwe n\u2019amateka y\u2019ubuhanzi James A. Porter. Harimo imirimo 34 kuva 1959 kugeza 1966. Kuri iri murika, yakoze \"ibishushanyo mbonera by\u2019isi\", uruhererekane rw\u2019ibikorwa byahumetswe na kamere, harimo \"izuka\" (1966), mu mwaka wa 2014 bikaba byari kugurwa mu cyegeranyo cya White House. Niwe mugore wa mbere w\u2019umunyafurika-Umunyamerika winjijwe mu cyegeranyo cy\u2019ubuhanzi gihoraho cya White House. \nTomasi n'umuhanzi Delilah Pierce, inshuti, bari gutwara imodoka mu cyaro aho Tomasi yashakishaga imbaraga, akuramo ibitekerezo ku ngaruka z'umucyo n'ikirere ku bidukikije. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nKugira ngo duhangane n'ikibazo cyatewe na Howard show, nk'uko Romare Bearden na Henry Henderson babitangaza, uburyo bwe bwongeye guhinduka, mu buryo bw'ingenzi: \"Tomasi yahinduye uburyo bwihariye ubu buzwi nk'umukono we - ukina ibara rirwanya ibara kandi hejuru y'ibara rifite ishusho ntoya, idasanzwe y'urukiramende rufite ibara ryinshi, akenshi rifite ibara ryinshi.\" [13] Iri murika ryakiriwe neza na Helen Hoffman mu kinyamakuru Washington Post cyo ku ya 4 Gicurasi 1966, cyiswe \"ibara ryerekana amabara ryerekana umwuka we\". \nAhumekewe n'ukwezi kugwa mu 1969, Alma Thomas yatangiye insanganyamatsiko ye ya kabiri y'ingenzi yo gushushanya. Urukurikirane \"Umwanya, Snoopy\" \"nisi\" byashyizwe mubikorwa pointillism. Yabyukije umwuka muburyo butandukanye cyane bwamabara nuburyo bwa mozayike, akoresha ubururu bwijimye bwijimye bwijimye kandi bwijimye bwa orange, agaragaza abstraction nubwiza butunguranye akoresheje ibara. Ibikorwa byinshi muriki ruhererekane bifite uruziga, rutambitse, na vertical verisiyo. Ibishushanyo birashobora kubyara ibyiyumvo byo kureremba. Ibishushanyo nabyo bitanga ingufu muri canvas. Itandukaniro ryamabara ritera ibara rikomeye, kandi rigumana imbaraga ziboneka. \nHagati ya 1967 na 1975, Thomas yahawe ibihembo byinshi n\u2019ishimwe mu mashyirahamwe atandukanye y\u2019ubuhanzi n\u2019ingoro ndangamurage z\u2019Abanyamerika. Mu 1967, Thomas yatsindiye icyubahiro mu imurikagurisha ry\u2019umuryango w\u2019abanyamerika bo muri Otirishiya hamwe n\u2019ishusho ye \"The Viennese Waltzes,\" nyuma mu 1972, afite imyaka 81, Thomas ni we mugore wa mbere w\u2019umunyamerika w\u2019umunyamerika wagize imurikagurisha wenyine mu nzu ndangamurage y\u2019ubuhanzi ya Whitney. Nyuma yaho muri uwo mwaka, imurikagurisha rinini cyane ryabereye mu ngoro y\u2019ubuhanzi ya Corcoran.:\u200a452\u200aThomas yahakanye ibirango bamushyizeho nk'umuhanzi kandi ntiyemera inzitizi zose zibuza ibikorwa bye byo guhanga no gukora umwuga w'ubuhanzi, harimo n'irangamuntu ye nk'umwirabura. Yizeraga ko icy'ingenzi kuri we ari ugukomeza guhanga icyerekezo cye binyuze mu bihangano bye ndetse no mu isi y\u2019ubuhanzi nubwo amacakubiri ashingiye ku moko. Thomas yari akivangura nkumuhanzi wigitsina gore wumwirabura kandi yanenzwe muburyo bwe budafatika butandukanye nabandi Banyamerika b'Abirabura bakoranye ibishushanyo n\u2019ibimenyetso mu kurwanya igitugu. Ibikorwa bye byagaragaye hamwe nabandi bahanzi benshi b'Abanyafurika-Abanyamerika muri za galeries no kwerekana, nk'ububiko bwa mbere bufite abirabura mu Karere ka Columbiya. \nNyuma yo kwerekana muri Whitney, icyamamare cya Thomas mu muryango w\u2019ubukorikori cyiza cyane. Kuba yaramenyekanye vuba aha byatewe ahanini na Robert Doty amushyigikiye mu majwi, kuko yateguye igitaramo cya Thomas's Whitney mu rwego rwo kwerekana imurikagurisha ry\u2019abahanzi bo muri Afurika n\u2019Abanyamerika, rigamije kwamagana ko badahagarariwe. Abanenga New York bashimishijwe nuburyo bwa kijyambere bwa Thomas, cyane cyane ko yari umukecuru wimyaka 80 mugihe yatangiraga igihugu. Ikinyamakuru New York Times cyasuzumye imurikagurisha rye inshuro enye, yita amashusho ye \"gukuramo impuguke, tachiste mu buryo, nta makemwa mu gukoresha amabara Abazungu benshi bamunegura bamushimye nk \"\" Ikimenyetso cyabashushanyijeho amabara \"kandi nk\" \"impano, abstractioniste ebullient\". Filozofiya ya Alma Thomas yubuhanzi bwe nuko ibikorwa bye byuzuye imbaraga, kandi izo mbaraga ntizishobora gusenywa cyangwa kuremwa. \nUshinzwe gutunganya ibihangano bya New York akaba n'umwanditsi witwa Thomas B. Hess yaguze ishusho ya Tomasi yo mu 1972 ishushanya \"Red Roses Sonata\", maze mu 1976 umusingi w\u2019umuryango we uha iki gitabo inzu ndangamurage y\u2019ubuhanzi ya Metropolitan. [3]:\u200a34\u200a] \nMary Beth Edelson ' Bamwe mu bahanzi b'Abanyamerika bazima / Ifunguro Ryera (1972) bakiriye \"Ifunguro Ryera\" rya Leonardo da Vinci, hamwe n'abayobozi b'abahanzi b'abagore bazwi bahurira hejuru y'imitwe ya Kristo n'intumwa ze; Alma Thomas yari muri abo bahanzi b'abagore bazwi. Iyi shusho, ivuga ku ruhare rw\u2019amadini n\u2019ubuhanzi amashusho y\u2019amateka mu kugandukira abagore, yabaye \"imwe mu mashusho agaragara y\u2019ubuhanzi bw\u2019umugore.\" \nUbuzima bwite.\nThomas yabwiye \"New York Times\" mu 1977 ko \"atigeze arongora umugabo ariko ibihangano byanjye. Ni uwuhe mugabo wigeze ashima ibyo nashakaga?\" Yanditse ati: \"Kera byavuzwe, ntupfe kugira\" Miss \"ku ibuye ryawe. Ndumva nishimiye cyane kuba narakomeje Miss wanjye. Ndavuga ko Miss uhagaze kuri Jackasses zose nabuze mu buzima.\" [4] Yongeyeho ati: \"Umugabo mwiza ni umunezero, ariko ku bw'Imana ntukagwe na Jackass.\" [4] Yagize ubuzima busanzwe, hamwe ninshuti nyinshi zabahanzi. \"Ntakunze kubura\" inzu ndangamurage cyangwa imurikagurisha rifungura i Washington. [13]:\u200a447\u200a\nThomas yabaga mu nzu imwe i Washington, ku muhanda wa 1530, 15, NW, ubuzima bwe bwose, kuva mu 1907 igihe umuryango we wimukiye muri Jeworujiya kugira ngo ashobore kwiga amashuri yisumbuye kugeza apfuye mu 1978 (usibye imyaka mike yari afite mu myaka 20 yakoraga ahandi). Murumuna we John Maurice Thomas, uzwi ku izina rya se kandi yari afite umwuga wo kuba isomero muri kaminuza ya Howard, yasangiye inzu na we. [4]:\u200a7\u200a Urwo rugo, ubu ruzwi ku izina rya Alma Thomas Inzu, rwubatswe ahagana mu 1875 kandi rushyirwa ku gitabo cy\u2019igihugu cy\u2019ahantu ndangamateka. Ku ya 26 Gicurasi 2025, Umuhanda hagati y\u2019Itorero na Q wahinduwe Alma Thomas \nUrupfu n'ububiko.\nAlma Thomas yapfuye ku ya 24 Gashyantare 1978, mu bitaro bya kaminuza ya Howard, nyuma yo kubagwa aortic. \nImpapuro za Tomasi zatanzwe mu bihe byinshi hagati ya 1979 na 2004 muri Archives of Art Art y'Abanyamerika na mushiki we, J. Maurice Thomas. \nImiterere yubuhanzi.\nAlma Thomas akazi ke kare kari guhagarariwe muburyo. Nkumwirabura, yibanze kumurimo we wo guhanga aho kwibanda kumoko cyangwa igitsina. Tomasi yizeraga ko guhanga bigomba kwigenga kuburinganire cyangwa ubwoko, guhanga imirimo yibanda kubwiza butunguranye no gukuramo ibara. \nAfter further education at American University and influenced by James V. Herring and Lois Mailou Jones, her work became more abstract. Toward the end of her life, her style moved \"to a color-filled, impastoed geometric abstraction of tessellated brushstroke patterns.\" These paintings have been compared to Byzantine mosaics and the pointillist paintings of Georges-Pierre Seurat. Thomas' style has qualities similar to West African paintings as well as Byzantine mosaics.\nIbara rye ryamazi hamwe namavuta yashizwemo no gukoresha (rimwe na rimwe kurengana) urukiramende rwamabara. Yakomeje gukoresha ubu buhanga mu mirimo ye, bwerekanaga amabara aboneka mu biti, indabyo, ubusitani, ndetse n\u2019andi mashusho asanzwe. Igishushanyo cye \"nimugoroba Glow\" cyatewe ahanini n\u2019uko Tomasi yashishikajwe n\u2019amabara y\u2019isi: \"Igiti cyera hanze y\u2019icyumba cye, cyashishikaje Tomasi ibishushanyo mbonera byakozwe n'amababi yacyo ku idirishya, kandi bifite ishusho y\u2019urumuri n\u2019igicucu hasi hasi no ku rukuta imbere mu rugo rwe.\" Amashusho ye yise 'Alma's Stripes', kubera ko ishusho yuzuye irangi yaremye urukiramende rurerure. Nyuma ibikorwa byahumetswe nubushakashatsi bwikirere hamwe nisi. Umutwe w'ishusho ye \"ya Mars Dust\" (1972) yerekanaga inkuru zamakuru yumuyaga wumukungugu kuri Mars. [4]:\u200a33\u200a.\nNyuma reaction, kwerekana, niterambere.\nUmuhanga mu by'amateka y\u2019ubuhanzi Richard J. Powell yanditse mu 1997 ku bijyanye n\u2019umwanya wa Thomas na Sam Gilliam nk\u2019abanyamuryango babiri bazwi cyane b\u2019Abanyafurika-Abanyamerika bo mu Ishuri ry\u2019amabara rya Washington, ati: \"Mu gihe baganiraga n\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019abahanzi bagenzi babo bo mu Ishuri ry\u2019amabara rya Washington (Gene Davis, Morris Louis, na Kenneth Noland), banabagejejeho, binyuze mu buryo bwa tekiniki kandi bwo mu rwego rwo hejuru bwo gusiga amarangi, ibyifuzo by\u2019imibereho by\u2019icyiciro rusange cya Washington DC.\" Yakomeje avuga ko mu myaka ya za 1960 Thomas \"yateye umugongo\" ku buryo yari asanzwe ahagarariye \"umuryango w\u2019ubuhanzi wa DC wabonaga ko ari ibitekerezo by\u2019ibitekerezo,\" ashyigikira \"uburyo budasubirwaho bwatewe n\u2019ubuhinzi bw\u2019imboga, inyigisho z\u2019amabara ya siyansi, ndetse n\u2019umuziki.\" Powell yavuze ko Tomasi yo mu 1976 \"Azeleas Kuririmba no Kubyina Rock na Roll Music\" ari \"ubuhanga bwo kuganira inzira zinyerera hagati ya kamere na sosiyete,\" kandi \"bikerekana uburyo bwo kwishyira hamwe kw'ibihe.\" Ikinyamakuru Washington Post cyamusobanuye ko ari \"imbaraga mu ishuri ry\u2019ibara rya Washington \". \nYanditse mu 1998, umuhanga mu by'amateka y\u2019ubuhanzi Sharon Patton yavuze ko \"Igitaramo cya Tomasi cyo mu 1973 cy\u2019umuyaga na Crepe Myrtle\" ari \"kimwe mu bishushanyo mbonera bya Minimalist Color-Field byakozwe n\u2019umuhanzi nyafurika w\u2019umunyamerika.\" \nNubwo Thomas atabonye monografiya\u00a0 kugeza mu 1998 igihe inzu ndangamurage ya Fort Wayne yerekanaga ibyerekeranye n\u2019umuhanzi, ubukererwe bw\u2019abashakashatsi bwimbitse ntabwo bugaragaza umurage we n\u2019ingaruka ku buhanzi bwa Visual. Jacob Kainen, umwarimu we muri kaminuza y'Abanyamerika mu gatasi 1957, [3] yemeza ko \"Tomasi yagize uruhare runini mu iterambere ry\u2019ibishushanyo mbonera mu kinyejana cya 20.\" Kainen yanditse mu gitabo cya Fort Wayne yerekana ko yahuye na Thomas mu 1943, mu birori byabereye mu nzu mberabyombi ya Barnett-Aden. [3]:\u200a30\u200aKainen amwibuka muri kiriya gihe nk \"\" umugore muto, unanutse ufite ubwiza bwimyambarire, imyifatire ye ndetse no gushikama kudashidikanywaho byatumye ikibazo cy'ubunini bwe kidafite akamaro. \" [3] Muri gahunda y\u2019imyidagaduro y\u2019ubuhanzi ya kaminuza ya Howard yo mu 1966 \"Alma W. Thomas: Imurikagurisha ryisubiraho, 1959-1966,\" Kainen asobanura ko ari \"Ikimenyetso cy\u2019abashushanya amabara.\" \nMu mwaka wa 2009, amashusho abiri yakozwe na Thomas, harimo na \"Watusi (Hard Edge)\", yatowe na Madamu wa Perezida Michelle Obama, umushinga w'imbere mu nzu ya White House, Michael S. Smith (umushinga w'imbere), hamwe n'umuyobozi ushinzwe inzu ya White House, William Allman kugira ngo berekanwe muri White House mu gihe cya perezida Obama. \"Watusi (Hard Edge)\" yaje gukurwa muri White House kubera impungenge zatewe n'iki gice kibereye mu biro bya East Wing ya Michelle Obama. \"Sky Light\", yatanzwe na Hirshhorn Museum and Garden Sculpture, yamanitswe mu nzu bwite ya Obama. \nMu mwaka wa 2015, ikindi gishushanyo cye, \"Izuka\" (1966), cyamanitswe cyane mu cyumba cyo gusangiriramo umuryango wa Old House cyo muri White House, kikaba cyaraguzwe mu cyegeranyo cya White House mu 2014 hamwe n\u2019amadorari 290.000 n\u2019inkunga yatanzwe n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019amateka rya White House. Guhitamo mu cyegeranyo cya White House byasobanuwe nk'ikimenyetso cyiza ku butegetsi bwa Obama na Holland Cotter wanenze ibihangano \"bya New York Times\". Cotter yavuze ko umurimo wa Tomasi ari \"kureba imbere nta gukabya; nyuma y'amoko ariko kandi ukunda amoko.\" \nMu mwaka wa 2016, imurikagurisha \"Alma Thomas\", ryasobanuwe mu bikoresho byamamaza ko ari \"uburyo bwa mbere bwerekanwe ku bikorwa by\u2019umuhanzi mu myaka igera kuri makumyabiri,\" kandi ko bugaragaza \"ubwihindurize butandukanye bw\u2019imirimo ya Tomasi kuva mu mpera za 1950 kugeza apfuye mu 1978\" bwateguwe na The Frances Young Tang Teaching Museum and Art Gallery muri Skidmore College na Studio Museum i Harlem. Iri murika ryateguwe na Ian Berry, Umuyobozi wa Dayton w\u2019Ingoro Ndangamurage ya Tang na Lauren Haynes, Umuyobozi wungirije ushinzwe amasomo, icyegeranyo gihoraho mu nzu ndangamurage ya Studio i Harlem kandi ashyigikiwe n\u2019inshuti za Tang. Ibikoresho byamamaza imurikagurisha byagaragaje ko \"ibihangano bya Tomasi, ibishushanyo mbonera by\u2019ingufu ndetse no kwiyemeza kurangi byamuremye umurimo wihariye kandi udasanzwe.\" Bavuze kandi ko \"ikubiyemo gake cyane amabara y\u2019amazi n\u2019ubushakashatsi bwakozwe hakiri kare.\" Iri murika ryagabanyijwemo ibice bine: Himura kuri Abstraction; Isi, Umwanya, hamwe nakazi katinze. \n\"Ikinyamakuru Wall Street Journal\" cyamusobanuye mu mwaka wa 2016 nk'umuhanzi wahoze ari \"umuhanzi udashimwa\" uherutse kumenyekana kubera ibikorwa bye \"exuberant\", uzwi cyane ku buryo bwabo, injyana n'ibara. \nMuri 2019, Tomasi yo mu 1970 yashushanyije \"izuba rirenze\" ryatejwe cyamunara mugurisha Christie. Yagurishijwe miliyoni 2.655. \nMu 2021, hashyizweho igiciro gishya cy\u2019ibikorwa bya Tomasi igihe \"ubusitani bw\u2019indabyo bwa Alma\", bwashushanywaga mu myaka ya 1968 kugeza mu 1970, bwateshejwe agaciro n\u2019inzu ndangamurage y\u2019ubuhanzi ya Greenville, yagurishije mu kugurisha ku giti cye n\u2019umuguzi utamenyekanye ku madolari miliyoni 2.8. Inzu ndangamurage yari yaguze irangi mu 2008 ku madolari 135.000. \nIbikorwa bya Thomas byashyizwe mu imurikagurisha ryo mu 2021 \"Abagore muri Abstraction\" kuri Centre Pompidou. \nImurikagurisha ry\u2019ubuhanzi bwe yise \"Alma W. Thomas: Byose ni Byiza,\" ryateguwe n\u2019inzu ndangamurage ya Chrysler i Norfolk, muri Virijiniya n\u2019inzu ndangamurage ya Columbus i Columbus, Jeworujiya, yafunguwe ku ya 9 Nyakanga 2021, mu nzu ndangamurage ya Chrysler. Byari biteganijwe ko bizahakorera kugeza ku ya 3 Ukwakira 2021, nyuma yaho bikorera mu cyegeranyo cya Phillips i Washington, DC, mu mpeshyi 2021, inzu ndangamurage ya Frist i Nashville mu mpeshyi 2022, n'inzu ndangamurage ya Columbus mu mpeshyi 2022. \nInyandiko ngufi, \"Miss Alma Thomas: Ubuzima mu Ibara\", yashinzwe ku bufatanye n\u2019imurikabikorwa. Iyobowe na Cheri Gaulke ikanakorwa na Jon Gann, yakinnye iserukiramuco rya firime zirenga 40 ku isi yose kandi yegukana ibihembo ndetse n'ibihembo.\nMu 2023, ibikorwa bye byashyizwe mu imurikagurisha \"Igikorwa, Ibimenyetso, Irangi: Abahanzi b'Abagore na Global Abstraction 1940-1970\" mu nzu mberabyombi ya Whitechapel i Londres. \nIbikorwa bigaragara mubyegeranyo rusange.\nAlma Thomas Teen Umwanya muri Martin Luther King Jr. Urwibutso rwibutso rwitiriwe izina rye."}
{"id": "21285", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21285", "title": "Celine Dion", "text": "ngingo 109I\nCeline DionC\u00e9line Dion, yavutse ku wa 30 Werurwe 1968 i Charlemagne (Quebec), ni umuririmbyi wo muri Kanada.\nCeline Dion,ni umwana w'umuhererezi mu bana cumi na bane, yatangiye kubona ibihembo akiri muto mu ntara ye,mu gihugu kavukire cya Qu\u00e9bec yatangiye gutsindira ibihembo byihuse ku ndirimbo ye ya mbere Ce n'\u00e9tait qu'un r\u00eave muri alubumu y'indirimbo z'igifaransa yahimbye mu myaka ahagana 1980. izi ndirimbo zatumye arushaho gukundwa no kumenyekana mu gihe indirimbo yise \"D'amour ou d'alliance\" (1983)yarimbye bwa mbere mu gihugu cy'Ubufaransa yamuheshejekurushaho kumenyekana no kwamamara mu Bufaransa. Yakomeje kwamamara akimara gutsinda amarushanwa y'indirimbo za Eurovision mu 1988 aho yari ahagarariye igihugu cy' Ubusuwisi mu indirimbo ye yise\" \"Ne partez pas sans moi\".\"\nNyuma yize icyongereza, ahindura imyambarire maze asinyana amasezerano na Epic Records muri Amerika. MuriAlubumuye yo mu Cyongereza, \"Unison\", yasohotse mu 1990 maze imugaragaza nk'umuhanzi ukomeye wa pop mu masoko yo muri Amerika y'Amajyaruguru na Anglo-Saxon.\nMu myaka ya za 1990, yamenyekanye cyane ku isi, cyane cyane akora alubumu ebyiri ziza ku rutonde rw'izagurishijwe cyane mu mateka ya muzika:Alubumu \"Falling into you\" (1996) na \"Let's Talk About Love\" (1997), buri imwe yaycuruje kopi zirenga miliyoni 30 ku isi yose. Yakomeje kwigarurira imitima y'abatuye isi bose mu ndirimbo ye yise\" My Heart Will Go On \" no muri Filimi yiswe \" Titanic ya Jemes Cameron en 1997.Yakomeje kwamamara muri alubumu nyinshi yagiye akora mu gifaransa akomeza kuzicuruza ku masoko y'ubufaransa ibi kandi byamuhesheje amahirwe akomeye yo guhura na Jean-Jacques Goldman wamuyoboye muri Albumu D'eux (1995),Iyi niyo albumu y'indirimbo z'igifaransa yacurujwe cyane mu gihugu cy'Ubufaransa no mu isi yose.\" S'il suffisait d'aimer\" (1998).\nMu myaka ya za 2000, yamenyekanye cyane nk'umukinnyi w'umugore wa filimi, cyane cyane mu gitaramo \"Umunsi mushya\u2026\" cyatangiwe i Las Vegas kuva 2003 kugeza 2007, kikaba ari cyo gitaramo cyinjije amafaranga menshi mu mateka hamwe na \"Taking Chances World Tour\" kuva 2008 kugeza 2009 cyabaye imwe mu ngendo zunguka cyane mu bihe byose.\nMu myaka ya za 2010, yongeye gutura i Las Vegas kuva mu 2011 kugeza 2019 kandi akora ibitaramo byinshi byo mu karere ku isi. Mu mwaka wa 2016, urupfu rw'umugabo we n'umuyobozi, Ren\u00e9 Ang\u00e9lil, wagize uruhare runini mu byiciro byose yatsindiye, byagaragaje impinduka mu mwuga we.\nUmuziki wa Celine Dion ufasha abakunzi be mu ibintu bitandukanye, kuva R&amp;amp;B kugeza gospel kugeza kera kugeza pop. Yandika cyane cyane mu Gifaransa n'Icyongereza, ariko nanone rimwe na rimwe mu akandika muri Espagnol,Igitaliyani, Ikidage, Ikilatini, Ikiyapani na Mandarin, azwi cyane kandi azwi nk'umwe mu bantu bafite ijwi rikomeye muri muzika ya pop. Yakiriye ibihembo bitanu bya Grammy, harimo Album y'umwaka n'indirimbo y'umwaka, naho ibihembo bibiri bya Academy by'indirimbo y'umwimerere nziza byahawe indirimbo yakoze mu 2003, ihuriro mpuzamahanga ry\u2019inganda za Fonografiya ryamuhesheje icyubahiro kubera kugurisha alubumu zirenga miliyoni 50 mu Burayi. Mu bihembo bya muzika ku isi 2007, yahawe \"igihembo cya Legend\" mu rwego rwo kumushimira \u00ab\u00a0Gutsinda ku isi yose hamwe no guteza imbere ibikorwa bya muzika\u00bb. Mu buryo nk'ubwo, yahawe \"igihembo cya Billboard Icon Igihembo\" cya Billboard Music Awards mu 2016 mu rwego rwo gushimira umwuga we wose.\nUmuhanzi rukumbi wamamaye cyane mu mateka ya muzika muri Kanada mu mateka. Ni umwe mu bahanzi bagurishije Alubumu nyinshi cyane hamwe na miliyoni zirenga 200 zagurishijwe kwisi yose.\nCeline Dion"}
{"id": "21286", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21286", "title": "Inyamaswa ziba muri Africa Museum", "text": "Inyamaswa ziba mu Rwanda no muri Afurika zasizwe imiti ngo zikomeze kugaragara mu mwimerere.\nMuri afurika Museum harimo inyamaswa zigaraga mu isura ya nyayo aho zazizwe imiti ngo zitangirika, kuko zizanwa hashize igihe kirekire.\nMuri izo Nyamaswa harimo Inzovu, Intare, Imvubu, Isatura, Agasumbashyamba, Ingugi, Imbogo, Igisamujyonjyo(Pangolin), Impala, Imparage, Inzoka, Ingona,Ingwe, Urusamagwe, Imbwebwe, Umuhari, Akanyamasyo ndetse n'izindi.\nAkarusho ku muntu utarabona izo nyamaswa iyo azibonye asanga zifite umubiri wazo w'umwihariko, ubwoya ndetse n'ibindi bice bitigeze byangirika kubera zibitswe mu buryo bwa gihanga butuma zitangirika.\nIzo nyamaswa zigaraga nuri iyo nzu ndangamurage harimo izakuwe mu Rwanda ndetse n'izakuwe mu bindi bice byo muri Afurika nka Tanzania, u Burundi na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Congo. Inzu ndangamurage ya Africa Museum iherereye mu nkengero z'umujyi wa Buruseli mu gace Tervuren ikaba iri mu nzu ndangamurage zikomeye ku isi, irimo ibisigaswa miliyoni 10 by'inyamaswa, amabuye y'agaciro ibihumbi 250, ibikoresho by'umuziki 8,000, ubushyinguro bw'amateka (Archives) 350, amakarita ibihumbi 20, ubwoko bunyuranye bw'ibiti ndetse n'ibikoresho bijyanye n'umuco karande."}
{"id": "21288", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21288", "title": "Faith Ringgold", "text": "Faith Ringgold (Faith Willi Jones ; Ku ya 8 Ukwakira 1930 - 13 Mata 2024) yari umwirabura w\u2019umunyamerika akaba umwanditsi, umunyabugeni, umuhanzi ukora ibitaramo, akaba n'umurwanashyaka uhuza abantu, yari azwi nkumuntu uzi kuvuga neza imbwirwaruhame. \nRinggold yavukiye i Harlem, mu mujyi wa New York, kandi yabonye impamyabumenyi yicyiciro cyagatatu cya kaminuza yakuye muri City College ya New York. Yari umwarimu wubuhanzi muri sisitemu yishuri rusange rya New York City. Nkumuhanzi wa multimediya, ibihangano bye byasesenguye insanganyamatsiko yumuryango, ubwoko, icyiciro, nuburinganire. Urukurikirane rw\"inkuru, byakozwe kuva mu myaka ya za 1980, byafashe ibyabaye ku Banyamerika b'Abirabura maze biba ibihangano bye byasinywe. Mu mwuga we, yazamuye ibikorwa by\u2019abahanzi b'Abirabura maze arahaguruka arwanya guhezwa kwabo n\u2019ingoro ndangamurage. Yanditse kandi ashushanya ibitabo birenga icumi byabana. Ubuhanzi bwa Ringgold bwerekanwe ku isi yose kandi buri mu byegeranyo bihoraho bya The Guggenheim, Inzu Ndangamurage y\u2019Ubuhanzi ya Metropolitan, Inzu Ndangamurage y\u2019Ubuhanzi n\u2019ibishushanyo, inzu ndangamurage ya Philadelphia, n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019ubushakashatsi cya Schomburg mu muco w\u2019abirabura.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nFaith Willi Jones yavutse ari umuhererezi mu bana batatu ku ya 8 Ukwakira 1930, mu bitaro bya Harlem, mu mujyi wa New York.:\u200a24\u200aAbabyeyi be, Andrew Louis Jones na Willi Posey Jones, bakomokaga mu miryango y'abakozi bimuwe na Great Migration. Nyina wa Ringgold yari umunyamideli kandi se, ndetse no gukora imirimo itandukanye, yari umwanditsi w'inkuru. Bamurereye mubidukikije byamuteye gutangira kwiga guhanga. Nyuma ya Harlem Renaissance, inzu ya Ringgold akiri umwana i Harlem yakikijwe n\u2019ubuhanzi butera imbere - aho abantu nka Duke Ellington na Langston Hughes babaga hafi aho.:\u200a27\u200aInshuti ye yo mu bwana Sonny Rollins, wabaye umucuranzi ukomeye wa jazz, yakundaga gusura umuryango we kandi akitoza sakasofone mu birori byabo.:\u200a28\u200a\nKubera indwara ya asima yari arwaye, Ringgold yakoze ubushakashatsi ku buhanzi bugaragara nk'imyidagaduro ikomeye abifashijwemo na nyina, akenshi yageragezaga na crayons akiri umukobwa muto.:\u200a24\u200aYize kandi kudoda no gukora mu buryo bwa gihanga akoresheje imyenda ya nyina. \u200b:\u200a24\u200aIzi ngaruka zose hamwe, ibihangano bya Ringgold bizaza byatewe inkunga n'abantu cyane, imivugo, numuziki yakundaga kubikora mu bwana, nubwo ivanguramoko, ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina, n'amacakubiri byamucaga intege mubuzima bwe bwa buri munsi.:\u200a9\u200a\nMu 1948, kubera igitutu cy\u2019umuryango we, Ringgold yiyandikishije mu Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019Umujyi wa New York yiga ibijyanye n\u2019ubuhanzi, ariko ahatirwa kwiga ibijyanye n\u2019ubuhanzi, kubera ko City College yemereraga abagore kwiyandikisha mu byiciro bimwe na bimwe.:\u200a134\u200aMu 1950, yashakanye numuntu wakundaga gucuranga piano witwa Robert Earl Wallace babyarana abana babiri, Michele na Barbara Faith Wallace, mu 1952. Ringgold na Wallace batandukanye nyuma yimyaka ine kubera kunywa ibiyobyabwenge bya heroine.:\u200a54\u200aHagati aho, yiganye n'abahanzi Robert Gwathmey na Yasuo Kuniyoshi. Yamenyekanye kandi n\u2019umucapyi Robert Blackburn, bazafatanya gukurikiranya ibicapo nyuma yimyaka 30.:\u200a29\u200a\nMu 1955, Ringgold yakuye impamyabumenyi ihanitse muri City College hanyuma bidatinze yigisha muri gahunda y\u2019ishuri rusange rya New York City. Mu 1959, yabonye impamyabumenyi ihanitse yakuye muri City College yajyanye na nyina n\u2019abakobwa be mu rugendo rwe rwa mbere mu Burayi. Igihe bari mu rugendo mu mahanga i Paris, Florence, na Roma, yasuye ingoro ndangamurage nyinshi, harimo na Louvre. Iyi ngoro ndangamurage yashishikarije urukurikirane rw'ibishushanyo bizwi ku izina \"ry'Igifaransa\" (1991\u20131997). Uru rugendo rwaciwe mu buryo butunguranye, ariko, kubera urupfu rwa murumuna we mu 1961. Ringgold, nyina n\u2019abakobwa be bose basubiye muri Amerika kumushyingura.:\u200a141\u200aYashakanye na Burdette Ringgold ku ya 19 Gicurasi 1962. \nRinggold yasuye Afurika y'Iburengerazuba inshuro ebyiri: rimwe mu 1976 na none mu 1977. Izi ngendo zagize uruhare runini mu gukora mask, gushushanya ibipupe, n'ibishusho. \nIbikorwa by'ubugeni.\nUbuhanzi bwa Ringgold bwari butandukanye cyane. Harimo gushushanya,kubihangano bikozwe mu bisigazwa bya palasitike, amabuye nibindi, gutunganya amashusho n'ibikorwa by'ubuhanzi no gutunganya ibitabo by'abana. Nkumwarimu, yigishije muri sisitemu yishuri rusange rya New York City ndetse no kurwego rwa kaminuza. Mu 1973, yaretse kwigisha ishuri rya Leta kugira ngo yitangire guhanga ibihangano igihe cyose. Mu 1995, yegerejwe na ACA Galleries kugirango abahagararire wenyine kandi yari ahagarariwe nabo ubuzima bwe bwose. "}
