{"id": "21300", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21300", "title": "Van Vicker", "text": "Joseph van Vicker (yavutse ku ya 1 Kanama 1977), uzwi cyane ku izina rya Van Vicker, ni umukinnyi wa filme ukomoka muri Gana, akaba Umuyobozi wa filme akaba na Humanitarian. Niwe muyobozi mukuru (CEO) wa Sky + Orange production, inzu itunganya filme. Van Vicker yahataniye ibihembo bibiri aribyo \"Umukinnyi mwiza\" n' \"Umukinnyi mwiza ukizamuka\" mu bihembo bya yo muri 2008. \nAmateka.\nVicker yavukiye mu mujyi wa Accra muri Gana ku mubyeyi umubyara nyina w'umunyagana na se Ise yaje gupfa afite imyaka itandatu gusa.\nVicker yize mu aho yiganye n'umukinnyi, Yarangirije muri mu mwaka wa 2021.\nUbuzima bwe bwite.\nVicker yashakanye na Adjoa ku wa 16 Ukwakira 2003. Igihe bizihizaga isabukuru y'imyaka 21 bamaranye bashakanye, yashimiye Imana ndetse anashimira umugore we kuba ahora amuba hafi.\nIbikorwa by'Umwuga.\nTeleviziyo.\nVicker yinjiye mu myidagaduro akora kuri radiyo nk'umunyamakuru yitwaga Groove yumvikanaga kuri 106.3 fm (1999-22000) n'iyitwa Vibe 91.9fm (2001\u20132004) ndetse aza gukora no kuri televiziyo yo muri Gana yitwa (1997\u20131999) &amp; Metro TV (2000\u20132004), Vicker yagaragaye muri televiziyo yo muri Gana \"izuba\" ryerekanaga ubuzima bwa kaminuza. Yakinnye imico ya LeRoy King Jr., umunyeshuri wubuhanzi Bwiza wavukiye muri Amerika ugeze muri Sun City kurangiza amashuri ye. Urukurikirane rwakoresheje ibice 10 byose. \nCareer.\nTeleviziyo.\nVicker yinjiye mu myidagaduro ahereye kuri radiyo nk'umunyamakuru yitwaga Groove yumvikanaga ku murongo wa 106.3 fm mu mwaka wa (1999 - 2000) akomereza kuri Vibe yumvikanaga kuri 91.9fm muri (2001\u20132004) ndetse aba n'umunyamakuru wa televiziyo yitwa muri (1997\u20131999) akora no kuri mu (2000\u20132004), Vicker yaje kugaragara muri filme y'uruhererekane yo muri Gana \"yitwaga \"Sun City\"\" yavugaga ku buzima bwo muri kaminuza. Yakinaga yitwa LeRoy King Jr umunyeshuri mwiza wiga iby'ubuhanzi wavukiye muri Amerika waje muri Sun City kurangiza amashuri ye. Iyi filme yagize ibice 10 byose. \nFilme.\nNyuma yaho Vicker yatorewe gukina muri filme yitwaga \"Divine Love\" nk'umukinnyi usanzwe. Iyi filme kandi yabaye imbarutso ku ma role y'abakinnyi bakomeye nka na bakinnyemo nk'Umuhungu n'Umukobwa bayoboye inkuru y'iyo filme.\nAkenshi Vicker akunzwe gutoranywa nk'umukinnyi ukina role zo gukundana aho akinana na Jackie Appiah cyangwa ugasanga bakunze kumugereranya na mugenzi we wo muri Gana Majid Michel cyangwa wo muri Nigeriya.\nKumenyeka muri Nollywood.\nVicker yagaragaye muri filme nyinshi zakorewe muri aho yakinannye n'Abakinnyi bakomeye bo muri Nollywood, barimo nka,, ndetse na. Muri filme yakiniye muri Nollywood harimo nka \"My Soul Mate\", \"Heart of Fire\", \"Popular King\", \"Gambling with Marriage\", \"Harvest of Love\", \"Stolen Will\", \"The Joy of a Prince\", \"Discovered\", \"The Kingdom\" and \"Against the law\".\nKumenyekana ku rwego Mpuzamahanga.\nVicker yayoboye, akina kandi akora filme 5 abikoreye muri Sky + Orange Productions kuva mu 2008. Umwaka wa 2012 wabaye umwaka mwiza ku nzu ye ya production aho yatwaye ibihembo 2 kuva muri NAFCA icya Best Actor n'icya Director Awards abiheshejwe na filme ye \"Joni Waka.\"\nVicker yahataniye ibihembo byinshi ndetse anatsindira byinshi kuva muri Africa kugeza muri. Ibihembo birimo nka, ACRAG Awards na Nollywood Academy Films Critics 'Awards. \nMuri 2009 yatsindiye igihembo cya Best African Caribbean Actor na Best African American Actor naho muri 2011 yatsindiye icya the Pan African creative actor. Muri 2013 atsindira icya the Best International Actor award muri Papyrus Magazine Screen Actors Awards (PAMSAA) ya 2013 yabereye Abuja muri Nijeriya. \nReferences.\nJoseph van Vicker (yavutse ku ya 1 Kanama 1977), uzwi cyane ku izina rya Van Vicker, ni umukinnyi wa filme ukomoka muri Gana, akaba Umuyobozi wa filme akaba na Humanitarian. Niwe muyobozi mukuru (CEO) wa Sky + Orange production, inzu itunganya filme. Van Vicker yahataniye ibihembo bibiri aribyo \"Umukinnyi mwiza\" n' \"Umukinnyi mwiza ukizamuka\" mu bihembo bya yo muri 2008. \nAmateka.\nVicker yavukiye mu mujyi wa Accra muri Gana ku mubyeyi umubyara nyina w'umunyagana na se Ise yaje gupfa afite imyaka itandatu gusa.\nVicker yize mu aho yiganye n'umukinnyi, Yarangirije muri mu mwaka wa 2021.\nVicker yashakanye na Adjoa ku wa 16 Ukwakira 2003. Igihe bizihizaga isabukuru y'imyaka 21 bamaranye bashakanye, yashimiye Imana ndetse anashimira umugore we kuba ahora amuba hafi.\nIbikorwa by'Umwuga.\nTeleviziyo.\nVicker yinjiye mu myidagaduro ahereye kuri radiyo nk'umunyamakuru yitwaga Groove yumvikanaga ku murongo wa 106.3 fm mu mwaka wa (1999 - 2000) akomereza kuri Vibe yumvikanaga kuri 91.9fm muri (2001\u20132004) ndetse aba n'umunyamakuru wa televiziyo yitwa muri (1997\u20131999) akora no kuri mu (2000\u20132004), Vicker yaje kugaragara muri filme y'uruhererekane yo muri Gana \"yitwaga \"Sun City\"\" yavugaga ku buzima bwo muri kaminuza. Yakinaga yitwa LeRoy King Jr umunyeshuri mwiza wiga iby'ubuhanzi wavukiye muri Amerika waje muri Sun City kurangiza amashuri ye. Iyi filme yagize ibice 10 byose. \nFilme.\nNyuma yaho Vicker yatorewe gukina muri filme yitwaga \"Divine Love\" nk'umukinnyi usanzwe. Iyi filme kandi yabaye imbarutso ku ma role y'abakinnyi bakomeye nka na bakinnyemo nk'Umuhungu n'Umukobwa bayoboye inkuru y'iyo filme.\nAkenshi Vicker akunzwe gutoranywa nk'umukinnyi ukina role zo gukundana aho akinana na Jackie Appiah cyangwa ugasanga bakunze kumugereranya na mugenzi we wo muri Gana Majid Michel cyangwa wo muri Nigeriya.\nKumenyeka muri Nollywood.\nVicker yagaragaye muri filme nyinshi zakorewe muri aho yakinannye n'Abakinnyi bakomeye bo muri Nollywood, barimo nka,, ndetse na. Muri filme yakiniye muri Nollywood harimo nka \"My Soul Mate\", \"Heart of Fire\", \"Popular King\", \"Gambling with Marriage\", \"Harvest of Love\", \"Stolen Will\", \"The Joy of a Prince\", \"Discovered\", \"The Kingdom\" and \"Against the law\".\nKumenyekana ku rwego Mpuzamahanga.\nVicker yayoboye, akina kandi akora filme 5 abikoreye muri Sky + Orange Productions kuva mu 2008. Umwaka wa 2012 wabaye umwaka mwiza ku nzu ye ya production aho yatwaye ibihembo 2 kuva muri NAFCA icya Best Actor n'icya Director Awards abiheshejwe na filme ye \"Joni Waka.\"\nVicker yahataniye ibihembo byinshi ndetse anatsindira byinshi kuva muri Africa kugeza muri. Ibihembo birimo nka, ACRAG Awards na Nollywood Academy Films Critics 'Awards. \nMuri 2009 yatsindiye igihembo cya Best African Caribbean Actor na Best African American Actor naho muri 2011 yatsindiye icya the Pan African creative actor. Muri 2013 atsindira icya the Best International Actor award muri Papyrus Magazine Screen Actors Awards (PAMSAA) ya 2013 yabereye Abuja muri Nijeriya. "}
{"id": "21301", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21301", "title": "Kwitwaza Inkoni", "text": "Umugenzo Nyarwanda wo kwitwaza Inkoni.\nMu muco n'amateka y'u Rwanda, habagamo imigenzo mikuru yabaga ari umuco karande ababakomokaho bazagenderaho ibihe byinshi. Muriyo migenzo, ntitwabura kuvuga k'umaze imyaka myinshi mu muco w'Abanyarwanda, ari wo wo kwitaza inkoni.\nKwitwaza inkoni, byari bimwe mu bigize imigenzo myinshi y'Abanyarwanda, yaba abakiri bato n,abakuru, abayobozi n'abayoborwa.\nImpamvu nyamukuru zatumaga Abanyarwanda bo hambere bitwaza inkoni:\nKwirinda no Kwitabara.\nKera u Rwanda rukiri amashyamba ya cyimeza, rwari rurimo inyamaswa nyinshi z'inkazi n'ibikururuka bitagira ingano. Ibyo byatumaga Abanyarwanda, bahora bitwaje inkoni, kugira ngo mu gihe bahuye n'inyamaswa iyo ari yo yose yabasagarira babashe kwitabara. Iyo bahuraga n'inzoka, inkoni babaga bitwaje, ni yo yabibafashagamo kugira ngo babashe kuyica, itabangiza. \nInkoni nk'ikimenyetso cy'ubushumba.\nAbanyarwanda bitwazaga inkoni nk'ikimenyetso cy'ubuyobozi n'ubushumba bw'abo bashumbye cyangwa se bashinzwe kubungabunga umutekano wa bo. Iteka ryose, wasangaga abami, abatware b'umwami n'abatware b'imiryango, bakunze kwitwaa inkoni.\nInkoni nk'akaguru ka gatatu.\nAbanyarwanda bitwazaga inkonink'akaguru ka gatatu, iyo umuntu yaageraga mu zabukuru, akenshi yagiraga intege nke, zivanze no kurwara isusumira, bityo bikamusaba kugira inkoni yo kwicumba, kugira ngo abashe gushingura abe yagira iyo agana.\nIzo akaba ari zo mpamvu nyamukuru zatumaga Abanyarwnda, baba abato n'abakuru bagira umugenzo wo kwitwaza inkoni, ukaba waramamaye na magingo aya.\nNta bwo kwitwaza inkoni byari umuco w'urugomo cyangwa se impamvu z'ubusaza nk'uko benshi babyibwira cyangwa se babibwiwe, buri wese yagiraga impamvu ze zituma yitwaza inkoni hakaba n'izo bahuriyeho."}
{"id": "21302", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21302", "title": "Majid Michel", "text": "Majid Michel (yavutse ku ya 22 Nzeri 1980) ni umukinnyi wa filme ukomoka muri Gana, akaba umunyamideli, agira ibiganiro kuri televiziyo, ni umuvugabutumwa, akora n'imirimo yo gufasha imbabare (humanitarian). Yagiye ahatanira kenshi igihembo cya \"Best actor in a leading role\" mu bihembo bya Africa Movie Academy Awards mu myaka ya,, na. Gusa yaje kwegukana icya 2012 nyuma yo guhatana ubugira 3 byanga\nAmateka.\nMichel yavukiye i mu nkengero z'umurwa mukuru wa Gana Accra. Ni umuhungu ukomoka kuri Se w'umuLibani na nyina umubyara w'umunyagana akaba avukana n'abavandimwe be 9. Yize amashuri abanza muri St Therese ayakomereza muri, aho yiganye na Van Vicker umukinnyi wa filme ndetse n\u2019uwahoze ari w\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye. Mu mashuri yisumbuye, Michel yyakundaga gukina no kugaragara mu kinamico akaba n'umwe mu bagize drama club yo ku kigo yigagaho, bimuhesha gutwara igikombe cya Best Actor Award kuva muri kimwe mu bitaramo yakinnyemo ku munsi wo kwibohora muri aho muri Gana. \nIbijyanye n'Umwuga.\nMbere yo kuba umukinnyi wabigize umwuga, Michel yamurikaga imideli. Mu kiganiro yagiranye na \"Star FM Ghana muri 2017,\" Majid yatangaje ko bwa mbere agerageza gukina filme atahise abona amahirwe kubera yaratarabimenya ariko ntibyamuca intege ahubwo ishyaka n'umuhate n'urukundo yarafitiye umwuga wo gukina filme byamuteye guhatana kurushaho mu ruganda rwa filme.\nRole ya mbere yayibonye muri filme y'uruhererekane yamamaye cyane \" a\"ho yakinnyemo nk'umusore ukora muri hoteri wo muri Libani. \nNyuma atoranywa nk'umukinnyi w'imena muri filme irangira ya mbere ye \"Divine Love\" akinana na hamwe na Van Vicker muri role yunganira. \"Iyi filme bahuriyemo irakundwa cyane ibahesha kugira amazina akomeye aturuka muri Ghana.\"\nMu mwaka wa 2008 Michel yakinnye muri \"Agony of the Christ nk'umukinnyi w'imena, filme yahataniye ibihembo 7 muri\" Afurika Movie Academy Awards yo muri 2009, harimo n'igihembo cya Michel yahataniraga nk'umukinnyi mwiza w'uwo mwaka.\nMu Kwakira 2017 Michel yatangaje ko ahembwa byibuze $15.000 kandi ko yinjije amadorari agera ku 35.000 ayakuye mu gukina filme. mu kwa cumi 2017 Michel gutangaza ko atazongera gukina role zimusaba gusomana kubera impamvu z'uko ari umukristo wavutse ibwa kabiri kandi imyemerere ye ikaba itabimwemeza abitangariza mu kiganiro kuri radiyo.\nKumenyekana muri Nollywood no Kwamamara.\nMichel ni umwe mu bakinnyi bo muri Ghana binjiye mu ruganda rwa filme mu gihe cya usanzwe uyobora filme muri Nijeriya ubwo yagiranaga amasezerano y'ubufatanye na Director w'umunyagana ukorera muri Venus Films. [\"citation needed\"] Aya masezerano yatumye Abakinnyi benshi bo muri Ghana bagaragara ku isoko rya bibahesha amahirwe cyane kuruta n'Abakinnyi bo muri Nigeria, zimwe muri filme zakorewe muri ayo masezerano Michel yagaragayemo harimo: \"Crime to Christ\" (2007), \"Agony of Christ\" (2008), ' (2009), ' (2010), and \"Who Loves Me?\" (2010) amongst others.\nMichel yatangiriye kuri filme y'urukundo yo muri 2009 \"Emerald\" akina role y'imena hamwe nubwo benshi bashimye imikinire ya Michel n'umubano we na Nnaji bagaragaje muri filme, ntibyatumye filme itagira amanota mabi. Gusa filme yo muri 2009 yakiriwe neza ibona amanota meza yaba ku mikorerwe yayo (production) ndetse n'imikinire ya Michel.\nMu mwaka wa 2009 Michel yakinnye muri filme yo muri nijeriya \"Guilty Pleasures\" yamugaragaje nk'umukinnyi mwiza ndetse ibona n'amanota meza. Muri 2010 yari inshuro ya 3 yongeye gukinana na Genevieve Nnaji bahurira noneho muri filme filme yo muri Nollywood yakiriwe bitandukanye inavugwaho mu buryo butandukanye Aho Kuri Nnaji Michel yavuze ko yamwigishije gukina Kandi aza no gutangaza ko buriya Genevieve Nnaji ariwe mukinnyi uzi gukina neza asomana mu ruganda rwa sinema.\nMichel yakunze gukemura impaka hakiri kare mu mwuga we wa Nollywood mu magambo ye mu bitangazamakuru, harimo no kuvuga ko Gana nta nganda za firime yigeze. Mu mpera za 2010, byavuzwe ko uyu mukinnyi yaruhutse gukorera muri Nollywood nyuma yo guhabwa iterabwoba ry\u2019urupfu yahabwaga n\u2019abakinnyi bo muri Nijeriya batekerezaga ko abatwara ama role mesnhi \nYagarutse muri Gana aho yagaragaye muri filme nka \"4 Play\" yo muri 2010 hamwe n'ibice byayo byayikurikiye \"4 Play Reloaded\" (2011).\nMuri 2012, yakinnye muri filme yavugaga ku ntambara yitwa \"Somewhere in Africa\", akina ari umunyagitugu, nubwo iyi filme itagafashe ariko Michel yashimiwe uko yayikinnyemo atsindira igihembo cye cya mbere muri Africa Movie Academy Award Byatumye yongera kugaruka muri Nollywood muri 2014 ahita agaragara muri 30 days in Atlanta aho byamushyize ku rutonde na the Nigerian Cinema Exhibition Coalition nk'imwe muri highest box office draws yo muri 2014. izindi film zo muri 2014 yagaragayemo harimo nka: ', itarakiriwe neza na ' ndetse na \"\", zombi zigorwa no kuzamamaza ndetse no kumenyekana.\nUbuzima bwite.\nMajid Michel yarashatse abyara abana batatu. Ku wa 19 Ugushyingo 2015 Michel yatangaje ko Umugore we bamaranye imyaka 10 y'urushako ariwe soko y'instinzi ye Ashima Imana muri uwo mwaka aba arinabwo basubiramo isezerano bagiranye ryo kubana nk'umugabo n'umugore.\nMajid ni Umukristo ukijijwe Kuwa 4 Ukwakira 2016, Yari umushyitsi w'umuvugabutumwa mu rusengero aho yajyaga abasangiza Ijambo ry'Imana rifasha abantu Ubwo yari mu kiganiro kuri Radiyo Joy FM yo muri Gana, yatangaje ko ubu afite ubuzima bushya nk'umukristo nk'uko bibiliya ivuga Kuwa 1 Mata 2017 yavuze ko kuva yatangira urugendo rwe rw'agakiza byatumye atana n'incuti ze za mbere, ariko Imana imuhesha izindi ncuti zimushyigikira mu buzima bwe bushya. \nMu 2017 mu gitaramo cya pasika Majib yavuze mu magambo make ko kubambwa kwa Kristo bishushanywa no kwanga ivanguramoko, inzangano, ishyari, ubwibone, intambara, n\u2019ububasha bw\u2019abadayimoni ahubwo ukabaho ubuzima bwuzuye ubuntu buturuka ku Mana\" \nMu kwa cumi 2017 yatangaje ko Imana ariyo imukoresha mu gukorera abantu ibitangaza. Ku ngingo yo kwikinisha, Majid avuga ko ari icyaha ku Mana ari nta muntu ukwiye kubikora na rimwe mu buzima bwe avuga ko nawe yigeze kubatwa nabyo mu myaka ye y'ubuto ariko ashishikariza urubyiruko kubyirinda \nUbwo yari mu kiganiro na, Majid ntiyemeranije na Freeze ku bijyanye no gutanga icyacumi. Majid yavuze ko gutanga icyacumi atari inyigisho zo mu isezerano rya kera. Ahubwo, avuga ko kigomba guhabwa itorero kugira ngo rifashe abakene."}
{"id": "21303", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21303", "title": "Ramsey Nouah", "text": "Ramsey Nouah (yavutse ari Ramsey Tokunbo Nouah Jr kuwa 19 Ukuboza 1970) ni umukinnyi wa filme ukomoka muri Nijeriya akanaziyobora. Yatsindiye igikombe muri Africa Movie Academy Award cy'umukinnyi witwaye neza mu role y'ibanze agiheshejwe na filme yakinnye yatangiriye kuyobora filme kuri filme yo muri 2019\"\u200b\"\u200b\"\u200b\" ahita akomereza kuri filme yakunzwe muri yitwa ikaba filme yari yongewe gusubirwamo\u200b yo muri 1995\nAmateka.\nRamsey Tokunbo Nouah Jr. yavukiye i kuwa 19 Ukuboza 1970 kuri se w'umuLibani na nyina w'umunya- ukomoka muri Owo, muri Leta ya Ondo. Yakuriye i Surulere Lagos, aho yigiye amashuri abanza kuri Atara primary school akomereza kuri community grammar school. Yakuye impamyabumenyi ya mu ishuri rikuru rya Lagos (), nyuma nibwo yabonye gukomeza umwuga wo.\nIbijyanye n'Umwuga.\nNouah yinjiye mu mwuga wo gukina filme mu myaka ya za 90 kuko yari akeneye amafaranga yo kwishyura impamyabumenyi ya General Certificate Education (GCE). Ariko umwuga we wo gukina filme ufata ishusho ubwo yakinaga nka Jeff Akin-Thomas muri filme yacaga kuri televiziyo yo muri Nijeriya bise Soap Opera Fortunes Kuva icyo gihe yagaragaye muri filme nyinshi nk'umukinnyi w'imena aza kwitirirwa akabyiniriro ka Lover Boy kubera role nyinshi yakinaga muri filme z'urukundo Afatwa kandi nk'umwe mu bakinnyi bashakishwa cyane muri Nijeriya.\nMuri 2015, Nouah yahawe uburenganzira bwo gusubiramo filme Living in Bondage yo muri 1992. Muri 2018, nibwo yatangaje ko iyo azasubiramo azayita Living in Bondage: Breaking Free, yaje no gusohoka kuwa 8, ugushyingo 2019, iba filme ya mbere Nouah yayoboye anayikinamo\u200b ndetse iza gutsindira ibihembo 7 muri.\nUbuzima bwite.\nNouah yashakanye na Emelia Philips-Nouah, bibarutse abana 2 b'abahungu Quincy Nouah na Joshua Nouah n'umukobwa umwe witwa Desiree Nouah."}
{"id": "21304", "revid": "11606", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21304", "title": "Destin Conrad", "text": "Destin Conrad (yavutse ku ya 25 Kamena 2000) ni umuhanzi w'umunyamerika. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nDestin yavukiye i Tampa muri Leta ya Floride, arererwa n\u2019umubyeyi umwe ukomoka muri Jamayika. Nyirasenge, wari umuvugabutumwa, yakundaga kumujyana mu rusengero no mu bikorwa by\u2019itorero aho yaririmbaga. Yatangiye kumenyekana ku mbuga nkoranyambaga Vine mu mwaka wa 2014, ubwo yashyiragaho videwo ye ya mbere, maze akaza kubona abayoboke barenga miliyoni. Ni naho kandi yahuriye bwa mbere n\u2019umuhanzi Kehlani, bafitanye ubucuti bukomeye kandi amufata nk\u2019umuvandimwe we mukuru. \nUmwuga.\nAmaze kwigaragaza nkumuntu wimbuga nkoranyambaga kuri Vine, yatangiye gusohora umuziki nkubuseribateri. Muri 2019, yasohoye indirimbo \"Cautious.\" Mu myaka mike yakurikiyeho, yasohoye izindi ndirimbo, zirimo ubufatanye na Ambr\u00e9 bise \"Uburiganya\" na trap / R &amp; B hybrid \"Closure\", byombi byasohotse mu 2020. Kugeza mu 2021, yashoboye gusohora icyegeranyo cy\u2019indirimbo 9 za \"Colorway.\" Yarekuye \"Satin\" mu 2022, \"Yayoboka\" mu mpera za 2023, na \"Submissive 2\" mu 2024. Yandikiye abandi bahanzi nka Kehlani na Ambr\u00e9. Yakoranye kandi n'umuririmbyi / umwanditsi w'indirimbo Alex Isley (umukobwa wa Ernie Isley) mu ndirimbo 2024 yise \"Amakosa amwe.\" Basohoye kandi amashusho yindirimbo imwe. 2024, Destin Conrad yatangiye urugendo rwe rwa mbere. Ni urugendo rwo mu mijyi 36 yo muri Amerika rwatangiye ku cyumweru, tariki ya 4 Gashyantare 2024 i Ngwino Ufate Live muri Austin, Texas hanyuma ruzenguruke i Los Angeles kuri Echoplex ku wa gatanu, 5 Mata 2024. "}
{"id": "21305", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21305", "title": "Yorodani Ward", "text": "Jordan Alexander Ward (wavutse ku ya 1 Gashyantare 1995), uzwi cyane nka Jordan Ward, ni umuririmbyi, umwanditsi w\u2019indirimbo ndetse n\u2019umubyinnyi w\u2019umunyamerika. Yatangiye umwuga we nk\u2019umubyinnyi mbere yo kwinjira mu muziki. Yatangiriye umuziki mu mwaka wa 2017, maze mu 2023 asohora alubumu ye ya mbere ya studio yitwa \"Imbere\". Mu 2024, yatorewe igihembo cya NAACP Image Award mu cyiciro cy\u2019umuhanzi mushya w\u2019indashyikirwa mu bihembo bya 55 bya NAACP\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nJordan Ward yavutse ku ya 1 Gashyantare 1995 kandi yakuriye i St. Louis, muri Missouri. Kuva akiri muto, yerekanye ishyaka rikomeye ry'ubuhanzi, cyane cyane imbyino n'umuziki. \nUmwuga.\nUmwuga wo kubyina.\nYorodani yize kubyina, harimo ballet, jazz, na hip-hop, akiri ingimbi. Mbere yo kwishora mu muziki, Jordan Ward yigaragaje nk'umubyinnyi, imyitozo ndetse anakorana n\u2019amasosiyete atandukanye yo kubyina ndetse no mu bitaramo byinshi. Amaze kurangiza amashuri yisumbuye, yimukiye i Los Angeles, ari naho yakoraga nk'umubyinnyi winyuma, azenguruka abahanzi barimo Justin Bieber, Becky G, Janet Jackson, na Beyonc\u00e9. \nUmwuga wa muzika.\nWard yatangiye kwandika no gufata amashusho y'indirimbo ze mu Muri 2017, Jordan Ward yashyize ahagaragara umushinga we wa mbere, \"A Peak mu nama\". Nyuma yibi, yasohoye indirimbo nyinshi, harimo \"Mustard\" irimo 6LACK. \nMu Kwakira 2021, yasohoye EP yitwa \"Guma Gutuza.\" Muri Werurwe Ward yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye ya mbere, \"Imbere\", muri Interscope Records. Iyi yakozwe na Lido, igaragaramo ubufatanye na Joyce Wrice, Ryan Trey, Gwen Bunn, na Joony. Isohora, \"Imbere\" yashushanyije ku mbonerahamwe ya Billboard R&amp;amp;B yo muri Amerika mu cyumweru cyayo cya mbere. \"[\" [\"needed\"] \"Rolling Stone\" yashyize \"Imbere\" kurutonde rwayo rwa Album 100 Nziza zo mu \nMu gihembwe cya kane cya 2023, yazengurutse u Burayi bwose. Ward yatorewe igihembo cy\u2019ishusho cya NAACP kubera umuhanzi mushya w\u2019indashyikirwa mu bihembo bya 55 bya NAACP. Ward \u200b Muri Mata 2024, yasohoye indirimbo \"Umukinnyi wa kabiri\" mu majwi ya \"Ntubwire Mama Wapfuye Umwana.\" Ku ya \"\" 2025, Ward yasohoye indirimbo imwe 'JUICY' yakozwe na Michael Uzowuru na Teo Halm. \nMuburyo bwa muzika hamwe ningaruka.\nUmuziki wa Ward uhumekwa na funk, ubundi rock, na hip hop. \nImizenguruko.\nUmutwe\nGushyigikira"}
