{"id": "21308", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21308", "title": "Jackie Appiya", "text": "Jackie Appiah (yavutse kuwa 5 Ukuboza 1983) ni umunyegana wavukiye muri kanada, Umukinnyi wa filme wamamaye cyane mu ruganda rwa sinema muri Afrika. \nJackie yavukiye mu mujyi wa Toronto muri Kanada, aza kwimukira muri Gana akiri muto ariho yatangiriye umwuga we wo gukina filme. Uko imyaka yagiye itambuka Jackie yerekanye ubuhanga bumuhesha kuyobora role nyinshi ahawe yaba muri Nollywood cyangwa Gallywood, biramwubahisha yaba ku rwego rw'imbere mu gihugu ndetse no mu mahanga.\nIbikorwa bye birivugira kuko byamuhesheje ibihembo byinshi ndetse anahatanira byinshi, aho yegukanye igihembo cy'umukinnyi mwiza muri 2010 agikuye muri Africa Movie Academy Awards(AMAA) ndetse ahabwa n'icy'umukinnyi mwiza wunganira (Best Actress in a supporting role) muri africa Movie Academy Awards yo muri 2007 aza guhatana no muri 2008 icya \"Best Actress in a Leading Role\" n'icya \"Best Upcoming Actress\" muri AMAA nubwo byo atabyegukanye\".\" Ibi bishimangira izina rye ku ruhando rw'amazina akomeye muri sinema. Muri 2023 Glitz Africa yamuhaye igihembo cya Excellence in Creative Art Award mu ishimwe ngarukamwaka rigenerwa Abagore. Jackie ayobora filme, akazishoramo amafaranga, ni umunyamideli yerekana imideli ndetse afasha n'ababaye (humanitarian) \nIbijyanye n'umwuga.\nMu myaka 20 ishize, Jackie Appiah yagize igihe cyamuhiriye mu mwuga we wo gukina filme yaba muri Gana cyangwa muri Nijeriya. Mu mpera zo mu myaka ya 90 nibwo Jackie Appiah yinjiye mu mwuga wo gukina filme ahereye kuri filme zacaga kuri televiziyo na filme zirangira zo muri Gana.\nMuri 2003 nibwo yabaye nkugaragara bwa mbere kubera filme \"\" yo muri gana yakinnyemo ikaza kwamamara imuhesha kumenyekana muri sinema yo muri Afurika y'iburengerazuba. Nyuma y'uko iyo filme yerekanye ubuhanga bwe byatumye akina muri filme zitandukanye yaba muri Gana no muri Nijeriya, ahinduka umukinnyi mwiza w'umukobwa wagaragazaga ikizere mu karere. \nUsibye kuba umukinnyi wa filime, Appiah yagiye akora n'ibikorwa by'ubugiraneza, yifashishije izina rye ryamamaye, afasha mu burezi ndetse no mu buvuzi muri Gana. Ibyo bikorwa bimuhesha ibihembo byinshi n\u2019ishimwe kubera uruhare yagize mu nganda za firime ndetse n\u2019ibikorwa bye by\u2019ubutabazi.\nKwitabira ubutumire bwa Edward Seddoh Junior, Jackie Appiah byamubereye inyungu kuko yakinnye role ya Enyonam Blagogee muri filme Things We Do For Love yanditswe na Edward Seddoh Junior. Nyuma nibwo yaje gukina muri filme nka\"Tentacles\", \"Games People Play\", \"Sun-city\". n'izindi filme nyinshi z'uruhererekane.\nJackie ajya yibuka ko yarafite ubwoba ku nshuro ya mbere ubwo yajyaga gukina filme, yagize ati: \"ndabyibuka naringiye gukna muri filme Venus yaje kwitwa Divine Love, aho nakinnye nitwa Kate (), sinizeraga ko nabikora neza, naratitiraga ariko abantu benshi ntibabimenye\" Gusa byarangiye yemeje abantu bose batitaye ku bwoba yarafite.\nJackie avuga ko igice yakunze muri filme ari Mummy's Daughter cyo muri film Venus, inkuru y'iyo filme igaruka ku miryango, aho yayikinnyemo ari umukobwa w'igikomangomakazi. Jackie yatangaje ko yakunze uburyo yakinnye ndetse ko yanakunze cyane iyi role yakinaga Ubu Jackie yishimira aho uruganda rwa sinema rugeze rwiyubaka ndetse ko ari vuba cyane n'abandi bakabona iterambere ryawo ritangaje.\nJackie Appiah afatwa nk'umwe mu bakinnyi ba filme bari ku rugero rwiza kandi bakomeye, uruganda rwa sinema yaba iyo muri Gana cyangwa Nijeriya bafite mu myaka 20 ishize.\nKumenyekana muri Nollywood no Kwamamara.\nAppiah yari yaramaze kumenyekana muri Nollywood kubera filme nyinshi zo muri Gana yagaragayemo zamamaye nyinshi zatsindiye muri Gana harimo: \"Beyonc\u00e9 - The President's Daughter\", ', \"Passion of the Soul\", \"Pretty Queen\", \"The Prince's Bride\", \"The King is Mine,\" hamwe na '. Muri filme zakiniye muri Nollywood zamenyekanye cyane harimo: \"Black Soul\" na \"Bitter Blessing yakinanye\" n'umukinnyi wo muri Nollywood Ramsey Nouah ndetse na \"My Last Wedding ari kumwe n'umukinnyi wo muri\" Nollywood.\nMuri 2013 yatsindiye igihembo cy\u2019umukinnyi mpuzamahanga witwaye neza muri \"Papyrus Magazine\" Screen Actors Awards (PAMSAA) cyo muri 2013 cyabereye Abuja, muri Nijeriya.\nAkazi ko kwamamaza.\nIsura ya Jackie ushobora kuyibona ku byapa byinshi byamamaza no kuri televiziyo zo muri Gana harimo na advert ya GSMF yavugaga ibyo kwirinda virusi itera SIDA. \nJackie yegukanye kuba uhagarariye U.B mu kwamamaza ibikorwa byabo, Ubu akaba ahagarariye ibikorwa byo kwamamaza IPMC ndetse no ku byapa byabo byose. \"GSMF\" niko kazi ke ko kwamamaza ka mbere yakoze\nIbihembo.\nKuva yaba umukinnyi wa filme, Appiah yahataniye ibihembo byinshi ndetse anatsindira byinshi. yagiye atsindira igihembo cy'umukinnyi mwiza muri role z'ibanze nk'icya 2010 muri Africa Movie Academy Awards (AMAA). ndetse ahabwa n'ibindi by'umukinnyi mwiza wunganira nk'icyo yatsinze muri 2007 muri AAMA Muri 2008 aba nominated gusa ntiyatsinda \"Glitz Africa\" yaje kumuha igihembo cy'ishimwe muri 2023 yise the Excellence in Creative Art Award muri Ghana Women of the Year Honours 2023 "}
{"id": "21309", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21309", "title": "Jackie Appiah", "text": "Jackie Appiah (yavutse kuwa 5 Ukuboza 1983) ni umunyegana wavukiye muri kanada, Umukinnyi wa filme wamamaye cyane mu ruganda rwa sinema muri Afrika. \nJackie yavukiye mu mujyi wa Toronto muri Kanada, aza kwimukira muri Gana akiri muto ariho yatangiriye umwuga we wo gukina filme. Uko imyaka yagiye itambuka Jackie yerekanye ubuhanga bumuhesha kuyobora role nyinshi ahawe yaba muri Nollywood cyangwa Gallywood, biramwubahisha yaba ku rwego rw'imbere mu gihugu ndetse no mu mahanga.\nIbikorwa bye birivugira kuko byamuhesheje ibihembo byinshi ndetse anahatanira byinshi, aho yegukanye igihembo cy'umukinnyi mwiza muri 2010 agikuye muri Africa Movie Academy Awards(AMAA) ndetse ahabwa n'icy'umukinnyi mwiza wunganira (Best Actress in a supporting role) muri africa Movie Academy Awards yo muri 2007 aza guhatana no muri 2008 icya \"Best Actress in a Leading Role\" n'icya \"Best Upcoming Actress\" muri AMAA nubwo byo atabyegukanye\".\" Ibi bishimangira izina rye ku ruhando rw'amazina akomeye muri sinema. Muri 2023 Glitz Africa yamuhaye igihembo cya Excellence in Creative Art Award mu ishimwe ngarukamwaka rigenerwa Abagore. Jackie ayobora filme, akazishoramo amafaranga, ni umunyamideli, yerekana imideli ndetse afasha n'ababaye (humanitarian) \nAmateka.\nJackie yavutse kuwa 5 Ukuboza 1983 kuri se Bwana Kwabena Appiah mu avukira Toronto muri Kanada, Jackie niwe muhererezi mu bana batanu bavukana. Nyirarume yari umuyobzi ukomeye muri Gana. Ubuzima bwe bunini akiri muto yabaga muri Kanada agize imyaka 10 we na nyina bimukira muri Gana yamamaye cyane ku izina rye Appiah, Muri 2005 yashakanye na Peter Agyemang bakaba bafitanye umwana w'umuhungu."}
{"id": "21310", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21310", "title": "Ego Ella May", "text": "Ego Ella May (/ \u025bg-o\u028a \u02c8\u025bl.\u0259 me\u026a / eh - go eh - luh yavutse mumwaka wa 1992 ni umuririmbyi winjyana ya R na B, neo-soul hamwe na Jazzy ya contemporary. Ni umurirmbyi uturuka m'Ubwongereza, muri London yamajyepfo.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nElla May yavukiye mu gace ka Croydon. Izina rye ryahumetswe n\u2019umuco we wo muri Nijeriya ndetse no ku muririmbyikazi Ella Fitzgerald. Yatangiye kuririmba akiri muto, kandi afite imyaka 19 yigishije kwiyarangurira gucuranga gitari, gutunganya indirimbo no gukora umuziki we bwite.\nUmwuga.\n2014\u20132018.\nMuri 2014, Ella May yasohoye umuzingo windirimbo we wambere, \"Guhumeka Amazi\", AFROPUNK yagize ati: \"yampaye ubushagarira kuva mu ntangiriro kugeza ku iherezo\". \"Vice\" yamusobanuye ko nk'ijwi ry'ejo hazaza rya neo-roho\". \nMuri 2015, yasohoye umuzingo windirimbo, \"Zero\", aho SPIN yise \"guhuza imbaraga z'ubugingo, jazz na elegitoroniki\". \nMuri 2018, indirimbo ye \"Imbonerahamwe ya Umwe\", yaje kurutonde rwa \"New York Times\" rw'indirimbo nshya zizwi cyane. Yashyizwe mumajwi yigihembwe cya gatatu cyuburere \"bwimibonano mpuzabitsina\". \n2019\u20132021.\nMuri 2019, Ella May yasohoye, \"Icyayi &amp; Impuhwe\". \"Earmilk\" yise inzira \"ibirori biryoheye amatwi\". Indirimbo ye \"Abakobwa Ntibahora Baririmba Abahungu\" yasobanuwe nkitangaje \"na Onsmash\" "}
{"id": "21316", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21316", "title": "Ogi (umuririmbyi)", "text": "Ogi Ifediora, uzwi cyane nka Ogi, ni umuhanzi w\u2019Umunyamerika ufite inkomoko muri Nijeriya, uririmba injyana ya R&amp;B na blues. Yamamaye cyane ubwo yaririmbaga indirimbo \"AlJ\" ya PJ Morton, ndetse n\u2019indirimbo ye yo mu 2021 \"I Got It\", yakozwe n\u2019umuhanga mu gutunganya indirimbo wegukanye Grammy, No ID.\nAmateka bwite.\nOgi Ifediora yavutse mu 1997 hanze ya Chicago akurira i Madison, muri Wisconsin. Kuva akiri muto, yakundaga umuziki. Nyirakuru yakunze kuririmba indirimbo gakondo zo muri Nigeriya kumukangura. Yahoraga kandi mu nama zo gusengera mu muryango, zirimo n'indirimbo. Ibi byaranze intangiriro yinyungu za Ogi muburyo bukomeye kandi bugoye. Mu mashuri yisumbuye, yari umunyamuryango wa korari jazz usibye gucuranga inanga. Nyuma yize muri Northwestern University aho yize ibijyanye na siyanse ya politiki kandi yiga ibijyanye n\u2019amategeko. Igihe yari ahari, yari umwe mubagize itsinda rya cappella, SHAKA cappella. \nMu myaka ye mikuru, yakoze konte ya Instagram aho yashyize ibifuniko byindirimbo zitandukanye, harimo nindirimbo ya \"Alight\" ya PJ Morton. PJ Morton amaze gusubiramo igifuniko cye, yaje kuvugana na producer No ID., wafatanije nawe gukora indirimbo ye ya mbere, \"Nabonye\". \nMuri 2022, Ogi yasohoye Uumuzingo we wa mbere, \"Monologues\". Nkumuhanzi, yashyigikiye kandi afungura abahanzi nka Marias, Mahalia, Snoh Aalegra, na Paramore. [Mu 2022, Ogi yerekanye bwa mbere BET Awards yakinnye na \"Nabonye\", indirimbo ye ya mbere muri \"Monologues\" EP. \nUbuhanzi.\nUmuziki we wasobanuwe cyane nka R&amp;amp;B, hamwe na jazz na hip hop. Avuga kandi ko umuziki nyafurika wagize ingaruka ku njyana ye. "}
{"id": "21317", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21317", "title": "Omi (umuririmbyi)", "text": "Omar Samuel Pasley (wavutse ku ya 3 Nzeri 1986), uzwi ku izina ry\u2019ubuhanzi Omi (/\u02c8o\u028ami\u02d0/ OH-mee), ni umuririmbyi wo muri Jamayika. Yamenyekanye cyane muri 2012 kubera indirimbo ye \"Cheerleader\", verisiyo yasubiwemo ikamenyekana ku rwego rw\u2019isi. Ubu yasinyanye na Ultra Music, igice cya Sony Music, kandi yarekuye alubumu ye ya mbere, \"Me 4 U\", muri 2015.\nUmwuga.\nIntangiriro.\nOmar Samuel Pasley yavukiye muri paruwasi ya Clarendon. Yashingiwe i Kingston, nyuma yo kuvumburwa na Dancehall impresario Clifton Dillon (uzwi ku izina rya Specialist) maze asinyana na Oufah, ifatwa nkikirango cyigenga cya Jamayika. Indirimbo ye ya mbere yafashwe amajwi ni \"Guhagarara kuri Batatu\" yasohokanye n'amashusho yindirimbo. OMI yari yarahimbye indirimbo ye yambere yise \" Cheerleader \" mu mwaka wa 2008. Amaherezo yaje kuyandika no kuyikora no kuyisohora mu mwaka wa 2012. Yasohowe muri Jamayika hamwe na videwo y\u2019ingengo y\u2019imari iciriritse, yerekana amashusho menshi muri Oregon mu rugendo rwa mbere OMI yagiriye muri Amerika, iba icyamamare muri Jamayika ndetse inamenyekana muri Hawaii no muri Dubai. Ntabwo yigeze asohora alubumu, OMI yashoye indirimbo zakunzwe cyane muri Jamayika nka \"Fata Byoroshye\", \"Ibishashi byurufaya\" (iherekejwe n'amashusho y'indirimbo) na \"Ibara ry'iminwa yanjye\", iyanyuma irimo Busy Signal, imbyino izwi cyane yo muri Jamayika, ska, n'umuhanzi wa reggae.\n2014 - ubungubu: \"Me 4 U.\".\nMu mwaka wa 2014, \"Cheerleader\" yabonye ubuzima bwa kabiri ubwo Patrick Moxey, perezida wa Ultra Music, ikirango cy'imbyino igice kimwe na Sony Music yumvise iyi ndirimbo maze arayikunda maze ayisubiramo ayitangaza nkindirimbo ibyinitse. Mu ntangiriro za 2014, Ultra Music yashyizeho remix ebyiri z\u2019indirimbo, imwe ya Ricky Blaze indi ya Felix Jaehn, bikorwa n'umuhanzi utunganya indirimbo w\u2019imyaka 20 w\u2019umudage. Amaherezo, Ultra Music yahisemo inzu yo mu turere dushyuha ya \"Cheerleader\" nkuko byasubiwemo na Jaehn. Iyo yasubiwemo yabanje gukundwa cyane muri Suwede, amaherezo yemezwa inshuro 5 na platinum. Bidatinze, indirimbo yakwirakwijwe mu zindi mbonerahamwe z\u2019i Burayi, cyane cyane Ubufaransa, Ubutaliyani n'Ubudage. Yaje ku isonga mu bihugu byinshi by\u2019Uburayi no muri Ositaraliya. Mu Bwongereza, OMI yakoze amateka ku ya 24 Gicurasi 2015, ubwo \"Cheerleader\" yaje ku mwanya wa mbere mu Bwongereza ku rutonde rw\u2019abaseribateri mu cyumweru cya kane yikurikiranya, ibyo bikaba bibaye igihe kirekire gikurikiranye umuhanzi wo muri Jamayika wagize uwo mwanya ku mbonerahamwe. Muri Amerika, indirimbo yinjiye muri Billboard Hot 100 muri Gicurasi 2015; nyuma yaje gukora umwanya wambere wa Hot 100 nyuma yibyumweru 12 mubishushanyo mbonera. Binyuze mukwigarurira umwanya wa mbere, OMI yaje kumenyekana kwisi yose. Ku ya 27 Kanama 2015, yasohoye indirimbo \" Hula Hoop \". Yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye ya mbere ya studio \"Me 4 U\" ku ya 16 Ukwakira 2015. Iyi alubumu ikubiyemo indirimbo \" Cheerleader \", \" Hula Hoop \", \"Kangura\", na \"Tera mu nyanja\".\nUbucukumbuzi.\nIndirimbo yasohoye wenyine.\nNkumuhanzi uyobora.\nInyandiko\nIndirimbo \"Hula Hoop\" ntiyigeze yinjira kurutonde rwa Billboard Hot 100 ariko yaje kumwanya wa 16 kurutonde rwa Bubbing under Hot 100 chart "}
{"id": "21321", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21321", "title": "Alex Isley", "text": "Alexandra Isley (wavutse ku ya 16 Mata 1987) ni umuririmbyi n\u2019umwanditsi w\u2019indirimbo wo muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Yasohoye umuzingo muto we w'indirimbo wambere witwa The Love / Art Memoirs mu mwaka wa 2012. Yakoze indirimbo n'abahanzi batandukanye barimo Scarface, Terrace Martin, Masego, 9th Wonder, Rapsody, Tank and the Bangas, ndetse na Lucky Daye. Isley kandi yigeze gutoranywa mu bihembo bibiri bya Grammy Awards.\nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nMukuvuka kwa Alexandra Isley, ni umukobwa wa Ernie Isley wo mu itsinda ryimyororokere rya Isley Brothers. Isley yavukiye muri New Jersey, ariko igihe kinini cy'ubwana bwe yabaga i Los Angeles. Yise Stevie Wonder, Umuganwa, Ella Fitzgerald, Toni Braxton, Aaliyah, na Mariah Carey nk'abahanzi bibihe byose kuri we. Yakundaga kuririmba kuva mu bwana kandi umuryango we washyigikiraga gukurikirana umuziki nkumwuga wabigize umwuga. \nYatangiye imyitozo yo kugorora yijwi kera afite imyaka 12 nyuma arangiza amashuri yisumbuye y'ubugeni muri LA County. Isley yakuye impamyabumenyi ihanitse muri UCLA, aho yize mu ishami rya jazz. \nIsley afite synesthesia, yasobanuye iryo hurizo kuri \"LA Weekly\": \"Mu mutwe wanjye mfite ibitekerezo binyuranye, kandi ibintu byose bisa nkibishushanyije, cyangwa ni umurongo uhoraho w'amabara... Rimwe na rimwe nzatangira guhimba ikintu kandi ngomba guhindura urufunguzo kuko ayo mabara ntazanyorohera.\" \nUmwuga.\nIsley yasohoye bwa mbere umuzingo mugufi w'indirimbo yise \"The\" \"Love Art / Memoirs\" mu mwaka wa 2012 Okayplayer yasubiyemo uwo muzingo maze itanga igisubizo cyiza: \"Nyamuneka mwizere ijwi rya Alex mutagendeye kumusaruro we utuje ashoboye kubyara igisekuru cyabana bakunzwe cyane nka \"Hagati y'impapuro\" uko yabaye intangarugero\" \nIsley yavuze ko umuziki we ari r &amp; b hamwe na hip hop hamwe na jazz. Samantha Callender wa \"Essence\" yavuze ko ijwi rye ari \"amajwi yoroshye ya silike atwara injyana ya neo-roho.\" Yakoranye n'abahanzi nka 9th Wonder mundirimbo \"Ibicu by'imvura\"; Lucky Daye na Masego muri \"Nziza &amp; Byinshi (Yasubiwemo)\"; Chromonicci muri \"Interstellar\"; na Christian Kuria muri \"Toroka.\" \nUgushyingo 2019 yasohoye umuzingo mugufi w'indirimbo \"Wilton\" ihuriweho na Jack Dine utunganya umuziki. Muri 2020 Isley yakoze igitaramo cya serivise ntoya ya \"NPR\". Muri uwo mwaka kandi yari umuhanzi wamamaye cyane muri Cautious Clay mundirimbo \"Kugera\", kumajwi yigihembwe cya kane \"cy'umutekano muke\". \nMuri 2022 yasohoye \"Marigold,\" alubumu yakoranye na Jack Dine. Jackie B. wo muri Soul Bounce yasuzumye neza umushinga ati: \"Alex Isley na Jack Dine bakomeje kuba umuhuro mwiza wakozwe mu ijuru kuko batujyana mu ruziga ruva mu bimera rukamera kugeza kuri \"Marigold\".\" Yagaragaye ku ndirimbo ya Tank iheruka \"Nta mbibi\" muri alubumu ye ya 10 R&amp;amp;B Amafaranga.\nIsley yasohoye alubumu \"Nasize Umutima wanjye muri Ladera\" hamwe na Terace Martin mu Kwakira 2023. Iyi alubumu, yabaye iye yambere yagaragaye kumbonerahamwe ya Billboard, yagaragaye ku mwanya wa kabiri ku rutonde rwa Album ya Jazz ya Jazz ya Billboard no ku mwanya wa 22 kuri Album ya Jazz. \nYatsindiye ibihembo bibiri bya mbere bya Grammy Award nk'umuhanzi wagaragaye kuri \"Garuka ku Rukundo\" na Robert Glasper mu birori bya 66 bya Grammy Awards. Indirimbo yatowe nk'indirimbo nziza ya R&amp;B hamwe na R&amp;B nziza. \nMuri Gashyantare 2025, Isley yasinyiye ikigo cyita kwifunguro rya sasita ry/ubuntu gitangwa na Warner Records. \nUbuzima bwite.\nIsley aba i Los Angeles. Afite umukobwa numuririmbyi Kenyon Dixon (b. 2017). "}
{"id": "21322", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21322", "title": "Tony Kofi", "text": "Tony Kofi (wavutse kuya 10 Nyakanga 1966) ni umuririmbyi w'umwongereza munjyana ya Jazz sexaphonist n'umwirongi. Ayobora inyabutatu na quartet kandi ni umwe mu bashinze itsinda rya Monk Liberation Band. Ubutatu bwe burimo umukaraza Winston Clifford na Hammond B3 n'umuyobozi Anders Olinder. Kofi yasinye mu imitsinda ryihariye rya Jazz. Yatsindiye ibihembo bibiri bya BBC Jazz Awards: umucuranzi mwiza muri 2008 na Alubumu nziza muri 2005 muri Byose Birabizi. Tony yinjiye muri Orchestre Grand Union mu 1998, iyobowe n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019ubuhanzi Tony Haynes, kandi kuva icyo gihe yabaye umuhanzi ukomeye. Muri Gicurasi 2021, Kofi yagaragaye kuri Radiyo BBC 4 kugira ngo aganire ku mibereho ye ya mbere ndetse n\u2019ibintu byahinduye ubuzima byatumye afata sekisafone.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nKofi yavukiye i Nottingham ku babyeyi ba Gana. Nyina yari umukunzi wa jazz kandi yari afite inyandiko nyinshi.\nYavutse akoresha akaboko k'ibumoso ariko ahatirwa n'umuryango we gukoresha ukuboko kwe kw'iburyo.\nKofi yari afite inzozi zo kuba umucuranzi ariko bamubwira ko bidashoboka. Kubera ko yari umuhanga mububaji ku ishuri, ibyo bikaba byaramuteye inzira yo kuba umwuga w'ububaji.\nAfite imyaka 16, yakoraga nk'uwimenyereza umwuga mugihe agace gato kurubaho kamufashe kumwenda wukuboko akagwa hejuru yinzu. Yaguye avuga ko yiboneye icyerekezo gisobanutse cyubuzima bwe burambuye imbere ye, harimo ingendo, umuryango ndetse no gucuranga. Nyuma yo kugwa yari muri koma iminsi myinshi ariko mugihe cyakurikiyeho yaje gukira neza.\nKofi yakiriye amafaranga y'indishyi zo kugwa, maze amaylo 50 ayatakaza kuri sekisafone. Yabwiye ababyeyi be ko atazasubira ku kazi kandi ko azibanda cyane ku kwiyigisha gucuranga.\nUbwa mbere umuryango we ntiwabyemeye ariko yayikinaga buri munsi, nubwo bitotombeye urusaku rwa barumuna be batandatu. Amaze gutera imbere, ababyeyi be baza kumushyigikira kandi nyina amuha inyandiko zo kwigiraho.\nNyuma Kofi yize muri Berklee College of Music.\nUbucukumbuzi k'umuziki.\nInkomoko: "}
{"id": "21323", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21323", "title": "Davido", "text": "David Adedeji Adeleke (wavutse ku ya 21 Ugushyingo 1992), uzwi ku izina rya Davido, ni umuririmbyi wo muri Nijeriya-Amerika, umwanditsi w'indirimbo ndetse na producer. Davido yavukiye i Atlanta, muri Amerika, akurira i Lagos, muri Nijeriya. Yatangiye umuziki we nkumunyamuryango witsinda KB International. Davido yize imiyoborere yubucuruzi muri kaminuza ya Oakwood mbere yo kuva mu ishuri kugira ngo akubite kandi yandike amajwi. Yamenyekanye cyane nyuma yo gusohora \" Dami Duro \", indirimbo ya kabiri muri alubumu ye ya mbere ya studio \"Omo Baba Olowo\" (2012), aho yavuyemo izindi ndirimbo esheshatu - \"Back when\", \"Ekuro\", \"Overseas\", \"All of you\", \"Gbon Gbon\" na \"Feel alright\" - bafashwe. Muri 2012, Davido yatsindiye igihembo bikurikiraho muri The Headies Hagati ya 2013 na 2015, yasohoye indirimbo \" Gobe \", \"one of a kind\", \" Skelewu \", \" Aye \", \"Tchelete (Goodlife)\", \"Naughty\", \"Owo Ni Koko\", \"The Sound\" na \"The Money\".\nMuri Mutarama 2016, Davido yatangaje ku rubuga rwa Twitter ko yasinyanye amasezerano na Sony Music nyuma y'amezi make, ashinga inzu itunganya imiziki yitwa Davido Music Worldwide, aho abahanzi barimo Morravey na Logos Olori basinyemo amasezerano. Muri Nyakanga 2016, Davido yasinyanye amasezerano na RCA Records ya Sony maze mu Kwakira muri uwo mwaka, asohora indirimbo eshanu Yaguwe (EP) \"son of Mercy\", yari ishyigikiwe n\u2019indirimbo \"Gbagbe Oshi\", \"How long\" na \"Coolest Kid in Africa \". Muri Mata 2017, Davido yongeye kugirana amasezerano na Sony kubera ibibazo byo kugenzura ibihangano hanyuma nyuma yuwo mwaka, asohora indirimbo eshanu zirimo \"IF\" na \" Fall \". \"\u200b\" Mu Gushyingo 2019, Davido yasohoye alubumu(umuzingo) ye ya kabiri ya studio \"A Good Time\", yatewe inkunga n\u2019indirimbo zasohotse mbere \"IF\", \"Fall\", \"Assurance\", \"Blow My Mind\" na \"Risky\".\nMuri 2019, ikinyamakuru \"New African\" cyashyize ahagaragara Davido nk'umwe mu Banyafurika 100 bakomeye. Album ye ya studio, \"Igihe cyiza\", yasohotse ku ya 13 Ugushyingo 2020. Muri Gashyantare 2021, Davido yagaragaye ku rutonde rukurikira rwa Time 100. Yasohoye \"Timeless\", alubumu ye ya kane ya studio, ku ya 31 Werurwe 2023. Davido ni ambasaderi w\u2019umuco muri Nijeriya nijwi rikomeye ry\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu muri Afurika. Ni umwe kandi mu bahanzi bakunzwe cyane muri Afurika kuri Instagram na Twitter. \nUbuto n'amashuri.\nDavid Adedeji Adeleke yavutse ku ya 21 Ugushyingo 1992, avukira i Atlanta, Jeworujiya, Amerika. Adeleke (wavutse 1957) ni igihangange mu bucuruzi ukomoka muri Nijeriya, naho nyina Vero Adeleke (1963\u20132003) yari umwarimu wa kaminuza. Davido ni umuhererezi muri barumuna batanu n'umuhungu wa gatatu wa se. Yize mu ishuri mpuzamahanga ry\u2019Abongereza i Lagos, maze afite imyaka 16, asubira muri Amerika kwiga ibijyanye n\u2019ubucuruzi muri kaminuza ya Oakwood. \nIgihe yari i Oakwood, Davido yaguze ibikoresho bya muzika atangira gukora. Yakoze kandi umuziki KB International hamwe na babyara be B-Red na Sina Rambo. Davido yavuye muri kaminuza ya Oakwood gukurikirana umuziki igihe cyose yimukira i Londres, ari naho yakoraga mu majwi ye. Nyuma yo gusubira muri Nijeriya mu 2011, Davido yahagaritse umwuga we wa muzika maze yemera ko yubaha se yiyandikisha muri kaminuza ya Babcock, ari naho yarangije muri Nyakanga 2015, afite impamyabumenyi y\u2019umuziki nyuma yuko se yishyuye kaminuza kugira ngo atangire ishami ry\u2019umuziki mu ishuri ryatangije umunyeshuri umwe. \nUmwuga.\nIntangiriro Y'umwuga.\nMuri 2011, Davido yatangiye gukora kuri alubumu ye ya mbere ya studio \"Omo Baba Olowo\", ikaba ivanze na Afrobeats na hip hop. Davido yakoranye na Jay Sleek, Maleek Berry, GospelOnDeBeatz, Spellz, Dokta Frabz, Bwana Chidoo, Theory Soundz na Shizzi gukora alubumu. \"Omo Baba Olowo\" agaragaramo abashyitsi kuva Naeto C, Sina Rambo, B-Umutuku, Kayswitch, Ice Prince na 2 Face Idibia. Muri rusange yakiriwe nabi nabanenga umuziki, berekanaga ibiyikubiyemo ndetse n\u2019indirimbo za Davido. Iyi alubumu yatsindiye Album nziza ya R &amp; B / Pop kandi yahawe igihembo cya Album yumwaka muri The Headies 2013, ndetse na Album nziza yumwaka muri Nigeriya Imyidagaduro 2013. \nIndirimbo \"Yagarutse Iyo\" ya Naeto C yasohotse nk'indirimbo ya mbere ya alubumu ku ya 7 Gicurasi 2011. Yakorewe i Londres na Davido kandi yakiraga kenshi mu kirere. 9 Gicurasi 2011 2 Indirimbo yamenyekanye nyuma y'amezi atatu yohereje kuri bamwe mu nshuti ze. Amashusho y'indirimbo aherekejwe na \"Dami Duro\" yashyizwe ahagaragara ku Mutarama 2012, ubwo imyigaragambyo yigarurira Nigeriya. \nIndirimbo ya gatatu ya Album \"Ekuro\" yasohotse ku ya 25 Mutarama 2012. Amashusho y\u2019indirimbo yafashwe amajwi kandi ayobowe na Miami na Antwan Smith. Umuhanzi wo muri Nigeriya Aramide yasohoye igifuniko cyindirimbo. Indirimbo ya kane ya Album \"Hanze\" yasohotse ku ya 6 Gicurasi verisiyo itarangiye yindirimbo yasohotse mbere yuko isohoka kumugaragaro. Davido yavuze ko yafashe indirimbo hamwe na GospelOnDeBeatz 'bahuriye mu isoko. \n2013\u20132016: Isohora risanzwe, \"Baddest\" na \"Son of Mercy\".\nKu ya 25 Gashyantare 2013, Davido yasohoye inzira yakozwe na Shizzi \" Gobe \". umwanya wa kabiri ku rutonde rwa \"Premium Times\" ' 10 za mbere za 2013 \".\" Godfather Productions yafashe amashusho y'indirimbo muri Afrika yepfo. Davido yatangaje ku rubuga rwa Twitter \"one of kind\" izasohoka ku ya 13 Gicurasi 2013. Shizzl nawe yakoze iyi ndirimbo. Tebza wa Godfather Productions yafashe amajwi anayobora amashusho yindirimbo muri Afrika yepfo ; yerekana Afurika yunze ubumwe ikungahaye ku muco n'umuziki. \n\" Skelewu \" yasohotse ku ya 13 Kanama 2013. Yashyizwe ku mwanya wa gatanu ku rutonde rwa \"Premium Times\" ' rutonde rw\u2019indirimbo 10 za mbere za irekurwa ryaherekejwe no gutangaza amarushanwa yo kubyina \"Skelewu\". \"Skelewu\" yashyigikiwe n'amashusho abiri y'indirimbo; iyambere yayobowe na Sesan isohoka ku ya 15 Ukwakira 2013. Yashyizwe kuri YouTube ikoresheje konte ya parody. Nyuma gato yo gusohora amashusho, Davido yavuze ko hari umuntu wamuhemukiye ayirekura kandi ko azakora indi videwo hamwe na Moe Musa, umuyobozi w\u2019amashusho y\u2019indirimbo mu Bwongereza. Sesan yanenze Davido n'ubuyobozi bwe kuba barasohoye amagambo atari yo. Moa Musa yafashe amajwi anayobora amashusho yindirimbo yemewe ya \"Skelewu\" i Londres, kandi yasohotse mu Kwakira 2013. \nKu ya 1 Gashyantare 2014, Davido yasohoye \" Aye \", yakozwe na T-Spize. indirimbo yayobowe na Clarence Peters asohoka ku ya 7 Gashyantare 2014. Indirimbo ya Davido yakoranye na Mafikizolo wo muri Afurika yepfo, yiswe \"Tchelete (Goodlife)\", yasohotse ku ya 30 Mata 2014. na Oskido na Shizzi, ikwirakwizwa na MTN ya Play na Callertunez. na Mafikizolo mu birori byabereye muri MTN Nigeriya ya Elite Night mu Kuboza 2013. Oskido na Uhuru bagaragaye muri videwo. \nMuri Kamena 2014, Davido yakoranye na Mi Casa, Lola Rae, Sarkodie, Diamond Platnumz na Tiwa Savage mu ndirimbo \"Africa Rising\", indirimbo yakoreshejwe mu gikorwa cy'uruganda rwa DStv cyo guteza imbere ibikorwa by'ishoramari mu rwego rw'imibereho myiza. Video y'indirimbo yafashwe amajwi kandi yayobowe n'inzu yo gutunganya indirimbo yo muri Afurika y'Epfo Callback Dreams. Aba bahanzi baririmbye iyi ndirimbo mu birori byo gutangiza Africa Rising muri Mauritius. Muri Kamena 2015, Davido yashyize hanze indirimbo ya \"Fans Mi\" yafashije Meek Mill. Mbere yo kurekurwa, yashutse abafana akoresheje amajwi n'amafoto y'inyuma y'ibisonga bya videwo. \nAlbum ya Davido The Baddest yari iteganyijwe gusohoka muri Kamena 2015 ariko gusohoka kwayo byasubitswe ku itariki ya 10 Ukwakira uwo mwaka. Hashize iminsi ibiri mbere y'uwo munsi, gusohoka byongeye gutangwa kuko ikigo kitamenyekanye cyatanze igitekerezo cyo kugitanga. Davido yari yarashyize hanze Igishushanyo cy'indirimbo ya album no ku rutonde rw'indirimbo mu ntangiriro z'uwo mwaka. The Baddest yari ifite gahunda yo gutunganya ibijyanye na Shizzi, Del B, Spellz, J Fem, Don Jazzy, Puffy Tee, Uhuru, Kiddominant na Young John. Nanone byari kuzitabirwa n'abahanzi nka P-Square, Don Jazzy, Runtown, Uhuru, DJ Buckz, Akon, Meek Mill, Wale na Trey Songz. Muri Mutarama 2016, Davido yatangaje kuri Twitter ko yasinye amasezerano ya disiki na Sony Music; itangazo rye rivugwaho n'abantu batandukanye. Iki kigo cy'ubuhanzi cyashyize ahagaragara itangazo ry'itangazamakuru ryo kwemeza amasezerano. amasezerano Davido yagiranye na Sony yasabye ko asohora albums ebyiri, kandi amwemerera gukomeza uburenganzira ku muziki no kuririmba mu bitaramo. \nAmezi make nyuma yo gusinyana na Sony, Davido yashinze label yanditseho Davido Music Worldwide (DMW). Dremo, Mayorkun, Yonda na Peruzzi kuri ubu basinywe muri label. Muri Nyakanga 2016, Davido yasinyanye amasezerano na RCA Records. Amasezerano yanditse na yahinduye gahunda yo ' \"Baddest\". Nk\u2019uko ibivuga, amasezerano Davido yagiranye na Sony yasabye ko alubumu yitabirwa n\u2019amahanga kugira ngo yemererwe ku isi hose. Mu Kwakira 2016, yasohoye inzira eshanu EP \"Umuhungu w\u2019Impuhwe\", washyigikiwe n\u2019indirimbo \"Gbagbe Oshi\", \"Igihe kingana iki\", \"Coolest Kid in Africa\"; kandi ikubiyemo abashyitsi bagaragara na, na \n2017\u20132018: \"If\", \"Fall\", \"Fia\" and \"Assurance\".\nDavido yatsindiye ibihembo byiza bya Afrika muri MOBO Awards 2017. Ku ya 17 Gashyantare 2017, yasohoye \"Niba\", yakozwe na Tekno, wanditse umuzimu wanditse inzira ya Davido. Amashusho yindirimbo \"Niba\" amaze gukwirakwizwa inshuro zirenga miliyoni 172 kuri YouTube, bituma abona umwanya muri videwo ye yitwaye neza. yari diyama yemejwe n\u2019inganda zandika amajwi muri Afurika yepfo (RISA), yerekana kohereza ibicuruzwa 200.000. \"Niba\" yatsindiye Indirimbo nziza ya Pop Indirimbo nziza yumwaka muri Headies 2018. Asubiramo OkayAfrica, Sabo Kpade yavuze ko iyi ndirimbo ari \"gutwika buhoro\" hamwe n \"\" urusaku rudasanzwe rwumvikana neza kandi rudafite ibikoresho \". Amashusho y'indirimbo \"Niba\" yafatiwe i yayobowe na Director Q ikorwa na Tunde Babalola. Davido yifatanije nuwashushanyaga imyenda yumugabo Orange Umuco wo gusohora icyegeranyo cya capsule cyahumetswe na \"Niba\". \nDavido Yasohoye indirimbo \"Fall\",ikubiyemo igice cy'indirimbo Kojo Funds's track \"Dun Talking\", muri Kamena 2, 2017. RISA yemeje \"Fall\" platinum;\nIyo ndirimbo yari imwe mu ndirimbo 100 zakunzwe cyane gushakishwa kuri muri Amerika muri Mutarama 2019, kandi yari mu ndirimbo 10 zakunzwe cyane kuri Shazam muri New York muri Gashyantare 2019,Yabaye indirimbo ya pop y\u2019Abanyanigeria imaze igihe kirekire ku rutonde rwa \"\" mu mateka. \"Fall\" yashyizwe ku mwanya 163 ku rutonde rwa Pitchfork rw'indirmbo 200 nziza za mbere mu za 2010s kugeza 2019. Umuyobozi w\u2019amashusho wavukiye muri Nigeria akaba Umunyaburayi, Daps, ni we wayoboye gufata video y\u2019indirimbo ya \"Fall\", mu Ugushyingo 2023 yari imaze kurebwa inshuro zisaga miliyoni 274, ikaba ari video imaze kurebwa cyane cyane n\u2019umuhanzi w\u2019Umunya-Nigeria kuri YouTube.\nKu ya 10 Ugushyingo 2017, Davido yasohoye \"Fia\" yakozwe na Fresh VDM kandi isobanurwa nk'inzira nziza. Ku murongo wa kabiri, Davido avuga ku ifatwa rye n\u2019uruhare rwa Caroline Danjuma mu gukurura ibihuha yagize uruhare mu rupfu rwa Tagbo Umenike. Umwanditsi w'ikinyamakuru Native Magazine yashimye uburyo Davido yanditse indirimbo avuga ko \"Fia\" \"abasha kwerekana zimwe mu ntambara aherutse kugirira ku giti cye, atiriwe yifuza mu buryo burambuye\". Asubiramo umuziki muri Afurika, Kayode Faniyi yavuze ko \"Fia\" itanga \"amakimbirane abaho\" kandi ko \"nta gushidikanya ko ari indirimbo y\u2019umwuga wa Davido - nibura kugeza igihe azirenza\". Daniel Orubo wo mu miyoboro ya Konbini yavuze ko \"Fia\" ari inzira \"ihuza\" ikoresha \"ijwi ryijimye\" rya Davido. \" yatorewe kuba Indirimbo nziza ya Pop Indirimbo nziza yumwaka muri Headies 2018. Stefflon Don yatewe inkunga na \"Fia \" yasohotse ku ya 30 Werurwe 2018. Davido yatsindiye igihembo cyiza cya Afurika kandi yari umwe mu bahawe ibihembo byiza ku isi hose muri MTV Europe Music Awards 2017. Davido yasohoye \"Icyizere\" ku ya 30 Mata 2018; yeguriye inzira umukunzi we arayirekura kugira ngo ahure n\u2019imyaka 23 amaze avutse. Asubiramo ikinyamakuru \"kavukire\", Toye Sokunbi yavuze ko indirimbo \"ivuga byinshi ku kamaro ko gusobanuka mu gihe cya emojis, kwemezwa n'abo dukunda no gushyira urukundo imbere, mu buryo butandukanye\". Davido yatsindiye amategeko mpuzamahanga meza muri BET Awards 2018, abaye umuhanzi wa mbere nyafurika wabonye igihembo cye kuri stage nkuru. Mu ijambo rye ryakiriye, yasabye abakunzi n\u2019abahanzi bo muri Amerika gusura Afurika no kurya ibiryo. \nMuri Kanama na Nzeri 2018, Davido yaririmbye mu nzu ya Blues i Boston mu rwego rwa \"The Locked Up Tour\", yatangiye muri Kanama ikazarangira muri Nzeri., nyuma y'uru ruzinduko, yakinnye hamwe na Meek Mill, Post Malone na Fat Joe mu iserukiramuco rya Made in America. \n2019: Igitaramo cya O2 Arena, \"Blow My Mind\", \"Risky\", Good time.\nMuri Mutarama 2019, Davido yagurishije The O2 Arena i Londres, abaye umuhanzi wa mbere w\u2019umunyafurika wabikoze nyuma ya Wizkid mu mwaka wa 2018. Kwandikira \"The Guardian\" Caroline Sullivan yahaye igitaramo inyenyeri enye kuri eshanu, yita Davido \"alfa\" ati; \"imyifatire ye myinshi iterwa n'abaraperi b'Abanyamerika bakoranye, barimo Young Thug na Swae Lee\". \nInzira ya Chris Brown yafashijwe \" Blow My Mind \" yasohotse ku ya 26 Nyakanga 2019. Yakozwe na Shizzi kandi mu ntangiriro yari igamije gusohoka nk'indirimbo ya mbere ya alubumu. Amashusho yindirimbo yindirimbo yakusanyije miliyoni imwe mumasaha arenga \"Fever\" ya Wizkid na \" Ngwino wegere \" ahinduka amashusho yindirimbo yo muri Nigeriya kugirango agere kuri iki gikorwa vuba. Yabaye kandi amashusho yindirimbo yo kugirango ibone ibitekerezo byinshi mumasaha 24 yambere isohotse. \"Risky\" yasohotse ku ya 23 Ukwakira Amashusho y'indirimbo \"Risky\" yayobowe Alabi kandi yunamiye serivise ya televiziyo ya \"Top Boy\". Muri, umunyarwandakazi wo mu bakozi ba Davido na Popcaan abamenyesha abapolisi. \nAlbum ya kabiri ya Davido A Good Time yasohotse ku wa 22 Ugushyingo 2019; ikubiyemo indirimbo z'indirimbo \"If\", \"Fall\", \"Assurance\", \"Blow My Mind\" na \"Risky\". Davido yafashe amashusho ya A Good Time i Atlanta; yabwiye ikinyamakuru Vibe ko yifuzaga gufata amashusho muburyo bushya. Davido yavuze ko album ari igitabo cyakozwe n'abantu bose, avuga ko igizwe ahanini n'abakinnyi b'ikipe ya Afrobeats ariko ko igizwe n'ibindi bintu byo mu zindi njyana. Davido yatangaje izina ry'iyi album mu birori byabereye i Lagos muri Nzeri 2019 avuga ko izasohoka mu kwezi gukurikiraho. Nanone yashyize hanze inyandiko z'indirimbo enye zo muri album mu gihe cy'iki gitaramo. Muri Nyakanga 2020, A Good Time yarenze miliyari 1 y'indirimbo zafashwe amajwi ku mbuga zitandukanye za digitale. \n2020\u20132022: \"A Better Time\" and social media fundraising.\nMuri Gicurasi 2020, Davido yagaragaye ari kumwe na Bwana Eazi na Tiwa Savage mu nkuru y\u2019ikinyamakuru \"Billboard\" yise \"Africa Now\". Ikiganiro cyakozwe hifashishijwe guhamagarwa kuri videwo ; abahanzi bakemuye ingingo nyinshi, zirimo ubuzima buri muri karantine na afrobeats nkicyiciro. \nKuri Twitter, Davido yatangaje gahunda yo kumurika alubumu ye ya gatatu ya studio \"A Igihe Cyiza\". Yavuze ko yafashe amajwi 11 kuri iyi alubumu anatangaza ko iyi nyandiko izagaragaramo \" Tiwa Savage \" kandi ko we n'abantu bose bakoraga kuri iyi alubumu bateranije inzira mu minsi 14. Muri, Davido yagaragaye kuri \"Tonight Show yakinnye na Jimmy Fallon\" kugira ngo akore agace k'indirimbo ze \"D&amp;G\" na \"Kugwa\" kuri alubumu \"Igihe Cyiza\". Ku Kanama 2020, Inzu Ndangamurage ya Grammy yatangaje ko Davido ari umushyitsi wihariye mu kiganiro cyayo cyo ku wa mbere. Yitabiriye ibirori ndangamurage bya Instagram Live, byabaye nyuma yiminsi itatu. Ku ya 10 Nzeri 2020, yasohoye indirimbo yakozwe na Dammy Twitch yise \"FEM\", hamwe n'amashusho yayo. \n\"Igihe cyiza\" cyasohotse ku ya 13 Ugushyingo 2020. Harimo abashyitsi bagaragaye muri Lil Baby, Nicki Minaj, Nas, Chris Brown, na Young Thug, n'abandi. Davido yafashe alubumu nyuma yo guhagarika urugendo rwe muri Amerika y'Amajyaruguru 2019 biturutse ku cyorezo cya COVID-19 gikomeje. Ku ya 17 Ugushyingo 2021, Davido yasabye bagenzi be ndetse n\u2019abafana kumwoherereza miliyoni imwe naira, maze avuga ko abatamutumyeho amafaranga batagomba kongera kwiteranya na we. Yakusanyije miliyoni 200 naira yongeraho miliyoni 50 naira y'amafaranga ye, yose ayatanga mu mazu y'imfubyi muri Nijeriya. \nMuri Werurwe 2022, Davido yagaragaye ku ndirimbo \" Hayya Hayya (Better together) \" ari kumwe n'umuririmbyi w'umunyamerika Trinidad Cardona n'umuririmbyi wa Qatari Aisha. Indirimbo yagaragaye bwa mbere kuri alubumu yakusanyije \"FIFA Igikombe cyisi Qatar 2022 Amashusho yemewe\" (2022). Muri, Davido yasohoye indirimbo yakozwe na Pheelz \" Hagarara ukomeye \", iyi ikaba ari yo ya mbere yasohoye wenyine muri uyu mwaka kandi ikubiyemo amajwi ya Korali yo ku cyumweru. Muri, Davido yatangaje iserukiramuco rye rya mbere ngarukamwaka ryitwa Are We African Yet (AWAY), ryabereye ahitwa Farm Farm Arena i Atlanta, Jeworujiya, ku ya 18 Ugushyingo 2022, rikaba ryarimo n'ibitaramo byakozwe na Kizz Daniel, Pheelz, Lojay na BNXN. \n2023 - ubungubu: \"Timiless\", Nine + Records, na \"5ive\".\nMuri Kamena 2022, Davido yabwiye ikinyamakuru \"Rolling Stone\" (Umuzingo)alubumu ye ya kane ya studio \"Igihe\" kitarangiye. 21 Werurwe 2023, yatangaje kuri Instagram iyi alubumu izasohoka ku ya 31 Werurwe. \"Igihe\" cyabaye alubumu ya mbere ya Davido mumyaka itatu. Yatangarije CNN umutwe wa alubumu, uwatunganije amajwi Don Jazzy yamusabye, ni ikigaragaza intego ye kugira ngo iyi alubumu yibukwe mu myaka ibarirwa muri za mirongo. Yatangarije kandi umuyoboro wamakuru alubumu yanyuze mu byiciro bitatu mbere yanyuma yayo. Album ya 17-track ikubiyemo ubufatanye na Skepta, Angelique Kidjo, Asake, Focalistic, Cavemen nabandi. wakozwe na Magicsticks, Rage, Darmie, Blaisebeatz, 1da Banton, Caltonic SA, Young Alpha n'abandi. Ahanini inyandiko ya amapiano, \"Igihe kitarambiranye\" cyerekana imiziki nka Dancehall, ragga, konto, highlife na Afropop. Ubuhanzi bwa Umuzingo(alubumu) yerekana igishusho cy'umutwe wa Davido, inzovu ebyiri zifunze, n'inzira iganisha ku masaha manini. Indirimbo ya kabiri yo muri ku umuzingo we \" ishushanya mu Bwongereza, Ubusuwisi, Ubuholandi na Suriname, aho yageze ku mwanya wa mbere. \nDavido yakiriye ibihembo bitatu mu birori bya 66 ngarukamwaka bya Grammy Awards, harimo umuzingo wa mwiza w'indirimbo wa mbere kwisi na Icyiciro cy\u2019indirimbo cyangwa imbyino nyafurika zihiga izindi muri \"Unavailable\". Mu 2023, Chris Brown yerekanye Davido na Lojay ku ndirimbo ye yise \" Sensational \", yasohotse nk'indirimbo ya kabiri muri alubumu ye ya cumi na rimwe muri studio \"11:11\". Iyi ndirimbo yerekanwe ku mwanya wa 96 kuri \"Billboard Hot 100\" yo muri Amerika, ikora nka Davido na Lojay ku nshuro ya mbere ku mbonerahamwe. Muri Mutarama 2024, Davido yashyizwe ku rutonde inshuro eshatu muri 55 ya NAACP Image Awards. Muri Mata 2024, Davido yashinze isosiyete ye yandika, Nine + Records, ku bufatanye na UnitedMasters. Mu, yabwiye ikinyamakuru \"Rolling Stone\" ko alubumu ye ya gatanu ya studio, \"5ive\", izashyirwa ahagaragara muri Werurwe 2025. Yatangaje kandi ko \"Funds\" igaragaramo umuraperi Odumodublvck n'umuririmbyi Chike, nk'indirimbo ya kabiri ya alubumu. Indirimbo ntangarugero ya Brenda Fassie yo mu 1997 \"Vuli Ndlela\". \nUbuhanzi.\nDavido avuga ko ishyaka rye ry'umuziki abikesha nyina, maze akura yumva abaraperi Ja Rule na 50 Cent. Nk\u2019uko \"kibitangaza\" ngo ubuhanzi bwe bugaragaza itandukaniro riri hagati ya Afrobeats, hip hop na R&amp;amp;B. Mu kiganiro na \"Num\u00e9ro\", Davido yavuze ko yari umwe mu bagize itsinda rya hip-hop mbere yo kwerekeza muri R&amp;B hanyuma Afrobeats. Nk\u2019uko umwanditsi Jon Pareles wanditse \"ikinyamakuru New York Times\" abitangaza ngo umuziki wa Davido wibanze ku ngingo zishimishije nko gukundana, kwifuza, no gutekereza neza. N'ubwo yanenzwe kuba afite \"ijwi ryijimye kandi ryijimye\", Emmanuel Daraloye yashimye imikorere ya Davido mu majwi kuri udakendera. By'umwihariko, Daraloye yamuhaye inguzanyo yo kujya \"ku birenge\" hamwe na Fave kuri \"Kante\" no gutanga \"igitabo cyo hasi cyashyizwe hasi\" ku ndirimbo \"Ku Muhanda\". \nIndi mishinga.\nKu ya 6 Mata 2012, \"Imyidagaduro yo muri Nijeriya Uyu munsi\" yatangaje ko Davido yasinyanye na MTN miliyoni 30 zama pound. Muri ayo masezerano, Davido yabaye isura ya MTN Pulse, ubukangurambaga bugamije kwamamaza urubyiruko rwo muri Nijeriya. Ku Ukwakira 2013, \"Pulse Nigeria\" yatangaje ko Guinness Nigeria yasinyanye na Davido amasezerano yo kwemeza. Mu rwego rw\u2019amasezerano, yakoreye igitaramo muri Guinness World of More Concert ari kumwe n\u2019abahanzi barimo P-Square, D'banj, Wizkid, Ice Prince, Burna Boy, Olamide, Phyno, Chidinma, Waje na Tiwa Savage. \nMuri Gicurasi 2018, Davido yasinyanye amasezerano yo kwamamariza Infinix Mobile, uruganda rukora telefoni rukorera muri Hong Kong. Muri, yabaye ambasaderi w\u2019ikirango ku isoko rya 1xBet. Mu Kwakira 2021, ambasaderi w'ikirango cya cognac Martell cyatangaje ko ari ambasaderi mushya. Mu, Davido yasinyanye amasezerano n\u2019uruganda rukora inkweto Puma maze aba ambasaderi w\u2019ibirango ku isi. \nUbuzima bwite.\nDavido yabyaye abana batandatu; abakobwa batatu n'abahungu batatu (umwe muri bo yapfuye). \nKu ya 31 Ukwakira 2022, ikinyamakuru \"Peoples Gazette\" cyatangaje urupfu rw'umuhungu mukuru wa Davido n'umwana wa gatatu David Ifeanyi Adeleke Jr., warohamye muri pisine yo koga mu rugo rwa se I Banana ; yari afite imyaka itatu igihe yapfaga. Polisi yakoze iperereza ku bakozi bo mu rugo rwa Davido. Abakozi umunani bo mu rugo batumiwe kuri sitasiyo ya polisi kugira ngo babazwe nyuma yuko umwe yari amaze kumenyesha polisi impanuka yo kurohama. Nyuma y\u2019iperereza ry\u2019abapolisi, abakozi batandatu bararekuwe abandi babiri bakomeza gufungwa. \nMuri Werurwe 2023, Davido yemeje ko yashakanye n'umugore we bamaranye igihe kirekire, Chioma Rowland. Ku ya 25 Kamena 2024, yakoresheje ibirori by'ubukwe ahitwa Harbour Point mu kirwa cya Victoria, i Lagos. Ibirori byitabiriwe nabantu benshi bakomeye, barimo Olusegun Obasanjo na Babajide Sanwo-Olu. Davido yanditswe na Deangelictouchstylist, Lucky Enemuo, na Ugo Monye. \nMuri Gicurasi 2023, Davido yagizwe Umuyobozi ushinzwe Iteka rya Nijeri (OON "}
{"id": "21324", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21324", "title": "Mick Jenkins", "text": "Jayson Andrew \"Mick\" Jenkins (yavutse ku wa 16 Mata 1991) ni umuraperi wo muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika uba i Chicago, kandi ukorera munsi y\u2019inzu itunganya umuziki ya Cinematic. Yamenyekanye cyane binyuze mu mushinga we \"Water\" wasohotse muri 2014, hakurikiraho umuzingo mugufi w'indirimbo \"Waves\" muri 2015.\nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nJenkins yavukiye i Huntsville, muri Alabama. Nyuma yo gutandukana n'ababyeyi be, yimukiye i Chicago, muri Illinois ari kumwe na nyina na mushiki we afite imyaka icyenda. Nkumwana, Jenkins yayobowe cyane nababyeyi be bakunda umuziki. Nyina yumvaga Neo-soul, mugihe se yakundaga umuziki w'Imana wo muri iki gihe. Igihe Jenkins yari afite imyaka 17 gusa, yatangiye kujya afungura indangururamajwi muri Young Chicago Authors, ihuza abanditsi bato. Mick Jenkins yize muri Hirsch Metropolitan High, aho yatangiye kwitabira ibigeragezo by'agashinyaguro ku ishuri ryigisha amategeko muri iryo shuri mu 2008. Amahirwe aboneye, yaje kuba umunyeshuri wimenyereza umwuga mu rukiko rw'inyubako nkuru ya Dirksen i Chicago. Jenkins yarangije amasomo ye mu by'amategeko mu mwaka wa 2009, ubwo yabaga uwimenyereza umwuga muri Sir &amp; Madame, iduka ry'imyenda, maze muri make aba umuntu wifuza kwerekana imideli. Nyuma muri 2009, yasubiye i Huntsville kwiga muri kaminuza ya Oakwood, nyuma afungwa iminsi 34 ashinjwa amakosa. Oakwood ni ishuri ryigenga ryifatanije n\u2019itorero ry\u2019Abadiventisti bo ku munsi wa karindwi. Mu mwaka wa kabiri wa Jenkins ku ishuri, yinjiye mu marushanwa ya rap, aho igihembo cyari Udukoresho tw\u2019amatwi tw'umuziki twa Beats By Dre. Jenkins ntabwo yatsinze iri rushanwa, ariko avuga ko byamuteye kuvumbura ishyaka ryo gukora umuziki. Jenkins yaje kuva muri Oakwood nyuma yuko se abuze akazi ku ishuri, bivuze ko amashuri ataragikomeje. Jenkins avuga ko yasohoye imvange zindirimbo eshanu akiri muri kaminuza, nubwo nyuma yaje kuzirengagiza akazikura kuri interineti. \"Mickstape\" hamwe na \"Gukurikirana Ibyishimo: Inkuru ya MickalasCage\", zo ziracyaboneka. Mu mwaka wa 2012, Jenkins yemeye icyaha aregwa cyo gutunga urumogi. Yaje gufungwa iminsi 34 muri Alabama, mbere yo gusubira i Chicago kwibanda ku muziki. \nUmwuga wa muzika.\n2012\u20132013: Intangiriro yumwuga, \"Ibiti &amp; Ukuri\", hamwe nuruvange.\nKu ya 13 Mutarama 2012, Jenkins yasohoye imvange ye ya mbere yemewe, \"The Mickstape\", ikurikirwa na \"The Pursuit of HappyNess: The Story of Mickalascage\" muri Kanama Muri 2012, Jenkins yasubiye i Chicago maze yinjira muri YCA (Young Chicago Authors), itsinda ry\u2019imivugo, aho yaririmbiye umurongo wa mbere utazirwa nka akapera. [\"citation needed\"] Ibi byatumye abahanzi bafata amajwi baho, hamwe numuyobozi witsinda rya Pivot Gang rya Chicago, Saba bamwitondera. Bombi bahise bakorana mundirimbo, yitwa \"Heaux\", yari igenewe umushinga wa Mick Jenkins, ariko barangije bagaragara kuri mvanjye ya Saba \"GETCOMFORTable\" (2012). Jenkins yabaye kandi umwe mu bagize itsinda rya hip-hop, ryitwa Free Nation. Abandi banyamuryango barimo Prop, J-Stock, Burman, na Maine Uwera. Igihugu cyigenga ni \"itsinda rya hip hop riteza imbere ibitekerezo byo guhanga utakiriye ibitekerezo bigufi byashyizweho nububasha\". \nMuri Mata 2013, Jenkins yasohoye imvange \"ye y'ibiti &amp;amp; Ukuri\". Kaseti yahise ikundwa cyane mu karere, irimo umusaruro jazz, ibivugwa muri Bibiliya, hamwe n'indirimbo ye ikabije. Nyuma y'amezi make gusa irekuwe, ubufatanye hagati ye na bagenzi be b'abaraperi ba Chicago Chance The Rapper na Vic Mensa bwaje mu ndirimbo imwe \"Crossroads\" imwe, iyi ndirimbo kandi yarashimwe cyane kandi yakirwa neza. \n2014\u20132015: \"Amazi\" \"n'imiraba\".\nMuri Nyakanga 2014, Jenkins yagarutsweho cyane nyuma y\u2019isohoka ry\u2019indirimbo ye ndetse n\u2019amashusho yitwa \"abahowe\" \"Imana\", ibyo bikaba byaragaragazaga ubushishozi ku kuri gukabije kw\u2019umuryango hamwe n\u2019ifata ryiza. Indirimbo ikangura ibitekerezo yari ifite ubutumwa ku ihohoterwa rikorerwa imbunda, intambara hagati y'umutimanama we no gutsinda gushya, ndetse n'ubwana bwe bw\u2019imivurungano i Chicago. \"Abahowe Imana\" yoboye abantu bakomeye mu muryango wa hip-hop nka Timbaland, kugira ngo bagere kandi bashimire Jenkins impano ye ya muzika ndetse n\u2019amagambo akomeye. Ku ya 12 Kanama, Jenkins yashyize ahagaragara umushinga we, \"Amazi,\" kugira ngo ashimwe. Ugereranyije indi mishinga yagiye asohora, \"Amazi\" yibanze ku gitekerezo cyo kugereranya amazi nukuri kwubuzima.] [4 \u200b Urugendo rwe rwa mbere rwemewe rwabaye muri Gashyantare 2015 hamwe Knight, Noname na Saba. Yifatanyije kandi na Joey Bada $$ na Denzel Curry mu cyiciro cya 1 cyuruzinduko rwabo ku isi. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\n2016: \"Ibice bikiza\".\nKu ya 17 Kanama 2016, Mick Jenkins yasohoye indirimbo ya mbere muri alubumu ye ya mbere yari itegerejwe cyane, \"Spread Love\". Ku ya 25 Kanama 2016, Jenkins yasohoye indirimbo ye ya kabiri ya alubumu yise \"Kurohama\", igaragaramo igikoresho cyakozwe na quartet ya jazz ikorera mu mujyi wa Toronto BADBADNOTGOOD. Indirimbo ivuga mu buryo butaziguye urupfu rwa Eric Garner, umwirabura wanizwe n'abapolisi. Iyi alubumu, \"The Healing Component\", yasohotse ku ya 23 Nzeri 2016. Indirimbo nyinshi ziri kuri alubumu zirimo intore na outros hamwe n'ibiganiro byerekeranye n'urukundo n'umugore uvuga inkuru, mushiki we. \"Healing Component\", mu magambo ahinnye ya THC, yerekana insanganyamatsiko yurukundo muri alubumu. Kuva ku kwikunda kugeza kuburambe bwurukundo, ahuza uburyo butandukanye urukundo rushobora gufata.\n2017\u20132020: \"Cyangwa\" Urukurikirane rw'imizingo y'indirimbo migufi, \"Ibice byumugabo\" na \"sirusi\".\nKu ya 21 Ugushyingo 2017, Mick Jenkins yasohoye \"Cyangwa Ibindi; Amaganya\", imvange ya mbere mu ruhererekane rw'imishinga Jenkins asobanura ko ari \"urukurikirane rw'umushinga urimo ibitekerezo n'ibitekerezo bya muzika birimo gutera inkunga alubumu.\" Imvange ya kabiri murukurikirane, \"Cyangwa Birenzeho; Kwiheba\", yasohotse ku ya 24 Gashyantare 2018. Ku ya 26 Ukwakira, alubumu ye ya kabiri ya studio, \"Piece of a Man\", yashyizwe ahagaragara. Indirimbo ya mbere ya alubumu, \" Yumviswe ku ya 12 Ukwakira [\"citation ikenewe\"]\n2021: \"Inzovu mu cyumba\".\nKu ya 8 Ukwakira 2021, Mick Jenkins yatangaje alubumu ye ya gatatu yari yitezwe yise \"Inzovu mu Cyumba\", yasohotse ku ya 29 Ukwakira. mbere, \"Truffles\" yasohotse ku ya 23 Kamena 2021. Indirimbo ya nyuma ya alubumu \"Scottie Pippen\" yasohotse ku ya 22 Ukwakira \n2023: \"Kwihangana\".\nKu ya 7 Nyakanga 2023, Jenkins yatangaje alubumu ye ya kane \"Yihangana\", asohora indirimbo yayobowe na JID \"Smoke Break-Dance\" kuri uwo munsi. Iyi alubumu yerekanye ko yasohotse bwa mbere nyuma yo kuva muri Groupe yumuziki ya Cinematike, ubu akaba akora kubufatanye na RBC Records na BMG. Indirimbo ya kabiri ya alubumu, \"Guapanese\" yasohotse ku ya 28 Nyakanga 2023 \n2025: \"andika ubusa\", \"Ibiteye ubwoba\" \"n'ubwicanyi bw'inkongoro\".\nKu ya 16 Mutarama 2025, Jenkins yasohoye \"umuzingo mugufi andika umwanda\", gusa kurubuga rwa muzika kumurongo. Uwo muzingo watumye rap ya Jenkins y \"ubwoko bwa beats\" yisanga kuri YouTube, maze asobanura inzira iri inyuma yo gusohora, avuga ko umushahara muto abahanzi bakura ku mbuga za muzika. Yagaragaje kandi ko ari intangiriro y \"icyiciro gikurikira muri muzika\", asezeranya umuziki n\u2019ibirimo kuzagera mu 2025. Nyuma y\u2019amezi arindwi, Jenkins yasohoye indirimbo ebyiri zitwa \"Scarecrows\", zigizwe n\u2019ubufatanye na Smino na Ab-Soul. "}
{"id": "21325", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21325", "title": "Saba (umuririmbyi)", "text": "Anna Saba Lykke Oehlenschl\u00e6ger (; wavutse ku ya 11 Kanama 1997), uzwi cyane nka Saba (yandikwa mu nyuguti nkuru), ni umuririmbyi w\u2019Umunyetiyopiya-Umunyadanishi, akaba anakina amafilime ya muzika ndetse anakora umwuga wo kumurika imideli. Mu mwaka wa 2024, yahagarariye Danemarke mu irushanwa rya Eurovision ahatanishijwe indirimbo ye \u201cUmusenyi\u201d, maze agera mu cyiciro cya nyuma cy\u2019iryo rushanwa \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nAnna Saba (amazina y\u2019amavuko ni Saba Lykke Oehlenschl\u00e6ger) n\u2019uwasanganywe inda imwe Andrea (wavutse yitwa Sara) bavukiye i Addis Ababa ku ya 11 Kanama 1997. Baje gutoranywa bakajyanwa mu miryango ibarera bafite amezi umunani, maze bakurira i Ringk\u00f8bing muri Danemarke kuva ku ya 10 Mata 1998. Akiri umwana, Oehlenschl\u00e6ger yakiniye ikipe y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru ya DBU Jutland.\nUmwuga.\nNyuma yo kuva mu mashuri yisumbuye, Oehlenschl\u00e6ger na mushiki we bimukiye i Copenhagen, batangira kuba umunyamideli na rwiyemezamirimo mu bicuruzwa byera amenyo, mu gihe mushiki we yakoraga umwuga wo kuririmba no gucuranga. \"]\", agitangira bwa mbere nkumukinnyi wa stade udasanzwe. \nKu ya 25 Mutarama 2024, Saba yatangajwe nk'umwe mu bitabiriye, umukino wanyuma wigihugu cya Danemark kumarushanwa yindirimbo za Eurovision 2024, hamwe nindirimbo \"Umusenyi\". Yakomeje gutsinda umukino wa nyuma ku Gashyantare 2024, abona uburenganzira bwo guhagararira Danemark mu marushanwa ari imbere. Ku ya 29 Werurwe 2024, abinjira benshi barimo Saba, basohoye itangazo rihuriweho risaba \"guhagarika imirwano bidatinze kandi birambye\" muri Gaza, ndetse no \"gutahuka mu buryo butekanye ingwate zose\". Saba yananiwe kwitabira imikino ya kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza ku ya 9 Gicurasi 2024, ashyira uwa 12 kuri 16 n'amanota 36. \nUbuzima bwite.\nMuri 2018, Oehlenschl\u00e6ger bamusanganye indwara ya bipolar I maze ajyanwa mu bitaro inshuro nyinshi kugeza muri 2020, nk'uko yabisobanuye muri filime ya DR DR 2020 (transl.\u2009'Impanga yanjye yasaze'). Yitoje kandi kwigirira nabi mu myaka ye y'ubwangavu. Ni ambasaderi w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019ihungabana rya Danemark. \nOehlenschl\u00e6ger yari afitanye umubano na L\u00e6rke-Maria Schmidt kuva muri 2020 kugeza muri 2023 "}
{"id": "21326", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21326", "title": "Kara Walker", "text": "Kara Elizabeth Walker (wavutse ku ya 26 Ugushyingo 1969) ni umunyamerika wo muri iki gihe ushushanya akoresheje amarangi, gucura ibyuma, umwanditsi, gutegura urubyiniro, umukinnyi wa firime, na mwarimu ukora ubushakashatsi ku moko, igitsina, ubuzima bw'imyororokere, urugomo, n\u2019irangamuntu mu kazi ke. Azwi cyane nkuwakoze igishushanyo kinini kizwi kw'izina tableaux yumukara ikoze mu mpapuro zishashagirana nkibyuma. Walker yahawe igihembo cy'ubusabane cya MacArthur mu 1997, afite imyaka 28, aba umwe mu bakiri bato bahawe igihembo. Yabaye iicyitegererezo mu buhanzi bugaragara mu ishuri ry\u2019ubuhanzi rya Mason Gross kaminuza ya Rutgers kuva mu \nWalker afatwa nkumwe mu bahanzi bakomeye kandi bazwi cyane mu b'Abanyamerika b'Abirabura bagikora muri iki gihe. "}
{"id": "21327", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21327", "title": "Nadia Buari", "text": "Nadia Buari (yavutse kuwa 21 Ugushyingo 1982) ni umukinnyi wa filme ukomoka muri Gana. Nadia Buari yahataniye ibihembo 2 (nominated) by'umukinnyi mwiza wunganira (best actress in a leading role) mu bihembo bya Africa Movie Academy Awards byo muri 2009.\nAmateka.\nNadia Buari yavukiye mu mujyi witwa Oil City muri Gana, Abyarwa n'Ababyeyi babanyagana na wabyaye abana 5, abyara impanga inshuro 2 Nadia Buari avuka ari uwa 5. Yize mu ishuri rya Mfantsiman_Girls'_Secondary_School riherereye mu murwa hagati, muri kaminuza yiga ibijyanye n'ubuhanzi muri University_of_Ghana ahakura bachelor (impamyabumenyi) mu buhanzi (Fine Arts) Mu gihe cyose yamaze muri University_of_Ghana yabarizwaga mu mahuriro y'imbyino n'ikinamico (drama and dance clubs).\nIbijyanye n'Umwuga.\nMu mwaka wa 2005 Nadia Buari yatangiriye umwuga wo gukina filme muri filme y'uruhererekane yacaga kuri televiziyo yo muri Gana yitwa Games People Play. Filme ye ya mbere ikomeye yakinnyemo ni Mummy's Daughter abona gukina mu yitwa \"Beyonce: The president's daughter\" ayikinamo yitwa Beyonce ikaba ariyo filme yamumenyekanishije cyane. Kuva yakina muri Games People Play yahataniye igihembo cya Best Actress muri 2005 Nyuma yaho yagaragaye muri filme zirenga 20\nMuri 2013 yasohoye filme ye bwite yise \"The Diary of Imogene Brown\" \nUmukinnyi w'icyamamare bwa mbere yakinanye na mugenzi we ukomoka muri Gana \"Kumawood\" Umukinnyikanzi akaba n'ukora kuri televiziyo Nana Ama McBrown bahurira muri filme yitwa \"Coming Africa: Welcome to Ghana in 2023.\"\nKumenyekana muri Nollywood no Kwamamara.\nMuri 2008 nibwo Nadia Buari asa nkuwavuye muri filme zo muri Gana yinjira no ku isoko ryo muri. Filme ya mbere yamumenyekanishije muri Nollywood ni \"Beyonc\u00e9 &amp; Rihanna\" akinamo nka \"Beyonc\u00e9\" aho akinana na umukinnyikazi wo muri Nollywood wakinnye nka '. Izindi filme yakiniye muri Nollywood zamenyekanye harimo \"Rough Rider\", \"Beauty and the Beast\", ' na \"\".\nakunze gukinana kandi na \"Jim Iyke\" umukinnyi wa filme wo muri nollywood bahuriye muri \"Beyonce &amp; Rihanna\" bakinana no muri \"Hot Romance\" n'iyitwa \"Behind a smile\".\nMu mwaka wa 2013, yatsindiye igihembo cya the Pan African Actress award mu bihembo ngarukamwaka bya (NEA Awards) byabereye muri \nAkandi kazi.\nBuari yabaye ambasaderi wa Tablet India Limited (TIL) muri 2013. \nUbuzima bwite.\nMuri 2019 nibwo Nadia Buari yatangarije mu kiganiro ko yashyingiwe kandi amaze kubyara abana bane. Avuga ko abavandimwe be ari Malik Buari, Ayisha Buari, Jameel Buari na Jeed Rogers, ndetse ababyeyi be ari Sidiku Buari na Hajia Buari\nMu kiganiro yagiriye kuri Citi TV muri Nyakanga 2023, yatangaje ko yari kuba yarahagaritse umwuga we by'akanya agato iyo bitaba Mama we wahoraga amushinja ko adashoboye inshingano zo kuba umubyeyi no kubifatanya no gukina filme.\nKwamamara.\nMuri 2014, Buari yahawe igihembo cyihariye cyo kumenyekana muri \nMuri 2015 no muri 2019 yahataniye ibihembo ku mwanya wa Best Actress in a leading role kubera filme yakinnyemo \"Diary of Imogen Brown na Getting Married respectively\" \nNadia Buari yahataniye igihembo cya Best Performance cy'umukinnyi mwiza kuri role y'imena mu bihembo byo muri Gana Movie Awards yo muri 2021 yaje gutsindira ari kumwe na Jasmine Baroudi"}
{"id": "21328", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21328", "title": "Tekno", "text": "Augustine Miles Kelechi Okechukwu (wavutse ku wa 17 Ukuboza 1992), uzwi cyane ku izina rya Tekno, ni umuririmbyi, umwanditsi w\u2019indirimbo ndetse n\u2019utunganya imiziki wo muri Nijeriya. Indirimbo ye \u201cEnjoy\u201d niyo film yuruhererekana inyura kuri TV Winning Emmy Ted Lasso (Igice cya gatatu n'igice cya karindwi).\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nKelechi akomoka mu karere ka Ivo, Intara ya Ebonyi, mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Nijeriya. Yavukiye muri Leta ya Bauchi mu muryango w'abana batandatu - abahungu batanu n'umukobwa umwe.] \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bYakuriye mu bice bitandukanye by\u2019igihugu birimo Nasarawa State, Kaduna (umurwa mukuru wa Kaduna State), ndetse na Abuja (umurwa mukuru w\u2019Igihugu cya Nijeriya), kubera ko se yakoraga mu gisirikare cya Nijeriya Tekno Miles afite imyaka 8, yiyandikishije mu ishuri ry\u2019umuziki aho yize kandi akaba n'umuhanga wo gucuranga piyano na gitari. Ni umuvandimwe mukuru wundi muhanzi muri nijeriya witwa spotless \nUmwuga wa muzika.\nTekno Miles niwe wambere wasinyishijwe na K-Money Entertainment. Indirimbo ye yise \"Holiday\",yasohowe ku izina rya Imprint, kandi irimo ijwi ry\u2019umuhanzi w\u2019icyamamare Davido, \"Holiday\" yakiriwe neza kandi Ibona amajwi menshi. \nMu mwaka wa 2012, Tekno Miles yagaragaye n\u2019umunyarwenya uzwi cyane wo muri Nijeriya witwa Julius Agwu mu birori byabereye i Abuja, nyuma yuko Tekno Miles yakiriye amashyi menshi nyuma yo gukora indirimbo yise \"Onye Ne Kwu\", remix ye yise \"Oleku\". Muri ibyo birori niho yahuye na Iyanya na Ubi Franklin, umuyobozi wa Made Men Music Group maze baba inshuti. Ubi na Iyanya amaherezo bashishikarije Tekno Miles kwimukira i kugirango ateze imbere umwuga we wa muzika.\nKu ya 5 Ukwakira 2013, yasinyanye amasezerano yo gufata amajwi na Made Men Music Group \"(MMMG)\", aho yasohoye indirimbo nka \"Dance\" na \"Anything\". Aba baseribateri bamuhesheje igihembo mu cyiciro cya \"Best New act of the Year\" mu birori byo kwidagadura muri Nigeria 2014. Ku ya 18 Kamena 2015, Tekno Miles yasohoye indirimbo ye yise \"Duro\", yakozwe na DJ Coublon. \"Duro\" yakiriwe neza haba muri Afurika ndetse no muri Amerika. Remix yagaragayemo na yasohotse ku ya Indirimbo yakozwe na DJ Coublon hamwe na video iyobowe na AJE Filmworks. Ku Ukuboza 2016, Tekno yagizwe umwe mu mpano icumi za mbere za hip-hop na R&amp;B kureba muri Amerika muri 2017 na Billboard. tekno izwi kandi nka Pana shobuja yahinduye izina ayita Big Tek\nMu mwaka wa 2016, Elton John yakinnye indirimbo ya Tekno yise 'Diana' kuri kimwe mu bice bye bya radiyo Isaha ya Radio kuri. \nIcyakora, ku wa 13 Ukwakira 2017, Tekno yagaragaye na DJ Cuppy ku ndirimbo yise \"Green Light\", iyi ikaba yari indirimbo ya mbere ya DJ Cuppy. \nKu ya 12 Ukuboza 2017, Umuraperi wo muri Kanada Drake yashyize amashusho ye hamwe na Tekno ku rubuga rwe rwa Instagram, yandikaho ngo \"Igi fata igihe \" \nKu wa 10 Kanama 2018, Umuhanzi w\u2019umunyamerika Ciara, yifatanyije na Tekno, mu bufatanye bwiswe \"Freak Me.\" Kuri uyu wa Tekno yatangaje ko iyi ndirimbo yasohotse kandi agaragaza ibihangano bitwikiriye kuri konte ye ya Instagram @teknoofficial.kuwa gatanu \nKu wa 15 Kanama 2019, Tekno yatangajwe nk'umwe mu batunganya 'Won't Be Late' na Swae Lee uafatanyije na Drake\nMuri Kamena 2018, Tekno yasinyanye amasezerano yo gukwirakwiza na Universal Music Group Nigeriya (UMGN), ishami ry\u2019umuziki wa Universal Music Group ishinzwe Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba, ndetse n\u2019ikirwa cyitwa Records cyitwa UK. Muri, Tekno yagaragaye kuri Beyonc\u00e9 ' \"\" y'amajwi y'indirimbo \"Don't Jealous Me\". \nKu wa 6 Ukuboza 2020, Tekno yashyize ahagaragara urutonde rwa alubumu ye ya mbere yari itegerejwe na benshi, \"Old Romance\". Mu 2022, yagaragaye muri ' ' afataniyije na Kizz Daniel, inzira yabaye injyana ya mbere ya shazamed mu mwaka umwe. Nanone, muri uwo mwaka, Davido yerekanye uburyo Tekno yagize uruhare mu kubyutsa umwuga we mu gihe gikomeye cyane ubwo yari akeneye imbaraga nshya. \nUmuhanzi Tekno wo muri Afro-pop yashyize ahagaragara amashusho yindirimbo ye yise \"Puttin\". Inyuma ya alubumu ye yamenyekanye cyane mu 2023, The More The Better, igihembo -gutsindira umucuranzi wa producer wo muri Nigeriya akaba na producer, Tekno, yatangije ibihe bishya bya muzika n'indirimbo ye aheruka kwitwa Wayo. Iyi ndirimbo nshya niyambere itanga ubufatanye bwe bushya na emPawa Afrika ya Mr Eazi, izabona Tekno abaye umushoramari nabafatanyabikorwa muri label. \nUbuzima bwite.\nMuri Gicurasi 2018, umukunzi wa Tekno yibarutse umwana w'umukobwa. Muri 2020, Tekno yatangaje ko yimukiye muri Amerika. Iki cyari igisubizo ku makuru y\u2019icyifuzo cyatanzwe mu Nteko ishinga amategeko ya Nijeriya yo guhindura izina ry\u2019igihugu muri UAR, kikaba cyari amagambo ahinnye y\u2019igihugu cya Afurika yunze ubumwe cyangwa Repubulika yunze ubumwe ya Alkebulan ku ya 2 Kamena.\nMuri 2017, Tekno yamenyesheje rubanda ko afite aside irike. Ibintu byari bimaze kuba ingorabahizi kandi amaherezo byagize ingaruka ku ijwi rye. Yagombaga kubagwa kugira ngo akemure icyo kibazo. \nUrutonde rw'indirimbo.\nAlbum za studio\nInyandiko zakozwe.\n\"Ikigo cy'Abanyeshuri cya Nijeriya \" (Tekno)"}
{"id": "21329", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21329", "title": "Sagrada Fam\u00edlia", "text": "Basilika ya Sagrada Fam\u00edlia yubatswe hashingiwe ku gishushanyo mbonera cya Antoni Gaud\u00ed, ikirangirire mubwubatsi. Iherereye hagati mumujyi wa Barcelona, ikaba imaze imyaka irenga ijana iri kubakwa, kandi biteganyijwe ko iyi inyubako izarangira umwaka utaha.\nImiterere.\nBasilika ya Sagrada Fam\u00edlia ubu ifite uburebure bwa metero 162.91, ikaba iciye kunyubako y'urusengero rwo mu Budage rwitwa Ulm minster yari urusengero rurerure kuva mu 1890. \nUlm Minster, ni urusengero rwa gikiristu rwubatswe hagati y'umwaka wa 1543 na 1890, ni rwo rwari rusanzwe rufite uwomwanya, rukaba rufite uburebure bwa metero 161.5. Ubu Sagrada Fam\u00edlia yarurengejeho metero imwe, kuko ifite metero 162.91. \nAmateka.\nIbuye ryambere rya Sagrada Fam\u00edlia ryashyizweho mu 1882. "}
{"id": "21330", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21330", "title": "Ramba Hills", "text": "Ramba Hills, ni umushinga w'ikigo Investment Africa Holdings Ltd, kibarizwa i Kigali, kikaba gifite ishami ryitwa Ramba Real Estate ari ryo rizaba ricunga ibikorwa bya Ramba Hills. \nUyu mushinga wubakwa muri Gasabo, mu Murenge wa Kacyiru, hepfo y\u2019Ibitaro bya King Faisal, hafi y\u2019inzira ijya muri Vision City no ku kibuga cya Golf cya Kigali. Uteganyijwe kurangirana n\u2019imyaka ine. \nImiterere.\nRamba Hills izaba igizwe ninyubako ndende ebyiri n'izindi zizigaragiye ziringaniye, ubusitani bugari butaga amahumbezi, ubwogero rusange, parikingi nini,imihanda myinshi n'ibindi urebeye kugishushanyo mbonera. \nMu gice cy\u2019imbere hateganyijwe inzu 10 zigeretse rimwe zo guturamo, ziteganyijwe ku ruhande rureba ku Kibuga cya Golf cya Kigali. Zizaba zifite ubusitani bunini bwihariye ndetse n\u2019imihanda inyuramo.\nKu rundi ruhande, hagiye kubakwa imiturirwa ibiri miremire, imwe ifite amagorofa 26 indi 24. Hegereye izo, hari izindi nyubako enye zindi z\u2019amagorofa: imwe izaba ifite 16, indi 12, n\u2019indi 10. Muri izo nyubako ebyiri ndende cyane, imwe izaba ikorerwamo n\u2019ibiro, indi igenewe guturwamo. \nAkamaro.\nUyu mushinga uri mukiciro cyo kurushaho guhindura isura y'Umujyi wa Kigali, ariko n'imibereho y'abanyamujyi ikarushaho kuba myiza bigendanye no kubona ahantu hagezweho ho gutura no gukorera"}
{"id": "21333", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21333", "title": "Visi perezida w'u Rwanda", "text": "Visi Perezida w\u2019u Rwanda (Igifaransa: Visi-pr\u00e9sident rwandais, Kinyarwanda: visiperezida) yari umwanya wa politiki mu Rwanda washyiriweho Paul Kagame kuva muri Nyakanga 1994 kugeza muri Mata 2000. Uyu mwanya wakuweho mu mwaka w'2000.\nUyu mwanya wabayeho no mu itegeko nshinga ry\u2019u Rwanda kuva 1961 kugeza 1973. Icyakora, uwo mwanya ntiwigeze ushyirwaho umuntu n'umwehagati ya 1961 na 1969. "}
{"id": "21334", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21334", "title": "Lil Wayne", "text": "Dwayne Michael Carter Jr. Dwayne Michael Carter Jr. (wavutse ku wa 27 Nzeri 1982), uzwi cyane nka Lil Wayne, ni umuraperi wo muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Akunze gufatwa nk\u2019umwe mu bahanzi bakomeye ba hip-hop b\u2019igihe cye, ndetse no mu baraperi bakomeye mu mateka. Yavukiye kandi akurira i New Orleans, aho yaje gutahurwa na Birdman mu 1993 maze asinya muri Cash Money Records afite imyaka 11. Yakomeje kwamamara muri iri tsinda kugeza igihe ayivamo muri 2018.\nCarter yashyizwe bwa mbere mwitsinda rimwe na Cash Money labelmate BG muri 1994 - bazwi nka BG'z - maze basohora alubumu yiswe \"inkuru y'ukuri\" muri uwo mwaka, nubwo Carter (icyo gihe yitwaga Baby D) yagaragaye kuri eshatu gusa. Carter na BG bahise bashinga itsinda rya Hot-hop ryamajyepfo Hot Boys hamwe na bagenzi babo Juvenile na Turk muri 1997, basohora alubumu yabo ya mbere, \"Get It How U Live!\" uwo mwaka. Hot Boys yigaruriye abantu muri rusange nyuma yo kumurika alubumu yabo ya kabiri \"Guerrilla Warfare\" (1999) ndetse no kugaragara mundirimbo imwe ya BG, \" Bling Bling \". Iri tsinda ryaratandukanye nyuma ya alubumu bitewe na buri munyamuryango (usibye Carter) aho buri wese yaciye inzira ze, nubwo indi alubumu imwe \"'Em Burn\" (2003) - yasohotse nyuma. \nAlubumu ya mbere ya Carter ya studio, \"Tha Block Is Hot\" (1999), yari intambwe ihambaye nkumuhanzi wenyine, aho byazamuye ubucuruzi bwe. Yakurikiwe na \"Light Out\" (2000) na \"500 Degreez\" (2003). Carter ashimwa kuba yarahinduye imvange zindirimbo hamwe nuburyo bwe bushya mu myaka ya za 2000.] \"[\" \"2\" Album ye ya gatandatu, \"Tha Carter III\" (2008), yagize akamaro kanini mu mwuga wa Wayne, mu cyumweru cya mbere yagurishijwe miliyoni zirenga imwe mu gihugu. Yatsindiye Album nziza ya Rap muri Grammy Awards ku nshuro ya 51 kandi ishyigikirwa na Billboard Hot 100 ku ndirimbo \" Lollipop \" (irimo Static Major), hamwe no mu ndirimbo icumi za mbere hajemo \" A Milli \" na \" Yabonye Amafaranga \" (irimo T-Pain).\nAlubumu ya karindwi ya studio ya Carter, \"kuvuka bundi bushya\" (2010), yagerageje rap ya rock hanyuma isohoka mubusanzwe yakiriwe nabi. Ukwezi kumwe kurekuwe, yakatiwe igifungo cy\u2019amezi 8 azira gutunga imbunda akomoka ku byabaye muri 2007. Alubumu ye ya munani, \"Ntabwo ndi Umuntu\" (2010), yasohotse mu gihe yari afunzwe, mu gihe alubumu ye ya cyenda, \"Tha Carter IV\" (2011), yasohotse nyuma amezi avuye muri gereza. Nubwo hari ibitekerezo bitandukanye, \"Tha Carter IV\" yagurishijwe ibice 964,000 mucyumweru cyayo cya mbere muri Amerika Aulubumu ye ya cumi na kabiri ya studio, \"Tha Carter V\" (2018) - yabanjirijwe na \"Ntabwo ndi Umuntu wa II\" (2013) na \"Alubumu ya Free Weezy\" (2015) - yasohotse nyuma y\u2019ubukererwe bw\u2019igihe kirekire n\u2019amakimbirane yo mu itsinda ryamuteguriraga umuziki, maze igira ibice 480,000 mu kugurishwa mucyumweru cya mbere. Alubumu ye ya cumi na gatatu, Gushyingura (2020), ibaye alubumu ye ya gatanu idakurikiranye numero ya mbere. Muri Kamena 2025, yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye ya cuminakane, \"Tha Carter VI\".\nCarter yagurishije inyandiko zisaga miliyoni 120 ku isi yose, harimo alubumu zisaga miliyoni 25 na miliyoni 95 zikoreshwa mu buryo bwa digitale muri Amerika, bituma aba umwe mu bahanzi ba muzika bagurishije cyane ku isi. [1 2 \u200b\u200b Muri Nzeri\u00a027, 2012, yabaye umuhanzi wambere wumugabo anyuze kuri Elvis Presley wanditswe cyane kuri Billboard Hot 100, hamwe n'indirimbo 109. Carter yashinze itsinda ritunganya umuziki Young Money Entertainment muri 2005, yasinyishije abahanzi barimo Drake, Tyga na Nicki Minaj.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nDwayne Michael Carter Jr. yavutse muri Nzeri\u00a027, 1982. Yamaze imyaka ye ya mbere mu gace gakennye ka Hollygrove ka Uptown New Orleans, Ward ya 17 ya Louisiana. Nyina, umutetsi, yamubyaye afite imyaka 19. Ababyeyi be baratandukanye afite imyaka ibiri, kandi se yataye burundu umuryango. Mu kiganiro 2009, umunyamakuru wa CBS News Katie Couric yabajije uyu muraperi impamvu yakoresheje izina Wayne aho gukoresha izina rye. Carter yarashubije ati: \"Nzakubwira impamvu nakuyeho D hano hano kuri TV. Nakuyeho D kuko nari ndi muto. Data, ariho, kandi ntabwo ari mubuzima bwanjye kandi ntabwo yigeze aba mubuzima bwanjye. Sinshaka rero kuba Dwayne. Nahitamo kuba Wayne.\" Couric yabajije niba se abizi, maze Carter, aseka ati: \"Ubu arabizi.\" Carter yavuze ko abona umugabo washatse nyina nyuma nyakwigendera Reginald \"Urukwavu\" McDonald ari se nyawe. Carter afite tatouage yeguriwe McDonald. \nCarter yiyandikishije muri gahunda yimpano mwishuri ryibanze rya Lafayette. Nyuma yaje kwiga mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Eleanor McMain imyaka ibiri, aho yari umunyeshuri w\u2019icyubahiro akaba n\u2019umunyamuryango w\u2019ikinamico, akina Tin Man mu ishuri ryakozwe na \"The Wiz\". 1 Nyina wa Carter yafashe icyemezo cyo kumukura ku ishuri kubera umutekano we. Ku myaka 15, Carter yari atangiye kwamamara mubikorwa bya muzika; nyina yemeje ko agomba kuva mu mashuri yisumbuye nyuma yo kubona imbunda yapakiye mu gikapu cye kugira ngo yirinde. \nCarter yanditse indirimbo ye ya mbere ya rap afite imyaka umunani. Mu mpeshyi yo muri 1991, yahuye n\u2019umuraperi washinze Cash Money Records Bryan \"Baby\" Williams (uzwi ku izina rya Birdman), wamutoje kandi amutera inkunga yo gukunda hip-hop; Birdman yashyizemo Carter mundirimbo za Cash Money, kandi (mukwitura) yakundaga gufata amajwi mato kumashini isubiza ya Williams. \nMu 1994, afite imyaka 12, Carter yakomerekejwe n\u2019amasasu hafi y\u2019igituza. Icyo gihe, yavuze ko gukomeretswa byabayeho ku bw'impanuka. Icyakora, muri Nzeri 2018, Carter mu biganiro yavuze ko byari ukwiyahura nyuma yo kubwirwa na nyina ko agomba guhagarika amashyirahamwe ye afitanye isano na rap. Carter ashimira umupolisi ubu utari mu kazi Robert Hoobler (1956\u20132022), uwo yise \"Uncle Bob\", ko yarokoye ubuzima bwe ashimangira ko umwana uri hafi gupfa ajyanwa mu bitaro mu modoka ya polisi aho gutegereza ko ambulance iboneka. Izindi konti zerekana ko hari abandi abapolisi benshi bagize uruhare muguhitamo no gushyira mubikorwa iyo nzira. \nUmwuga.\n1994\u20131999: Intangiriro yumwuga nabahungu Bashyushye.\nNyuma yo gukira igikomere cy\u2019amasasu, Carter yahujwe na Christopher Dorsey, umuraperi wo muri New Orleans uzwi ku izina rya BG, inshuti ye kuva kera, umukunzi wa Cash Money hamwe na mugenzi we Hot Boys. Nyuma baza gushinga bombi, BG'z, BG yitwa \"Lil Doogie\" na Carter yitwa \"Baby D\". Basohoye alubumu imwe gusa mwizina ryitsinda, \"Inkuru Yukuri\" (1995). \nMu 1997, Carter na Dorsey bahise binjira muri quartet hip-hop, Hot Boys, hamwe nabaraperi nabandi bagenzi babo, Juvenile, na Turk. Amaze kwinjira afite imyaka 14, Carter yari umunyamuryango muto muri kiriya gihe. Alubumu ya mbere ya Hot Boys, \"Get It How U Live!\", yasohotse muri uwo mwaka, muri uwo mwaka wa 1999 yakurikiwe na alubumu ikomeye yitsinda muri rusange ya \"Guerrilla Warfare\", yageze ku mwanya wa mbere ku mbonerahamwe ya Alubumu \"rwa Billboard\" Top R &amp; B / Hip-Hop na nimero ya gatanu kuri Billboard 200. Mugihe cyumwuga wabo, Hot Boys yari ifite indirimbo ku mbonerahamwe ebyiri, \" Turi kwaka \" kuva kuri \"Get It How U Live!\" na \" Nkeneye Umukobwa ushyushye \" kuva kuri Guerrilla Warfare. Itsinda ryasangiye indirimbo, \" Bling Bling \", hamwe nandi matsinda ya Cash Money, itsinda rya babiri Big Tymers (bigizwe na Birdman na producer Mannie Fresh). Umurongo wa Carter muri iyo ndirimbo wumvikanye gusa ku ndirimbo yagombaga kunyura kuri radiyo, mugihe kuyariri kuri alubumu yumvikanye aririmba agace gato rusange. \"Bling Bling\" yagaragaye kuri Album y'abanyamuryango ba Hot BoG, \"Chopper City muri Ghetto\", yasohotse muri Mata 1999. Carter yitabiriye no kuririmbana na Juvenile mu gihangano \u201cBack That Azz Up\u201d, cyaje kugera ku mwanya wa 18 ku rutonde rwa Billboard Hot 100, kandi kigaruka ku mwanya wa 5 mu ndirimbo z\u2019imbere muri R&amp;B na Hip-Hop. \n\"Bareke bashye\", alubumu irimo zitashyizwe ahagaragara yanditswe na quartet mugihe cya 1998 na 2000, yasohotse muri Werurwe 2003, hashize imyaka myinshi itsinda rimaze gusenyuka. Yageze ku mwanya wa gatatu ku mbonerahamwe ya Top R &amp; B / Hip-Hop, ariko ntiyitwaye neza kuri \"Billboard\" 200 aho yaje kuri nimero cumi na kane. \n1999\u20132004: \"Uruhande rushyushye\", z\"imya amatara\", na \"Dogere 500\".\nAlubumu ya mbere ya Carter wenyine, \"Uruhande rushyushye\", yasohotse ku ya 2 Ugushyingo 1999, ubwo yari afite imyaka 17 kandi agaragaza imisanzu ikomeye yatanzwe na Hot Boys. Yatangiye ku mwanya wa gatatu kuri Billboard 200 nyuma iza kwemezwa na platine na RIAA mu Kuboza 1999, bitarenze ukwezi isohotse. \"]\" Iyo alubumu yatumye mu 1999 atoranywa na Source magazine nk'umuhanzi mushya wahize abandi iza mw'icumi zambere zigezweho Indirimbo yari iyambere ya alubumu yari ihagarariye izindi, iyo korasi yayo ikaba yarakozwe nuwahoranye na Carter muri Hot Boys, Juvenile na BG\n2004\u20132006: \"Tha Carter\", \"Tha Carter II\", na \"Nka Data, Nk'umuhungu\" \"we\".\nKu ya 29 Kamena 2004, Album ya kane ya studio ya Carter, \"Tha Carter\", yashyizwe ahagaragara, ibyo bikaba byerekana icyo abanenga batekereza ko ari iterambere mu njyana ye yo kuririmba no ku nsanganyamatsiko. Byongeye kandi, ibihangano bitwikiriye alubumu byagaragaye bwa mbere kuri Wayne-umukono wa dreadlock. \"Tha Carter\" yamenyekanye cyane na Wayne, agurisha kopi 878,000 muri Amerika, mu gihe indirimbo \" Go DJ \" yabaye eshanu za mbere ku rutonde rwa \"Billboard\" Hot R &amp; B / Hip-Hop. Nyuma y\u2019isohoka rya \"Tha Carter\", Lil Wayne yagaragaye ku ndirimbo yise \u201c Umusirikare \u201d ya Destiny's Child hamwe n\u2019umuraperi TI wa Atlanta, wageze ku mwanya wa gatatu kuri Billboard Hot 100 hamwe n\u2019indirimbo Zishyushye za R &amp; B / Hip-Hop. \n2006\u20132007: Indirimbo zivanze nizo yafatanyije n'abandi.\nAho gukurikirana alubumu imwe yonyine, Carter yatangiye kugera kubamuteze amatwi abinyujije mu mvange nyinshi ndetse n'abashyitsi bagaragara kuri pop zitandukanye, R&amp;B na hip hop. Mu mvange nyinshi, \"Kwiyegurira 2\" na \"Da Amapfa 3\" byakiriye ibitangazamakuru byinshi kandi bisubirwamo. \"Kwiyegurira Imana 2\", byasohotse mu 2006, byahujije Carter na DJ Drama kandi bikubiyemo inzira yamenyekanye cyane mu mibereho, \"Georgia Bush\", remix ya Field Mob na Ludacris '\" Jeworujiya \", aho Carter yanenze igisubizo cyahoze ari perezida w\u2019Amerika George W. Bush ku ngaruka z\u2019umuyaga Katrina wagize mu mujyi wa New Orleans. \"Da Dought 3\" yarekuwe umwaka ukurikira kandi yaraboneka kubuntu kubuntu. Harimo Carter kuririmba hejuru yibitaramo bitandukanye uhereye kumuririmbyi uherutse gukorwa nabandi bahanzi. Ibinyamakuru byinshi bizwi cyane bya hip hop nka \"XXL\" na \"Vibe\" byerekanaga imvange. Christian Hoard wo mu kinyamakuru \"Rolling Stone\" yasuzumye imvange \"Da Amapfa 3\" \"n\u2019amapfa ararenze 2 (Carter 3 Sessions)\" \"muri alubumu nziza zo mu 2007\". \n2007\u20132010: \"Tha Carter III\", \"Turi Abanyamafaranga bakiri bato\", no \"kuvuka ubwa kabiri\".\nMuri 2007, Carter yavuze ko azongera guhura na Hot Boys, afite gahunda yo kumurika alubumu nyuma yuko Alubumu ya BG yonyine \"Too Hood to Be Hollywood\" irangiye. Ubusanzwe \"Tha Carter III\" yari iteganijwe gusohoka mu 2007, ariko yaratinze nyuma y\u2019amajwi menshi yamenyekanye kandi akwirakwizwa hifashishijwe imvange, harimo \"n\u2019amapfa yarangiye Pt.\" \"2\" kandi \"Amapfa ararangiye Pt.\" \"4\". Mu Kuboza, Lil Wayne yateguye gusohora \"The Leak\", alubumu itandukanye irimo indirimbo zasohotse hamwe n'inzira enye ziyongera, ku Kuboza\u00a018, 2007, hamwe na \"Tha Carter III\" yatinze kugera muri Werurwe\u00a018, 2008. Ahubwo, \"The Leak\" yabaye EP ifite indirimbo eshanu kandi yasohotse muburyo bwa digitale mukuboza\u00a025, 2007. \n2010\u20132013: \"Ntabwo ndi Urukurikirane rw'umuntu\" na \"Tha Carter IV\".\nMu kiganiro kuri Mixtape ya MTV ku wa mbere, Carter yatangaje ko hasohotse \"Tha Carter IV\". Nyuma yaje gutangaza ko izasohoka mu mpera za 2009 mbere y\u2019ikiruhuko. Birdman yari yavuze mbere ko \"Tha Carter IV\" izasohokana na \"Rebirth\" nka alubumu ya disiki ebyiri. Carter yabihakanye, avuga ko \" \"Tha Carter IV\" ikwiye \"Tha Carter IV\" \", yongeraho ko \"Turi bato babanyamafaranga\" ishobora gusohokana hamwe no \"Kuvuka ubwa kabiri\". Izi alubumu amaherezo zasohotse zitandukanye. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nCarter yasohoye alubumu ye ya munani, \"Ntabwo ndi Umuntu\", ku myaka 28 y'amavuko, Nzeri\u00a0Iyi alubumu yasohotse mu gihe Carter yari afunzwe ashinjwa gutunga intwaro. Iyi alubumu yagurishije kopi zirenga 953000 muri Amerika havamo indirimbo yatsindiye \" Right Hejuru Yayo \", yaje ku mwanya wa gatandatu kuri Billboard Hot 100. Iyi alubumu nayo yagaragaye ku mwanya wa kabiri, ariko nyuma iza ku mwanya wa mbere kuri \"Billboard\" 200, bituma Carter aba umuraperi wa mbere mu gihe yari afunzwe (kuva Album ya Tupac Shakur yashyizwe ku mwanya wa \"mbere\" kugeza mu 1995). \n\"Tha Carter IV\" yatinze mu 2011, nyuma yuko Lil Wayne atangiye gufata amajwi kuva kera nyuma yo kuva muri gereza. Yasobanuye ko indirimbo ye ya mbere kuva yasohoka ari \"verisiyo ya \"A Milli\" yo muri 2010 kuri steroid\". Indirimbo ya mbere ya \"Tha Carter IV\", \" 6 Foot 7 Foot \" irimo Cory Gunz, yasohotse mu Kuboza\u00a015, 2010. Ku ya Werurwe\u00a08, Carter yasohoye indi ndirimbo, \"Tugarutse vuba\", nubwo itari yashyizwe kumurongo wemewe wa \"Tha Carter IV\". Indirimbo, \" John \", irimo Rick Ross, yasohotse muri Werurwe\u00a024. [\"citation ikenewe\"] Mu kiganiro cyo muri Werurwe\u00a029, Carter yatangaje ko azasezera afite imyaka 35; kuvuga ngo \"Numva ndikunda njya muri studio mugihe ari ingingo ikomeye\" mubuzima bwabana be bane. Mu gihe cyimyaka ibiri hagati ya 2010 na 2012, Carter yagiye agaragara mu ndirimbo nyinshi zamenyekanye nka \" Nabikoze (Cash Money Intwari) \" na Kevin Rudolf, \" Miss Me \", \"Motto \", na \" HYFR (Hell Ya Fucking Right) \" na Drake, \" Nta rukundo \" na Eminem, \"Kanda kuri Light \" na Jay, \" \" Ndi kuri Umwe \", \" Bijyana ku mutwe \", na \" Nta Nshuti Nshya \" by DJ Khaled, \" Motivation \" ya Kelly Rowland, \" Ballin\" \"na Young Jeezy,\" Ibicu bidasanzwe \"by BoB,\" Ndashobora gutekereza gusa \"by David Guetta,\" Fade \"na Tyga,\" Pop That \"by French Montana, na\" Bandz a Make J D.\nIbikorwa bya \"Tha Carter IV\" byashyizwe ahagaragara muri Mata\u00a020. Ubusanzwe byari biteganijwe kurekurwa muri Gicurasi\u00a016, yatinze inshuro nyinshi kugeza yemejwe ko izarekurwa ku ya 29 Kanama 2011. Muri Gicurasi\u00a026, indirimbo ya gatatu ya alubumu, \" Uburyo bwo Gukunda \", yasohotse. Yasohoye indi nzira, \"Nshuti Anne (Stan Igice cya 2)\", muri Kamena. [\"citation needed\"] Mu rwego rwo kwitegura \"Tha Carter IV\", Carter yasohoye imvange, \"Ihangane 4 Tegereza\", bisa na mixtape ye \"No Ceilings\" (2009); mixtape yongeye gusohoka kuri serivise zitangwa muri Mutarama 2022 hamwe ninzira enye ziyongera. \n2014\u20132019: \"Album ya Weezy Yubusa\" na \"Tha Carter V.\".\nUkwakira\u00a018, 2013, uwahoze ari visi perezida wa Cash Money Records ushinzwe kwamamaza Mel Smith, yanditse kuri Twitter ati: \"Umunsi mwiza wa gatanu !! Umuziki mushya wa YMCMB uza vuba !! Carter 5.\" Nyuma y'amezi hafi ane, mu kiganiro na \"The Griffin\", yasohotse muri Gashyantare\u00a014, 2014, Smith yagize icyo avuga kuri alubumu iri hafi: \"Turi hafi cyane yo guhagarika alubumu. Bizatungura abantu bose... Sinshobora gusohora itariki kuko ashaka gutangaza abantu.\" \u00a015, mu gitaramo cya Drake mu birori bya NBA All-Star Weekend muri New Orleans, Carter yagaragaye nk'umushyitsi mbere yo gutangaza ko \"Tha Carter V\" azasohoka muri Gicurasi\u00a05, 2014. Muri Werurwe 2014, Carter yongeye kuvuga mu kiganiro yagiranye na SXSW ko \"Tha Carter V\" yaba alubumu ye ya nyuma. \nIbitekerezo bya politiki n'amoko.\nMuri 2013, Carter yakiriwe nabi nyuma yuko amashusho yasohowe na TMZ amweretse bigaragara ko akandagiye ibendera rya Amerika. Carter yaje gusobanura ko \"Ntabwo nigeze ngambirira gusuzugura ibendera rya Amerika\", kandi ko arimo gufata amashusho y'indirimbo kuri alubumu ye yise, \"Imana Ihe umugisha Amerika\". Avuga ko intego y'ibendera yari iyo kwerekana ko \"inyuma y'Ibendera ry'Amerika hari Hoods ya Amerika\". \nMu mpera z'umwaka wa 2016, Carter yagize icyo anenga ku mutwe wa Black Lives Matter, agira ati: \"Ntabwo numva mfitanye isano n'ikintu kibi ntanafite aho mpuriye nacyo. Niba ubikora, uri umusazi nk'umwanda,\" yongeraho ko kuba afite umwirabura w'umukire ufite abakunzi b'abazungu ari gihamya ko abirabura bahabwa agaciro muri Amerika. \nUbucukumbuzi.\nAlubumu za studio\nAlbum zifatanije"}
{"id": "21335", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21335", "title": "Primus Guma Guma Super Star", "text": "Primus Guma Guma Super Star mu mpine PGGSS ni Amarushanwa yabaga buri mwaka y'Abahanzi baririmba mu Rwanda. \nPGGSS yaterwaga inkunga na Primus lager ya Bralirwa, ariko aya marushanwa agategurwa na East African Promoters (EAP) akaba yarabaga mu rwego rwo gufasha Abahanzi no guteza imbere uruganda rw'umuziki mu Rwanda. Aho aya marushanwa atanira n'andi amenyerewe nka Tusker Project Fame cyangwa American Idol akunze gukoresha abahanzi baririmba batari bamenyekana, Primus Guma Guma Super Star yo itabirwaga n'Abahanzi bamaze kugira amazina akomeye mu Rwanda (nka Tom Close, Bruce Melodie, King James, Riderman, Dream Boys n'abandi.. bagahangana bagamije gutsindira amafaranga yateganyijwe nk'igihembo, bazenguruka igihugu bataramira abafana babo.\n2013 ubwo yabaga ku nshuro ya 3, Aya marushanwa yaramaze gufata indi ntera akunzwe, yitezwe na benshi bakunda umuziki nyarwanda, aho abanyamakuru ndetse n\u2019abasesengura mu myidagaduro mu Rwanda bashimiye Primus Bralirwa kuba yaranye igikorwa nk'iki kinini mu Rwanda.\n2019 Mushyoma Joseph uzwi nka Boubou uyobora EAP yabwiye ikinyamakuru IGIHE ko iri rushanwa ritazongera kuba ndetse ko Bralirwa na East African Promoters (EAP) yabafashaga kuritegura bari kugirana ibiganiro byo gushaka ikindi gikorwa bafatanya gukora cyateza imbere abahanzi, nk'uko PGGSS yari imaze imyaka igera ku munani ibikora. ni nyuma y'uko Bruce Melodie ariwe muhanzi waruritsindiye muri 2018.\nImpaka.\nPGGSS yagiye igira impaka nyinshi nko mu mwaka wa 2013, havugwaga urutavugarumwe mu itangazamakuru bashinja Bralirwa ndetse na EAP babashinja kuba baribeshye bagatsindisha umuraperi Riderman atariwe warukwiriye gutsinda. "}
{"id": "21336", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21336", "title": "Little Simz", "text": "Simbiatu \u201cSimbi\u201d Abisola Abiola Ajikawo (wavutse ku ya 23 Gashyantare 1994), Yamenyekanye cyane ku izina rye ryambere Little Simz, ni umwongerezakazi uririmbi injyana na rap hamwe numukinnyi wa filime. Ni umuhanzikazi wamenyekanye cyane binyuze mu mizingo ye itatu ya mbere yakoze ku giti cye: Curious Tales of Trials + Persons (2015), Stillness in Wonderland (2016), na Gray Area (2019). Uyu wa nyuma washyizwe ku rutonde rw\u2019ibihembo bya Mercury Prize, kandi utsindira ibihembo bya Ivor Novello mu cyiciro cya Alubumu Nziza, ndetse unabona intsinzi muri NME Awards. \nAlubumu ye ya kane, \"Rimwe na rimwe nshobora kuba intore\" (2021), Yakunzwe cyane n\u2019inzobere mu muziki, kandi ibinyamakuru bitandukanye byayigaragaje nk\u2019iyo hejuru mu 2021. Iyi alubumu yegukanye igihembo cya Mercury Prize 2022, inatuma nyirayo ahabwa Brit Award y\u2019Umuhanzi mushya w\u2019umwaka 2022 ndetse na Libera Award yo muri Hip-Hop/Rap. Album ye gatanu, Oya Urakoze (2022), yasohotse kugirango ashimwe. Mu 2024, yagaragaye ku ndirimbo \" Turasenga \" ya Coldplay, ari kumwe na Burna Boy, Elyanna, na Tini. Alubumu ye ya gatandatu ya studio, \"Lotus\", yasohotse ku ya 6 Kamena 2025.\nHanze yumuziki, Ajikawo yakinnye muri Netflix yububyutse ikinamico \"Top Boy\". Yagaragaye kandi nka we muri filime \"Venom: Reka habeho ubwicanyi\" (2021).\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nAjikawo yavukiye Islington, London, ku babyeyi ba Nigeriya. Yakuriye mu isambu hamwe na bashiki be bakuru. Nyina na we yari umurezi mu bwana bwe. Ni ubwoko bwa Yoruba. \nYize mu ishuri rya Highbury Fields i Londres kandi yiga no mu rubyiruko rw\u2019urubyiruko rwa St Mary mu Muhanda wo hejuru, Islington, ari kumwe na Leona Lewis na Alexandra Burke. Ajikawo yashimiye Club y'urubyiruko ya Mary uruhare yagize mu mwuga we, avuga ko ari \"ahantu byose byatangiriye kuri njye home inzu ya kabiri\". \nNyuma Ajikawo yize muri Westminster Kingsway College na kaminuza ya West London aho yakomereje umwuga we wa muzika. \nUbuhanzi.\nAsobanura umuziki we nka rap nubushakashatsi. Mu gihe afitanye isano rya hafi n\u2019ubwoko bwa grime, yanakuye imbaraga mu zindi njyana zirimo reggae, blues, synth-rock na jazzy R&amp;B. \nAjikawo yakuze yumva abahanzi ba rap Busta Rhymes, Nas na Biggie Smalls, byamuteye gukora umwuga wo gufata rap. yakunze kuvugwa nkimwe mubintu byamugizeho ingaruka. Ajikawo yagize ati \"Ndatekereza ko \"Miseducation ya Lauryn Hill\" yari amashuri yanjye rwose. Lauryn Hill yari umwe mu bahanzi ba mbere batumye numva imbaraga z'umuziki.\" Yakuye kandi imbaraga ku bahanzi ba jazz Nina Simone, John Coltrane na Billie Holiday kuri alubumu ye \"Rimwe na rimwe nshobora kuba intore\". Ibindi byamuteye inkunga harimo ikigirwamana cye Kendrick Lamar, wamwitaga \"umuntu mubi ubikora ubu\" mu \nUmwuga.\nUmuziki.\n2015\u20132017: Intangiriro yumwuga \"nigitekerezo cyamatsiko yikigeragezo + Abantu\" no \"gutuza muri Wonderland\".\nAjikawo yakoreye ibitaramo muri Rising Tide, iluvlive, Gufata Inganda (Iterambere ry\u2019imijyi) Ingoma ya Hackney, Inzu ya Somerset n'inzu ya ba nyagasani. Yakinnye kandi muri BBC 1Xtra Prom 2015 muri Royal Albert Hall, ari kumwe na orchestre yuzuye iyobowe na Jules Buckley. Ajikawo arashobora kumvikana kuri \"Leave to Remain\" amashusho yindirimbo, akora indirimbo \"Kureka Nukwo\". Mu ntangiriro za 2013, yagaragaye kuri Radiyo BBC 1Xtra kugira ngo aganire ku mikorere ye muri weekend ya Hackney. Ajikawo yagiye gukora isomo rya Maida Vale kuri Huw Stephens. Yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye ya mbere muri studio, \"Amatsiko Y\u2019ibigeragezo + Abantu\", ku ya 18 Nzeri 2015.\n2018\u20132021: \"Agace keza\", \"Kamanuka 6\" kandi \"Rimwe na rimwe nshobora kuba intore\".\nAjikawo asohora umuziki we \"kumyaka ye bwite yumuziki 101\" Yanditseho umuziki hamwe na AWAL Recordings. Ku ya 6 Nzeri 2018, Ajikawo na label ye AGE 101 basinyanye amasezerano n\u2019isi yose na AWAL Recordings, nyuma yuko AWAL imaze gukwirakwiza alubumu ye ya mbere yise \"Amatsiko y\u2019amatsiko y\u2019ibigeragezo + abantu\" mu 2015. Aya masezerano yongerewe ku ya 18 Kamena 2020. \nUbuzima bwite.\nAjikawo aba i Londres. Ni inshuti yo mu bwana bwumukinnyi Fady Elsayed numukinnyi wa filime Letitia Wright. Ajikawo na Wright bakomeje kuba inshuti nziza kandi Ajikawo yafotoye Wright kubera ibihangano by'indirimbo ye yise \"Kwikunda\" mu mwaka wa \nAjikawo numufana wa Arsenal FC \nMuri 2018 inshuti ye, umunyamideli Harry Uzoka, yarishwe, byamuteye inkunga yo kwandika indirimbo ye \"Ibikomere\". \nGukina.\nUmwuga we wo gukina wa Ajikawo watangiriye akina ari Vicky mu kiganiro cy\u2019abana ba BBC cyitwa Spirit Warriors, cyatangajwe mu mwaka wa 2010, ndetse na Meleka muri televiziyo ya E4 \"Youngers\". Yavugaga kuri televiziyo \"Afrofuturism\", na Shelley mu isubukurwa rya Netflix rya \"Top\" \"Boy\", ryerekanwe bwa mbere mu mpeshyi ya 2019. \nUbucukumbuzi.\nAlbum za studio"}
{"id": "21338", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21338", "title": "Tobi Lou", "text": "Tobi Adeyemi (yavutse ku ya 3 Ugushyingo 1988), uzwi cyane nka tobi lou, ni umuhanzi ufite inkomoko muri Nijeriya no muri Amerika; akaba akora umwuga wo kuririmba, kwandika indirimbo, kurapa no gutunganya umuziki. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nTobi Adeyemi yavukiye i Lagos akurira i Chicago. Yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Homewood-Flossmoor ndetse n\u2019ishuri ryisumbuye rya Hinsdale, ari naho yatangiye gufata amajwi. Yize muri kaminuza ya Illinois aho yakinnye umukino wa baseball hanyuma SUNY Albany na kaminuza ya Florida A&amp;amp;M, aho yakinaga umupira wamaguru wa kaminuza mumakipe yombi. Nyuma yo kutandikwa mu mushinga wa MLB wa 2011, yakinnye imyaka 2 ya kimwe cya kabiri cya baseball ya Joliet Slammers nkumukinnyi wo hanze mbere yo kugenda muri 2012 kubera imvune. Mu 2014, yimukiye i Los Angeles kugira ngo akomeze umwuga we wa muzika. Igihe yari i Los Angeles, yakoraga nk'umushoferi wa Uber. \nUmwuga.\n2015\u20132018: Intangiriro na \"tobi lou na\" Trilogy.\nKu ya 16 Nzeri 2015, Adeyemi yasohoye indirimbo ye ya mbere, \"Pretty Please\". Muri 2015, yasohoye indirimbo \"Uruhinja rwawe\" ku izina rya Wonda. Ku ya 9 Gashyantare 2018, yasohoye umuzingo w'indirimbo mugufi wa mbere, \"tobi lou n'ukwezi\". Ku ya 8 Werurwe 2018, yasohoye indirimbo \"Troop\" irimo Smino. Ku ya 9 Werurwe 2018, Ikitari Cyasohoye alubumu \"Ntabwo Ibintu Byiza Byose\", byari bikubiyemo indirimbo \"Monsters\" irimo Adeyemi na Michael Noheri. Ku ya 27 Mata 2018, yasohoye imizingo mito y'indirimbo \"tobi lou na\" \"Loop\", zari zirimo indirimbo \"Buff Baby\", yamamaye cyane kuri TikTok. Ku Kamena 2020, \"Buff Baby\" yemejwe na zahabu n\u2019ishyirahamwe ryandika amajwi muri Amerika. Ku ya 10 Kanama 2018, yasohoye imizingo mito y'indirimbo \"tobi lou n'umutobe\". Ku ya 6 Ukwakira 2018, yatangiriye ku mbonerahamwe ya Billboard Next Big Sound, igera ku mwanya wa 8. Ku ya 18 Ukuboza 2018, Penomeco yasohoye umuzingo muto w'indirimbo \"ubusitani\" bwe, bwagaragayemo Adeyemi ku ndirimbo \"Cool\". Adeyemi na Marc E. Bassy bifatanije na Kyle mu ruzinduko rwe \"Lightpeed\" 2018. \n2019\u20132022: \"Baho ku rubura, Lingo Starr,\" kandi \"Ntishobora Kurimbuka\".\nMuri 2019, Adeyemi yatangiye urugendo rwe rwa mbere, urugendo \"Ibyishimo + Birenze Agahinda\" hamwe na Liltrxptendo na femdot. Urugendo rwatangiye ku ya 12 Nzeri 2019 i Minneapolis, rukarangira ku ya 20 Ukwakira 2019 i Chicago. Ku ya 2 Kanama 2019, yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye ya mbere yuzuye ya studio yuzuye, \"Live On Ice,\" yerekana abashyitsi bagaragaye muri Erica Ren\u00e9, Cam O'bi, Rockie Fresh, Soundbwoy, sawa (K), Glassface, Vernon, Ryan Destiny, Djemba Djemba, na LeJKeys. Iyi alubumu yageze kuri 45 ku mbonerahamwe yigenga ya Amerika yigenga na 14 ku mbonerahamwe ya Heatseekers yo muri Amerika. Ku ya 19 Ukwakira 2019, yashyizwe ku mwanya wa 50 kuri Bandsintown x Billboard US Rising Artists Index. Ku ya 22 Ugushyingo 2019, Ryan Destiny yasohoye indirimbo \"Kimwe\" irimo Adeyemi. Adeyemi yagaragaye ku ndirimbo \"Sengera Ukuri\" ya Peter CottonTale, hamwe na Chance the Rapper, kuri Album ya CatchTale \"yitwa Catch\", yasohotse ku ya 17 Mata 2020. Indirimbo yageze kuri 24 ku mbonerahamwe ya Gospel Airplay. Adeyemi yagaragaye ku ndirimbo \"Maroc\" ya Kota Inshuti, kuri alubumu ye \"Byose\", yasohotse ku ya 22 Gicurasi 2020. Ku ya 3 Nyakanga 2020, yasohoye \"EP ya Lingo Starr\". Ku ya 10 Ugushyingo 2020, yasohoye indirimbo \"Okay\" hamwe na Dreezy. Ku ya 24 Ugushyingo 2020, Saba yasohoye indirimbo \"Areyoudown? Pt. 2\", irimo Adeyemi. Ku ya 23 Mutarama 2021, yashyizwe ku mwanya wa 2 ku rutonde rwa Billboard Top Chicago Emerging R &amp; B / Hip-Hop Abahanzi 2021. Ku Werurwe 2022, hasohotse alubumu ye ya studio \"Non-Perishable\", igaragaramo abashyitsi ba T-Pain, Jean Deaux, na Chika. Iyi alubumu yageze ku mbonerahamwe ya Billboard yo muri Amerika Yagurishijwe, 46 ku mbonerahamwe yo kugurisha Album ya Amerika muri iki gihe, na 5 ku mbonerahamwe ya Heatseekers yo muri Amerika. Ku ya 2 Mata 2021, Rockie Fresh yashyize ahagaragara alubumu \"Slid Thru Pt 2\", irimo Adeyemi na Jeff Kaale ku ndirimbo \"Gucci\". Ku ya 25 Werurwe 2022, yashyizwe ku mwanya wa 33 ku mbonerahamwe y\u2019abahanzi Emerging Abahanzi. Ku ya 29 Nyakanga 2022, Album ya Warren Hue \"y\u2019umuhungu w\u2019umwaka\" yasohotse, irimo Adeyemi ku ndirimbo \"Mu gikapu cyanjye.\" \n2023 - ubungubu: \"Ikirere cya Baggy\", \"Mumbabarire Natinze\", kandi \"Niyubashye\".\nKu ya 31 Werurwe 2023, yasohoye alubumu \"Baggy Weather\", igaragaramo abashyitsi ba Chief Keef na eaJ, nk'umwihariko kuri porogaramu ye ya TobiLoop. 'Mini-verisiyo' ya alubumu yasohotse umunsi umwe kuri serivise zitangwa. Ku ya 5 Gicurasi 2023, yasohoye umuzingo muto windirimbo \"Mumbabarire Natinze\". muri T-Pain mu ruzinduko rwe \"\"\" Guhunga Kuva Wiscansin: Igitero \" mu mpeshyi ya 2023. Muri, yatangaje urugendo rwa \"Perish Ubururu\" hamwe na grouptherapy. Urugendo rutangira ku ya 21 Nzeri 2023 i Houston, rukarangira ku ya 29 Ukwakira 2023 i Phoenix. Ku ya 15 Nzeri 2023, yasohoye indirimbo \"Cobra\" irimo Young Thug. Ku Ukwakira 2023, Adeyemi yitwaye nka K'Sante muri Ligue ya Legends itsinda ryitwa Heartsteel, hamwe na Baekhyun, \u00d8ZI, na Cal Scruby, mu ndirimbo yabo ya mbere yise \"Paranoia\". \nUbuhanzi.\nTobi Lou yatangaje ko abahanzi barimo Andr\u00e9 3000, The Notorious BIG, Will Smith, Tupac, NSYNC, Timbaland, Frank Ocean, Missy Elliott, Maroon 5, Pharrell Williams, na Kanye West bamutera inkunga. "}
{"id": "21339", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21339", "title": "Amaarae", "text": "Ama Serwah Genfi (wavutse ku ya 4 Nyakanga 1994), uzwi cyane nka Amaarae, ni umuhanzi w\u2019indirimbo akaba n\u2019umwanditsi. Yamenyekanye mu buryo bwe budasanzwe buhuriza hamwe pop, R&amp;B, Afrobeats na alt\u00e9, ndetse n\u2019imyambarire iranga ubwisanzure n\u2019igitsina. Nyuma yo gukorana n\u2019abahanzi bo mu karere no gusohora indirimbo nto zitarimo alubumu, mu 2017 yashyize hanze umuzingo mugufi we wa mbere yise Passionfruit Summers. \nMuri 2020, Amaarae yasohoye alubumu ye ya mbere \"Umumarayika Utazi\" gushimwa. Indirimbo \" Sad Girlz Luv Money \" irimo Moliy yamenyekanye cyane kuri TikTok. Mu 2021 indirimbo yasubiwemo hamwe na Kali Uchis kandi ishushanyije ku isi yose. Pitchfork yanditse alubumu \"Umuziki mushya mwiza\" maze ayita alubumu ya 19 nziza ya 2020.\nKu ya 9 Kamena 2023, yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye ya kabiri yari itegerejwe na benshi \"Isoko Baby\" kugira ngo itangwe ibitekerezo. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nAmaarae yavukiye i Bronx, muri New York kwa Ama Bawuah na Kwadwo Boateng Genfi akurira hagati ya Atlanta, New Jersey na Accra, muri Gana. Ni mukuru w'abana babiri. Amaarae yanditse indirimbo ye ya mbere afite imyaka Yibutse imvugo idasanzwe ya Kelis yamubereye umwete. \nYize mu ishuri mpuzamahanga rya Gana imyaka mike. Mu mashuri yisumbuye, yatangiye gukora imvange y'umuziki. Afite imyaka 17, yimenyereje muri studio yumuziki. Mu kigo cya kaminuza, yitoje amajwi kandi yubahiriza ubuhanga bwe bwo kwandika indirimbo yiga ubuvanganzo bw'icyongereza. Yasubiye muri Gana muri Kamena 2017. \nUmwuga.\nAmaarae yanditse imvange y'indirimbo ye ya mbere, \"Muri Splendid Isolation\", ISI muri make, afite imyaka 17 igihe yari muri Gana. Irimo indirimbo \"Yaje Mbere\", Amaarae yakiriye \"Cassie\" ya Cassie na Ryan Leslie, n'indirimbo \"CrukdStr8\", azunguruka kuri \" A $$ \" ya Big Sean.\nAmaarae yashyize ahagaragara umushinga we wa mbere \"Passionfruit Summers\" muri 2017. Iyi alubumu irimo indirimbo \"Fluid\", yunganirwa n'amashusho y'indirimbo. \nAmaarae yagizwe \"umwe\" mu bahanzi bashya bakunzwe muri Afurika muri Mata \u00a0imurikagurisha ryabereye i Lagos, muri Nijeriya. \nKu ya 12 Ugushyingo 2020, Amaarae yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye ya mbere ya studio, \"Umumarayika Utazi\". Owen Myers wo muri \"Pitchfork\" yanditse ko \"bivuguruzanya no guhanga udushya, mu gihe abantu bakomeye bo mu nganda bakanguka ku kuri kuva kera ko Afurika ishyiraho umuvuduko w\u2019umuziki wa pop.\" \nKu ya 14 Mata 2025, Amaarae yakoze amateka nk'umuhanzi wa mbere wo muri Gana wakoze wenyine ku giti cye mu iserukiramuco ry'umuziki n'ubuhanzi rya Coachella. Imyitwarire ye kuri Stage ya Gobi yagaragayemo inzira n'indirimbo zidashyizwe ahagaragara n'abahanzi bo muri Gana nka La M\u00eame Gang, Eazzy, Joey B, na Asakaa Boys. Muri iki gitaramo, yatangaje alubumu ye yise \"Black Star\" kandi yiyogoshesha umutwe kuri stage, iyi ikaba yarashimishije cyane ku mbuga nkoranyambaga. \nKu ya 8 Kanama 2025, Amaarae yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye ya gatatu \"Black Star\". Amashusho yindirimbo yemewe ya \"Fineshyt\" nayo yasohotse kumunsi umwe. "}
{"id": "21340", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21340", "title": "Mereba", "text": "Marian Azeb Mereba, uzwi nka Mereba, ni umuhanzi w\u2019Umunyamerika uririmba, ucuranga hip-hop, ukandika indirimbo, akaba anakora umuziki nk\u2019umutunganya bwite. \nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nMereba yavukiye i Montgomery, muri Alabama, akurira muri Pennsylvania. Se akomoka muri Etiyopiya. Nyina ni Umunyamerika kandi yavukiye kandi akurira i Milwaukee, muri Wisconsin. Umuryango we wimutse kenshi kubera akazi k'ababyeyi be nk'abarimu ba kaminuza. \nMereba yabanje gukunda umuziki afite imyaka ine. Yatangiye kwandika indirimbo mu mashuri abanza yiga gucuranga piyano na gitari. Yize amashuri yisumbuye i Greensboro, muri Karoline y'Amajyaruguru. \nMereba yize muri kaminuza ya Carnegie Mellon mbere yo kwimukira muri Spelman College. Yarangije muri Spelman mu 2011 afite impamyabumenyi y\u2019icyongereza n\u2019umwangavu muto. \nUmwuga.\n2013\u20132017: \"Icyumba cyo Kubamo\", \"Radio Flyer\", n'umudugudu wa Spillage.\nNyuma yimyaka itari mike akora ibitaramo muri muzika yindie muri Atlanta, Mereba yishyize ahagaragara umushinga we wa mbere wumuzingo w'indirimbo ngufi \"Icyumba cyo Kubamo\", ku izina rye ryuzuye, ku ya 14 Gashyantare 2013. \n2018\u20132019, 2021: \"Ishyamba ninzira yonyine yo gusohoka\" &amp; \"Glock Peaceful\".\nMu mwaka wa 2018, Mereba yasinyanye na Interscope Records, \" ahita asohora indirimbo \"Ikamyo\" \"Yirabura\" \" na \"Umubumbe.\nKu ya 13 Ukuboza 2021, Mereba yasohoye \"Glock Peaceful\", iteganya igihugu kitarangwamo ihohoterwa rikorerwa imbunda n'ubugome bwa polisi. Indirimbo yagaragaye kuri saison 5 yikiganiro \"Umutekano muke\" wakozwe na Issa Rae kuri HBO Max. \n2024-ubungubu: \"Umuyaga watwitse umuriro\".\nMu Kwakira 2024, byatangajwe ko Mereba yasinyanye amasezerano n\u2019umunyakanada rwihishwa, asohora indirimbo \"Impimbano\", yabaye iyambere muri alubumu ye ya kabiri \"yitwa The Breeze Grew a Fire,\" yasohotse ku ya 14 Gashyantare 2025. \nIngaruka.\nMereba yavuze ko Stevie Wonder nk'umujyanama ndetse n'umuziki ukomeye. Muri 2017, yakinnye hamwe na Wonder muri Malibu. "}
{"id": "21341", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21341", "title": "Cruel Santino", "text": "Osayaba Andrew Ize-Iyamu, uzwi cyane nka Cruel Santino, ni umuhanzi wo muri Nijeriya uririmba, yandika indirimbo, arapa kandi akanayobora amashusho. Ari mu itsinda rya Monster Boys hamwe n\u2019abatunganya umuziki Genio Bambino na GMK. Afite amasezerano na Interscope Records mu bufatanye na Monster Boy, ndetse na Warner Chappell Music. Yatangiye kumenyekana cyane nyuma yo gusohora alubumu ye ya mbere Mandy &amp; The Jungle, yamufashije kumurika injyana ya alt\u00e9 no kuyamamaza, cyane cyane binyuze mu ndirimbo ye \u201cRapid Fire\".\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nOsayaba Andrew Ize-Iyamu yavukiye i Lagos ku ya 3 Kamena 1992, akurira Ikeja. Yari umuhuzabikorwa wikinamico yingimbi mumashuri yisumbuye. Amaze kurangiza amashuri, yitabiriye gahunda y'umujyi wose nk'umuririmbyi wuduce duto. Mu kiganiro na GQ yo mu Bwongereza, yagize ati \"Numvise alubumu ya mbere ya Drake, Urakoze Nyuma. Kumva umuntu uririmba na rap byanyemeje ko nshobora kubikora.\" Se yari ashinzwe kwumwigisha umuziki we, mumikurire ye. \nUmwuga.\n2011\u20132016: Ozzy B kuri Santi, Gushyingura Suzie, Ubwoba bwa Gangsta.\nMu mwaka wa 2011, yatangije umwuga we wa muzika nk'umuraperi kuri SoundCloud, ku izina rya stage Ozzy B. Ku ya 13 Nzeri 2011, yasohoye imvange y'imirongo 21 yiswe \"Diaries of Loner\", kuri SoundCloud. Mu isuzuma rya We Plug Music Nziza, Neefemi, yagize ati \"umushinga ni umwe mu mvange nziza ya Nijeriya hamwe nigihe\". Ku ya 29 Nzeri 2013, yasohoye ivanga rye rya kabiri \"Ivuka rya Santi\". Mu mwaka wa 2016, yahinduye izina ry'ubuhanzi ayita Santi, hasohotse umuzingo we wa mbere wagutse \"wo gushyingura Suzie\", abinyujije kuri Monster Boy ku ya 30 Kamena 2016.\nKu ya 29 Kamena 2016, \"Gangsta Fear\" indirimbo yahimbye, yanditswe na Odunsi Moteri, gutandukana na SoundCloud, hamwe nibintu bya afro-Dancehall. Nyuma yo gusohora amashusho yindirimbo iyobowe na Falomo na Santi ubwe. Inyandiko yabaye intsinzi mubucuruzi mubindi bice bya muzika, muri Nijeriya, no mubwongereza.\n2017\u20132018: Ijwi rya OVO, Gukubita 1, Ibitaramo, umuriro wihuse.\nMuri 2017, yafunguye Skepta mu gitaramo Cyacu cyo gutaha muri Nijeriya. [\u200b\u200b\u200b Ku ya 29 Ukuboza 2017, yafunguye Show Dem Camp muri Palmwine Music Fest, ari kumwe na Bez, Ajebutter22, Lady Donli, Odunsi, Tomi Thomas, n'abandi. Ku ya 21 Mutarama 2018, Santino, Odunsi, MAKA, na Lady Donli, kivuga ku kinyamakuru cyitwa Guardian Life Magazine, Vibes Of The New Age Edition, aho bavugaga kuri gahunda zabo z'ejo hazaza. \nKu ya 2 Ugushyingo 2018, nka Santi, yasohoye \"Rapid Fire\", irimo Shane Eagle, Tomi Agape, na Amaarae binyuze kuri Monster Boy, kandi yakozwe na Genio Bambino. Nyuma y\u2019ikiganiro yagiranye na Julie Adenuga, na Ebro Darden, kuri Apple Music 1, yamenyekanye ku rwego mpuzamahanga.\nMuri 2018, yasinyanye amasezerano y\u2019ubufatanye na Carolina y'Amajyaruguru - ashingiye ku buryo budasobanutse, kandi asohora \"imihango yo gushyingura Suzie\". \n2019\u20132020: Mandy &amp; Ishyamba, Inyandiko zandika, Nta marira mu ishyamba ryerekana.\nKu ya 17 Gicurasi 2019, ku izina rye rya mbere ryitwa Santi, Santino yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye ya mbere ya studio \"Mandy &amp; The Jungle\", agaragara cyane muri DRAM, GoldLink, Tay Iwar, Amaarae, Krisirie, Nonso Amadi, Bridge, Shane Eagle, Kida Kudz, Seki, na Tomi Agape. Hamwe n'inguzanyo zitangwa na Odunsi (Moteri), GMK, Higo, LeMav, DOZ, na Genio Bambino. Mandy &amp; The Jungle, yavuzwe nka imwe muri alubumu Murinzi hamwe na tracks zo muri 2019. \nKu ya 28 Kanama 2019, Santino uzwi nka Santi, yayoboye amashusho y\u2019indirimbo \"U Say\" ya GoldLink, agaragaza Tyler, Umuremyi, na Jay Prince, kuri alubumu ya studio ya Diaspora. Ku ya 6 Gashyantare 2020, Santi ku murongo w\u2019ibirori bya Lovebox, biteganijwe kubera muri Gunnersbury Park i Londres, kuva ku ya 12-14 Kamena. Nyuma y\u2019ikwirakwizwa rya coronavirus ikomeje, ibirori byahagaritswe. Ku ya 3 Ugushyingo 2019, yakinnye mu birori bya Day n Vegas muri Las Vegas Festival Grounds, akingurira Tyler, Umuremyi, na Cat Cat.\nKu ya 10 Ugushyingo 2020, yaririmbye kuri Stage ya Gnaw, ya Camp Flog Gnaw Carnival. Ku ya 5 Ukuboza 2019, yayoboye ikiganiro cye cya mbere i Londres, yise Nta marira mu ishyamba, mu Nzu y'Amakoraniro ya Islington. Ku ya 3 Werurwe 2020, Santi yerekanye gahunda ye, yo gukora ikiganiro kuri televiziyo kivuga ku muco w'urubyiruko rwo muri Nijeriya. Abwira Crack Magazine ati: \"Aho niho umutima wanjye uri ubu. Muri Nijeriya, ntabwo twigeze tugira igitaramo kijyanye n'amashuri yisumbuye, igitsina ndetse n'ibiyobyabwenge. Ndumva abana bakeneye umwanya utekanye, ikintu cyo gushakisha no guhungira.\" \nKuva 2021: Amasezerano yo gutangaza, Subaru Boys: IJURU RYA NYUMA.\nKu ya 17 Gashyantare 2021, nyuma y\u2019ubufatanye bwo gutangaza hagati ya Warner Chappell Music, na Love Renaissance, itsinda rya Monster Boys (Cruel Santino, GMK, na Genio Bambino) ryasinyanye amasezerano yo gusohora na Warner Chappell Music. Ku ya 4 Werurwe 2022, yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye yari yitezwe na \"Subaru Boys: IJURU RYA NYUMA\", binyuze muri Interscope Records, hamwe nabashyitsi bagaragaye muri Brazy, Maison2500, Bratzbih, Seo, Ebee, Kawa, Gus Dapperton, Amaarae, Chi Virgo, Solis, na Skepta. Rolling Stone yashyize alubumu kurutonde rwabo rwa Album 100 nziza zo mu 2022. Ku ya 10 Gashyantare 2023, Santino yasohoye \"Showmetheway !!\" irimo Poco Lee, kandi yakozwe na GMK kuri Monster Boy. \nUbuhanzi.\nSantino azwiho kuvanga no guhuza amajwi atandukanye, kuva R&amp;B, roho na rap kugeza Afrobeats n'umuziki wa indie. Ku ya 11 Kamena 2019, Toye Sokunbi wo muri The Fader, yamwise izina nk'icyerekezo cy'ejo hazaza ha Afropop. Umugome Santino, wahoze azwi ku izina rya Ozzy B cyangwa Santi, azwiho kubyara ragga yatewe no gutanga imisatsi, imisatsi ndetse n'imyambarire. Ku ya 31 Gicurasi 2019, mu kiganiro n'ikinyamakuru Clash, Osayaba Andrew Ize-Iyamu yivugiye ko \"yagize uruhare mu njyana zose, byanze bikunze umuntu ku giti cye. Yashishikarije izina rye kuva Santigold. Yatewe inkunga na Beenie Man, na Young Thug, ndetse no kuba yarakozwe n'umuhanzi w'indie na hip-hop, byamufashije kwiteza imbere nk'umuhanzi.\" "}
{"id": "21342", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21342", "title": "Tems", "text": "Temilade Openiyi (wavutse ku ya 11 Kamena 1995), uzwi nka Tems, ni umuhanzi wo muri Nijeriya uririmba, yandika indirimbo kandi akabikora no mu buryo bwo gutunganya umuziki. Yatangiye kumenyekana cyane ubwo yafatanyaga na Wizkid ku ndirimbo \u201cEssence\u201d yo mu 2020, yak later igera ku mwanya wa 9 kuri Billboard Hot 100 nyuma yo gusubirwamo na na Justin Bieber. Iyo ndirimbo yamuhesheje igihembo cya Grammy. Muri uwo mwaka kandi, yagaragaye ku ndirimbo \u201cFountains\u201d ya Drake, umuraperi wo muri Kanada.\nMuri 2020, Tems yasohoye umuzgino we wa mbere wagutse (EP), \"Kumatwi yamenetse\". Yasinyanye na RCA Records kugirango arekure umuzingo we wa kabiri, \"Niba Orange yari Ikibanza\" (2021). Mu 2022, amajwi ya Tems yo mu ndirimbo ye \" Hejuru \" yatoranijwe na Future ku ndirimbo ye yise \" Ndagutegereje \", bituma amenyekana nk'umuhanzi w'umushyitsi hamwe na Drake. Iyi ndirimbo yatangiriye kuri \"Billboard\" Hot 100, bituma aba umuhanzi wa mbere nyafurika akaba numuhanzi wa kabiri wo muri Nigeriya ufite indirimbo abikora ku mbonerahamwe. Indirimbo yamuhesheje igihembo cya Grammy igihembo cyiza cya Melodic Rap. Tems yerekanaga \" Nta Mugore, Nta gutaka \" ya Bob Marley kuri Album ya \"Black Panther: Album ya Wakanda Forever\" yamajwi muri Nyakanga 2022 kandi muri uko kwezi, indirimbo ye \" Free Mind \" (yari iri kumuzingo we wambere) yatangiriye kuri \"Billboard\" Hot 100, igera ku mwanya wa 46 kandi yandika amateka y\u2019abagore ku ndirimbo ndende ya mbere yerekana urutonde rwa R &amp;amp; B / Hip-Hop. \u200b\u200b Yanafatanyije kandi nabandi kwandika no gutunganya amajwi yinyuma mundirimbo \"Nzamura hejuru\" ya Rihanna byatumye itoranywa muri, ndetse na \u200b \u200b \nMu 2024, Tems yasohoye alubumu ye ya mbere ya studio \"Yavukiye mu gasozi\" kugirango ashimwe. Iyi alubumu yageze kuri 30 ba mbere mu Buholandi, mu Busuwisi no mu Bwongereza, aho yageze ku mwanya wa 24. Yatangiye kuvuka kwe muri Born in the Wild Tour, kuzenguruka isi.] \u200b\u200b\"\u200b\"\u200b\u200b\u200b Tems yabaye umuhanzi wa mbere wo muri Nigeriya ufite ibihembo byinshi bya Grammy. \nMu mibereho ye yose, Tems yahawe ibihembo byinshi, harimo ibihembo bibiri bya Grammy, ibihembo bya Billboard Women in Music Award, ibihembo bine bya NAACP Image Awards, BET Awards bine na Soul Train Music Awards eshatu. \nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nTems yavutse ku ya 11 Kamena 1995, i Lagos, muri Nijeriya. Izina rye rya mbere Temilade risobanura \"ikamba ni ryanjye\" muri Yoruba; akomoka mu bwoko bwa Yoruba. Umuryango we wimukiye mu Bwongereza akiri uruhinja, nyuma asubira muri Nijeriya nyuma yo gutandukana kw'ababyeyi be, afite imyaka itanu. Tems yabaga Ilupeju mbere yo kwimukira i Lekki nyuma Ajah. Yize muri kaminuza ya Dowen yisumbuye na Monash Afurika y'Epfo kubera amashuri makuru, aho yakuye impamyabumenyi mu by'ubukungu. \nMu mashuri yisumbuye, yakundaga gutotezwa kubera ijwi rye. Afite imyaka 11, yinjiye muri korari y'ishuri maze bidatinze atangira kuririmba muri falsetto ariko abonwa numwarimu wumuziki wamutoje akamwigisha gucuranga piyano. Tems yakundaga kwitoza kuririmbana na murumuna we, wakundaga kumuherekeza kuri gitari. \nUmwuga.\n2018\u20132021: Intangiriro yumwuga nimizingo yagutse.\nMuri 2018, Tems yaretse akazi mu kwamamaza hakoreshejwe ikoranabuhanga kugira ngo akore umwuga wa muzika. Yatangiye kwiga ubuhanga bwo kwikorera kuri YouTube maze ku ya 18 Nyakanga 2018, asohora indirimbo ye ya mbere yise \"Mr Rebel\", indirimbo yayikoze wenyine. Ku ya 7 Kanama 2019, yasohoye indirimbo \"Gerageza\". Muri 2020, DJ Edu yamuhisemo kuba umwe mu \"bahanzi icumi bareba\" muri uwo mwaka. Ku Mata 2020, Tems yagaragaye ari kumwe n\u2019umuririmbyi mugenzi we wo muri Nijeriya Davido kuri verisiyo yakozwe n\u2019umuhanzi w\u2019indirimbo w\u2019umunyamerika witwa Khalid hamwe n\u2019indirimbo ya elegitoroniki y\u2019icyongereza ya Disclosure yise \u201c Menya agaciro kawe \u201d. \nKu ya 25 Nzeri 2020, Tems yasohoye umuzingo we wa mbere wagutse, \"Ku matwi yamenetse\". Yakozwe cyane cyane na we kandi indirimbo \" Indishyi \" yariri kumuzingo yabaye iyindi yakurikiranwe kuri \"Gerageza\", igera ku mwanya wa mbere ku mbonerahamwe ya muzika ya Apple yo muri Nijeriya na nimero ya gatandatu ku mbonerahamwe ya TurnTable Top 50 yashyizwe ahagaragara kandi imaze kubona miliyoni eshanu kuri YouTube. Ku ya 30 Ukwakira 2020, Tems yagaragaye ku ndirimbo mugenzi we wo muri Nijeriya Wizkid, \" Essence \", muri alubumu ya kane ya sitidiyo, \"Made i Lagos\". Indirimbo yamuhesheje umwanya wa mbere kuri BBC 1Xtra Airplay Chart. kandi umwuga we wa mbere kuri Billboard Hot. Ku ya 8 Ugushyingo 2020, Tems yashyizwe muri Future Awards Africa: Icyiciro cya 2020. \nKu ya 13 Kanama 2021, hasohotse verisiyo yakozwe na \"Essence\", ikubiyemo ikindi kintu cy\u2019umuririmbyi w\u2019umunyakanada Justin Bieber, yasohotse, bituma iyi ndirimbo igera ku mwanya wa cyenda kuri Billboard Hot 100. Ku ya 3 Nzeri 2021, Tems yagaragaye ku ndirimbo y\u2019umuraperi n\u2019umuririmbyi wa Drake, \" Isoko \", kuva kuri alubumu ya gatandatu ya sitidiyo ya nyuma, \"yitwa Certificate Lover Boy\", yatangiriye ku \"mwanya\" wa 26 kuri Hot Yakozwe mbere na mbere na GuiltyBeatz, kandi indirimbo \"Crazy Tings\" yasohotse hasigaye iminsi itanu ngo igere ku mwanya wa gatatu ku mbonerahamwe ya Afrobeats y\u2019Ubwongereza. \"]\" \u200b \"\u200b\"\u200b \n2022\u20132023: Iterambere.\nKu ya 31 Werurwe 2022, Umuziki wa Apple 1 watangije ikiganiro cya Vibe Radio Yerekana hamwe na Tems. Ku ya 2 Mata, igice cyayo cya mbere kirimo isura ya Muyiwa Awoniyi, na Tunji Balogun. Ku Mata 2022, Tems yagaragaye hamwe na Drake ku ndirimbo y\u2019umuraperi w\u2019umunyamerika Future, \" Ndagutegereje \", kuva kuri alubumu ya cyenda ya studio, \"Sinigeze Nkunda\". Indirimbo yatangiriye kuri Hot 100, bituma Tems umuhanzi wambere wumugore wumugore wumukobwa wambere wambere kurutonde nibindi byinshi byambere kuri chart. Indirimbo yerekana indirimbo \" Hejuru \" yo \"Kumatwi yamenetse\". \nMuri Nyakanga 2022, Tems yerekanaga \" Nta mugore, nta kurira \" ya Bob Marley ya filime ya Marvel yitwa \"Black Panther: Wakanda Forever\" amajwi yakunzwe na Rihanna. Ku ya 26 Nyakanga, Tems yungutse inshuro ya kane Ashyushye 100 n'indirimbo ye \" \"Free Mind\" \" yakuye \"kuri Broken Ears\" yagaragaye ku mbonerahamwe igera ku mwanya wa 44 na nimero ya 1 ku mbonerahamwe y'indirimbo Afrobeats yo muri Amerika. Byamuhesheje icyemezo cya mbere cya platine na silver wenyine wenyine muri Amerika no mubwongereza. \"]\" \u200b \u200b\u200b\"\u200b\" \nKu ya 5 Ukwakira 2023, Tems yasohoye indirimbo \" Me &amp;amp; U \". yerekana indirimbo yambere Tems yasohoye ari wenyine kuva yasohora Iyaba Orange hari ahantu, usibye igifuniko cye cya Bob Marley yise \" Nta Mugore, Nta kurira \" yasohotse mu 2022. \"Me &amp; U\" yahawe igihembo cyindirimbo mpuzamahanga Yindashyikirwa muri 55 ya NAACP Image Awards nigihembo cyiza cya Dr. Bobby Jones Igihembo cyiza cya Gospel / Inspirational Award.\nKu ya 5 Ukuboza 2023, Tems yatangaje ko indirimbo ye ya kabiri y'umwaka \" Ntabwo ari Umumarayika \" izasohoka ku ya 8 Ukuboza. \n2024 - ubungubu: \"Kuvukira mu gasozi\".\nMuri Werurwe 2024, Tems abaye umuririmbyi wa mbere wo muri Afurika wahawe igihembo cya Billboard Women in Music Award aho yahawe mu cyiciro cya Breakthrough. Alubumu yambere ya studio ya Tems \"yavukiye mu gasozi\" yasohotse ku ya 7 Nyakanga Kamena kandi izashyigikirwa n\u2019uruzinduko ku isi. Indirimbo \" Nkunda MeJJe \" kuri alubumu yaramenyekanye kandi ireba mbere ya Tems ya mbere ya Coachella yashyizwe ahagaragara isohoka ku ya 25 Mata.] \u200b\u200b \nMu 2025, Tems abaye umunyarwandakazi wa mbere wagize uruhare mu ikipe yumupira wamaguru wa Shampiyona nkuru yinjira mu itsinda rya San Diego FC. Yatunguwe no gusohora umuzingo \"Urukundo rwe ni Ubwami\" ku ya 21 Ugushyingo \nUbuhanzi.\nNyina wa Tems yamwemereye gusa kumva umuziki wa gikristo akiri umwana. Mu myaka ye y'ubwangavu, yashishikajwe na R&amp;amp;B na hip hop, atangira kumva abahanzi nka Burna Boy, Lauryn Hill, Adele, Rihanna, Coldplay, Paramore, na Asa. Yateze amatwi kandi Destiny's Child, Beyonc\u00e9, Lil Wayne, na Aaliyah, kandi yigeze kuvuga indirimbo ya Alicia Keys yo mu 2004, \" Niba ntakubonye \" mu gitaramo cya Live. Tems yiswe Aaliyah, \" Koga Nziza \" ya Frank Ocean, na \" I Gotta Find Peace of Mind \" ya Lauryn Hill nk'ibitekerezo byubaka muri icyo gihe, avuga ko indirimbo ya Hill ari \"cyane, mu mwuka cyane\". Yagaragaje uburyo umuziki w'abo bahanzi wamufashije kumva uburyo indirimbo zishobora guhuza amarangamutima, gutanga isano yo mu mwuka, no kuba inzira yo kwigaragaza neza. \nUbucukumbuzi.\nAlbum za studio\nImizingo yagutse\nIngendo.\nUmutwe\nIbihembo naho yatoranyijwe.\nTems yahawe ibihembo byinshi, harimo ibihembo bibiri bya Grammy, Billboard Women in Music Award, ibihembo bine bya NAACP, ibihembo bine BET na Soul Train Music Awards eshatu. "}
{"id": "21344", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21344", "title": "Urutonde rw'ubutumwa bwa diplomasi mu Rwanda", "text": "Uru ni urutonde rw'ubutumwa bwa diplomasi mu Rwanda. Umurwa mukuru Kigali kuri ubu ubarizwamo ambasade 44 na komisiyo nkuru.\nInshingano za diplomasi muri Kigali.\nAmbasade na Komisiyo Nkuru.\nIbyanditswe byanditseho inyenyeri (*) ni ibihugu byibumbiye mu muryango wa Commonwealth. Ibyo bihugu nibyo ambassade zabyo zitwa komisiyo nkuru cyangwa 'High Commission' mu rurimi rw'icyongerezarimi rw'icyongereza."}
{"id": "21345", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21345", "title": "Burna Boy", "text": "Damini Ebunoluwa Ogulu (wavutse ku ya 2 Nyakanga 1991), uzwi ku izina rya Burna Boy, ni umuraperi wo muri Nijeriya, umwanditsi w'indirimbo, ndetse na producer. Yamenyekanye cyane muri 2012 nyuma yo gushyira ahagaragara \"Like to Party\", indirimbo ya mbere ku muzingo we wambere we yakoreye muri studio ' (2013). Muri 2017, Burna Boy yasinyanye amasezerano na hamwe n\u2019isosiyete nkuru ya. Album ye ya gatatu ya studio ', yaje kumenyekana cyane muri label ya mbere, yasohotse muri 2018 \nMu 2019, Burna Boy yatsindiye Best International Act mu bihembo bya BET Award, kandi atoranywa nka. Muri uwo mwaka nyine, yasohoye alubumu ye ya kaneya studio, \"African Giant\", yatsindiye Album yumwaka muri 2019 All Music Music Awards 2019 kandi yatorewe kuba Album yumuziki mwiza ku isi muri 62 ya Grammy Awards.] \"\u200b\"\u200b Yatsindiye amategeko mpuzamahanga meza muri 2021 BET Awards kunshuro ya gatatu.\nAlbum ya gatandatu ya studio ya Burna Boy \"Love, Damini\", yasohotse muri Nyakanga 2022, ibaye alubumu ya mbere yo Muri Nigeriya ku mbonerahamwe ya Billboard 200. Yabaye kandi alubumu nyafurika yagaragaye cyane mu Bufaransa, Ubuholandi, n'Ubwongereza. Mu Kwakira 2022, Burna Boy yahawe igihembo cy\u2019umunyamuryango wa Order of the Federal Republic kubera ibyo yagezeho muri muzika. Mu 2023, \"Rolling Stone\" yamushyize ku mwanya wa 197 ku rutonde rw\u2019abaririmbyi 200 bakomeye mu bihe byose. Burna Boy yatsindiye International Act mpuzamahanga muri 2023 BET Awards. Indirimbo ye \" \" yatsindiye Afrobeats Ingaragu yumwaka nindirimbo yumwaka kuri Headies 2023. Burna Boy yabaye umuhanzi wa mbere nyafurika ufite alubumu ebyiri zinjije miliyari irenga 1 kuri Spotify. \nUbuzima n'umwuga.\nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nDamini Ebunoluwa Ogulu yavutse ku ya 2 Nyakanga 1991, avukira i Port Harcourt, muri Leta ya Rivers, muri Nijeriya. Nyina, Bose Ogulu, yakoraga nk'umusemuzi w'ururimi, naho se Samuel Ogulu, yayoboraga isosiyete yo gusudira. Sekuru ubyara Benson Idonije yigeze kuyobora Fela Kuti. Nyuma, nyina amubera umuyobozi. Ogulu yakuriye mu majyepfo ya Nijeriya maze atangira gukora wenyine akoresheje Studio ya FL. Yize amashuri yisumbuye ya Corona i Agbara, muri Leta ya Ogun, mbere yo kwimukira i Londere mu Bwongereza, kugira ngo akomeze amasomo ye. \u200b \u200b \u200b Yatangiye umwuga we wa muzika nyuma yo gusubira i \n2012\u20132015: L.I.F.E \"(Kureka Ingaruka Ziteka)\" na \"SPACESHIP\".\nAlbum ya mbere ya studio ya Burna Boy, \"L.I.F.E\", yasohotse ku ya 12 Kanama 2013, ibera nk'ikurikirana rya mixtape ye ya kabiri \"Burn Identity\" (2011). Iyi alubumu yagurishije kopi 40.000 kumunsi yasohotse. Aristokrat Records yaje kugurisha uburenganzira bwayo bwo kwamamaza muri Uba Pacific kuri \u20a6 10\u00a0miliyoni. Gusohora alubumu yabanjirijwe 'five: \"Like to Party\", \"Tonight\", \"Always Love You\", \"Run my Race\", na \"Yawa Dey\". \"L,I.F.E\" yakozwe na Leriq rwose kandi bugaragaramo abashyitsi kuva, MI Abaga, Timaya, Olamide, Reminisce, na Wizkid, nibindi. \"Nigeriya Imyidagaduro Uyu munsi\" yashyize alubumu ku mwanya wa 10 ku rutonde rwa Album ya 12 nziza ya 2013. Umuziki wa alubumu watewe inkunga na Fela Kuti, King Sunny Ade, na Bob Marley. Yakiriye neza muri rusange abanegura umuziki, bashimye umusaruro wayo. Yatowe muri Album nziza yumwaka muri 2014 Nigeriya Imyidagaduro. Muri Kanama 2013, \"L.I.F.E y\"ageze ku mwanya wa karindwi ku mbonerahamwe ya Album \"ya Billboard\" Reggae. \nMuri 2014, Burna Boy yatandukanye na Aristokrat Records; yashinze label yandika \"yitwa\" Spaceship Entertainment \",\" muri Gashyantare 2015. \n2018\u20132019: \"Hanze\" na \"Nini Nyafurika\".\nKu ya 19 Mutarama 2018, Burna Boy yagaragaye mu itsinda ry\u2019abanyamerika ryitwa Fall Out Boy ryitwa \"Sunshine Riptide\", umurongo wa alubumu yabo ya karindwi \"yitwa Mania\". Yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye ya gatatu ya studio, \"Outside\", nyuma y'icyumweru kimwe, ku ya 26 Mutarama 2018. Uyu muhanzikazi yavuze ko ari imvange, \"Outside\" igizwe ahanini na afrobeats, Dancehall, reggae, na rap rap. Irimo abashyitsi bagaragaye mu baririmbyi b'Abongereza J Hus, Lily Allen, na Mabel. \"Outside y\"ashyigikiwe n'indirimbo esheshatu: \"Rock Your Body\", \"Streets Africa\", \"Koni Baje\", \"Sekkle Down\", \"Heaven's Gate\" na \" Ye \". Umusaruro wayo wakozwe na Leriq, Baba Stiltz, Jae 5, Juls, Chopstix, Steel Banglez, Fred Gibson, Phantom, na FTSE. Iyi alubumu yakiriwe neza kandi yashyizwe ku rutonde na Pulse Nigeria na \"Nigeriya Imyidagaduro Uyu munsi\" nka alubumu nziza yo muri Nijeriya yo muri 2018. Yatsindiye Album y'umwaka muri 2018 Imyidagaduro ya Nigeria. 2018, \"Hanze\" yerekanwe ku mwanya wa gatatu ku mbonerahamwe ya Album \"ya Billboard\" Reggae. Indirimbo imwe yo muri alubumu, \"Ye\", yarangije ku rutonde rw\u2019ibitabo byinshi byo muri Nijeriya umwaka urangiye nk'indirimbo nini ya 2018. \nKu ya 7 Ukwakira 2018, Burna Boy yaririmbye mbere y\u2019imbaga yagurishijwe muri O2 Academy Brixton ya London. Umunsi umwe mbere yiki gitaramo, yakoze ibirori byamamaye kuri Red by Little Farm hanyuma agurisha udusanduku duto tw\u2019ibinyampeke bye bya Space Puffs, hamwe n'amakaye yabigenewe, amatara, hamwe n'amashati ashushanyije. Ku Ukwakira 2018, yatangajwe nk'umwe mu bahanzi bashya ba Afro Hub ba Spotify. Iri tangazo ryamuhuriranye no kwitwa Umuhanzi wa YouTube kuri Rise mu gihe cy'amezi atatu. \nKu ya 3 Mutarama 2019, Burna Boy yatangajwe hamwe na Bwana Eazi nk'umwe mu bahanzi bitabira iserukiramuco rya muzika n'ubuhanzi rya Coachella Valley 2019. Yatsindiye ibihembo bine mu iserukiramuco rya MVP rya Soundcity MVP, harimo Umuhanzi nyafurika w\u2019umwaka, Guhitamo abumva, na MVP nziza y'abagabo. Ku ya 21 Werurwe 2019, Burna Boy yasohoye EP-4 ikorana na EP hamwe na DJDS ikorera mu mujyi wa Los Angeles, yitwa \"Steel &amp;amp; Copper\". EP ihuza injyana ya Burna Boy hamwe na DJDS umutego ucuramye. \"]\" \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b \nKu ya 24 Kamena 2019, Burna Boy yatsindiye amategeko mpuzamahanga meza muri BET Awards 2019. Muri, yatangajwe nk'umuhanzi wa Apple Music Up Next. muri gahunda yaherekejwe n'ikiganiro Beats 1 yagiranye na Julie Adenuga na documentaire ngufi. Yanditse \"Ja Ara E\" (Yoruba: \"ubwenge bwenge\" cyangwa \"koresha umutwe wawe\") kuri Beyonc\u00e9 ' \"Ntare Umwami: Impano\" kandi niwe muhanzi wabatumirwa wenyine ufite inzira zabo kuri alubumu y'amajwi. \nAlbum ya kane ya sitidiyo ya Burna Boy, \"African Giant\", yasohotse ku ya 26 Nyakanga 2019. Yashyigikiwe n\u2019indirimbo esheshatu: \"Gbona\", \"Kuri Hasi\", Killin Dem \",\" Dangote \" Umuntu uwo ari we wese \"na\" Kurura \". Yatangiye gufata alubumu mu mwaka wa 2018, abwira \"Billboard\" ko ari umushinga we bwite mu gihe cyo kumva Los Angeles. basanganywe ku mbuga \"nkoranyambaga\". Mu ntangiriro yatangarijwe nka alubumu 16-yerekana Mu rwego rwo kumenyekanisha alubumu, Burna Boy yayoboye uruzinduko rw\u2019Africa igaruka, igice cya kabiri cy\u2019uruzinduko rwe muri Afurika, yanditse \"Amafaranga yanjye, \"Umwamikazi &amp;amp; Slim\" ' \" Indirimbo \"ya\" 1972 \" \u200b\u200b \n2020\u20132022: \"Inshuro ebyiri z'uburebure\" n'urukundo \", Damini\".\nMuri Mata 2020, Burna Boy yaririmbye \"Isi imwe: Hamwe murugo\" bidasanzwe. Ku ya 19 Kamena 2020, yagaragaye kuri remix yindirimbo ya virusi ya Master KG yo muri Afrika yepfo \" Jerusalema \". Burna Boy yakoresheje umukono wa afrobeat yumukono ku ndirimbo ndetse anaririmba igice mururimi rwa isiZulu. Ku ya 30 Nyakanga 2020, Burna Boy yagaragaye ku ndirimbo y\u2019umuhanzi w\u2019umwongereza Sam Smith, \" My Oasis \", indirimbo ya mbere muri alubumu yabo ya gatatu ya studio, \"Urukundo Rugenda\". Album ye ya studio, \"Twice as Tall\", yasohotse ku ya 14 Kanama 2020. Yakozwe na Diddy na nyina, Bose Ogulu. Ku ya 24 Ugushyingo 2020, \"Inshuro ebyiri nka Tall\" yatowe muri Album nziza ku Isi ku nshuro ya 63 ya Grammy Awards. Ni umwaka wa kabiri wikurikiranya Burna Boy yabonye nomination muri iki cyiciro. Yatsindiye igihembo cya Edison mu cyiciro cya Album ku Isi cya \"Afurika Igihangange\", kandi yatsindiye Itegeko mpuzamahanga ryiza muri MOBO Awards ku ya 9 Ukuboza, ahagarika amarushanwa ya Drake, Megan Thee Stallion, Lil Baby na Roddy Ricch. Mu birori ngarukamwaka bya Grammy Awards byabaye ku ya 15 Werurwe 2021, yatsindiye igihembo cya Grammy kuri Album nziza ya muzika ku isi. Indirimbo \"Destiny\" ya Burna Boy yashyizwe ku rutonde rw'abakinnyi mu muhango wo gutangiza Joe Biden. Yatsindiye Itegeko mpuzamahanga ryiza muri Awards, abaye umuhanzi wa mbere nyafurika wegukanye iki gihembo inshuro eshatu zikurikiranye. \nKu ya 19 Werurwe 2021, Burna Boy yagaragaye ku ndirimbo y\u2019umuririmbyi w\u2019umunyakanada Justin Bieber \"Ukundwa nawe\", umurongo wa alubumu ye ya gatandatu ya studio, \"Ubutabera\". Ku ya 17 Nzeri 2021, yagaragaye ku ndirimbo y\u2019umuririmbyi w\u2019umunyamerika Jon Bellion yise \"Ndabyumva\", ikaba yaranze ubufatanye bwa mbere bw\u2019umuziki hagati yabo bombi, ariko aba nyuma bandika \"Gukundwa nawe\" na Justin Bieber. Ku ya 4 Kamena 2022, Burna Boy yaririmbye kuri sitade y'imikino ya Belgravia i Harare, muri Zimbabwe, aho bivugwa ko yanze amafaranga yo kwambara igitambaro cya ZANU-PF mu rwego rwo kwemeza ubuyobozi bwa Mnangagwa. \nMuri 2022, yahawe igihembo cyitwa \"Best Solo Act on the World\" na NME. \nBurna Boy yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye ya gatandatu ya studio, \"Urukundo, Damini\", ku ya 8 Nyakanga 2022. Isohoka ryayo ryabanjirijwe n\u2019indirimbo \"Kilometero\" na \" Iheruka \". \nBurna Boy yakoze igitaramo cye cya mbere muri Jamayike ku ya 18 Ukuboza 2022, kuri Stade y'igihugu ya Jamaica. \n2023\u20132024: \"Nababwiye\u2026\".\nMuri Mata 2023, Burna Boy yasohoye indirimbo yise \" Mera Na \" irimo Sidhu Moose Wala, aho yahaye icyubahiro Sidhu. \"Mera Na\" yashushanyije ku mbonerahamwe mpuzamahanga zitandukanye zirimo Billboard Global 200, Kanada Hot 100, na New Zealand Hot Singles., yasohoye indirimbo \" Sittin Hejuru Yisi \", yerekana cyane umuririmbyi w\u2019umunyamerika Brandy mu 1998 yakunzwe cyane yise \" Top of the World \". \nKu ya 10 Kamena 2023, Burna Boy abaye umuhanzi wa mbere ukomoka muri Afurika witwaye neza muri UEFA Champion League Final Kick Off Show na Pepsi. Uyu muhanzikazi yerekeje kuri sitade Olempike ya Atat\u00fcrk i Istanbul muri Turukiya, imbere y'abashyigikiye barenga 71.412 ndetse n'abantu barenga miliyoni 700. Muri Nyakanga, abaye umuhanzi wa mbere nyafurika wanditse kandi agurisha ibitaramo kuri stade muri Amerika, yerekeza kuri Citi Field i New York. [\"Billboard\" nk'umuhanzi wa mbere wa Afrobeat w\u2019umwaka wa 2023. yatowe mu bihembo bine bya Grammy, bituma aba umuhanzi watowe kurusha abandi muri Nigeriya mu mateka ya Grammy hamwe n\u2019abakinnyi icumi batoranijwe mu mwuga ndetse n\u2019umunyanijeriya wa mbere wagize kandidatire mu myaka itanu yikurikiranya, kuva muri 2019 kugeza mu yashimiraga abahanzi bo muri Afurika ku bahatanira Grammy, The Recording Academy yavuze ko Burna Boy ari umuhanzi ukomeye muri Afurika. \"Igihugu\" cyamwise umwidagaduro wumwaka kubera kugira umwaka utagereranywa kandi udasanzwe. \n\"Sittin 'on Top of the world\" yakiriye igihembo cyiza cya Melodic Rap Cyiza Cyiza Cyiza cya 66 cya Grammy Awards. Burna Boy yakoze indirimbo mu birori ku ya 4 Gashyantare 2024, ari kumwe na Brandy na 21 Savage. \nMu Gushyingo 2024, indirimbo ye yamenyekanye cyane \"Hejuru\" yatowe nk'umuziki witwaye neza muri Afurika muri Grammy Awards ya 67 ngarukamwaka, izabera muri Gashyantare 2025 kuri Crypto.com Arena i Los Angeles. Yatorewe igihembo inshuro buzima bwe bwose.\n2025 - ubungubu: \"No Sign of Weakness\".\nKu ya 10 Nyakanga 2025, Burna Boy yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye ya munani ya studio \"Nta kimenyetso cyerekana intege nke\", irimo Travis Scott, Mick Jagger, Stromae, na Shaboozey ku ndirimbo imwe. Binyuze kuri iyi alubumu, yatunganije injyana ye kuva kuba collab-uburemere kugeza ku buke. Iyi alubumu yakozwe na label ye Spaceship, hamwe na Atlantic Records na Bad Habit. igaragaramo uburyo butandukanye bwa muzika butandukanye, harimo igihugu, '90s hiphop, inzu yikoranabuhanga, rock, na muzika ya elegitoroniki ya Nigeriya. \nBurna Boy yatangaje ko \"nta kimenyetso cyerekana intege nke\" muri Amerika y'Amajyaruguru azenguruka ibyumweru bike mbere yuko alubumu isohoka, uruzinduko rutangirira kuri Red Rocks Amphitheater muri Colorado mu Gushyingo. Ibitaramo byose byo muri Amerika ya ruguru bizagaragaramo icyiciro cya dogere 360, usibye Urutare rutukura, ruri kuri amphitheater isanzwe. Yakinnye kandi i Waldb\u00fchne i Berlin na SparkassenPark i M\u00f6nchengladbach, mu Budage, no mu iserukiramuco rya Wireless mu Bwongereza mbere y'urugendo. \nUbuzima bwite.\nBurna Boy yakundanye n'umuraperi w\u2019Ubwongereza Stefflon Don kuva 2018 kugeza \nUkuboza 2024, ibihuha bivuga ku mubano wa Burna Boy n'umuririmbyi w\u2019umunyamerika R&amp;B, Chloe Bailey, byagaragaye nyuma yo kumarana na we mu birori byo kwizihiza ' Detty Ukuboza '. Amashusho yabo yishimira ubuzima bwa Lagos nijoro byongereye ibitekerezo. Ku ya 7 Gashyantare 2025, \"Premium Times Nijeriya\" yemeje ko bakundana nyuma yo kugaragara ku munsi wo gusangira n\u2019abakundana n\u2019abakundana i Lagos, bakishora mu ruhame. \nMuri 2025, Burna Boy yagizwe umwe mubagabo bambaye neza ba GQ. \nUbuhanzi.\nUmuziki wa Burna Boy ni uruvange rwa Afrobeats, hip hop, reggae, na R&amp;amp;B. Umuziki we, avuga ko ari \"Afro-fusion\", ni ihuriro rya Afrobeat, dancehall, hip-hop, pop, R&amp;B, na reggae. \"]\" Umuhanzi Dancehall umuhanzi Kittitian Byron Messia yamusobanuye nkumuhanzi windirimbo zidasanzwe zidasanzwe utandika amagambo cyangwa guta igihe muri studio kugirango akore indirimbo. Mu kiganiro na \"The Punch\", Burna Boy yavuze uburyo ahumekwa agira ati: \"Ninjiye mu kazu maze ndyama injyana kandi umuziki uraza aho ndi. Mvugishije ukuri, sinshobora kubisobanura rwose - guhumeka n'ibitekerezo binyuzamo mu mwuka iyo ndi muri studio.\" Yamamaye cyane mu bafana ndetse no ku banegura kubera amagambo akubiye mu ndirimbo ze, zigaragara cyane mu gace ka Afrobeats, aho usanga indirimbo ziba zitezimbere kubyina bitwaye amafaranga. Yaganiriye kandi ku ngingo za politiki mu muziki we, nko ku murongo \"wa Afurika w'igihangange\" \"Indi nkuru\". Umuhanzi wo muri Nijeriya, Omah Lay, yatangaje ko Burna Boy ari umwanditsi mwiza w'indirimbo yigeze abona kandi ko ari imbaraga mu bijyanye n'ubuhanzi bwo kwandika. \nAzwiho kuba afite amajwi, ndetse n'ijwi rye rya baritone, aririmba avanze icyongereza, Yoruba, na Nigeriya Pidgin. \n\"Rolling Stone\" yanditse Burna Boy mubaririmbyi 200 bakomeye mubihe byose. \nUmurage.\nIntsinzi ya Burna Boy yatumye bamwe batekereza ko yahimbye umwirondoro wumuntu ukomeye muri Afrobeats. Umuyobozi ushinzwe impano Kim Moore yatangarije \"CNN\" ko \"Intsinzi ya Burna Boy (Grammy) izashishikariza abandi bahanzi bo muri Afurika gukora imishinga ishimisha abantu bose ku isi.\" Umunyamakuru wa radiyo BBC, Darren Joseph, yamusobanuye ko ari \"igishushanyo mu gisekuru\". \n\"Rolling Stone\" yamusobanuye ko ari igihangange mu muco wo muri Nijeriya, wabaye ambasaderi wa Afrobeats nk'umuryango \"w\u2019isi\" yose, ushobora kumva umeze nk'iwabo mu kuzamuka ku rutonde rw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019i Burayi ndetse no gukomeza umubano w\u2019amarangamutima n\u2019ubwoko \"bwashize\" nk\u2019ubuzima bwo \"hejuru\" imyaka yabo ya \nBOF yamwise \"umwe\" bagize uruganda ku isi Aniefiok Ekpoudom wo muri \"The Guardian\" yagize ati \"Burna Boy ari mu butumwa bwo kwibutsa Abanyafurika hose ku mizi yabo ku mugabane, kandi Afrobeats ni igikoresho cye\".\nImpaka.\nKu ya 8 Kamena 2022, abaherekeza bashinzwe umutekano witwa Burna Boy bivugwa ko barashe abantu babiri mu kabyiniro ka nijoro i Lagos. Nk\u2019uko byatangajwe n'umugore w'umwe mu bahohotewe, ibyabaye byatangiye nyuma yo kwanga ubutumire bwa Burna Boy bwo kwifatanya nawe mu gice cya VIP. Abashinzwe umutekano batanu bafitanye isano na Burna Boy batawe muri yombi bakurikiranyweho gushaka kwica. Nyuma y\u2019uwahohotewe yashinje uyu muhanzikazi n\u2019umuryango we gushaka gucecekesha umuryango we amafaranga y\u2019amafaranga. Kuva ku Kamena 2022, amashusho ya CCTV y\u2019iraswa ntabwo yari yashyizwe ahagaragara n\u2019iyi kipe. Ku ya 1 Mutarama 2023, ubwo yagendaga i Lagos mu rukundo rwe, Damini, urugendo Burna Boy rwababajwe cyane n\u2019uko yahakanye ibihuha byo kurasa nijoro ndetse n\u2019ibihuha bivuga ko nyina yahoze ari umubyinnyi w\u2019inyuma w\u2019umupayiniya wa Afrobeat, Fela Kuti. \n2019 'Abanyafurika Bunze ubumwe' guhagarika igitaramo.\nMu Gushyingo 2019, Burna Boy yatangajwe nk'umuyobozi mukuru w'igitaramo 'Africans Unite' muri Afurika y'Epfo, igikorwa kigamije guteza imbere ubumwe no gukemura ibibazo by'abanyamahanga. Icyakora, ibyo yabanje kwamagana ibitero bivugwa ko byakorewe abanyamahanga muri Afurika y'Epfo no kwerekana ko adashaka gusura iki gihugu byatumye abantu banengwa. Abahanzi bo muri Afurika yepfo n\u2019abaturage basabye imbabazi, Burna Boy yanga gutanga. Bavuze iterabwoba ry\u2019ihohoterwa n\u2019umutekano, abateguye ibirori amaherezo bahagaritse igitaramo. \nBurna Boy kandi yagiye mu makimbirane rusange n'umuraperi wo muri Afurika y'Epfo AKA kuri Twitter, biturutse ku biganiro ku ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina muri Afurika y'Epfo. Burna Boy yanenze ibyo bitero maze, kuri tweet kuva yasibwe, avuga ko azahura na AKA ku mubiri baramutse bahuye. \nMu gusubiza, AKA yagaragaje ko itishimiye, ishimangira ko Afurika y'Epfo yashyigikiye mbere umwuga wa Burna Boy mbere yuko atsinda ku rwego mpuzamahanga, anasaba imbabazi. Amakimbirane yarushijeho kwitabwaho ubwo igitaramo cya Burna Boy cyari giteganijwe mu gitaramo cya 'Africans Unite' cyongereye igitutu rubanda asaba imbabazi. Mu gihe impungenge zikomeje kwiyongera ku mutekano n\u2019impaka, igitaramo cyahagaritswe. Mu 2022, AKA yerekanye ko atagifite ibibazo na Burna Boy, byerekana ko hashobora kubaho ubwiyunge hagati y'abahanzi. \nGukora.\nFilozofiya iyobora Burna Boy ni Pan-Africanism. Yizera \"kubaka ibiraro\" hamwe na diaspora nyafurika, bizera Afrika nkumugabane w\u2019ababyeyi n\u2019aho abantu bavukiye. Yabaye umuvugizi uharanira ubutabera mbonezamubano ku isi. Umuziki wa Burna Boy ntabwo ari imyidagaduro gusa; ni umuhamagaro mubikorwa kuko akoresha urubuga rwe kugirango avugishe ukuri kubutegetsi kandi amurikire ibibazo bireba abantu muri Nijeriya ndetse no kwisi yose. Muri alubumu ye ya studio African Giant, arasesengura amateka y\u2019imivurungano ya Nijeriya asenya inkuru zayikikuje kuva zabona ubwigenge. Indirimbo nka \"Iyindi Nkuru\" iramagana ingaruka mbi z\u2019isosiyete ya Royal Niger mu gushyiraho ubutegetsi bwabakoloni muri Nijeriya, \"Kwangiza ingwate\" iranenga ubugwari bw\u2019Abanyanijeriya mu kudahangana n\u2019abakandamiza mu gihe \"Wetin Man Go Do\" yinubira ububabare bwa rubanda. Umunyamakuru wa radiyo BBC, DJ Target, yagize ati: \"Ahagarariye impinduka, kandi avuga nabi akarengane mu gihe ahagarariye Afurika akiri muto ndetse akanamenyekana ku isi hose.\" \nNyuma y'imyivumbagatanyo ya Johannesburg yo muri 2019 muri Afurika y'Epfo yibasiye Abanyafurika baba muri iki gihugu, yiyemeje kutazongera gusura Afurika y'Epfo niba guverinoma itagize icyo ikora kugira ngo iki kibazo gikemuke. Muri 2020, yashyizeho ikigega cyo gutabara abahohotewe na #EndSARS imyigaragambyo yo kurwanya ubugizi bwa nabi bwa polisi. Estelle Uba wo muri \"Repubulika\" yavuze ko amagambo akomeye ya Burna Boy adahatira Abanyanijeriya gusa, ahubwo ko abenegihugu baturutse mu bihugu byahoze biganjemo abakoloni muri Afurika y'Epfo, Aziya, na Amerika y'Epfo kugira ngo babare, kandi bahangane n'ukuri kw'abakoloni bashya mu bihugu byabo. Binyuze mu ndirimbo ye 20-10-20, yarekuwe ku bufatanye n\u2019iraswa rya Lekki 2020, yatanze ijwi ryamagana kurwanya iraswa ry\u2019abigaragambyaga #EndSARS, imiyoborere mibi, ruswa, n\u2019ubugome bwa polisi muri Nijeriya. "}
{"id": "21346", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21346", "title": "Itorero Garukurebe", "text": "Itorero Garukurebe ni itorero ry'umuco rikorera mu Karere ka Rwamagana mu Buganza. Ni itorero ryatangijwe hagamijwe gukuza no kubungabunga umuco nyarwanda, cyane cyane imbyino n'indirimbo gakondo.Itorero Garukurebe ryashinzwe mu mwaka wa 1982.rikaba ryarashinzwe na MUKAMPUNGA Janviere. Itorero Garukurebe Kugeza ubu rigizwe n\u2019ibyiciro bitatu birimo abana bakiri bato, icy\u2019urubyiruko ndetse n\u2019abakuze barimo abakecuru n\u2019abasaza. Abanyamuryango baryo bose barimo n\u2019ab\u2019icyubahiro bagera ku 101. "}
{"id": "21347", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21347", "title": "Abanyagitugu b'Afurika", "text": "Ubuyobozi bw'igitugu ni uburyo bw'imiyoborere burangwa no gukoresha imbaraga no kutumvikana n'abo uyobora, aho umuyobozi cyangwa itsinda ry'abayobozi bafata ibyemezo bonyine, kandi bakirengagiza uburenganzira n'ibyifuzo by'abaturage."}
{"id": "21348", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21348", "title": "Egiputa Mu Mikino yabafite ubumuga bwo Kutumva", "text": "Igihugu cya Misiri yatangiye kwitabira imikino ya mu 2013. Uwo mwaka ni na wo yabonye umudari wayo wa mbere w\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva, ubwo ikipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru yegukanaga umudari wa bronze. Egiputa ntabwo yigeze yitabira Itumba ryiryo rushanwa Deathlympics."}
{"id": "21349", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21349", "title": "2Baba", "text": "Innocent Ujah Idibia MON [a] (Listen \u24d8 ; yavutse ku ya \"18 Nzeri\" 1975), uzwi ku izina rye rya 2Baba wahoze yitwa 2Face Idibia n'umuririmbyi wo muri nijeriyaa uzi mukwandika Indirimbo no kuzitunganya, umwanditsi w\u2019indirimbo, umuhanzi w\u2019injyana n\u2019utunganya umuziki wo muri Nijeriya, uzwi cyane kubera album ye ya mbere yakoze ku giti cye 2004 [b] Afatwa nkumwe mu bahanzi \"bakomeye\"kandi bakomeye muri Afrobeats bibihe byose nyuma y\u2019umusanzu we muri muzika ya pop ya Nigeriya mu myaka ya za 2000. \n2Baba yatsindiye igihembo cya MTV Europe kubera African Act mu 2005 Mu 2019, yakoze indirimbo afatanyije na Cobhams Asuquo na Timi Dakolo bashyize hanze indirimbo igamije gukangurira abantu. \"Billboard\" yashyize indirimbo ye \" African Queen \" No 1 kurutonde rw'indirimbo nziza za Afrobeats mubihe byose. \nUbuzima bwe n'amashuri yize.\n2Baba yavutse ku ya 18 Nzeri 1975, avukira i Jos, muri Leta ya Plateau, muri Nijeriya, akomoka muri Idoma ukomoka muri Leta ya Benue muri Nijeriya rwagati. Yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Mount Saint Gabriel i Makurdi mbere yo gukurikirana Business adminsistration mu Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019Ubuyobozi n\u2019ikoranabuhanga, Enugu (IMT), riherereye muri Leta ya Enugu. \nNyuma yo Kwiyegurira umuziki, 2Baba yahagaritse amashuri asanzwe akurikirana umwuga we wa muzika. 1996, yari amaze gutangira guhimba imiziki no gufata amajwi cyane cyane muri GB Fan Club muri Enugu State Broadcasting Services (ESBS). Yakoreraga ku izina rya stage \"2Face\", yavuze ko iryo zina ari \"ugutandukanya ubuzima bwe bwite nubw\u2019ubucuruzi\" nubwo nyuma yaje guhinduka \"2Baba\" mu 2016. \nUmwuga.\nUbwo yari mu ishuri rikuru ry\u2019imiyoborere n\u2019ikoranabuhanga Enugu (IMT), Idibia yatangiye umwuga we wa muzika akorana na Blackface Naija, umunyeshuri biganaga mu mashuri yisumbuye, na Faze, bose nyuma baza gushinga itsinda ry\u2019abantu batatu, Plantashun Boiz. Itsinda ryasohoye alubumu ebyiri, \"body and soul\" (2000) na \"Sold Out\" (2003),babifashijwemo na Dove Records, gifitwe na Nelson Brown. Abagize itsinda batandukanye mu 2004, 2Baba basubira mu muziki wenyine.\n2Baba yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye ya mbere ku giti cye, \"Face 2 Face\" (2004), yasuzumwe neza n'abanegura umuziki kandi ashyirwa ku rutonde rwa \"alubumu ikomeye ya mbere yo muri Nijeriya yo mu kinyejana cya 21 n'umuhanzi wenyine\". Yakurikiwe na alubumu ye ya kabiri, \"Grass 2 Grace\" (2006). Nyuma yibyo, yavuye muri Kennis Music maze ashyiraho label ye bwite, Hypertek Digital., yasohoye alubumu y'ubushakashatsi yitwa \"The Unstoppable\", hamwe n\u2019ikinyamakuru International edition mu mwaka wa 2010 Music Video. \nMu 2004, 2Baba yavuye mu itsinda \"Plantashun Boiz\" byatumye iryo tsinda ryicamo ibice, bituma havuka amakimbirane n'abahoze ari bagenzi be bamushinja ko yatandukanijwe. 2Baba n\u2019umwe bari bigeze gukorana mu itsinda, Faze, basangizanyije amakosa mu ndirimbo zitandukanye zo mu ma album yabo y\u2019umwihariko. \nBlackFace yavuze ko indirimbo 2Baba yakoze zanditswe na bombi, nubwo iki kibazo cyaje gukemurwa mu rukiko. Indirimbo \" African Queen \" yabaye impaka hagati ya 2Baba, label ye yise Kennis Music, n'uwahoze ari umuririmbyi mugenzi we Blackface, bamushinje ku mugaragaro ko yamwibye indirimbo, avuga ko yanditse iyi ndirimbo bakiri itsinda. Umuziki wa Kennis waje kwemera guha Blackface inguzanyo zo kwandika iyi ndirimbo kandi yemera no kumwishyura amafaranga y\u2019amafaranga yavuye mu ndirimbo. \nKu ya 25 Mutarama 2017, 2Baba yatangaje binyuze ku rubuga rwe rwa Instagram ko azayobora imyigaragambyo mu gihugu hose ku ya 5 Gashyantare 2017; imyigaragambyo yarwanyaga politiki yashyizwe mu bikorwa na Perezidansi ya Muhammadu Buhari. Mu rwego rwo guhagarika imyigaragambyo, ubuyobozi, binyuze kuri komiseri w\u2019igipolisi cya Leta ya Lagos, Fatai Owoseni, bwasohoye itangazo rivuga ko imyigaragambyo yabujijwe muri Leta, avuga ko hari impungenge z\u2019uko amazu y\u2019amazu azayashimuta kandi agateza akaduruvayo. Icyakora, aya magambo yaranze kandi yirengagizwa ku mugaragaro, mu gihe kumenyekanisha imyigaragambyo byakomeje ku mbuga nkoranyambaga. \nMuri Gashyantare 2017, 2Baba yasohoye videwo ivuga ko yahagaritse imyigaragambyo kubera impamvu z'umutekano. Ibihuha byakwirakwiriye ku mbuga nkoranyambaga bivuga ko ubuyobozi, binyuze kuri DSS, bwamutoye mbere y'uwo munsi kandi bumuhatira guhagarika imyigaragambyo yavuzwe cyane, nubwo nyuma yaje gukora tweet nyinshi ku rubuga rwe rwa Twitter kugira ngo ahakana iki kirego. \n2Baba yashakanye n'umukinnyi w'amafirime ukomoka muri Nijeriya, Annie Macaulay-Idibia kuva mu 2012 i Lagos, muri Nijeriya. I Dubai ku ya 23 Werurwe 2013, habaye umuhango w\u2019imbonezamubano, kandi bafite abana babiri. \nKu ya 26 Mutarama 2025, yatangaje ko yatandukana n\u2019umugore we bashakanye, Annie kuri Instagram. Nyuma y'iminsi mike, uyu muhanzikazi yagaragaye ari kumwe na Natasha Osawaru, umushingamategeko mu nzu mberabyombi ya Edo. \nUmurage.\n2Baba yahawe ibihembo byinshi mubuzima bwe bwose, harimo igihembo cya MTV Europe Music Award na World Music Award, ibihembo bitanu bya Headies byindirimbo yumwaka, ibihembo bine bya Channel O Music Video Awards, na BET Award. Byongeye kandi, yahawe igihembo muri MTV Africa Music Awards, Umuziki wa Black Origin Awards, Kora Awards, ndetse na 'Afrima Legend Award' 2019. Yinjijwe muri \" The Headies Hall of Fame \" mu 2015 no muri 'Hall Legends Hall of Fame' muri Gana mu 2022 \nMuri Gicurasi 2016, 2Baba yahawe impamyabumenyi y'icyubahiro mu buhanzi muri kaminuza ya Igbinedion, muri Nijeriya, naho muri Werurwe 2019, agirwa Umunyeshuri w'ishuri ry'umuziki muri kaminuza ya Obafemi Awolowo. Muri Mutarama 2017, yatangaje ubufatanye na Komisiyo y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ishinzwe impunzi (UNHCR) anatanga impano ku bantu bimuwe mu byabo (IDP) n\u2019abatahutse. Yatangije kandi ubukangurambaga \"Vote Not fight\" munsi ya Fondasiyo ya Youngstars n'Ikigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe demokarasi. yabaye ambasaderi ku bicuruzwa the National Agency for Food and Drug Administration and Control (NAFDAC) in 2009, the Nigerian Stock Exchange (NSE), Airtel Nigeria, Globacom,bitandukanye gishinzwe imiyoborere NAFDAC ambasaderi nyafurika mu ruganda rukora inzoga mu Butaliyani, Campari mu 2016. \nIgitaramo cya FORTYfied All-Star Tribute Concert, cyateguwe na 2Baba kwizihiza isabukuru yimyaka 40 n\u2019uruhare muri muzika ya Nigeriya, cyabaye ku ya 20 Nzeri 2015, muri Eko Hotel na Suites Convention Centre. Yakiriwe na Basketmouth ikanaterwa inkunga na STAR Lager Beer, igitaramo cyamamaye cyane. Niwe kandi washinze urukurikirane rw'ibitaramo \"Buckwyld na Breathless\" na Fondasiyo ya 2Baba, yahoze yitwa \"2Face Reach Out Foundation\". "}
{"id": "21350", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21350", "title": "Tay Iwar", "text": "Austin Iornongu Iwar Jnr (wavukiye ku ya 9 Kamena 1997), uzwi nka Tay Iwar, ni umuhanzi uririmba, wandika indirimbo, ucuranga, ukora injyana z\u2019amajwi ndetse akanatunganya amajwi. Azwi cyane mu guhuza R na B n\u2019injyana ya Afro-fusion. Umwuga we watangiye hakiri kare cyane akiri muto yasohoraga imishinga ye ya mbere irimo Renascentia yo mu 2016. Yatangiye kumenyekana cyane kubera Gemini yo mu 2019, yasohotse ibinyujijwe kuri Soulection, itsinda rye rya muzika ryo muri Los Angeles. \nYaje mu muziki hamwe na alubumu ivanze yumuziki yamamaye cyane yitwa Passport, yamuhesheje igihembo ku mwanya wa 3 n'uwa 4 zo muri Nigeriya Teens Choice Awards mu cyiciro cya Choice Mixtape / EP mu 2014 na 2015. Ku ya 23 Ugushyingo 2021, \" Wizkid 's \"Made in Lagos\" deluxe studio album, yatowe muri GRAMMYs kandi imuha ibihembo bidasanzwe, binyuze cyane muri \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nAustin Iornongu Iwar yavutse ku ya 9 Kamena 1997 i Marina, akurira hagati ya Lagos na Abuja. Igaragara rye rya mbere muri muzika, ryaturutse kuri mukuru we Sut\u00e9 Iwar. Austin watangiye guhanga umuziki afite imyaka cumi nine, akoresheje sofutiware yumuziki wa digitale FL Studio. \nUmwuga.\nKu ya 22 Mata 2016, Tay Iwar yasohoye umuzingo w'indirimbo Indirimbo-zirindwi witwa Renascentia, irimo Sut\u00e9 Iwar. inzira \"Urukundo rwo kugendera ku mafarasi,\" yaje kugaragara ku majwi y\u2019igihembwe \"cy\u2019umukobwa w\u2019uruhu muri Transit\" mu 2017. \nMuri 2019, Iwar yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye ya sitydiyo GEMINI, ikubiyemo abashyitsi bagaragaye muri Cruel Santino, Prey\u00e9, Odunsi (Moteri), na Sut\u00e9 Iwar. Inzira \"Utero\" yatumye Iwar abahatanira ibihembo byiza byijwi (Umugabo) ku nshuro ya 14 ya The Headies. Ku ya 13 Mata 2019, indirimbo ze \"Diamond\" na \"Komeza\" zo muri GEMINI zagaragaye kuri radiyo Soulection. \nMuri 2020, Iwar yakoranye na Wizkid munzira \"Urukundo nyarwo,\" hamwe na Projexx, nyuma yaje kumuha izina rya mbere rya Grammy. Yagaragaje kandi kuri Album \"y\u2019umuhungu wenyine\" wa Omah Lay mu 2022. Ku ya 29 Werurwe 2022, Wizkid yashyize ahagaragara amashusho y\u2019indirimbo \"Urukundo nyarwo,\" arimo Tay Iwar na Projexx. \nMuri 2024, Tay Iwar yagaragaye kuri Alubumu \"ya nyuma\" ya Headie One kumurongo \"Imbunda &amp; Amafaranga\". Yasohoye kandi igice cya kabiri cya Zahabu EP hamwe na Le Mav ku ya 12 Nyakanga "}
{"id": "21351", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21351", "title": "Samara Byishimo", "text": "Samara Joy McLendon (yavutse ku ya 11 Ugushyingo 1999) ni umuririmbyi w\u2019Umunyamerika. Alubumu ye ya mbere yasohotse mu 2021 yamufashije gutorwa nk\u2019umuhanzi mushya mwiza na JazzTimes. Alubumu ye ya kabiri, Linger Awhile (2022), yageze ku mwanya wa mbere ku rutonde rwa Jazz Albums. Yahawe ibihembo bya Grammy, birimo icy\u2019umuhanzi mushya mwiza mu 2023, ndetse atsindira ibihembo bibiri by\u2019Album nziza ya Jazz Vocal (mu 2023 no mu 2025) hamwe n'icya Performance nziza ya Jazz (2024 na 2025).\nUbuzima bwambere n'uburere.\nYavukiye mu gace ka Castle Hill gaherereye mu gace ka Bronx, mu mujyi wa New York, Joy yavutse mu 1999 mu muryango w\u2019umuziki. Sekuru na sekuru, Umusaza Goldwire na Ruth McLendon, bashinze itsinda rya gospel rya Philadelphia The Savettes. Sekuru, Umusaza Goldwire McLendon nawe yarangije igihembwe cya 3 cya BET 'Gospel Talent show \"Sunday Best\". Se - umukinnyi w'amajwi akaba n'umucuranzi wa bass wazengurutse umucuranzi wa gospel Andra\u00e9 Crouch - yamumenyesheje abakomeye ba gospel nka The Clark Sisters, n'ubugingo n'umuziki wa Motown. Yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Fordham ryubuhanzi kandi akora ibitaramo mu itsinda ryayo rya jazz. Muri, yatsindiye Vocalist Nziza mu iserukiramuco rya Ellington, amarushanwa yisumbuye yakiriwe na Jazz mu kigo cya Lincoln. \nYabanje guhura na jazz muburyo bufite intego ubwo yiyandikishaga muri gahunda ya jazz muri SUNY 's Purchase College nkumu majwi wijwi, maze yitwa Ella Fitzgerald Scholar. Inshuti zaho zamumenyesheje amajwi y\u2019abahanzi bakomeye ba jazz barimo Sarah Vaughan na Fitzgerald, n\u2019abacuranga ibikoresho nka Kenny Washington, Jon Faddis (twiganye), na Ingrid Jensen. Ashingiye ku gishushanyo cya jazz Billie Holiday, Joy yaje gukora ikiruhuko cyitwa \"Ibumoso wenyine\" kandi yifashishije uburyo bwe bwose kuri stade igezweho.\nUmwuga.\nMuri 2019, nka Samara McLendon, yatsindiye amarushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Jazz Vocal Sarah Vaughan. Umwe mu bacamanza muri iryo rushanwa, Christian McBride uzwi cyane ku isi, yavuze ko Joy ari \"impano iboneka rimwe mu gisekuru.\" Yakoranye na producer ndetse n\u2019umuyobozi wa nyuma, Matt Pierson, yanditse alubumu ye yise iyambere akiri muri kaminuza, arangiza \"magna cum laude\" mu 2021. \"Samara Joy\" yasohotse ku ya 9 Nyakanga 2021, kuri Whirlwind Recordings. \"Jazz Times\" yise Umuhanzi mushya mwiza mu Mu kiganiro, umuyobozi wa firime Regina King yamwise \"umukobwa ukiri muto usa na Sarah Vaughan na Ella Fitzgerald bombi baba mu mubiri we.\" \nYasohoye amashusho menshi y'amashusho, harimo imwe yari imaze kurebwa inshuro zirenga miliyoni 1.5 guhera mu Kwakira 2020. Aya mashusho yari afite guhera mu Gushyingo 2022 yungutse abayoboke be 200.000 kuri TikTok. Ahanini ku mbaraga zatsinze, yazengurutse u Burayi, harimo n'ibitaramo byagurishijwe mu Butaliyani na Otirishiya. Mu 2021 akomeza muri 2022, yazengurutse Amerika, iserukiramuco Jazz,\nKu ya 15 Gashyantare 2022, yaririmbye kuri \"uyu munsi\" ari kumwe n'umucuranzi wa gitari Pasquale Grasso kuri \"uyu munsi\" muri Nzeri 2022. agaragara mu iserukiramuco rya Newport Jazz. Yagaragaye kuri alubumu ya 2022 ya piyano piyano Julius Rodriguez \"Reka amajwi abwire bose\". \nKu ya 16 Nzeri 2022, yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye ya kabiri, \"Linger Awhile\", kuri Verve Records. igaragaramo uvuza ingoma Kenny Washington, umucuranzi wa gitari Pasquale Grasso, piyano Ben Paterson, na David Wong wa bassiste. Mu byo yanditse mu gihe cy'imbeho 2022 harimo kuririmbana na Jazz muri Orchestre Lincoln Centre mu ruzinduko rwayo rwa Big Band. Mu rwego rwo kwiyamamaza kw\u2019ibiruhuko, Joy yifatanyije na Theory maze atangira indirimbo ye nshya yise \"Noneho na nyuma\" gusa yamamaye mu mujyi wa New York. Yavuze ko ibiruhuko bya Billie ku buryo bwe bwiza. \nYatowe kandi yatsindiye ibihembo bibiri muri Grammy Awards mu 2023: Alubumu nziza ya Jazz Vocal Album ya \"Linger Awhile\" n'umuhanzi mushya mwiza. Muri Grammy Awards mu 2024, yatowe kandi yegukana igihembo cyiza cya Jazz Performance hamwe nindirimbo ye \"Tight.\" Yatowe kandi yegukana ibindi bihembo bibiri muri Grammy Awards mu 2025: Igitaramo cyiza cya Jazz hamwe na \"Twinkle Twinkle Little Me\" na Album nziza ya Jazz Vocal ya \"Noheri nziza\". "}
{"id": "21352", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21352", "title": "Samara Joy", "text": "Samara Joy McLendon (yavutse ku ya 11 Ugushyingo 1999) ni umuririmbyi w\u2019Umunyamerika. Alubumu ye ya mbere yasohotse mu 2021 yamufashije gutorwa nk\u2019umuhanzi mushya mwiza na JazzTimes. Alubumu ye ya kabiri, Linger Awhile (2022), yageze ku mwanya wa mbere ku rutonde rwa Jazz Albums. Yahawe ibihembo bya Grammy, birimo icy\u2019umuhanzi mushya mwiza mu 2023, ndetse atsindira ibihembo bibiri by\u2019Album nziza ya Jazz Vocal (mu 2023 no mu 2025) hamwe n'icya Performance nziza ya Jazz (2024 na 2025).\nUbuzima bwambere n'uburere.\nYavukiye mu gace ka Castle Hill gaherereye mu gace ka Bronx, mu mujyi wa New York, Joy yavutse mu 1999 mu muryango w\u2019umuziki. Sekuru na sekuru, Umusaza Goldwire na Ruth McLendon, bashinze itsinda rya gospel rya Philadelphia The Savettes. Sekuru, Umusaza Goldwire McLendon nawe yarangije igihembwe cya 3 cya BET 'Gospel Talent show \"Sunday Best\". Se - umukinnyi w'amajwi akaba n'umucuranzi wa bass wazengurutse umucuranzi wa gospel Andra\u00e9 Crouch - yamumenyesheje abakomeye ba gospel nka The Clark Sisters, n'ubugingo n'umuziki wa Motown. Yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Fordham ryubuhanzi kandi akora ibitaramo mu itsinda ryayo rya jazz. Muri, yatsindiye Vocalist Nziza mu iserukiramuco rya Ellington, amarushanwa yisumbuye yakiriwe na Jazz mu kigo cya Lincoln. \nYabanje guhura na jazz muburyo bufite intego ubwo yiyandikishaga muri gahunda ya jazz muri SUNY 's Purchase College nkumu majwi wijwi, maze yitwa Ella Fitzgerald Scholar. Inshuti zaho zamumenyesheje amajwi y\u2019abahanzi bakomeye ba jazz barimo Sarah Vaughan na Fitzgerald, n\u2019abacuranga ibikoresho nka Kenny Washington, Jon Faddis (twiganye), na Ingrid Jensen. Ashingiye ku gishushanyo cya jazz Billie Holiday, Joy yaje gukora ikiruhuko cyitwa \"Ibumoso wenyine\" kandi yifashishije uburyo bwe bwose kuri stade igezweho.\nUmwuga.\nMuri 2019, nka Samara McLendon, yatsindiye amarushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Jazz Vocal Sarah Vaughan. Umwe mu bacamanza muri iryo rushanwa, Christian McBride uzwi cyane ku isi, yavuze ko Joy ari \"impano iboneka rimwe mu gisekuru.\" Yakoranye na producer ndetse n\u2019umuyobozi wa nyuma, Matt Pierson, yanditse alubumu ye yise iyambere akiri muri kaminuza, arangiza \"magna cum laude\" mu 2021. \"Samara Joy\" yasohotse ku ya 9 Nyakanga 2021, kuri Whirlwind Recordings. \"Jazz Times\" yise Umuhanzi mushya mwiza mu Mu kiganiro, umuyobozi wa firime Regina King yamwise \"umukobwa ukiri muto usa na Sarah Vaughan na Ella Fitzgerald bombi baba mu mubiri we.\" \nYasohoye amashusho menshi y'amashusho, harimo imwe yari imaze kurebwa inshuro zirenga miliyoni 1.5 guhera mu Kwakira 2020. Aya mashusho yari afite guhera mu Gushyingo 2022 yungutse abayoboke be 200.000 kuri TikTok. Ahanini ku mbaraga zatsinze, yazengurutse u Burayi, harimo n'ibitaramo byagurishijwe mu Butaliyani na Otirishiya. Mu 2021 akomeza muri 2022, yazengurutse Amerika, nandi maserukiramuco cyane cyane muburayi.\nKu ya 15 Gashyantare 2022, yaririmbye kuri \"uyu munsi\" ari kumwe n'umucuranzi wa gitari Pasquale Grasso kuri \"uyu munsi\" muri Nzeri 2022. agaragara mu iserukiramuco rya Newport Jazz. Yagaragaye kuri alubumu ya 2022 ya piyano piyano Julius Rodriguez \"Reka amajwi abwire bose\". \nKu ya 16 Nzeri 2022, yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye ya kabiri, \"Linger Awhile\", kuri Verve Records. igaragaramo uvuza ingoma Kenny Washington, umucuranzi wa gitari Pasquale Grasso, piyano Ben Paterson, na David Wong wa bassiste. Mu byo yanditse mu gihe cy'imbeho 2022 harimo kuririmbana na Jazz muri Orchestre Lincoln Centre mu ruzinduko rwayo rwa Big Band. Mu rwego rwo kwiyamamaza kw\u2019ibiruhuko, Joy yifatanyije na Theory maze atangira indirimbo ye nshya yise \"Noneho na nyuma\" gusa yamamaye mu mujyi wa New York. Yavuze ko ibiruhuko bya Billie ku buryo bwe bwiza. \nYatowe kandi yatsindiye ibihembo bibiri muri Grammy Awards mu 2023: Alubumu nziza ya Jazz Vocal Album ya \"Linger Awhile\" n'umuhanzi mushya mwiza. Muri Grammy Awards mu 2024, yatowe kandi yegukana igihembo cyiza cya Jazz Performance hamwe nindirimbo ye \"Tight.\" Yatowe kandi yegukana ibindi bihembo bibiri muri Grammy Awards mu 2025: Igitaramo cyiza cya Jazz hamwe na \"Twinkle Twinkle Little Me\" na Album nziza ya Jazz Vocal ya \"Noheri nziza\". "}
{"id": "21353", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21353", "title": "Braxton Cook", "text": "Braxton Cook (wavukiye ku ya 27 Werurwe 1991) ni umunyamerika ucuranga saxophone yo mu majwi yo hejuru (alto) akaba n\u2019umwanditsi w\u2019indirimbo unaririmba. Yakoreye ingendo hamwe n\u2019abahanzi ba jazz barimo Christian Scott, Christian McBride na Marquis Hill, kandi aririmbira hamwe n\u2019abandi nka Jon Batiste, Mac Miller na Rihanna. \"\u200b\" Mu 2017, Fader yamwise \u201cimpano idasanzwe ya jazz,\u201d naho mu 2018, Ebony imushyira mu bahanzi batanu ba jazz bakwiye kwitabwaho cyane.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nBraxton Cook yavutse ku ya 27 Werurwe 1991, avukira i Boston, muri Massachusetts. Nyuma yo kwimuka inshuro nyinshi, umuryango we watuye ahitwa Silver Spring, Maryland, mu nkengero za Washington, DC, aho yabaga hafi yuburere bwe. \nCook yize ishuri ryisumbuye rya Springbrook yiga saxofone yayobowe na Paul Carr. Igihe yari ahari, yari umwe mu banyeshuri 30 bo muri Amerika batoranijwe mu itsinda rya Grammy jazz 2009. Yize muri kaminuza ya Georgetown imyaka ibiri, aho yize icyongereza yibanda cyane muri African American Studies. Nkumunyeshuri wambere, yiswe Finalist ya YoungArts 2010. \nMu mwaka wa 2011, Cook yimukiye mu ishuri rya Juilliard, aho yize jax saxophone hamwe na Ron Blake na Steve Wilson. Mu mbere muri Juilliard, Cook yitabiriye igitaramo cya Donald Harrison, aho yahuye na mwishywa wa Harrison, umucuranzi w\u2019inzamba Christian Scott. Nyuma yaho gato, Cook yabaye umunyamuryango muremure witsinda rya Scott. \nUmwuga.\nCook yatangije umwuga we wenyine muri 2014, yishyira ahagaragara bwa mbere EP \"Sketch\". Yashyize ahagaragara kandi alubumu yuzuye \"Cook Yahuye na Butcher Brown\" ku bufatanye n\u2019itsinda ry\u2019abanyamerika ryitwa \"Jazz\" Butcher Brown mu \"2015\", mbere yo gusinyana na label yigenga \"ya\" Fresh Selects mu 2016. Ibihembo. \nMuri 2018, Cook yagaragaye muri videwo \"ya Vox\" yise \" Indirimbo itinywa cyane muri jazz, yasobanuwe \", yakiriye uburyo bushya budasanzwe: Ubuhanzi, Ubuzima n\u2019umuco igihembo cya 40 cya News na Documentaire Emmy Awards. Ku ruhare rwe muri videwo, Cook yahawe icyemezo cya Emmy Awards. \nMuri 2019, Cook yakinnye hamwe na Jon Batiste kumajwi \"yubugingo\" bwa Pixar, yatsindiye igihembo cya Academy kumanota meza yumwimerere. \nMuri Gicurasi 2020, Cook yagaragaye mu gitaramo cya Tiny Desk cya NPR, yakoreye mu rugo rwe muri New Jersey. Nta itsinda rimushyigikira kubera intera mbonezamubano, yakoresheje imirongo kugirango ashyigikire gitari, amajwi, na saxofone. Muri iki gitaramo, Cook yakoze amashusho ya alubumu zitandukanye zirimo \"Ahantu Hagati\" (2017) \"n\u2019ikimenyetso cy\u2019umuriro\" (2020), ndetse na \"Indirimbo ye (ya Trayvon Martin)\", yanditse yandika ku ivanguramoko n'ubugome bwa polisi. [\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b \nUwahoze ari mugenzi we babanaga na Juilliard Jahaan Sweet yakoresheje urugero rwijwi rya Cook mu gutunganya \" Lavender Haze \", inzira ifungura kuri Album ya Taylor Swift ya Album ya \"Mid22\". Cook yashimwe nk'umuproducer wongeyeho kuriyi nzira, ariko ntiyigeze yumva kugeza alubumu isohotse. Cook na Sweet bari barigeze gukorana mugutunganya indirimbo \"Tryna Be\" yo muri Album ya 2022 ya studio ya Giveon \"Tanga cyangwa Ufate\". \nUkuboza 2022, Cook yatangaje ko hasohotse alubumu ye ya gatanu yuzuye ya studio yuzuye \"Ninde uri nde iyo ntawe ureba\" ku ya 24 Gashyantare 2023, kuri Nettwerk. ahagaragara alubumu nk'imwe mu ziteganijwe \"gusohoka\" mu 2023. "}
{"id": "21359", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21359", "title": "Umutungo kamere wa Mageragere", "text": "Mageragere ni umwe mu mirenge 10 igize akarere ka Nyarugenge, ari yo: Gitega, Kanyinya, Kigali, Kimisagara, Mageragere, Muhima, Nyakabanda, Nyamirambo, Nyarugenge, Rwezamenyo.\nUmurenge wa Mageragere ufite utugari 7 ari two: Kankuba, Nyarufunzo, Kavumu, Ntungamo, Runzenze, Nyarurenzi, Mataba."}
{"id": "21360", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21360", "title": "Gereza ya Mageragere", "text": "Gereza ya Mageragere, kumugaragaro ikigo ngororamuco cya Nyarugenge (, French), ni igororero riherereye mu Karere ka Nyarugenge, Kigali, mu Rwanda. Ryashinzwe muri Nzeri 2016, Rizwi nka Mageragere ni gereza nini mu Rwanda. Kugeza muri Kanama 2023, Mageragere icumbikira abagororwa bagera ku 9000. \nIkoreshwa na serivisi ishinzwe Gukosora mu Rwanda (RCS, Kinyarwanda, French).\nAmateka.\nGereza ya Mageragere yashinzwe mu 2016 ihuza ibigo bibiri bitandukanye byo gukosora. Gereza ebyiri zahujwe Gasabo na Nyarugenge \nAbagororwa n'ibikoresho.\nGereza ya Mageragere yubatswe hamwe hateganijwe guturwa hagati yimfungwa 8000 - 10,000. Gereza ya Mageragere igizwe nibice bitatu, buri gice kigenewe guhuza ibikenewe gukosorwa:\nReba.\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;2\u00b002\u203206\u2033S 30\u00b001\u203200\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff2.0350\u00b0S 30.0168\u00b0E\ufeff / -2.0350; 30.0168"}
{"id": "21361", "revid": "13702", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21361", "title": "Philippe Van Leeuw", "text": "Philippe Van Leeuw ni umuyobozi, umukinnyi ndetse n'umwanditsi wa filime. Akomoka mu gihugu cy'Ububiligi. Yakoze filime ye ya mbere mu 2009 yitwa The Day God Walked Away. Muri 2017\",\" yanditse kandi ayobora indi filime \u201c\u201d. Iyi filme yamurikimwe ku nshuro ya mbere mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya filime ryabereye i \".\" Mu bihembo bya Magritte Awards byabaye kunshuro ya 8, iyo filme yegukanye ibihembo byose by'icyo yari yahataniraga, bingana n'igiteranyo cy'ibyegukanywe na \" Mr Nobody\", birimo n'igihembo cya Filime nziza n'icy'umuyobozi mwiza wa filme cyahawe Van Leeuw. "}
{"id": "21362", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21362", "title": "Impuhwe z'ishyamba", "text": "Impuhwe z'ishyamba (Igifaransa: La Mis\u00e9ricorde de la Jungle) ni filime yakozwe mu mwaka wa 2018 n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019amafirimi ukomoka Mu Rwanda Jo\u00ebl Karekezi. Ivuga amateka y\u2019abasirikare babiri bo mu Rwanda bitandukanije n\u2019umutwe wabo wa gisirikare mu ntangiriro y\u2019Intambara ya Kongo ya kabiri ndetse n\u2019urugamba rwabo rwo kubaho mu mashyamba aryana hagati y\u2019amakimbirane y\u2019intambara akomeye\nIserukiramuco rya filime rya mbere ryabereye mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime muri Toronto ku ya 8 Nzeri 2018 kandi rikaba ryaragize umwanya wa kabiri kuva Jo\u00ebl Karakezi. Filime yatoranijwe ku rutonde rwa TIFF's Discovery; St\u00e9phane Bak, umwe muri bombi bayoboye, yatoranijwe nk'umwe mu ba star umunani bakizamuka muri ibyo birori. Filime yagaragaye muri Festival International du Film Francophone de Namur mu Bubiligi. Ku ya 20 Ugushyingo, yagaragaye bwa mbere mu Rwanda mu iserukiramuco rya sinema ry\u2019iburayi 2018 (EFF) i Kigali. Filime yatsindiye Stallion ya Zahabu muri FESPACO. \nUmugambi.\nSerija Xavier unaniwe n'intambara (Marc Zinga) hamwe n'abashyashya ba Private \"Faustin\" (Bak) batandukanye bituguranye kubera intambara na bataillon yabo yo mu Rwanda mu karere ka Kongo iyo ihamagarwa mu buryo butunguranye mu gitero cya n'ijoro. Bahura n\u2019ibura ry\u2019amazi, ibiryo, n\u2019iterabwoba biterwa na malariya ndetse n\u2019inyamanswa byo mu mashyamba. Bombi barashaka kongera guhura na bataillon berekeza iburengerazuba ariko bagomba gukomeza kwirinda kugirana imikoranire n\u2019abaturage baho bitewe n\u2019uko Abanyekongo banga kurwanya ingabo z\u2019u Rwanda no kuba hari imitwe y\u2019inyeshyamba idasanzwe.\nUbwa mbere, Xavier mukuru ararakara kandi asaba umusore \"Faustin private\" ariko umubano wimbitse amaherezo uratera imbere hagati yaba bagabo bombi, cyane cyane ko \"Faustin\" atanga umusanzu ukomeye mubuzima bwabo. Filime irimo ibitekerezo byinshi ku mahano yibasiye akarere n'ibibazo byinshi byinsobanuro n'imbabazi mugihe cyintambara. Xavier arahigwa bukware n\u2019ubugizi bwa nabi yiboneye ndetse akanakora mu gihe Faustin ashishikajwe n\u2019iyicwa ry\u2019umuryango we n\u2019umugore ukiri muto yifuza kongera kubona.\nAmaherezo bahitamo kwigana abasirikari ba congo ubwabo, bombi bashoboye kugwa hamwe nitsinda ry'abaturage babagaragariza urukundo n'ubufasha. Amashusho atandukanye ya firime - gukurikirana inyeshyamba, kongera guhura n'intambara, n'ingendo zabo bwite zaba bagabo bombi - bahurira kumusozo wa film.\nUmusaruro.\n\"The mercy of the Jungle yakorewe\" mu Bubiligi na Aur\u00e9lien Bodinaux binyuze muri Neon Rouge Productions. Bodinaux, Karekezi, na Casey Schroen bashimiwe amashusho. Amashusho y'ubukorikori yaturutse Mu bufaransa hamwe na Filime nziza yo kurasa yo mu budage yashyizwe kurutonde rw'abafatanyabikorwa. Gufata amashusho byabereye muri Uganda."}
{"id": "21363", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21363", "title": "Umuhoza Nishimwe", "text": "Consolee Nishimwe (wavutse ku ya 11 Nzeri 1979) ni umwanditsi w\u2019u Rwanda, Umukangurambaga, kandi warokotse jenoside yo mu Rwanda mu 1994. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nNishimwe yavutse ku ya 11 Nzeri 1979 i Rubengera, Kibuye (Karongi), mu Rwanda. Nyina, Marie-Jeanne Mukamwiza, na se, Andre Ngoga bombi bari abarimu bigisha mu mashuri abanza. Bahuye mu 1972 bashyingirwa muri Kanama 1977. Nishimwe ni imfura (niwe mukuru iwabo) mu bana batanu. Avuga Icyongereza na Kinyarwanda. \nJenoside Yakorewe abatutsi.\nNishimwe yari afite imyaka 14 igihe itsembabwoko ryo ryakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda ryatangiraga muri Mata 1994. Uyu muryango wahungiye mu gace k'Abayisilamu kugira ngo ukingirwe ariko se na nyirasenge bishwe ku ya 15 Mata 1994. Nyuma y'icyumweru, barumuna be batatu, Bon-Fils Abimana w'amezi 16, Pascal Muvara w'imyaka 7 na Philbert Nkusi w'imyaka 9, baricwa. Sekuru na nyirarume na bo barishwe. Nishimwe yarahunze yihisha amezi atatu, yihanganira iyicarubozo n\u2019izindi ngorane, harimo n\u2019ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina ryanduje virusi itera SIDA. Nyina, Marie-Jeanne, na mushiki we, Jeanette Ingabire, barokotse. Jenoside irangiye, 90% by'abatutsi bo mu mujyi wabo bari barishwe. \nIbikorwa bye.\nMu 2001, Nishimwe yimukiye muri Amerika aho yabaye umuntu uharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu akaba n'umuvugizi ushishikariza abantu. Mu mwaka wa 2012, yasohoye urwibutso, \"Yageragejwe Kugarukira ku mateka y'Umucikacumu wa Jenoside Kubabara, Kwihangana n'Ibyiringiro\". Mu 2014, yavugiye mu nama nyunguranabitekerezo ya kaminuza ya Yale ku isabukuru yimyaka 20 Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda. Muri 2018, yagejeje ijambo ku Nteko rusange y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye. \nUbuzima bwite.\nNishimwe ubu atuye mu mujyi wa New York. "}
{"id": "21364", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21364", "title": "Beata Umubaye Mairesse", "text": "Beata Umubaye Mairesse (wavutse 1979, i Butare) ni ikimanyi cy'umunyaporonye n'umunyarwanda Akaba ari umwanditsi w'igifaransa n'ikinyarwanda akaba yararokotse jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda. Ni umwanditsi w'ibitabo bitatu, hamwe n'ibyegeranyo byinshi by'inkuru ngufi n'imivugo. Inyandiko ye yabonye ibihembo byinshi by'ubuvanganzo mu bufaransa ndetse no mu mahanga.\nUbuzima.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nBeata Umubyeyi Mairesse yavukiye kandi akurira i Butare, mu Rwanda. Se yari Umunyapolonye naho nyina ni Umunyarwanda. Akiri umwana, yize ishuri mpuzamahanga i Butare, aho yize kuvuga igifaransa neza. Muri jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu 1994, Beata w'imyaka 15 y'amavuko yarokoye we na nyina w\u2019umututsi agerageza kwigira umufaransa. Bombi bahunze igihugu bihisha muri convoy y'abana ya Terre des hommes. Umubyeyi Mairesse nyuma azashyirwa hamwe n'umuryango urera mu majyaruguru y'ubufaransa. Amashuri yisumbuye, yize ubuvanganzo na siyanse ya politiki muri kaminuza ya Sorbonne, ari naho yarangirije impamyabumenyi mu bikorwa by\u2019ubutabazi n\u2019iterambere. Nyuma yakoraga mu miryango mpuzamahanga ifasha no mu rwego rw'ubuzima. Kuva mu 2007 yabaga i Bordeaux, mu Bufaransa. \nUmwuga wo kwandika.\nMuri 2015, Umubyeyi Mairesse yerekanye bwa mbere nk'umwanditsi ufite icyegeranyo cy'inkuru ngufi zitwa \"Ejo\", ijambo risobanura \"ejo hashiz n'ejo Hazaza\" i Kinyarwanda, ururimi rwe kavukire. Izo nkuru zashyizweho mbere na nyuma ya jenoside kandi zivugwa uhereye ku bagore. Muri 2017, yasohoye icyegeranyo cya kabiri cy'inkuru ngufi, \"L\u00e9zardes\". \nMuri 2019, yasohoye \"Apr\u00e8s le progr\u00e8s\", icyegeranyo cy'imivugo. Muri uwo mwaka, Mairesse yasohoye igitabo cye cya mbere, \"Tous tes enfants dispers\u00e9s\". Igitabo kivuga amateka y'umuryango washenywe na jenoside n\u2019ubuhunzi. Ireba insanganyamatsiko nk'ububyeyi, uruhare rw'umugore nk'abatwara umuco, ihererekanyabubasha n'umuco hagati y'ibisekuru, ivanguramoko n'umuco. \"Tous tes enfants dispers\u00e9s\" yakiriwe neza n\u2019abanenga Abafaransa kandi ihabwa ibihembo byinshi by\u2019ubuvanganzo, harimo na Prix des cinq umugabane wa 2020 de la francophonie. Icyongereza, \"Abana bawe bose, batatanye\" bahawe ishimwe na \"Financial Times\" na \"The Guardian\". \nUmubyeyi Mairesse yasohoye igitabo cye cya kabiri yise \"Consol\u00e9e\", mu 2022. \"Consol\u00e9e\" avuga inkuru y\u2019umugore w\u2019amoko avanze yakuwe kuri nyina w\u2019u Rwanda akiri umwana kugira ngo arerwe n\u2019ababikira bera nyuma yoherezwa kurerwa mu Bubiligi. Inkuru ishingiye kubintu byabayeho byabana bavanze-moko barerewe muri Institut pour enfants mul\u00e2tres de Save mugihe cy'ubutegetsi bwabakoloni. Igitabo cyahawe Prix Kourouma mu imurikagurisha ry\u2019ibitabo byabereye i Geneve mu 2023. \nMu 2024, Umubyeyi Mairesse yasohoye igitabo cyandika ku buzima bwa \"Le convoi\", cyerekanaga ko yahunze u Rwanda mu gihe cya jenoside yo mu 1994. Muri iki gitabo, avuga uburyo yakurikiranye abana kuva muri convoy yahunze, ikipe ya BBC yafashe amashusho ya convoy, hamwe n'abakozi bashinzwe ubutabazi bakijije ubuzima bwe. Yavanze autobiography hamwe ninyandiko, ahuza ibikorwa bye n'abandi banditsi barokotse itsembabwoko, nka Primo Levi na Imre Kert\u00e9sz. \"Le convoi\" yahawe ishimwe n\u2019abanenga Abafaransa, kandi yitwa kimwe mu bitabo byiza byo mu 2024 na T\u00e9l\u00e9rama na Les Inrockuptibles. Igitabo cyakomeje gutsindira ibihembo byinshi by\u2019ubuvanganzo, harimo Prix Essai France T\u00e9l\u00e9visions na Grand prix de l'h\u00e9ro\u00efne Madame Figaro. Yabaye kandi finale ya Prix du Livre Inter 2024.\nMuri uwo mwaka, icyegeranyo cye cy\u2019imivugo \"Culbuter le malheur\" cyasohowe n\u2019umwamamaji w\u2019Abafaransa-Kanada M\u00e9moire d'encrier. \nBeata Umubyeyi Mairesse yatanze ijambo ritangiza iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ry\u2019ubuvanganzo mpuzamahanga rya 2424. [\"citation ikenewe\"]"}
{"id": "21365", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21365", "title": "Annick Kayitesi-Jozan", "text": "Kayitesi annick Jozan (yavutse mu 1979 u Rwanda) ni umwanditsi w\u2019u Rwanda akaba yararokotse jenoside yakorewe abatutsi.\nUbuzima.\nMuri Mata 1994, Annick Kayitesi-Jozan yabuze abanyamuryango bishwe muri Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi. mu batutsi bari i Butare, kandi bari bahungiye mu kigo cy\u2019ishuri, aho nyina yakoreraga. Interahamwe zishe nyina muriryo shuri. Murumuna we Aim\u00e9, ufite imyaka 9, mushiki we Aline, ufite imyaka 16, babyara be bombi, bajyanywe mu gikamyo bajyanwa aho batewe imipanga baricwa. Annick ntabwo yajyanywe hamwe n'abandi bagize umuryango we, kubera impamvu zidasobanutse neza, ahari kubera ko abaturanyi bashakaga kumugumana nk'umukozi. \nWe na mushiki we Aline, bajyanywe n\u2019umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta Terre des Hommes. Yimukiye mu Bufaransa. Yabanje kubana nimiryango yakiriye abanyamahanga.. Yiga siyanse ya politiki, abona DEA, nyuma atangira kwiga psychologiya. yatangiye kwitwa impunzi, mu 2005,aza kubona ubwenegihugu bw'Ubufaransa. \nYashinze ishyirahamwe \u00c9tudes sans fronti\u00e8res kugira ngo ateze imbere ishuri ry\u2019imfubyi za jenoside. Yitabiriye kwibuka Kunshuro ya 30 jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. \nUbuzima bwite.\nAfite umuhungu n'umukobwa Yabyaranye n'umufaransa. Kuva mu 2015 yabaga muri Uzubekisitani hamwe n'umugabo we, Rapha\u00ebl Jozan uyobora ikigo gishinzwe iterambere ry'Ubufaransa (AFD). "}
{"id": "21366", "revid": "16551", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21366", "title": "Irakoze Ariane Vanessa", "text": "Irakoze Ariane Vanessa ni umukinnyi wa filime w'umunyarwandakazi watangiye umwuga we wo gukina muri 2020, mu ruherekane rw'urubuga rwa \"Maya\". Nyuma yaho gato, Irakoze yakinnye mu rundi rubuga rwa interineti, \"Ibanga(The secret)\", ryakozwe n'umukinnyi wa filime wo mu Rwanda Yves Mizero. \nIrakoze yakinnye mu ruherekane rwa filimi ica kuri terevisiyo \"iShusho ya Papa\" nka Olive. "}
{"id": "21367", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21367", "title": "Rising from Ashes(firimi)", "text": "Rising From Ashes ni filime yigenga ya 2012 yigenga ivuga ku iterambere ry\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019amagare mu Rwanda, igihugu kigikomeje kwibasirwa na jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994 aho abagera ku 500.000-1,000,000 bishwe. \nUmugambi.\nUmukinnyi w'amagare wabigize umwuga Jacques \u201cJock\u201d Boyer yimukiye mu Rwanda mu 2006 kugira ngo afashe itsinda ry'abacitse ku icumu rya jenoside bahanganye n'ikibazo cyo gushinga ikipe y'igihugu y'amagare. Iri tsinda rigizwe n\u2019abana basigaye ari impfubyi kandi bahahamuwe na jenoside mu myaka icumi ishize. Mugihe cy'inkuru, Boyer hamwe n'itsinda \"Rise from Ashes\" byahise babifashijwemo nibyagezweho.\n\"Team Rwanda\" itangira nk'umuryango w'amagare ariko igenda ihinduka uko abategura bamenya abakinnyi bakeneye cyane. Abanyonzi benshi ntibazi gusoma no kwandika, bafite ubuzima budafite amazi, amashanyarazi cyangwa ubuvuzi, kandi benshi barimo gukira ingaruka z\u2019amateka ya jenoside yo mu 1994. Amaherezo, \"Ikipe y'u Rwanda\" ifatwa nk'ikimenyetso kicyizere ku Rwanda, ambasaderi w'igihugu kigaruka. Mu myaka yakurikiyeho, itsinda ryagura icyerekezo kandi ritezimbere icyitegererezo cyo kwita ku bakinnyi. Mu mwaka wa 2012, iyi kipe itangira guteza imbere ikipe ya mbere y\u2019Afurika yose ihuye na Tour de France nyuma yuko umwe mu bakinnyi yujuje ibisabwa mu mikino ya 2012 Summer Olympics.\nIsubiramo.\nDaphne Howland wo \"muri The Village Voice\" yise \"Rising From Ashes\" \"documentaire idasanzwe. Ntabwo ireba ikipe yo gusiganwa ku magare gusa; ni gihamya y'ibyabaye iyo abantu bita kubandi.\" \n\"Umunyamakuru wa Hollywood\", Frank Schneck yagize ati: \"Filime irasobanutse kandi ifite ubukungu.\" \u201cFilime\u2026 irinda melodramatike idasanzwe, nyuma ya byose, ntibikenewe cyane mu nkuru isanzwe irimo amateka akomeye.\u201d \nUrubuga rwo gukusanya urubuga Rotten Tomatoes ruvuga ko 79% by'abanenga bahaye filime isuzuma ryiza rishingiye ku isuzuma 19, impuzandengo ya 5.9 / 10. \nUmusaruro.\n\"Rising From Ashes\" yakozwe n'imiryango ibiri ifatanya n'imiryango idaharanira inyungu, Gratis 7 Media Group hamwe nu Project Rwanda, mugihe cy'imyaka itandatu. Forest Whitaker yavuze iyi filime yakozwe n'amadorari 800.000 yaturutse gusa ku baterankunga. Kuva yasohoka mu 2012, iyi filime yatsindiye ibihembo mu birori birenga icumi bya firime ku isi. [\"citation ikenewe\"]"}
{"id": "21368", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21368", "title": "Isaac Murwanashyaka", "text": "Isaac Murwanashyaka Nzabonimana (yavutse ku ya 19 Mutarama 1991 mu Rwanda), bakunze kwita izina rya stage Isacco ni umuririmbyi w\u2019igifaransa n\u2019ikinyarwanda, akaba n'umwanditsi w'indirimbo.\nUbuzima N'amashuri.\nIsaac Murwanashyaka Nzabonimana yavukiye mu Rwanda akurira cyane cyane muri Kenya. Ni bucura iwabo mu bavandimwe batatu babyawe na B\u00e9ata na Callixte Nzabonimana. \nMu bwana bwe muri Kenya, yatangiye gukunda umuziki hakiri kare. Nyuma yaje kwimukira mu Bufaransa gukurikirana amasomo ya Logistics anakomeza gutezimbere umwuga we wu muzika. \nIsaac Murwanashyaka Nzabonimana yatandukanye n'ababyeyi be akiri muto kubera ihungabana n'ibihe bigoye byagize ingaruka ku gihugu cye muricyo Gihe gihe. Kuva afite imyaka itatu, yarezwe na bakuru be babiri adahari ababyeyi be badahari.\nNubwo yakuze adafite urukundo rw'ababyeyi, yahawe uburere bukomeye kandi bwita kuri benewabo, we abona ko ari ababyeyi be b'ukuri. Mu kiganiro kuri televiziyo, yagize ati: \u201cNdi uwo ndiwe uyu munsi kubera bo.\u201d mucyongereza \"\u201cI am who I am today because of them.\u201d\nYongeye guhura n'ababyeyi be bamubyaye afite imyaka 21, uburambe yavuze ko butazibagirana. \nMu bwana bwe bwose, abantu benshi mu baturage - inshuti z'umuryango ndetse n'abo baziranye - bagize uruhare mu kumwitaho no kumererwa neza, nubwo ntaho bahuriye kandi nta kintu na kimwe bategereje. Iyi nkunga ititangiriye itama yatangajwe cyane na Isaac Murwanashyaka Nzabonimana kandi bituma agira impuhwe n\u2019ubufatanye. Akenshi avuga ko kwiyemeza gufasha abandi bituruka kuri ubu bunararibonye bwawe: \u201cIyo ukoze ibyiza hafi yawe, umunsi umwe bikugarukira haba kuri wewe cyangwa ku muryango wawe.\u201d\nUmwuga wa muzika.\nAzwiho ubuhanga nka Isacco akitwa Umwami wa Stage kubera ibikorwa bye byimbaraga n'ubushobozi bwo gukurura abantu no kubashishikariza\nIsacco yatangiye urugendo rwe rwa muzika muri Kenya, aho yamenyekanye na sitidiyo zafashwe amajwi na mubyara we, Rukuz, utuganya imiziki. Yanditse indirimbo ye ya mbere, \" \"Maisha Ni Mpango\" \" (\"Life is a Project\"), yakiriye amashusho kuri radiyo yo muri Kenya kandi amuha amahirwe yo gukora nk'igitaramo cyo gutangiza ibitaramo byaho.\nNubwo mu ntangiriro atigeze atekereza ko umuziki ari umwuga wabigize umwuga, Isacco yagumye mu ruhando nyuma yo kwimukira mu Bufaransa. Agezeyo, yinjiye mu ruziga rw'inshuti z'umuziki maze ashinga itsinda \" ' IC-KS ' \". Nyuma y'imyaka itari mike, mugihe abagize itsinda bakurikiranye izindi nzira z'umwuga, yahisemo gutangira umwuga wenyine.\nMuri 2017, Isacco yasohoye indirimbo ye ya mbere ku giti cye, NONAHA (\"Now \"), yahise atsindira ako kanya maze atangira urugendo rwe rwa muzika wenyine. Kuva icyo gihe, yamenyekanye kubera ijwi rye ry'ukuri, imbaraga zikomeye, hamwe na stage ikomeye. \nYasohoye izindi ndirimbo nyinshi, zirimo:\n\"Cheza\" (2018)\n\"Uko Ubikora\" (2020)\n\"Urampagije\" (2020)\n\"Malayika\" (2021)\n\"Inchallah\" (2021). \nMuri 2020, yashinze label ye bwite, ISACCO Production, asohora zunguza afatanyije n'umuhanzi wo muri Gineya Lil Sako.\nAlbum ye ya mbere, \"On s'amuse\", yasohotse muri Nzeri 2021 kandi ikubiyemo inzira umunani. Album ya kabiri iteganijwe mu mpera za 2025, hamwe nubufatanye butandukanye n'abahanzi bo muri Kenya. \nIbikorwa bye bikomeje kwitabwaho n\u2019itangazamakuru mu Rwanda no muri Kenya, yemeza umwanya afite mu muziki wa diaspora nyafurika. \nImikorere.\nMuri uwo mwaka, Isacco yakoze ibitaramo byinshi byubahwa, hamwe n'abahanzi bazwi:\nFrankfurt - Yasangiye stage na Dadju\n\u00c9lys\u00e9e Montmartre (Paris) - yaririmbanye na Serge Beynaud\nDock Pullman - Yakinnye na DJ Arafat, Bramsito, Passi, na Djibril Ciss\u00e9, uwahoze ari umukinnyi mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru mu Bufaransa aza kuba umu DJ\nDock Eiffel - Yitabiriye igitaramo cyo kwizihiza isabukuru yimyaka 25 ya Soum Bill\nFoire de Paris - Yakozwe nabahanzi batandukanye ba Trace Afrika\nZ\u00e9nith de Paris - Yasangiye stage na Mariam Ba\nLes Pyramide (Port-Marly) - Yakoranye na Ya Levis Dalwear na Samy Diko\nLe Bataclan - Kuri stage hamwe na Djanii Alfa na Lil Saako \nIbihembo.\n2016 - Umuhanzi mwiza w'umugabo muri Diaspora, Nshuti Awards\n2017 - Umuhanzi mwiza nyafurika muri Diaspora\n2022 - Umuhanzi mwiza wa Diaspora\n2023 - Umuhanzi mwiza nyafurika muri Diaspora, Umusaruro wa Kara\nIbikorwa by'ubutabazi.\nIsacco yiyemeje cyane gushyigikira abatishoboye, cyane cyane abasaza n'abafite ubumuga. Yagaragaje ko yumva ari ingirakamaro rwose iyo kumarana nabo umwanya Abatega amatwi, no gusangira ibihe byo guhuza abantu. \nKuva mu 2013, Isaac Murwanashyaka Nzabonimana yitanze buri mwaka muri Diyosezi ya Pilgrimage of Oise i Lourdes, akora nk'umurezi w'ibitaro ku basaza n'abamugaye basura. Afata inararibonye nkisoko ifatika yo gukura kugiti cye no guhumeka mubuhanzi. \nUburyo bwe bwashinze imizi muri altruisme: atanga ubufasha adategereje kugaruka, atanga igihe cye nta nyungu ateganya, kandi yizera ko gukora ibikorwa byiza nta mpamvu zidasanzwe ari isoko y'ibanze yo gusohoza umuntu ku giti cye. Kuri we, ibikorwa by'ineza bikorwa muri iki gihe bishobora kugira ingaruka zirambye haba mu buzima bwe cyangwa mu buzima bw'abandi. \nIyi filozofiya ya kimuntu iramenyesha cyane uko abona isi kandi ikomeza guhindura ibyo yiyemeje n'imibereho ye. \nUmwuga.\nIsaac Murwanashyaka Nzabonimana afite impamyabumenyi n'inzobere muri logistique. Yakoreye ibigo byinshi mpuzamahanga, harimo:\nBMW nkibice byo kugurisha ububiko\nNestl\u00e9 Purina nk'umukozi ushinzwe ibikoresho\nCurieux E-fluid nk'umuyobozi wububiko\nSodexo nkumutekinisiye wibikoresho mugihe cya olempike ya Paris 2024\nFM Logistic nk'umuyobozi w'itsinda\nGreenTech nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe ibikoresho\nIbihangano.\nImizingo.\n\"On s\u2019amuse\" (2021)\nAlbum ya kabiri (iteganijwe mu mpera za 2025)\nByatoranijwe.\n\"Nonaha\" (2017)\n\"Cheza\" (2018)\n\"Uko Ubikora\" (2020)\n\"Urampagije\" (2020)\n\"Malayika\" (2021)\n\"Inchallah\" (2021)\n\"Zunguza\" feat. Lil Sako (2021)"}
{"id": "21369", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21369", "title": "Marc Zinga", "text": "Marc Zinga (wavutse ku ya 21 Ukwakira 1984) ni umukinnyi wa Kongo-Umubiligi, umuririmbyi akaba n'umukinnyi wa filime. Yaririmbye bye muri \"May Allah Bless France\", yatorewe igihembo cya Most Promising Actor.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nZinga yavukiye i Likasi, muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, yimukiye mu Bubiligi n'umuryango we afite imyaka itanu. Yari umwe mu baririmbyi bayoboye itsinda rya \"Peas Project\" hagati ya 2003 na 2011.\nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga we wo gukina agaragara mu ma firime mato na televiziyo mbere yo gutangira imirimo ikomeye muri filime \"Abaskuti ba Zebrasi\" na \"May Allah Bless France!\" muri 2014. \nUruhare rwe muri \"May Allah Bless France!\", Zinga yatorewe igihembo cya cesar Award for most Promising Actor. Muri 2015, yahawe igihembo cya Magritte Award for Most Promosing Actor mu bihembo bya 5 bya Magritte Award kubera uruhare yagize muri \"Zebras\", naho muri 2019, igihembo cy'umukinnyi witwaye neza muri African Film and Television Festival of Ouagadougou (Fespaco) kubera uruhare yagize muri filime yo mu Rwanda yatsindiye \"The Mercy of the Jungle\".\nMu 2024, yabonye igihembo cye cya kane cya Magritte aba nuwa kabiri mu bakinnyi bitwaye neza, kubera uruhare rwe muri \"Omen\", filime yo mu 2023 iyobowe n'umuraperi Baloji wo mu Bubiligi-Kongo mu mukino wa mbere yakinnye. Zinga afite uruhare runini rwa Koffi, Wagarutse i Lubumbashi nyuma yimyaka 15 adahari. "}
{"id": "21370", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21370", "title": "Amazina (2021 film)", "text": "Nameless (izina ry\u2019Igifaransa: \"Les anonymes\") ni filime nyarwanda yo mu 2021 yo mu bwoko bwa drama, yayobowe na Mutiganda Wa Nkunda mu kuyobora kwe bwa mbere Filime yerekanwe ku nshuro ya 27 ya FESPACO, aho yatsindiye igihembo cyiza cyane. Byatewe n\u2019icyaha cy\u2019urukozasoni Nkunda yibaneye i Kigalii Kigali, ndetse na film ya Ken Loach yo mu 1966 \"Cathy Come Home\". \nInyandiko.\nIyi filime yari ishingiye ku bintu byabayeho mu buzima bugoye bw\u2019abakunzi bakiri bato baturuka i Kigali, ndetse no kuba barababaje mu ihohoterwa. "}
{"id": "21371", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21371", "title": "Nameless(2021 film)", "text": "Nameless (izina ry\u2019Igifaransa: \"Les anonymes\") ni filime nyarwanda yo mu 2021 yo mu bwoko bwa drama, yayobowe na Mutiganda Wa Nkunda mu kuyobora kwe bwa mbere Filime yerekanwe ku nshuro ya 27 ya FESPACO, aho yatsindiye igihembo cyiza cyane. Byatewe n\u2019icyaha cy\u2019urukozasoni Nkunda yibaneye i Kigalii Kigali, ndetse na film ya Ken Loach yo mu 1966 \"Cathy Come Home\". \nInyandiko.\nIyi filime yari ishingiye ku bintu byabayeho mu buzima bugoye bw\u2019abakunzi bakiri bato baturuka i Kigali, ndetse no kuba barababaje mu ihohoterwa. "}
{"id": "21372", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21372", "title": "Kinyarwanda (film)", "text": "\u00a0Kinyarwanda ni filime ya 2011 ishingiye kuri jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda.\nFilime.\nUshingiye ku nkuru zukuri, film igizwe n'inkuru esheshatu zahujwe n'ibintu byinshi bibaho mugihe cya Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi riba. \u200b\u200b\u200b \nKwakira.\n\"\" yavuze ko iyi filime ari \"Doubly Disappointing\", mu gihe African American Literature Book Club cyasobanuye ko ari \"umukinnyi wa mbere w\u2019ubuyobozi\". "}
{"id": "21373", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21373", "title": "Gamaliel Mbonimana", "text": "Gamaliel Mbonimana ni umuhanga mu by'amateka y'u Rwanda, Porofeseri Emeritus muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda. \"Azwi cyane mu Rwanda kubera ibikorwa bye nk'umuhanga mu by'amateka n'umuco\". \nMu 2007, yahamagawe nk'umutangabuhamya w'inzobere mu bushinjacyaha mu rubanza rwa Simon Bikindi imbere y'urukiko International Criminal Tribunal for rwanda. "}
{"id": "21374", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21374", "title": "Bazigaga", "text": "Bazigaga ni filime ngufi ivuga kuri genoside yakorewe abatutsi mu rwanda iri mu rurimi rwigifaransa yo mu 2022 yanditswe kandi iyobowe na Jo Ingabire Moys. Yafatanije na Verbinski hamwe na Graham King na John B. Carls, film ikinamo Eliane Umuhire.\nIyi filime yatsindiye igihembo cya BAFTA ku bahatanira igihembo cyiza cya Filime ngufi mu bihembo bya 76 bya British Academy Film Awards. \nIncamake.\nFilime ishingiye ku kuri ku ibyabaye, ikavuga inkuru y\u2019umupasiteri ukiri muto witwa \u201cKarembe\u201d (Ery Nzaramba) usabwa gushakira ubuhungiro we n\u2019umukobwa we kugira ngo birinde imitwe y\u2019abicaga Abatutsi ishaka kubagiraho nabi.\nMu gushaka uko barokoka, bahungira mu rugo rw\u2019umupfumu ukomeye kandi ukiri utinyitse muri ako gace uruhare rwakinwe neza cyane na Eliane Umuhire "}
{"id": "21375", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21375", "title": "Benjamin Sehene", "text": "Benjamin Sehene (wavutse mu 1959) ni umwanditsi wo mu Rwanda umurimo we w'ibanze cyane cyane ku bibazo by\u2019irangamuntu ndetse n\u2019ibyabaye kuri jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda. yakunze kuba muri Kanada no mu Bufaransa.\nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nBenjamin Sehene yavukiye i Kigali, mu Rwanda, mu 1959 mu muryango w'Abatutsi. \nUmuryango we wahunze u Rwanda kubera amakimbirane ashingiye ku moko n'ubwicanyi bwakorerwaga abatutsi mu 1963 bajya muri Uganda. Bagize amahirwe yo gutoroka babikesheje mukuru wa Benyamini, wakoraga muri ambasade y'Amerika i Kigali icyo gihe akaba yarashoboye kwimura umuryango. \nBenjamin yarakuriye mu bugande yiga no muricyo gihugu. \nYize i Paris muri kaminuza ya Sorbonne mu ntangiriro ya za 1980.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1984 Sehene yimukiye muri Kanada, atangira kwandika ku mateka ye 1988. \nNyuma yo kwimukira i Paris, mu 1994 habaye Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu rwanda. Sehene yasubiye mu Rwanda guhamya no kwandika kubyo yabonye. Yavumbuye ibyiyumvo byo mu bwana byashyinguwe mu kwibuka, ndetse n'ururimi rwe kavukire, Kinyarwanda. Agaruka i Paris, byamutwaye hafi imyaka ine kugirango atezimbere ibitekerezo bye mu nyandiko. Ashingiye ku byamubayeho, Sehene yanditse inyandiko ya \"Le Pi\u00e8ge ethnique\" (1999), yasohotse mu Cyongereza yitwa \"The Ethnic Trap\". \nMu 2005 Sehene yateguye documentaire isubiramo itatanya ry'abagize umuryango we, i Toronto, Buenos Aires, Paris, na Kigali. Urudodo rwabo bahuriyemo ni ugushakisha indangamuntu: bose bitwara muri bo itsembabwoko ryo mu Rwanda n'intangiriro yaryo. Yahangayikishijwe cyane n'ejo hazaza h\u2019u Rwanda n'akarere Lake Region. Yashyigikiye Afurika Renaissance, yizeye ko bishoboka nyuma yo kureba urugero rwa Afurika y'Epfo. \nMuri 2005 kandi yandikaga igitabo kivuga ku bimukira hamwe n\u2019urubyiruko rwo mu gisekuru cya kabiri n'icya gatatu cy'Abanyarwanda. \nYanditse \"Le Feu sous la soutane\" (\"Umuriro munsi ya Cassock\") (2005), igitabo cy\u2019amateka cyibanze ku nkuru y\u2019ukuri y\u2019umupadiri Catholic hutu Priest, Wenceslas Munyeshyaka, watanze uburinzi ku mpunzi z\u2019abatutsi mu rusengero rwe mbere yo gusambanya abo bagore no kugira uruhare mu bwicanyi. Iki gitabo nicyo gitabo cya mbere cy\u2019igifaransa cyitwa Rwanda cyasohowe kuva jenoside yaba yo mu 1994. \nSehene atanga kandi ingingo mu kinyamakuru cyo kuri interineti rue89, kandi ni umunyamuryango wa PEN International. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nAho Atuye.\nMu 2002 Sehene yari atuye muri Kanada; mu 2005 yari atuye mu La Chapelle District ka Paris, aho yari atuye mu 2008; mu Kwakira 2010 yari agarutse mu Bufaransa. "}
{"id": "21376", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21376", "title": "Uwamahoro Antoinette", "text": "Uwamahoro Antoinette (yavutse ku ya 25 Ukuboza 1975 i Kigali) ni umukinnyi wa filrimi w'umunyarwandakazi\nUmwuga.\nUwamahoro Antoinette uzwi ku izina rya \"Intare y'igore\", \"Siperansiya\" amaze imyaka makumyabiri akina muri firime mu Rwanda. Yamenyekanye cyane muri firime zitandukanye zo mu Rwanda zirimo Serikwira, Giramata, Mukadata, Intare y'ingore n'abandi. bifata iyindi ntera muri Seburikoko kuri Televiziyo y'u Rwanda. \nUmukangurambaga.\nYumvaga abaye umustar wa firime nka Commando. \nUbuzima bwite.\nNi imfura mu bana barindwi Bavukana.\nArubatse, afite abana batatu. Kuri ubu, atuye mu Karere ka Nyarugenge mu Murenge wa Nyamirambo. "}
{"id": "21377", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21377", "title": "Mfuranzima Fred", "text": "Fred Mfuranzima (wavutse 1997) ni umwanditsi wu Rwanda, umuhanzi, umusizi, n\u2019umuntu uharanira amahoro. Yanditse ibitabo mu Cyongereza no mu Kinyarwanda. Muri 2018 yashinze Imfura Heritage Rwanda, urubuga rwo guteza imbere ubuhanzi n'ubuvanganzo, no Peace activism. Inyandiko ze zikunze kwerekana ibibazo n'intsinzi by'abantu mu Rwanda nyuma ya jenoside ya jenoside yakorewe abatutsi. Nk\u2019umuntu uharanira amahoro, Mfuranzima yagize uruhare rugaragara muri gahunda zitandukanye n\u2019ubukangurambaga bugamije kwimakaza amahoro n\u2019ubwiyunge mu Rwanda no mu karere k\u2019ibiyaga bigari.\nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nFred Mfuranzima yavukiye i Huye, mu majyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda mu 1997, ariko yakuriye mu gace ka Kigali akomoka mu muryango w\u2019abantu barokotse jenoside. Amateka yumuryango we yaje kumutera ishyaka, bituma agira uruhare mukubaka amahoro nubwiyunge akoresheje imivugo, kwandika nubuhanzi. \nYatangiye kwandika akiri umwana muto mu mashuri abanza. Mu mashuri yisumbuye, yandikaga imivugo n'inkuru abo bigana. \nMfuranzima yize anitabira amasomo menshi yo kwandika n'amahugurwa, ndetse n'ibindi bikorwa bitandukanye byo kwiga. \nUmwuga.\nMbere yo gutangira kwandika nkuwabigize umwuga nk, Mfuranzima yifuzaga kuba umikinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru, ariko Yagize imvune yahagaritse ibyiringiro byo kuba umukinnyi. \nYasohoye igitabo cye cya mbere, \"\"Letter From Tutsi Hill\", mu 2017. Yanditse ibitabo bitandukanye mu Cyongereza na Kinyarwanda, harimo: Child, \"U Rwanda is Poetry\",The Broken, \"Kuva ku gasozi Bututsi\", \"Dreams to find another World\", \"Sister's Left Shoes na The Lonely Soul\". Byinshi mu bikorwa bye byabanda ku nsanganyamatsiko z\u2019\"identity\" (kwimenya no kumenya aho ukomoka), ubwiyunge ndetse n\u2019ubuzima bwa muntu, akenshi agaragaza ibibazo n\u2019intsinzi abantu bahura na byo mu mibereho yabo Rwanda nyuma ya jenoside.\nMfuranzima yanditse kandi ibisigo byinshi, birimo \"My Shame \", \"Never Again\", \"Endless Music\", \"In low Voice\", \"Confession\", \"Three Patriots\", \"Umwiza\", \"Full of Repect\", na \"African Dream\". \nYavuze ko ibihangano by abanditsi nkabanditsi b\u2019u Rwanda Tharicis Gatwa, Scholastique Mukasonga, Yolande Mukagasana, n\u2019abandi nka Oduor Jagero, Kae Tempest, na Shakespeare bya muteye imbaraga mu nyandiko ze. \nIbindi bikorwa.\nKugeza mu 2021, Mfuranzima yigisha mu bice bitandukanye, harimo kuri \"American Corner Kigali\" no muri \"Kigali Public Library\".\nMuri 2018, yinjiye mu Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019Imibereho Myiza y'Abaturage kwiga iterambere ry'umushinga, igenamigambi n'imicungire, anasaba amasomo atandukanye yo kwihangira imirimo. [\"\u200b\"] \nMuri 2018 Mfuranzima yashinze ikigo cy\u2019imibereho Imfura Heritage Rwanda Ltd, gikoresha ubuhanzi, ubuvanganzo, n\u2019ubumenyi bw\u2019ubwenge mu guteza imbere umuco w\u2019amahoro n\u2019ibyiringiro mu karere k\u2019ibiyaga bigari bya Afurika. Itera kandi impano nshya binyuze mu kwandika, umuziki, imivugo, hamwe n\u2019ubuhanzi bugaragara, kugira ngo ifashe kurema umuryango w\u2019abantu bashinzwe imibereho myiza n\u2019abaharanira amahoro. Mu 2021 Imfura yari ifite amashami i Kanombe, Kiyovu, na Huye. Yashinze kandi umuyobozi wa Imfura Arts Centre na Imfura Arts for Peace association. \nyateguye iserukiramuco ngarukamwaka ry'amahoro ryiswe Imfura Heritage Festival, rigaragaramo abahanzi bato baturutse mu karere. Yateje imbere ubufatanye na ambasade ya Isiraheli n\u2019Ubudage mu Rwanda, Isomero rusange rya Kigali, Intumwa z\u2019Umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi mu Rwanda, n\u2019imiryango itegamiye kuri Leta itandukanye mu Rwanda, harimo na Never Again Rwanda. \nYafunguye kandi inzu yo isohora ibitabo ikanabitangaza, kugirango byorohereze abanditsi b'u Rwanda gusohora. Yishyura 75 ku ijana by'amafaranga yo gutangaza naho abanditsi bishyura 25 ku ijana. \nKu rwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kigali ku munsi wo kwibuka jenoside yakorewe Abatutsii ku ya 21 Mutarama 2023, ufatanije na Aegis Trust, Mfuranzima yasomye bimwe mu bisigo bye. "}
{"id": "21378", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21378", "title": "Lyiza", "text": "Lyiza ni filime ngufi yo mu Rwanda ya 2011 iyobowe na Marie-Clementine Dusabejambo. \nInyandiko.\nIbihe byashize bihora mu buzima bwa Lyiza ugomba kubana n'ihahamuka ry'ubwicanyi bw'ababyeyi be, mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu 1994 mu Rwanda. Iyo amenye se w'uwo bigana, Rwena, nyirabayazana w'ubwicanyi bwabo, abivuga ku mugaragaro, bitera impagarara nyinshi. Ariko ubwumvikane bugaruka binyuze mu butabazi bwa mwarimu ujyana abasore mu ngoro ndangamurage ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, aho bibukwa, akanayobora Lyiza kubabarirra. Tutiriwe d\u00e9dactique kandi n'uburyo bw'umwimerere bwo kuvuga, film ishimangira akamaro ko gusangira ubunararibonye no kwigisha ukuri n'ubwiyunge. "}
{"id": "21379", "revid": "17049", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21379", "title": "Ikinyantigwa na Baribuda", "text": "Ikinyantigwa na Baribuda\u00a0ni ururimi rwa kinyacroele ruvuga Icyongereza, rwavutse ku ivangamiriro ry\u2019abavuga indimi za\u00a0Kwa\u00a0n\u2019abavuga Icyongereza cyo muri Antigwa na Baribuda mu birwa bya\u00a0Leeward. Ubu, ni ururimi kavukire muri Antigwa na Baribuda, Saint Kitts na Nevis, Anguilla, Montserrat, ndetse no mu miryango imwe yo muri Dominica. Ikinyantigwa na Baribuda ni rwo rurimi ruvugwa cyane mu bihugu byigenga byombi, kandi ni rumwe mu ndimi zivugwa cyane mu Burasirazuba bwa Karayibe. Ururimi rufite abantu bagera ku 150,000 baruvuga nk\u2019ururimi kavukire.\nIkinyantigwa na Baribuda rigizwe n\u2019amoko menshi atandukanye, kandi amwe muri yo yumvikana gusa mu buryo bugarukirijeho. Bitewe no kwiyongera kw\u2019ihuriro hagati y\u2019abatuye Ibirwa bya Leeward, uru rurimi rwa creole rwagize amoko menshi y\u2019utugari yaje kuzimira nyuma y\u2019ivangura. Ubwoko buvugwa cyane kurusha ubundi,\u00a0Northern Antigwan, bwagize impinduka cyane bitewe no kugabanuka no kugengwa n\u2019abandi bavuga Icyongereza.\nIgice kinini cy\u2019amagambo y\u2019Ikinyantigwa na Baribuda gikomoka mu Cyongereza, kandi ururimi rufite uburyo bwihariye bw\u2019inyajwi ndetse n\u2019imiterere y\u2019imvugo idasanzwe. Ikinyantigwa na Baribuda kigumye kuba ururimi rutari urwo mu nzego zemewe, bityo ntikigishwa mu mashuri cyangwa ngo gikoreshwe mu itumanaho ryemewe."}
{"id": "21380", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21380", "title": "Natacha Muziramakenga", "text": "Umwirondoro.\nNatacha\u00a0MUZIRAMAKENGA ni umunyarwandakazi wavutse: 1984(afite imyaka 41). Akaba azwi ku mazina: MIZIGURUKA. Akora umwuga wo gukina filim no gukora cyangwa guhanga filime. Ibihangano by'ingenzi Gukina filime, gukurikirana ibikorwa by'ubugeni. Urugero rwa fililme ya yoboye: \"Neptune Frost\", urugero rwa Filime yakinnye: Grey matter, Small country: An African childhood. \nNatacha MUZIRAMAKENGA, uzwi kandi ku izina rya MIZIGURUKA (wavutse 1984), ni umuhanzi uhuza ibihugu byinshi byo mu Rwanda akaba n'umuyobozi ushinzwe guhanga. Ibikorwa bye birimo imivugo, gukina, no gutunganya. Insanganyamatsiko yakozeho zagarutsemo kenshi harimo kwihangana, ubuzima bwo mu mutwe, uburenganzira bwa muntu, feminism(uburinganire bw'abagore n'abagabo), no guhagararira abirabura. \nMiziguruka yakinnye muri filime zitandukanye harimo \"Neptune Frost\" ; \"Petit Yishyura\", izwi kandi ku izina rya \"Igihugu gito: Gukurira muri Afurika\" ; \"Grey matter\" ; na \"Icyumweru k'i Kigali\". \nYagize uruhare mu ikinamico yitwa \"Kwiga Feminism yo mu Rwanda\", azenguruka Ubudage n'Ubusuwisi hagati \"ya\" 2020 na 2021. Yanditse igitabo cyitwa \"M\u00e9andres\" kandi akora ibitaramo bihuriza hamwe amashusho n\u2019imivugo mu birori bya Frequencies Festival i Berlin.Yerekanye ibikorwa bye nk\u2019ukurikiranira hafi ubuhanzi bw\u2019iki gihe i Seoul mu 2023.\nIbihangano bye byanditswe mu kinyamakuru \"Wasafari\" no mu gitabo rusange \"Au dessous des Volcans\", cyasohowe na Sepia mu mwaka wa 2019.\u00a0[]"}
{"id": "21382", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21382", "title": "Dorcy Rugamba", "text": "Dorcy Rugamba (yavutse mu 1969) ni umwanditsi, umukinnyi w'ikinamico, umubyinnyi n'umuyobozi w'ikinamico w'Umunyarwanda. Ni umuhungu wa Rugamba Cyprien na Daphrose Mukansanga. Ababyeyi be n'abavandimwe be benshi bishwe muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Ibikorwa bye byinshi bivuga kuri iyo Jenoside.\nMu 2012, Dorcy Rugamba yashinze Rwanda Arts Initiative. Mu 2024, yari umuyobozi w'ubuhanzi wa Kigali Triennial ya mbere. Mu 2024 kandi, yasohoye igitabo \"Hewa Rwanda, une lettre aux absents\". Mu 2026, yasohoye igitabo cy'inkuru \"Les enfants g\u00e2t\u00e9s de Butare\".\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nDorcy Rugamba yavutse mu 1969, mu Rwanda. Se ni Rugamba Cyprien. Rugamba Cyprien yari umwanditsi, umuhimbyi w'indirimbo n'imbyino, akaba n'umushakashatsi. Ni we winjije Dorcy mu buhanzi. Dorcy yatojwe imbyino gakondo z'Intore.\nDorcy yize ibijyanye n'imiti (farumasi) muri Kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda no muri Kaminuza Gatolika ya Louvain. Mu 1992, yashinze itorero ry'imbyino n'ikinamico \u00abIsango\u00bb i Butare.\nKu ya 7 Mata 1994, Dorcy n'umuvandimwe we Olivier ntibari mu rugo i Kigali. Bari i Butare kwa nyirasenge. Uwo munsi, abasirikare bishe ababyeyi be n'abavandimwe be batandatu. Umuvandimwe we Cirdare ni we warokotse mu rugo.\nDorcy yize ikinamico muri Conservatoire royal de Li\u00e8ge, mu Ububiligi. Yahawe igihembo cya mbere mu buhanzi bw'ikinamico.\nUmwuga.\nDorcy Rugamba ni umwe mu banditsi batandatu b'ikinamico \"Rwanda 94\". Itsinda ry'ikinamico Groupov ryayerekanye mu iserukiramuco rya Avignon, mu Bufaransa, mu 1999. Iyi kinamico yahawe ibihembo byinshi mu Bubiligi no mu Bufaransa. Mu 2004, yerekaniwe mu Rwanda: i Butare, i Kigali n'i Bisesero.\nMu 2001, Dorcy yashinze \u00abAteliers Urwintore\u00bb i Kigali. Ni ahantu ho kwigisha, guhanga no gukora ubushakashatsi mu buhanzi. Mu 2005, yayoboye ikinamico \"L'Instruction\" ya Peter Weiss. Iyi kinamico ivuga ku rubanza rw'abakoze ibyaha muri Auschwitz. Yerekanywe mu Rwanda, mu Bufaransa, mu Bubiligi, mu Bwongereza, mu Buyapani no muri Amerika. Hagati ya 2004 na 2008, Dorcy yakinnye mu makinamico yayobowe na Peter Brook, Rosa Gasquet na Milo Rau.\nDorcy yanditse ikinamico \"Bloody Niggers!\". Muri Mata 2011, ikinamico ye \"Gamblers, or the Last War of the Soldier Hungry\" yerekanywe bwa mbere i Antwerp, mu Bubiligi.\nMu 2012, Dorcy yashinze Rwanda Arts Initiative i Kigali. Ni ikigo giteza imbere ubuhanzi. Iki kigo cyateguye imishinga ye nka \"Planet Kigali\" na \"Umurinzi\". \"Umurinzi\" yakozwe mu 2019, mu kwibuka ku nshuro ya 25 Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nMuri Werurwe 2020, Dorcy yakoze \"Les restes supr\u00eames\". Iki gihangano kivuga ku murage w'Afurika uri mu nzu ndangamurage z'i Burayi. Cyerekanywe muri Biennale ya Dakar mu 2022. Mu Ukwakira 2020, yatangiye gukorana na Abderrahmane Sissako kuri opera \"Le vol du Boli\", i Paris. Umuziki wayo wahimbwe na Damon Albarn.\nMuri Gashyantare 2024, Dorcy yari umuyobozi w'ubuhanzi wa Kigali Triennial ya mbere. Yakinnye kandi muri filime \"Neptune Frost\" ya Saul Williams na Anisia Uzeyman. Dorcy aba hagati ya Buruseli na Kigali.\nIbitabo.\nMuri Werurwe 2024, Dorcy yasohoye igitabo \"Hewa Rwanda, une lettre aux absents\" muri \u00c9ditions JC Latt\u00e8s. Muri iki gitabo, yandikira ababyeyi be n'abandi bapfuye. Avuga ku bwana bwe n'ubusore bwe i Kigali. Iki gitabo cyashyizwe ku rutonde rwa mbere rw'igihembo Renaudot, mu cyiciro cy'inyandiko (\"essai\").\nIki gitabo cyahinduwe igitaramo giherekejwe n'umuziki. Dorcy agikorana n'umucuranzi w'Umunyasenegali Majnun. Cyerekanywe i Buruseli mu Ukwakira 2024. Muri Werurwe 2025, cyerekanywe mu iserukiramuco rya Adelaide, muri Ositaraliya. Mu 2026, cyari muri gahunda ya Biennale Teatro y'i Venise.\nMuri Kanama 2026, Dorcy yasohoye igitabo cy'inkuru \"Les enfants g\u00e2t\u00e9s de Butare\" muri JC Latt\u00e8s. Iki gitabo kivuga ku mujyi wa Butare mbere ya Jenoside."}
{"id": "21383", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21383", "title": "Rwanda na Juliet", "text": "U Rwanda na Juliet ni inyandiko ya nyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda yakozwe na producer Ben Proudfoot. \nUmugambi.\nIyi filime ikurikira urugendo rw\u2019umwarimu w\u2019ishuri rikuru rya Dartmouth, Andrew Garrod i Kigali aho agerageza kwinjiza abakomoka ku bahutu n\u2019abatutsi kugira ngo bakore icyiciro cya Shakespearean bizeye ko gishobora kubatera kwiyunga. \nKwakira.\nFilime yongewe ku masomo ya Universite Universite Film &amp;amp; Video Council. Yerekanywe muri Meredith College, ishyirahamwe ry'abanyeshuri rya USC Shoah Foundation. \nIbirori no kwerekana.\nIserukiramuco rya Filime mu Rwanda 2016 \n2016 Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Wisconsin \nIbihembo.\nFilime yatsindiye documentaire nziza mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya 16 ngarukamwaka. "}
{"id": "21384", "revid": "16551", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21384", "title": "Emamode Edosio", "text": "Emamode Edosio, uzwi cyane ku izina rya Ema, ni umukinnyi wa filime akaba n'umuyobozi wa filime. Yabonye impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor of Science (B.SC.) muri siyanse ya mudasobwa yakuye muri kaminuza ya Leta ya Ogun. Yize gukora firime ya digitale muri New York Film Academy (NYFA) n'amashusho yerekana amashusho muri Motion Pictures Institute of Michigan, Amerika. Yakiriye Filime nziza n'umu Director w'umwaka batanga ibihembo bya bashiki bacu. \nMu 2013, yasubiye muri Nijeriya. Yakoranye na sosiyete ikora filime nka 66 Dimension ni 2007. Nyuma yaje gukorana na Hip Hop TV, Clarence Peters muri Capital Dreams Pictures, EbonyLife TV ndetse aba n'umwanditsi kuri BBC. Ema yasubiye ku ishuri i Abuja kugira ngo akomeze kwiga sinema. Yakoze filime nyinshi nka \"Joy Ride\", \"Ochuko\" anayobora Kasala.\nUbuzima bwa mbere hamwe n'akazi ko kwiga.\nEdosio yavukiye mu rugo rwa gikristo. Ni umwana wa gatatu mu bana barindwi mu muryango we. Se ni umwubatsi akaba ari mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru naho nyina yari umunyamategeko. Yatangiye amashuri ye muri Loral Nursery and Primary School, umujyi wa Festac, Lagos nyuma yaho akomereza muri kaminuza nkuru ya leta, Odogbolu imyaka mike mbere y'uko arangiza amashuri yisumbuye muri S-tee Private Academy, Umujyi wa Festac.\nYabonye impamyabumenyi ya B.Sc. muri siyanse ya mudasobwa yakuye muri kaminuza ya Olabisi Onabanjo, mbere yuko ajya kwiga gukora firime ya digitale muri NYFA n'amashusho yerekana amashusho muri Motion Picture Institute of Michigan. \nUmwuga wabigize umwuga.\nYagarutse muri Nijeriya mu 2013 nyuma ya gahunda ye yo kwiga muri Amerika. Muri Nijeriya, Ema yakoranye na 66 Dimension, Hip Hop TV, Clarence Peters kuri Capital Dreams Pictures, TV ya Ebonylife na BBC. Nkumuyobozi, Ema yakoranye n'abahanzi bazwi nka 2Baba, 9ice, Lord of Ajasa, Terry da Rapmanand n'abandi benshi. Akazi ke ka mbere muri TV ya Ebonylife yitwa Heaven "}
{"id": "21385", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21385", "title": "Yuhi Amuli", "text": "Yuhi Amuli (wavutse ku ya 4 Nzeri 1993) ni umuyobozi wa firime, umwanditsi Wa Firimi, Akanazituganya Akaba n'umunyamategeko, Akomoka mu Rwanda. Filime ye ya mbere yerekanywe bwa mbere \"\"uburyohe bw'igihugu cyacu\" Ikaba izwi Nka \"A Taste of our Land\" (2020) yerekanywe bwa mbere muri Pan African Film Festival ryabereye i Los Angeles kandi yegukana igihembo cya Jury igihembo cya Filime nziza ya mbere yerekana inkuru. Iyi filime yagiye kwerekanwa mu yandi maserukiramuco atandukanye ya filime ku isi kandi yegukana ibihembo bya African Movie Academy Awards (2020).Filime mbere yakozwe n\u2019umuyobozi wayo yitwaye neza kurusha izindi\nUbuzima bwa hambere nakazi.\nAmuli yakuriye ku kirwa cya Nkombo, ikirwa gito kandi kitaratera imbere mu kiyaga cya Kivu, mu Rwanda, kikaba kidafite amazi n'amashanyarazi. Nyina yakoraga Mu ishuri ribanza ari umwarimu, naho se yari umucungamari. Nubwo amikoro Yari make Amuri yarezwe yihugurira cyane ku kamaro k\u2019uburezi no ku kwihangana. Yagiye mu mahugurwa menshi yo kwandika no kuyobora Firimi ku isi; harimo na Maisha Film Lab Yitabiriye muri 2014. \nAmuli yamenyekanye cyane muri filime ye ya mbere yise \"\u201cA Tasete of our Land\"\" (2020), Iyi filime Yakorewe mu gihugu cyo muri Afurika kitatangajwe izina, kandi ikubiyemo inkuru zabaye mu gihe abashinwa bari kwagura ibikorwa byabo kuri uyu mugabane, cyane cyane mu bikorwa by\u2019ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro. Yerekanwe bwa mbere mu Pan African Film Festival ryabereye i Los Angeles, yegukana igihembo cya Jury igihembo cya Filime nziza ya mbere yerekana inkuru nziza ndetse n\u2019igihembo cy\u2019Africa Movie Academy Award kubera Filime nziza ya mbere yakozwe n\u2019umuyobozi. Yabonye cyumukinnyi mwiza kuri Michael Wawuyo Sr muri Festival du Cin\u00e9ma Africain de Khouribga. \nFilime ye ya kabiri, \"Citizen Kwame\" (2023), ikurikira Kwame, umugabo wo muri Afurika wiyemeje kuva mu nzu ye. Ariko kugira ngo abigereho, agomba kubanza kubona viza itangwa n\u2019umugenzuzi wo mu Burengerazuba ugenga uko abantu basohoka cyangwa binjira mu nzu. Ni mu bufasha akura mu mubano mushya agiranye n\u2019umukobwa wo mu Burengerazuba aho ashobora kugera ku ntego ye. Iyo filime yegukanye igihembo cya Filime ndende ya mbere yakozwe n\u2019umuyobozi wayo yitwaye neza kurusha izind mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Afurika rya Luxor 2023. Muri 2017, yakoze \"Nameless\" abinyujije mu isosiyete ye yigenga yitwa, IZACU. Iyi filime yitabiriye amahugurwa nyuma y\u2019umusaruro mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Carthage muri Tuniziya, nyuma aza gutorwa kugira ngo ayikwirakwize na sitidiyo ya Orange mu Bufaransa. Numunyeshuri wiga muri Berlinale Talents (2021) na Laboratwari ya Toronto (2020). Kuva, Amuli yari arimo ategura film ye itaha, \"Kuva\". \nAmuli afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'amategeko yakuye muri kaminuza yigenga ya Kigali (Kigali Independent University) kandi akurikirana impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (LLMM) (icyiciro cya 2024) yibanda ku mategeko agenga imyidagaduro mu ishuri ry'amategeko rya Loyola i Los Angeles. "}
{"id": "21386", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21386", "title": "Jo Ingabire Moys", "text": "Jo Ingabire Moys ni umunyarwandakazi - umwanditsi, umukinnyi w\u2019amafirime n\u2019umuyobozi aho filime ye ngufi ya mbere \"Bazigaga\" yaranzwe no gutorwa mu bihembo bya BAFTA nyuma yo kwitwara neza mu maserukiramuco atandukanye. \nUbuzima bwa Hambere n'amashuri Yize.\nYavutse mu ntangiriro ya za 1990, mu ntangiriro ya Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi n\u2019abaturage bo mubwoko bw\u2019Abahutu mu 1994 Yakuriye ikigali muricyo gihe niwe wari muto mu bana batandatu. Nyina yakoraga ubucuruzi mu gihe se yakoraga ku biro bya gasutamo. \nMu 1997, igihe Moys yari afite imyaka 8, ku ikigo yigagaho batatswe n\u2019ingabo z\u2019interahamwe zakoze jenoside icyo gihe zashimuse abana b\u2019abanyapolitiki., Moys n'umuryango we bimukiye muri Uganda imyaka umunani nyuma bajyaa mu Bwongereza. Yize mu ishuri rya Dulwich mu majyepfo ya London. Aha niho yasanze ubuvanganzo bw'icyongereza kandi yibanda ku bitabo. Yarangije muri kaminuza Mariya y'i Londres.\nUmwuga.\nYakoze imirimo itandukanye muri firime na TV mbere yo kuba umuyobozi.I am \"Leah,\" ikinamico ye ya mbere \",\" yiteguye kwerekanwa bwa mbere mu nzu mberabyombi ya Kamden mu 2024.Ni umwe mu bashinze umuryango wa Ishami Foundation, umuryango utabara imbabare urwanya ivangura rikorerwa impunzi n\u2019abimukira mu bihugu bya Afurika. "}
{"id": "21387", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21387", "title": "Beautifully Broken (film)", "text": "Beautifullly Broken ni film yikinamico ya gikirisitu yo muri Amerika 2018 iyobowe na Eric Welch. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Benjamin A. Onyango, Scott William Winters, Michael W. Smith, Emily Hahn, Caitlin Nicol-Thomas na Eric Roberts mu nshingano zabo. Yashyizwe ahagaragara ku ya 24 Kanama 2018 na ArtEffects. \nUmugambi.\nAbabyeyi barwanira gukiza imiryango yabo, Ubuzima bwabo buhuzwa mu rugendo rutari rwitezwe ku isi yose, aho bahugurwa ku bijyanye n\u2019imbabazi n\u2019ubwiyunge.\nGosohoka.\n\"Beautifully Broken\" yarekuwe muri Amerika ku ya 24 Kanama 2018. \nIgisubizo gikomeye.\nKu rubuga rwo gusubiramo urubuga Rotten Tomatoes, firime ifite ibyemezo bya 67% hashingiwe kubisobanuro Bwa six Reviews, naho impuzandengo ya 5.8/10. "}
{"id": "21389", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21389", "title": "Tete Loeper", "text": "Tete Loeper, uzwi kwizina rya Divine Gashugi Umulisa Muri Filimi (wavutse mu 1990 i Huye, mu Rwanda), ni umwanditsi w'umunyarwandakazi, umunyamakuru, umukinnyi wa filime n\u2019umurezi.. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare rwe mu mushinga AMAHORO!, umushinga ugamije gushimangira ubufatanye hagati y\u2019amashuri yo muri Baden-W\u00fcrttemberg (Ubudage) n\u2019u Burundi, ndetse no guteza imbere guhahirana mu muco no mu burezi.\nUbuzima n'amashuri Yize.\nTete Loeper, Amazina ye nyakuri Ni Divine Gashugi Umulisa, ni umuhanzi, umunyamakuru, umukinnyi wa filimi n\u2019umurezi Ukomoka Mu Rwanda n\u2019Ubudage. Yize muri Groupe Scolaire Sainte Bernadette na Groupe Scolaire Officiel de Butare, aho yize ubugeni. Mu 2009 yatangiye umwuga we nk\u2019umwanditsi wa porogaramu ya radiyo \"Urunana\" kandi yatangiye no gukina mu makinamico y\u2019imbere mu gihugu no ku rwego mpuzamahanga - aho yigeze gukina nk\u2019umukinnyi mukuru muri \"\". Mu 2013 yabonye impamyabumenyi ya kaminuza (Licence) mu Itangazamakuru n\u2019Itumanaho muri Kaminuza Nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda.\nTete Loeper ukomoka mu Rwanda, yabayeho mu buhungiro mu gihe cya jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Burundi na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Ubunararibonye bwamuteye gusobanukirwa n\u2019imibereho n\u2019umuco mu karere k\u2019ibiyaga bigari. Uru rugendo rwe bwite rwagize uruhare runini mu kwiyemeza kwiga no guhana imico kama.\nUmwuga.\nTete Loeper yatangiye umwuga we nk'umunyamakuru, yandika ku ngingo zijyanye na n'uburezi n'uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nKuva mu 2022, afite umwanya wumuhuzabikorwa wa \"AMAHORO!\" gahunda, yashyizwe mu bikorwa na Baden-W\u00fcrttemberg (Ubudage). Iyi gahunda igamije gushimangira ubufatanye mu burezi hagati y\u2019abanyeshuri b\u2019Abadage n\u2019Uburundi.\nTete Loeper kandi yitabiriye, mu myaka irenga icumi, mu mishinga yo guhanga no kwigisha hamwe n\u2019abasore b\u2019Abarundi, cyane cyane mu buhanzi n\u2019uburezi.\nUmusanzu.\nTete Loeper yiyamamariza uburezi burimo no kugaragara kwa gahunda zuburezi mpuzamahanga. Ibikorwa bye bigira uruhare mu gushimangira ubwumvikane hagati y'Ubudage n'ibihugu bya Afurika y'Iburasirazuba."}
{"id": "21390", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21390", "title": "Alliance Isimbi", "text": "Alliance Isimbi (uzwi kandi ku izina rye ry'ubuhanzi Alliah Cool) ni umukinnyi wa filime wo mu Rwanda, umukinnyi wa filime na producer, wavutse ku ya 9 Gicurasi 1989. Ni umuntu uzwi cyane muri sinema Nyarwanda, cyane cyane kubera kwagura umwuga we akagera ku rwego mpuzamahanga, nko muri Nollywood (Nijeriya).\nUmwuga wa film.\nAlliance Isimbi yeeagaragaye bwa mbere muri filimi y'uruhererekana. yacaga kuri television Rwanda izwi nka Rwasa.\nArakora kandi nkutegura filimi afite intego yo gushishikariza abakobwa bakiri bato bo muri Afrika gukurikira inzozi zabo binyuze mubikorwa bye.\nYaguye umwuga we ku rwego mpuzamahanga, akorana n'ibigo byitangazamakuru muriNijeriya.Yakoze ku mushinga \"Accidental Vacation\" afatanyije n\u2019abahanga bo muri Nijeriya nka Anita Alaire Afoke Asuoha (Real Warri Pikin), kandi yabonye ibihembo muri Nijeriya kubera uruhare rwe mu ruganda rw\u2019imyidagaduro.\nKwiyemeza no Gutandukanya.\nMu kwezi kwa Gashyantare 2022, Alliance Isimbi yatorewe kuba Ambasaderi Mpuzamahanga w\u2019Amahoro (International Peace Ambassador) n\u2019Umuryango Mpuzamahanga w\u2019Abaharanira Amahoro ku Isi (IAWPA), bishimira uruhare rwe n\u2019umuhate afite."}
