{"id": "21397", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21397", "title": "Ishuri ryisumbuye rya IFAK Don Bosco", "text": "IFAK Don Bosco ni ishuri ryisumbuye riherereye mu karere ka Gasabo mu murenge wa Kimihurura, rikaba ryigisha abanyeshuri bari mu cyiciro cyibanza cy'amashuri yisumbuye(O Level) n'icyiciro gikuru gisoza amashuri yisumbuye (A Level). \nIshuri rya IFAK ryashinzwe n'umuryango mugari w'abasaleziyene mu mwaka w'1964, rifite intego yo gufasha abakiri bato gukura mu bwenge no mu mwuka, kumenya gutekereza byimbitse, no kugira imyitwarire ihwitse byose bifasha uwahize kugira ubumenyi buhagije ku isoko ry'umurimo. \nAmasomo yigishwa muri IFAK Don Bosco.\nIshuri ryigisha amasomo akurikira:"}
{"id": "21400", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21400", "title": "LAMBORGHINI", "text": "Automobili lamborghini S.p.A ni sosiyete yo mu Butaliyani ikora imodoka zihenze zizwi nka sports car n' imodoka zifite imbaraga nyinshi. iyi sosiyote ifite icyicaro i Sant'Agata Bolognese mu butaliyani kandi izwi ku isi yose kubera imodoka n'ikoranabuhanga rihanitse \nAmateka.\nLamborghini yashinzwe mu 1963 na Ferruccio Lamborghini, umushoramari w\u2019umutaliyani wari umaze kumenyekana mu gukora imashini n\u2019amapikipiki. Yashakaga gukora imodoka za siporo zifite ubudasa ku isoko ry\u2019icyo gihe kandi zihanganira urujya-n\u2019uruza rwa buri munsi. \nImodoka ya mbere yakorewe ni 350 GT mu mwaka wa 1960, ariko izamuhaye izina rikomeye ni Miura mu 1966, izwi cyane ku isi kubera ko yari ifite moteri hagati (mid-engine), bitari bisanzwe kuri izo modoka. \nMu myaka yakurikiyeho, Lamborghini yagiye ikora izindi modoka zizwi nka Countach, Diablo, Murci\u00e9lago n\u2019izindi, zose zigaragaza umuvuduko, imbaraga n\u2019imiterere yihariye. \nMu 1998, Automobili Lamborghini yabaye sosiyete iyobowe na Audi AG, sozi ya Volkswagen Group, bituma ishobora gukura no gukora imodoka zigezweho mu ikoranabuhanga no mu isoko mpuzamahanga. \nIbicuruzwa n\u2019Imodoka.\nImodoka za Siporo.\nLamborghini izwi cyane ku modoka za siporo zifite imikorere myiza, harimo:\nIkoranabuhanga n\u2019Imiterere.\nLamborghini iharanira gukoresha ikoranabuhanga rigezweho mu gukora imodoka zayo no gukora imodoka zifite imbaraga nyinshi ariko zifite n\u2019ibikorwa byita ku bidukikije, harimo gahunda yiswe Direzione Cor Tauri igamije kwimakaza imodoka zishyira imbere ikoreshwa ry\u2019ingufu zidahumanya ikirere kandi ziramba. \nUmusaruro n\u2019Imurikagurisha.\nKuva mu ishingwa ryayo, Lamborghini yakomeje gutera imbere. Mu mwaka wa 2023, yabashije kugeza ku bakiriya imodoka zirenze 10,000 mu mwaka umwe ku nshuro ya mbere mu mateka yayo, ikaba ari ikimenyetso cy\u2019iyongera ry\u2019ubucuruzi no kwaguka kw\u2019isoko. \nIcyicaro n\u2019Abakozi.\nSosiyete Automobili Lamborghini ifite abakozi basaga 3,000, kandi ifite urutonde rw\u2019abacuruzi mu bihugu birenga 50 ku isi yose, bituma imodoka zayo zigurishwa ku rwego mpuzamahanga. \nUmurage n\u2019Umurimo.\nLamborghini ni kimwe mu byamamare mu rwego rw\u2019imodoka zihenze kandi zifite imbaraga, ikaba ifite umubano ukomeye n\u2019abakunzi b\u2019imodoka ku isi yose. Imodoka zayo zikunze kugaragara mu bitaramo by\u2019imodoka, indirimbo, sinema n\u2019ahandi mu muco rusange."}
{"id": "21401", "revid": "17152", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21401", "title": "Bentley", "text": "Isosiyete ikora imodoka ya Bentley ni isosiyete izwi cyane y\u2019imodoka ikora ibinyabiziga bifite moteri yo mu rwego rwashinzwe ku ya 10 Nyakanga.1919 na Walter Owen aho icyitegererezo cya mbere cyubatswe i Cricklewood (mu Bwongereza) [1] [1]\nIT ifite icyicaro gikuru mu Bwongereza Pyms Lane, Crewe, Cheshire.\nItanga moderi zitandukanye zirimo imodoka zihenze hamwe na SUV zimwe aho bake muribo bashobora kurutonde hepfo:\nIngero z'umusaruro ugezweho (2025)\n Coupe nziza cyane. Moderi yo mu gisekuru cya kane 2025 igaragaramo sisitemu ya \"Ultra-Performance Hybrid\" isimbuza moteri yahoze ya W12.\n Ihindurwa rya verisiyo ya GT, itanga gufungura-hejuru kuzenguruka.\n SUV nziza ya Bentley. Iraboneka muburyo butandukanye harimo imikorere-yibanze hamwe no guhumurizwa.\n. "}
{"id": "21402", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21402", "title": "EPAK Don Bosco primary school", "text": "EPAK Don Bosco ni ikigo cy'amashuri abanza cyigwamo nabanyeshuri kuva mumwaka wa mbere kugeza mumwaka wa 6. icyi kigo cya Epak Don Bosco cyafunguwe nabasaleziyani (selesians) mu mwaka wi 1990. Icyi kigo Epak Don Bosco cyigwaho nabana bose ndetse kikaba kiyobowe n'abasaleziyani. \nIcyi kigo Epak Don Bosco cyatangijwe numutagatifu witwa Don Bosco ndetse akaba yarafatanije na Padiri Provincial Pierre Celesin Ngoboka hamwe na Padiri Jean Bosco Ntirenganya. \nIBYO ABANYESHURI BIGA MURI EPAK Don Bosco"}
{"id": "21403", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21403", "title": "Saint don bosco", "text": "Mutagatifu Don Bosco (izina rye bwite yitwaga Yohani Bosco cyangwa John Bosco mu Cyongereza) azwi ku Isi hose nk'\"Umubyeyi n'Umwarimu w'Urubyiruko\". Yari umupadiri Gatolika w'Umudage wo mu kinyejana cya 19, wamenyekanye cyane kubera ubwitange bwe mu burezi no mu gufasha urubyiruko rwari rwaratawe cyangwa rubayeho mu buzima bugoye. \nIsomo nyamukuru isi yize kuri Don Bosco, cyangwa Mutagatifu Yohani Bosco, ni agaciro k'uburezi bushingiye ku rukundo, ikizere, n'impuhwe, cyane cyane mu rubyiruko. Yagaragaje ko kugira ngo umuntu yigishwe neza, agomba kubanza kugaragarizwa urukundo no kwitabwaho, bityo yashyizeho uburyo bw'uburezi bwitwa \"Sal\u00e9sien\" cyangwa \"Preventive System\", bukubiyemo gutanga ubumenyi, kumurika inzira y'ubuzima, no gutegura abakiri bato kuzamura imibereho yabo no kugira uruhare mu iterambere ry'igihugu, aho kubahana n'ibihano cyangwa iterabwoba. Ubu butumwa bukomeje kugira ingaruka nziza mu Rwanda no ku isi hose binyuze mu bigo by'amashuri n'ibindi bikorwa bigamije guteza imbere urubyiruko"}
{"id": "21404", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21404", "title": "Pastor p", "text": "Bugingo Ndanga Patrick known as Pastor P wabonye izuba ku 1 Kanama 1986.Ni umwe mu batungamuziki mu buryo bwa majwi(Music Producer) mu Rwanda.Yatangiye uyu mwuga muri 2005 aho nyuma y'imyaka ibiri yakoze indirimbo ya mbere yiswe Ndarota y'umuhanzi Shanel.\nUsibye kuba ari umutunganyamuziki ni n'umuhanzi, aho yakoze album yitwa \"Warakoze Kunkiza\".\nIbikorwa yakoze.\nMu mwuga we yakoze ibikorwa byinshi birimo:\nByinshi wamumenyaho.\nMu iziki ufite umudiho nyarwanda, uyu muhanzi yasubiyemo indirimbo ya Burna Boy yise \u201cYe\u2019\u2019 ayicuranga bya Kinyarwanda ndetse iranishimirwa cyane ukurikije ibitekerezo byayitanzweho ku rubuga rwa Youtube.Iyi ndirimbo yagiye hanze muri Nzeri 2021 yayisohoye nk\u2019umuhanzi mushya mu muziki witwa KaguranoRwimo.Aho yavuze ko ari amazina akomora kwa Sekuruza. Ati \u201cKagurano yari Sogokuruza wanjye naho Nyirarwimo akaba Nyogokuruza, bityo Sogokuruza aza kubihina anyita Rwimo.\u201dAya ni amazina Pastor P yavugaga ko yahawe na Sekuruza ayakurana mu muryango ariko ntiyayitwa mu buzima busanzwe. Pastor P avuga ko aya mazina yahawe n\u2019ababyeyi be yayiyise ubwo yatekerezaga gukora umuziki ushingiye ku muco w\u2019u Rwanda.Ati \u201cNtekereza gukora umuziki ushingiye ku muco w\u2019u Rwanda, nibwo nabonye ko nkwiye gukoresha ya mazina nahawe na Sogokuruza.\u201dYavugaga ko n\u2019ubwo azajya akoresha aya mazina, ntabwo bikuyeho ayo yari asanzwe yitwa nk\u2019umutunganyamuziki.\nIbihangano bye.\nAlbum nshya ya Kagurano Rwimo yayise \u201cRuticumugambi\u201d. Iyi album igizwe n\u2019indirimbo 10. Hariho indirimbo z\u2019Urukerereza nka \u201cKabanyana k\u2019Abakobwa\u2019\u2019, \u201cRubanda rugira ayabo\u201d, \u201cWiriweho mwali\u2019\u2019, \u201cIbare\u201d, \u201cAgashinge\u201d, \u201cYewe Roza\u201d na \u201cAmashyo Rugamba\u201d.Hariho izindi ndirimbo nka \u2018Inyamanza\u201d, yamenyekanye cyane mu myaka yo hambere iyi kuri iyi album yayirimbiwe na Marie Louise (Umubeyi w\u2019i Musanze), \u201cAbaticumugambi\u201d y\u2019Abasaamyi ba Nkombo na \u201cLaurette\u201d ya Kamaliza yaririmbiwe na Miss Shimwa Guelda wegukanye ikamba rya Nyampinga w\u2019Umurage n\u2019Umuco muri Miss Rwanda mu 2017.Pastor P yavuze ko iyi album ari igitekerezo cyaturutse ku kuntu yabonaga indirimbo zo ha mbere zitagicurangwa kandi zifite amateka ahambaye ku bakunzi b\u2019umuziki, bityo zikaba zikwiriye gusigasirwa.Ati \u201cIyo ugiye kureba usanga indirimbo zo ha mbere radiyo zitakizicuranga kuko nta muziki irimo nyamara zifite amateka akomeye ku mitima yacu, ibyo byatumye nzisubiramo nziha imiziki kandi nzikora ku buryo bugezweho ku buryo byakunda ko bakomeza kuzicuranga no muri iyi minsi.\u201dPastor P yavuze ko iyi album y\u2019indirimbo icumi yazihereyeho mu rugendo rwe rwo gukora umuziki, ati \u201cNibaza ko mfite indirimbo nyinshi zirimo izanjye bwite, gusa naravuze nti aho kugira ngo nkomeze gukora izindi uwabanza kureba ku zisanzwe zihari.\u201dLaurette ya Kamaliza yasubiwemo na Miss Guelda Shimwa ntabwo ari indirimbo nshya kuko Pastor P yayimukoreye mu myaka yo hambere dore ko uyu mukobwa yanayiririmbye mu gitaramo cyo kumurika album ya Charly na Nina mu 2017.Iki gihe uyu mukobwa yavugaga ko yiteguye gutangira urugendo rw\u2019umuziki ku giti cye gusa yaje guhura n\u2019ibicantege bitandukanye iby\u2019umuziki abishyira ku ruhande."}
{"id": "21405", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21405", "title": "B-2 spirit", "text": "= Northrop Grumman B-2 Spirit =\nThe Northrop Grumman B-2 Spirit, also known as the Stealth Bomber, is an American heavy strategic bomber, featuring low-observable stealth technology designed to penetrate dense anti-aircraft defenses. A flying wing design with a crew of two, the B-2 is capable of delivering both conventional and thermonuclear weapons.\nDevelopment and History.\nThe B-2 originated from the \"Advanced Technology Bomber\" (ATB) project during the Carter administration. Its development was a significant leap in aerospace engineering, focusing on reducing the aircraft's radar, infrared, visual, and acoustic signatures.\nDesign Features.\nThe B-2\u2019s most distinctive feature is its flying wing configuration, which lacks a fuselage or tail. This shape, combined with radar-absorbent materials (RAM), makes it exceptionally difficult to detect on radar.\nStealth Technology.\nThe aircraft's stealth comes from a combination of reduced acoustic, infrared, visual, and radar signatures. This allows the B-2 to operate at high altitudes without being easily targeted by surface-to-air missiles or interceptor aircraft.\nOperational History.\nThe B-2 was originally designed to strike high-value Soviet targets during the Cold War. However, it has seen extensive use in conventional conflicts since its debut.\nNote: Due to its high maintenance requirements and sophisticated skin, the B-2 requires specialized climate-controlled hangars to protect its radar-absorbent coating."}
{"id": "21406", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21406", "title": "Spiro", "text": "Spiro ni ikigo cy'ubucuruzi gikorera muri Afurika, gikora kandi gicuruza moto z'amashanyarazi, kikanatanga serivisi yo guhinduranya bateri (\"battery swapping\") ku bamotari.\nGikorera mu bihugu bitandatu by'Afurika, harimo n'Rwanda, aho cyatangiye ibikorwa mu 2023. Kigamije kugabanya ikoreshwa ry'ibikomoka kuri peteroli mu bwikorezi no kugabanya ingaruka mbi ku bidukikije.\nAmateka.\nSpiro yatangiye ibikorwa byayo muri Togo na Bene mu 2022, maze mu 2023 igera muri Kenya, Rwanda, Ubugande na Nijeriya. Umuyobozi wayo mukuru ni Kaushik Burman. Muri Gicurasi 2024, ikinyamakuru \"TIME\" cyayishyize ku rutonde rw'ibigo 100 bifite ijambo rikomeye ku isi (\"TIME100 Most Influential Companies\"); icyo gihe yari ifite moto z'amashanyarazi zigera ku 14 000.\nMu Kwakira 2025, Spiro yabonye ishoramari rya miliyoni 100 z'amadolari y'Amerika, harimo miliyoni 75 zatanzwe n'ikigega FEDA cya Banki Nyafurika y'Ubucuruzi bw'Ibyoherezwa mu Mahanga (Afreximbank).\nIbikorwa mu Rwanda.\nMu Rwanda, ibiro bya Spiro biri i Remera\u2013Giporoso, mu mujyi wa Kigali. Muri Nzeri 2025, Spiro yamuritse imideli mishya ya moto, Ekon 450M1 na Ekon 450M2, iteranyirizwa mu gihugu kandi ku giciro kiri hasi ugereranyije n'iyabanje. Ku wa 14 Kanama 2026, yamuritse moto nshya, EKON M1 V3, yakorewe imisozi n'imihanda igoye yo mu Rwanda, mu imurikagurisha ry'i Gikondo.\nMuri Nyakanga 2026, Spiro yari ifite mu Rwanda moto z'amashanyarazi zirenga 28 000 na sitasiyo zirenga 300 zo guhinduranya bateri, harimo eshatu nini i Kigali; yari imaze no guha akazi abantu barenga 3 000."}
{"id": "21407", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21407", "title": "Imyitwarire y'amuntu", "text": "Ubumenyi bw\u2019Imitekerereze bushingiye ku Myitwarire (Behavioral Psychology).\nUbumenyi bw\u2019imitekerereze bushingiye ku myitwarire, buzwi nka \"Behavioral Psychology\", ni ishami ry\u2019ubumenyi bwiga kandi bugasesengura imyitwarire igaragara y\u2019abantu n\u2019inyamaswa, hibandwa ku buryo imyitwarire yiga, igahinduka, kandi ikagenzurwa n\u2019ibidukikije. Iri shami ryirinda kwibanda cyane ku bitekerezo byihishe mu mutwe, ahubwo rikita ku byo umuntu akora bishobora gupimwa no kugaragara.\nBehavioral Psychology ishingiye ku gitekerezo cy\u2019uko imyitwarire myinshi yigishwa binyuze mu bunararibonye, cyane cyane hifashishijwe ibihembo (reinforcement) n\u2019ibihano (punishment). Abahanga bagaragaje ko iyo imyitwarire ihembwe, ishobora kwiyongera, naho iyo ihaniwe, ishobora kugabanuka cyangwa igahagarara burundu.\nHari amahame y\u2019ingenzi agenga Behavioral Psychology. Irimwe muri ryo ni kwiga binyuze mu gusubiramo (conditioning). Habaho ubwoko bubiri bw\u2019ingenzi:\nIri shami ry\u2019ubumenyi rifite akamaro kanini mu nzego zitandukanye z\u2019ubuzima. Mu burezi, rifasha abarimu gutegura uburyo bwo kwigisha bushingiye ku guhemba imyitwarire myiza y\u2019abanyeshuri, bityo bigatuma biga neza kandi bakitwara neza. Mu rwego rw\u2019ubuvuzi bw\u2019indwara zo mu mutwe, Behavioral Psychology ikoreshwa mu gufasha abantu guhindura imyitwarire itabafasha, nk\u2019ubwoba bukabije, imyitwarire yo kwigunga, cyangwa ingeso mbi.\nNanone, Behavioral Psychology ifite uruhare mu mibereho ya buri munsi. Ifasha abantu gusobanukirwa impamvu bitwara mu buryo runaka no kumenya uko bahindura imyitwarire yabo bifashishije imyitozo, kwiyemeza, n\u2019ibihembo byiza. Ibi bituma umuntu yiyubaka, akagira imyitwarire imufasha kugera ku ntego ze no gutera imbere.\nMu gusoza, ubumenyi bw\u2019imitekerereze bushingiye ku myitwarire ni ingenzi cyane mu gusobanukirwa no kunoza imyitwarire ya muntu. Bwerekana ko imyitwarire myinshi ishobora kwigishwa no guhindurwa, bigatanga umusanzu ukomeye mu iterambere ry\u2019umuntu ku giti cye n\u2019iry\u2019umuryango muri rusange."}
{"id": "21408", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21408", "title": "Rolls royce", "text": "Rolls royce ni uruganda rukora imodoka rwo mugihugu cy'ubwongereza (England), rukaba ruzwiho gukora imodoka nziza kandi zigezweho, zijyanye n'iterambere.\nRolls royce izwiho kuba ikora imodoka zitari iza siporo (non-sports cars) zifashwa mu bikorwa bigiye bitandukanye nko mubirori, mubukwe ndetse nibindi bikorwa bigiye bitandukanye.\nUko rolls royce yatangijwe.\n7. Umurage.\nRolls-Royce yakozwe kubera ubuhanga bwa Henry Royce mu by\u2019imashini, ubushobozi bwa Charles Rolls mu bucuruzi, n\u2019impamvu zabo zo gukora ibicuruzwa byiza kurusha ibindi byose\u2014biba mu modoka cyangwa mu moteri z\u2019indege"}
{"id": "21409", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21409", "title": "BLUEFACE", "text": "JONATHAN JAMAL PORTER ni umuhanzi wo muri AMERICA uzwi cyane kumazina ya BLUEFACE wamenyekanye cyane mu mwaka wa 2018\nasohoye indirimbo yitwa respect my crippin ariyo yahise imuzamurira urwego rwubuhanzi akunzwe cyane kandi bitewe nuburyo bwa offbeat bwe\nbutandukanye nubwabandi nubwo indirimbo yamuzamuye ari respect my crippin ariko iye izwi cyane ni thotiana yasohotse 2020. BLUEFACE yaramaze igihe kirekire adasohora bitewe nuko yari yarafunzwe kuva muri 2023 bitewe no gucyekwaho icyaha cyihohotera ry'umwana we w'umuhungu amwima ibiryo kandi atabuze ubushobozi amategeko amukatira imyaka ibiri muri gereza iba muri northcarolina\nUBUZIMA BWE BWA MBERE YUMUZIKI\nJAMAL PORTER yavutse kuri 20 nyakanga 1997 avukira mu mugi wa los angeles,california. Yabanje kubana na mama we nyuma ava california yimukira oakland city kubana na papa we,aho yagiye ku ishuri ryitwe arleta ahita ajya mubandi banyeshuri bari barakoze itsinda ry'ubuhanzi yisangamo impano yo kuririmba kandi nanone aba mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru bitewew nimbaraga yari afite n'indeshyo byatumye bamwizera cyane muri uwo mukino. muri ibyo bihe yakinaga uwo mukino kurusha uko yitaga kubuhanzi bwe akomeza gukina no kubindi bigo mpaka 2016.\nAKAZI K'UBUHANZI\nAHO NABISOBANUYE KO yasohoye indirimbo ye yambere 2018 izamura abafana bitewe nuburyo aririrmba byihariye nyuma aza gusohora indirimbo ye yakuruye abafana benshi yitwa THOTIANA yakoranye nuwitwa CARDI B nyuma yaho aba reproducer batangira gukururwa inkuru murizo yitwa lyrical lemonade ariyo yahise ahitamo muri zose ahita akorana indirmbo nabandi bahanzi bakuruwe nawe aho muri 2020 yakoze concert ye yambere"}
{"id": "21410", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21410", "title": "Central cee", "text": "Real names of central cee are Oakley Neil Caesar-Su and he was born on 4 june 1998(currently 27 years). He was born and raised in shepherds bush. Central cee is an atypical London drill rapper best known for hits such as \"commitment issues\" and \"loading\". As for now central cee is an unsigned singer/independent\nHe currently has 4 awards including 2021 winner MOBO award (Best drill act),2021 winner MOBO award (Best newcomer),2022 winner MOBO award(video of the year),2022 winner MOBO award (Best male act)and 12 nominations"}
{"id": "21412", "revid": "15993", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21412", "title": "Costa Titch", "text": "Costantinos Tsobanoglou (Yavutse 25 Mutarama 1995 - Yitabarutse 11 Werurwe 2023), uzwi cyane ku izina rye ry'ubuhanzi rya Costa Titch, yari umuraperi mujyana ya Amapiano wo muri Afurika y'Epfo, umuririmbyi n'umwanditsi w'indirimbo n'umubyinnyi. \nUbuzima bwite.\nSe wa Costa Titch yari Umugereki naho nyina akaba Umunyafurika y\u2019Epfo. Yavukiye muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo.Ku ntangiriro z\u2019ubuzima bwe, Costa Titch yagiraga urukundo rukomeye n\u2019imyidagaduro, atangira ari umubyinnyi. Mu mwaka wa 2014, yimukiye i Johannesburg, aho yakomeje umwuga we wo kuba umuraperi.\nMu 2020, Costa Titch yasohoye alubumu ye ya mbere yise \"Made In Africa\", irimo ubufatanye n'abahanzi batandukanye bo muri Afurika y'Epfo nka AKA, Riky Rick, na Boity. Iyi alubumu yamamaye cyane kandi yagenze neza mu bucuruzi, ishimangira ko Costa Titch ari umwe mu bahanzi bakomeye mu muziki wo muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yakomeje kwegukana ibihembo 3 byo guhatanira ibihembo bya Hip Hop Awards 2020 muri Afurika y'Epfo ndetse yegukana Igihembo Cyo gufatanya n'abandi bahanzi \"Nkalakatha Remix\" irimo AKA na Riky Rick mu gusubiramo Nkalakatha yakozwe na Mandoza.\nIndirimbo ye \"Ayeye\" yakiriwe neza cyane, bitewe n'ubutumwa bwayo butera inkunga bwo kugumana icyizere nubwo ubuzima bwari bugoye. Indi ndirimbo ye, \" \"Big Flexa\" \", yatsinze agahigo ko kuba videwo y'indirimbo Amapiano yarebwe cyane kuri YouTube mu Ukuboza 2022. Muri uwo mwaka, yabonye amanota menshi mu marushanwa ya 7 ya All Africa Music Awards 2022. \nCosta Titch yanakoranye n'umuririmbyi w'umunyamerika ukomoka muri Senegali witwa Akon mu gukora remix y'indirimbo \" \"Big Flexa\" \", irimo umusanzu wa mugenzi we w'umucuranzi wa Amapiano Alfa Kat akaba na producer Ma Gang. \nMu 2022, Titch yakoranye n'umuririmbyi w'umunya - Nigeria, OLA, mu ndirimbo yabo ya \" \"Data\" \". \nCosta Titch na Champuru Makhenzo bashyize ahagaragara umushinga wabo wa EP ' \"Trapiano Vol.1\" '. \nUrupfu.\nKu ya 11 Werurwe 2023, Costa Titch yaguye mu kantu ubwo yari arimo kuririmba mu iserukiramuco rya muzika rya Ultra South Africa i Johannesburg. Yahise asubirana imbaraga ze maze akomeza kuririmba, ariko yongera kugwa Ahita apfa afite ku myaka 28. Dukurikije iperereza ryakozwe n'umuryango we n'abaganga b'indwara, urupfu rw'uyu muhanzi w'icyamamare rwatewe n'ibintu byinshi bitandukanye, birimo umuvuduko utazwi ku mutima we, stress idashira, n'umunaniro ukabije.\nItangazo ryemewe ryasohowe n\u2019umuryango we rivuga ko igitutu ku mutima we n\u2019umunaniro uhoraho (stress chronique) bishoboka ko byateye ihindagurika ridasanzwe ry\u2019imiterere y\u2019imikubitire y\u2019umutima, ari na ryo ryateye igicuri (seizure) cyamwishe ubwo yari ari ku rubyiniro aririmba. "}
{"id": "21415", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21415", "title": "Ikiganiro mpaka", "text": "Ikiganiro mpaka Mubuzima busanzwe iyo tuganira cyangwa iyo duhuye nabagenzi bacu turasuhuzanya tugahana ibiganza ndetse hari abagira n'akanyamuneza bagahoberana ndetse bagahana n'imisaya ibyo baganira cyangwa se amambo babwirana niyo azamura ibyiyumvo umuntu akiyumva bitandukanye nuko yarasanzwe yiyumva mubihe bisanzwe.\nni nabwo hahita habaho intangiro yokuganira kw' abantu babiri ikiganiro kinikizwa sinakubwira rimwe na rimwe ninabwo usanga harubwo umuntu aturika agaseka biturutse kukiganiro kirikuganirwa."}
{"id": "21418", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21418", "title": "Michel Nkuka Mboladinga", "text": "Michel Nkuka Mboladinga cyangwa Michel Kuka Mboladinga (yavutse ku wa 26 Nzeri 1976) ni mufana w'umupira w'amaguru wo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (RDC). Azwi ku mazina y'akabyiniriro Lumumba na Lumumba Vea kubera uko ahagarara asa n'igishushanyo cya Patrice Lumumba mu gihe ikipe y'igihugu ya RDC \"Les L\u00e9opards\" iri gukina. Kuva mu 2013, amara umukino wose ahagaze adahumeka, atimura umubiri, nk'igishushanyo. Yamenyekanye cyane muri rubanda no mu itangazamakuru mpuzamahanga ubwo yagaragaraga mu mikino ya Igikombe cya Afurika cya 2025 cyabereye muri Maroke.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nMichel Nkuka Mboladinga yavukiye muri Zayire (ubu ni Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ku wa 26 Nzeri 1976. Ni umufana ukomeye w'ikipe y'igihugu ya RDC, izwi ku izina \"Les L\u00e9opards\", kandi avuga ko yatangiye kuyishyigikira kera mbere y'uko amenyekana nk'\u00abmufana igishushanyo\u00bb. \nMu 2013, yafashe icyemezo cyo guhindura uburyo yifata mu kibuga: kuva icyo gihe, mu mikino minini y'ikipe y'igihugu ahagaze ameze nk'igishushanyo, aticara kandi atagendagenda mu bafana. Ni umunyamuryango w'ishyirahamwe ryemewe ry'abafana n'abashishikariza ikipe y'igihugu ya RDC, kandi mu kiganiro yivuga nk'umuhanzi n'umushyushyarugamba ukoresha umupira w'amaguru ngo yibutse amateka y'igihugu cye.\nIbisobanuro ku mikorere ye.\nMu gihe cy'umukino, Michel Kuka Mboladinga ahagarara iminota 90 yose y'umukino w'ibanze, kandi iyo bibaye ngombwa akageza no ku nyongera n'imitutire y'amapenaliti, aticara na rimwe. Akenshi ahagarara hejuru y'agahanda gato kateguwe ku ruhande rw'ikibuga, akazamura ukuboko kwe kw'iburyo hejuru areba mu kirere, mu mwanya uvanze n'uwa statue ya Patrice Lumumba iri ku rwibutso ruri i Kinshasa. \nYambara imyambaro yiganjemo amabara y'ibendera rya RDC \u2013 ubururu, umuhondo n'umutuku \u2013 kandi imisatsi ye n'amaso y'amaso agashushanya uburyo bw'ibijyana n'imyambarire yo mu myaka ya 1960, kugira ngo arusheho gusa na Lumumba. Mu biganiro n'itangazamakuru asobanura ko iyo myitwarire ari ituro ryo kubaha Lumumba no kugaragaza indangagaciro z'icyubahiro, ubwigenge n'ubusugire bw'igihugu.\nUko yamenyekanye mu itangazamakuru.\nMu gihe cya Igikombe cya Afurika cya 2025, kuba ahagaze adahinduka mu kibuga byatumye amamera mu mashusho y'ibinyamakuru mpuzamahanga, kuko imyitwarire ye itandukanye cyane n'uburyo abafana benshi b'umupira w'amaguru bamenyerewe kwitwara batanga ibyishimo n'amajwi menshi. \nAmafoto n'amashusho ye yakwirakwiye ku mbuga nkoranyambaga, aho bamwe bamwise \u00abmufana igishushanyo\u00bb cyangwa \u00abumwuzukuru wa Lumumba\u00bb. Mu mikino y'umuyoboro wa televiziyo, abatangaza imikino bakunda kugaragaza ifoto ye buri mukino RDC yakinnye, ku buryo aba ikimenyetso cyihariye cy'iyo kipe. \nAbandi bafana bamwe na bo batangiye kugerageza kumwigana bahagarara mu mwanya nk'uwo, nk'ikimenyetso cyo kumushyigikira no kwifatanya n'ubutumwa bwe.\nIntego avuga ko afite.\nMichel Nkuka Mboladinga avuga ko ibikorwa bye bidahagararira ku gushimisha ikipe y'igihugu gusa, ahubwo ari \u00abmisiyo y'ubumwe n'ubutwari bw'igihugu\u00bb igamije kubaha amateka ya RDC no gutanga inkunga y'ubutwari ku bakinnyi n'abaturage. \nBamwe mu banditsi n'abanyamakuru basobanura iyi myitwarire nk'urugero rugaragaza uko siporo ishobora gukoreshwa mu kugaragaza icyangano cy'ubukoloni no gushimangira umwirikano w'igihugu mu Rwanda rwa Kongo."}
{"id": "21422", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21422", "title": "Bernard Bahati", "text": "Bernard Bahati ni umurezi n'umushakashatsi w'Umunyarwanda mu bijyanye n'ikoranabuhanga mu burezi. Kuva muri Gashyantare 2021 ni Umuyobozi Mukuru (\"Director General\") w'Ikigo cy'Igihugu gishinzwe Ibizamini n'Ubugenzuzi bw'Amashuri (NESA), akaba ari we muyobozi wa mbere w'icyo kigo.\nMbere yaho yari umwarimu muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda. Afite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (PhD) yakuye muri Kaminuza ya Stockholm muri Suwede.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nBahati yatangiye umwuga we ari umwarimu mu mashuri abanza. Yize icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza (\"Master of Education\" mu ikoranabuhanga mu burezi no kwiga hifashishijwe ikoranabuhanga) muri Kaminuza ya Witwatersrand i Johannesburg muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo.\nMu mwaka wa 2019 yabonye impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (PhD) mu ishami ry'ubumenyi bwa mudasobwa n'imikorere y'ibigo (\"Department of Computer and Systems Sciences\") rya Kaminuza ya Stockholm muri Suwede. Igitabo cy'ubushakashatsi bwe, \"Technology-enhanced formative assessment in higher education: An intervention design of scaffolding student self-regulated learning\", kigaruka ku buryo ikoranabuhanga ryafasha mu isuzuma rihoraho (\"formative assessment\") ry'abanyeshuri ba kaminuza.\nUmwuga.\nBahati yabaye umwarimu muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda, nyuma aba Umuyobozi ushinzwe kunoza imyigishirize n'imyigire (\"Director of Teaching and Learning Enhancement\") muri iyo kaminuza. Ubushakashatsi bwe bwibanda ku ikoreshwa ry'ikoranabuhanga mu kwigisha no kwiga.\nInama y'Abaminisitiri yo ku wa 19 Gashyantare 2021 yamushyize ku mwanya w'Umuyobozi Mukuru wa NESA, ikigo gishya cyari kimaze gushyirwaho n'itegeko ryasohotse mu Igazeti ya Leta mu Ukwakira 2020. NESA yatangiye imirimo ku wa 1 Werurwe 2021; ishinzwe gutegura no gukoresha ibizamini bya Leta by'amashuri abanza, ayisumbuye n'ay'imyuga (TVET), ndetse no kugenzura ireme ry'uburezi mu mashuri. Bahati ni we wayoboye ishyirwaho ry'icyo kigo.\nNk'umuyobozi wa NESA, akurikirana imigendekere y'ibizamini bya Leta n'ishyirwa ry'abanyeshuri mu mashuri. Muri Nzeri 2023, yibukije abayobozi b'amashuri yo mu Kigali ko gushyira abanyeshuri mu mashuri (\"placement and orientation\") ari inshingano za NESA yonyine, abasaba kutivanga muri uwo murimo. Muri Gashyantare 2026 yari akiri Umuyobozi Mukuru wa NESA."}
