{"id": "21425", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21425", "title": "Rugezi marsh", "text": "Rugezi Marsh ni igishanga cyo hejuru cyane hamwe nubutaka buri mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda, cyane cyane mu Turere twa Burera na Gicumbi hafi y\u2019umupaka na Uganda. Ifite ubuso bungana na hegitari 6.735, ni kamwe mu turere tw\u2019ibidukikije by\u2019ingenzi mu gihugu ndetse n\u2019u Rwanda rwonyine rwashyizweho na Ramsar - igishanga gifite akamaro mpuzamahanga mu Masezerano ya Ramsar.\nInyandiko.\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20140630150821/http://irst.ac.rw/IMG/pdf/Paper_for_V_International_Symposium_on_En_Hydrology1.pdf"}
{"id": "21426", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21426", "title": "Shenseea", "text": "Shenseea ni nde?\nShenseea, amazina ye nyakuri akaba Chinsea Linda Lee, ni umuhanzi w\u2019icyamamare ukomoka muri Jamaica, uzwi cyane mu njyana ya Dancehall. Yavutse ku itariki ya 1 Ukwakira 1996, akaba yaramenyekanye cyane kubera ijwi rye rikomeye, imbyino zidasanzwe n\u2019imyambarire ikurura abantu benshi.\nUrugendo rwe mu muziki\nShenseea yatangiye kumenyekana cyane mu mwaka wa 2016 nyuma yo gusohora indirimbo \"\u201cLoodi\u201d\" yakoranye n\u2019umuhanzi Vybz Kartel. Iyi ndirimbo yamufunguriye amarembo ku rwego mpuzamahanga, atangira gukorana n\u2019abahanzi bakomeye nka Sean Paul, Megan Thee Stallion, Kanye West na Drake. Yagiye agaragaza ko Dancehall ishobora kuvanga n\u2019izindi njyana nka Hip-Hop na Pop.\nUbutumwa n\u2019ingaruka ku rubyiruko\nShenseea azwiho kuba aharanira ko abagore bagira ijambo rikomeye mu muziki wa Dancehall, wari usanzwe wiganje n\u2019abagabo. Indirimbo ze zikubiyemo ubutumwa bwigenga, kwigirira icyizere no kwihagararaho. Ibi byatumye aba icyitegererezo ku rubyiruko rwinshi, cyane cyane abakobwa bifuza kwinjira mu muziki.\nUmwihariko we\nUsibye umuziki, Shenseea azwiho gukoresha imbuga nkoranyambaga neza, bikamufasha gukomeza gukundwa n\u2019abafana be hirya no hino ku isi. Ni umwe mu bahanzi bagaragaza ko impano, umurava n\u2019icyerekezo bishobora kugeza umuntu ku rwego mpuzamahanga.https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shenseea"}
{"id": "21437", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21437", "title": "UMUSOZI WA HURO", "text": "UMUSOZI WA HURO ni umusozi uherereye mu karere ka Gakenke,uri mu mudugudu wa Huro, akagari ka Gakenke,umurenge wa Muhondo. Kera hahoze hitwa i Bumbogo. Amateka agaragaza ko umurwa wa abanyamihango b'umuganura bitwaga abiru bo kwa myaka bari bashinzwe gutegura imbuto arizo amasaka n'uburo. Aha i Huro hahurizwaga imbuto zarobanuwe neza kandi zizira icyasha zikoherezwa ibwami gukoreshwa mu mihango y'umuganura,ari naho havuye imvugo yakwirakwiye mu Rwanda ngo \" ihuriro ni i HURO \". Bashakaga kuvuga yuko abazanye imbuto n'abazijyanye bahurira i Huro.\nMudahinyuka Paulin w\u2019imyaka 78, uri mu basaza batuye i Huro, yavuze ko mu gihe cyo gutoranya imbuto babyitagaho kandi nta mugore wari wemerewe gukora mu mbuto ngo atayanduza bitewe no gutinya ko yazakoramo ari mu gihe cy\u2019imihango abakera bafataga nk\u2019igihe cyanduye.\nAti \u201cBakoraga uko bashoboye bakarobanura imbuto nziza itarangiritse izabasha kumera bitagoranye, kandi abagore bari babujijwe gukorakora iyo mbuto ngo itazagenda yarangiritse, ndetse n\u2019abagabo ntibakoreshagamo intoki, ahubwo bakoresha agati bitaga \u2018isando\u2019, birinda kuyangiza.\u201d\nIyi mbuto yajyaga ibwami iherekejwe n\u2019ingoma n\u2019inzoga z\u2019imitsama zateguwe, kugira ngo bimurikirwe Umwami, abiheshe umugisha.\nMudahinyuka, yakomeje avuga ko Umwami yazaga ari kumwe n\u2019umuganuza mukuru bagashyira intoki mu gitenga (ikibo kinini), cyuzuye imbuto maze zigasesekara ku butaka, ubwo \u201cumwami akaba atanze imbuto kuko isesekaye ku butaka bw\u2019u Rwanda.\u201d\nKimwe mu bimenyetso bikiranga amateka ya Huro twavugamo Ivubiro ryahashyizwe n'umuvubyi witwaga Minyaruko wa Nyamikenke.wari umutware w'ubusigi mu kinyejana cya cumi na gatandatu(16)abisabwe na Ruganzu II ndori.nan'uyu munsi hakaba hakiri ikibinsi kiri mu gihuru kirimo amazi.Iri vubiro ryifashishwaga n'Abiru b'Abahinzi bo kwa Myaka bapima imvura kugirango bamenye niba izagwa vuba cyangwa izatinda maze babona izatinda bakihutira kubimenyesha Umwami nuko nawe agashaka uburyo ayivubisha vuba.\nkandi mubindi bice by'amateka biri muri Gakenke twavugamo umusozi wa Kabuye ahari iriba rya Nyirarucyaba n'Ubuvumo bw'Umwami,hari kandi i Mbirima ya Matovu mu murenge wa Coko ahari amateka y'Abami;lbuye rya Bajyejye riri muri santere ya Gakenke,n'ahandi."}
{"id": "21438", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21438", "title": "Septimius Awards", "text": "Septimius Awards ni ibirori ngarukamwaka bitanga ibihembo mu byerekeye amafilime bibera mu mujyi wa Amsterdam mu Ubuholandi. Ibi bihembo byatangiye mu mwaka wa 2022, bishyira imbere gushyigikira impano nshya no guteza imbere imishinga y'indashyikirwa mu bihugu bitandukanye ku isi.\nIki gikorwa cyashinzwe na Jan-Willem Breure, umuyobozi w'amafilime ufite inkomoko muri u Rwanda, wifuje gushyiraho urubuga rugaragaza uburinganire hagati y'amafilime y'iburengerazuba n'ayandi bice by'isi.\nImiterere n'Intego.\nSeptimius Awards izwiho kuba igabanya ibyiciro by'abakinnyi n'amafilime hagati y'imigabane itanu y'isi: Afurika, Aziya, Amerika, Uburayi, n'Oseyaniya. Ibi bikorwa kugira ngo habeho guhagararirwa kw'impano zitandukanye zitagaragara mu bindi birori bikomeye nka Oscars.\nIbihembo bitangwa mu byiciro birenga 30, harimo amafilime maremare, amafilime mbarankuru, n'inyandiko z'amafilime (scripts).\nAbatsinze n'abashyikirijwe ibihembo.\nMu bamaze guhabwa ibi bihembo harimo abakinnyi bazwi cyane ku rwego mpuzamahanga:"}
{"id": "21439", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21439", "title": "Jan-Willem Breure", "text": "Jan-Willem Breure (yavutse ku ya 1 Nzeri 1988) ni umuyobozi wa filime, ushinzwe itunganywa rya filime (producer), akaba n'umushabitsi w'Umunyarwanda uba mu Buholandi. Ni we washinze ibihembo mpuzamahanga bya Septimius Awards na Isis Fashion Awards.\nAmateka n'uburezi.\nBreure yavukiye mu Rwanda, nyuma aza kururwa n'abamisiyoneri b'Abaholandi. Yakuriye mu bihugu bitandukanye bya Afurika birimo Kenya na Namibiya mbere yo kwimukira mu Buholandi. Yize ibijyanye no gushushanya mu ishuri rikuru ry'ubugeni rya Royal Academy of Art, The Hague.\nUmwuga.\nBreure ni we washinze isosiyete itunganya filime yitwa JW Productions. Azwi cyane ku itunganywa rya filime mbarankuru (documentaries) zivuga ku bibazo byugarije umuryango mugari. Breure arimo gutegura filime filime y\u2019abana b\u2019intambara n\u2019umuryango w\u2019abagore w\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye.\nSeptimius Awards.\nMu mwaka wa 2022, Breure yashinze Septimius Awards, ibihembo mpuzamahanga bitangirwa buri mwaka i Amsterdam. Ibi bihembo bishimwa cyane kubera uburyo biteguye, aho ibyiciro bigabanywa dushingiye ku migabane (Afurika, Aziya, Burayi, Amerika, n'Osiyaniya) kugira ngo buri gice cy'isi kibe gihagarariwe.\nIsis Fashion Awards.\nYashinze kandi Isis Fashion Awards (IFA), iserukiramuco ryibanda gusa ku bashushanya imitako n'ibikoresho by'ubwiza (accessory designers). Iri serukiramuco rishaka guha agaciro abakora inkweto, amasakoshi, n'imitako.\nJoburg Film Festival.\nMu mwaka wa 2026, Breure yagizwe umwe mu bagize akanama nkemurampaka (jury) mpuzamahanga mu iserukiramuco rya filime rya Joburg Film Festival muri Afurika y'Epfo."}
{"id": "21440", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21440", "title": "Isis Fashion Awards", "text": "Isis Fashion Awards (IFA) ni irushanwa mpuzamahanga ry'imideli ribera mu Ubuholandi. Iri rushanwa ryibanda gusa ku bikoresho by'imideli (\"accessories\"), nk'inkweto, amasakoshi n'imitako.\nIsis Fashion Awards yashinzwe na Jan-Willem Breure. Ibirori bya mbere byabaye mu 2022. Ibirori bitambuka kuri televiziyo SALTO y'i Amsterdam.\nAmateka.\nIsis Fashion Awards yashinzwe na Jan-Willem Breure. Jan-Willem Breure ni we kandi washinze Septimius Awards. Breure avuga ko urugendo rwe ruva mu Rwanda rujya mu Buholandi rwamuhaye igitekerezo cy'ibi bihembo.\nAbashushanya ibikoresho by'imideli ntibakunze kwitabwaho. Abantu bitaye cyane ku bashushanya imyenda. Isis Fashion Awards yashinzwe kugira ngo ibahe urubuga. Ni ryo rushanwa rya mbere mu Buholandi ryahariwe ibikoresho by'imideli gusa.\nIzina Isis rikomoka ku mana Isis y'Abanyamisiri ba kera.\nImigendekere y'ibirori.\nIFA ni ibirori by'umunsi umwe. Bigizwe n'ibiganiro ku itapi itukura, imyiyerekano y'imideli n'umuhango wo gutanga ibihembo.\nAbashushanya berekana ubwoko bwinshi bw'ibikoresho. Muri byo harimo inkweto, amasakoshi, amadarubindi, imitako, amasaha, imikandara n'ingofero.\nAberekana imideli ntibaba bambaye imyenda. Baba bambaye ibikoresho gusa. Ibi bituma abantu bareba ibikoresho.\nImyiyerekano igabanyijemo ibice by'iminota 20. Nyuma ya buri gice, akanama nkemurampaka gatanga ibitekerezo. Abashushanya batatu ba mbere bahabwa igikombe cya zahabu gishushanya imana Isis.\nItangazamakuru.\nIsis Fashion Awards itambuka kuri televiziyo SALTO kuva mu 2022. Ibirori bya 2026 byatambutse kuri SALTO2 ku wa 25 Kamena 2026.\nIbirori byavuzweho kandi n'ibindi bitangazamakuru. Muri byo harimo ShowNieuws, PowNed, OndaTV yo mu Butaliyani, ikinyamakuru Plitky cyo muri Ikerene na \"Playboy\" y'Ubuholandi."}
{"id": "21442", "revid": "16551", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21442", "title": "Sauli Williams", "text": "Saul Stacey Williams (yavutse ku ya 29 Gashyantare 1972) akaba umuraperi w\u2019umunyamerika, umuririmbyi, umwanditsi w\u2019indirimbo, umucuranzi, umusizi, umwanditsi, n\u2019umukinnyi wa filime. Azwiho kuvanga imivugo n'izindi hip hop, ndetse no kuba yarayoboye muri filime yigenga yiswe \"ya Slam\" yo mu 1998 ndetse n\u2019umuziki wa jukebox.. Yabonye igihembo cya 2026 Grammy Awards kubera alubumu ye \"Saul Williams yahuye na Carlos Ni\u00f1o &amp; Inshuti Kuri Treepeople\" mu cyiciro cya Album Cyiza Cyivugo Cyivugo. \nUbuzima bwa mbere n'uburere.\nSaul Stacey Williams yavukiye i Newburgh, muri New York, ku ya 29 Gashyantare 1972, ni umuhererezi mu bana batatu. Yize muri Newburgh Free Academy, aho yanditse indirimbo ye \"Black Stacey\". Yarangije muri kaminuza ya Morehouse afite impamyabumenyi ya BA mu bijyanye no gukina filime na filozofiya, nyuma yimukira mu mujyi wa New York, ari naho yakuye impamyabumenyi ya MFA mu gukina porogaramu ya Graduate Acting University ya New York muri Tisch School of Arts. Igihe yari muri kaminuza ya New York, yabaye umwe mu bakinnyi bakinnye mu mivugo ya New York caf\u00e9. Yabaye kandi muri Burezile nk'umunyeshuri wo guhanahana amakuru kuva 1988 kugeza 1989.\nUmwuga.\nIbisigo.\nKugeza 1995, Williams yari yarabaye umusizi wa mic. Mu 1996, yatsindiye izina rya Nuyorican Poets Cafe ' Grand Slam Champion. Filime documentaire \"SlamNation\" ikurikira Williams hamwe n'abandi bagize itsinda rya Nuyorican Poets Slam mu 1996 (Beau Sia, muMs da Schemer, na Jessica Care Moore)ubwo bahatanira amarushanwa y\u2019imivugo y\u2019igihugu ya 1996 yabereye Portland, Oregon. Umwaka ukurikira, Williams yagize uruhare runini mu gukinwa kwa filime yitwa \"Slam\" yo mu 1998. Williams yagaragaye nk'umwanditsi n'umukinnyi muri filime, yari kuzegukana igihembo cya Sundance Festival Grand Jury Award ndetse na Cannes Kamera D'Or (Kamera ya Zahabu). \nUmuziki.\nAhagana mu 1998, Williams na we nibwo yinjiraga mu muziki. Yakinnye n'abahanzi nka Nas, The Fugees, Blackalicious, Erykah Badu, KRS-One, Zack De La Rocha, De La Soul, Buckethead, na DJ Krust, ndetse n'abasizi Allen Ginsberg na Sonia Sanchez. Amaze gusohora urutonde rwa EP, yasohoye LP \"Amethyst Rock Star\" hamwe na producer Rick Rubin mu 2001. Muri Nzeri 2004, yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye yiyitiriye yakunzwe n'abantu benshi. Yakinnye ibitaramo byinshi bishyigikira Nine Inch Nail mu ruzinduko rwabo mu Burayi mu mpeshyi 2005, anashyigikira na Mars Volta. Williams yatumiwe mu iserukiramuco rya muzika rya Lollapalooza muri kiriya gihe, kandi icyiciro cya Chicago cyemereye Williams gukurura abantu benshi. Yagaragaye kuri Album ya Nine Inch Nail \"Y'umwaka Zero\", kandi ashyigikira iryo tsinda mu ruzinduko rwabo muri Amerika y'Amajyaruguru 2006. Muri urwo ruzinduko, Williams yatangaje ko Trent Reznor bazafatanya gukorana alubumu ye yari ikurikiyeho. \nUbu bufatanye bwavuye muri 2007 \"The Inevitable Rise and Liberation of NiggyTardust!\". Iyi alubumu yaboneka ku rubuga rwayo gusa kugeza CD y'umubiri isohotse, irimo imirongo mishya hamwe n'ubuhanzi bwagutse. Abakiriya 100.000 ba mbere ku rubuga bari bafite uburyo bwo gukuramo verisiyo y'ubusa yo hasi y'ubusa. Ubundi buryo bwari ubwo abakoresha kwishyura $ 5 kugira ngo bashyigikire umuhanzi mu buryo butaziguye kandi bahabwe guhitamo gukuramo verisiyo yo mu rwego rwo hejuru ya MP3 cyangwa verisiyo ya FLAC itagira igihombo. Ibikoresho byakozwe na Trent Reznor bivangwa na Alan Moulder. Reznor ni we wavuze, nyuma y\u2019uko aherutse kugirana amasezerano na label, ko bagomba kuyisohora mu bwigenge no mu buryo butaziguye ku bari bateranye. \nMu ntangiriro za 2008, ubucuruzi bwa Nike Sparq bwerekanaga indirimbo ya Williams \"Urutonde rw'ibisabwa (Indishyi)\". Mu kiganiro cyo mu Gushyingo 2008 yagiranye na Wired.com, Williams yavuze ku mishinga ye iri imbere: \"Hariho alubumu imwe ninjiye mu rukenyerero mfite intego yo kuyirangiza mu kwezi gutaha. Trent irashaka gukora ku rukurikirane rwa \"Niggy\" nkeka ko rwaba rwiza, kandi mfite na alubumu n'indirimbo nshya zerekaniwe mu rugo ko niteguye kujya muri sitidiyo kandi nkaryama.\" \nAlbum ya kane ya Williams, \"Ikirunga cy\u2019izuba\", yasohotse ku ya 11 Ugushyingo 2011. Williams yerekanye iyo alubumu mu gikoni cya Hoxton Bar cyo mu mujyi wa Londres ku ya 26 Mutarama 2011. Livemusic yabajije Williams ku mugoroba maze akora filime yakurikiyeho, yakozwe n\u2019umuhanzi Alex Templeton-Ward. Igihe Williams yabazwaga icyo imivugo igamije, yagize ati: \"Ibi ndabihimbye, nta gitekerezo mfite ariko hano turagiye. Ndatekereza ko byaba ari ukugaragaza, gusangira, kuruhuka, gushakisha. Kuri njye, imivugo itanga bimwe mubyabaye kuri cathartique. Nshobora kunyura mu marangamutima n'ubunararibonye bw'amarangamutima cyane cyane, urabizi, gutandukana, ibibazo nk'ibintu byose nkeneye guhura nabyo, yaba ari hamwe n'inganda, ufite idirishya rifunguye hafi aho. Iyo niyo ntego y'ubusizi: iyo idirishya rifunguye, ryemerera akayaga gake, ubundi bushishozi, ibindi bishoboka ku buryo dushobora gushakisha ibyo twumva byose, ibyo dutekereza byose hamwe n'umwanya wo kubona ibirenze ibyo tuzi, kuko hari ibintu byinshi birenze ibyo tuzi, noneho naba narazimiye. \"\nAlbum ya gatanu ya Williams, \"MartyrLoserKing\", yasohotse ku ya 29 Mutarama 2016. Indirimbo ya mbere yasohotse muri iyi alubumu ni \"Burundi\", ku bufatanye na Emily Kokal wa Warpaint. \nMuri Werurwe 2018, The Kills basohoye igifuniko cy' \"Urutonde rw'ibisabwa (Indishyi)\" Williams maze Williams afungura igitaramo cyagurishijwe cyabereye mu nzu mberabyombi ya Regent i Los Angeles ku ya 13 Kanama 2018.\nKwandika.\nNk'umwanditsi, Williams yasohotse mu \"kinyamakuru The New York Times\", \"Esquire\", \"Bomb Magazine\", na \"African Voices\", ndetse asohora ibyegeranyo bine by\u2019imivugo. Nk'umusizi n'umucuranzi, Williams yazengurutse kandi atanga ibiganiro ku isi yose, agaragara muri kaminuza n'amashuri makuru. Mu kiganiro cye mu gitabo \"Amagambo yawe mu maso yawe: Kuzenguruka mu myaka makumyabiri\", Williams agenewe kuririmba cyane gutaka, ni uko ubuzima bukora.\" \nMuri Mutarama 2009, yasohoye \"NGH WHT \u2013 Imizingo yapfuye ya Emcee hamwe na The Arditti Quartet\", isoma igitabo cye cy\u2019imivugo mu 2006. Ubu bufatanye na Thomas Kessler (wanashyizeho umurongo wa Williams uvuga ijambo, \"yavuze ko imbunda ku mutwe\" ku muziki) yasohotse hakoreshejwe uburyo bubiri bwo kwishyura: abayumva bashoboraga gukuramo igice cya 18 kugeza ku cya 22 cy'iminota 27 yahimbwe mu buryo bwa MP3 ku buntu, cyangwa bagashobora gukuramo ibice 33 byose bigize imiterere ya AIFF itagira igihombo ku madorari 6, hamwe n'amajwi atandukanye hamwe na quartet. Ibikururwa byose byishyuwe byose hamwe bifite 563 megabytes. Williams yagize uruhare mu mirongo ibiri kuri alubumu \"Baba Urukundo\" rwa 2011 na Arthur H. \nGukina.\nWilliams yakinnye muri \"Slam\" (1998) n'uyu \"munsi\" (2012). Kuri stage, yatorewe umwanya wa mbere muri \"Holler Niba Ya Unyumva\", umuziki wa Broadway urimo umuziki na Tupac Shakur. Nubwo igaragaramo umuziki wa Shakur, umuziki ntabwo ari ubuzima bwe. Ninyandiko yumwimerere yanditswe na Todd Kreidler. \"Rolling Stone\" yavuze ko umusaruro ari \"umuziki wa mbere wa hip-hop jukebox mu mateka ya Broadway\". Igitaramo cyabaye ku ya 19 Kamena 2014 \".\" \nYabonye igihembo cy\u2019umunyakanada cyerekana igihembo cy\u2019umukinnyi witwaye neza mu bihembo bya 9 bya Kanada byerekanwe muri 2021, kubera ibikorwa bye muri filime \"Akilla's Escape\". \nMu 2025 yagize uruhare mu kubwiriza muri filime iteye \"ubwoba\" ya Ryan Coogler. \nKuyobora.\nMu 2021, \"Neptune Frost\", Williams yanditse kandi afatanya na Anisia Uzeyman, yerekanwe i Cannes muri Fortnight ya Diregiteri. Filime yatewe inkunga na Kickstarter yiyamamaza neza muri 2018. \nUbuzima bwe bwite.\nWilliams ni inyamanswa. Aranenga cyane intambara yo kurwanya iterabwoba n'intambara yo muri Iraki na Afuganisitani. Mu bikorwa bye bizwi cyane harimo indirimbo zirwanya intambara \"Ntabwo mu Izina ryanjye\" na \"Act III Scene 2 (Shakespeare)\". Muri 2011, yongeyeho izina rye muri Occupy Musicians, ashyigikira umuryango wa Occupy ku isi hose kurwanya ubusumbane bw\u2019amafaranga. Yerekana ko ari umutekamutwe. \nWilliams na Marcia Jones, umuhanzi w\u2019amashusho n\u2019umwalimu w\u2019ubuhanzi, batangiye umubano mu 1995 nk'abahanzi bakoranye mu buhanzi bwa Brooklyn ndetse n\u2019amagambo y\u2019imivugo. Icyegeranyo cy\u2019imivugo cyanditswe na Williams cyiswe \"S/HE\" ni uruhererekane rwo gutekereza ku iherezo ry\u2019umubano we na Jones. Jones yakoze ibishushanyo mbonera bya \"karindwi ya Octave\", amashusho muri \"S/HE\" asubiza Williams, anashyiraho alubumu ye \"Amethyst Rock Star\" 2001. \nWilliams afite umuhungu hamwe na koreografiya Fatima Robinson. \nKu ya 29 Gashyantare 2008 (isabukuru y'imyaka 36), Williams yashakanye n'umukinnyi wa filime Persia White nyuma y\u2019imyaka itanu. Bahuye ubwo yagaragaraga abashyitsi kuri serie \"Y'umukobwa\". Ku ya 17 Mutarama 2009, White yatangaje abinyujije kuri blog ye Myspace ko we na Williams batakiri kumwe. \nYashakanye n'umukinnyi wa filime Anisia Uzeyman. Yabaye i Paris imyaka ine ubu aba i Los Angeles. "}
{"id": "21443", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21443", "title": "Dominique Celis", "text": "Dominique Celis, wavukiye mu gihugu cyu Burundi, ni umwanditsi w\u2019Umubiligi n\u2019Umunyarwanda.\nUbuzima bw'umuntu.\nDominique Celis yavukiye mu gihugu cyu u Burundi, yakuriye mu Rwanda hanyuma aza gukurira muri Zayire (ubu ni Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo). Umuryango we watuye mu gihugu cy'u Bubiligi mu 1986. Umwe mu bagize umuryango we wa nyina yapfuye muri jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994. Yakomereje amasomo ye ya kaminuza i Li\u00e8ge, aho yabonye impamyabumenyi y'uburere mu bya filozofiya. Nyuma yo kwigisha mu mashuri yisumbuye, yakomeje umwuga we akorera Inteko Ishinga Amategeko y'Ububiligi. Ni we washinze ishami rya Li\u00e8ge rya Ni Putes Ni Soumises (Nta busambanyi cyangwa ngo abe umunyamategeko uyoboka). Yimukiye i Kigali mu 2013.\nYasohoye inyandiko nyinshi kuri jenoside yekorewe ry\u2019Abatutsi, mu kinyamakuru \"Aide-M\u00e9moire\" cy\u2019ishyirahamwe \"Territoires de la M\u00e9moire\", cyibutsa kwibuka abishwe mu Bubiligi.\nMu 2022, yasohoye igitabo \"cyitwa Ainsi pleurent nos hommes (Ngaho Abagabo Bacu bararira\"). Muri iki gitabo, Dominique Celis asobanura jenoside binyuze mu ijwi ry'umwanditsi ndetse n'inyandiko, Erika. Erika yahunze u Rwanda umwaka umwe mbere ya jenoside. Yagarutseyo mu 2013. Binyuze mu kwandikirana na mushiki we, no kuba inkuru y'urukundo ikomeye, avuga ku kuba bidashoboka kwibagirwa mu gihugu kirimo guhinduka cyane."}
{"id": "21463", "revid": "106", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21463", "title": "Paris Saint-Germain FC", "text": "Amateka.\nParis Saint-Germain (PSG) yashinzwe mu 1970 nyuma yo guhuzwa kwa Paris FC na Stade Saint-Germain. Mu mwaka wayo wa mbere w\u2019imikino, PSG yegukanye Ligue 2, bityo izamuka muri Ligue 1. Ariko umuvuduko w\u2019iterambere ryayo wahise uhagarara, maze ikipe iratandukana mu 1972. Paris FC yagumye mu cyiciro cya mbere, mu gihe PSG yamanukaga mu cyiciro cya gatatu. Nyuma yo kuzamuka inshuro ebyiri zikurikiranye, PSG yagarutse mu cyiciro cya mbere mu 1974 kandi yimukira ku kibuga gishya cya Parc des Princes.\nIbikombe bya mbere bya Paris Saint-Germain (PSG) byageze mu myaka ya 1980. Iyobowe n\u2019abakinnyi b\u2019icyamamare nka Safet Su\u0161i\u0107, Luis Fernandez na Dominique Rocheteau, PSG yegukanye Coupe de France mu 1982 na 1983, ndetse n\u2019igikombe cyayo cya mbere cya Ligue 1 mu 1986. Nyuma y\u2019iyo myaka y\u2019intsinzi, ikipe yagize igabanuka rikomeye, ariko Canal+ yafashe PSG mu 1991 maze ikongera kugarura ubukire bwayo. Iyobowe n\u2019abakinnyi nka David Ginola, George Weah na Ra\u00ed, PSG yatwaye ibikombe icyenda kandi igeze mu cyiciro kimwe cya kabiri cy\u2019ibikombe byo ku mugabane w\u2019i Burayi mu myaka ya 1990. Ikigaragara ni uko Paris yegukanye igikombe cya kabiri cya shampiyona mu 1994 ndetse n\u2019igikombe cya UEFA Cup Winners' Cup mu 1996. Luis Fernandez, wari umwe mu bakinnyi b\u2019icyamamare muri icyo gihe, ubu akaba ari umutoza wamenyekanye cyane.\nMu ntangiriro z\u2019ikinyejana cya 21, Abanya-Paris bahanganye no kugaruka ku mwanya wa mbere, nubwo bari bafite abakinnyi b\u2019inararibonye nka Ronaldinho n\u2019umusaruro w\u2019ibitego wa Pauleta. Muri icyo gihe, PSG yegukanye ibindi bikombe bitanu birimo bitatu bya Coupe de France, kimwe cya Coupe de la Ligue, ndetse n\u2019igikombe cya UEFA Intertoto. Ariko ikipe yamenyekanye cyane kubera guhangana n\u2019ibibazo bitandukanye by\u2019imiyoborere. Mu 2006, Canal+ yagurishije PSG ku kigo cya Colony Capital, ariko ibintu byarakomeje kuba bibi, maze PSG imara imyaka ibiri ikurikiranye irwana no kwirinda kumanuka mu cyiciro cya kabiri.\nIhirwe rya Paris Saint-Germain (PSG) ryahindutse cyane ubwo Qatar Sports Investments, iyoborwa na guverinoma ya Qatar, yafataga ikipe nk\u2019iyabo mu 2011. Guhera icyo gihe, PSG yashoye amafaranga menshi mu gusinyisha abakinnyi b\u2019abahanga ku isi nka Zlatan Ibrahimovi\u0107, Lionel Messi, Neymar na Kylian Mbapp\u00e9, aba bakinnyi babiri ba nyuma bakaba ari bo bahenze cyane mu mateka y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru. Kubera iyo mpamvu, PSG yabaye ikipe ikomeye mu mupira w\u2019amaguru w\u2019Abafaransa, yegukana ibikombe 37 birimo 11 bya shampiyona, 8 bya Coupe de France, 6 bya Coupe de la Ligue na 11 bya Troph\u00e9e des Champions.\nKu rwego rw\u2019i Burayi, PSG yabaye abakinnyi basanzwe mu cyiciro cya 16 cya UEFA Champions League, bagera ku mukino wa nyuma ku nshuro ya mbere mu mateka yabo mu 2020, ndetse begukana igikombe cyabo cya mbere ku rwego rw\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru w\u2019isi mu 2025. Ikipe y\u2019i Burayi yatwaye kandi UEFA Super Cup ndetse na FIFA Intercontinental Cup mu 2025, ikaba yarageze ku rwego rudasanzwe rw\u2019imyaka 20 y\u2019intsinzi n\u2019amateka y\u2019ikirenga."}
{"id": "21475", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21475", "title": "Nyamko Sabuni", "text": "Nyamko Ana Sabuni (wavutse ku ya 31 Werurwe 1969) ni umunyapolitiki wo muri Suwede wari Umuyobozi w\u2019abigenga hagati ya Kamena 2019 na Mata 2022.Yabanje kuba Minisitiri w\u2019Ubufatanye kuva 2006 kugeza 2010 ndetse anaba Minisitiri w\u2019Uburinganire kuva 2006 kugeza 2013 muri guverinoma ya Suwede. Sabuni umwe mu bagize Ishyaka Riharanira Ukwishyira ukizana kwa buri muntu, yatorewe kuba Umudepite mu 2002. Sabuni yakoze amateka muri Kamena 2019 abaye umuyobozi wa mbere w\u2019ishyaka mu nteko ishinga amategeko ya Suwede ukomoka mu moko mato ndetse n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019ishyaka rya mbere ukomoka mu mpunzi. Muri Mata 2022, Sabuni yeguye ku buyobozi bw'ishyaka.\nNyamko Sabuni yavukiye i Bujumbura mu Burundi, aho se, umunyapolitiki w\u2019ibumoso ukomoka muri Zayire, yabaga mu buhungiro. Se wa Sabuni ni umukirisitu, naho nyina ni umuyisilamu. Uyu muryango wabonye ubuhungiro bwa politiki muri Suwede mu 1981 naho Sabuni akurira i Kungs\u00e4ngen, mu majyaruguru ya Stockholm. Yize amategeko muri kaminuza ya Uppsala, politiki y\u2019abimukira muri kaminuza ya M\u00e4lardalen muri Eskilstuna, n\u2019itumanaho n\u2019itangazamakuru mu ishuri ry\u2019itumanaho rya Berghs i Stockholm. \nYashakanye kuva 2004 kugeza 2012 kandi afite abahungu b'impanga kuva muri ubwo bukwe. Yavuze ko atari umunyamadini.\nPawe\u0142 Rogali\u0144ski, Nyamko Sabuni na Mara Carfagna mu nama ya gatatu y\u2019uburinganire yabereye i Stockholm muri Nzeri 2009.\nSabuni yari umwe mu bagize akanama k\u2019Urubyiruko rwigenga rwa Suwede kuva mu 1996 kugeza mu 1998. Yavuze ko iyicwa ry\u2019impunzi ya Cote d'Ivoire Gerard Gbeyo, ryakozwe n\u2019umusuwede neo-Nazi wo muri Suwede mu mujyi wa Klippan mu 1995, nkimwe mu mpamvu zatumye yishora muri politiki. \nNyuma gato yo gutorerwa imirimo, yafashe icyemezo cyo gukuraho inkunga y\u2019umuryango Centrum mot rasism, aho nyirarume Mkyabela Sabuni yari umuyobozi. \nMu ibaruwa y\u2019ibitekerezo yo ku ya 17 Nyakanga 2006 yasohotse mu kinyamakuru cyo muri Suwede Expressen, Sabuni yasabye ko hasuzumwa abagore b\u2019abagore b\u2019abagore bose b\u2019ishuri hagamijwe gukumira imyanya ndangagitsina. Yasabye ko hijab ihagarikwa ku bakobwa bari munsi y\u2019imyaka 15 kandi anashyigikira ko ubwicanyi bw\u2019icyubahiro bwashyirwa mu cyiciro cyigenga mu gitabo cy\u2019amategeko ahana cya Suwede. Muri Nyakanga 2006, hasohotse igitabo cye Flickorna vi sviker (\"Abakobwa Tureka\"), kivuga ku bagore bo muri Suwede babangamiwe n\u2019ihohoterwa ry\u2019icyubahiro. \nSabuni avuga ko kwimenyereza Abayisilamu babaho na Qor'ani \"bigabanya amahirwe yabo\". Yagaragaje ko imyitozo nko gusenga inshuro eshanu ku munsi cyangwa kubaza umuziki, itesha agaciro Abayisilamu. \nKu ya 6 Ukwakira 2006, guverinoma nshya ihuriweho na Suwede yavuye mu matora yatangaje ko Sabuni yagizwe Minisitiri mushya w\u2019uburinganire n\u2019uburinganire. Niwe muntu wa mbere ukomoka muri Afurika wagizwe Minisitiri muri guverinoma ya Suwede. \nKuba Sabuni yagizwe Minisitiri w\u2019Uburinganire n\u2019Uburinganire bw\u2019Uburinganire byahuye n\u2019imyigaragambyo ya bamwe mu Bayisilamu bo muri Suwede, bamushinje Islamophobia na populism. Icyifuzo cyo kwanga ko ashyirwaho umukono n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abayisilamu bo muri Suwede, bivugwa ko ariryo shyirahamwe rinini rihagarariye abayisilamu muri Suwede.\nYeguye ku ya 21 Mutarama 2013, avuga ko uzamusimbura agomba kwitegura mbere y'amatora rusange ya 2014\nMuri Kamena 2021, Sabuni yatorewe kuba umuyobozi w'ishyaka rya Liberal. \nKu ya 8 Mata 2022, Sabuni yeguye ku buyobozi bw'ishyaka nyuma y'impaka zikomoka ku magambo ye avuga ko azahunga Suwede yerekeza muri Noruveje niba Suwede yarigeze gutera. Umunsi umwe yasimbuwe na Johan Pehrson\n1.https://www.nytimes.com/2007/01/13/world/europe/13profile.html\n2.https://vi.se/en-tuff-mjukis-nyamko-sabuni-ar-favorit-bland-nya-partiledarkandidater/\n3..https://www.aftonbladet.se/nyheter/article14647491.ab\n4.https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nyamko_Sabuni"}
{"id": "21476", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21476", "title": "Barack Obama Sr.", "text": "\u00a0Barack Hussein Obama wavutse Baraka Hussein Obama, ku ya 18 Kamena 1934 - 24 Ugushyingo 1982) yari umuhanga mu by'ubukungu muri Kenya akaba na se wa Barack Obama, wahoze ari Perezida wa Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Ni umuntu ukomeye mu nkuru y'ubuzima bw'umuhungu we, Dreams from My Father (1995). Obama yashatse mu 1954 babyarana abana babiri n'umugore we wa mbere, Kezia. Yatoranyijwe muri gahunda yihariye yo kwiga kaminuza muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, yiga muri Kaminuza ya Hawaii aho yahuriye na Stanley Ann Dunham, bashyingiranywe mu 1961 nyuma yo gutwita umuhungu we, Barack. Obama na Dunham baratandukanye nyuma y'imyaka itatu. Hanyuma Obama yagiye muri Kaminuza ya Harvard kwiga amashuri yisumbuye, aho yabonye impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu by'ubukungu, maze asubira muri Kenya mu 1964. Yabonye umuhungu we Barack nanone, ubwo umuhungu we yari afite imyaka 10.\n1."}
{"id": "21477", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21477", "title": "Ubworozi bw'inzuki", "text": "Abantu benshi bagira imitekerereze inyuranye kubwozi bw'inzuki ndetse bamwe bakibwira ko ari udusimba tugira amahane.Nyamara kandi ubuzima bw\u2019inzuki buratangaje kandi burangwa n\u2019imwe mu mico yo kubaha inzuki z\u2019ingore kuko ingore ari zo zibyara umwamikazi.imibanire yazo ndetse n'imikoranire yazo iratangaje kuko ziha icyubahiro umwamikazi wazo kuko ariwe uzibeshaho kandi uziyoboye.Abahanga bavuga ko umwamikazi (urwiru) atandukanye n'izindi nzuki kuburyo iyo ziri kumwe uhita ubona itandukaniro.Bavuga ko kandi hagati y\u2019inzuki icumi na makumyabiri bashobora gukuramo icyana cy\u2019uruyuki bagatangira kugiha ibyokurya by'ibwami n\u2019igikoma kibwami.inzuki kandi zifite umumaro k'ubuzima bwamuntu.\nIbyo benshi bita umwanda sikobiri kuko nibyo bivamo ubuki.inzuki kandi zigira ibishashara aribyo bakamuramo ubuki,bashobora kandi kubikoramo buji mu gutanga urumuri."}
{"id": "21479", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21479", "title": "Imiti nyararwanda", "text": "Babigarutseho mu nama nyunguranabitekerezo yabahurije muri Lemigo Hotel kuri uyu wa 23 Ukwakira 2021, yigaga ku guteza imbere amoko y\u2019ibiti gakondo mu kubungabunga ubutaka n\u2019ibyogogo byangiritse. Iyi nama yateguwe n\u2019Ikigo cy\u2019Igihugu gishinzwe Amashyamba (RFA) ku bufatanye n\u2019Umuryango ARCOS utegamiye kuri Leta.\nUmuyobozi Mukuru wa RFA, Mugabo Jean Pierre, yavuze ko hakenewe kongerwa imbaraga n\u2019ubukangurambaga mu gutera ibiti gakondo bikomeje gukendera.\nYagaragaje ko kubitera bikigoranye kuko mu mishinga itandukanye ishyirwaho igamije kongera amashyamba n\u2019ibiti bivangwa n\u2019imyaka usanga ibyatewe bishobora gukura neza biri ku mpuzandengo yo hasi.\nYakomeje ati \u201cKubera impamvu yo guhangana n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe itugiraho ingaruka twese, n\u2019abaterankunga ubasabye amafaranga ushobora kubumvisha uko ibyo biti byaterwa. Bo icyo barebaho ni ingaruka byagira, n\u2019imbogamizi zihari.\u201d\nMugabo yanasobanuye ko hakwiye kurebwa impamvu zose zizitira kuba ibyo biti byakwiyongera zikigirwa uko zikurwaho.\nAti \u201cNiba ari ingemwe zitujuje ubuziranenge zigakosorwa. [\u2026] Reka ibyo biti byongere bigaruke abaturage babibone. Ibijojo, imivumu, imiko, imiravumba n\u2019ibindi.\u201d\nIsoko y\u2019imiti n\u2019 ibiryo by\u2019amatungo \u2026\nNk\u2019uko buri gihugu kigira umuco wacyo, Abanyarwanda nabo bafite uburyo bivura bwa gakondo budakoresha imiti ya Kizungu ahubwo bwifashisha ibyatsi n\u2019ibiti.\nIbirimo umuravumba, umubirizi, umuvumu, n\u2019ibindi byinshi bizwiho kwifashwa mu buvuzi bw\u2019indwara zitandukanye.\nIbiti gakondo binongera imyunyungugu mu butaka bukarumbuka, bikabufata ntihabe isuri iterwa n\u2019imvura, bigafasha abaturage kubona inkwi ndetse bikaba ibiryo by\u2019amatungo n\u2019zindi nyamaswa muri rusange. Hari n\u2019izo bibera icumbi zirimo inyoni n\u2019inzuki kimwe n\u2019utundi dusimba duto.\nUmuyobozi wa ARCOS (Albertine Rift Conservation Society), Dr Kanyamibwa Sam, yasobanuriye abitabiriye iyo nama ko kuba ibi biti bifite akamaro haba mu mibereho y\u2019abanyarwanda no mu kubungabunga ibidukikije, bishimangira ko ari ngombwa gukomeza kubitera no kubibungabunga.\nYakomeje agira ati \u201cAya yagombye kuba amahirwe yo kuganira neza tukagera ku bisubizo byakwifashishwa mu kubungabunga ibi biti.\u201d Kanyamibwa yashimangiye kandi ko kugira ngo ibiti gakondo byatangiye guterwa bizakure neza, hakwiye kwimakaza umubona udasanzwe hagati y\u2019abaturage ndetse n\u2019abatanga ibi biti.\nAbitabiriye inama batanze ibitekerezo bagaragaza zimwe mu mpamvu ibi biti bigenda bikendera ndetse n\u2019icyakorwa ngo bibungabungwe. Bimwe mu bitekerezo byatanzwe nuko abaturage batagikunda ibi biti kuko bitinda gutanga umusaruro bityo bikaba byaba ngombwa ko bajya bahabwa indi mishanga yabafasha kubungabunga ibi biti."}
{"id": "21480", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21480", "title": "Akamaro k'ubuki", "text": "ubuki:ni bimwe mubiribwa biryohera bikorwa ni nzuki\n\"Muri iki gihe\" \"cyubu indwara z\u2019umutima ziri guhitana benshi kubera imibereho ya buri munsi itandukanye,hamwe usanga abantu benshi bafite ibiro byinshi badakora imyitozo ngororamubiri ndetse numubyibuho ukabije.\"\nabashakashatsi batandukanye bagaragaje ko ubuki bwifitemo ubushobozi bwo kurinda indwara zifata umutima. muri iyi nkuru rero tugiye kureba bimwe mubigize ubuki twavugamo; isukari y'umwimerere;imyunyu ngugu n'ibindi bitandukanye. bimwe mubyiza by'ubuki twavugamo, bufasha umutima gutera neza,bwongera imbaraga z'umutima mugukora neza, butuma amaraso akomeza gutembera neza mumubiri.\nKubantu bajya barwara umutima ubuki bugabanya ububabare bw' umutima kuko bakunda kuribwa mugatuza kugice cyaho umutima uherereye. ariko nubwotwabonye ibyiza byinshi byo gukoresha ubuki ntago aribyiza gukoresha ingano nyinshi irengeje urugero nko kubana bari munsi y'umwaka umwe."}
{"id": "21481", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21481", "title": "I ngaruka za makimbirane mu Miryango", "text": "Ingaruka zamakimbirane mumiryango harimo kwishora mubiyobya bwenge, ubusambanyinyi,guta amashuri kubana,kwiyaka ubuzima,kwishora mubujura ndetse noguta umuryango.kubanu bakuru habaho kutigirira ikizere mumuryango ndetse ababyeyi habaho gutndukana cyangwa se umwe akaba yakica undi.habaho inzangano hagati yimiryango ifitanye amakimbirane."}
{"id": "21482", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21482", "title": "Paruwase ya Rwamagana", "text": "Paruwasi ya Rwamagana yashinzwe na Nyiricyubahiro Yohani-Yozefu Hiriti, kuwa 5 Gashyanare 1919, maze ayiragiza Bikira Mariya Umwamikazi w'imitsindo.(Notre dame dese victoires). Kuri iyo tariki ni bwo Abamisiyoneri bahageze kugira ngo bahatangire ubutumwa muri Misiyoni yari imaze gushingwa.\nAmavu n'amavuko ya Paruwasi ya Rwamagana\nUbuganza ni igice cy'u Rwanda kiri mu nkengero z'ikiyaga cya Muhazi, mu burasirazuba bushyira amajyepfo y'icyo kiyaga.\nPadiri Lewo Delimasi (R.P. Leon Delmas) watumwe kurambagiza ako karere gaherereye mu nkengero z'ikiyaga cya Muhazi adutekerereza amateka y'ishingwa ry'iyo Misiyoni.RWAMAGANA niryo zina ryahawe Misiyoni nshya yagiye mu ruhererekane rw'ishingwa rya za misiyoni z'icyahoze ari Vikariyati ya Kivu kuva muri Gashyantare 19199.\nMuri Gashyanare 1918, Padiri Lewo Delimasi, aturutse muri Misiyoni ya Kigali yari yarashinzwe kuwa 21 ugushyingo 2013, akaba yari ayibereye umukuru, nibwo yakoze urugendo rwe rwa mbere mu Buganza, abisabwe na Musenyeri Yohani-Yozefu Hiriti wifuzaga ko yamenya neza imiterere y'ako karere gakikije ikiyaga cya Muhazi."}
{"id": "21483", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21483", "title": "Akamaro kibirayi", "text": "Ibirayi ni ikiribwa cyiza cyane ku bantu bakora siporo kuko kibarinda kuba bagira ikibazo cy\u2019isukari nkeya mu gihe bakoresheje imbaraga muri siporo. Ikindi kandi ibirayi byongera imbaraga, bikongera ubwinshi bwa \u2018potassium\u2019 mu mubiri cyane cyane iyo bitekeshejwe umwuka (cuire \u00e0 la vapeur), iyo potassium rero ituma imikaya ikomera."}
{"id": "21484", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21484", "title": "Amata y'inka", "text": "muri ikigihe abantu batandukanye bakiri mu myaka yo kubyara usanga bababibazaku mata baha abana babo basubiye mu kazi, kuko ikiruhuko umubyeyi ahabwa ari amezi atatu, yaba akorera leta cyangwa abikorera."}
{"id": "21485", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21485", "title": "Amata yuzuye intungamubiri", "text": "= Amata yuzuye intungamubiri ariko hari abatinya ko yabatera ibibazo =\nKu rubuga www.lemonde.fr, bavuga ko nko mu Bufaransa, kugurisha amata byagabanutseho 20% hagati y\u2019umwaka wa 2003-2016, bitewe n\u2019uko hari amakuru agenda avuga ko amata yaba atera ibibazo bitandukanye mu mubiri, harimo n\u2019ibijyanye n\u2019igogora.\nUrubuga www.lexpress.fr, rwo rugaragaza ko hari abavuga ko amata y\u2019inka ashobora gutera indwara zitandukanye harimo nka kanseri ifata imyanya y\u2019ibanga y\u2019abagabo(cancer de la prostate), cyangwa kanseri ifata intanga z\u2019abagore (ovaires).\nGusa ibyo bivuguruzwa n\u2019inzobere mu by\u2019ubuzima, ahubwo bakavuga ko amata akize cyane ku butare bwa \u201ccalcium\u201d na \u201cvitamine D\u201d, gusa kunywa amata cyane cyane ku bantu bakuru biracyateza impaka zo kumenya niba ari bibi cyangwa ari byiza.\nKunywa amata y\u2019inka atakuwemo na kimwe mu biyagize, byarinda umwana kubyibuha bikabije, bikanamurinda kubura vitamine D.\nUbushakashatsi bwakorewe muri Canada bwagaragaje ko abana banywa amata y\u2019inka uko yakabaye, nta kintu cyakuwemo, baba bananutse ugereranyije n\u2019abanywa amata agabanyijwemo amavuta(demi-\u00e9cr\u00e9m\u00e9), kandi abana banywa amata uko yakabaye, baba bafite vitamine D mu maraso iri ku rugero rwiza.\nUbwo bushakashatsi bwakorewe ku bana 2.745 bafite hagati y\u2019imyaka ibiri n\u2019itandatu, bukorerwa ku bitaro bya St Michael by\u2019ahitwa i Toronto, butangazwa mu kinyamakuru cyitwa \u2018American Journal of Clinical Nutrition\u2019, bwagaragaje ko amata y\u2019inka ari meza kuri bo kuko abazanira vitamine D kandi ikenewe mu mubiri wabo.\nUbwo bushakashatsi bwahinyuje ibitekerezo by\u2019uko amata yaba ari mabi ku buzima.\nKu rubuga www.healthline.com, bavuga ibindi byiza byo kunywa amata y\u2019inka.\nAmata y\u2019inka yifitemo intungamubiri.Ubushakashatsi bwakorewe muri Canada bwagaragaje ko abana banywa amata y\u2019inka uko yakabaye, nta kintu cyakuwemo, baba bananutse ugereranyije n\u2019abanywa amata agabanyijwemo amavuta(demi-\u00e9cr\u00e9m\u00e9), kandi abana banywa amata uko yakabaye, baba bafite vitamine D mu maraso iri ku rugero rwiza.Ubwo bushakashatsi bwakorewe ku bana 2.745 bafite hagati y\u2019imyaka ibiri n\u2019itandatu, bukorerwa ku bitaro bya St Michael by\u2019ahitwa i Toronto, butangazwa mu kinyamakuru cyitwa \u2018American Journal of Clinical Nutrition\u2019, bwagaragaje ko amata y\u2019inka ari meza kuri bo kuko abazanira vitamine D kandi ikenewe mu mubiri wabo."}
{"id": "21486", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21486", "title": "Akamaro kurukundo", "text": "umuntu wese ajya murukundo ashaka kuzarambana n'uwo yihebeye.\nrero hari ibimenyetso bigera muri 2 byakwerekako uwo mukundana ko mutazarambana,bitwo bikaba byagufasha gufata umwanzuro.\n1.gushira kw'amatsiko:igihe ukundanye nu muntu igihe kirekire birashobokako,wageraho ukamumenya neza.ariko ibukako umuntu agenda ahinduka.\n2.Nagukorera ikintu kiza akakikwishyuza:ubundi umuntu wawe agukorera ikintu kiza adategerejeko nawe uzakimukorera cyangwa ko uzamwishyura."}
{"id": "21488", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21488", "title": "Bill Gates", "text": "William Henry Gates III (wavutse ku ya 28 Ukwakira 1955) ni umucuruzi w\u2019umunyamerika akaba n\u2019umugiraneza. Yabaye umuhanga mu mpinduramatwara ya mudasobwa nto mu myaka ya 1970 na 1980, afatanyije na Paul Allen mu bwana bwe, bashinze isosiyete ya mudasobwa ya Microsoft mu 1975. Gates yabaye umuherwe muto ku isi icyo gihe mu 1987, afite imyaka 31. Ibi byakurikiyeho nyuma y\u2019uko Microsoft yatangiraga gutanga umusanzu wayo mu mwaka ushize ndetse n\u2019izamuka ry\u2019imigabane. Ikinyamakuru Forbes cyamushyize ku mwanya w\u2019umuntu ukize cyane ku isi mu myaka 18 muri 24 hagati ya 1995 na 2017, harimo imyaka 13 yikurikiranya kuva mu 1995 kugeza 2007. Gates yabaye umuherwe wa mbere mu 1999, ubwo umutungo we warengaga gato miliyari 100 z\u2019amadolari ya Amerika. Nk\u2019uko Forbes ibivuga, kugeza muri Gicurasi 2025, umutungo we wari miliyari 115.1 z\u2019amadolari ya Amerika, bimugira uwa cumi na gatatu mu baherwe ku isi.\u00a0\nGates yavukiye i Seattle, muri leta ya Washington, yize amashuri yigenga muri Lakeside School, aho yagiranye ubucuti na Allen ndetse anateza imbere ibyo akunda mu bijyanye n\u2019ikoranabuhanga. Mu 1973, yiyandikishije muri Kaminuza ya Harvard, aho yize amasomo arimo Math 55 n\u2019amasomo ya siyansi ya mudasobwa yo mu rwego rwa kaminuza, ariko yayahagaritse mu 1975 ajya gushinga no kuyobora Microsoft. Yayikoreye nk'umuyobozi mukuru mu myaka 25 yakurikiyeho, ndetse aba perezida na perezida w\u2019inama y\u2019ubutegetsi ubwo iyi sosiyete yashingwaga mu 1981. Yasimbuwe nk'umuyobozi mukuru na Steve Ballmer mu 2000, yahindutse umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019ubwubatsi bwa porogaramu, umwanya yari afite kugeza mu 2008. Yavuye ku mwanya wa perezida w\u2019inama y\u2019ubutegetsi mu 2014 aba umujyanama mu ikoranabuhanga w\u2019umuyobozi mukuru Satya Nadella n\u2019abandi bayobozi ba Microsoft, umwanya agifite. Yeguye ku mwanya w\u2019inama y\u2019ubutegetsi mu 2020.\nUko igihe cyagiye gihita, Gates yagabanyije inshingano ze muri Microsoft kugira ngo yibande ku bikorwa bye byo gufasha afatanyije na Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation, umuryango munini ku isi w\u2019abagiraneza, we n\u2019umugore we icyo gihe, Melinda French Gates, bayoboye kuva mu 2000 kugeza mu 2024. Yibanda ku nzego zirimo ubuzima, uburezi, no kurwanya ubukene, Gates yamenyekanye kubera imbaraga ze zo kurwanya indwara zandura nka igituntu, malariya na polio. Nyuma y\u2019uko French Gates yeguye ku mwanya w\u2019umuyobozi wungirije nyuma yo gutandukana kw\u2019aba bombi, umuryango wahinduriwe izina witwa Gates Foundation, aho Gates ari we muyobozi wawo wenyine.\nGates ni we washinze akaba na perezida w'andi masosiyete menshi, arimo BEN, Cascade Investment, TerraPower, Gates Ventures, na Breakthrough Energy. Mu 2010, we na Warren Buffett bashinze Giving Pledge, aho bo n'abandi baherwe biyemeje gutanga nibura kimwe cya kabiri cy'umutungo wabo mu bikorwa by'ubugiraneza. Yamenyekanye nk'umwe mu n'ikinyamakuru \"Time\" mu 1999, yahawe andi mashimwe n'ibihembo byinshi, harimo n'umudari wa Perezida w'Ubwigenge, wahawe we na French Gates mu 2016 kubera ibikorwa byabo by'ubugiraneza. Yanditswe muri filime nyinshi za documentaire, yasohoye igitabo cya mbere mu bitabo bitatu byateguwe, \"Source Code: My Beginnings\", mu 2025.\nWilliam Henry Gates III yavutse ku ya 28 Ukwakira 1955, i Seattle, muri Washington, nk'umuhungu w'ikinege wa William H. Gates Sr. [a] (1925\u20132020) n'umugore we wa mbere, Mary Maxwell Gates (1929\u20131994). Inkomoko ye irimo Icyongereza, Ikidage, n'Ikinya- Irish / Ikigo cy'Abanye-Ecosse-Irish. Se yari umunyamategeko ukomeye, naho nyina yakoraga mu nama y'ubuyobozi ya First Interstate BancSystem na United Way of America. Sekuru wa Gates, JW Maxwell, yari perezida wa banki y'igihugu. Gates afite kandi mushiki we mukuru, Kristi (Kristianne), na mushiki we muto, Libby. Ni uwa kane mu izina rye mu muryango we, ariko azwi ku izina rya William Gates III cyangwa \"Trey\" (ni ukuvuga batatu) kuko se yari afite inyuguti \"II\". Uwo muryango wabaga mu gace ka Sand Point muri Seattle mu nzu yangijwe n'inkubi y'umuyaga idasanzwe ubwo Gates yari afite imyaka 7. Gates akiri muto, ababyeyi be bifuzaga ko akora umwuga w\u2019amategeko. Mu bwana bwe, umuryango we wakundaga kujya mu itorero ry\u2019amatorero ya gikristo ya Congregational, idini ry\u2019abaporotesitanti bavuguruye. Gates yari muto ugereranyije n'imyaka ye kandi yatotezwaga akiri umwana. Umuryango washishikarizaga amarushanwa; umwe mu bashyitsi yavuze ko \"ntacyo byari bitwaye byaba ari imitima cyangwa umupira wo mu mazi cyangwa koga ujya ku cyambu; buri gihe hariho igihembo cyo gutsinda, kandi buri gihe hariho igihano cyo gutsindwa\". \nKu myaka 13, Gates yiyandikishije mu ishuri ryigenga rya Lakeside Prep School. Ubwo yari mu mwaka wa munani, itsinda ry\u2019ababyeyi bo muri iryo shuri ryakoresheje amafaranga yavuye mu igurishwa rya Lakeside School kugira ngo bagure terminal ya Teletype Model 33 ASR n\u2019igihe gito cya mudasobwa kuri mudasobwa ya General Electric (GE) ku banyeshuri.[17] Gates yashishikajwe no gukora porogaramu ya GE muri BASIC, maze yemererwa kuva mu masomo y\u2019imibare kugira ngo akurikirane inyungu ze. Yanditse porogaramu ye ya mbere ya mudasobwa kuri iyi mashini, ishyirwa mu bikorwa rya tic-tac-toe ryemereraga abayikoresha gukina imikino kuri mudasobwa. Gates yashimishijwe n\u2019iyo mashini n\u2019uburyo yahoraga ikora neza cyane.\nNyuma y\u2019uko impano ya Mothers Club irangiye, Gates n\u2019abandi banyeshuri basabye umwanya kuri sisitemu, harimo na mudasobwa nto za DEC PDP. Imwe muri izi sisitemu yari PDP-10 ya Computer Center Corporation (CCC), yabujije Gates, Paul Allen, Ric Weiland, n\u2019inshuti magara ya Gates akaba n\u2019umufatanyabikorwa wa mbere mu bucuruzi, Kent Evans, mu mpeshyi nyuma y\u2019uko ibafashe bakoresha udukosa muri sisitemu yo gukora kugira ngo babone umwanya wa mudasobwa ku buntu. \nAbanyeshuri bane bashinze Lakeside Programmers Club kugira ngo binjize amafaranga. [8] Nyuma y\u2019ihagarikwa ry\u2019akazi, bitanze gushaka udukosa muri porogaramu za CCC kugira ngo babone igihe cy\u2019inyongera kuri mudasobwa. Aho gukoresha iyi porogaramu ukoresheje Teletype, Gates yagiye ku biro bya CCC yiga kode y\u2019isoko ya porogaramu zitandukanye zakoreshaga iyi porogaramu, harimo Fortran, Lisp, n\u2019ururimi rw\u2019imashini. Amasezerano na CCC yakomeje kugeza mu 1970, ubwo iyi sosiyete yavaga mu kazi. \nMu 1971, umwarimu wo muri Lakeside yasabye Gates na Evans gukoresha sisitemu yo gutegura gahunda y\u2019amasomo y\u2019ishuri, abaha igihe cya mudasobwa n\u2019amafaranga y\u2019inyongera. Aba bombi bakoze cyane kugira ngo gahunda itegure umwaka wabo wa nyuma. Mu mpera z\u2019umwaka wabo wa gatatu, Evans yahitanywe n\u2019impanuka yo kuzamuka imisozi, Gates yavuze ko ari umwe mu minsi ibabaje cyane mu buzima bwe. Hanyuma yiyambaje Allen, wamufashaga kurangiza gahunda yo muri Lakeside. \nKu myaka 17, Gates yakoranye na Allen yise Traf-O-Data kugira ngo akore ibyuma bipima umuhanda bishingiye kuri poroseseri ya Intel 8008. Mu 1972, yabaye umwanditsi w\u2019Inteko Ishinga Amategeko mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko. Yari intiti mu by\u2019ubumenyi bw\u2019igihugu ubwo yarangizaga mu ishuri rya Lakeside mu 1973. Yabonye amanota 1590 muri 1600 mu bizamini bya Scholastic Aptitude Test (SAT) maze yiyandikisha muri Kaminuza ya Harvard mu gihe cy\u2019umuhindo wa 1973. \nGates ntiyamaze igihe gihagije muri Harvard ngo ahitemo kwibanda ku byo yibandaho, ahubwo yafashe amasomo y\u2019imibare (harimo na Math 55) n\u2019amasomo ya siyansi ya mudasobwa yo mu rwego rwa kaminuza. Ubwo yari muri Harvard, yahuye n\u2019umunyeshuri mugenzi we akaba n\u2019umuyobozi mukuru wa Microsoft Steve Ballmer. Gates yavuye muri Harvard nyuma y\u2019imyaka ibiri mu gihe Ballmer yagumyeyo maze arangiza \"kaminuza\". Nyuma y\u2019imyaka myinshi, Ballmer yasimbuye Gates nk\u2019umuyobozi mukuru wa Microsoft maze akomeza uwo mwanya kuva mu 2000 kugeza yeguye mu 2014. Gates yateguye uburyo bwo gutondeka pancake nk'igisubizo kuri kimwe mu bibazo bitarakemurwa byatanzwe mu isomo rya combinatorics rya Porofeseri Harry Lewis. Igisubizo cye cyabaye icya mbere mu myaka irenga 30, kandi icyakurikiyeho ni 2% gusa Igisubizo cye cyashyizwe ahagaragara ku bufatanye n'umuhanga mu bya mudasobwa wa Harvard Christos Papadimitriou. \nGates yakomeje kuvugana na Paul Allen maze aza kumusanga muri Honeywell mu mpeshyi yo mu 1974. [32] Mu 1975, MITS Altair 8800 yasohotse ishingiye kuri Intel 8080 CPU, maze Gates na Allen babona amahirwe yo gutangiza sosiyete yabo bwite ya porogaramu za mudasobwa. [33] Gates yavuye muri Harvard muri uwo mwaka. Ababyeyi be baramushyigikiye nyuma yo kubona ukuntu yifuzaga gutangiza sosiyete ye bwite. [34] Yasobanuye icyemezo cye cyo kuva muri Harvard ati: \"Iyo ibintu bitagenda neza, nashoboraga gusubira ku ishuri buri gihe. Nari mu kiruhuko cyemewe.\" \nreferences:"}
