{"id": "21502", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21502", "title": "Amagaju FC", "text": "Amagaju Football Club ni ikipe yumupira wamaguru yo mu karere ka Nyamagabe Intara y Amajyepfo, yu Rwanda. Kurubu iyi kipe irushanwa muri Shampiyona y\u2019umupira wamaguru mu Rwanda, ikinira imikino yayo iwayo kuri Stade de Nyamagabe izwi ku izina rya Nyagisenyi.Nikipi yumupira wamaguru yumwuga ikorera mu Karere ka Nyamagabe. Iyi kipe yashinzwe muwi 1935, ikina imikino yayo murugo kuri Stade Nyagisenyi. Ibara ryabo murugo ni umuhondo nubururu. Amagaju ni imwe mu makipe amaze igihe mu Rwanda, afite ibikombe 5. [\"Icyitonderwa kirakenewe\"]"}
{"id": "21503", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21503", "title": "Umurenge wa Nyange", "text": "Umurenge wa Nyange ni umwe mu mirenge 13 igize Akarere ka Ngororero, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba, mu Rwanda. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Nyange wari utuwe n'abaturage 24 859.\nNyange izwi kubera amateka ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Izwi kandi kubera abanyeshuri b'Intwari z'Imena bo mu 1997.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'abaturage.\nUmurenge wa Nyange ni umwe mu mirenge 13 y'Akarere ka Ngororero. Ufite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 54,37.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Nyange wari utuwe n'abaturage 21 932. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 24 859. Ubucucike bwari abantu 457 kuri kilometero kare.\nUbukungu.\nAkarere ka Ngororero gafite ibikorwa byinshi by'ubucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro. Umurenge wa Nyange uri mu mirenge irimo ubucukuzi butemewe bwinshi.\nUmurenge wa Nyange ufite ikigo cy'ikoranabuhanga (\"telecenter\"). Muri Nyakanga 2025, umushinga wa DOT Rwanda wahaye icyo kigo mudasobwa 10. Uwo mushinga uzahugura kandi abacuruzi bato mu ikoranabuhanga.\nAmateka.\nMu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, Abatutsi benshi bahungiye muri kiliziya Gatolika ya Nyange. Padiri Athanase Seromba yategetse ko iyo kiliziya isenywa. Abari bayirimo bose barapfuye. Uyu munsi i Nyange hari urwibutso rwa Jenoside.\nMuri Werurwe 1997, Interahamwe zateye Ishuri ryisumbuye rya Nyange. Zategetse abanyeshuri kwitandukanya hakurikijwe ubwoko. Abanyeshuri barabyanze. Bavuze ko bose ari Abanyarwanda. Bamwe muri bo barishwe. Abo banyeshuri bari mu Ntwari z'Imena."}
{"id": "21504", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21504", "title": "Rwanda women's national under-16 basketball team", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore y'u Rwanda ya Basketball y'abatarengeje imyaka 16 nikipe ya Basketball y'igihugu cy'u Rwanda, iyoborwa na F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Rwandaise de Basketball Amateur. Ihagarariye igihugu mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Basketball y'abagore batarengeje imyaka 16."}
{"id": "21505", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21505", "title": "Faustin But\u00e9ra", "text": "Faustin But\u00e9ra (wavutse kuwa 20 Nzeri 1955) numukinnyi w'umunyarwanda usiganwa ku maguru. Yitabiriye irushanwa ryo gusiganwa kumaguru rya metero 400 na metero 400 mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi yo mu 1984. \nBut\u00e9ra yegukanye umudari wewa mbere mpuzamahanga mu irushanwa rya 1978 rya Siporo muri Afurika yo Hagati ryabereye i Libreville, muri Gabon, ahoyatsindiye umudari wa zahabu mu kwiruka metero 800 mu minota 1 n'iminota 55.5. Mu 1979, yashyizeho igihe agahigo ke cya mbere cyo kwiruka metero 400 mu buryo bw'amasegonda 53.7, nubwo yari yihuta kurusha agahigo k'u Rwanda ntikemejwe bitewe n'uburyo bwo gukoresha igihe n'intoki. Yashyizeho igihe cyecya mbere cyo kwiruka metero 400 mumasegonda 49.36 mu 1982. \nBut\u00e9ra yatsinze mumikino yo gusiganwa kumaguru yametero 400 ndetse no mu mikino Olempike yomuri 1984, yari iteganyijwe muminsi ikurikiranye. Ku itariki ya 3 Kanama, But\u00e9ra yarangije ari uwa 7 mu mikino yo gusiganwa kumaguru ya metero 400, yirukanye amanota 54.36 ariko ntagera muri kimwe cyakabiri cy\u2019irushanwa. Igihe cye cyashyize umuhigo w\u2019igihugu cy\u2019u Rwanda kugeza uburacyariho muri 2025 Ku itariki ya 4 Kanama, yagarutse muri metero 400, yiruka amasegonda 51.41 aba uwa 8 mu gihe yarari mwirushanwa. \nNyuma y'imyaka itatu mu mikino ya Afurika yo Hagati yo mu 1987, But\u00e9ra yongeye kwitabira mu isiganwa ry'imipira yogusiganwa metero 400. Yatsindiye umudari wifeza inyuma ya Jean-Pierre Abossolo-Ze, yiruka amasegonda 54.0. Igihe cye cyongeye kwihuta kurusha agahigo ke k'igihugu, ariko ntibyemejwe bitewe n'uburyo bwogukoresha igihe nintoki bwakoreshejwe. \nMuri 2012, But\u00e9ra yashimwe na Minisiteri y'Umuco n'Imikino yomu Rwanda, ahabwa uburenganzira bwo kwinjira mumikino yose yomu Rwanda kubera kuba umukinnyi mpuzamahanga ukomeye mu gihugu. "}
{"id": "21506", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21506", "title": "IMVUNJA", "text": "Amavunja ni indwara mbi cyane iterwa n'umwanda,ikaba ikwira kwira muburyo bwihuse iyo utabyitayeho nkiyo hari uyirwaye mumuryango.\nubushakashatsi bwakozwe kuri iyindwara bugaragaza ko hari uburyo butandukanye amavunja ashobora kwanduriramo. ahenshi cyane nimuburyo bwoguhura cyangwa kwegerana muburyo bwogukoranaho.\nUBUSHAKASHATSI KUBIJYANYE NO KWANDURA AMAVUNJA MU MURYANGO:\nUbushakashatsi bwakozwe mubihugu bitandukanye bwerekanye ko amavunja yandura cyane mumiryango,aho umuntu umwe ashobora kuba intandaro yogukwirakwiza indwara mubandi.kuburyo bworoshye,ibiheri byinkuruka bituruka kumuryango umwe bigenda bigaragara kubagize urugo. \nIbi bigaragazwa nazaraporo zibigonderabuzima naza kaminuza aho amavunja yandura kuburyo bworoshye mumiryango cyane cyane habayeho kutita kwisuku. ubushakashatsi kandi bwerekanyeko igihe cyogukwirakwira kwamavunja gitandukana bitewe nicyiciro cyabantu.abana nabacecuru nibo bagaragaza ibyago byinshi byokwandura kuko umubiri wabo uba utabasha neza gukingira indwara nkamavunja. \nurubyiruko rwari hagati yimyaka 18 na 35 rwasanganywe ibyago byinshi byogukwirakwiza amavunja kuberako hari byinshi bakora mumiryango nomumatsinda bituma bandura byoroshye."}
{"id": "21507", "revid": "18414", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21507", "title": "Akamaro k'amata", "text": "Amata ni kimwe mubyo kurya byihagije ku ntungamubiri n'ibifitiye umubiri akamaro ku buryo ashobora gutunga yaba umwana cyangwa umuntu mukuru igihe kirekire adakeneye ikindi kintu.\nAmata arimo amoko menshi. harimo amata akomoka ku nyamaswa, ku bantu, amata ya soya, ay'utubuto duto twa almond, aya coconut n'andi ava mu bindi.\nAmata y'inka nk'amwe mu akundwa na benshi, usanga nayo anyobwa mu buryo butandukanye. Hari anyobwa arimo ibinure bike, anyobwa atarimo ibinure (fat-free milk), ikivuguto, n'andi.\nIntungamubiri ziba mu mata.\nAmata abamo intungamubiri nyinshi, harimo: \nAkamaro k'amata ku buzima.\nAmata afitiye umubiri w'umuntu akamaro kanini, twavugamo nk'ibinure bigize amata, ibi ni ingenzi cyane kuko bituma umubiti ugira imbaraga ukaba wabasha gukora imisemburo yo kuwurinda ibishobora kuwangiza, ndetse bikanawurinda ubukonje.\nIbinure kandi hari vitamine zibikenera kugira ngo zibashe gukora neza mu mubiri akamaro kazo.\nProteyine ziboneka mu mata, ni kimwe mu bifasha umubiri w'umuntu gusana ahangiritse, kongera ubudahangarwa by'umubiri, gukomeza imikaya n'amagufwa, ndetse n'indi mikorere myiza y'umubiri.\nIzi vitamin n'izindi ntungamubiri ziba mu mata zigira akamaro gatandukanye tutarondora. Kamwe muriko ni:\nVitamin A iba mu mata, ituma amata agira akamaro cyane mu gukomeza amenyo, gukomeza imikaya y'amaso, kurwanya indwara y'amaso yo kutabona neza nijoro, kugira uruhu rwiza n'ibindi.\nUmuganga w'umuhanga mu kuvura amagufwa, Frorence Piquet, atanga inama yo kwihata cyane ibikomoka ku mata kuko bikungahaye ku myunyungugu (calcium) ituma amagufwa akomera kandi bikanayarinda korohera no kumungwa ngo abe yavunika uko umuntu agenda akura.\nVitamin B1 igira akamaro cyane mu kurinda indwara y'imitsi, ifasha mu mikorere y'umutima n'imitsi y'amaraso, ituma umubiri ugira ingufu, ni vitamine zirinda ubusaza, kurinda amaso kurwara ishaza, ifasha mu mikorere myiza y'uruhu, amaso, imisatsi, umunwa ndetse n'umwijima. iyi vitamine kandi inafasha umubiri guhangana na stress.\nVitamin B2 irinda uburwayi bwo kubura amaraso (anemia) kuko ifasha umubiri kwinjiza ubutare.\nVitamin B3 ifasha umutima gukora neza ikanagabanya choresterol mbi mu mubiri\nVitamin B5 ifasha mu gukora uturemangingo dufasha mu guhanahana amakuru ku bwonko, ituma umutima ukora neza, ikanakomeza amagufwa. Iyi vitamin kandi ituma inda ibyara (uterus) ikura neza \nVitamin D ifasha mu kuringaniza umuvuduko w'amaraso, ituma umutima ukora neza, ifasha mu kurinda indwara zituma umubiri wirwanya (autoimmune diseases) ndetse inafasha umubiri kwinjiza kalisiyumu no kuringaniza imyunyungugu mu mubiri\nAbahanga bahamya ko bitewe n'uko amwe mu mafunguro cyangwa ibiribwa abantu bafata biba byuzuyemo aside (acid) bigira uruhare mu gukura imyunyungugu mu magufwa bityo akaba yakwangirika byoroshye. Banavuga kandi ko kurya umunyu mwinshi nabyo biri mu byangiza amagufwa.\nKunywa amata rero n'ibiyakomokaho ni kimwe mu bisubizo bituma amagufwa atangirika. ikindi harimo no kurya nk'imboga za epinari, kwirinda kurya umunyu mwinshi cyane cyane uwakorewe mu nganda, ndetse ukanakora imyitozo ngororamubiri. ibi byose birinda amagufwa kwangirika no koroha."}
