{"id": "21509", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21509", "title": "Urutonde rw'abakoresha imiti yongera imbaraga mu mikino ngororamubiri", "text": "Gukoresha ibiyobyabwenge byongera imbaraga (gukoresha imiti yongeri imbaraga muri siporo) birabujijwe mu mikino ya siporo. Abakinnyi bagaragaye ko bakoresheje ibiyobyabwenge nk'ibyo bibujijwe, byaba binyuze mu isuzuma ry'ibiyobyabwenge, sisitemu ya pasiporo y'ibinyabuzima, iperereza cyangwa kwemererwa mu ruhame, bashobora guhagarikwa mu irushanwa igihe kirekire. Ku byerekeranye n'ibiyobyabwenge byagaragaye ko Ibiyobyabwenge n\u2019ibisindisha bikoreshwa mu buryo butandukanye no ku mpamvu zitandukanye mu bihugu byinshi byo ku isi. N\u2019ubwo ahenshi mu bihugu, ibinyobwa birimo arukoru/imisemburo isindisha (alcool) byemewe n\u2019mategeko, ibyo ntibibujije ko bigira ingaruka ku buzima kubera uburozi buba bubirimo. Iyo umuntu anyoye ibinyobwa birimo arukoru buri munsi, agera aho akaba umugaragu wabyo bikanamwokama agahora ashaka kubifata. Bimwe mu bibazo biterwa n\u2019ibiyobyabwenge/ibisindisha harimo ibibazo bijyanye n\u2019imyitwarire, ibibazo by\u2019ubuzima bigaragara inyuma ku mubiri, ibibazo by\u2019 uburwayi, imitekerereze idahwitse ibi bikaba ari bimwe mu bigaragaza bigaragaza uburemere bw'icyaha. Abakinnyi bagaragaye ko bafite ibiyobyabwenge mu mubiri bibujijwe, cyangwa byangiza cyangwa banze gupimwa ibiyobyabwenge nabo bashobora guhagarikwa muri uyu mukino. guhagarikwa mu irushanwa ashobora kandi guhabwa abakinnyi bagaragaye ko bafite ibiyobyabwenge bibujijwe cyangwa imiti itera imbaraga idafite ingaruka nyinshi ku barushanwa mu mikino. Urwego rwa siporo rushinzwe kugena ibiyobyabwenge bibujijwe muri siporo ni Ikigo Mpuzamahanga Gishinzwe Kurwanya Ibiyobyabwenge (WADA).\nUbusanzwe, umukinnyi wese upimwe ibiyobyabwenge bibujijwe nyuma yo kurangiza igihano cya mbere, acibwa burundu mu mukino wa siporo. Abantu benshi bazwi cyane bafatiwe ibihano byo gukoresha imiti igabanya ubukana bw'ibiyobyabwenge baturutse mu mukino wa siporo, hamwe n'imanza zikomeye zakozwe kuri Ben Johnson, Marion Jones na Tim Montgomery. Byongeye kandi, abakinnyi benshi bakorewe gahunda za leta zo gukoresha imiti igabanya ubukana mu Budage bw'Iburasirazuba no mu Muryango w'Abasoviyeti hagati y'imyaka ya 1950 na 1980 bari abasiganwa mu mikino, ariko ireme ry'akazi mpuzamahanga ko kurwanya imiti yongerera umubiri imbaraga ryari ribi cyane ku buryo umukinnyi umwe gusa wo mu Budage bw'Iburasirazuba yagaragaye ko afite iyi ndwara. Nyuma y'ibirego byo gukoresha imiti igabanya ubukana bw'ibiyobyabwenge mu Burusiya, IAAF yahagaritse abakinnyi bo muri icyo gihugu mu marushanwa, harimo n'imikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi ya 2016.\nurutonde rwintandanturo"}
{"id": "21510", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21510", "title": "Patrick irakiza", "text": "Patrick Irakiza.\nPatrick irakiza n'umusore w'umunyarwanda, ukora imyitozo ngorora mubiri akaba afite wimyaka 23 yamavuko wiga muri kaminuza y' Rwanda, mu ishami ry' uburezi i rukara, Muntara y' iburasirazuba, akaba ashobora gukoresha umubiriwe agashushanya uruziga, yanakwizingazingira kugiti nk' inzoka, ashobora no kwigana ingendo z' inyamanswa zimwe nazimwe nki ingagi ndetse nizindi. Akaba yariyise \"Boneless\" aribyo bisobanura umuntu utagira amagufwa, umurebye wakwibazako atagira amagufwa bitewe nuko akoresha ibice by'umubiri we. \nUyu musore ashobora gukoresha umubiri umurongo ugororotse imfuruka ya 180 nibindi abantu babonako bitashoboka, Ndetse akaba akomoka mukarere ka Musanze mu ntara yamajyaruguru y' Igihugu. Akaba yaravuzeko "}
{"id": "21511", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21511", "title": "BBC y'amatigers", "text": "Tigers Basketball Club ni ikipe ikina umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda. Ifite icyicaro i Kigali. Yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2019, yinjira muri shampiyona y\u2019umukino wa Basketball y\u2019u Rwanda (RBL) muri 2029.\nTigers Basketball Club yashinzwe na Francis Shyaka, uyu akaba na rwiyemezamirimo, kandi yahoze ari umukinnyi wa basketball. Umusaruro mwiza iyi kipe yagize ni umwanya wa 4 muri shampiyona ya 2021-2022 initabira imikino ya 1/2 muri iyi shampiyona. Mu Ukuboza 2024, iyi kipe yasinyishije umutoza watsinze inshura eshanu witwa Henry Mwinuka, nk'umutoza mukuru wayo mushya. \nIkipe ya Tigers yatwaye igikombe cyayo cya mbere mu mwaka wa 2025 ubwo yatwaraga igikombe Basketball cy'u Rwanda. \nIkibuga cy'imikino.\nKuva yashingwa, Tigers yakiniye mu bibuga byinshi byatanzwe na Rwanda Basketball League (RBL), ariko, ikipe ifite gahunda yo kubaka ikibuga cyayo mu gihe kizaza. "}
{"id": "21512", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21512", "title": "Rwandan Cup", "text": "Rwanda Peace Cup yari izwi nka The Rwanda Cup ni cyo gikombe cya mbere cya shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru mu Rwanda. Cyashinzwe gikorwa bwa mbere mu 1975, naho icya mbere cyegukanwa na Kiyovu Sports.\nIrirushanwa rifunguye kumakipe yose yomu cyiciro cyambere n'icyakabiri mu Rwanda. Abatsinze bemerewe kujya mu gikombe cya CAF Confederation Cup nokujya muri FERWAFA Super Cup, umukino uzahuza amakipe yatwaye igikombe cya shampiyona y'u Rwanda mumwaka utaha. APR FC niyo kipe yatsinze cyane mugutwara ibikombe cumi na bitatu."}
{"id": "21513", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21513", "title": "Mukungwa FC", "text": "Mukungwa Ruhengeri nikipe yumupira wamaguru ituruka Ruhengeri mu Rwanda.\nMu 1988 iyikipe yegukanye igikombe cya Shampiyona y'Urwanda. \nIkibuga cyumupira.\nIkipikina kukibuga cya Regional de Kigali.\n Amakipe y'igikombe cya Afurika cy'amakipe yatwaye ibikombe bya shampiyona yo mu 1989\u00a0\u2013 Icyiciro cya mbere\n 1988, 1989"}
{"id": "21514", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21514", "title": "Umukino gakondo wo gukirana", "text": "Gukirana ni umwe mu mikino gakondo y\u2019Abanyarwanda yakundwaga cyane cyane n\u2019abasore, aho wabafashaga gupima imbaraga z\u2019umubiri, ubutwari n\u2019ubushobozi bwo guhangana.Uyu mukino wari mu cyiciro cy\u2019imikino njyarugamba, ifite uruhare rukomeye mu gutegura urubyiruko kuba abantu bafite ingufu n\u2019umurava mu buzima bwa buri munsi.\nAmateka n\u2019aho umukino ukomoka.\nMu bihe bya kera, mbere y\u2019uko imikino y\u2019amahanga nk\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru itangira gukwirakwira mu Rwanda hagati ya 1920 na 1930, imikino gakondo yari igize igice cy\u2019ingenzi cy\u2019imibereho y\u2019Abanyarwanda. Icyakora, uko ubukoloni n\u2019indi myidagaduro mishya byagiye byinjira, imwe muri iyo mikino yaragiye ihigikwa ndetse igera aho igenda yibagirana.\nIgitabo \u201cImikino n\u2019Intwaro Gakondo\u201d cyamuritswe na Komite Olempike y\u2019u Rwanda gifatanyije na Inteko Izirikana muri Nyakanga 2018, cyagaragaje ko imikino gakondo irimo gukirana ifite uruhare mu gusigasira umuco no kwimakaza indangagaciro zirimo ubutwari, ubufatanye n\u2019ikinyabupfura.\nUko gukirana byakinwaga.\nGukirana byakinwaga n\u2019abantu babiri bafatana bagamije gutsindana umwe akagusha undi hasi mu buryo bwubahiriza amabwiriza gakondo. Byasabaga:\nAbasore bakuraga bamenyereye uyu mukino bakabonwa nk\u2019abiteguye inshingano zikomeye mu muryango no mu gihugu.\nAkamaro ko gukirana mu burezi n\u2019imibereho.\nNk\u2019uko indi mikino gakondo yar'ifite icyo itoza, gukirana byafashaga:\nByongeraga kandi icyubahiro ku musore watsindaga mu marushanwa, bikamugira icyitegererezo mu bandi."}
