{"id": "21516", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21516", "title": "Igikombe cy'isi cy'umupira w'amaguru", "text": "Igikombe cy'isi cy'umupira w'amaguru ni irushanwa ritegurwa n'ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga ry'umupira w'amaguru (FIFA), rikaba buri gihe nyuma y'imyaka ine, rikabera mu gihugu cyateganyijwe, rikitabirwa n'ibihugu biba byaratsinze imikino y'amajonjora, bihatanira kwitabira iryo rushanwa."}
{"id": "21517", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21517", "title": "Umukino w'urukiramende", "text": "Urukiramende ni umukino gakondo w\u2019u Rwanda rwo hambere wari wubashywe kandi ukunzwe n\u2019ingeri zose z\u2019abanyarwanda. Uyu mukino ushize mu cyiciro cy\u2019imikino yo gusimbuka, aho umukinnyi asabwa gusimbuka akarenga umugozi cyangwa igiti kigenda kizamurwa hashingiwe ku bipimo bya metero.\nAmateka n'inkomoko.\nAmateka y\u2019u Rwanda agaragaza ko uyu mukino wari ufite intego yo kwerekana imbaraga, ubushongore, n\u2019ubuhanga bw\u2019abasore b\u2019intarumikwa. Mu mwaka wa 1907, mu Mujyi wa Nyanza, hagaragaye amafoto yafashwe n\u2019umuhanga mu by\u2019imibereho ya muntu (anthropologist) w\u2019Umunyapolonye, Jan Czekanowski, yerekana abasore b\u2019Abanyarwanda basimbuka urukiramende rurerure cyane.\nIyo foto yaje kumurikirwa i Berlin mu Budage mu mwaka wa 1909 mu rugendoshuri rwateguwe n\u2019itsinda rya \"Deutsche Zentral-Afrika-Expedition\". Amakuru akubiye muri ayo mateka agaragaza ko Abanyarwanda bashoboraga gusimbuka urukiramende ruri ku burebure bwa metero 2.50, ibintu byafatwaga nko kurenga imiterere isanzwe y'umuntu.\n= urutonde rw'indanganturo ="}
{"id": "21518", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21518", "title": "Umukino wa golf", "text": "UMUKINO WA GOLF MU Rwanda\nmu Rwanda rw' imisozi igihumbi\u00a0 mubibaya bitatse ibyiza uhasanga icyanya cya hariwe umukino\u00a0 uzwi kwizina rya\"GOLF\" aho nahandi ni Kigali Golf Resort &amp; Villas. aho bagusanganiza ururwiro n'akanyamuneza bakwakirana urugwiro, murakaza neza mu mukino wa Golf mu rwanda ukndwa nabeshi ariko ugasaba agatubutse ugakinwa nabifite bo mubiciro bitandukanye haba abo mu Rwanda cyangwa mumahanga \numukino wa golf watangiye ahagana muri 2005 mu akarere ka Gasabo umurenge wa Nyarutarama aho watangiranye nabari bifite muri icyo gihe bakazarya batumira abaturanyi mu bindi bihugu bakaza gukina umukino uryenda ukura kuryeraho bagiye bagura ikibuga banongeramo ibicyenewe kugirango habashe kuzarya hakira abantu beshi baje gukina Golf.\nUmukino wa Golf ni umwe mu mikino idakunze gukinwa na buri wese cyane ko ugaragara nk\u2019ukinwa n\u2019abakuze ndetse n\u2019abifite. Gusa ni umwe mu ishingirwaho ubukerarugendo bw\u2019u Rwanda bushingiye kuri siporo.\nKubera iyo mpamvu, u Rwanda ni kimwe mu bihugu biri kwihutisha iterambere rya siporo rudasize inyuma umukino wa Golf, usa n\u2019aho wamaze kwigarurirwa n\u2019abafite amikoro ari hejuru.\nKugeza mu 1997 hongeweho indi myobo iba 18, ariko iyo na yo ntabwo yari yuzuye neza kuko ntiyari ikoze ku rwego nk\u2019urwo iriho ubu rushobora kwakira amarushanwa ayo ari yo yose ku Isi nk\u2019uko byagenze mu gihe cyashize twakira Sunshine Tour. Ubu na PGA Tour twayakira.\nSunshine Tour ni irushanwa ryo muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo riri ku rwego rw\u2019Isi. Rijya ritumirwamo ba Tiger Woods, ba Rory McIlroy n\u2019abandi bose. Muri uyu mwaka twarayakiriye ariko hari na European Tour ishobora kubera aha, na PGA Tour yahabera.\nNi amarushanwa nyine afite ibigwi ku rwego rw\u2019Isi. Iryo twagiraga rikomeye ni Rwanda Open ryatumirwagamo ibyo bihugu byose. Nubwo baza gukina ariko biba byatewe n\u2019amafaranga y\u2019ibihembo yashyizweho.\nBo bareba amafaranga ariho. Kugira ngo utumire nka Tiger Woods aze gukina hano, bisaba amafaranga. Iki kibuga rero kiri ku rwego rwiza kandi rukomeye rwakwakira ayo marushanwa yose.\nAmashakiro"}
{"id": "21519", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21519", "title": "Nkombo FC", "text": "NKOMBO FC, n'ikipe y'umpira w'amaguru mu Rwanda, yashinzwe mumwaka wi 2024. ikaba ikina mukiciro cya kabiri (2) nyuma yumwaka umwe ishinzwe ikaba yarahise iva mukiciro cya gatatu izamuka mukiciro cya kabiri akaba ari naho ibarizwa ubungubu, ikaba ikina amarushanwa ategurwa na FERWAFA. Iy'ikipe ikaba iherereye Mu intara y'Iburengera zuba, Akarere ka Rusizi, umurenge wa Nkombo, akaba ari umurenge ubarizwa mukirwa rwahagati. \nNKOMBO FC yabaye ikipe yemewe yokwitabira amarushanwa ategurwa nurwego rushinzwe umuPira w'amaguru murwanda FERWAFA, nyuma yuko yari imaze imyaka igera muri itatu yegukana ibikombe by\"umurenge Kagame Cup, harimo ibikombe 2 byokurwego rw'Akarere yatwaye mumyaka 2018, ndetse nuwa 2023. niho havuye igitekerezo cyabamwe mubari bayihagarariye barimo UJEKUVUKA Emmanuel uzwi ku izina rya MARCHAL, akaba ari nawe muyobozi wayo mukuru cyokuyandikisha muma kipe azajya yitabira amarushanwa ategurwa na FRWAFA, \nNKOMBO FC nyuma y'amezi 7 izamutse mukiciro cya kabiri mumarushanwa ategurwa na FERWAFA, ikaba iri kumwanya wambere n'amanota 26, aho ikurikirwa na Espoire FC n'amanota nayo ibarizwa mukarere ka Rusizi."}
{"id": "21520", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21520", "title": "Marato", "text": "Amarushanwa yo kwiruka Hari amarushanwa menshi yo kwiruka abera mu RWANDA harimo nka Kigali International Peace Marathon iberara mumugi wa Kigali.\nUyumukino utuma abanyarwada bayoboka sporo kandi ugatuma bamwe muribo bungukamo inkunga yokwiga nogutenbera hanze yigihugu.\nKandi nanone uyumukino hari bamwe mubanya gihugu nka Yve womuri APR ATHLETICS hamwe nabandi hari ibyowagiye ubafasha muburyo bwimibereho hamwenubuzima.\nHari ibigo byamashuri bitera inkunga abanyeshuri bikanazamura abanyemano bifitiye nabyo kamaro kanini kubanyagihugu cyane cyane kubanyeshuri nokubayeyi biyingera kubwiza bwiyi sporo kandi gushishikariza abanyemano kugaragaza imano zabo nubwitabire mumarushanrwa nanone duhimira na Sina Gerard Athetics Club kubufasha itanga."}
{"id": "21521", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21521", "title": "Kepler college volleyball", "text": "Kepler College Volleyball Club\nKepler College Volleyball Club ni ikipe ikomeye ifite ikicaro mu Rwanda ikinyinya, izwiho gukina mu cyiciro cya mbere (Serie A) mu bagabo n'abagore, ikaba yarigaragaje nk'imwe mu makipe mashya afite intego zikomeye nyuma yo gufata umwanya wa kabiri muri shampiyona y'abagabo ya 2023/24. Iyi kipe itozwa na Fid\u00e8le Nyirimana, ikinira muri Volleybox Rwanda National League kandi Mu mwaka wayo wa mbere, yageze ku mukino wa nyuma wa shampiyona, itsindwa na APR VC, bituma iba iya kabiri. Ikipe igizwe n'abakinnyi b'abanyeshuri ba Kepler College n'abandi b'inzobere, baharanira gukina bafatanyije n'uburezi kandi Iyi kipe ikina amarushanwa akomeye nka FRVB League ndetse n'amarushanwa yo kwibuka (Memorial Tournaments). Mu kiciro cy'abagore, ikipe ya Kepler yagaragaye mu myanya ya hafi (iy'iya 4 mu mwaka wa 2025/26) kandi Kepler Volleyball Club ikomeje kwerekana ko ari ikipe ishobora gutwara ibikombe mu gihe cya vuba mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "21523", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21523", "title": "GAHUNDA YO KUGABURIRA ABANA MU BIGO BY'AMASHURI", "text": "Gahunda yo kugaburiri abana mu bigo by'amashuri ni gahunda yatangijwe Mu Mwaka wa mashuri wa 2021-2022 Guverinoma yafashe icyemezo cyokugeza gahunda yo kugaburira abana ku ishuri no mu mashuri abanza nyuma y'uko itangijwe mu yisumbuye,gusa minisiteri y'Uberezi ivugako hakiri inzitizi kubera ko ingingo y'imariyagenewe kunganira ibigo by'amashuri idahagije kuko harimo icyuho cya millioni 15Frw."}
