{"id": "21526", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21526", "title": "Ikibuga cy'Amagare cy'i Bugesera", "text": "Ikibuga cy'amagare cy'i Bugesera ni ikibuga bakiniraho amagare cyatangiye gukora ku mugaragaro m'ukuboza 2023, giherereye mu murenge wa Ntarama mu karere ka Bugesera. Cyubatswe ku bufatanye n'ikipe ya Israel-Premier Tech, aho habera imyitozo n'amarushanwa yo gusiganwa ku magare, mu rwego rwo kwitegura Shampiyona y'Isi y'amagare.\nAmakipe ahakinira.\nIki kibuga cy'amagare gikinirwago n'abana bato kuva ku myaka 13, ndetse hakanitoreza ikipe y'abakorwa ya bugesera."}
{"id": "21527", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21527", "title": "Ganza", "text": "Ganza cyari ikirango cy'ahawe irishanwa ry'ashampiyona y'isi y'amagare yabere mu mujyi wa kigali mu Rwanda. \nImiterere.\nUbundi Ganza yagiye agaragara ahantu hatandukanye mu gihe cy'ampiyona y'isi yaberaga muri kigali, nko muri GenZComedyShow, Shampiyona y'Isi mu gihe yabaga, no muri BK Arena. Ganza yari ameze nk'igunge ku mutwe ndetse n'amaboko no kunda hakaba hari ikirangantego cy'idarapo ry'u Rwanda. "}
