{"id": "21533", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21533", "title": "Kwita Izina Cycling Tour", "text": "Kwita Izina Cycling Tour nisiganwa ry'amagare ryomu muhanda ryamaraga iminsi myinshi mu Rwanda riba buri mwaka kuva muwi 2009 kugeza muwi 2012. Ryari mu rwego rwa UCI Africa Tour nk'irushanwa rya 2.2 kubyiciro bibiri bya nyuma. \nIrushanwa rya gatatu munshuro enye ryatsindiwe na Abraham Ruhumuriza, naho irya 2011 ryegukanwe na Daniel Teklehaymanot wo muri Eritrea. "}
{"id": "21534", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21534", "title": "Kigali International Peace Marathon", "text": "Isiganwa ryamaguru Mpuzamahanga y'Amahoro ya Kigali [a] ni isiganwa ngarukamwaka ibera mumi muhanda iyobowe na Kigali, mu Rwanda, kuva muri 2005. [1] Ni isiganwa ry'umuhanda rya World Athletics Label kandi rikaba ari umunyamuryango w'ishyirahamwe ry'amasiganwa mpuzamahanga ya Marato n'amasiganwa yo kure. [7] Mu mpera z'icyumweru cy'isiganwa, hatangwa kandi igice cya marato n'isiganwa ry'ibiro 10 [b]. [9] Kwiruka nijoro nabyo bifitanye isano n'iri siganwa, nubwo bitabaye mu mpera z'icyumweru kimwe. [10]\nAmateka.\nMuri 2004, nyuma ya jenoside yo mu Rwanda imyaka icumi mbere yaho, Soroptimist International yafashe icyemezo cyo gutegura isiganwa ryamaguru kugira ngo iteze imbere iterambere ry'amahoro binyuze mumikino. [1] Isiganwa rya mbere ryabaye kuwa 15 May 2005 [1] \nIrushanwa ryo muri 2020 ryasubitswe kabiri mbere yuko rihagarikwa kubera icyorezo cya coronavirus. [11] \nIsomo.\nMarato itangira kandi ikarangira imbereya BK Arena. [13] Igizwe n'imizunguruko ibiri, ahobasiganwa igice cya marato biruka rimwe. [13]"}
