{"id": "21536", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21536", "title": "Icyiciro cya Kabiri cy'umukira wa maguru mu Rwanda", "text": "Irishanwa ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru w'icyikiro cya kabili mu Rwanda ni ryo cyiciro cya kabiri cy\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru mu Rwanda, ryategurwa n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru mu Rwanda. \nAmakipe.\nShampiyona yo guhera muri 2024-25 y'icyiciro cya kabiri cy'u Rwanda igizwe n'amakipe makumyabiri n'atandatu, aho agabanyijemo amatsinda abiri, nimwe rigizwe n'amakipe 13."}
{"id": "21537", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21537", "title": "Thierry Manzi", "text": "Thierry Manzi (wavutse ku ya 12 Nyakanga 1996) Akaba afite uburebure bwa metero imwe na mirongwinani na gatanu(1,85m) n' umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'u Rwanda wabigize umwuga ukina nk'umwunganizi mwikipe ya Al Ahli Tripoli yo muri Libiya ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda. \nThierry Manzi Nyuma y'imyaka ibiri akinira ikipe ya APR FC aho yayigiyemo avuye muri Rayon Sports"}
{"id": "21538", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21538", "title": "Oumar Sidib\u00e9 (footballer, born 1990)", "text": "Oumar Sidib\u00e9 (wavutse 25 Werurwe 1990) n'umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru wa Mali ukina nk'umukinnyi wohagati mukibuga mwikipe ya Rayon Sports yomu Rwanda.\nUmwuga w'ikipe.\nSidib\u00e9 yatangiyumupira wemuri Mali mwikipe ya Real Bamako na Stade Malien. Yerekeje muri Sudan mwikipe ya Al-Hilal Club mu 2013. Mu 2016, yerekeje muri DR Congo mu ikipe ya AS Vita Club, hanyuma akomereza aho muri Turukiya mu ikipe ya Hatayspor. Ku ya 5 Kanama 2019, yerekeje mwikipe yomu Rwanda ya Rayon Sports. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nSidib\u00e9 yagaragaye arikumwe n'ikipe y'igihugu cya Mali mu mukino wagicuti batsinzemo Guin\u00e9e Equatorial 3-0 ku ya 24 Mata 2009. "}
{"id": "21539", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21539", "title": "Laudit Mavugo", "text": "Laudit Mavugo (wavutse kuya 10 Ukwakira 1993) yari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'Umurundi. Yarumwe mu bagize ikipe y'igihugu y'Uburundi.\n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo bigaragaza amanota y'Uburundi ku isonga.\" "}
{"id": "21540", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21540", "title": "Addax sc", "text": "Addax SC yahoze ari Rugende FC ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ibarizwa mu marushanwa y'icyiciro cya kabiri muri shampiyona itegurwa na Ferwafa, ikaba ari ikipe y'umushoramari Mvukiyehe Juvenal.\nAho ibarizwa.\nAddax sc ikinira ku kibuga cy'i Rugende i kabuga Juvenal yahoze ari umuyobozi wa Kiyovu sport."}
{"id": "21542", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21542", "title": "Motar FC", "text": "Motar FC ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru mu Rwanda,yashinzwe kandi inakinamo abakora umwuga wo gutwara abantu kuri za Moto, ibarizwa mu marushanwa y'icyiciro cya kabiri muri shampiyona itegurwa na Ferwafa Ni ikipe itozwa na Uwimana Abdul uzwi nka Gakara wahoze akina muri Rayon Sports. Perezida w\u2019ikipe ya Motar FC akaba ari Habiryayo Aloys Patrick.\nIndi kipe.\nMotar FC ifite ikipe ya Karate y\u2019abamotari yitwa WUSHU, ikorera kuri Club Rafiki, hari ikipe y\u2019abagore, ikindi ni hari ikipe izajya ikina imikino yo gusiganwa kuri Moto. bafite icyiciro cy\u2019abana bato, icyiciro cy\u2019abakanyujijeho ndetse n\u2019icyiciro cy\u2019abakinnyi bakina mu cyiciro cya gatatu cya shampiyona y\u2019 u Rwanda."}
{"id": "21543", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21543", "title": "City Boys FC", "text": "City Boys FC ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ibarizwa mu Rwanda ikaba ikina mu cyiciro cya kabiri cy'ashampiyona y'umupira wa maguru. Ikina igikombe cy'amahoro mu Rwanda yakinnye na Rayon sport. City Boys FC ikaba ari umuvandimwe wa Gorilla FC kuko zose zashizwe na Mudaheranwa Hagdi."}
{"id": "21544", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21544", "title": "Unity SC", "text": "Unity SC (Unity Sport Club) ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ibarizwa mu Rwanda. Unity ibarizwa mu cyiciro cya kabiri cyiciro cya kabiri cy'ashampiyona y'umupira wa maguru ategurwa na Ferwafa. Unity ikaba iyoborwa KNC, AKaba arinawe mu yobozi wa GAsogi United. "}
{"id": "21545", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21545", "title": "Miroplast FC", "text": "Miroplast FC ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ibarizwa mu Rwanda, yagaragaye mu Cyiciro cya Mbere cytwaga Azam Rwanda Premier League mu mwaka w'imikino wa 2017 kugeza 2018. ni ikipe ishingiye ku ruganda rwa Milonko. Miroplast FC ubwo yakina muri shampiyona y'icyiciro cy'ambere mu Rwanda ya tewe mpaga ndetse igatsirwa ibitego byoroshye.\nibikombe.\nMoroplast FC ikaba ifite igikombe ya rwaye cy'abatarengeje imwaka 18, mu irushanwa rya Sebamed Tournament muri 2015."}
{"id": "21546", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21546", "title": "Ejoheza FA", "text": "Ejoheza FC cyangwa Ejoheza football Academy (Ejoheza WFC/Academy) ni ikipe y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru y\u2019abagore ategurwa na FERWAFA, ndetse na marushanwa y'abatarengeje imyaka 17/20. ikinira Murenge wa bugarama mu Karere ka Rusizi. Ejo heza FA ibarizwa mu cyiciro cya kabiri cya shampiyona mu Rwanda. "}
{"id": "21548", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21548", "title": "Vision Jeunesse Nouvelle FC", "text": "Vision Jeunesse Nouvelle FC ni ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ibarizwa mu Rwanda ikaba ari ikina mu cyiciro cya kabiri cy'ashampiyona y'umupira wa maguru. Vision Jeunesse Nouvelle FC ikaba itegamiye kuri leta cyangwa ari umuryango udaharanira inyungu washinzwe mu mwaka wa 2002."}
{"id": "21550", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21550", "title": "Vision FC", "text": "Vision FC ni ikipe y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru ibarizwa mu Rwanda, yakinaga mu mu Cyiciro cya Mbere muri shampiyona ya 2024, yakirira amakipe mu rugo ku kibuga cya Mumena, mu muyi wa Kigali.\nAbakinnyi bayizamukiyemo.\nVision FC yakinnyemo abakinnyi batandukanye nka Karema Eric, Ishimwe Christian, Byiringiro Lague, Nizeyimana Djuma n'abandi"}
{"id": "21551", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21551", "title": "ASPOR FC", "text": "Aspor FC ni ikipe ikinira umukira w'amaguru ku kibuga cya Rugenda mu karere ka Gasabo, ikaba ibarizwa mu cyiciro cy'akabiri cya shampiyona yu Rwanda muri Ferwafa. ikaba ari ikipe ya kinnyemo abakinnyi nka Imanishimwe Emmanuel Mangwende."}
{"id": "21552", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21552", "title": "Esperance de Kigali", "text": "Esperance FC ni ikipe y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru ibarizwa mu Mujyi wa Kigali, ikinira ku kibuga cya Kimisagara ikina mu cyiciro cya kabiri cya shampiyona mu Rwanda muri Ferwafa. Esperance de Kigali ikaba ari kipe ikoresha siporo mu guteza imbere amahoro n'uburinganire."}
{"id": "21553", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21553", "title": "Sina Gerard FC", "text": "Sina Gerard FC ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ibarizwa mu Rwanda ikaba ikina mu cyiciro cya kabiri cy'ashampiyona y'umupira wa maguru mu Rwanda. \nAmakipe.\nSina Gerard FC ikaba ifite amakipe atandukanye, hari amakipe y'abagabo ndetse hakaba hari n'amakipe n'abagore.\nIbikombe.\nSina Gerard fc Ikaba yaratwaye igikombe cy'icyiciro cya Gatatu cy'amarushanwa y'umupira wa maguru mu Rwanda ndetse n'ibindi bihembo itsinze Motar FC."}
{"id": "21554", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21554", "title": "Sport in Rwanda", "text": "Siporo ifite uruhare runini mu Rwanda, cyane cyane murwego rw'abaturage, aho umupira w'amaguru ari ikintu gikunzwe cyane kandi abana bakinira muburyo butunguranye mu midugudu, mu mijyi no mu mashuri. Siporo kandi ishyigikiwe na Politiki ya leta yoguteza imbere siporo yomu Ukwakira 2012. Ibi bivuga ko siporo ifite inyungu nyinshi, harimo guhuza abantu, kunoza ishema ry'igihugu nbumwe, nokunoza ubuzima. Iyi politiki igaragaza imbogamizi mw'iterambere rya siporo mu gihugu, harimo ibikorwa remezo bike nubushobozi buke bw'amafaranga. Ishyiraho \"intego itera imbaraga\" ko, muri 2020, u Rwanda rugomba kugira \"ijanisha ryinshi ry'abaturage bakina siporo kurusha mu kindi gihugu icyo ari cyo cyose cya Afurika\" kandi rukaza mubihugu bitatu bya mbere bya Afurika mu mikino ya basketball, volleyball, gusiganwa kumagare, siporo n'imikino ya Paralempike, hamwe n'imikino icumi ya mbere mumupira w'amaguru. Igamije kandi \"guteza imbere ukwitabira cyane kw'abantu mumikino gakondo\". Dukurikije ubushakashatsi bwashyizwe ahagaragara nikigo cy'ubumenyi n'iterambere rya siporo cya Kaminuza ya Western Cape, siporo ikunzwe cyane mu Rwanda ni umupira w'amaguru, volleyball, basketball, siporo n'imikino ya Paralempike. \nIncamake.\nU Rwanda rwagaragaye bwambere mu mikino Olempike muwi 1984, ndetse rugaragara bwa mbere mu mikino Paralempike muri 2004. Iki gihugu cyohereje abakinnyi barindwi mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi ya 2012 yabereye i Londres, bayihagararira mumikino ngororamubiri, koga, gusiganwa ku magare yo mu misozi na judo, n'abandi 15 mu mikino Paralempike yo mu mpeshyi ya Londres kugira ngo bahatanire imikino ngororamubiri, guterura amashanyarazi na volleyball yo kwicara. U Rwanda rwitabiriye imikino ya Commonwealth ku nshuro yambere mu mikino ya 2010 yabereye i Delhi mu Buhinde, nyuma yokwinjira muri Commonwealth umwaka wabanjirije uwo. Abakinnyi 'u Rwanda bitabiriye imikino ngororamubiri, guterana iteramakofe, gusiganwa kumagare mumuhanda no koga. U Rwanda rwohereje abakinnyi mu mikino ya 2014 kugira ngo bahatanire imikino ngororamubiri, guterana iteramakofe, gusiganwa kumagare, koga no guterura ibiremereye. Ikipe yu Rwanda mu mikino y'urubyiruko ya Afurika ya 2014 yarifite umubare munini w'abakinnyi b'abagore (abakinnyi 29 muri 49 bose hamwe) kurusha abandi bakinnyi bose bitabiriye. \nUmupira w'amaguru.\nBasketball nimwe mumikino ikunzwe cyane mu Rwanda, ikaba ariya kabiri nyuma y\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru kandi ikaba ari yo mikino irebwa cyane mu gihugu. Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda ryabaye umunyamuryango wIshyirahamwe Mpuzamahanga rya Basketball kuva muwi 1977. Mbere yomuri 2000, ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya Basketball mu Rwanda ntiyari izwi cyane hanze yigihugu, ariko kuva hagati mumyaka ya 2000 yakomeje kumenyekana ku rubyiniro rwa Afurika. Ikipe y\u2019abagabo yamaze kwegukana itike yokugera mu cyiciro cyanyuma cya Shampiyona ya Basketball muri Afurika inshuro enye zikurikiranya kuva mu 2007. Igihugu cyasabye kwakira Shampiyona ya Basketball muri Afurika ya 2013, ariko uburenganzira bwo kwakira irushanwa bwahawe Ivory Coast. \nAfroBasket 2021 yahawe Kigali. Kubutaka bwiwabo, u Rwanda rwatsinze Angola, wegukanye ibihembo 10 bya AfroBasket hagati yi 1989 na 2013. Alex Mpoyo womu Rwanda yagize ati:\"Nibyiza kubona kakazi kacu ko guhagararira igihugu cyacu neza gashimwa cyane. Mu by'ukuri, sinabura gushimira bihagije abafana ibihumbi baje kudushyigikira, baririmba indirimbo zabo nimbyino zabo mumukino wose, ndetse nomu gihe twari inyuma. Inkunga yabo idashingiye kukiguzi yatubereye isoko ikomeye yinkunga.\" \nUmupira w'amaguru.\nIshyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru mu Rwanda riyoborwa n'Ishyirahamwe ry'Umupira w'Amaguru mu Rwanda (FERWAFA), ryashinzwe muwi 1972 ryemererwa kwinjira muri FIFA muwi 1978. FERWAFA kandi ifitanye isano nishyirahamwe ry'Umupira w'Amaguru muri Afurika (CAF) n'Inama y'Ishyirahamwe ry'Umupira w'Amaguru muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba n'iyo Hagati (CECAFA). Ikipe y'igihugu yayo ya mbere yakinnye igikombe cya Afurika mwirushanwa ryo mu 2004. Ikipe yambere yu Rwanda yatwaye igikombe cya CECAFA muwi 1999, ubwo igihugu cyakiraga iri rushanwa. Igikombe cya CECAFA cy'Amakipe kizwi nka Kagame Interclub Cup kuva muri 2002, ubwo Perezida w'u Rwanda Kagame yatangiraga gutera inkunga iri rushanwa. Ikipe y'igihugu ntiragera kurutonde rw'abahatanira igikombe cy'isi. Irushanwa rikomeye ryumupira w'amaguru mu Rwanda ni ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru mu Rwanda. \nVolleyball yo ku mucanga.\nU Rwanda rufite amakipe yigihugu ya Volleyball yoku mucanga yabagabo n'abagore. Muri Kamena 2021, umutoza mukuru wamakipe yombi yari Jean Paul Mana, wayoboye amahugurwa yabereye kumucanga wa Lake Kivu mu Karere ka Rubavu. \nMugikombe cyomuri 2018\u20132020 CAVB Beach Volleyball Continental Cup Rwanda yarihagarariwe namakipe abiri mugice cy\u2019abagore aribo Charlotte Nzayisenga na Valentine Munezero, ndetse na Benitha Mukandayisenga na Seraphine Mukantabana. Abakinnyi bigitsina gabo ni Olivier Ntagengwa, Patrick Kavalo Akumuntu, Venuste G amas na Fils Habanzintwari. \nCricket.\nCricket yavuzwe karumwe mumikino ikura vuba mu Rwanda. Uyu mukino watangiye gukundwa cyane mugihugu ubwo impunzi zagarukaga ziva muri Kenya, ahozari zarize gukina uyu mukino. Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wa Cricket mu Rwanda (RCA) ryashinzwe mu 1999 kandi ryemerwa n\u2019Inama Mpuzamahanga ya Cricket muri 2003. Iterambere ryuyu mukino mu gihugu ryatewe inkunga numuryango wabagiraneza ukorera mu Bwongereza witwa Cricket Without Boundaries, ugamije kunoza ubukangurambaga ku cyorezo cya SIDA binyuze mu mukino, ndetse n\u2019umuryango wa Marylebone Cricket Club Foundation. Uyumukino utera inkunga umushinga wo kubaka ikibuga cy\u2019igihugu cya Cricket mu nkengero za Kigali. Ubunyamuryango bw\u2019u Rwanda muri Commonwealth bwashimiwe kuba bwarafashije gukurura umukino wa Cricket mu gihugu, aho abagabo nabagore bawukina mubigo by\u2019imfubyi, amashuri, zakaminuza n\u2019amakipe ya Cricket. \nKugendera ku igare.\nGusiganwa ku magare byakunze gufatwa nk'uburyo bwogutwara abantu mu Rwanda, ariko mu minsi ishize habayeho iterambere mu mikino yo gusiganwa ku magare mu gihugu. Umukinnyi w'amagare yo mu misozi akaba numukinnyi w'amagare wo mu muhanda Adrien Niyonshuti yabaye Umunyarwanda wambere wasinye amasezerano y'umwuga nikipe mpuzamahanga y'amagare, yinjiye muri MTN Qhubeka mu 2009. Ikipe y'igihugu y'amagare, Team Rwanda, yashinzwe muri 2007 n'Abanyamerika Jock Boyer, wahoze ari umukinnyi wamagare w'umwuga, na Tom Ritchey, rwiyemezamirimo wamagare. Ikipe ya Rwanda yanditswe mugitabo, \"Land of Second Chances: The Impossible Rise of Rwanda's Cycling Team\" na filime, \"Rising from Ashes\". Irushanwa rya Tour of Rwanda ryabaye bwambere muwi 1988. Mbere ya 2009, ryitabiriwe cyane cyane n'abanyamagare bomu gihugu n'abaturutse mubihugu by'abaturanyi, ariko mu mpera za 2008 ryemejwe na Union Cycliste Internationale kandi kuva muri 2009 ryashyizwe mw' irushanwa rya UCI Africa Tour. \nShampiyona y'Isi ya UCI Road ryabereye murii Kigali muri Nzeri 2025.\nUruhare rwa siporo mu mibereho myiza.\nSiporo ifatwa nabamwe nk'uburyo bwo kugera kubwiyunge nyuma yamakimbirane mu Rwanda, kandi imiryango myinshi igira uruhare mugukoresha siporo muguteza imbere ubwiyunge. Politiki y'iterambere rya siporo y'igihugu irimo muntego zayo guteza imbere \"ikoreshwa rya siporo nk'inzira ikomeye y'iterambere no kubaka amahoro\", kandi guverinoma yiyemeje guteza imbere ikoreshwa rya siporo muzindi ntego zitandukanye z'iterambere, harimo n'uburezi. "}
{"id": "21555", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21555", "title": "Sadio Man\u00e9", "text": "Sadio Man\u00e9 (wavutse kwi 10 Mata 1992) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru wabigize umwuga womuri Senegali ukina nkumukinnyi wo ku ruhande rw'ibumoso mwikipe ya Al-Nassr yo muri Saudi Pro League n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Senegali. Afatwa cyane nkumwe mubakinnyi beza bomu gihecye ndetse n'umwe mubakinnyi bakomeye b'Abanyafurika bibihe byose. [a]\nMan\u00e9 yatangiye umwuga wemu ikipe ya Metz yo mu cyiciro cya kabiri mu mikino ya Ligue 2 afite imyaka 19, ariko yaje kuvamo nyuma yumwaka umwe ajya mwikipe ya Red Bull Salzburg yomuri Otirishiya muri 2012 kugiciro cya \u20ac4.\u00a0miliyoni, atsindira igikombe cya shampiyona n'igikombe cy'imbere mu gihugu mu mwaka w'imikino wa 2013-14. Nyuma yiyo mpeshyi, Man\u00e9 yerekeje mu ikipe yomu Bwongereza ya Southampton ku giciro cyanyuma cy'ikipe kingana na \u00a311.8.\u00a0miliyoni. Aho niho yashyizeho agahigo gashya ka Premier League ko gutsinda ibitego bitatu kunshuro ya mbere, yatsinze mumasegonda 176 ubwo batsindaga Aston Villa ibitego 6-1 muri 2015.\nMan\u00e9 yasinye amasezerano nikipe ya Liverpool muri 2016, ku giciro cya miliyoni 34 z'amapawundi, bimugira umukinnyi uhenze cyane muri Afurika mumateka icyogihe. Nyuma yo gukora abakinnyi batatu bakomeye bateye hamwe na Mohamed Salah na Roberto Firmino nyuma yokugenda kwa Philippe Coutinho, yafashije ikipe kugera kumikino yanyuma ya UEFA Champions League yikurikiranya muri 2018 na 2019, ayitsindira iyi ya nyuma. Yanarangije ari umukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi muri shampiyona ya 2018-19, atwara igikombe cya zahabu cya Premier League. Man\u00e9 yaje gufasha Liverpool kurangiza imyaka 30 yo guhatanira igikombe cya shampiyona yegukanye igikombe cya shampiyona cya 2019-20. MuUkwakira 2021, yatsinze igitego cye cya 100 cya Premier League, abumnyafurika wa gatatu ugeze kuruyu mwanya. Man\u00e9 yarangije ari uwa kane nuwa kabiri mwirushanwa rya Ballon d'Or rya 2019 na 2022 ; naho muri FIFA Men's Player mwiza cyane yageze ku mwanya wa gatanu mu 2019 n'uwa kane mu 2020.\nKurwego mpuzamahanga, Man\u00e9 amaze gutsinda ibitego 53 mu mikino 126 yakinnye muri Senegal kuva yatangira gukina muri 2012, kandi ubura mu bakinnyi batsinze ibitego byinshi mu gihugu cye, akaba n'uwa kabiri mu mikino yose. Yahagarariye Senegal mu mikino Olempike ya 2012, ndetse nomu mikino ya 2015, 2017, 2019, 2021, 2023 na 2025 y'igikombe cya Afurika. Mu irushanwa ryomuri 2019, Man\u00e9 yafashije Senegal kurangiza ariya kabiri, maze nyuma y'umwaka umwe, agirwa umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'umwaka muri Afurika. Ku mukino wa nyuma wa 2021, Man\u00e9 yatsinze igitego cy'intsinzi mugutera penaliti byatumye Senegal iba umukinnyi wa mbere w'igikombe cy' Afurika, ndetse anagirwa umukinnyi w'irushanwa. Muri 2022, yambitswe ikamba ry'umukinnyi w'umwaka muri Afurika kunshuro yakabiri. Man\u00e9 yanahagarariye igihugu cye mu gikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cya 2018, ubwo yakinnye bwakabiri muriri rushanwa. Nyuma Man\u00e9 yayoboye Senegali mu gikombe cyayo cyakabiri cya AFCON mu 2025, yongera kugirwa umukinnyi mwiza w'irushanwa.\nUbuzima bwa mbere.\nMan\u00e9 yavukiye mumuryango w\u2019aba Guineya i Bambali, S\u00e9dhiou, muri Senegali. Yakuriye mu muryango w\u2019abanyamadini. Yifuzaga umwuga mumupira wamaguru, arikose (wari imamu) yamubujije gukina uwomukino akiri umwana. Se yashakaga kashyira imbere amasomo ye yidini, icyakora, se yapfuye afite imyaka irindwi. Afite imyaka 15, yahunze umudugudu w\u2019iwabo abifashijwemo n\u2019inshuti ye yomu bwana, Luc Djiboune, ajya i Dakar gukurikirana intego yeyo kuba umukinnyi w\u2019umupira wamaguru; kuvicyogihe yashyigikiwe numuryango wekugira ngagere ku bushobozi bwe. \nUmwuga w'ikipe.\nUmwuga wa mbere.\nMuri 2009, ubwo yakinaga muri M'Bour, yabonwe nabashinzwe umutekano maze nyuma yerekeza kuri G\u00e9n\u00e9ration Foot, ikipe yafashije kuzamuka mucyiciro cyakabiri mumwaka wa 2010-11. \nMetz.\nMuri 2011, Man\u00e9 yinjiye muri Metz yagiranye ubufatanye na G\u00e9n\u00e9ration Foot. Yakinnye umukino wewa mbere kuri 14 Mutarama 2012, aza gusimbura K\u00e9vin Diaz kumunota wa 75 mu mukino batsinzwe na Bastia murugo 0-1 muri Ligue 2. Yakinnye imikino 19 mu mwaka we wa mbere wa shampiyona, 12 arumukinnyi ubanza, anatsinda igitego kimwe mumukino batsinzwe na Guingamp 2-5 kuri Stade Saint-Symphorien kuri 4 Gicurasi. Metz yamanuwe muri Championnat National mu mpera z'uyu mwaka wa shampiyona.\nRed Bull Salzburg.\nMetz yashyizeho igiciro cyifuzwa cya \u20ac2\u00a0miliyoni kuri Man\u00e9, kandi yakuruye abantu benshi, harimo numuyobozi wa siporo wa Red Bull Salzburg yo muri Otirishiya, Ralf Rangnick. Nyuma yo guhabwa poromosiyo nyinshi mumpeshyi, Metz yongereye igiciro cyayo cyogusaba kigera kuri \u20ac4.\u00a0miliyoni, maze yimukira i Salzburg kuri 31 Kanama 2012, amafaranga yagatatu menshi Metz yari yarahawe yokugura abakinnyi. \nYatsinze ibitego bitatu (hat-trick) byebya mbere mwikipe kuri 31 Ukwakira, ubwo batsindaga SC Kalsdorf ibitego 3-1 mumukino wagatatu w'igikombe cya Austrian Cup. \nKuri 27 Ukwakira 2013, yatsinze igitego cyecya mbere cya hat-trick muri Bundesliga yomuri Otirishiya, ubwo batsindaga Gr\u00f6dig ibitego 3-0 mu kibuga. Yatsinze ikindi gitego cyagatatu ku ya 7 Gicurasi 2014 ubwo Salzburg yatsindaga Horn ibitego 7-0 mumikino yakimwe cya kabiri cy'igikombe; shampiyona yarangiye ikipeye itsinze ibitego bibiri byomu gihugu. Mumpera za Kanama 2014, Man\u00e9 yatumye avamuri iyi kipe, ataje mumyitozo ndetse nomu mukino ukomeye cyane kuri Salzburg icyogihe kugira ngoyegukane igikombe cya Champions League. \nSouthampton.\nIgihembwe cya 2014\u201315.\nKw' itariki ya 1 Nzeri 2014, Man\u00e9 yerekeje mw' ikipe ya Southampton yo mu cyiciro cya mbere ku giciro cya \u00a311.8.\u00a0miliyoni, asinya amasezerano y'imyaka ine. Yakinnye umukino wewa mbere nyuma y'iminsi 22 mumukino batsinze Arsenal 2-1 mu gikombe cya League, atsinda igitego cya mbere cya Southampton. Yakinnye umukino wewa mbere muri shampiyona mumukino wongeye gutsinda Queens Park Rangers 2-1 ku ya 27 Nzeri, atangira anafasha Ryan Bertrand gutsinda igitego cya mbere mu mukino. Yatsinze igitego cyecya mbere muriyi kipe mumukino batsinze Sunderland 8-0 kuri 18 Ukwakira, nubwo iki gitego cyaje kwitwa igitego cya Patrick van Aanholt. Ariko, yatsinze igitego cyecya mbere mumukino wewakurikiyeho, batsinze Stoke City 1-0 nyuma y'icyumweru kimwe. \nMu Ukuboza na Mutarama yatsinze ibitego mumikino itatu yikurikiranya, ubwo yakinaga na Crystal Palace, Chelsea na Arsenal. Man\u00e9 yatsinze ibitego bibiri mu mpera z'ikiruhuko mu mukino wa shampiyona wa Queens Park Rangers yatsinzemo 1-0 ku ya 7 Gashyantare 2015 ndetse nomu rugo yatsinzemo Crystal Palace kuya 3 Werurwe. Ariko, Man\u00e9 yari yakuwe mu bakinnyi bambere ba Southampton ubwo batsindwaga na Liverpool 0-2 murugo kuri 22 Gashyantare nk'igihano cyogutinda kugera kukibuga. \nKw' itariki ya 16 Gicurasi, ubwo Southampton yakinaga umukino wanyuma murugo muruyu mwaka w'imikino, Man\u00e9 yatsinze ibitego bitatu muminota 2 n'amasegonda 56 mumukino batsinzemo Aston Villa ibitego 6-1, bituma ashyiraho agahigo gashya muri Premier League ko gutsinda ibitego bitatu byihuse cyane. Aka gahigo kari gafitwe kuva muwi 1994 na Robbie Fowler, watsinze ibitego bitatu kuri Arsenal muminota 4 n'amasegonda 33. Man\u00e9 yarangije shampiyona afite ibitego 10 mumikino 32 yakinnye mu marushanwa yose.\nIgihembwe cya 2015\u201316.\nMan\u00e9 yatangiye umwaka w'imikino wa 2015-16 atsinda ibitego bibiri byatanze imipira mumukino wa gatatu wa UEFA Europa League, Vitesse Arnhem ari mu rugo, anatsinda igitego mu mukino wokwishyura, ubwo Southampton yageraga mucyiciro gikurikiraho ibitego 5-0. Kuya 2 Ukuboza, byamutwaye amasegonda 39 kugira ngafungure igitego ubwoyakinaga na Liverpool muri kimwe cyakane cyirushanwa rya League Cup, ariko Saints yaje gutsindwa ibitego 6-1 mu rugo. \nKuya 2 Mutarama 2016, yongeye gukurwa mubakinnyi babanzamo numutoza Ronald Koeman kumukino wabereye muri Norwich City ubwo yazaga akererewe munama mbere yumukino. Yahawe ikarita itukura kuri 12 Werurwe ubwo batsindaga Stoke City ibitego 2-1 kubera kugongana na Erik Pieters, nubwo ibibyahise bivanwaho mubujurire. \nNyuma yo kudatsinda igitego muri shampiyona mugihe cy'amezi arenga ane, Man\u00e9 yatsinze ibitego bibiri mu ntsinzi ya Liverpool kubitego 3-2 ku ya 20 Werurwe 2016, akurikizaho ibitego bitanu mumikino itanu yakurikiyeho, harimo nigitego cya gatatu muntsinzi ya Manchester City ku bitego 4-2 kuya 1 Gicurasi. Yarangije shampiyona ari umukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi muri Southampton, afite ibitego 15 mumikino yose. [\"Icyitonderwa kirakenewe\"]\nLiverpool.\nIgihembwe cya 2016\u201317.\nKw'itariki ya 28 Kamena 2016, Man\u00e9 yinjiye muri Liverpool kugiciro cya \u00a334\u00a0miliyoni (zishobora kwiyongera zikagera kuri 36\u00a3\u00a0miliyoni) kumasezerano yimyaka itanu. Amafaranga yokugura abakinnyi yamugize umukinnyi uhenze cyane muri Afurika mumateka icyo gihe. Kuri 14 Kanama, yakinnye umukino we wambere muri Premier League mw'ikipe ya Reds, atsinda igitego cya kane mumukino batsinzemo Arsenal 4-3 hanze. Nyuma yogutsindwa na Liverpool na Burnley kubera imvune yoroheje ku rutugu, Man\u00e9 yagarutse mubakinnyi bambere bakinnye na Burton Albion mu gikombe cya League Cup ahoyatsinzemo ibitego bibiri mumukino batsinzemo ibitego 5-0. \nKw' itariki 19 Ukuboza, Man\u00e9 yatsinze igitego kimwe rukumbi muri Merseyside derby ya 227 mu minota y'inyongera bakina na Everton kuri Goodison Park. Kw' itariki 11 Gashyantare 2017, Man\u00e9 yatsinze ibitego bibiri mu minota ibiri bakina na Tottenham Hotspur i Anfield, ibi bikaba byaratumye Liverpool itsinda shampiyona ya mbere muri 2017. Kwi'tariki 20 Mata 2017, Man\u00e9 yatoranyijwe mu ikipe y'umwaka ya PFA nyuma yo gutsinda ibitego 13 muri shampiyona ye yambere muri Liverpool. Nubwo yatakaje igice cyanyuma cy'imikino kubera imvune, Man\u00e9 yahawe igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'umwaka wa Liverpool ku ya 9 Gicurasi 2017. \nIgihembwe cya 2017\u201318.\nMu mukino wambere w'umwaka mushya, kuri 12 Kanama 2017, mukibuga cy'i Watford, Man\u00e9 yatsinze igitego cya mbere cya Liverpool muri uyumwaka mumukino banganyije 3-3. Yagizwe umukinnyi w'ukwezi muri Premier League nyuma yogutsinda igitego kimwe muriburi mukino itatu ikipe ya Reds yakinnye muri Kanama. Kuya 9 Nzeri 2017, yahawe ikarita itukura mugice cya mbere cy'umukino batsinzwemo na Manchester City ibitego 5-0 kubera umupira mwinshi bakinanye na Ederson, bituma ahagarikwa imikino itatu. Man\u00e9, Mohamed Salah, Roberto Firmino na Philippe Coutinho bagize itsinda ry'abakinnyi bateye cyane bise \"Fab Four\" na \"Fab Three\" nyuma yokuva mumwaka w'imikino hagati. \nKuri 14 Gashyantare 2018, Man\u00e9 yatsinze ibitego bitatu byambere mwikipe ya Liverpool ubwo yatsindaga Porto ibitego 5-0 mu mukino wa mberewa UEFA Champions League wo mu mwaka wa 2017-18. Mukubikora, yabaye umukinnyi wa kabiri gusa utsinze ibitego bitatu bya gatatu mw'ikipe y'i Burayi. Nyuma, atsinze igitego mu mukino batsinzemo AFC Bournemouth ibitego 3-0 ku ya 14 Mata, yarenze agahigo ka Demba Ba kogutsinda ibitego 43, aba umunyasenegali watsinze ibitego byinshi mumateka ya Premier League. \nKw' itariki ya 26 Gicurasi, ubwo bakinaga umukino wa nyuma wa UEFA Champions League na Real Madrid mu 2018, Man\u00e9 yatsinze igitego cya Liverpool cyokunganya ubwo batsindwaga ibitego 3-1. Mukubikora, yabaye umukinnyi wambere wa Senegali utsinze igitego kumukino wa nyuma w'irushanwa. Igitego cye cyari icya 10 muri uyu mwaka w'imikino, aho Liverpool yabaye ikipe ya mbere mumateka ifite abakinnyi batatu batsinze ibitego 10+ mumwaka umwe w'imikino wa Champions League, aho Man\u00e9 yageze kuntambwe ishimishije arikumwe na bagenzi be ba rutahizamu Salah na Firmino. \nIgihembwe cya 2018\u201319.\nKuri 22 Ugushyingo 2018, Man\u00e9 yasinye amasezerano mashya y'igihe kirekire na Liverpool. Ku ya 10 Werurwe 2019, Man\u00e9 yatsinze ibitego bibiri mumukino batsinzemo Burnley ibitego 4-2, icya kabiri kikaba cyari igitego cyecya 50 mwirushanwa muri Liverpool. Ibitego bye byamugize umukinnyi wa gatanu wa Liverpool utsinze ibitego mumikino itandatu yikurikiranya ya Premier League nyuma ya Michael Owen, Fernando Torres, Luis Su\u00e1rez na Salah. Nyuma y'iminsi itatu, yatsinze ibitego bibiri mumukino batsinzemo Bayern Munich ibitego 3-1 kugira ngo afashe Liverpool kugera muri kimwe cyakane cya Champions League. Mukubikora, yabaye umukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi hanze y'urugo mu irushanwa afite ibitego birindwi. Mu mukino wakurikiyeho wa Liverpool, yatsinze indi rekodi ya Ba, aba umukinnyi wa Senegali watsinze ibitego byinshi mu mwaka umwe w'imikino ya Premier League, nyuma yo gutsinda igitego cye cya 17 mumwaka w'imikino ubwo batsindaga Fulham ibitego 2-1. Kw' itariki ya 20 Mata, yari umwe mubakinnyi batandatu batoranyijwe mubahatanira igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'umwaka wa PFA ari kumwe na mugenzi we Virgil van Dijk. Yanatoranyijwe mu ikipe y'umwaka ya PFA arikumwe na bagenzi beba Liverpool, Trent Alexander-Arnold, Andrew Robertson na Van Dijk. \nKumunsi wa nyuma w'imikino yomu gihugu, Man\u00e9 yatsinze ibitego bibiri mumukino batsinze Wolverhampton Wanderers ibitego 2-0. Ibitego bibiri yatsinze byatumye atsinda ibitego 22 muri uyumwaka, bituma asangira igihembo cya Golden Boot na Salah na Pierre-Emerick Aubameyang wa Arsenal. Kuya 1 Kamena, Man\u00e9 yafashije Liverpool gutsinda penaliti hakiri kare ku mukino wa nyuma wa UEFA Champions League 2019 ubwo bakinaga na Tottenham, nyuma y'amasegonda 24 gusa umukino utangiye, nyuma y'uko umupira wewakubiswe ukuboko kwa Moussa Sissoko mugice cy'amahina; Salah yaje gukubita umupira awukuramo maze atangira gutsinda, maze Liverpool itsinda ibitego 2-0 maze yegukana igikombe. \nIgihembwe cya 2019\u201320.\nKw' itariki 14 Kanama 2019, Man\u00e9 yatsinze ibitego bibiri ku mukino wanyuma wa UEFA Super Cup 2019 bakinnye na Chelsea mumukino Liverpool yatsinzemo ibitego 5-4 kuri penaliti nyuma yuko umukino urangiye ari 2-2 nyuma y\u2019iminota 120. Man\u00e9 yagizwe umukinnyi w\u2019umukinnyi mwiza kurusha abandi. Nyuma y\u2019ukwezi kumwe gusa, yatsinze ibitego bibiri mumukino batsinzemo Newcastle United ibitego 3-1 ndetse yongera imikino 50 yakinnye Liverpool i Anfield, umukinnyi uwo ari wewese ukina kuri sitade runaka. Kunshuro yeya 100 akina muri Premier League akinira Liverpool ku ya 5 Ukwakira, Man\u00e9 yatsinze igitego cyecya 50 muri shampiyona muriyi kipe ubwo batsindaga Leicester City ibitego 2-1. \nKw' itariki ya 21 Ukwakira, Man\u00e9 yashyizwe kurutonde rw'abakinnyi 30 bazahatanira Ballon d'Or ya 2019. Kw' itariki ya 2 Ukuboza yarangije ari kumwanya wakanemu guhatanira igihembo, inyuma ya Lionel Messi, mugenzi we Virgil van Dijk wa Liverpool na Cristiano Ronaldo. Nyuma y'iminsi ibiri, yatsinze igitego kimwe anatanga izindi gitego ebyiri ubwo Liverpool yatsindaga Everton 5-2 muri Merseyside derby, bituma bongera imikino yabo 32 mumupira w'amaguru utaratsindwa, waragahigo gashya k'ikipe. Nyuma muriko kwezi, Liverpool yegukanye igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA Club cya 2019, Man\u00e9 ashyiraho igitego cyatsinzwe na Firmino ku mukino wa nyuma bakinnye na Flamengo. \nKw'itariki ya 7 Mutarama 2020, Man\u00e9 yatorewe kuba umukinnyi w\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru w\u2019umwaka muri Afurika muri CAF. Numunyasenegali wakabiri gusa (nyuma ya El Hadji Diouf) wegukanye ikigihembo. \nKuri 24 Gashyantare, Man\u00e9 yatsinze igitego cy'intsinzi mumukino bakinnye na West Ham United ku bitego 3-2 mukibuga cya Premier League ubwo Liverpool yatsindaga imikino 21 mukibuga cyayo yikurikiranya, agahigo kashampiyona gasangiwe n'ikipe ya Liverpool ya Bill Shankly kuva muwi 1972, ndetse anagatsinda imikino 18 yikurikiranya mukibuga cya Premier League. Ku ya 7 Werurwe, Man\u00e9 yatsinze igitego cy'intsinzi mumukino bakinnye na Bournemouth ku bitego 2-1 i Anfield ubwo Liverpool yashyiragaho agahigo gashya mu Bwongereza ko gutsinda imikino 22 yikurikiranya mukibuga cyayo. Liverpool yakomeje gutwara igikombe cya Premier League mumpera z'umwaka w'imikino. \nIgihembwe cya 2020\u201321.\nKuri 20 Nzeri 2020, Man\u00e9 yafunguye amanota yemuri Premier League ya 2020-21, atsinda ibitego byombi Liverpool yatsinze Chelsea ibitego 2-0. Kuya 2 Ukwakira 2020, Man\u00e9 yagaragaye ko arwaye COVID-19. Bitewe nuko we na Liverpool bari bameze nabi, Man\u00e9 yavuze ko 2020-21 ari wo mwaka mubi cyane mumwuga we. Ku ya 23 Gicurasi 2021, umunsi wanyuma wa shampiyona ya shampiyona, Man\u00e9 yatsinze ibitego bibiri ubwo yatsindaga Crystal Palace ibitego 2-0, bituma Liverpool ibiya gatatu ndetse ikanatwara igikombe cya Champions League. \nIgihembwe cya 2021\u201322.\nKuri 18 Nzeri 2021, Man\u00e9 yatsinze igitego cyecya 100 cya Liverpool mumukino batsinzemo Crystal Palace mu rugo 3-0 muri Premier League. Igitego batsinzemo Crystal Palace cyanatumye Man\u00e9 ashyiraho agahigo gashya ka Premier League aba umukinnyi wambere utsinze igitego mumikino icyenda yikurikiranya ya shampiyona bakina n'uwo bahanganye. Kuri 16 Ukwakira, Man\u00e9 yatsinze igitego cye cya 100 cya Premier League \u2014 aba umunyafurika wa gatatu ugeze ku kimenyetso nyuma ya Didier Drogba na Salah \u2014 igitego cya mbere cya Liverpool mu mukino batsinzemo Watford 5-0. Kuya 10 Mata 2022, isabukuru yey'imyaka 30, Man\u00e9 yatsinze igitego cya Liverpool cyo kunganya mumukino banganyamo 2-2 na Manchester City. Man\u00e9 yakurikiyeho ibi atsinda ibitego bibiri kuri 16 Mata kuri sitade ya Wembley muri kimwe cya kabiri cya FA Cup, mumukino batsinzemo ibitego 3-2 byafashije Liverpool kugera kumukino wa nyuma wa FA Cup kuva muri 2012, amaherezo batsinze. Kuya 3 Gicurasi, yatsinze igitego cy\u2019intsinzi mumukino batsinzemo Villarreal ibitego 3-2 hanze muri kimwe cyakabiri cya Champions League, bituma ikipe ye ikomeza gukina umukino wa nyuma, Liverpool yaje gutsindwa na Real Madrid igitego 1-0. Liverpool yabuze amahirwe yokugera kunshuro enye z\u2019amateka, iba iyakabiri muri Premier League nomuri UEFA Champions League ya 2021-22 ariko itwara igikombe cya EFL na FA Cup. \nBayern Munich.\nKuri 22 Kamena 2022, Man\u00e9 yinjiye mwikipe ya Bundesliga Bayern Munich kumasezerano n'ikipe y'Ubudage kugeza kuri 30 Kamena 2025. Byatangajwe ko amafaranga yari afite ari miliyoni 32 z'amayero (miliyoni 27.4 z'amayero) ashobora kwiyongera akagera kuri miliyoni 41 z'amayero (miliyoni 35 z'amayero) bitewe n'uko yakinnye ndetse n'ibyo yagezeho kugiti cye nomu ikipe. Kuri 30 Nyakanga 2022, Man\u00e9 yatangiye gukina umukino wewa mbere kumugaragaro, atangira muri DFL-Supercup ya 2022 maze atsinda igitego cyecya mbere afasha Bayern gutsinda RB Leipzig ibitego 5-3 kuri Red Bull Arena. Ibi yakurikiyeho nyuma y'icyumweru kimwe atsinda igitego cyecya mbere cya Bundesliga ubwo batsindaga Eintracht Frankfurt ibitego 6-1. \nKw' itariki 8 Ugushyingo, Man\u00e9 yagize imvune maze biba ngombwa kava mukibuga nyuma y'iminota 20 Bayern itsinze Werder Bremen ibitego 6-1. Iyimvune yamubujije kwitabira igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cya 2022, biba ngombwa kabagwa mu ijosi rye ry'iburyo. Yamaze amezi atatu adakina, agaruka kw' itariki ya 26 Gashyantare 2023 nk'umusimbura, aza gukina ku munota wa 65 asimbura Kingsley Coman ubwo Bayern yatsindaga Union Berlin ibitego 3-0. \nKuri 13 Mata, Man\u00e9 yahagaritswe ndetse anacibwa amande na Bayern, nyuma y'amakuru yavugaga ko yakubise mugenzi we Leroy San\u00e9 mucyumba cy'uruganiriro nyuma yogutsindwa na Manchester City mugice cyakane cya Champions League ibitego 3-0. Kuri 28 Gicurasi, Bayern Munich yatwaye igikombe cya Bundesliga nyuma yoguhabwa amanota abiri nikipe ya mbere ya shampiyona Borussia Dortmund. \"\"\nAl-Nassr.\nKuya 1 Kanama 2023, ikipe ya Al Nassr yo muri Saudi Pro League yatangaje ko yasinyishije Man\u00e9. Man\u00e9 yaje gutangaza ko abahoze bakinana muri Liverpool, Fabinho na Roberto Firmino, bari barigeze kuvugana nawe kugira ngo bamubwire kashobora kujya mumakipe yabo, Al-Ittihad na Al-Ahli muri Arabiya Sawudite. Man\u00e9 yavuze kandi kuwahoze ari kapiteni we, Jordan Henderson, yari yamwoherereje ubutumwa bwiza ubwo yajyaga muri Arabiya Sawudite. Nyuma y'iminsi ibiri, yakinnye umukino wewa mbere asimbuye Abdulaziz Al-Aliwa mu gice cya mbere cy'umukino banganya na Zamalek 1-1 mu gikombe cya Arab Club Champions Cup cya 2023. Yatsinze igitego cyecya mbere muriyi kipe kuya 14 Kanama ubwo batsindwaga na Al-Ettifaq 2-1 muri shampiyona. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\n2012\u20132017.\nMan\u00e9 yari mu ikipe ya Senegal mu irushanwa Olempike ryo mu 2012, kandi yatangiye buri mukino ubwo banyuraga mu itsinda rya A nk'aba kabiri imbere y'Ubwongereza mbere yogutsindwa ibitego 4-2 nyuma y'iminota y'inyongera muri kimwe cyakane cyanyuma na Mexico yaje kuba umukinnyi wambere.\nMan\u00e9 yakuwe mu ikipe ya Senegali yitabiriye Igikombe cya Afurika cya 2015 nyuma y'imvune yagize mumukino ikipe ya Southampton yatsinzemo Arsenal ibitego 2-0 kuya 1 Mutarama 2015. Nyuma yaje kugaruka mwikipe, maze atangira imikino ibiri yanyuma mumatsinda bakina na Afurika y'Epfo na Algeria mu mukino basohowe mu matsinda. \n2017\u20132019.\nMan\u00e9 yahagarariye Senegal mu gikombe cya Afurika cya 2017 cyabereye muri Gabon, anatsinda igitego mumikino ibiri yambere y'igihugu, atsinda Tunisia na Zimbabwe ibitego 2-0. Nyuma yo kunganya igitego kubusa mumukino wakimwe cya kane cyanyuma na Kameruni, yahushije penaliti mu mukino wahuje Senegal n'ikipe ye, aho Senegal yasezerewe mwirushanwa. \nMuri Gicurasi 2018, Man\u00e9 yashyizwe mwikipe ya Senegal yabakinnyi 23 bazitabira Igikombe cy\u2019Isi cya FIFA cya 2018 mu Burusiya. Yatsinze igitego cyambere mumukino banganya n\u2019Ubuyapani 2-2 mu cyiciro cy\u2019amatsinda. Man\u00e9 yatangiye imikino yose itatu ya Senegal mu matsinda ubwo yasezererwaga nyuma yicyiciro cyambere, arangiza arimunsi y\u2019Ubuyapani ku manota y\u2019umukino utaberanye. \nMan\u00e9 yongeye guhamagarwa mwikipe yanyuma ya Senegali izakina igikombe cya Afurika cya 2019. Yatsinze ibitego bibiri anahusha penaliti mumukino batsinzemo Kenya ibitego 3-0, ubwo Senegali yarangizaga kumwanya wakabiri mu matsinda ikanagera ku cyiciro cya 16. Man\u00e9 yatsinze igitego kimwe rukumbi mumukino anahusha ikindi gitego mumukino Senegali yatsinzemo Uganda igitego 1-0 mucyiciro cya 16. Yakinnye imikino itatu yakurikiyeho ya Senegali ubwo yageraga ku mukino wa nyuma, itsindwa na Algeria igitego 1-0 mumukino wo kwisubiramo wa Senegali wambere w'irushanwa. Nubwo yarangije irushanwa aruwa kabiri, Man\u00e9 yashyizwe mu ikipe y'irushanwa. \n2021\u2013ubu.\nMu gikombe cya Afurika cya 2021, Man\u00e9 yakinnye muri Senegal ubwo yatsindaga irushanwa ku nshuro yambere. Mu mukino wa nyuma yakinnye na Misiri - umukino wamuhuje namugenzi wewa Liverpool Mohamed Salah - Man\u00e9 yabonye penaliti yigabanuka kumunota wa 7, ariko akomeza gutsinda igitego cyatsinze mugutera penaliti. Uretse gutsinda igitego cyambere cyatsinzwe kugira ngo yegukane igikombe, Man\u00e9 yatsinze ibitego bitatu anatanga imipira ibiri mbere y'umukino wanyuma, ndetse atorwa nk'umukinnyi w'irushanwa. Mu cyiciro cya gatatu cy'imikino yo gushaka itike yo gukina igikombe cy'isi cya 2022, yanatsinze igitego cyatsinze mu gutera penaliti ubwo bakinaga na Misiri nyuma yokunganya igitego 1-1 ku mukino wose, kugira ngo igihugu cyekijye mu gikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cya 2022. \nKwitariki ya 4 Kamena 2022, Man\u00e9 yatsinze ibitego bitatu mumukino batsinzemo Benin ibitego 3-1 mu mikino yo guhatanira itike yo kujya mu gikombe cya Afurika cya 2023, maze abumukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi muri Senegal n'ibitego 32, arusha Henri Camara. \nKw' itariki 11 Ugushyingo 2022, Man\u00e9 yashyizwe mw' ikipe y\u2019abakinnyi 26 ba Senegal bazitabira igikombe cy\u2019isi cya FIFA cyabereye muri Qatar muri 2022, nubwo yagize imvune ubwo Bayern Munich yatsindaga Werder Bremen ibitego 6-1 muminsi mike mbere yaho. Ariko, kw'itariki 17 Ugushyingo, Man\u00e9 yakuwe mw' irushanwa maze ava mw' ikipe. \nMan\u00e9 yakinnye umukino we wa 100 muri Senegal kuri 18 Ugushyingo muri 2023, atsinda ibitego bibiri mumukino wo guhatanira itike yo gukina igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cya 2026 ubwo bakinaga na Sudani y'Epfo. \nMu Ukuboza 2023, Man\u00e9 yashyizwe mw' ikipe ya Senegali yitabiriye imikino y\u2019igikombe cya Afurika cya 2023 yabereye muri Ivory Coast. Yasoje imikino y\u2019amatsinda afite igitego kimwe kuri Kameruni ndetse anatanga imipira ivuyemo ibitego kuri Gambia na Guin\u00e9e. Hanyuma yakinnye iminota 120 yose kuri Ivory Coast mucyiciro cya 16, afasha Habib Diallo gutsinda igitego cya Senegali. Nyuma y\u2019uko umukino urangiye banganya 1-1 nyuma y\u2019iminota yinyongera, Senegali yakuwemo nabakiriye imikino ndetse nabayitsinze mugutera penaliti. \nKw' itariki 14 Ukwakira 2025, Man\u00e9 yatsinze ibitego bibiri mumukino batsinze Mauritania ibitego 4-0, bituma Senegali yemererwa kujyamu gikombe cy'isi cya 2026. Nyuma yuwo mwaka, yahamagawe mu gikombe cya Afurika cya 2025. \nKuri 14 Mutarama 2026, igitego cya Man\u00e9 cyatsinze Misiri 1-0 muri kimwe cyakabiri mu gikombe cya Afurika. Kuri 18 Mutarama, Senegali yabashije gutsinda igihugu cyakira Maroc 1-0 nyuma y'iminota y'inyongera ku mukino wa nyuma, Man\u00e9 atwara igikombe nkumukapiteni w'igihugu cye ndetse anahabwa igihembo cy'umukinnyi mwiza mw' irushanwa. \nUmwirondoro w'umukinnyi.\nFabinho wahoze akinira Liverpool yasobanuye Man\u00e9 nk'umukinnyi wuzuye ukina \"afite imbaraga nyinshi kandi yitonze\". Jamie Carragher wahoze ari myugariro wa Liverpool yise Man\u00e9 \"umukinnyi woku ruhande rwisi\", amugereranya numukinnyi nka John Barnes wahoze akinira Liverpool. Yanagereranyijwe na Cristiano Ronaldo nuwahoze ari myugariro wa Ajax Danny Blind, wamushimiye ubuhanga bwebwo gutsinda ibitego akoresheje amaguru nimitwe, hamwe no gukora \"imipira itangaje\". \nMan\u00e9, umukinnyi ukina imbere mukibuga ufite ubushobozi bwo gutsinda ibitego byinshi, akaba afite umwihariko wokurangiza neza, kwihuta, ubuhanga, namayeri mugutwara ibitego, ndetse no gufata ibyemezo, kumenya gukoresha ubuhanga bwemu mikinire, guhanga udushya, ubuhanga, kuringaniza, kugenzura, gukora kumupira, nogukoresha imbaraga ze mu gukubita umupira. [Yanashimiwe mw' itangazamakuru kubera ubuhanga bwemu gukina, gutanga imipira, nokumenya kugera ku myanya myiza, ahashobora gutsinda ibitego cyangwa guha amahirwe bagenzi be. Azwiho kubumuntu utuje kandi ugira ubwoba, ubushobozi bwebwo guhangana n'igitutu nabwo bwagaragajwe nk'imwe mumbaraga ze zikomeye. Uretse ubuhanga bwebwo gusatira, tekiniki, noguhanga, abakinnyi bebakomeye mukazi ko kwirwanaho nabo bagaragaje ubuhanga bwe mumikinire, ndetse n'ubushobozi bwe mukirere, nubwo afite amanota. Man\u00e9 ubusanzwe akina nk'umukinnyi woku ruhande rw'ibumoso, umwanya umwemerera gukata hagati nogutera izamu akoresheje ikirenge cye cy'iburyo gikomeye. Mu gihembwe cya 2021-22, ubwo yasinyishaga Luis D\u00edaz, Man\u00e9 yatangiye gukina cyane nkarutahizamu woagati kandi atera imbere muruwo mwanya. Mu 2022, Kyle Walker yavuze ko Man\u00e9 arumwe mu bakinnyi bakomeye cyane yigeze guhura nabo mumwuga we. \nUmuryango n'ubugiraneza.\nMuri 2019, Man\u00e9 yatanze \u00a3250.000 ($ 319,103 ; \u20ac 284,813) yokubaka ishuri mumujyi akomokamo wa Bambali, muri Senegali. Muri Werurwe 2020, Man\u00e9 yatanze \u00a341.000 ($ 52,564 ; \u20ac 46,083) kurikomite y'igihugu irwanya COVID-19 muri Senegali. Muri 2021, yatanze \u00a3500.000 ($ 684,932 ; \u20ac 561,987) mu kubaka ibitaro i Bambali. Byongeye kandi, yanatanze inkunga yokubaka sitasiyo ya lisansi n'ibiro by'iposita ku baturage bomu gace atuyemo, ahishuri mudasobwa zigendanwa na interineti kubuntu bivuye kuri serivisi ya interineti ya 4G yateye inkunga mu mudugudu. Muri rusange, yakoresheje arenga \u00a3700.000 ($ 958,904 ; \u20ac 786,782) muri izi nyubako. Byongeye kandi, yategetse buri muryango mugace atuyemo kagizwe n'abantu 2.000 guhabwa amafaranga y'inyongera kukwezi. Aya mafaranga angana n'umushahara w'ukwezi kumuturage wa Senegali ku mushahara muto. \nMan\u00e9 kandi ni intumwa ya Right To Play, umuryango mpuzamahanga udaharanira inyungu ufite intego yokongerera ubushobozi abana batishoboye. Yakoranye nuyu muryango udaharanira inyungu mugutanga uburinganire nokongerera ubushobozi abakobwa nabagore bato muri Senegali, \"akamaro ko kumenya akamaro k'abakobwa n'abahungu ko kubona amahirwe yo gukina no kwiga\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nUbwo yari muri Liverpool, Man\u00e9 yari atuye i Allerton, muri Liverpool, kandi yibwe inshuro ebyiri, rimwe mugushyingo 2017 naryo muri Gashyantare 2019. Ni umuyisilamu ukora akazi kandi rimwe narimwe agaragara akora du'a mbere yuko burimukino utangira. \nYagizwe Umuyobozi Mukuru w\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Intare w\u2019Igihugu na Perezida wa Senegal Macky Sall nyuma yintsinzi yigihugu mugikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 2021. \nYashakanye na Aisha Tamba, umurusha imyaka 13, kuri 7 Mutarama 2024 binyuze mu mihango ya Isilamu. Ubwo bashyingiranwaga, yarafite imyaka 31 naho umugore wafite imyaka 18. Bivugwa kobari barahuye imyaka irenga ibiri mbere yaho. \nIbyubahiro.\nRed Bull Salzburg\nLiverpool\nBayern Munich\nAl-Nassr\nSenegali\nUmuntu ku giti cye\nAmabwiriza"}
{"id": "21556", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21556", "title": "Rwego ngarambe", "text": "Rwego ngarambe ni umunyamabanga wa Leta muri minisiteri ya Siporo mu Rwanda kuva kuya 20 ukuboza 2024, mbere akaba yari Umuyobozi ushinzwe Iterambere rya Siporo muri iyi Minisiteri ya siporo mu Rwanda. \nUmuryango.\nNgarambe Rwego yashakanye na Josine, akaba ari imfura mu muryango avukamo wa Ngarambe Fran\u00e7ois Xavier, usanzwe ari umuhanzi uririmba indirimbo zitandukanye. "}
{"id": "21557", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21557", "title": "Ndayishimiye Samson", "text": "Ndayishimiye Samson ni umugabo akaba ari umuyobozi w'ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Umukino w\u2019Amagare mu Rwanda (FERWACY), ahoa yagiye kuri uwo mwanya asimbuye Murenzi Abudara kuya 5 Ugishyingo 2023. Ubusanzwe Ndayishimiye asazwe ari inzobere mu mukino wo koga mu mazi ndetse n'amarushanwa yo gusiganwa ku modoka.\nImidali.\nNdayishimiye Samson yatsindiye umudari mu bagobo i Sydney mu marushanwa ya olepike, yitabiriye amarushanwa atandukanye ku isi, abona imidari imbere mu gihugu."}
{"id": "21558", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21558", "title": "Niyonkuru Samuel", "text": "Niyonkuru Samuel yavutse kuya 03 gicurasi 2003 muri Rwamagana, ni we wegukanye irishanwa mu bagabo aho yegukanye irushanwa ry\u2019amagare ryiswe Umusambi Race ryateguwe ku nshuro ya gatatu mu rwego rwo kubungabunga inyoni y\u2019umusambi mu Rwanda.\nImidali.\nNiyonkuru yegukanye imidali itandukanye hari yatwaye umwanya wa 3 mu kunyonga igare isiganwa n'ibihe muri irushanwa ryo muri gabon ryitwa Chantal Biya."}
{"id": "21559", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21559", "title": "Nirere Xaverine", "text": "Nirere Xaverine ni umunyarwandakazi unyonga igare yavutse 12 mata 2002, akaba ari mushiki wa Valens Ndayisenga wigeze gutwara irushanwa rya magare mu Rwanda. Yatangiye amarushanwa mu mwaka wa 2016, akaba akinira ikipe ya Team Amani y'amagare ahagarariye Akarere ka Rwamagana.\nAmarushanwa.\nNirere yegukanye imidari ibiri mu mikino ya Afurika yabereye i Accra muri Ghana mu mwaka wa 2023. Nirere kandi yakoze amateka muri Namibiya ubwo ku wa 2 Kanama 2025 muri irushnwa rya Windhoek asize abandi iminota irenga icumi. kandi muri Shampiyona y\u2019Isi muri 2025, ryabereye i Kigali ni we wabaye umukinnyi wa mbere watangije isiganwa ryo gusiganwa n\u2019ibihe,yasoje ku mwanya wa 27 ku isi, aba uwa mbere muri Afurika."}
{"id": "21560", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21560", "title": "Team Amani", "text": "Team Amani yatangiye 2025ni ikipe y'amagare yo ku rwego rw\u2019umugabane w'afurika, ibarizwa mu ka karere k\u2019Iburasirazuba bwa Afurika harimo u Rwanda, Kenya, Uganda, na Etiyopiya, izamura impano z\u2019abakiri bato kugira ngo bashobore guhatana ku rwego mpuzamahanga. \nIkipe.\nTeam amani ikoresha abakinnyi batandukanye harimo abanyarwanda nka Eric Muhoza, Samuel Niyonkuru, na Xaverine Nirere mu ikipe y\u2019abagore. ndetse irakina na tour yu Rwanda 2026. "}
{"id": "21561", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21561", "title": "Rwanda at the 2008 Summer Olympics", "text": "U Rwanda rwitabiriye imikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi ya 2008 yabereye muri Beijing, Repubulika y'Abaturage y'u Bushinwa kuva ku ya 8 Kanama kugeza kuri 24 Kanama 2008. Kugeza kuri 26 Kamena 2008, abantu bane gusa nibo bari bahagarariye u Rwanda mu marushanwa yo kwiyamamaza i Beijing - babiri mumikino ngororamubiri n'abandi babiri mukoga. "}
{"id": "21562", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21562", "title": "Rwanda at the 2008 Summer Paralympics", "text": "U Rwanda rwohereje itsinda ry\u2019abahagarariye abandi mumarushanwa ya Paralympic yo mu mpeshyi yabereye i Beijing mu 2008. Igihugu cyarigihagarariwe n\u2019umukinnyi umwe. Jean de Dieu Nkundabera, wegukanyumudari wa bronze mumarushanwa ya Paralympic yomumpeshyi yabereye i Atene mu 2004, yitabiriyisiganwaryo kwiruka metero 800 kuntebe y\u2019abamugaye. "}
{"id": "21563", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21563", "title": "Rwanda at the 2013 World Championships in Athletics", "text": "U Rwanda rwitabiriye amarushanwa ya shampiyona y'isi mu mikino ngororamubiri yabereye i Moscou mu Burusiya yo muri 2013, kuva kwi 10 kugeza kuya 18 Kanama 2013. Itsinda ry'abakinnyi babiri ryatangajwe ko rizahagararira igihugu muriri rushanwa. "}
