{"id": "21565", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21565", "title": "Rwanda at the 2019 African Games", "text": "U Rwanda rwitabiriye imikino ya Afurika ya 2019 kuva kuri 19 kugeza kuri 31 Kanama 2019 i Rabat, muri Maroc. Muri rusange, abakinnyi bahagarariye u Rwanda begukanye imidari itatu ya bronze, maze igihugu kirangiza ku mwanya wa 37 ku rutonde rw'imidari.\nSiporo.\nNoel Hitimana na Marthe Yankurije barushanwe muri siporo. \nHitimana yitabiriye isiganwa rya metero 10.000 z'abagabo naho Yankurije yitabira isiganwa rya metero 10.000 z'abagore. \nHitimana yarangije ku mwanya wa 5 naho Yankurije arangiza ku mwanya wa 8. \nKugendera ku igare.\nU Rwanda rwahatanye haba mu gusiganwa kumagare yo mumisozi no mwigare ryo mumuhanda. Moise Mugisha yegukanye umudari wa bronze mwirushanwa ry\u2019abagabo kugiti cyabo. Yari no mwikipe yegukanye umudari wa bronze mwirushanwa ry\u2019abagabo kugihe. \nVolleyball.\nU Rwanda rwitabiriye irushanwa rya volleyball yo ku mucanga ry'abagabo.\nPatrick Akumuntu Kavalo na Olivier Ntagengwa begukanye umudari wa bronze. \nBenitha Mukandayisenga na Valentine Munezero bitabiriye amarushanwa ya volley ball y'abagore. Barangije ku mwanya wa 8."}
{"id": "21566", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21566", "title": "Rwanda at the Olympics", "text": "U Rwanda rwitabiriye imikino Olempike y'impeshyi kunshuro ya 11. Ntirwigeze rwitabira imikino Olempike y'itumba.\nU Rwanda ntirwigeze rutsindira umudari Olempike, ariko Jean de Dieu Nkundabera yegukanye umudari wa bronze mumikino ngororamubiri y\u2019abamugaye mu mikino ngororamubiri mu irushanwa rya Paralympique ryo mu mpeshyi ryabereye i Atene muri 2004. "}
{"id": "21567", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21567", "title": "Rwanda at the Paralympics", "text": "U Rwanda rwatangiye gukina imikino ya Paralempike mu mpeshyi ya 2000 i Sydney. Rwahagarariwe numukinnyi umwe w'igitsina gabo Cesar Rwagasana wokoga. Muri 2004, u Rwanda rwohereje abasiganwa babiri: Olive Akobasenga na Jean de Dieu Nkundabera. Nkundabera yegukanye umudari wa bronze mwisiganwa rya metero 800 mu bagabo (T46). Niwe wenyine wahagarariye igihugu muri 2008, yitabiriye iri siganwa, ariko kuriyi nshuro yananiwe kurenga urwego rw'isiganwa. \nU Rwanda ntirwigeze rwitabira imikino ya Paralympic y'itumba. "}
{"id": "21568", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21568", "title": "Rwanda Basketball League Division 2", "text": "Shampiyona ya Basketball mu Rwanda Icyiciro cya 2 nirushanwa rya kabiri rya Basketball mu bagabo mu Rwanda, nyuma ya Shampiyona ya Basketball mu Rwanda (RBL). Kuya 1 Ukuboza 2021, FERWABA yatangaje ishyirwaho ry'irushanwa rishya. Igihembwe cyambere cyatangiye kuya 1 Mata 2022, amakipe cumi n'atandatu agabanyijemo amatsinda atatu. Kugeza muri 2024, shampiyona ifite amakipe 24. \nAbatwaye igikombe n'aba kabiri muri shampiyona bazamurwa mucyiciro cyakabiri cya Basketball muri Rwanda mumwaka w'imikino ukurikira.\nAmakipe.\nAmakipe 24 akurikira agize ishami rya 2 muri shampiyona ya 2024. "}
{"id": "21569", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21569", "title": "Rwanda Billie Jean King Cup team", "text": "Ikipe y'u Rwanda ya Billie Jean King Cup ihagarariye u Rwanda mwirushanwa rya tenisi rya Billie Jean King Cup kandi iyobowe n'ishyirahamwe ry'umukino wa Tennis mu Rwanda. Ubu irushanwa mugace k'i Burayi/Afurika mu itsinda rya kane.\nAmateka.\nU Rwanda rwitabiriye imikino yambere ya Billie Jean King Cup mu 2021. Umusaruro mwiza rwabonye nokurangiza rufite umwanya wa kane mu itsinda rya gatatu muri 2021.\nIkipe iriho ubu.\n\"Urutonde rw'abashinzwe gukurikirana kugeza kuya 6 Ugushyingo 2023\"\nIbisubizo.\nDore urutonde rw'imikino yose kuva muwi 1995, ubwo irushanwa ryatangiraga kuba muburyo bw'amatsinda y'isi."}
{"id": "21570", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21570", "title": "Rwanda Davis Cup team", "text": "Ikipe ya tennis ya Rwanda Davis Cup ihagarariye u Rwanda mumarushanwa ya tennis ya Davis Cup kandi iyoborwa na F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Rwandaise de Tennis.\nUbu u Rwanda ruri mw' irushanwa rya gatatu mw' itsinda rya gatatu ry\u2019i Burayi/Afurika. Rwabaye urwa kabiri mw' itsinda rya gatatu muri 2005.\nAmateka.\nU Rwanda rwitabiriye irushanwa rya mbere rya Davis Cup muri 2001."}
{"id": "21571", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21571", "title": "Rwanda men's national under-16 basketball team", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagabo y'u Rwanda ya Basketball y'abatarengeje imyaka 16 nikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball y'u Rwanda, iyoborwa na \"F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Rwandaise de Basketball Amateur\". Ihagarariye igihugu mumarushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Basketball y'abagabo batarengeje imyaka 16."}
{"id": "21572", "revid": "8075", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21572", "title": "Abraham Ruhumuriza", "text": "\u00a0Abraham Ruhumuriza (wavutse kuri 28 Kanama 1979) ni Umunyarwanda wahoze arumukinnyi w\u2019amagare. Intsinzi ye nyamukuru yatsinze yari muri Tour du Rwanda, yatsinze inshuro eshanu hagati yomuri 2002 na 2007."}
{"id": "21573", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21573", "title": "Amandin Rutayisire", "text": "DaMarcus Ellis (wavukiye i Dallas ariko u Rwanda rwamushyize ku rutonde rw'abavutse kuri 15 Kamena 1985, i Kikukiro) numukinnyi wa Basketball w'Umunyamerika wakiniye ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda ya Basketball mw' irushanwa rya FIBA Africa Championship ryo muri 2009 yitwa Amandin Rutayisire. Yakiniye Robert Morris Colonials basketball y'abagabo hagati yomuri 2001 na 2003. \nRutayisire yari mushya mw'ikipe y\u2019u Rwanda mw' irushanwa rya FIBA rya Afurika rya 2009 nyuma y\u2019uko igihugu cyari cyaragaragaye bwa mbere mw' irushanwa rya Afurika muri FIBA Africa Championship 2007. Muriri rushanwa, Rutayisire yabonye amanota 7.6 kuri buri mukino na 2.5 kuri buri mukino kugira ngo afashe Abanyarwanda kurangiza ku mwanya wa 9 ndetse n\u2019uko bitwaye neza kugeza ubu muri Shampiyona ya Afurika. "}
{"id": "21574", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21574", "title": "C\u00e9sar Rwagasana", "text": "C\u00e9sar Rwagasana numunyarwanda woga byakinyamwuga.\nNiwe muntu wa mbere wahagarariye u Rwanda muri Paralympic ubwo yari uhagarariye igihugu wenyine muri Paralympic yo mu mpeshyi ya 2000 i Sydney. Yari yaritoje mu kiyaga cya Tanganyika. Yitabiriye irushanwa rya metero 50 (S10 category), maze yoga uburebure bwa pisine muminota 42.39, arangiza ari uwa nyuma, inyuma y'uwa kabiri mu koga buhoro buhoro mu manota 13.7. Ni bwo buryo bwonyine yitabiriye mu mikino Paralympic. \nNubwo Kyodo News International yavuze ko yatakaje ukuguru kwe kw'ibumoso mugihe cya jenoside yo mu Rwanda, mu byukuri yari abuze ukuguru kwe kwiburyo, kandi Rwagasana yabwiye \"The Daily Telegraph\" ko yavutse adafite ukuguru. "}
{"id": "21575", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21575", "title": "William Kamanyi", "text": "William Luwagga Kamanyi (wavutse muwi 1942) yahoze arumukinnyi wa Uganda ukina umukino wogusimbuka kure, umukinnyi wa cricket, akaba n'umutoza wasiporo. Yahagarariye Uganda mu mikino yomuri 1962 y'Ubwongereza n'imikino ya Commonwealth ndetse n'imikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi yo mu 1964, nyuma aza gutoza ikipe y'igihugu ya cricket yo muri Uganda.\nKamanyi yitabiriye King's College Budo. Mu irushanwa ry'abagabo ryo gusimbuka kure mumikino ya British Empire Games yo muri 1962 yabereye i Perth, muri Ositaraliya y'Uburengerazuba, yaje kumwanya wa cumi mubakinnyi cumi n'icyenda, asimbuka. Ibi byashyizeho agahigo k\u2019igihugu cya Uganda mugihe cy\u2019imyaka 14. Muri iryo rushanwa ryabereye i Tokyo mu mpeshyi yomuwi 1964, Kamanyi yanditswe nk\u2019umuhatanira, ariko raporo ye yagaragazaga ko \"atahari\". Nyuma yokurangiza umwuga wewo gukina siporo, yahisemo kwibanda kuri cricket, ahagararira ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya Uganda nk\u2019umukinnyi w\u2019umuhanga hagati ya 1971 na 1983. \nHagati yi 1998 na 2001, Kamanyi yabaye umutoza mukuru wikipe y'igihugu ya cricket ya Uganda. Muricyo gihe, yanatoje ikipe yigihugu y'abagore bari munsi y'imyaka 19 ya Uganda mu irushanwa rya Afurika ry'abari munsi y'imyaka 19 ryo mu 2001, kandi yagize uruhare mugushinga ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore. Muri Nyakanga 2007, Kamanyi yagizwe umuyobozi ushinzwe iterambere ry'ishyirahamwe ry'umukino wa cricket muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, asimbuye umunyakenya Tom Tikolo. Imwe mu nshingano ze za mbere muri uyumwanya kwari ukugenzura kwimura ibiro by'iterambere biva muri Nairobi, muri Kenya, bijya i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Yanakoranye bya hafi nikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda yarikiri nto, ayibera umutoza mwirushanwa ry'isi rya cricket muri Afurika ry'icyiciro cya gatatu rya 2009. Muri 2014, Kamanyi yahawe igihembo cy'ubuzima bwose cyatanzwe n'inama mpuzamahanga ya cricket. "}
{"id": "21576", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21576", "title": "Simon De Schutter", "text": "Simon De Schutter (afite Imyaka 36) ni umubirigi w'umunyarwanda akaba umuyobozi wa tour du Rwanda, akaba ategura iri rushnwa kuva muri 2019, yarageze mu Rwanda kuva 2017, akabba ashizwe kwamamaza irushanwa ruzenguruka u Rwanda.\nUmuyobozi.\nSimon De Schutter ni we washinze ndetse akaba ari n'umuyobozi wa sosiyete Rwanda Epic, hamwe ni rushanwa rya magare rya Gorilla Gravel."}
{"id": "21577", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21577", "title": "Rwanda Epic", "text": "Rwandan Epic ni irushanwa mpuzamahanga ry\u2019amagare yo mu misozi rikorerwa ku butaka bwu Rwanda. ni irishanwa rya shinzwe ndetse riyoborwa na Simon De Schutter, aho ritegurwa na Rwanda Alternative Riding Events (RAR Events) ku bufatanye n\u2019Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Umukino w\u2019Amagare mu Rwanda ariryo (FERWACY). \nAbaritwaye.\nRwanda epic ryagiye ritwarwa n'abakinnyi bagiye batandukanye aribo: Umunyarwanda HABIMANA Jean Eric ndetse n\u2019umudage Karl Platt muri 2022. "}
{"id": "21578", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21578", "title": "Girubuntu Jeanne d'Arc", "text": "Jeanne d'Arc Girubuntu (yavutse 6 Gicurasi 1995) yavukiye i Rwamagana, ni umukinnyi w\u2019umunyarwandakazi ukina umukino w'igare, akaba ari we watwaye igikombe cy\u2019u Rwanda muri 2014, akaba yaritabiriye amarushanwa y\u2019isi mu 2015.\nUbuzima.\nGirubuntu yitabiriye imikino y'olempike yo mu mujyi wa Londere muri 2012. Yinjiye mu ishuri ryigisha amagare rya Adrian Nyonshuti muri 2012. Yinjiye mu ikipe y\u2019igihugu y'amagare muri 2014 \nYabaye shampiyona w\u2019u Rwanda muri 2014 mu isiganwa ryo mu muhanda. Mu 2015, yamaze amezi atatu mu Kigo cy\u2019Isi cy\u2019Amagare mu Busuwisi, yatumiwe.\nMu 2015, yitabiriye kandi amarushanwa y'isi: yarangije kumwanya wa 44 mu gusiganwa n'igihe n'uwa 87 mu irushanwa ryo mu muhanda.\nMuri 2016, Jeanne d'Arc Girubuntu yitabiriye imikino olempike ya Riyo de Janeyiro. Mu marushanwa ya Afurika yo mu 2017, yarangije ari uwa munani mu gusiganwa n'igihe. Mu 2018, yegukanye umudari mu gusiganwa n'igihe. Muri 2019, mu marushanwa ya Afurika, yarangije ari uwa gatandatu mu gusiganwa n'igihe kugiti cy'umuntu n'uwa munani mu irushanwa ryo mu muhanda."}
{"id": "21579", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21579", "title": "Diane Ingabire", "text": "Diane Ingabire, yavutse ku itariki ya 17 Nyakanga 2001, ni umunyarwandakazi ukina umukino w'igare.\nUmwuga.\nYatsindiye umudari wa feza mu irushanwa ry'igare mu bakinnyi bato bakina mu muhanda mu irushanwa ryo muri 2019 ryabereye i Bahir Dar. Mu irushanwa ryo muri 2021 ryabereye i Cairo, yatsindiye imidari ya feza mu irushanwa basiganwa n'igihe, ndetse n\u2019umudari mu irushanwa ry\u2019igihe cy\u2019abari munsi y\u2019imyaka 23."}
{"id": "21580", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21580", "title": "Bonaventure Uwizeyimana", "text": "Bonaventure Uwizeyimana, yavutse itariki ya 4 Mutarama 1993, ni umunyarwanda ukina umukino w'igare.\nUbuzima bw'umuntu.\nBonaventure Uwizeyimana yubatse izina mu mwaka wa 2013 ubwo yafataga umwanya wa kabiri mu irushanwa ry\u2019amasiganwa yo mu muhanda mu Rwanda, ubwo yari ahanganye na Gasore Hategeka. Yanatsinze amasiganwa abiri yo mu gihugu, yabaye ku mwanya wa cyenda muri mu irushanwa ry'asimara aba nuwa 15 mu irushanwa rya Eritereya."}
{"id": "21581", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21581", "title": "Naomi Schiff", "text": "Naomi Schiff, yavutse ku ya 18 Gicurasi 1994, ni umushoferi w\u2019amasiganwa y\u2019imodoka ufite ubwenegihugu bw'Umunyarwanda n\u2019Umubiligi akaba n\u2019umunyamakuru ukora kuri Televiziyo. Yavukiye mu Bubiligi se ni Umubiligi na nyina w\u2019Umunyarwanda, yakuriye muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo ubu atuye i Paris.\nMu 2020, yagizwe intumwa y\u2019ubumwe n\u2019ubwuzuzanye muri W Series. Yabaye umunyamakuru kuri televiziyo ya Formula 1 Grand Prix, muri Sky Sports muri 2022, no muri Canal Plus muri 2023.\nUmwuga.\nNyuma y'ikiruhuko cy'umwaka umwe, yongeye kwinjira mu ikipe ya RC Formula mu cyiciro muri 2020 Formula Renault Eurocup muri Circuit Motorland Aragon. Yanahatanye muri Supercar Challenge Superlights - SR3 n'ikipe ya GH Motorsport.\nKu ya 20 Nyakanga 2023, Canal Plus yatangaje ko Naomi Schiff azinjira mu ikipe yabo ya F1 avuye mu irushanwa rya Hongiriya Grand Prix ryo muri 2023.\nNi umwe mu bagize itsinda ry'abajyanama ba Sky Sports F1 mu mwaka w'imikino wa 2025."}
{"id": "21582", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21582", "title": "Kwizera Arnold", "text": "Kwizera Arnold (yavutse ku ya 24 Nzeri 1993) ni umunyamakuru w\u2019umunyarwanda, akaba n\u2019umukozi kuri radiyo na televiziyo. Arnold ni umuyobozi mukuru wa Patriots Basketball Club, ndetse n'urubuga rw\u2019itangazamakuru ry\u2019imari, aho ari umuyobozi wa Pivot and Profit. Ni umwe kandi mu bashinze akaba n\u2019umuyobozi mukuru wa ArCa Ventures Fund na Studio, akora ikiganiro cya saa sita kuri radiyo kuri Royal FM, akaba n\u2019uwahoze ari umunyamakuru wa siporo, ikiganiro cya saa sita kuri Televiziyo y\u2019u Rwanda. \nUbuzima.\nArnold yavukiye i Westville, muri Afurika y'Epfo ku ya 24 Nzeri 1993. Ku myaka 2, yimukiye muri Uganda kubana na nyina. Se yakoraga akazi ko gucuranga disiki. Mu bwana bwe, Arnold yakundaga kujya mu birori byo kwizihiza isabukuru y'inshuti ze."}
{"id": "21583", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21583", "title": "Bigango Valentin", "text": "Bigango Valentin ni umugabo w'umunyarwanda akaba ari nu muyobozi mukuru w'ungirie aho visi Perezida wa mbere w\u2019Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Umukino w\u2019Amagare mu Rwanda, yungirije Ndayishimiye Samson. \nIgare.\nBigango Valentin ni "}
{"id": "21584", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21584", "title": "PFL Afurika 3 (2025)", "text": "2025 PFL Afurika 3: U Rwanda rwari mwirushanwa ry\u2019imikino yo kurwana ryateguwe n\u2019Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Abarwanashyaka b\u2019Umwuga ryabaye kuri 18 Ukwakira 2025, muri BK Arena i Kigali, mu Rwanda. \nInyuma.\nIri rushanwa ryabereye muri kimwe cya kabiri cy\u2019irushanwa rya PFL Africa Tournament ryo muei 2025 mucyiciro cy\u2019abasiganwa kumagare bakomeye, abapima ibiro byinshi, abapima ibiro byinshi n\u2019abapima ibiro byinshi. \nMugihe cyo gupima, imikino ya \u00bd cya nyuma hagati ya Patrick Ocheme na Abdul Razak Sankara bombi bananiwe ibiro bya feather weight ubwo Ocheme yazaga kubiro 156.2 na Sankara ku biro 151 maze imikino ikomeza mumukino wo kwerekana catchweight. Bityo, Mohamed Camara na Alain Majorique bafashe umwanya wabo muriryo rushanwa. \nByongeye kandi, Karim Henni\u00e8ne yapimaga ibiro 137.2, ibiro 1.2 hejuru y\u2019umubare ntarengwa w\u2019abafata imyenda, naho Wasi Adeshina apima ibiro 148, ibiro 2 hejuru y\u2019umubare ntarengwa w\u2019abafata imyenda. Henni\u00e8ne na Adeshina baciwe amanota 20% by\u2019isakoshi ye, yagenewe Boule Godogo na Dwight Joseph. "}
{"id": "21585", "revid": "106", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21585", "title": "Patriots Basketball Club", "text": "Patriots Basketball Club Yashinzwe mu 2014 izwi kandi nka Patriots, ni ikipe y'ababigize umwuga umukino w'amaboko ya Basketil ifite icyicaro i Kigali, mu Rwanda., ikinira imikino yayo kuri Sitade y'Amahoro. Iyi kipe imaze gutwara igikombe cya shampiyona y'umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda (RBL) inshuro 4. \nMu mwaka w'imikino wa 2021, iyi kipe ya Patriots yakinnye muri Basketball Africa League (BAL). Iyi kipe yamenyekanye cyane ku isi ubwo umuraperi w'icyamamare w'umunyamerika J. Cole yasinyaga amasezerano n'iyi kipe kugira ngo ayikinire muri BAL.\nAmateka.\nIkipe ya Patriots BBC yashinzwe muri 2014 n'itsinda ry'abayobozi bakuru b'ibigo bitandukanye bikora mu bukungu. Mu mwaka wa mbere w'imikino, Patriots yahise igera ku mukino wa nyuma wa shampiyona, ariko itsindwa na Espoir ibitego 1-3. Nyuma y'imyaka ibiri, Patriots yegukanye igikombe cyayo cya mbere cy'igihugu.\nKu ya 21 Nzeri 2019, Patriots yegukanye igikombe cyayo cya kane cya shampiyona nyuma yo gutsinda REG BBC mu mukino wa 7 w\u2019imikino ya nyuma, mu kibuga cya Kigali Arena cyagurishijwe cyane. Ku ya 26 Ukwakira, umutoza mukuru Henry Mwinuka, watwaye ibikombe bitatu bya shampiyona na Patriots, yatandukanye n\u2019iyi kipe ajya muri REG. Ku ya 6 Ugushyingo, umutoza wungirije Carey Odhiambo yazamuwe mu ntera aba umutoza mukuru. Muri Mata 2021, mbere y\u2019uko shampiyona ya mbere ya BAL itangira, iyi kipe yasinyishije umunyamerika Alan Major nk\u2019umutoza mukuru mushya. Muri Mata 2021, iminsi itanu mbere y\u2019uko alubumu ye, umuraperi w\u2019umunyamerika J. Cole yasinye amasezerano na Patriots. \nPatriots yakinnye umukino wayo wa mbere wa BAL ku ya 16 Gicurasi 2021 mu rugo i Kigali, itsinda ikipe ya Rivers Hoopers yo muri Nijeriya amanota 83\u201360. Amaherezo, ikipe yarangije iri ku mwanya wa kane utangaje mu irushanwa.\nNyuma y'umwaka w'imikino wa 2023-24, Mwinuka yavuye muri iyi kipe, asimburwa n'umutoza mukuru mushya Sunny Niyomugabo. \nUbuterankunga.\nMuri 2024, Patriots BBC yasinye amasezerano y'imyaka itanu yo gutera inkunga Banki y'Iterambere y'u Rwanda (RDB). "}
{"id": "21587", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21587", "title": "Rugby union in Rwanda", "text": "Ishyirahamwe ry'abakina umupira wa Rugby mu Rwanda numukino muto ariko urimo gukura. Ikipe y'igihugu ubiri ku mwanya wa 95 n'isi yose ya Rugby \nUrwego rushinzwe imiyoborere.\nSiporo iyobowe na F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Rwandaise de Rugby.\nAmateka.\nU Rwanda rwahoze rukoronejwe n'Ububiligi, kandi umukino watangiye kugaragara aho ngaho.\nMugihe cy'ubukoloni, umupira wa Rugby womu Rwanda wari ufite umupira woroshye ariko uhoraho; icyakora, wagiye ugabanuka nyuma y'ubwigenge bw'u Rwanda, kandi amahano yomu ntambara yo mumyaka yowi 1990 yangije umukino cyane.\nAriko, imiryango y\u2019ubutabazi yahageze nyuma y\u2019iryo shyano yongeye gutangiza umukino, urimo kwitabwaho na benshi murubyiruko. Hari umuntu umwe wagize ati: \"Mumyaka yanjye yose, ntarabona ishyaka n\u2019icyifuzo cyo gukina rugby nkuko nabikoze mu Rwanda. Abahungu bafite ishyaka ryo kwiga byinshi mumukino uko bashoboye kose.\" \nUbu u Rwanda rufite ikipe y'igihugu ya rugby y'abagabo n'abagore."}
{"id": "21588", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21588", "title": "Rwanda Women's Football League", "text": "Shampiyona y'abagore yo mucyiciro cyambere mu Rwanda ni shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru y'abagore yoku rwego rwo hejuru mu Rwanda.\nAmateka.\nMbere yashampiyona yomuri 2004-2008...\nShampiyona yatangiye muri 2008 kandi yashinzwe gusa n'amafaranga yavuye kuri FIFA. Gutangiza imikino yokwishyura nyuma y'umwaka w'imikino washampiyona wa 2013-14. Hamwe n'amakipe cumi n'atandatu gusa yanditswe, nta kumanuka mucyiciro cyakabiri, ariko hateganijwe gushyiraho shampiyona yoku rwego rwakabiri. Muri 2015 FIFA yateye inkunga shampiyona n'amadolari 70,000. \nAbakinnyi batsinze.\nUrutonde rw'abatsinze n'abatsinze kumwanya wakabiri: "}
{"id": "21589", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21589", "title": "Espoir BBC", "text": "Espoir BBC ni ikipe y'abagabo babigize umwuga ikina ya Basketball yo mu Rwanda ifite icyicaro i Kigali. Iyi kipe ikaba ikina mu irushanwa muri Shampiyona y'igihugu ya Basketball mu Rwanda. \nUbusanzwe, iyi kipe yagiye igaragaza abakinnyi batandukanye bagiye ndetse mu makipe menshi m'ugihugu by'afurika. \n 2003\u201304, 2011\u201312, 2012\u201313, 2013\u201314, 2014\u201315"}
{"id": "21590", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21590", "title": "Ndaye Chancel", "text": "Chancel Ndaye (yavutse ku ya 14 Mata 1999) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka mu Burundi, ukinira ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru nka myugariro.\nUmwuga.\nYakuriye mu rwego rw'urubyiruko rwa LLB Acad\u00e9mic, muri Gashyantare 2019 yerekeje i Burayi asinya amasezerano n'ikipe ya Tch\u00e8que yo muri Vy\u0161kov.\nKu itariki ya 20 Ukuboza 2019 muri uwo mwaka, yimukiye muri Las Vegas Lights burundu. \nYahagarariye ikipe y'igihugu y'abatarengeje imyaka 20 mu gikombe cya Afurika cy'ibihugu by'abatarengeje imyaka 20 cya 2019. "}
{"id": "21591", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21591", "title": "2021 BAL finals", "text": "Imikino ya nyuma ya BAL yo muri 2021 niyo yari shampiyona y'umwaka wa mbere wa Basketball Africa League (BAL). Umukino wa nyuma wabereye muri Kigali Arena i Kigali kuri 30 Gicurasi 2021. Umukino wahuje ikipe yomuri Misiri ya Zamalek n'ikipe yomuri Tuniziya ya US Monastir.\nBitewe n'amabwiriza y'icyorezo cya COVID-19, ubwitabire mukibuga bwari buke kandi abantu 1.789 bari bahari. Zamalek yatsinze ikipe ya Monastir yomuri Tuniziya amanota 76-63 itwara igikombe cyayo cyambere cya BAL n'igikombe cya kabiri cya Afurika, nyuma yo kwegukana igikombe cya Afurika cyomuwi 1992. Kubera iyompamvu, ikipe yegukanye igikombe cya FIBA Intercontinental Cup cya 2021. Walter Hodge wa Zamalek yagizwe umukinnyi w\u2019inararibonye mu mikino ya shampiyona nyuma y\u2019umukino wanyuma.\nAho bizabera.\nKuya 1 Kanama 2019, Kigali Arena, yubatswe kandi ifungurwa muri 2019, yatangajwe ko izakira imikino ya nyuma yabane y'irushanwa rya BAL. Iyisitade ifite ubushobozi bwo kwakira abantu bagera ku 10.000, ikaba yarakiriye imikino yogushaka itike ya AfroBasket 2021 ndetse na shampiyona y'igihugu ya Basketball y'u Rwanda mbere yaho.\nImiterere ya shampiyona yaje guhindurwa maze shampiyona yose ibera muri Kigali. Kubera icyorezo cya COVID-19, ubwitabire bwari buke kandi abareba bose bagombaga gukurikiza amategeko agenga intera hagati y\u2019abantu.\nInyuma.\nMonastir yo muri Amerika.\nUS Monastir yegukanye igikombe cya Pro A muri 2019, kugira ngo yegukane shampiyona ya mbere ya BAL. Iyikipe yanatwaye igikombe cya shampiyona muri 2020 kandi yegukanye shampiyona yomuri 2020-21 kuya 27 Mata 2021, nyuma yo gutsinda ikipeya Ezzahra Sports mumikino ya nyuma. kugira ngo yegukane ibikombe 6 muri shampiyona. Kuya 12 Mata 2021, iyi kipe yasinyishije Mounir Ben Slimane nk'umutoza wayo mushya. \nMuri 2014, Monastir yatangiye gukina shampiyona ya FIBA Africa Club Championship, shampiyona ikomeye ku mugabane wa Afurika, kunshuro yambere. Muri 2017, iyikipe yarangije iriku mwanya wa gatatu muri shampiyona y\u2019umugabane wa Afurika. \nIkipe ya Monastir yaririmo abakinnyi barindwi bari n'abakinnyi b'ikipe y'igihugu ya Tuniziya. Mu gihe cya BAL, ikipe yitwaye neza mumatsinda itsinda abo bahanganye bose, ikaba ari yo kipe yonyine yabashije kubona amanota arenga 100 mumukino umwe ubwo yatsindaga GNBC yomuri Madagasikari kumanota 113 kuri 66. Yaje kuba iyambere mumikino yanyuma kandi yafashwe nk' \"abakunzwe\" kugikombe mbere y'uko shampiyona itangira na \"ESPN\". \nZamalek.\nZamalek yegukanye igikombe cya Egyptian Super League muri 2019, igikombe cyayo cyambere mumyaka 11, kugira ngo yegukane shampiyona yambere ya BAL. Mu myaka yomuwi 1990, iyi kipe yari yatsinze kurwego rw'umugabane ndetse n'igikombe cya FIBA Africa Basketball League mu 1992 n'icya nyuma cyatsinzwe muwi 1998. Ukongeraho imikino ya nyuma mwirushanwa ryahoze ari FIBA, uyu wari umukino wa gatanu wanyuma wa Zamalek ku mugabane w'umugabane.\nNi womwaka wa mbere w\u2019imikino uyobowe n\u2019umutoza mukuru w\u2019umunya-Espagne August\u00ed Julbe, waje avuye muri Gran Canaria. Mu gihe cyo gukina muri BAL, Zamalek yarikiri mu mikino ya kimwe cya kabiri cya Shampiyona ya Misiri yomuri 2020-21. Mbere y\u2019umwaka w\u2019imikino, ikipe yikomeje hamwe na Michael Fakuade, Mouloukou Diabate na Chinemelu Elonu. Ikipe yakinnye neza cyane mumatsinda, itsinda abo bahanganye bose uko ari batatu, ijya mumikino ya nyuma y\u2019imikino nk\u2019iy\u2019aba kabiri.\nUmukino.\nNubwo ikipe ya Monastir ya Amerika yari itowe mbere y'umukino, Zamalek yatsinze umukino wa nyuma kuburyo butangaje. Mohab Yasser, umukinnyi muto mumwaka wa shampiyona ya BAL kumyaka 18, yatanze amanota 14 nyuma yogutera 6-kuri-8 mukibuga. Abakinnyi batatu ba Solo Diabate, Michael Fakuade na Chinemelu Elonu bongereye amanota 40 avuye kuntebe y'abasimbura. Hasigaye iminota umunani ngo umukino ugere, Zamalek yafunguye amanota 15 maze ibasha gutsinda BAL bwambere. Walter Hodge, umukinnyi wa Zamalek ukina amanota 12, anatanga imipira 4, maze ahabwa igihembo cya mbere cya BAL Most Valuable Player. Hodge yariyakiniye US Monastir mumwaka ushize."}
{"id": "21592", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21592", "title": "2022 BAL finals", "text": "Imikino ya nyuma ya BAL yo mu 2022 yarumukino wa shampiyona y'umwaka wa 2022 wa BAL, umwaka wakabiri wa Basketball Africa League (BAL). Umukino wanyuma wabereye muri BK Arena i Kigali kuri 28 Gicurasi 2022, hagati y'ikipe yomuri Angola Petro de Luanda nikipe yomuri Tuniziya ya US Monastir.\nUS Monastir yatsinze umukino nyuma yo kwitwara neza mugice cya kane, yegukana igikombe cya mbere cya BAL ndetse n'igikombe cyambere cya Afurika. Uyu mukino witabiriwe n'abantu 10.000 bagurishijwe. \nAmakipe.\n\"Mu mbonerahamwe ikurikira, imikino ya nyuma muri FIBA Africa Clubs Champions Cup iri mu nyandiko nto.\"\nAho bizabera.\nKw' itariki ya 9 Ukuboza 2021, BK Arena, icyo gihe yiswe \"Kigali Arena\", yatangajwe nkaho hazabera imikino ya Playoffs ya BAL yo mu 2022. Iyiyari final yakabiri yikurikiranya yabereye muriyo stade.\nInyuma.\nPetero de Luanda.\nPetro de Luanda yegukanye igikombe cyumwaka wa 2020-21, anagarura umutoza wa Brezili Jos\u00e9 Neto mumwaka wakabiri w'imikino. Itsinda ry'abakinnyi bakomeye ryakomeje kuba ryiza, Anderson Correia na Yanick Moreira basinyishijwe nk'abakinnyi bongerewe imbaraga kuri 15 Werurwe 2022. \nPetro yagize ibihe byiza cyane mumateka, kuko yegukanye shampiyona ya Basketball ya Angola yo mu 2021-22 ifite agahigo ko kudatsindwa k'ibitego 33-0. Kuri 11 Gicurasi 2022, yegukanye igikombe cyayocya 15 cy'igihugu nyuma yogutsinda Interclube mumikino yanyuma y'igihugu. Ubwo ikipe yanatwaraga igikombe cya Angola na Angola Supercup, yegukanye igikombe cyayo cyambere cy'igihugu.\nMu nama ya BAL Nile yo mu 2022, Petro yarangije ariku mwanya wakabiri nyuma yo gutsindwa na Zamalek gusa. Ku 8 Gicurasi, umukinnyi w\u2019umunyamerika EC Matthews yongewe kurutonde rw\u2019abakinnyi mbere y\u2019imikino ya nyuma. Nyuma yo gutsinda AS Sal\u00e9 mumukino wongeye gukinirwa muri kimwe cyakane cy\u2019irangiza cy\u2019umwaka ushize, Petro yatsinze FAP igera kumukino wanyuma wa BAL wa mbere ndetse n\u2019umukino wa yuma wa cyendaku mugabane wa Afurika.\nMonastir yo muri Amerika.\nUS Monastir yegukanye igikombe cyakabiri cya BAL nyuma yokwegukana igikombe cya Championnat National A cyomuri 2020-21. Mu gihe cy'ikiruhuko cy'izabukuru, iyikipe yatakaje abakinnyi bayo b'ibyamamare ba All-BAL Omar Abada na Makrem Ben Romdhane mugihe cy'ikiruhuko cy'izabukuru ubwo basinye amasezerano muri Arabiya Sawudite na Porutugali. Abakinnyi bakomeye bashyizwemo Solo Diabate na Michael Dixon, mugihe Ater Majok yongeye gusinya amasezerano.\nMu marushanwa yayo yo mugihugu imbere, Monastir yagize ikindi gihembwe gikomeye ubwo yegukanaga igikombe cyayo cyakane cyikurikiranya cy\u2019igihugu kuwi 11 Gicurasi 2022, nyuma yo gutsinda Ezzahra Sports kumukino wanyuma. Nyuma y\u2019iminsi itatu, kuri 14 Gicurasi, Monastir yanatwaye igikombe cya Tuniziya irangiza igikombe cyakabiri. \nMu nama ya 2022 ya BAL Sahara, Monastir yabaye iyakabiri nyuma yo gutsindwa bitunguranye n'ikipe yomu Rwanda REG. Mbere y'imikino ya nyuma y'amajonjora, ikipe yongeye gukomezwa n'umuzamu w'umunyamerika Julius Coles Jr. Murikimwe cyakane cy'irangiza, ikipe yatsinze Cape Town Tigers kukinyuranyo cy'amanota 39 kumwaka w'imikino. Mumikino ya kimwe cyakabiri cy'irangiza, ikipe yatsinze Zamalek kugira ngoyihorere kugutsindwa kwanyuma mumwaka ushize.\nUmukino.\nMugice cyambere, ikipe ya US Monastir yatsinze imikino 17-18 mugice cyambere. Mugice cyakabiri, Petro de Luanda yatsinze imikino 8-0 irimo ibitego bitatubya Gerson Gon\u00e7alves na Carlos Morais, bituma igice cy mbere kirangira arimbere kumanota 40-33. Monastir yatsinze 0-8 inyuma y'umurongo w'amanota atatu mugice cyambere, maze abakinnyi ba Tunisia barushwa amanota 17-2 n'Abanya Angola. Nyuma yo gukubita umupira mugice cyagatatu, Monastir yari inyuma y'amanota 57-59 gusa. Michael Dixon yatsinze amanota atatu yatumye Monastir izamuka kumanota 60-59, ari na yoyari iyoboye igice cyakabiri. Abakinnyi bakomeye ba Petro, Jone Pedro na Yanick Moreira, bombi batsinzwe amakosa hasigaye iminota 8 n'umunota 1 ngumukino ugende neza. Hasigaye iminota itatu ngumukino ugende neza, Carlos Morais yakoze ikosa ridasanzwe, Monastir aryifashisha atsinda amanota 72-67. Umukino warangiye hasigaye amasegonda 30 ngo Radhouane Slimane atsinde umupira nyuma yo gutsindwa na Julius Coles Jr. maze atsinda igitego bituma Monastir atsinda amanota 78\u201372. Nyuma yo gutsindwa na Petro de Luanda, rutahizamu wa Monastir Firas Lahyani yibye umupira ariko nta mahirwe yahaye Petro yo kugaruka. Michael Dixon yateye umupira 7 kuri 10 mukibuga maze atsinda amanota 21 n'imipira 6 yavuyemo ibitego, kandi nyuma yo kwitwara neza cyane, yagizwe umukinnyi ukomeye cyane muri BAL, nyuma ya Walter Hodge nk'uwa kabiri wegukanye iki gihembo. Ater Majok wohagati muri Monastir, watsinze amanota 14 mu mukino, yagizwe umukinnyi w'umwaka w'ubwirinzi muri BAL. Gerson Gon\u00e7alves yatsinze amanota 28 mu ikipe ya Angola yatsinzwe, akurikirwa n'amanota 18 ya Yanick Moreira avuye ku ntebe y'abasimbura. \nIngaruka.\nMurwego rwokwizihiza shampiyona yabo, Monastir ya Amerika yakiriwe mu ngoro ya Carthage na Perezida wa Tuniziya Kais Saied. Ikipe yanashimiwe kuri Twitter na Barack Obama, wahoze ari Perezida wa Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika akaba n'umushoramari muri BAL. "}
{"id": "21594", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21594", "title": "Rwanda Basketball League", "text": "Shampiyona ya Basketball y'u Rwanda (RBL) (yahoze yitwa shampiyona y'igihugu ya Basketball y'u Rwanda) niyo shampiyona ikomeye ya Basketball y'umwuga mu Rwanda. Ubusanzwe shampiyona yayitangira mu Gushyingo kugeza muri Nzeri. Abatsinze shampiyona ya NBL batsindira imikinoyo guhatanira itike ya Basketball Africa League (BAL).\nShampiyona ubigizwe n'amakipe 10, menshi muriyo akaba aturuka mmurwa mukuru w'igihugu wa Kigali. Shampiyona ya RBL ubu ni APR, ikaba ariyo kipe ifite ibihembo byinshi muri shampiyona imaze gutwara ibikombe 16. Andi makipe azwi ni REG na Patriots, bahanganye nabo, bamaze imyaka myinshi bakomeye.\nKuva mumwaka w'imikino wa 2021-22, FERWABA inategura ishami rya 2 rya RBL ahamakipe abiri yanyuma muri RBL ariyo amanuka. \nAmateka.\nUmukino wa Basketball watangijwe mu Rwanda muwi 1930 n'abapadiri Gatolika, bigishaga uyu mukino bwambere mumashuri yisumbuye mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo. Mumyaka yakurikiyeho, umubare w'uyu mukino wariyongereye ukw' igisirikare n'ibigo bimwe na bimwe bya leta byashinze amakipe ya Basketball. Muwi 1974, ishyirahamwe ry'igihugu rya Basketball FERWABA ryashinzwe. Nyuma y'imyaka itatu, muwi 1977, hashinzwe shampiyona yambere y'igihugu. \nJenoside yo mu Rwanda yomuwi 1994 yasubije inyuma siporo, kuko abakinnyi b'Abatutsi, abarebaga n'abayobozi bapfuye ndetse n'ibikorwa remezo by'ingenzi byarasenyutse. \nMumyaka yaza 2000, APR yari ikipe ikomeye mu Rwanda kandi yitabiriye igikombe cya FIBA Africa Clubs Champions Cup inshuro eshatu. Umusaruro mwiza yakuyemo numudari wa bronze muri 2009.\nKuva muri 2011 kugeza 2015, Espoir BBC yegukanye ibikombe bine by'igihugu bikurikirana. Kuva icyo gihe, amakipe abiri mashya REG (yafitwe na Rwanda Energy Group) na Patriots yinjiye muri shampiyona. Ayo makipe yombi yahanganye kandi yakinnye mumikino ya nyuma mugihe cy'imyaka myinshi.\nMumyaka yaza 2020, shampiyona ya Basketball Africa League (BAL) yatangijwe - imikino ya mbere yakinwe na BK Arena i Kigali. Patriots yarangije kumwanya wakane mumwaka wa mbere washampiyona wa 2021. Shampiyona yahinduye izina yitwa Rwanda Basketball League (RBL) mu 2023. FERWABA yatangije amarushanwa abiri mashya, igikombe cy'u Rwanda n'igikombe cya Rwanda Super Cup, mumwaka wa 2024. \nAhantu habera.\nImikino ya shampiyona mugihembwe gisanzwe ikunze kubera mucyumba cyomu nzucya Lyc\u00e9e de Kigali, gishobora kwakira abantu 1.500, nyuma y\u2019uko cyavuguruwe na FERWABA na NBA Africa muri 2023. Indi mikino ikinirwa mucyumba cyo munzu cya Kaminuza ya Kepler. Imikino ya Playoffs ikunze kubera muri BK Arena ifite imyanya 10.000 (yahoze yitwa Kigali Arena), yafunguwe muri 2019. Indi salle ikoreshwa ni Petit Arena, iherutse kuvugururwa kugira ngo ijyemo abantu 1.500.\nAmakipe ariho ubu.\nAmakipe yo mu 2025.\nAmakipe akurikira azakina muri shampiyona ya BAL ya 2025:\nInkomoko: \nAmakipe yahozeho.\n[nb 1]\nAbakinnyi batsinze.\nUrutonde rw'abakinnyi bose bakomeye mwikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda banditseho kobazatwara igikombe cya shampiyona y'icyiciro cyambere: \nImikino ya nyuma (2007\u2013ubu).\nUrutonde rw'imikino yanyuma ya shampiyona y'imikino yanyuma, cyangwa niba bidahuye n'urutonde rwanyuma rw'imikino y'umwaka wimikino.\nIbihembo by'umuntu ku giti cye.\nUmukinnyi w'agaciro kurusha abandi.\nNyuma yaburi mwaka w'imikino wa RBL, umukinnyi umwe ahabwa umwanya w'umukinnyi w'agaciro kurusha abandi mw' irushanwa. Olivier Shyaka niwe mukinnyi wenyine watsindiye nibura ibihembo bibiri bya MVP. Kuvamu mwaka w'imikino wa 2023, RBL ifite igihembo cy'umukinnyi witwaye neza mumwaka w'imikino usanzwe, ndetse n'ikindi gitandukanye cy'umukinnyi witwaye neza mumikino yanyuma y'imikino.\nUmukinnyi w\u2019indashyikirwa mu mikino ya Playoffs.\nKuva muri 2023, shampiyona itanga igihembo kumukinnyi witwaye neza mumikino yanyuma y\u2019imikino.\nIkipe y'Umwaka.\nAbakinnyi banditse munyuguti zitukura batorewe kuba umukinnyi w'agaciro kurusha abandi muri uyumwaka w'imikino.\nMu marushanwa ya Afurika.\nBuri mwaka, abakinnyi batwaye igikombe cya NBL bashyirwaga mumarushanwa yo guhatanira itike ya FIBA Africa Basketball League, irushanwa ryambere muri Afurika. Kuva muri 2020, iyi shampiyona yasimbuwe na Basketball Africa League (BAL). Urutonde rukurikira rugaragaza amakipe yomu Rwanda yakinnye irushanwa rikomeye:\nMuri shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru muri Afurika.\nKuva mumwaka w'imikino wa 2023, abakinnyi batwaye igikombe cya RBL bemerewe kwinjira muri BAL, kuko irushanwa ryabagennye nk'isoko ryagenwe."}
{"id": "21597", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21597", "title": "IPRC-Kigali bbc", "text": "IPRC-Kigali BBC ni ikipe ikina umukimo w'amaboko wa basketball mu Rwanda, ifite icyicaro mu karere ka Kicukiro muri Kigali. Ikaba ibarizwa mu ishuri rikuri rya IPRC Kigali Polytechnic University. Abakinnyi benshi bakaba banakina mu ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda, nka Dieudonn\u00e9 Ndizeye. IPRC-Kigali yamanuwe muri Shampiyona ya Basketball mu Rwanda mu cyiciro cya 2 muri shampiyona ya 2023, cyiciro cya 2."}
{"id": "21598", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21598", "title": "Kepler BBC", "text": "Kepler Basketball Club ni ikipe y\u2019ababigize umwuga m\u2019umukino wa basketball mu Rwanda ifite icyicaro i Kigali mu Rwanda. ikaba iyoborwa kandi ishingiye ku ikigo cy\u2019uburezi cya Kepler. Ikipe y\u2019abagabo ikina muri shampiyona y\u2019umukino wa basketball y\u2019u Rwanda (RBL) kuva mu mwaka w\u2019imikino wa 2024.\nIkibuga cy'imikino.\nIkipe ikinira mu kibuga cyo hanze nk omuri kaminuza ariko yatangiye kubaka ikibuga cyayo cyo mu nzu gifite imyanya 1.500 muri 2024. "}
{"id": "21599", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21599", "title": "REG BBC", "text": "REG BBC ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaboko ya basktaball ikina muri shampiyona ya basketball yu Rwanda. REG BBC ikaba ishingiye ku cy'ikigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe gutanga amashanyarazi mu Rwanda, ikaba yaratwaye shampiyona myaka ya 2017, 2021 na 2022.\nAmateka.\nREG BBC yashinzwe muri 2016, maze itwara igikombe cya mbere muri 2017, iza kwitabira amarushanwa y furika ya basketball muri 2018 na 2019."}
{"id": "21600", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21600", "title": "Orion BBC", "text": "Orion Basketball Club ni ikipe y\u2019abakina umukino wa maboko wa Basketball mu Rwanda ibarizwa i Kigali mu Rwanda. orion ikina muri shampiyona y\u2019umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda. Orion yashinzwe muri 2022 itangira gukina mu cyiciro cya 2 ihita izamurwa mu cyiciro cya mbere. \nIyi kipe yashinzwe na James Mutabazi. hamwe n'bandi bashoramari barimo Jarred Harrington. Izina ry'iyi kipe risobanura \"Inyenyeri irabagirana\". "}
{"id": "21601", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21601", "title": "2025 Kwibuka Women's T20 Tournament", "text": "Irushanwa rya Kwibuka ry\u2019abagore rya T20 ryomu 2025 ryarirushanwa mpuzamahanga rya Twenty20 (T20I) ryabereye mu Rwanda kuva kuya 3 kugeza kuya 14 Kamena 2025. Amakipe yitabiriye ni Brezili, Kameruni, Malawi, Nijeriya, u Rwanda, Sierra Leone, Tanzaniya, Uganda na Zimbabwe High Performance XI. Irushanwa rya Kwibuka ryabaye ku nshuro ya cumi na rimwe ryibukije isabukuru y\u2019imyaka 31 jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Uganda niyo yarintwari, imaze kwegukana irushanwa ryo muri 2024. \nAmakipe yakinnye mu irushanwa ryo gusiganwa ku maguru, nyuma y\u2019aho ane yambere agana murikimwe cya kabiri cy\u2019irangiza. U Rwanda rwarangije arurwa mbere mw' irushanwa ryo gusiganwa kumaguru, rutsinda imikino umunani mumikino icyenda. \nTanzaniya yatsinze u Rwanda amanota 16 muri kimwe cyakabiri cy\u2019irangiza, umukino warurimo amanota make. Uganda yatsinzwe na Zimbabwe High Performance XI amanota 1 mukindi gice cyakabiri cy\u2019irangiza, nyuma yogutsindwa kuva kuri 83/2 kugeza kuri 92 zose. Tanzaniya yatsinze Zimbabwe High Performance XI amanota 32 kumukino wanyuma. "}
{"id": "21602", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21602", "title": "Rwanda Basketball Federation", "text": "Ishyirahamwe ry'umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda (French) nurwego ruyobora basketball mu Rwanda. Ruyobora ikipe y'igihugu ya basketball y'u Rwanda ndetse n'amakipe akomeye ya NBL n'andi makipe y'abatarabigize umwuga.\nAmateka.\nMuwi 1930, basketball yazanywe bwambere mu Rwanda n'abapadiri gatolika, imikino yambere yakinwe mumashuri yisumbuye mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo. Nyuma y'ubwigenge muwi 1962, hashinzwe amakipe mashya mu gisirikare no mubigo bimwe na bimwe bya leta. Muwi 1974, ishyirahamwe ry'umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda ryashinzwe, maze shampiyona yambere y'igihugu iratangira nyuma y'imyaka itatu. "}
{"id": "21603", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21603", "title": "2019 Kwibuka Women's T20 Tournament", "text": "Irushanwa rya Kwibuka ry\u2019abagore rya T20 ryo muri 2019 ryarirushanwa ry\u2019abagore rya T20I (WT20I) ryabereye mu Rwanda kuva kuri 18 kugeza kuri 23 Kamena 2019. Iri ryari irushanwa rya gatandatu rya Kwibuka T20 ribera buri mwaka, ryateguwe bwa mbere muri 2014 mu rwego rwo kwibuka abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. \nAbitabiriye namakipe y'igihugu y'abagore y'u Rwanda, Uganda, Mali na Tanzaniya, aho amakipe abiri ya nyuma yitabiriye irushanwa bwambere mugihe Kenya yarifite igikombe ivuyemo kubera kubura inkunga. Nubwa mbere mumateka y'iri rushanwa imikino yemejwe nk'imikino mpuzamahanga y'abagore ya Twenty20 International (WT20I) nk'uko byatangajwe na ICC byo guha imikino yose yakinwe hagati y'amakipe afatanyije nyuma yi 1 Nyakanga 2018. Imikino yose yakinwe kuri sitade mpuzamahanga ya Cricket ya Gahanga i Kigali. Kenya yari imaze gutwara igikombe inshuro eshatu (2015, 2017, 2018) mugihe Uganda yari yagitwaye kabiri, icya mbere muri 2014 ndetse no muri 2016. Tanzania Women yatwaye igikombe cy'uyu mwaka itsinze imikino yayo yose bityo iguma idatsindwa, mugihe abakinnyi babiri b'Abagande, Rita Musamali na Joyce Apio baba abatsinze amanota menshi ndetse n'abafashe amanota menshi. \nMu mukino wa 2 w'irushanwa, ikipe y'abagore ya Mali yatsinzwe amanota atandatu muma overs icyenda n'ikipe yakiriye irirushanwa, bituma iba ikipe iri hasi cyane mu mukino wa WT20I. Ikipe y'u Rwanda yatsinze amanota arindwi mumipira ine gusa, bituma itsinda umukino kumanota icumi, isigarana imipira 116. Mumukino wa gatanu w'irushanwa na Mali, Uganda yatsinze amanota 314/2 mu ma overs 20, bituma iba ikipe iri hejuru mu ma shampiyona mpuzamahanga ya Twenty20 y'abagore. Nubwa mbere mumukino mpuzamahanga wa cricket wa T20, mu bagabo cyangwa abagore, ikipe yatsinze amanota 300. Ikipe ya Mali yatsinzwe amanota 10 muma overs 11.1, ikaba ari yoya kabiri muma shampiyona make muri WT20Is. Intsinzi (amanota 304) nayo yari nini cyane mu mukino wa WT20I. \nByari biteganijwe kwirushanwa rya karindwi rizaba muri Kamena 2020, ariko ryasubitswe kugeza mumwaka ukurikiyeho kubera icyorezo cya COVID-19. "}
{"id": "21604", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21604", "title": "2021 Kwibuka Women's T20 Tournament", "text": "Irushanwa rya Kwibuka ry'abagore rya T20 ryo muri 2021 ryari irushanwa ry'abagore rya T20I (WT20I) ryabereye mu Rwanda kuva kuya 6 kugeza kuya 12 Kamena 2021. Iri iryari irushanwa rya karindwi rya Kwibuka T20 ribera buri mwaka, ryateguwe bwa mbere muri 2014 murwego rwo kwibuka abazize jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muwi 1994. Imikino yose yakinwe kuri sitade mpuzamahanga ya Cricket ya Gahanga i Kigali. Tanzaniya yegukanye irushanwa rya 2019 ariko ntiyarinze igikombe uyumwaka. Irushanwa ryomuri 2020 ryahagaritswe kubera icyorezo cya COVID-19. \nIrushanwa ryo muri 2021 ryatangajwe bwa imbere ko rizahuza amakipe atanu, aho amakipe y'abagore ariyo Rwanda, Botswana, Namibia, Nijeriya na Uganda imaze gutwara igikombe inshuro ebyiri. Kuri 29 Gicurasi 2021, byemejwe ko Kenya imaze gutwara igikombe inshuro eshatu nayo izitabira. Botswana, Namibia na Nijeriya bakinnye irushanwa ryaKwibuka ku nshuro yambere. Amakipe atandatu yashyizwe mumatsinda abiri y'abantu batatu. Ariko, Uganda yasezerewe mwirushanwa kuya 3 Kamena 2021 kubera ibizamini bya COVID-19 mu nkambi yabo. Mbere yuko ivamo, Uganda yariyashyizeho itsinda ry'agateganyo ry'irushanwa. \nIshyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wa Cricket mu Rwanda ryatangaje ko rigamije gukomeza kunoza irushanwa ryaKwibuka binyuze mugushyiramo Zimbabwe buri gihe mumyaka irimbere no gutumira amakipe akomeye aturutse i Burayi n\u2019ahandi, bavuga kobamaze kugirana ibiganiro byiza n\u2019Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wa Cricket mu Budage n\u2019Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wa Cricket muri Brezili. \nNamibia yatsinze imikino ine yose yakinnye mumatsinda, ibikipe yambere yemerewe kujya muri \u00bd cy\u2019irangiza. Ikipe yakiriye iyikipe, u Rwanda, yatsinze Nijeriya mumukino wayo wanyuma mu matsinda, yemeza ko izakina muri \u00bd cy\u2019irangiza. Kenya nayo yabonye umwanya muri \u00bd cy\u2019irangiza. Mumukino wa nyuma mumatsinda, Nijeriya yatsinze Botswana kumanota atatu, iba ikipe yakane kandi yanyuma yemerewe kujya muri \u00bd cy\u2019irangiza. Namibia na Kenya zageze ku mukino wanyuma zitsinze Nijeriya n\u2019u Rwanda muburyo bushimishije. \nU Rwanda rwarangije irushanwa ruriku mwanya wa gatatu, nyuma yogutsinda Nijeriya amanota umunani mumukino wo kwishyura. Kenya yegukanye igikombe cya Kwibuka T20 cyakane nyuma yogutsinda Namibiya amanota 7 kumukino wanyuma. Queentor Abel womuri Kenya watsinze amarushanwa yose niwe watowe nk'umukinnyi w'irushanwa, nyuma yogutsinda amanota 165 nogutsinda amanota 7. \nAmatsinda.\nAmakipe akurikira ni yo yatoranyijwe muri iri rushanwa: \nIkipe y'irushanwa.\nAbakinnyi 14 bakurikira nibo batoranyijwe mu ikipe y\u2019irushanwa: "}
{"id": "21605", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21605", "title": "2022 Kwibuka Women's T20 Tournament", "text": "Irushanwa rya Kwibuka ry\u2019abagore rya T20 ryo mu 2022 ryarirushanwa rya Cricket ry\u2019abagore rya T20I (WT20I) ryabereye mu Rwanda kuva kuya 9 kugeza kuya 18 Kamena 2022. Iri ryari irushanwa rya munani rya Kwibuka T20 ribera buri mwaka, ryakinwe bwambere muri 2014 murwego rwo kwibuka abazize jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muwi 1994. Imikino yakinwe ahantu habiri mumujyi wa Kigali - Sitade Mpuzamahanga ya Cricket ya Gahanga na IPRC Cricket Ground. Kenya niyo yari igikombe cy\u2019abakandida, nyuma yo kwegukana irushanwa rya 2021. Ni ku nshuro yakane Kenya yegukanye irirushanwa. \nAmakipe cumi n'umwe yatangajwe ko azitabira uyumwaka, ugereranyije n'andi atanu muri 2021, bigaragaza ko irushanwa rya Kwibuka rikomeje kwiyongera nokumenyekana. Amakipe yemejwe mbere kazitabira ni u Rwanda rwakiriye imikino, Kenya yatwaye igikombe, Tanzania na Uganda zabanje kwegukana igikombe, ndetse na Botswana, Nijeriya, bagaragaye bwa mbere mw'irushanwa rya Kwibuka, Brezili, Ubudage, Ghana, Sierra Leone na Zimbabwe. Ariko, irushanwa ryaje kugabanuka rigera ku makipe umunani. Iri ryarirushanwa ryambere rya Kwibuka ryahuje amakipe aturutse hanze ya Afurika. \nNyuma y'iminsi itatu yambere y'imikino, Kenya na Nijeriya ntibyatsinzwe, buri kimwe kine kine kinesha. Kumunsi wakane, Tanzania yakomeje amateka yayo 100% itsinda Abanyakenya, kandi izamuka kumwanya wambere nyuma y'uko Nijeriya itsinzwe bwambere nyuma yo gutsindwa na Uganda kumanota 43 gusa. Nyuma y'uko imikino yo gusiganwa kumaguru irangiye, Kenya na Tanzania itaratsindwa byaje kwegukana itike yokujya kumukino w nyuma, mugihe ikipe yakiriye iyi mikino yatsinze Uganda kumwanya wagatatu. \nKumunsi wa mbere w'imikino yanyuma, Ubudage bwatsinze Botswana burangiza kumwanya wa karindwi, naho Nijeriya itsinda Brezili irangiza kumwanya wa gatanu murirusange. Ku munsi wanyuma w'irushanwa, Uganda yatsinze u Rwanda irangiza kumwanya wagatatu, na Tanzania itsinda Kenya kumukino wanyuma itwara irushanwa kunshuro yakabiri. Tanzaniya yari yatwaye irushanwa mugihe yari imaze gukina muri 2019, ariko ntiyashoboye kurwanira igikombe muri 2021 kubera icyorezo cya COVID-19. \nRobini y'uruziga.\nImbonerahamwe y'amanota.\n\u00a0 Advanced to the final\n\u00a0 Advanced to the third-place play-off\n\u00a0 Advanced to the fifth-place play-off\n\u00a0 Advanced to the seventh-place play-off"}
{"id": "21606", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21606", "title": "2023 Kwibuka Women's T20 Tournament", "text": "Irushanwa rya Kwibuka ry\u2019abagore rya T20 ryo muri 2023 ryariirushanwa mpuzamahanga rya Twenty20 (T20I) ryabereye mu Rwanda kuva kwi 10 kugeza kuri 17 Kamena 2023. Ryari irushanwa rya cyenda rya Kwibuka T20 ribera buri mwaka, ryakinwe bwambere muri 2014 muri rwego rwo kwibuka abazize jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muwi 1994. \nTanzaniya yari yatwaye irushanwa rya 2022, ariko ntibitabiriye irushanwa ryo muri 2023, ryari ririmo u Rwanda, Botswana, Kenya, Nijeriya na Uganda. \nNijeriya yatangiye neza, itsinda imikino yayo itatu yambere itunguranye, ifata umwanya wambere mw' irushanwa. Ikipe ya round-robin yari ihanganye cyane, amaherezo ikipe yakiriye imikino na Nijeriya mw' irushanwa ryo kwegukana umwanya wa kabiri kumukino wanyuma inyuma ya Uganda. Uganda niyo yayoboye urutonde rw'imikino, itsinda imikino irindwi yambere ya round-robin, mbere yo gutsindwa na Nijeriya. \nU Rwanda rwatsinze Uganda kumukino wanyuma muburyo butunguranye kumanota 6. Iyi niyo ntsinzi yambere u Rwanda rutsinze Uganda, ikaba ari n'inshuro yambere rutsindira irushanwa rya Kwibuka. \nRobini y'uruziga.\nImbonerahamwe y'amanota.\n\u00a0 Advanced to the final\n\u00a0 Advanced to the 3rd place play-off"}
{"id": "21607", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21607", "title": "2024 Kwibuka Women's T20 Tournament", "text": "Irushanwa rya Kwibuka ry\u2019abagore rya T20 ryo muri 2024 ryarirushanwa mpuzamahanga rya Twenty20 (T20I) ryabereye mu Rwanda kuva kuya 30 Gicurasi kugeza kuya 8 Kamena 2024. Ryari irushanwa rya cumi ngarukamwaka rya Kwibuka T20, ryakinwe bwambere muri 2014 mu rwego rwo kwibuka abazize jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Amakipe yitabiriye ni Botswana, Kameruni, Kenya, Malawi, Nijeriya, u Rwanda, Uganda na Zimbabwe A. Irushanwa ryari rigizwe n\u2019imikino yo kuzenguruka, nyuma y\u2019aho amakipe abiri yambere yerekeje kumukino wanyuma. U Rwanda nirwo rwatwaye igikombe, rumaze kwegukana irushanwa kunshuro ya mbere muri 2023. \nIntsinzi yatsinzwe n'u Rwanda kumanota 12 yatumye Uganda iba iya mbere mukubona umwanya wa nyuma, kuko yatsinze buri mukino mumikino itandatu yambere. Ibi byanasobanuye kikipe yakiriye iyimikino yagombaga kuba yaragombaga gutsinda Zimbabwe A mumukino wayo wa nyuma mw'irushanwa ryo gusiganwa kumaguru kugira ngo ibone amahirwe yokugera kumukino wa nyuma. U Rwanda rwabashije gutsinda umukino, ariko amahirwe yogutsinda ntabwo yari ahagije kugira ngoyemererwe kugera kumukino wa nyuma, kuko Zimbabwe yazamutse ku gipimo cy'amanota. \nUganda yatsinze Zimbabwe A kumanota 2 mumukino wanyuma wari ugoye cyane kandi ufite amanota make. U Rwanda rwatsinze Nijeriya ruhita rwegukana umwanya wagatatu, Kenya itsinda Botswana mumukino wo guhatanira umwanya wa gatanu, naho Malawi ifata umwanya wa karindwi imbere ya Kameruni. Kelis Ndhlovu womuri Zimbabwe niwe watowe nk'umukinnyi w'irushanwa. "}
{"id": "21608", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21608", "title": "John Hakizimana", "text": "John Hakizimana (wavutse kuya 26 Ukwakira 1996) numunyarwanda wiruka interandende. Mu 2018, yitabiriyirushanwa rya \u201chalf marathon\u201d ry\u2019abagabo mwirushanwa rya \u201cIAAF World Half Marathon Championships\u201d ryabereye i Valencia muri Esipanye ryo mu 2018. Yarangije ari ku mwanya wa 34. \nMu 2019, yahagarariye u Rwanda mumikino y\u2019isi yagisirikare yabereye i Wuhan mu Bushinwa mu 2019. Yatsindiye umudari wa bronze mwirushanwa rya marato ry\u2019abagabo. \nYahagarariye u Rwanda mumikino Olempike yomumpeshyi yabereye i Tokyo mu Buyapani mu 2020. Yitabiriye marato y'abagabo ariko ntiyarangiza isiganwa rye. \nMu Gushyingo 2023, Hakizimana yahawigihano cy'imyaka ibiri n'Ishami rishinzwe Iterambere ry'Imikino kucyaha cyokutubahiriza amategeko yokurwanya imiti ikoreshwa mugutera imiti iyobyabwenge nyuma yogupimwa Triamcinolone acetonide mu irushanwa ry'isi rya 2023 nyuma yo kwiruka marato y'abagabo. Kumwanyawa cyenda yakuweho. "}
{"id": "21609", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21609", "title": "United Generations Basketball", "text": "United Generations Basketball, izwi kandi nka UGB, ni ikipe y\u2019umukino wa basketball y\u2019u Rwanda ifite icyicaro i Kigali. Iyikipe ikina muri shampiyona y\u2019umukino wa basketball y\u2019u Rwanda (RBL), ishami rikomeye mugihugu kuva muwi 1998.\nIyikipe ifitwe n'umuririmbyi Bruce Melodie, wabaye umunyamigabane muri 2024. Buri mwaka, UGB itegura irushanwa ry'imurikagurisha ryitwa Legacy Tournament murwego rwo guha icyubahiro abashinze amakipe Championat Aimable na Jean De Dieu Nizeyimana. Mubakinnyi bazwi cyane muriyi kipe harimo Jean Jacques Boissy na Guibert Nijimbere. \nMumwaka wa shampiyona wa 2025, umutoza Yves Murenzi yasezerewe kukazi kogutoza hagati mumwaka wa shampiyona asimburwa n'umutoza w'Umurundi Olivier Ndayiragije. \nIbyubahiro.\nShampiyona ya Basketball y'u Rwanda"}
{"id": "21610", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21610", "title": "2025 FIBA U16 Women's AfroBasket", "text": "2025 FIBA U16 Women's AfroBasket yari irushanwa rya cyenda rya shampiyona ya basketball y'abagore bari munsi y'imyaka 16. Irirushanwa ryabereye i Kigali, mu Rwanda, kuva kuya 2 kugeza kuya 14 Nzeri 2025. \nIrirushanwa ryanabaye nk'irushanwa ryogushaka itike yo kwitabira igikombe cy'isi cya FIBA cy'abagore bari munsi y'imyaka 17 muri Repubulika ya Tch\u00e8que mu 2026, aho amakipe abiri ya mbere yabashije kwitwara neza.\nIcyiciro cy'itsinda.\n\"Ibihe byose ni ibyo mu gace utuyemo (Igihe cya Afurika yo Hagati ; UTC+2).\""}
{"id": "21611", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21611", "title": "Rwanda at the 2025 World Aquatics Championships", "text": "U Rwanda rwitabiriye amarushanwa y\u2019isi ya Aquatics yo mu 2025 yabereye muri Singapuru kuva kuya 11 Nyakanga kugeza kuya 3 Kanama 2025.\nAbarushanwa.\nUrutonde rw'abahatanira ibihembo muri Shampiyona nirukurikira. \nKoga.\nU Rwanda rwinjiye mubakinnyi 4 bokoga. "}
