{"id": "21614", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21614", "title": "Tigers BBC", "text": "Tigers Basketball Club (yashinzwe muri 2019) ni ikipe y'umukino wa maboko wa Basketball w'abigize umwuga ibarizwa i Kigali. Tigers BBC ikina muri imikino ya shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere mu Rwanda cyitwa Rwanda Basketball League (RBL). \nAmateka.\nTigers BBC ni kiipe yashinzwe na rwiyemezamirimo ndetse yahoze akinira basketball mu Rwanda witwa Francis Shyaka. Ighe yitwaye neza ni umwanya wabo wa 4 muri shampiyona yo muri 2021-22. Ukuboza 2024, iyi kipe yasinyishije Henry Mwinuka, wari wabaye umutoza mwiza wa shampityona ya RBL inshuro eshanu yikurikiranya, nk'umutoza wabo mushya."}
{"id": "21615", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21615", "title": "UGB BBC", "text": "United Generations Basketball cyangwa se izwi kandi ku izina rya UGB, yashizwe muri 1998 ni ikipe ikina ikoresheje a maboko ya Basketball y'abigize umwuga ibarizwa Kigali mu Rwanda. Iyi kipe ikina muri shampiyona ya maboko ya Basketball yitwa Rwanda Basketball League (RBL), ibarizwa mu icyiciro cya mbere.\nAmateka.\nUGB yashinzwe nitsinda ry'abantu batandukanye aho ndetse iyoborwa n'umuririrmbyi Bruce Melodie akaba numwe mubanyamigabane bayo kuva muri 2024. "}
{"id": "21616", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21616", "title": "Kigali Titans", "text": "ya Kigali Titans ni ikipe y'abagabo babigize umwuga ibarizwa muri ya Basketball y\u2019u Rwanda ikaba ikorera i Kigali. Iyi kipe ikina mu cyiciro cya kabiri cya shampiyona y\u2019umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda (RBL D2).\nAmateka.\niyi kipe washinzwe muri 2021 n'umucuruzi w'imiti witwa Eugene Rubonera Junior nyuma y'aho FERWABA itangarije ko izashyiraho ikigo cya kabiri cy'igihugu cy'amakipe y'abagabo. Cyril Kalima yagizwe umutoza mukuru wayo.\nTitans yinjiye mu cyiciro cya 2 cya RBL mu mwaka wayo wa mbere w'imikino, maze ihita yegukana igikombe cya shampiyona cyoyo cy'ambere muri 2021-22 cyatumye izamuka muri shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere. Imikino ya nyuma y'icyiciro cya 2 yatsinzwe na Orion BBC ibitego 2-0. Mu mwaka wayo wa kabiri w'imikino, Titans yasinyishije abakinnyi mpuzamahanga Will Perry, Francis Azolibe na \u00c1lvaro Calvo Masa. \nMuri shampiyona ya 2024, Titans yarangije iri ku mwanya wa 10 ari nawo wa nyuma, bityo isubizwa mu cyiciro cya 2."}
{"id": "21617", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21617", "title": "APR BBC", "text": "Arm\u00e9e Patriotique Rwandaise Basketball Club, izwi cyane nka APR BBC, ni ikipe y\u2019umukino w'amaboko wa Basketball yo mu Rwanda ifite icyicaro i Kigali. Itunzwe kandi igaterwa inkunga na Minisiteri y\u2019Ingabo z\u2019u Rwanda, ikina muri shampiyona y\u2019umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda (RBL) no muri Basketball Africa League (BAL) kuva mwaka wa 2024. Iyi kipe yitwa \"Lions \", ni yo kipe ifite ibikombo byinshi mu gihugu, kuko APR imaze gutwara igikombe cy\u2019igihugu inshuro 16. \nAmateka.\nIyi kipe yashinzwe mu gihe cy'intambara yo kubohora u Rwanda (RPF) mu ntambara y'abenegihugu muri 1993, kugira ngo ikore nk'uburyo bwo gushakisha no kwigarurira abasirikare mu gihe cy'imirwano yo guhagarika imirwano hagati y'ibiganiro by'amahoro byaje gutuma hashyirwaho umukono ku masezerano ya Arusha. Ku ruhande rw'ikipe ya basketball, RPF yazanye amakipe muri volleyball na football, akomeje gukora neza. \nKuva muri 1995 kugeza muri 2003, APR yatwaye ibikombe cy'igihugu icyenda cyikurikiranya. \nIkipe yatowje n'umutoza mukuru wavukiye muri Kenya, Cliff Uwuor, muri 2005. Yatwaye igikombe cya FIBA Africa Zone 5 Club Championship muri 2008, inatwara ibikombe bya shampiyona muri 2005, 2006, 2009 na 2010. \nIkipe y'abagore.\nAPR WBBC ni ikipe y'abagore y'iyi kipe ikina muri shampiyona y'abagore ya Basketball y'u Rwanda kandi yahagarariye igihugu mu gikombe cya shampiyona y'abagore ya FIBA muri Afurika cya 2022. "}
{"id": "21619", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21619", "title": "Panth\u00e8res Noires", "text": "Panth\u00e8res Noires Kigali (yashizwe 1965-1989)yari ikipe ikina shampiyona ya mbere y'umupira wamaguru i Kigali mu Rwanda.\nMuri 1980 ikipe yegukanye igikombe cya Shampiyona y'Urwanda cy'uRwanda. \nSitade.\nIkipe ikina kuri Stade Regional de Kigali.\n Amakipe y'igikombe cya Afurika cy'amakipe yatwaye ibikombe bya shampiyona yo mu 1986\u00a0\u2013 Icyiciro cya mbere\n 1980, 1984, 1985, 1986, 1987"}
{"id": "21620", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21620", "title": "Sitade regional i Nyamirambo", "text": "Sitade ya Kigali Pel\u00e9, izwi ku izina rya Sitade y'Akarere ka Nyamirambo cyangwa sitade regional i Nyamirambo, ni sitade ifite ikorerwamo ibintu bitandukanye iherereye mu gace ka Nyamirambo muri Kigali, mu Rwanda. Kuri ubu ikoreshwa mu mikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi yakira amakipe atandukanye muri Shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru mu RWanda, harimo APR FC na Rayon Sports.\nIfite ubusitani cyangwa ubwatsi bw'ubukorano kandi yakira abantu 22.000. Sitade yafashwe nk'aho idakwiriye kwakirira imikino mpuzamahanga muri 2021 n'ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru muri Afurika, ivugururwa muri Mutarama 2023 mbere y'inama ya 73 ya FIFA, yabereye i Kigali. Yongeye gufungura ku ya 15 Werurwe 2023, maze ihindurirwa izina mu rwego rwo guha icyubahiro umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru wo muri Brezili Pel\u00e9 na perezida w'u Rwanda Paul Kagame na perezida wa FIFA Gianni Infantino. \nMuri 1998, sitade yakoreshejwe mu kwica abantu bane bahamwe n'icyaha cyo kugira uruhare muri jenoside yo mu Rwanda, barimo Froduald Karamira. "}
{"id": "21622", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21622", "title": "Asamoah Gyan", "text": "Asamoah Gyan (/\u02cc \u00e6 s \u0259 \u02c8 m o\u028a \u0259 \u02c8d\u0292\u0251\u02d0n / ASS -\u0259- ASS - \u0259 JAHN ; yavutse kuri 22 Ugushyingo 1985) numukinnyi wahoze arumukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru wabigize umwuga muri Ghana wakinaga nka rutahizamu. Yahoze ari kapiteni w'ikipe y'igihugu ya Ghana. \nGyan yatangiye umwuga we muri 2003 mw' ikipe ya Liberty Professionals yo muri Ghana, atsinda ibitego icumi mumikino cumi n'itandatu. Hanyuma yamaze imyaka itatu mw' ikipe ya Serie. Yabaye ikipe ya Udinese mugihembwe cy'imyaka ibiri yatijwe muri Modena, atsinda ibitego inshuro cumi n'eshanu mumikino 53 ya shampiyona no muri Udinese aho yatsinze ibitego inshuro 11 mumikino 39 ya shampiyona. Muri 2008, Gyan yinjiye mw' ikipe ya Rennes yo muri Ligue 1, atsinda ibitego inshuro cumi n'enye mumikino mirongo ine n'umunani ya shampiyona mumyaka ibiri. Mur i2010, Gyan yinjiye mw' ikipe ya Sunderland yo muri Premier League icyo gihe, arangiza agahigo kiyikipe ko kugura abakinnyi no gutsinda ibitego inshuro icumi mumikino mirongo itatu n'ine ya Premier League mumyaka ibiri. \nMuri 2011, Gyan yinjiye muri Al Ain yomuri UAE Pro League ku nguzanyo maze aba umukinnyi wambere mugutsinda ibitego muri shampiyona, atsinda ibitego 22 mumikino 18. Mumwaka wakurikiyeho, Gyan yinjiye muri Al Ain burundu maze ayifasha kugumana igikombe cya Pro League, yongera kurangiza ari umukinnyi wambere mugutsinda ibitego muri shampiyona, atsinda ibitego 31 mumikino 22. Mu mwaka wa shampiyona wa 2013-14, Gyan yarangije arumukinnyi wambere mugutsinda ibitego byinshi ku nshuro yagatatu, atsinda ibitego 29 mumikino 26. \nGyan niwe mukinnyi wambere mubakinnyi batsinze ibitego byinshi mw'ikipe y'igihugu ya Ghana, afite ibitego 51. Yahagarariye Ghana mu bikombe by'isi bya FIFA byomuri 2006, 2010 na 2014. Afite ibitego bitandatu, niwe mukinnyi wambere mubanyafurika mu mateka y'igikombe cy'isi. Gyan yanahagarariye Ghana mumikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi ya 2004 nomu bikombe birindwi bya Afurika (2008, 2010, 2012, 2013, 2015, 2017 na 2019), ayifasha kurangiza kumwanya wagatatu muri 2008 noku mwanya wakabiri muri 2010 na 2015. Yatangije igitabo cye cy'amateka, cyitwa \"LeGYAndry\" muri Hoteli ya Kempinski Gold Coast i Accra. Kuri 20 Kamena 2023, Gyan yatangaje kasezeye mumupira w'amaguru. \nUbuzima bwite.\nGyan numuhererezi mubabyeyi be, Baffour Gyan Mensah (Se) na nyakwigendera Madamu Cecilia Amoako (Nyina). Mukuru we Baffour Gyan nawe yahoze ari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru wabigize umwuga. Gyan yashakanye na Gifty Sandra Dzamesi kandi babyaranye abana batatu, aribo Rafael Gyan, Frederick Gyan, Floyd Gyan. \nUmwuga w'ikipe.\nAbanyamwuga mu by'ubwisanzure.\nYavukiye i Accra, Gyan yize amashuri yeya mbere muri Seven Great Princess Academy i Dansoman muwi 1999, naho amashuri yisumbuye ayashyira muri Accra Academy kuva muwi 1999 kugeza muri 2002. Gyan yatangiye umwuga we mu ikipe ya Liberty Professionals yo muri Ghana iherereye i Accra. Mumwaka umwe rukumbi yamaze mw' ikipe, yakinnye imikino 16 ya shampiyona muri Ghana Premier League, anatsinda ibitego 10. Yarangije umwaka arumukinnyi wa gatatu watsinze ibitego byinshi muri shampiyona. \nUdinese.\nNyuma yogusinya amasezerano muri Udinese muri 2003, yamaze imyaka ibiri agurishijwe muri Serie B club Modena kugira ngabone ubunararibonye mumikino. Nyuma yo kwitwara neza mu gikombe cy'isi cya 2006, yakuruye ikipe yomu Burusiya ya Lokomotiv Moscow. Gyan yasubiye muri Udinese muntangiriro za 2006, ariko kuri 17 Gashyantare 2007, Udinese yakuyemo amasezerano yo kumugurisha mu idirishya ryo kugura no kugurisha mukwezi kwa Mutarama. Uyu rutahizamu yari hafi gusinya amasezerano y'imyaka itatu muri Lokomotiv Moscow Club yo mu Burusiya kuri miliyoni 10.5 z'amadolari y'Amerika, akaba ariyo mafaranga yakane mumateka y'umupira w'amaguru w'Uburusiya. Gyan yabwiye BBC Sport ati: \"Rubanda Udinese yashakaga kunsimbuza ntiyabasinyiye.\" \"Nabwiwe kubu ngomba kuguma mu Butaliyani mugihe cyose cy'umwaka.\" \nKw' itariki ya 10 Kanama 2007, hamwe na Fabio Quagliarella, Gyan yasinye amasezerano y\u2019imyaka itanu yogukomeza muri Udinese kugeza kuri 30 Kamena 2012, nk'igihembo cy\u2019uko yitwaye neza mu mikino yo kwitegura shampiyona yomuri 2007-08. Asamoah yagize ati: \"Nahisemo kuguma hano kuko ari imwe muri shampiyona zikomeye ku isi,\" ati: \"Hari amahirwe yogukina umupira w'amaguru usanzwe hano kugira ngombe umukinnyi mwiza. \"Ndishimye n'amasezerano mashya kandi nziko nshobora gufasha Udinese kugera kubintu by'ejo hazaza\". Gyan na Quagliarella bongereye amasezerano yabo batsinze ibitego bibiri buri umwe mumukino Udinese yatsinzemo ibitego 7-0 nyuma yaho kuruwo mugoroba. \nKuri 29 Nyakanga 2007, nyuma yokwitwara neza mumikino yo kwitegura shampiyona, harimono gutsinda ibitego bitatu mumukino wa gicuti bakinnye n'ikipe ya Spezia yo muri Serie B kuri 25 Nyakanga 2007, mbere yuko Udinese isezeranya amasezerano y'igihe kirekire. Gyan yatsinze ibitego umunani muri 2006-07 afasha ikipe ya Stadio Friuli kurangiza kumwanya wa 10 muri Serie A.\nGyan yakomerekejwe n'imvune mumwaka wa shampiyona womri 2007-08, ntiyasubiye kugaragara mw' ikipe ya Udinese nyuma ya Mutarama 2008, amaze gukina imikino 13 gusa muri Serie A kandi atsinda ibitego 3 muruwo mwaka w'imikino.\nRennes.\nKuri 11 Nyakanga 2008, Gyan yasinyishijwe n'ikipe ya Stade Rennais yo muri Ligue 1 mugihe cy'imyaka ine kugiciro cya miliyoni 8 z'amayero. Gyan yakinnye inshuro 48 muri Rennes, atsinda ibitego 14. Mu mpera z'ikipe yeya Rennes, yamenyekanye cyane kubera ubuhanga bwe mugutsinda ibitego, atsinda ibitego 13 muri shampiyona yomu mwaka wa 2009-10. Ariko, Gyan yakinnye imikino itatu gusa muri Ligue 1 mumwaka wakurikiyeho, bituma imikino yeyose igera kuri 53, mbere yuko yerekeza muri Sunderland.\nSunderland.\nKw'itariki 31 Kanama 2010, Gyan yasinye amasezerano y'imyaka ine n'ikipe ya Sunderland kwikipe ya miliyoni 13 z'amapawundi. Nyuma Gyan yahawe umupira wa nimero 33 muri Sunderland. Yatsinze igitego ku mukino we wa mbere Sunderland yakinaga na Wigan Athletic ku ya 11 Nzeri nyuma yo kwinjira asimbuye Danny Welbeck. Umukino warangiye banganyije 1-1, Antol\u00edn Alcaraz atsinda igitego cyokunganya cya Wigan. Yatangiye Sunderland atsinda igitego kimwe rukumbi ubwo bavaga mu gikombe cya League Cup batsinzwe na West Ham United. Gyan yatsinze igitego bibiri kumukino wewa mbere wa Premier League muriyi kipe ubwo batsindaga Stoke City ibitego 2-0 ku ya 6 Ugushyingo. Igitego cyecya mbere cyabonetse kumunota wa 9 ubwo umunyezamu Asmir Begovi\u0107 yateraga Nedum Onuoha ishoti, Gyan ari kumwe nawe agatsinda igitego cyokwisubiraho, naho icya kabiri cyabonetse ku munota wa 86, bituma \"Black Cats\" itsinda ibitego 2-0. Nyuma y'iminsi itatu, yakurikiyeho atsinda igitego cyokunganya na Tottenham kuri White Hart Lane mu mukino banganyije 1-1 ubwo Sunderland yazamukaga ku mwanya wakarindwi kurutonde. Yanatsinze igitego mumukino Sunderland yatsinze 3-0 kuri Stamford Bridge na Chelsea. Gyan yatsinze igitego cyagatatu cya Sunderland mumukino batsinze Blackburn Rovers 3-0 kuya 1 Mutarama 2011. \nKuri 16 Mutarama 2011, yatangiye gukina n'ikipe ya Newcastle United yo mugace, ayitsinda igitego cyo kunganya kumunota wa 94, bituma Newcastle ibona intsinzi yayo yakabiri y'umwaka w'imikino ubwo bakinaga na Sunderland. Gyan yongeye gutsinda ibitego byinshi ubwo yatsindaga igitego hanze ya Stoke City kuya 5 Gashyantare 2011. Yatsinze igitego kumunota wa 11 ubwo bakinaga na Tottenham kuri 12 Gashyantare 2011. Igitego gikurikiyeho cya Gyan cyaje kuri 23 Mata ubwo Sunderland yatsindaga Wigan Athletic ibitego 4-2, umukino warangiye mbere y'igihe kuruyu mukinnyi kuko yasimbuwe nyuma y'imvune y'akaguru byitezwe ko azabura shampiyona isigaye. Gyan yakize neza ku gihe kugira ngo yinjire mumukino wa nyuma wa Sunderland muruyu mwaka w'imikino muri West Ham ariko ntabwo yongeyeho amanota yeyo kurangiza umwaka wewa mbere mumupira w'amaguru w'Ubwongereza afite ibitego 10 muri shampiyona. Gyan yatwaye umupira wa 3 mu mwaka w'imikino wa 2011-12, umubare w'ikipe yambaye muri Ghana.\nAl Ain.\nKw' itariki ya 10 Nzeri 2011, byemejwe kurubuga rwa Sunderland ko Gyan azagenda ku nguzanyo y'umwaka wose mw' ikipe ya Al Ain FC. Mu gihe hari havugwaga amafaranga agera kuri miliyoni 6 z'amapawundi yishyuwe mu gihe cy'inguzanyo, aho Gyan yahabwaga umushahara we wa mbere inshuro enye, Perezida Niall Quinn yashimangiye inyungu z'amafaranga z'amasezerano kuri Sunderland n'umukinnyi. Uyu munya Ghana yarangije shampiyona ari kumwe na Al Ain ayifasha gutsinda imikino ya shampiyona kunshuro yacumi, kandi niwe watsinze ibitego byinshi muri shampiyona, atsinda ibitego 22 muri shampiyona.\nUbwo Martin O'Neill yabaga umutoza wa Sunderland kw'itariki 8 Ukuboza 2011, yatekereje kuburyo bwo kwirukana Gyan mu ikipe ye yatijwe. \nGyan yasinye amasezerano y'imyaka itanu muri Al Ain kuya 6 Nyakanga 2012, afite agaciro karenga miliyoni 6 z'amapawundi kuriburi mwaka w'imikino. Niwe watsinze ibitego byinshi muri shampiyona ya UAE mu mwaka w'imikino womuri 2013, kandi yafashije ikipeye kugumana igikombe cya shampiyona. Kuri 24 Nyakanga 2014, Gyan yatangaje ku rubuga rwe bwite koyasinye amasezerano yokongera amasezerano muri Al-Ain, ahabwa amasezerano meza kandi amuhuza n'iyi kipe kugeza muri 2018. \nShanghai SIPG.\nKw' itariki ya 7 Nyakanga 2015, Gyan yemeje ku rubuga rwe bwite ko yavuye muri Al Ain kandi ko yagombaga kujya mw' ikipe ya Shanghai SIPG yo mu Bushinwa. Shanghai SIPG yatangaje ku mugaragaro ko yasinyishije Gyan avuye muri Al Ain amafaranga atatangajwe. Hanyuma byagaragaye kumushahara waburi cyumweru wa Gyan ungana na \u00a3227.000 mw' ikipe yeyo muBushinwa wahise umugira umwe mubakinnyi bahembwa neza kw' isi. \nKayserispor.\nKwi tariki 5 Nyakanga 2017, yinjiye mw' ikipe ya Kayserispor yo muri Turukiya. Kuya 9 Kanama 2019, Gyan yavuye muri Kayserispor. \nAmajyaruguru y'Uburasirazuba bw'Isi.\nKuri 19 Nzeri 2019, yinjiye mw' ikipe ya NorthEast United yomuri Indian Super League. Kuri 26 Ukwakira 2019, yatsinze igitego cyecya mbere mw' ikipe ya Northeast United FC ubwo bakinaga na Odisha FC kumunota wa 84 w'umukino ubwo ikipeye yatsindaga umukino kubitego 2-1. Hagati mumwaka w'imikino, yagize imvune yatumye adakina shampiyona yose, maze kuri 15 Mutarama 2020, avanwa muriyi kipe ku mugaragaro, rutahizamu w'umunya-Ireland Andy Keogh asimburwa nk'umusimbura. Yarangije igihe cyemuri Northeast United atsinda ibitego 4 mumikino 8.\nImijyi ya Legon.\nKuri 1 Ugushyingo 2020, Gyan yagarutse muri Ghana ajya mw' ikipe ya Legon Cities, munguzanyo irenga miliyoni imwe y'amadolari. Yakinnye umukino wewa mbere kuri 27 Ugushyingo 2020, aza gukina ku munota wa 71 atsinze Raphael Ocloo mumukino banganya na Medeama kubusa, birangira amaze imyaka 17 agarutse muri Ghana Premier League kuva yava mw' ikipe yeya Liberty Professionals akiri muto, asinya mw'ikipe ya Udinese yomu Butaliyani. Kuya 3 Kamena 2021, Gyan yatangiye umukino wewa mbere mw' ikipe ya \"Royals\" mu mukino wa shampiyona ya FA Cup ya Ghana yo mu 2021 bakina na Uncle 'T', warangiye batsinze ibitego 2-1 kuri Accra Sports Stadium kugitego cya Richmond Antwi. \nIkiruhuko cy'izabukuru.\nGyan yatangaje kasezeye mumupira w'amaguru kuri 20 Kamena 2023, ibibikaba byararangiye mumyaka makumyabiri yamaze akina umupira w'amaguru. Iri tangazo ryabereye munama ngarukamwaka ya 30 ya Afreximbank yabereye mu kigo mpuzamahanga cy'inama cya Accra. \nItangazo rya Gyan ryo gusezera kukazi ryeryagaragaje kigihe cyari kigeze ngo asezera kumwuga we ukomeye wogukina, yemera iterambere risanzwe abakinnyi bose b'umupira w'amaguru bahura naryo. Yashimiye igihugu cye, umuryango we, bagenzi be, n'abandi bose bagize uruhare mu ugendo rwe rw'umupira w'amaguru. Gyan yanagaragaje kafite intego yogukomeza kwitabira uyumukino, yibanda ku gutoza, ubucuruzi bw'umupira w'amaguru, nogushakisha, mugihe akomeje guteza imbere impano z'abana bato, nk'uko bigaragazwa n'uruhare rwe ruherutse mw' irushanwa rya Afurika rya Baby Jet U16. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nGyan yakinnye umukino wewa mbere mpuzamahanga afite imyaka 17, iminsi itatu mbere y'isabukuru ye y'imyaka 18. Gyan yatsinze igitego mumukino wewa mbere mpuzamahanga mw' ikipe ya Ghana bakinnye na Somalia kuri 19 Ugushyingo 2003, kumunota wa 90. Yaje mu mwanya wa Nana Arhin Duah kumunota wa 77 mu mukino wo gushaka itike yo gukina igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cyo mu 2006, iminsi itatu mbere y'uko yuzuza imyaka 18; afasha Ghana gutsinda uwomukino, kandi aba umukinnyi muto kurusha abandi bose batsinze igitego muri Ghana. \nYatsinze ibitego bine mumikino irindwi mugihe cyo gushaka itike yokujya mgikombe cy'isi, afasha Ghana kwegukana itike yokujya mugikombe cy'isi cya mbere mumateka. Yari mw' ikipe ya Ghana Olempike yo mu 2004, yavuye mu cyiciro cya mbere, arangije ari kumwanya wa gatatu mw' itsinda rya B. \nYanatsinze igitego cyihuta cyane mw' irushanwa nyuma y'amasegonda 68. Igitego cya mbere cya Ghana mu gikombe cy'isi cya FIFA, cyaje mu mukino bakinnye na Repubulika ya Tch\u00e8que kuri 17 Kamena kuri RheinEnergieStadion i Cologne, mu Budage, cyatumye Black Stars itsinda ibitego 2-0. Yahushije penaliti nyuma y'umukino, maze abona ikarita y'umuhondo imubuza gukina umukino wanyuma mumatsinda kubera kugerageza gufata penaliti hakiri kare cyane. Mu mukino Ghana yatsinzwe na Brezili mu cyiciro cya 16, yirukanwe kumunota wa 81 nyuma yokubona penaliti yakabiri mumukino (yo kwibira). \nKw' itariki ya 24 Mutarama 2008, mu gikombe cya Afurika, Gyan na murumuna we Baffour bahisemo kuva muri Black Stars nyuma yokunengwa nyuma yogutsinda Namibia igitego 1-0. Itangazamakuru ryamenye kabo bavandimwe bari bapakuruye imizigo yabo kandi ko biteguye kuva muri hoteli y'ikipe ariko bagenzi babo barabingingaga. Mu gikombe cya Afurika cya 2010, Asamoah Gyan yafashije ikipe ya Ghana, yari yakomerekejwe n'imvune mumikino yanyuma. Gyan yatsinze ibitego bitatu muribine bya Ghana mw' irushanwa.\nGyan yatsinze penaliti kumunota wa 85 w'umukino wambere wa Ghana mu gikombe cy'isi cya 2010 ubwo yakinaga na Seribiya igitego 1-0. Yakubise izamu kumunota wa 92 mbere yo gusimbuzwa amashyi menshi mbere gato y'uko ifirimbi ya nyuma irangira. Mumukino wa kabiri wa Ghana, yatsinze penaliti kumunota wa 26 kugira ngangane amanota maze ikipe yibone amanota 1-1 na Ositaraliya. \nMumukino wa 1/8 cya shampiyona bakinnye na Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, yatsinze igitego mu minota y'inyongera bituma Ghana itsinda ibitego 2-1 bityo iba ikipe yagatatu ya Afurika mumateka yemerewe kugera muri kimwe cyakane cy'irushanwa, nyuma ya Kameruni na Senegal. Mumukino wa 1/4 cya shampiyona bakinnye na Uruguay, nyuma y'uko Luis Su\u00e1rez afashe umupira kumurongo w'izamu, yahushije penaliti nta mwanya usigaye mu minota y'inyongera, akubita umupira ku rutare rw'izamu bituma biba ngombwa ko hafatwa penaliti kugira ngo hamenyekane umukino. Yahinduye penaliti ye muminota yakurikiyeho, ariko Uruguay ikomeza gutsinda penaliti 4-2. \nKunshuro ya kabiri mmwuga we, Gyan yabuze penaliti ikomeye mw' irushanwa rikomeye ubwo yatsindwaga penaliti mumukino wa 1/2 w'igikombe cya Afurika cya 2012. Ghana yakomeje gutsindwa igitego 1-0. Nyuma yokubura penaliti, Gyan yahisemo \"kuruhuka burundu\" mu mupira w'amaguru mpuzamahanga. Kuya 8 Gicurasi 2012, yatangaje koyagarutse mw' ikipe ya Black Stars. \nKw' itariki ya 7 Kamena 2013, yatsinze ibitego 2 mumukino batsinzemo Sudani ibitego 3-1 mumukino wo gushaka itike yogukina igikombe cy'isi, bituma abumukinnyi wambere mu gutsinda ibitego byinshi muricyo gihugu, arusha ibitego 33 bya Abedi Pele. \nKw' itariki ya 2 Kamena 2014, Gyan yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Ghana izakina igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cya 2014. Mumukino wambere w'ikipe, yayoboye Black Stars batsinzwe na Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika ibitego 2-1. Yatsinze igitego cyecya mbere muriryo rushanwa ubwobanganyaga n'Ubudage ibitego 2-2, anganya agahigo ka Roger Milla k'ibitego bitanu bya FIFA mu gikombe cy'isi. Mu mukino wanyuma w'amatsinda, yabaye umukinnyi wambere w'umunyafurika mumateka y'igikombe cy'isi atsinda igitego cya Black Stars ubwo batsindwaga na Porutugali ibitego 2-1. \nMu gikombe cya Afurika cya 2015, Gyan yasibye umukino wambere wa Ghana, batsinzwe na Senegal ibitego 2-1, ndetse arwara malariya \"itari yoroshye\". Yagarutse kumukino wakabiri, atsinda igitego cy'intsinzi kumunota wanyuma batsinze Algeria ikipe ikundwa mw' irushanwa mumukino batsinze Black Stars igitego 1-0. Guhunga mpuzamahanga kwamaze umwaka urenga byarangiye mu Ukwakira 2018 ubwo Gyan yahamagarwaga mw' ikipe ya Ghana mumikino ibiri yo gushaka itike yo gukina Igikombe cya Afurika cya 2019 na Sierra Leone. \nYatangaje ko asezeye mumupira w'amaguru mpuzamahanga kuri 20 Gicurasi 2019, ukwezi kumwe mbere y'uko igikombe cya Afurika cya 2019 kibera. Ariko, nyuma y'umunsi umwe Gyan yahinduye icyemezo cyenyuma yokuganira na perezida wa Ghana, Nana Addo Dankwa Akufo-Addo. Muntangiriro za Kanama 2022, Gyan yasohoye itangazo rivuga koyari arimo gukora imyitozo kugira ngo asubire ku buzima bwiza kugira ngakine igikombe cy'isi cyomuri 2022 muri Qatar. Gyan ntiyari mw' ikipe y'abakinnyi 26 batoranyijwe guhagararira Ghana mugikombe cy'isi cya 2022 kandi kuva icyo gihe yari umufana ukomeye wa Black Stars kandi akaba yarayoboye amaserukiramuco n'imihango y'abafana. Gyan yasezeye nk'umukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi muri Ghana, atsinda ibitego 51 mu mikino 109 yakinnye mugihugu cye. Yanasezeye kumwanya wewo kuba umukinnyi w\u2019umunyafurika watsinze ibitego byinshi mumateka y\u2019igikombe cy\u2019isi, aho yatsinze ibitego bitandatu.\nUmupira w'amaguru wo hanze.\nKwamamaza umukino w'iteramakofe.\nMuri Kamena 2012, Gyan yibanze kukuzamura umupira w'amaguru maze atangaza kazakorera igitaramo cyecya mbere cy'umukino w'iteramakofe muri Ghana. Kuya 6 Nyakanga 2012, Asamoah Gyan yagize ati:\nMuri Gashyantare 2021, amasezerano hagati ya Baby Jet Promotions na Emmanuel Tagoe warumukinnyi w\u2019iteramakofe wenyine muriyi promotion yaraseswaga. Amasezerano yariay\u2019igihe kuvamu Ukwakira 2018 kugeza mu Gushyingo 2021. \nIsosiyete y'indege ya Baby Jet.\nGuhera mu Ukwakira 2017, Asamoah Gyan yahawe \"uruhushya rwo gutwara ibintu mukirere\" (ACL) n'Ikigo gishinzwe iby'indege za gisivili muri Ghana (GCAA). Nk'uko bivugwa n'Ibiro Ntaramakuru bya Ghana, ururuganda rushya rwitwa Baby Jet Airlines. Hamwe n'uruhushya muntoki, ururuganda rushya ubu rwemerewe gutangirana n'urugendo rwarwo rwokwemeza korufite uburenganzira bwogutwara ibintu mu kirere (AOC). \nTenisi.\nYatangiye gukina Tennis muri 2020 kugira ngo akomeze kugira ubuzima bwiza nyuma y'ikiruhuko kirekire kubera imvune. Baby Jet promotions yahujwe na MANCWA Commodities kugira ngitware irushanwa rya Top 16 Invitational murwego rwo guteza imbere siporo. \nIbyubahiro.\nRennes\nAl Ain\nShabab Al Ahli\nGana\nUmuntu ku giti cye\nInyandiko"}
