{"id": "21624", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21624", "title": "2023 BAL final", "text": "Umukino wanyuma wa BAL wo mu 2023 wari umukino wa shampiyona y'umwaka wa 2023 wa BAL, umwaka wagatatu wa Basketball Africa League (BAL), kandi wasoje imikino ya nyuma. Umukino wanyuma wakinwe kuya 27 Gicurasi 2023 muri BK Arena i Kigali, mu Rwanda, mu mwaka wa gatatu wikurikiranya. Umukino wanyuma wahuje ikipe yomuri Misiri Al Ahly n'ikipe yo muri Senegali AS Douanes.\nAl Ahly yegukanyigikombe cyayocyambere nyumayogutsinda AS Douanes amanota 80\u201365 ku nshuro yambere ya BAL ndetse n'igikombe cyakabiri cy'umugabane w'Afurika, nyuma y'igikombe cya FIBA Africa Club Champions Cup mu 2016. Umutoza mukuru wa Al Ahly August\u00ed Julbe yabaye umutoza wa mbere wegukanye igikombe cya BAL inshuro ebyiri, mu gihe Nuni Omot yagizwe umukinnyi w'agaciro kurusha abandi (MVP) muri shampiyona nyuma y'umukino.\nNk\u2019abatwaye igikombe cya BAL, Al Ahly yegukanye itike yokwitabira igikombe cya FIBA Intercontinental Cup cya 2023, ahoyarangije ariyakane.\nAmakipe.\nMumbonerahamwe ikurikira, imikino yanyuma muri FIBA Africa Clubs Champions Cup irimu nyuguti nto. Amakipe yombiyagaragaye bwambere muri BAL Final. Al Ahly yari yakinnye umukino wa nyuma wa FIBA ACC inshuro eshatu mbere, kandi yatsinze rimwemu 2016. AS Douanes ntiyigeze igaragara mumukino wanyuma wa'Afurika, kandi ni yo kipe ya mbere yakinnye umukino wa nyuma wa Afurika kuva kuri Jeanne d'Arc imyaka 31 mbereyaho (mu 1992). \nAho bizabera.\nIkibuga cya BK Arena cyakoreshejwe nk'ikibuga cyakirimikino yanyuma ndetse n'icya nyuma mu mwaka wagatatu wikurikiranya, hakurikijwamasezerano BAL yagiranye na Minisiteri y'Imikino mu Rwanda.\nInyuma.\nAl Ahly.\nAl Ahly yujujibisabwa mumwaka wa 2023 ubwoyegukanaga shampiyona y\u2019icyiciro cya mbere cya Basketball yomu Misiri ya 2021-22, nyumayogutsinda Al Ittihad Alexandria ku mukino wa nyuma. Ikipe izwi ku rwego rw\u2019umugabane w\u2019Afurika, uyuwarumwaka wayo wambere muri BAL iyobowe n\u2019umutoza August\u00ed Julbe. Julbe yari yamaze gutwara shampiyona ya BAL mu 2021 ari kumwe na Zamalek. Iyikipe yaguze rutahizamu womuri Sudani y\u2019Epfo Nuni Omot, ndetse n\u2019umuzamu w\u2019umunyamerika Michael Thompson, wavuye mukiruhuko cy\u2019izabukuru muri BAL. Mu nama yabereye i Cairo, Al Ahly yatsinzimikino inemuri itanu. Mumukino na Petro de Luanda, yatsinzwe n\u2019umukino uvunacyane.\nHagati y\u2019icyiciro cy\u2019amatsinda n\u2019imikino yanyuma ya BAL, Al Ahly yegukanyigikombe cyakarindwi cya Misiri nyumayo gutsinda Al Ittihad Alexandria muri shampiyona y\u2019igihugu ya Basketball yomu 2022-23.\nMbere y'imikinoyanyuma y'imikino, Al Ahly yongeyimbaraga mwikipe yabikoresheje Michael Fakuade, wari warakiniye iyi kipe mu 2021. Nyumayogutsinda ikipe yomu Rwanda REG mu gice cya kane cy'irangiza, Al Ahly yatsinze ikipe yomuri Mali Stade Malien mugice cya kabiri cy'irangiza nyuma y'amanota 21 ya Ehab Amin.\nAS Douanes.\nAS Douanes yinjiye mumwaka wa 2023 nyumayogutwara igikombe cya Senegal mumwaka wa 2022, igaruka nyuma y'umwaka umwe idakinamuri shampiyona. Douanes, iyobowe n'umutoza mukuru Pabi Gueye kuva mu 2013, yaguze Chris Crawford na Terrell Stoglin nk'abakinnyi b'Abanyamerika baturutse hanze. Crawford yari amaze imyaka ibiri akina muri BAL, Stoglin akabariwe watwayigikombe cya BAL inshurebyiri.\nIkipe yatsinzwimikino ibiryambere y'umwaka w'imikino, nyumayahwikipe yasezereye Stoglin mu ikipeyayo. Nyumay'ibi, Douanes yatsinzimikino itatu yikurikiranya ndetsibasha kwemererwa kujya mu mikino ya nyuma nyuma yo gutsinda ikipe ya US Monastir kumunsi wanyuma w'umukino. Yanasezereye Monastir, mazikomeza ishingiye kumukino wahujamakipe atanu afite agahigo kogutsinda 3-2. \nMu mikino ya Playoffs ya BAL yomu 2023, Douanes yatsinze Ferrovi\u00e1rio da Beira byoroshye, mbere yo guhura na Petro de Luanda wariwabaye uwakabiri muri \u00bd cy'irangiza. Nyuma y'amanota 28 ya Jean Jacques Boissy n'amanota 26 ya Crawford, Douanes yatsinze ikipe y'Angola muburyo bwafatwaga nk'intsinzi itangaje. Kwitariki ya 26 Gicurasi, umunsumwe mbere y'umukino wa nyuma, Pabi Gueye yatorewe kuba umutoza w'umwaka wa BAL. \nIgitaramo cya nyuma y'igice cy'umunsi.\nIgitaramo cyakozwe mugice cyakabiri cyakozwe na Bruce Melodie, Pheelz na DJ Neptune. \nUmukino.\nIncamake.\nKhaman Maluach yatangijumukino muri AS Douanes, niwemukinnyi mutowatangiye umukino wa shampiyona ya BAL afite imyaka 16. Chris Crawford womuri AS Douanes yatangijumukino n'amanota atatu yatumye Abanyasenegali batsinda 3-0. Amr Zahran wa Al Ahly yasubije umupira n'amanota atatu ubwo Abanyamisiri banganyaga, kuko AS Douanes yayoboye amasegonda 23 kuko Al Ahly itashoboraga kuva aho iri. Nyuma y'uko Nuni Omot atsinze igitego, Al Ahly iyoboye 17-10 nyuma y'igice cya mbere cy'amanota make. \nMugice cyagatatu, Abanyegiputa batsinzibitego bibiri byatsinzwe na Corey Webster na Ehab Amin, bituma batsinda amanota 13. Igicecyagatatu cyarangiye Al Ahly iyoboyeneza amanota 17 kuri 63\u201346. AS Douanes yatsinze amanota abiri gusa yatsinzwe mumukinowose, inatsinda ibitego 6% gusa, itsinda bibirigusa munshuro 31 yagerageje. Chris Crawford, waruyoboye Douanes mugutsinda ibitego byinshi, yatsinzwe amanota 9 gusa n'izamu rya Al Ahly. \nIbisobanuro birambuye.\nAl Ahly yabayikipe ya gatatu murirusange, ndetse n'ikipe ya kabiri yomu Misiri yegukanye igikombe cya BAL, nyuma ya Zamalek mu 2021. August\u00ed Julbe yabayumutoza wambere wegukanye ibikombe bibiri bya BAL, nyuma y'igikombe cyemuri Zamalek mu 2021. Umukinnyi wambere Michael Fakuade yabayumukinnyi wa kabiri wegukanye ibikombe bibiri bya BAL, nyuma ya Solo Diabate. \nNuni Omot wa Al Ahly, watsinzamanota 22 menshi kumukino wanyuma, yagizwumukinnyi w\u2019agaciro kanini muri BAL nyumay\u2019umukino. Chris Crawford na Jean Jacques Boissy barinze ikipe ya AS Douanes bashyizwe mu ikipe ya mbere ya All-BAL, baba abakinnyi ba mbere muri iyo kipe batoranyijwemurikigihembo. \nNk\u2019umukinnyi watsinze umukino wanyuma, Al Ahly yegukanye itikeyokwitabira igikombe cya FIBA Intercontinental Cup muri Singapuru mu 2023. Mugikombe cya Intercontinental, Al Ahly yubatse amatekibikipe yambere y'Afurika itsinze umukino nyumayo gutsinda NBA G League Ignite ku ya 21 Nzeri. Yarangije iri ku mwanya wa kane mu makipe atandatu. "}
{"id": "21625", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21625", "title": "2026 African Men's Handball Championship", "text": "Shampiyona y'Umupira w'Amaboko w'Abagabo yomu 2026 yariy'inshuroya 27 y'Irushanwa ry'Umupira w'Amaboko w'Abagabo ry'Abagabo ry'Abagabo, shampiyona mpuzamahanga y'Umupira w'Amaboko w'Abagabo yomur'Afurika ibaburimyakibiri yateguwe na CAHB. Iri rushanwa ryabaye kuvakuya 21 kugeza ku ya 31 Mutarama 2026 i Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nNubwa mberemumateka shampiyona itegurwa n'u Rwanda, ndetse nubwambere shampiyona ibera mur'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba.\nYabayirushanwa ry'Afurika ryogushaka itikeyo kwitabira shampiyona y'isi y'umukino w'intoki w'abagabo yo mu 2027 mu Budage, ahibihugu bitanu byambere byaje mucyiciro cyambere.\nMisiri yatwayigikombe inshureshatu, iherutsegutsinda Alijeriya amanota 29-21 kumukino wa nyumawabereye i Cairo mu 2024. Yarwanye igikombe itsinze Tuniziya. \nAhantu habera.\nIrirushanwa rizabera i Kigali mubibuga bibiri.\nIgishushanyo.\nTombola yabaye saa 17:30 UTC+02:00 kuya 14 Ugushyingo 2025 kuri Sitade Amahoro, i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Tombola yatangiye, ukozikurikirana, amakipe 4, 3, 2 na 1, burikipe igatoranywa hanyumigashyirwa mwitsinda ryambere riboneka hakurikijwe inyuguti z'urutonde.\nIcyiciro cya mbere.\n\"Ibihe byose ni ibyo mu gace utuyemo (UTC+2).\"\nIbikoresho byo gukata imbunda.\nMucyiciro cy'amatsinda, amakipakurikirana hakurikijwe amanota (amanota 2 kwintsinzi, inota 1 ku banganyije, amanota 0 ku itsindwa). Nyumayo kurangizicyiciro cy'amatsinda, nibamakipe abiri cyangwa menshi afite amanota angana, urutonde ruzagenwa ku buryo bukurikira:\nIyohamenyekanye urutonde rw'imwe muri izi kipe, ibipimo byavuzwe haruguru bikurikizwa uko bikurikirana kugeza igihehamenyekanye urutonde rw'amakipe yose. Iyontarutonde rushobora kumenyekana, icyemezo cyafashwe na CAHB binyuze mu gutombora tombola.\nIcyiciro cy'ingenzi.\nAmanota n'ibitego byabonetse mu itsinda ry'ibanze n'amakipe azazamuka bizimurirwa mu cyiciro cy'ibanze.\nIgice cya nyuma.\nUdukingirizo.\nAgace ka 5\u20138 k'umwanya"}
{"id": "21626", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21626", "title": "2022 African Men's Youth Handball Championship", "text": "Shampiyona y'Umupira w'Amaboko w'Abagabo yomu 2022 yabereye i Kigali, mu Rwanda kuvakuya 30 Kanama kugeza kuya 6 Nzeri 2022. Yanabayirushanwa ryogushakisha itike yo gukina shampiyona y'Umupira w'Amaboko w'Abagabo yomu 2023.\nMisiri yegukanyigikombe itsinze u Rwanda amanota 51-29, naho Maroc itsinda u Burundi amanota 41-34 itwarumudari wa bronze. Bityo, u Burundi n'u Rwanda byegukanye imidari yabyoyambere ndetse n'iyambere mwirushanwa ry'umupira w'intoki kurwego rw'abagabo.\nIgishushanyo.\nTombola yabaye kuya 22 Nyakanga 2022 kubiro bikuru by'ishyirahamwe ry'umukino wa Handball mur'Afurika i Abidjan, muri Cote d'Ivoire. \nIcyiciro cya mbere.\n\"Ibihe byose ni ibyo mu gace utuyemo (UTC+2).\""}
{"id": "21628", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21628", "title": "2016 African Nations Championship", "text": "Irushanwa ry\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika ryo muri 2016, rizwi kandi mu magambo make nka CHAN ya 2016 nomu rwego rwo gutera inkunga nk\u2019irushanwa ry\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika rya Orange, ryarirushanwa rya kane ry\u2019irushanwa ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru rya buri myaka ibiri ryateguwe na CAF ririmo amakipe y\u2019ibihugu agizwe n\u2019abakinnyi bakina mu mashampiyona y\u2019ibihugu byabo. Ryabereye mu Rwanda kuva kuri 16 Mutarama kugeza kuri 7 Gashyantare 2016. \nIkipe ya Libiya yatwaye igikombe cyakabiri ntiyabashije kwegukana iki cyiciro. Nicyo cyiciro cyambere cyagaragayemo imikino ya \u00bd igizwe n'amakipe 4 yose, naho iyanyuma iterwa inkunga na Orange, ikipe ikomeye muby'ingufu na peteroli mu Bufaransa Total yari igiye gusimbura iyimikino kuva mu cyiciro gikurikiraho. \nImpamyabushobozi.\nU Rwanda rwinjiye mucyiciro cyambere muburyo bwikora nk'icyakira imikino, aho imyanya isigaye igenwa n'amajonjora yabaye hagati ya Kamena na Ukwakira 2015. \nAhantu habera.\nCAF yemeje ibibuga 4 byatanzwe n'ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru mu Rwanda. \nAmatsinda.\nAmakipe yose yari agizwe n'abakinnyi batarenze 23. \nTombola y'iri rushanwa yabaye kuri 15 Ugushyingo 2015, amasaha 72 mbere y'uko byari biteganyijwe, saa 18:30 CAT (UTC+2), i Kigali. Amakipe 16 yashyizwe mumatsinda ane y'abantu bane. \nAmakipe yatoranyijwe hashingiwe ku bisubizo yakuye mubyiciro 3 byabanje: 2009 (yakubye inshuro 1), 2011 (yakubye inshuro 2) na 2014 (yakubye inshuro 3): \nHashingiwe kuburyo bwavuzwe haruguru, inkono enye zatanzwe ku buryo bukurikira:\nIcyiciro cy'itsinda.\nAmakipe abiri ya mbere muri buri tsinda yageze kucyiciro cya 16.\nAmakipe yashyizwe kurutonde hakurikijwe amanota (amanota 3 kuntsinzi, inota 1 kubanganyije, amanota 0 ku itsindwa). Iyo amanota angana, amanota yokunganya yashyirwa kurutonde rukurikira: \nIbihe byose byaribyo mugace; CAT (UTC+2). \nItsinda A.\n----\u00a0\nItsinda B.\n----\u00a0\u00a0\nItsinda C.\n----\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\nItsinda D.\n----\u00a0\u00a0\nIcyiciro cya Knockout.\nMucyiciro cyogukuranamo, iyomukino wabaga unganya igihe gisanzwe cyogukina, hakinwaga igihe cy'inyongera (iminota 15 buri kimwe) hanyuma, byaba ngombwa, hagakurikiraho gutera imipira iturutse ku kimenyetso cya penaliti kugira ngohamenyekane uwatsinze, uretse umukino w'uwa gatatu aho nt gihe cy'inyongera cyakinwaga. \nUdukingirizo.\n----\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\nIgice cya kabiri.\n----\u00a0\u00a0\nUmusozo.\n&lt;time&gt;7\u00a0Gashyantare\u00a02016\u00a0(2016-02-07)&lt;/time&gt; &lt;time&gt;18:30&lt;/time&gt;\nAbatsinze ibitego.\nDore urutonde rw'abatsinze ibitego. \nIbihembo.\nDore urutonde rw'ibihembo byatanzwe hepfo. \nUrutonde rwa nyuma.\nHasi ni urutonde rwa nyuma. "}
