{"id": "21631", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21631", "title": "FIBA AfroBasket 2021", "text": "FIBA AfroBasket 2021 yarirushanwa rya 30 rya FIBA AfroBasket, shampiyona y'abagabo ya basketball kumugabane w'Afurika. Irirushanwa ryakiriwen'u Rwanda ku nshuro ya mbere. Byari biteganyijwe ko rizaba hagati ya tariki ya 17 na 29 Kanama 2021, arikoryimuriwe inyuma icyumweru kimwe kubera icyorezo cya COVID-19, rishyirwa kuya 24 Kanama kugeza kuya 5 Nzeri 2021. \nIrirushanwa ryariririmo amakipe 16, aho Sudani y'Epfo yatangiriye kwirushanwa ry'AfroBasket. Tuniziya niyo yari ifite igikombe cy'izamu, imaze kwegukana irushanwa rya 2017 kandiyarwanye igikombecyayo itsinze Ivory Coast kunshuro yanyuma, naho Senegal yegukanumudari wa bronze. \nGuhitamo abashyitsi.\nMuri Kamena 2019, Afurika FIBA yatangaje ku Rwanda rwakiriye 2021 FIBA AfroBasket irenga amasokoya Senegali, Coryte d'Ivoire, na DR Congo. \nAho bizabera.\nIrushanwaryose ryabereye muri Kigali Arena, ryafunguwe muri Kanama 2019. Ninaryo rushanwa rinini cyaneryo munzu mur'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba.\nImpamyabushobozi.\nAmarushanwa yatangiye mu 2020, ahoamakipe icyenda yitabiriye imikino ibanziriza irushanwa, harimo n'amakipe ane yakuwe mumikino yoguhatanira itike y'igikombe cy'isi cy'Afurika cya 2019. U Rwanda rwakiriye imikino rwitabiriye imikinoy'AfroBasket 2021.\nIgishushanyo.\nTombora yabaye ku ya 28 Gicurasi 2021. \nIcyiciro cya mbere.\nGahunda yashyizwe ahagaragara ku ya 8 Kamena 2021. \n\"Ibihe byose ni ibyo mu gace utuyemo (UTC+2).\"\nUrutonde rwa nyuma.\nInkomoko: \nImibare n'ibihembo.\nIbihembo.\nIbihembo byatangajwe ku ya 5 Nzeri 2021. "}
{"id": "21632", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21632", "title": "2015\u201316 Rwanda National Football League Rwanda 2015\u201316", "text": "Shampiyona y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru y'u Rwanda yomu 2015-16, izwi nka Azam Rwanda Premier League kubera impamvu z'ubuterankunga, ni shampiyona ya 39 y'umupira w'amaguru ukomeye mu Rwanda. Shampiyona yatangiye kuri 18 Nzeri 2015 irangira kuri 17 Nyakanga 2016, APR yegukana igikombe cyayo cyagatatu yikurikiranya n'icya 16 muri rusange, byose mugihe cy'imyaka 22.\nRayon Sports yarangije ku mwanya wakabiri muguhatanira itike yo kwitabira CAF Confederation Cup 2017 mugihe Rwamagana City na Muhanga zarangije kumwanya wa 15 na 16, uko bikurikirana, kandi zizamanuka mu cyiciro cya kabiri cy\u2019u Rwanda mumwaka w\u2019imikino wa 2016-17.\nAmakipe.\nAmakipe 16 yose hamwe azahatanira iyi shampiyona nyuma y\u2019uko yazamutse iva kuri 14 mumwaka wa 2014-15. Isonga yamanukiraga mu cyiciro cya kabiri nyuma yo kurangiza kumwanya wa 14. Bugesera, Muhanga na Rwamagana City zose namakipe mashya yiyongereye muri irirushanwa uyumwaka.\nIbisubizo.\nAmakipe yose akina muburyo bwa robin double round (murugo no hanze)."}
{"id": "21633", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21633", "title": "2016\u201317 Rwanda National Football League Rwanda 2016\u201317", "text": "Shampiyona y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru y'u Rwanda yo muri 2016-17, izwi nka Azam Rwanda Premier League kubera impamvu z'ubuterankunga, ni shampiyona ya 40 y'umupira w'amaguru womu cyiciro cyambere mu Rwanda. Shampiyona yatangiye kuri 14 Ukwakira 2016 irangira kuri 15 Kamena 2017. "}
{"id": "21634", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21634", "title": "2024 Rwanda Challenger", "text": "\u00a0Irushanwarya Tennis rya 2024 Rwanda Challenger ryarirushanwa rya Tennis ryakinwekubibuga by'ibumba. Ryarirushanwa ryambere ryabayemwirushanwa rya ATP Challenger Tour rya 2024. Ryabereye i Kigali, mu Rwanda, hagatiya tarikiya 26 Gashyantare na 2 Werurwe 2024.\nAbitabiriye tombola y'ibanze mu bakinnyi b'ingaragu.\nAbandi binjira.\nAbakinnyi bakurikira bahawe amakarita y\u2019ibanga mu mukino w\u2019ibanze w\u2019abakinnyi bonyine:\nAbakinnyi bakurikira nibo binjijwe mu mukino wo gushaka itike:"}
{"id": "21635", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21635", "title": "Rwanda at the 2016 Summer Olympics", "text": "U Rwanda rwitabiriye imikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi ya 2016 yabereye i Rio de Janeiro muri Brezili, kuva kuya 5 kugeza kuri 21 Kanama 2016. Iyi yari inshuro yacyenda igihugu kiyitabiriye mumikino Olempike yomu mpeshyi.\nKomite y'igihugu y'imikino Olempike na Siporo mu Gifaransa (French) yatoranyije itsinda ry\u2019abakinnyi barindwi, abagabo bane n\u2019abagore batatu, kugira ngobahiganwe gusa mumikino ngororamubiri, gusiganwa kumagare mumuhanda, gusiganwa kumagare mumisozi nokoga mu mikino Olempike, bihuye n\u2019ingano y\u2019abakinnyi b\u2019igihugu n\u2019abakina London 2012. Itsinda ry\u2019abahagarariye u Rwanda ryari rigizwe n\u2019abakinnyi babiri bagarutse mumikino Olempike baturutse mumikino yabanje, barimo Claudette Mukasakindi wiruka marato, n\u2019umusiganwa ku magare Adrien Niyonshuti, wasubiyemo inshingano zezo gutwara ibendera ry\u2019igihugu kunshuro ya kabiri mumuhango wogufungura. \nSiporo (gusiganwa ku maguru).\nAbakinnyi b'u Rwanda kugeza ububageze kubipimo by'ibizamini mu mikino ngororamubiri bikurikira (hafi abakinnyi 3 muriburi mikino): \nKugendera ku igare.\nUmuhanda.\nU Rwanda rwabonye umukinnyi umwe mw' isiganwa ry\u2019abagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mumuhanda bitewe n\u2019uko arimu bantu 10 bambere mu irushanwa rya UCI Africa Tour rya 2015. \nGutwara igare mu misozi.\nU Rwanda rwabonye umuntu umwe ukina igare ryo mumisozi mw'isiganwa ry\u2019abagabo ryo gusiganwa mumikino Olempike, bitewe n\u2019uko rwarangije mu marushanwa ya Afurika yo mu 2015 ari mu marushanwa abiri ya mbere muhihugu, ariko ntarayabona.\nKoga.\nU Rwanda rwakiriye ubutumire bwa FINA bwo kohereza abakinnyi babiri bokoga (umwe w\u2019umugabo n\u2019undi w\u2019umugore) mumikino Olempike. "}
{"id": "21636", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21636", "title": "Rwanda at the 2016 Summer Paralympics", "text": "U Rwanda rwitabiriye amarushanwa ya Paralympic yo mu mpeshyi ya 2016 yabereye i Rio de Janeiro muri Brezili, kuva kuya 7 Nzeri kugeza kuri 18 Nzeri 2016.\nInkunga n'inkunga.\nKomite y\u2019Imikino y\u2019Abamugaye mu Rwanda yahawe igihembo cya Agitos Grant Award, aho inkunga yagenewe iterambere ry\u2019inzira y\u2019abakinnyi muri Rio na Tokyo. Iyinkunga yagiriye akamaro abakinnyi 900 hirya nohino mugihugu, mugihe yanagenewe guhugura abatoza, abashyira mubyiciro n\u2019abasifuzi mu Rwanda. \nIntego ya Rwanda NPC ni ukohereza itsinda rinini ry\u2019abamugaye i Rio. \nIshyirwa mu byiciro ry'abafite ubumuga.\nBuriwese witabiriye Paralympic afite ubumuga bwebushyirwa mu byiciro bitanu by'ubumuga ; gucibwamo ibice, indwara ishobora kuvukanwa cyangwa igaterwa n'imvune cyangwa indwara; ubumuga bwo mu bwonko ; abakinnyi b'ibimuga, akenshi usanga hari ahobihurira n'ibindi byiciro; ubumuga bwo kutabona, harimo n'ubuhumyi ; Les autres, ubumuga ubwaribwo bwose bw'umubiri budashyirwa mucyiciro kimwe gusa, urugero nk'ubudashyikirwa cyangwa indwara nyinshi zo mu bwonko. Buri siporo ya Paralympic igira ibyiciro byayo, bitewe n'ibyo umubiri ukeneye mw' irushanwa. Ibirori bihabwa kode, igizwe n'imibare n'inyuguti, isobanura ubwoko bw'ibirori n'ibyiciro by'abakinnyi bahatanira. Imikino imwe n'imwe, nk'imikino ngororamubiri, igabanya abakinnyi hakurikijwe icyiciro n'uburemere bw'ubumuga bwabo, indi mikino, urugero nko koga, abarushanwa mumatsinda atandukanye hamwe, itandukaniro ryonyine rishingiye kuburemere bw'ubumuga. \nSiporo.\nHermas Cliff Muvunyi yatoranyijwe guhagararira u Rwanda mumikino Paralempike yo mumpeshyi yo muri 2016 mumarushanwa ya T46 metero 400 na metero 1500. Muyunyi yujuje ibisabwa kugira ngo yegukane i Rio mumarushanwa y'isi ya IPC Athletics World Championships yabereye i Doha muri Qatar muri 2015. Mbere y'imikino, yatangaje kazasezera kukazi nirangira imikino ya Rio. Agiye muri Rio, Muyunyi yaratuye muri Sitade y'Igihugu y'Amahoro aho yakoreye imyitozo na Eric Karasira. "}
{"id": "21637", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21637", "title": "2019 Kagame Interclub Cup", "text": "Ibihe byose byerekanwe biri mu masaha ya Afurika y'Iburasirazuba (UTC+3).\nAbitabiriye.\nAmakipe 16 akurikira yitabiriye irushanwa:\nIcyiciro cy'itsinda.\nIcyiciro cy'amatsinda cyarimo amakipe cumi n'atandatu, ahamakipe 4 ari mw' itsinda A, itsinda B, itsinda C, na D. Amakipe abiri yomw' itsinda A na B hamwe n'itsinda C na D yageze ku cyiciro cya 16.\nItsinda A.\n&lt;time datetime=\"2019-07-07T13:00:00+00:00\"&gt;7 Nyakanga 2019&lt;/time&gt; &lt;time datetime=\"2019-07-07T13:00:00+00:00\"&gt;13:00&lt;/time&gt;\n----\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\nItsinda B.\n&lt;time datetime=\"2019-07-07T13:00:00+00:00\"&gt;7 Nyakanga 2019&lt;/time&gt; &lt;time datetime=\"2019-07-07T13:00:00+00:00\"&gt;13:00&lt;/time&gt;\n----\u00a0\nItsinda C.\n&lt;time datetime=\"2019-07-06T13:00:00+00:00\"&gt;6 Nyakanga 2019&lt;/time&gt; &lt;time datetime=\"2019-07-06T13:00:00+00:00\"&gt;13:00&lt;/time&gt;\n----\u00a0\u00a0\nItsinda D.\n&lt;time datetime=\"2019-07-08T14:00:00+00:00\"&gt;8 Nyakanga 2019&lt;/time&gt; &lt;time datetime=\"2019-07-08T14:00:00+00:00\"&gt;14:00&lt;/time&gt;\n----\u00a0\u00a0\nAmareferensi.\nCECAFA Kagame Cup Dates Confirmed"}
