{"id": "21639", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21639", "title": "2023 FIBA Women's AfroBasket", "text": "Irushanwa rya AfroBasket ry\u2019abagore rya FIBA ryo mu 2023 ryarirya 26, rikabaryarabaye kuva kuya 28 Nyakanga kugeza kuya 5 Kanama 2023 i Kigali, mu Rwanda. \nNijeriya yegukanyigikombe cyayocya kane yikurikiranya n'icyagatandatu murirusange nyuma yo gutsinda Senegal kumukino wanyuma, amanota 84\u201374. \nGuhitamo abashyitsi.\nU Rwanda rwahawuburenganzira bwo kwakira iri rushanwa kuya 25 Gicurasi 2023. Nubwambere u Rwanda rwakiriye iri rushanwa ndetse n'ubwa kabiri murirusange murwego rw'abakuru, nyumayokwakira irushanwa ry'abagabo mu 2021.\nImiterere.\nAmakipe 12 yagabanyijwemo amatsindane y\u2019amakipatatu buririmwe. Ikipeyambere yemerewe kugeramurikimwe cyakane mugihe andimakipe abiri yakinnye mucyiciro cyanyuma. Ikipeya kabiri yahuye n\u2019iya gatatu, naho iya gatatu ihura n\u2019iya kabiri. Hakoreshejwe uburyo bwo gukubita umupira nyuma y\u2019icyiciro cyambere, mazamakipe yatsinzwe murikimwe cyakane akina imikinoyo gushyira mubyiciro mugihe iyatsinze yakinaga n\u2019iya shampiyona. \nAho bizabera.\nKimwe n'irushanwa rya AfroBasket ryo mu 2021 kuruhande rw'abagabo, iryahozeryitwa BK Arena (ryahoze ari Kigali Arena) niryoryakira irushanwaryose.\nAmatsinda.\nBuri kipe yagombaga gushyiraho urutonde rw'abakinnyi 12.\nIgishushanyo.\nTombola yabaye ku ya 9 Kamena 2023 i Maputo, muri Mozambike. \nIcyiciro cya mbere.\n\"Ibihe byose ni ibyo mu gace utuyemo (UTC+2).\" \nIcyiciro cya Knockout.\nUdukingirizo.\nAgace ka 5 k'umwanya\nImibare n'ibihembo.\nIbihembo.\nIbihembo byatangajwe ku ya 5 Kanama 2023. "}
{"id": "21640", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21640", "title": "2019 FIBA U16 Women's African Championship", "text": "Shampiyona y\u2019abagore ya FIBA Africa U16 yomu 2019 yari iy\u2019abagore ku nshuro ya 6 ya FIBA Africa U16, yakinwe hakurikijwe amategeko ya FIBA, ikigo gishinzwe umupira w\u2019amaguru kw' isi, na FIBA Africa. Iri rushanwa ryabereye mu Rwanda kuva kuri 26 Nyakanga kugeza kuya 4 Kanama, aho imikino yakiniwe i Kigali. Amakipe abiri yambere yemerewe kwitabira igikombe cy\u2019isi cya FIBA U17 cy\u2019abagore cya 2020 muri Rumaniya.\nIcyiciro cy'itsinda.\nAmakipe yose yakinnye mumukino wa robin w\u2019icyiciro kimwe. Ikipe ya mbere mw' itsinda yari ifite amakipe ane yemerewe kugera muri kimwe cya kabiri, mugihe andi yose yageze muri kimwe cyakane.\nIcyiciro cya Knockout.\nAmasaha yose ari kw' isaha yo mugace utuyemo, UTC+02:00. Udukingirizo twakozwe hashingiwe kurubuga rwemewe rwa FIBA.\nIgice cya kabiri cy'ishyirwa mu cyiciro.\nUwatsinze yageze kumwanya wa gatanu, uwatsinzwe aza kumwanya wa karindwi.Abatsinze bemerewe kwitabira igikombe cy'isi cya FIBA U17 cy'abagore cya Basketball cya 2020.\nAmasano yo hanze.\nOfficial website"}
