{"id": "21642", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21642", "title": "2024 African Rhythmic Gymnastics Championships", "text": "Amarushanwa ya 2024 ya Gisiganwa ku Mikino ya Gisiganwa ku Mitsi ya Afurika izwi kandi nka Shampiyona ya 18 ya Afurika yabaye kuva kuya 25 kugeza kuya 26 Mata 2024 i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Ayamarushanwa yarayogushakisha itike yokwitabira imikino Olempike ya 2024. Amarushanwa Olempike yahawe abatsinze amarushanwayose, Aliaa Saleh kugiticye n'itsinda rya Misiri. \nAbatsindiye imidari.\nUmuto.\nInkomoko: "}
{"id": "21643", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21643", "title": "2019\u201320 Rwanda Premier League", "text": "Shampiyona y'Ubwongereza ya 2019-20 yari shampiyona ya 43 ya shampiyona y'Ubwongereza, shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru yomu cyiciro cyambere mu Rwanda. Shampiyona yatangiye kuya 4 Ukwakira muri 2019. \nShampiyona yahungabanyijwe n'icyorezo cya COVID-19 cyatumye imikino yomu cyiciro cya 24 ikinirwa mumuhezo ariko mbere y'uko icyiciro kirangira, shampiyona yahagaritswe kuri 22 Gicurasi. Urutonde rw'imikino nyuma y'icyiciro cya 23 rufatwa nk'urwa nyuma.\nAmakipe.\nAmakipe 16 yose hamwe niyo azahatana muruyu mwaka w'imikino wa 2019-20, ahikipe yambere izahatanira igikombe cya CAF Champions League, iyakabiri izahatanira igikombe cya CAF Confederation Cup, naho iyakabiri izatangirira mu cyiciro cya kabiri cy'u Rwanda. "}
{"id": "21644", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21644", "title": "2024\u201325 Rwanda Premier League", "text": "Shampiyona y'Ubwongereza ya 2024\u201325 ni shampiyona ya 48 ya shampiyona y'Ubwongereza, shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru yo mu cyiciro cya mbere mu Rwanda. Shampiyona yatangiye kuri 15 Kanama 2024 irangira kuri 28 Gicurasi 2025. APR FC yambitswe igikombe, yegukana igikombe cyagatandatu yikurikiranya, Rayon Sports iriku mwanya wakabiri. Muhazi United na Vision FC nizo kipe zombi zavuye muri shampiyona y'Ubwongereza. \nIncamake y'igihembwe.\nMuntangiriro z'uyu mwaka w'imikino, kugeza mumpera za 2024, ikipe ya Rayon Sports yari yiganjemo abakinnyi bayo ba Rayon Sports, bari barimo bashakisha igikombe cyabo cyambere kuva mumwaka wa 2018-19. Nyuma y'imikino icumi, iyikipe yayoboye urutonde rw'abakinnyi ku manota atandatu imbere ya AS Kigali, ahorutahizamu w'umunyasenegali Ngagne Fall ari wewayoboye abandi batsinze ibitego bitandatu. APR FC, yatwaye ibikombe bitanu byabanje, yari kumwanya wagatanu muntangiriro z'Ukuboza, ariko yari imaze gukina imikino myinshi mike ugereranyije n'abo bahanganye. \nShampiyona yafashe ikiruhuko hagati mumwaka wa shampiyona muri Mutarama, Rayon Sports yariyoboye amanota atanu icyogihe nyuma y\u2019uko yombi na APR yari ku mwanya wakabiri batsinzwe imikino yabo yanyuma mbere y\u2019ikiruhuko, haba kuri Sitade ya Huye, Mukura Victory Sports na Amagaju. Amakipe abiri yambere yari arusha andi makipe menshi muriki cyiciro, AS Kigali yari kumwanya wa gatatu yarinyuma ya APR amanota atandatu mugihe cy\u2019ikiruhuko. \nShampiyona yongeye gusubukurwa muri Gashyantare, aho APR yagabanyije amanota abirubwo amakipe yombi yahuraga kumukino wa kabiri w'umwaka kuya 9 Werurwe kuri Sitade Amahoro. Uyumukino warangiye ari 0-0 nta mpande zombi zabonye amahirwe menshi yo gutsinda. \nMuri Mata, Rayon Sports yirukanye umutoza wayo Robertinho nyuma yo kunganya na Marine FC ibitego 2-2. Iyikipe yari imaze gukina imikino itatu gusa mw' icumi mbere y\u2019iyo ngingo, kandi yatakaje umwanya wa mbere ku rutonde rw\u2019amakipe yatsinzwe na APR. Nubwa mbere Rayon itarayobora urutonde kuva umwaka wa 2025 watangira. Claude Rwaka, umutoza w\u2019abagore wa Ryon wegukanye igikombe, yasimbuye Robertinho. \nKw' itariki ya 17 Gicurasi, umukino wa Bugesera na Rayon Sports wagombaga gusubikwa nyuma y'iminota 57 ubwo abafana ba Rayon batangiraga kwigaragambya nogutera ibisasu mukibuga. Icyo gihe Bugesera yariyoboye ibitego 2-0, Umar Abba akaba yari amaze gutsinda igitego cyakabiri binyuze muri penaliti iteye ubwoba, nyuma gato y'uko Rayon yangiwe penaliti yayo kugira ngigere kumukino. APR yatsinze umukino wayo kuruwo munsi, itsinda Gorilla FC igitego 1-0 - igitego kimwe rukumbi cyaje nogutsindwa na penaliti iteye ikibazo - kandi yatsinze amanota abiri kumwanya wa mbere w'ikipe. Umukino wa Bugesera na Rayon wasubukuwe nyuma y'iminsi ine, uhereye ahowari warasubitswe, kandi nubwo yatsinze igitego kumunota wa 84, yatsinzwe umukino ibitego 2-1. \nVision FC yabaye ikipe ya mbere yasezerewe kuri 13 Gicurasi nyuma y'umwaka umwe mucyiciro cyambere, nyuma yogutsindwa na Marines FC ibitego 2-1. Hanyuma APR FC yegukanye igikombe cya Premier League kuri 24 Gicurasi ubwo yatsindaga Muhazi United igitego 1-0, mu gihe Rayon Sports yanganyije na Vision FC ku busa. Iyintsinzi yahaye APR amanota animbere ya Rayon hasigaye umukino umwe gusa ngo irangire. Intambara yokwirinda umwanya wakabiri wo kumanuka mu cyiciro cya kabiri yagiye kumunsi wanyuma, ubwo Amagaju yahuraga na Muhazi United, ifite amanota atatu imbere y'abo bahanganye. Amagaju yatsinze umukino ibitego 2-1, igabanya Muhazi ijya mucyiciro cyakabiri. \nIngaruka.\nIgikombe cya APR cyaricya 23 muri rusange muri shampiyona y'u Rwanda - cyongereye agahigo kabo - ndetse n'igikombe cya 6 cyikurikiranya muntangiriro za 2020. Barangije kandi igikombe cya kabiri cya shampiyona n'igikombe, ndetse batwaye igikombe cy'u Rwanda cyo muri 2024-25. \nUmuhango wo gutanga ibihembo wabereye muri Kigali Convention Centre kuri 30 Gicurasi 2025, murwego rwoguha icyubahiro abakinnyi bagize uruhare runini mumwaka wa 2024-25. Clement Niyigena womuri APR yegukanye igihembo cy'umukinnyi mwiza, Djibirl Ouattara womuri APR na Umar Abba womuri Bugesera nabo bari mumarushanwa yo guhatanira igihembo. Niyigena kandi yari yatwaye igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'irushanwa rya Kagame Interclub Cup 2024 mu ntangiriro z'umwaka wa shampiyona. "}
