{"id": "21648", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21648", "title": "Clementine Mukandanga", "text": "Clementine Mukandanga (wavutse 8 Ukuboza 1985) numukinnyi wamarato mu Rwanda. \nUmwuga.\nMu 2014, yitabiriye imikino ya Commonwealth Games ya 2014 kumunota wa 34:12:31 ubwo yarangizaga kumwanya wacumi mumukino wanyuma w\u2019abagore wa metero 10000 i Glasgow. Mukandanga yatsinze irushanwa rya siporo rya kilometero 5 rizwi nka 'Christmas Run' ryabereye kuri Sitade y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Amahoro mu Kuboza 2014. \nMukandanga yarangije aruwa gatandatu mukwiruka metero 10.000 mu mikino ya Afurika yabereye muri Repubulika ya Kongo mu 2015. Yitabiriye irushanwa rya Afurika ry\u2019abakinnyi bakuru ryabereye i Durban mu 2016, aho yarangije ari uwa karindwi mu isiganwa rya metero 10.000 ndetse akuzuza ibisabwabyo kwitabira imikino Olempike yo mumpeshyi ya 2016 bitewe n\u2019uko yitwayeneza. Mu 2017, yegukanye irushanwa rya 10 ry\u2019u Rwanda.\u00a0km kwambukiranya igihugu muri Kicukiro. \nMu 2018, yarangijaruwa gatatu muri Marathon ya Firenze mazeyuzuza ibisabwa mu irushanwa ry\u2019isi, yirutse iminota 2 n\u2019iminota 30 n\u2019iminota 50. Yitabiriye i Doha muri Shampiyona y\u2019Isi ya Siporo yo mu 2019. Mu 2020, yatsinze Marathon ya Varma muri Bulugariya akoresheje iminota 2 n\u2019iminota 35 n\u2019iminota 14. \nMukandanga yashyizeho igihembo cya 2:25:54 kugirangoyegukane Marathon ya Firenze mu Gushyingo 2023. Ibibyaribyihutacyane ugereranyije n'iminota ibiri yari afite mbere y'umwaka wabanjirije uwo, ndetse n'icyabereye i Firenze, aho yarangije ari uwa gatatu. \nUbuzima bwite.\nMukandanga afite icyicaro i Siena, mu Butaliyani. "}
{"id": "21649", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21649", "title": "Ibiyobyabwenge", "text": "IBIYOBYABWENGE;ni ibintu bihindura imikorere yubwonko nimyitwarire yu muntu bishobora gutuma umuntu yumva ameze neza byakanya gato ariko bigasenya ubuzimA buhoro buhoro.ninko ku gurisha ejo hazaza hawe kugirango wumve umeze neza iminota 20\nUBWOKO BWIBIYOBYABWENGE\n1.IBIKANGURA(stimulants)\nbitera imbaraga zakanya gato urugero;cocaine,nicitine,caffeine,\n2.ibisimziriza(depressants)\nbigabanya imbaragazumubiri nubwonko.urugero inzoga,heroin\n3.ibihindura imitekerereze (hallucinogens)\nbituma umuntu abona cyangwa yumva ibintu bitabaho:urugero marijuana\ningaruka zabyo\n.kwibasira ubwonko numutima\nkugira imyitwarire mibi\nkunanirwa ku ishuri cyangwa akazi\ngushaka kubikoresha buri gihe\n.ibibazo byamafaranga mumuryango\nUKO BABYIRINDA\n.guhitamo inshuti nziza\nkwirinda ahantu haboneka ibiyobyabwenge\n.kuganira nababyeyi cyangwa abarimu\n.kwishora mumikino,amasomo,nibindi bikorwa byubaka"}
{"id": "21650", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21650", "title": "Daphrose Nyiramutuzo", "text": "Daphrose Nyiramutuzo (yavutse 1 Nzeri 1972) numunyarwanda wiruka hagati.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1987, Nyiramutuzo yitabiriye imikino y'Afurika yo Hagati yabereye i Brazzaville, muri Repubulika ya Kongo, yegukana umudariwa feza mwisiganwa ry\u2019abagore ryametero 1500 akoresheje iminota 4 n'iminota 38.5. \nNyiramutuzo yanasiganwaga mukwiruka metero 1500 mu bagore ndetse nomu kwiruka metero 3000 mu bagore mumikino Olempike yomumpeshyi yabereye i Seoul muri Koreya y'Epfo mu 1988. "}
{"id": "21651", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21651", "title": "Laurence Niyonsaba", "text": "Laurence Niyonsaba (wavutse ku ya 14 Kamena 1973) n'umukinnyi w\u2019Umunyarwanda wiruka intera yohagati. Yitabiriye irushanwa rya metero 1500 mubagore mumikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi yo mu 1992. \nUmwuga.\nNiyonsaba niwewenyine wasiganwaga metero 1500 washoboye guhagararira u Rwanda mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi yo mu 1992. Muriyomikino, Niyonsaba yarangijaruwa 11 mugihe yarafite imbaraganyinshi, ananirwa kujyamumikino yanyuma. \nMuri Mata 1993, Niyonsabayashyizeho agahigo k'igihugu cy'u Rwanda ko gusiganwa metero 1000 mwirushanwa ryabereye i Saint-Maur mu Bufaransa mumupira w'amaguru. Nyumay'uwo mwaka, yujuje ibisabwa mukwiruka metero 800 na metero 1500 mu irushanwa ry'isi rya 1993 mu mikino ngororamubiri. Yarangije aruwa 6 mugusiganwa metero 800 nokumwanya wa 12 mu gusiganwa metero 1500, ananirwa gukomeza murayomarushanwa yombi. "}
