{"id": "21653", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21653", "title": "Isonga FC", "text": "Isonga FC nikipe yumupira wamaguru yu Rwanda, ifite icyicaro i Kigali. \nAmateka.\nIyikipe yashinzwe mu 2011. \nMuri Kamena 2013, ikipeyarekuye ikipeyayoyose nyuma yo gusezererwa muri Primus National Football League. "}
{"id": "21654", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21654", "title": "2024 BAL final", "text": "Umukino wa nyuma wa shampiyona nyafurika BAL 2024, wari umukino wa shampiyona y'umwaka wa 2024 muri BAL, mu mwaka wa gatatu wa Basketball nyafurika (BAL), ndetse n'isozwa ry'imikino ya nyuma. Umukino wa nyuma wabaye ku ya 1 Kamena 2024 kuri BK Arena i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Umukino wa nyuma wahuje ikipe yo muri Angola Petro de Luanda n'ikipe yo muri Libiya Al Ahly Ly.\nPetro de Luada yatsinze Al Ahly Ly ku manota 107\u201394, yegukana igikombe cya BAL ndetse n'igikombe cya gatatu k'umugabane w'afurika, harimo n'igikombe cya FIBA afurika. Mu kubikora, babaye kandi ikipe ya mbere yo munsi y'ubutayu bwa Sahara yegukanye igikombe cya BAL. Nk'abatsinze, kandi Petro de Luanda, yegukanye igikombe cya FIBA cyo muri 2024.\nPetro de Luanda abaye ikipe ya kabiri yakinnye imikino ibiri ya nyuma ya BAL, yikurikiranya gusa amaze gukina no gutsindwa imikino muri 2022. Al Ahly Ly niyo kipe ya mbere yo muri Libiya yakinnye umukino wanyuma, ndetse nitsinda rya mbere ryujuje ibisabwa binyuze mu majonjora yo mu muhanda ugana BAL muri shampiyona imwe yakinnye umukino wanyuma."}
{"id": "21655", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21655", "title": "2022 BAL playoffs", "text": "Imikino ya 2022 BAL Playoffs yari iya kabiri mumikino yanyuma ya Basketball Africa League (BAL) kandi yari irushanwa ryanyuma ry\u2019umwaka wa 2022 BAL. Imikino yanyuma yatangiye kuri 21 Gicurasi 2022 irangira kuri 28 Gicurasi 2022 hamwe n\u2019imikino ya nyuma. Mumwaka wa kabiri wikurikiranya, imikino yose yanyuma yakinwe muri [Arena i Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nGahunda yemewe yatangajwe kuri 8 Gashyantare 2022. \n \"Ibihe byose biba mugihe cya Greenwich Mean Time (GMT) cyo mugace utuyemo.\"\nImikino ya kimwe cya kane.\nPetro de Luanda vs AS Sal\u00e9.\nPetro de Luanda na AS Sal\u00e9 bahuye muri BAL kunshuro ya gatatu. Wari umukino wongeye gukinwa muri kimwe cya kane cya 2021, watsinzwe na Petro. Petro de Luanda yatsinze amanota 19 ubwo yatsindaga Sal\u00e9, ayoboye n'amanota agera kuri 28 mugice cyagatatu. Amakipe yombi ntiyigeze ahura mbere. Mu bwitabiriwe bwa 7.576, FAP yatsinze REG mu buryo butangaje kuko ikipe yakiriye iyi kipe yatsinze imikino 25 mumukino. FAP yari iyobowe n'amanota agera kuri 52\u201339 mugice cyagatatu, mbere yuko REG igabanya igitego mugice cya yuma. Olivier Shyaka yatsinze amanota atatu hasigaye iminota 4 n'iminota 30 kugira ngo FAP igere kumwanya wa mbere. \nMonastir ya Amerika ihanganye na Cape Town Tigers.\nAyamakipe yombi ntabwo yigeze ahura mbere. Monastir yatsinze Cape Town neza, ntiyigeze irushwa n'umukino. Ifite amanota 39, niyo ntsinzi ninikurusha izindi zose mumwaka w'imikino wa BAL. \nZamalek vs SLAC.\nAya makipe yombi ntabwo yigeze ahura mbere. SLAC yakinnye umukino wayo wambere mumikino yanyuma idafite Chris Crawford, umukinnyi wayo watsinze ibitego byinshi mucyiciro cy'amatsinda, wasinyiye muri Siriya. Chris Obekpa, umuyobozi wa SLAC ukina inyuma, yasibye umukino kubera imvune. \nIgice cya kabiri.\nPetro de Luanda vs. FAP.\nAmakipe yakinnye mbere mucyiciro cy'amatsinda cy'umwaka w'imikino wa 2021, aho Petro yatsinze umukino kumanota 66\u201364.\nMonastir yo muri Amerika ihanganye na Zamalek.\nUyu mukino waruwo kongera gukina umukino wa nyuma wa BAL wo mu 2021, aho Zamalek yegukanye igikombe cyambere cy'umwaka w'imikino.\nImurikagurisha rya Elevate.\nBAL yateguye umukino wokwerekana abakinnyi ba Elevate bomuri NBA Academy Africa n'ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda y'abatarengeje imyaka 23."}
{"id": "21656", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21656", "title": "2022 African Men's Junior Handball Championship", "text": "Shampiyona y'umukino w'intoki w'abagabo bomu mwakawa 2022 yabereye i Kigali, mu Rwanda kuva ku ya 20 kugeza ku ya 27 Kanama 2022. Yanabaye irushanwa ryogushaka itike yogukina shampiyona y'umupira w'intoki y'abagabo bomumwaka wa 2023. \nMisiri yegukanye igikombe cyayocya 13 nyumayogutsinda Alijeriya amanota 35-15, naho Tuniziya yegukana umudariwa bronze itsinze Angola amanota 24-22.\nIgishushanyo.\nTombola yabaye kuya 22 Nyakanga 2022 kubiro bikuru by'ishyirahamwe ry'umukino wa Handball mur'Afurika i Abidjan, muri Cote d'Ivoire. \nIcyiciro cya mbere.\n\"Ibihe byose ni ibyo mu gace utuyemo (UTC+2).\""}
{"id": "21657", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21657", "title": "Real madrid", "text": "REAL MADRID CF\nREALMADRID ni ikipe yatangiye gukina mu gihumbi kimwe na maganacyenda aho yatangijwe mumugi wi MADRID muri ESIPANYE. iyo kipe ifite sitade nkuru yitwa Santiago Bernabeu yakira abafana bagera muri 83,186.iyo kipe ifite akazina ka Los Blancos.umuyobozi mukuru wa Real Madrid ni uwitwa Florentino Perez.\nReal Madrid yagiye itwara ibikombe bitandukanye ariko igikombe yatwaye kubwinshi ni ikizwi nka LA Liga aho yagitwaye inshuro 35;itwara ikitwa UCL cyangwa Champions League incuro 15 ariyo kipe yagitwaye incuro nyinshi \nIzina Santiago Bernabeu ryavuye kumuyobozi mukuru wa RealMADRID nawe witwaga Santiago Bernabeu[1895-1978] iyo sitade ikaba ariyo yonyine sitade yakiniweho final enye arizo zabaye mu myaka ya 1957;1969;1980;2010.Ndetse ikanaberaho semi finale yigikombe cya copa cyo muri 2018 \niyo sitade bikaba byaratangajwe kandi ko izina ryayo ryahinduwemo Bernabeu gusa hanyuma Santiago bakarikuraho "}
{"id": "21660", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21660", "title": "Outline of sports", "text": "Incamake ikurikiritangwa nk'incamake y'imikino n'ubuyobozi bw'ingenzi: Sport ishobora gutanga ibyishimo kubitabiriye no kwidagadura kubareba. Umubare w'abitabira siporo runaka ushobora gutandukana kuva kubantu amagana kugeza kumuntu umwe.\nSiporo ni iki?\nSiporo ishobora gusobanurwa nk'ibi bikurikira:\nSiporo hakurikijwe akarere.\nAfurika\n Afurika y'Iburengerazuba\n Benin \u2022 Burkinafaso\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\n Afurika y'Amajyaruguru\n Alijeriya \u2022 Misiri \u2022 Libiya \u2022 Mauritaniya \u2022 Maroke \u2022 Sudani \u2022 Tuniziya \u2022 Sahara y'Iburengerazuba\n Afurika yo Hagati\n Angola \u2022 Burundi \u2022 Kameruni \u2022 Repubulika ya Centrafrique \u2022 Tchad \u2022 Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo \u2022 Gineya ya Ekwatoriya \u2022 Gabon \u2022 Repubulika ya Kongo \u2022 Rwanda \u2022 S\u00e3o Tom\u00e9 na Pr\u00edncipe\n Afurika y'Iburasirazuba\n Burundi \u2022 Comoros \u2022 Djibouti \u2022 Eritereya \u2022 Etiyopiya \u2022 Kenya \u2022 Madagasikari \u2022 Malawi \u2022 Mauritius \u2022 Mozambike \u2022 Rwanda \u2022 Seychelles \u2022 Somaliya \u2022 Tanzaniya \u2022 Uganda \u2022 Zambiya \u2022 Zimbabwe\n Afurika y'Amajyepfo\n Botswana \u2022 Eswatini \u2022 Lesotho \u2022 Namibiya \u2022 Afurika y'Epfo\n Ubwishingizi\n Mayotte\u00a0 \u2022 Mutagatifu\u00a0Helena\u00a0 \u2022 Puntland \u2022 Somaliland \u2022 Sahrawi\u00a0Icyarabu\u00a0Abademokarate\u00a0Repubulika\nAntaraktika\nAziya\n Aziya yo Hagati\n Qazaqistan \u2022 Kirigizisitani \u2022 Tajikistan \u2022 Turukimenisitani \u2022 Uzubekisitani\n Aziya y'Iburasirazuba\n Ubushinwa \n Tibet\n Hong Kong \u2022 Macau \n Ubuyapani \u2022 Koreya ya Ruguru \u2022 Koreya y'Epfo \u2022 Mongoliya \u2022 Tayiwani \n Aziya ya Ruguru\n Uburusiya \n Aziya y'Amajyepfo y'Uburasirazuba \n Brunei \u2022 Birimaniya (Miyanimari