ye. Uru rwego rwanasuzumye uburyo amacakubiri atandukanye hagati y\u2019ibitsina mu mikino ashobora kugira ingaruka ku matsinda y\u2019abagore. \nImitekerereze y'abantu ku mikino.\nImitekerereze ya siporo ni inyigo y'uburyo ibintu byo mu mutwe bishobora kugira ingaruka ku kwitabira siporo z'umwuga n'imyidagaduro, ndetse n'uburyo siporo igira ingaruka ku miterere y'imitekerereze y'umukinnyi. Nyuma yo gukundwa cyane mu ntangiriro z'ikinyejana cya 20, ubu ni ishami rya siyansi rizwi kandi rijyanye n'imikino myinshi itandukanye. Abahanga mu by'imitekerereze ya siporo bo muri iki gihe bakunze gukoresha uburyo bwo gushyiraho intego, ubuhanga bwo kureba ibintu mu buryo bugezweho n'uburyo bwo gukora mbere y'uko abakinnyi bagera ku ntego zabo. "}
{"id": "21661", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21661", "title": "Denis Omedi", "text": "Denis Omedi (wavutse kuya 13 Kamena 1994) numukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'umunya-Uganda ukina nka rutahizamu mwikipe ya APR yo mu cyiciro cya mbere cy'u Rwanda ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda. \nUmwuga w'ikipe.\nOmedi yatangiye umupira w'amaguru muri Booma FC iherereye mukarere ka Masindi, nyumaza kujya muri Kitara FC kuvamu 2023 kugeza 2024, azanokujya mwikipe ya APR FC yo mu cyiciro cya mbere mu Rwanda mu 2025, yatsinze ibitego 15 muri Uganda Premier League. Omedi yahawe igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'ukwezi kwa Gashyantare 2024, mubihembo bya Real Stars Awards byabereye i Lugogo. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nOmedi yakinnyimikino icumi muri Uganda Cranes, yatsinzibitego bitatu anatanga imipira ine ivamo ibitego. Denis Omedi yafashije Uganda kubonumwanya mwirushanwa rya Afurika ry\u2019ibihugu 2025 rizabera muri Maroc, yatsinze igitego kimwe ubwo yakinaga na Bafana Bafana mu mukino wo gushaka itike ya AFCON 2025 warangiye banganya ibitego 2-2. \nIbihembo n'ibitaramo.\nOmedi yatowe mwirushanwa rya FIFA Puskas Award 2024 kubera igitego cye cya rabona yatsinze KCCA mu irushanwa rya FUFA Super 8. Ikigitego kizahatanirwa mubandi bakinnyi 10 barimo Hassan Al Haydos, Terry Antonis, Yassine Benzia, Walter Bou, Michaell Chirinos, Federico Dimarco, Alejandro Garnacho, Mohammed Kudus, Jaden Philogene na Paul Onuachu. Igitego cya rabona cyanatowe mu cyiciro cy\u2019Intego y\u2019Umwaka mubihembo bya CAF Awards 2024, bityo kikaba aricyogitego cyonyine hamwe n\u2019umupira Benzia yatsinzemo Algeria kuri Afurika y'Epfo, cyahawe imyanya yombi ya CAF na Puskas. \nMubihembo bya FIFA Pusk\u00e1s Awards bya 2024, rutahizamu wa Kitara FC na Uganda Cranes yarangije ari uwa gatatu n'amanota 16 yose hamwe. Gutoranywa kwekwishimira igitego cyecya rabona yatsinze kuri KCCA FC. Ikigihembo cyahawumukinnyi wa Manchester United na Argentine Alejandro Garnacho, igitegocyecyamuhesheje umwanya wambere n'amanota 26, gikurikirwa n'igitego cya Yassine Benzia kur'Afurika y'Epfo, cyabonye amanota 22. \nByongeye kandi, Omedi yarimubahatanira ibihembo bya CAF bya 2024, ahoyatorewe umwanya woguhatanira igihembo cy'intsinzi y'umwaka. Nubwoyitwaye nezacyane, yabaye uwagatandatu mu matora n'amajwi 13.766. Iki gihembo cyatsindiwe na Mabululu wo muri Angola. Kuba Omedi yarashyizwe muri ibi bihembo by'icyubahiro byatumye amenyekana cyane kandi yongera amahirwe yeyokugura abakinnyi. Amasezerano yey'akazi muri Kitara FC azarangira mu mpera z'uyu mwaka wa 2024, kandi asanzwe afitamakipe aturutse muri Esipanye, Pyramids FC yo muri Misiri na Gor Mahia yomuri Kenya. Yanabonye amakipaturutse muri Afurika y'Epfo na Libiya kuva mwirushanwa ryokugura abakinnyi ryabanje. "}
{"id": "21662", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21662", "title": "73rd FIFA Congress", "text": "Kongere ya 73 ya FIFA yabereye muri BK Arena i Kigali, mu Rwanda, ku ya 16 Werurwe 2023. \nAmatora ya perezida yo mu 2023.\nKuya 31 Werurwe 2022, munama ya 72 ya FIFA yabereye i Doha, Perezida wa FIFA ucyuye igihe Gianni Infantino yatangaje ko aziyamamariza manda ya gatatu. Nyuma y'itariki ntarengwa yoku ya 18 Ugushyingo 2022, niwemukandida wenyine, bityo atsindamatora ashima. "}
{"id": "21664", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21664", "title": "Winter Paralympic Games", "text": "Imikino ya Paralempike y'Imbeho nirushanwa mpuzamahangarihuza abakinnyi bafitubumuga bw'umubiri, amaso, n'ubwonko ahobarushanwa mumikino y'urubura n'urubura. Irirushanwa ririmo abakinnyi bafitubumuga bwokugenda, ubumuga bwogucikamibice, ubumuga bwokutabona, n'ubumuga bwo mu bwonko. Imikino ya Paralempike y'Imbeho iba buri myaka ine nyuma y'imikino Olempike y'Imbeho kandi (kuva mu 1992) yaberaga muruwomujyi. Komite Mpuzamahanga y'Imikino ya Paralempike (IPC) igenzura iyimikino. Imidari itangwa muriburi irushanwa: zahabu kumwanya wambere, feza kuwa kabiri, n'umuringa kuwa gatatu, hakurikijwe umuco w'uko imikino Olempike yatangiye mu 1904.\nImikino ya Paralympic y'itumba yatangiye mu 1976 i \u00d6rnsk\u00f6ldsvik, muri Suwede. Iyomikino niyo ya mbere Paralympic yagaragayemo abakinnyi batari abagendera kuntebe z'abamugaye. Imikino yagutse kandi ikura, harimo n'imikino ya Paralympic y'impeshyi, ibigice cy'imikino mpuzamahanga minini nyuma ya Olempike. Bitewe n'uko yagutse, hakenewe uburyo bwihariye bwo gushyira mu byiciro. Ububuryo kandi bwatejimpaka kandi bufungura inzira zitandukanye zogukopera, byangije ubunyangamugayo bw'imikino.\nNoruveje yabayigihugu kiri kumwanya wambere (imidari) mumikino ine ya Paralempike y'itumba: 1980, 1988, 1994, na 1998. Ubudage bwabaye igihugu kiri kumwanya wambere (imidari) mu mikino itatu ya Paralempike y'itumba: 1976, 2002, na 2010. Uburusiya (2006 na 2014) na Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika (1992 na 2018) byabaye igihugu kiri ku mwanya wa mbere inshuro ebyiri buri kimwe. Otirishiya (1984) n'Ubushinwa (2022) byabaye igihugu kiri kumwanya wa mbere inshuro imwe buri kimwe. \nAmateka.\nInkomoko y'imikino ya Paralympic y'itumba isacyane n'imikino ya Paralympic y'impeshyi. Abasirikare bakomeretse bavuye mu Ntambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yosebashakaga siporo nk'inzira yo gukira. Yateguwe na Dr. Ludwig Guttmann, amarushanwa y'imikino hagati y'ibitaro by'Abongereza byakiraga indwara yatangiyemu 1948 akomeza kugeza mu 1960 ubwimikino Olempike yaberaga i Roma nyuma y'imikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi yo mu 1960. Abakinnyi b'amagare barenga 400 bitabiriye imikino ya Paralympic yo mu 1960, yajekwitwa Paralympic ya mbere. \nSepp Zwicknagl, watangije imikino yogusiganwa kurubura kubakinnyi bafite ubumuga, yari umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku rubura wo muri Otirishiya ufite amaguru abiri, wagerageje gusiganwa ku rubura akoresheje ibyuma bisimbura. Akazi ke kafashije abantu bafite ubumuga kwitabira imikino yo mu gihe cy'itumba. Iterambere ryagenze buhoro, kandi nibwo mu 1974 habaye irushanwa rya mbere ryemewe ku isi ku bakinnyi bafite ubumuga, ryarimo gusiganwa ku misozi no gusiganwa ku maguru. Imikino yambere y\u2019abamugaye yabereye mugihe cy'itumba mu 1976 i \u00d6rnsk\u00f6ldsvik, muri Suwede kuva ku ya 21 kugeza ku ya 28 Gashyantare. Imikino yogusiganwa ku rubura mumisozi miremire no mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba nibyo byari ingenzi ariko gusiganwa kurubura byashyizwemo nk'igikorwa cyokwerekana. Hari abakinnyi 198 bitabiriye baturutse mu bihugu 16, kandi ni bwo bwa mbere abakinnyi bafite ubumuga uretse abakinnyi bafite ubumuga bw'ibimuga bemerewe gusiganwa. \nGuhera mu 1988, imikino Olempike y'abamugaye yomu mpeshyi yabereye mumujyi umwe n'imikino Olempike y'impeshyi. Ibibyatewe n'amasezerano yagiranyehagati ya Komite Mpuzamahanga Olempike (IOC) na Komite Mpuzamahanga y'abamugaye (IPC). Imikino ya Paralempike y'imbeho yo mu 1992 ni yoyambere mumikino y'imbeho yakoresheje ibikoresho bimwe n'imikino Olempike y'imbeho. \nUburiganya.\nAbakinnyi bakopfoye cyanemukugaragaza ubumuga kugira ngobagire amahirwe yoguhangana, no gukoresha imiti yongerimbaraga. Umudagukina skiing Thomas Oelsner yabaye umukinnyi wa mbere wa Paralympian mugihe cy'itumba wapimwe imiti ya steroide mu 2002. Yariyaratsindiye imidari ibiriya zahabu mumikino yomumisozi miremire arikoyambuwe imidari ye. Imwemu mpungenge abayobozi ba Paralympic ububahanganye nuburyo bwokongera umuvuduko w'amaraso, buzwi nka autonomic dysreflexia. Ukwiyongera k'umuvuduko w'amaraso gushobora kongera imikorere kukigero cya 15% kandi ningirakamaro cyane mumikino yokwihangana nko gusiganwa ku maguru. Kongera umuvuduko w'amaraso abakinnyi baterihungabana kumaguru nkana munsi y'igikomere cy'umugongo. Iri hungabana rishobora kuba ririmo kuvunika amagufwa, guhambira ingingo cyane nogukoresha amasogisi yogukandacyane. Imvunentibabaza umukinnyi ariko igira ingaruka ku mubiri kandi igira ingaruka ku muvuduko w'amaraso w'umukinnyi, kimwe n'uburyo bushobora gukoreshwa nkokureka uruhago rukazura cyane. \nKomite Mpuzamahanga y\u2019Imikino y\u2019Abamugaye (IPC) yasanze ibimenyetso bigaragaza ko uburyo bwo gusiganwa ku maguru bwakozwe mu mikino y\u2019abamugaye yo mu gihe cy\u2019itumba ya 2014 i Sochi. Kuya 7 Kanama 2016, Inama Nyobozi ya IPC yatoye kumugaragaro kwikipe yose y\u2019Uburusiya ibujijwe kwitabira imikino y\u2019abamugaye yo mu mpeshyi ya 2016, ivuga ko Komite y\u2019Imikino y\u2019Abamugaye y\u2019Uburusiya idashobora gushyira mubikorwa Itegeko rya IPC ryokurwanya imiti ikoreshwa mu gusiganwa ku maguru n\u2019Itegeko Mpuzamahanga ryo kurwanya imiti ikoreshwa mugusiganwa kumaguru, ariryo \"gisabwa n\u2019itegeko nshinga\". Perezida wa IPC, Sir Philip Craven, yavuze ko guverinoma y\u2019Uburusiya \"yananiwe cyane abakinnyi bayo ba Para\". Perezida w\u2019Inama y\u2019Abakinnyi ba IPC, Todd Nicholson, yavuzeko Uburusiya bwakoresheje abakinnyi nk'\"abakoresha imbaraga\" kugira ngo \"byerekane ubuhanga ku isi\". \nIbyiciro by'abafite ubumuga.\nIPC yashyizeho ibyicirobitandatu by'abafite ubumuga birebimikino y'abafite ubumuga yomu mpeshyi n'iy'itumba. Abakinnyi bafitebumwe murububumuga bw'umubiri bashobora kwitabira imikino y'abafite ubumuga, nubwo atari buri siporo ishobora kwemerera buricyiciro cy'abafite ubumuga. \nGushyira mu byiciro.\nMubyiciro bitandatu by'abafitubumuga, abakinnyi bagombakugabanywa hakurikijwe urwego rw'ubumugabwabo. Uburyo bwo gushyira mubyiciro butandukanye bitewe n'imikino. Uburyo bugenewe gufungura imikino ya Paralympic ku bakinnyi benshi bashoboka, bashobora kwitabira amarushanwa atunganye n'abakinnyi bafite ubushobozi bumwe. Ibintubingana cyane mu marushanwa y'abadafite ubumuga ni ibyiciro by'imyaka mu mikino y'abana bato, n'ibiro mu mikino yokurwana, guterana iteramakofe, noguterura ibiremereye. Ibyiciro biratandukanye hakurikijwe ubuhanga butandukanye busabwa kugira ngo umuntu akore uyumukino. Ikibazo gikomeye muri gahunda yogushyira mubyiciro nuburyobwo gusobanurubwoko bwinshi n'uburemere bw'ubumuga. Kubera iyompamvu, hazabaho ubumuga butandukanye mucyicirorunaka. Ibikurikira ni urutonde rw'imikino ya Paralympic y'itumba n'uburyo ishyirwa mubyiciro.\nGusiganwa kurubura mumisozi miremire: Haribintu bibiri mugusiganwa kurubura mumisozi miremire: slalom na slalom nini. Gusiganwa ku rubura mu misozi miremire byakira abakinnyi bafite ubumugabukurikira: imvune z'umugongo, indwara zomubwonko, gucibwa ibice by'umubiri, \"Les Autres\" n'ubumuga bwo kutabona neza. Hariibyiciro cumi na kimwe, birindwi kubakinnyi bahagaze, bitatu ku bakinnyi bicaye, na bitatu kubakinnyi bafitubumuga bwokutabona. Ibyiciro bigenwa n'urwego rw'imikorere y'abakinnyi n'ibikenewe kubikoresho bibafasha (prosthesis, inkingi zo gusiganwa ku rubura, nibindi). Umusaraba wa Snowboard ubu uri muri iki cyiciro, nubwo amarushanwa azabaho gusa mu byiciro bike (reba hepfo).\nBiathlon: Biathlon nuruhurirane rw'imikino yogusiganwa kurubura hamwenokurasa intego. Bisaba imbaraga z'umubiri nokurasaneza. Ibibirori bifunguye kubakinnyi bafitubumuga bw'umubiri n'ubumuga bwokutabona. Haribyiciro cumi na bitanu ahwabakinnyi bazashyirwamo bitewe n'urwego rw'imikorere yabo. Ibyiciro cumi na bibiri ni iby'abakinnyi bafite ubumuga bw'umubiri naho bitatu ni iby'abakinnyi bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. Abakinnyi barushanwa hamwe, kandi igihe cyo kurangiza gishyirwa muburyo bw'icyiciro cyabo cy'ubumuga kugira ngo hamenyekane uko abakinnyi barangiza muri rusange. Abakinnyi bafite ubumuga bwokutabona bashobora guhatana binyuze mu gukoresha ibimenyetso by'amajwi. Ubukana bw'ibimenyetso buratandukanye bitewe niba umukinnyi arikuntego cyangwa atari yo. \nGusiganwa ku rubura mu misozi miremire: Gusiganwa kurubura mumisozi miremire, bizwi kandi nka Nordic skiing, bifunguye ku bakinnyi bafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe, ubumuga bwo kutabona neza nokutabona neza. Hariho ibyiciro cumi na bitanu, bitatu ku bakinnyi bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona neza, icyenda kubakinnyi bahagaze na bitatu kubakinnyi bicaye. Ibyiciro bigenwa mu buryo bumwe no gusiganwa kurubura mu misozi miremire hibandwa ku rwego rw'imikorere y'abakinnyi n'uburyo bakeneye ibikoresho bibafasha. \nHoki yo mu Rubura: Hoki yomu Rubura ifunguye gusakubakinnyi bafite ubumuga bw'umubiri mu gice cyohasi cy'umubiri wabo. Kuva mu 2010 yabaye umukinuvanze n'ibitsina mumikino Paralympique y'itumba, ariko abakinnyi b'abagore baracyari bake Uyu mukino ukinwa hakoreshejwe amategeko mpuzamahanga ya hoki hamwe n'impinduka zimwe na zimwe. Abakinnyi bicara ku rubura rufite ibyuma bibiri byemerera puck kujya munsi y'urubura. Bakoresha kandi inkoni ebyiri, zifite icyuma gisunika n'icyuma gifata amasasu. Abakinnyi bashyizwe mu matsinda atatu: itsinda rya 1 ni iry'abakinnyi badafiticyuma gifata amasasu cyangwa bafite ubumuga bukomeye mu ngingo zo hejuru no hasi, itsinda rya 2 ni iry'abakinnyi bafite ubumuga bwo kwicara n'ubumuga buciriritse mugingo zabonaho abakinnyi bomwitsinda rya 3 bafite uburinganire bwiza n'ubumuga buciriritse mungingo zabo zohejuru nohasi. \nGusimbuka kw'abamugaye: Gusimbuka kw'abamugaye nigikorwa cy'ikipe y'abakinnyi bafite ubumuga buhoraho bwo hasibubasaba gukoresha intebe y'abamugaye mubuzima bwabobwa buri munsi. Abakinnyi bafitubumuga bwomumutwe cyangwindwara ya Sclerosis nyinshi nabo bashobora gukina iyo bakoresheje intebe y'abamugaye. Gutanga ibuye bishobora gukorwa hakoreshejwe intoki cyangwahakoreshejwe inkingi. Ntabyiciro biharimuri ikigikorwa uretseko abakinnyi bose bitabiriye bagomba kuba bakeneye intebe y'abamugaye kugira ngo bashobore kugenda buri munsi. \nPara snowboard: Kuya 2 Gicurasi 2012, Komite Mpuzamahanga y\u2019Imikino y\u2019Abamugaye (IPC) yemeje kumugaragaro Para snowboarding (yahoze yitwa \"adaptive snowboarding\") nk'umudari mu mikino ya Para snowboarding yo mu gihe cy'itumba ya 2014 munsi ya Alpine Skiing. Habayeho amarushanwa yo gusiganwa ku rubura kubagabo n'abagore. Irushanwa rya mbere ry\u2019imikino y\u2019abamugaye ryabereyemo abakinnyi bafite ubumuga bw\u2019amaguru yo hasi gusa. Abakinnyi baciwe ingingo bemerewe kwambara icyuma gikingira. Ibirori byabereye mu buryo bw\u2019igihe, ariko nta buryo bwakozwe hashingiwe kurwego rw\u2019ubumuga bw\u2019umukinnyi. Mumikino y\u2019abamugaye yo mu gihe cy'itumba ya 2018, umubare w\u2019imikino wariyongereye uva kuri 2 ugera kuri 10, aho ibice by\u2019amaguru yo hasi byagabanyijwemo amatsinda abiri (LL-1 kubafite ubumuga bukomeye na LL-2 ku bafite ubumuga buke), ndetse no kongeramo slalom ya banki. Irushanwa ryo gusiganwa ku rubura ryakozwe muburyo bwoguhangana n\u2019itsinda ry\u2019abakinnyi (snowboard cross) hamwe n\u2019amarushanwa menshi yo gukubitana kugirangohamenyekane abatsinze imidari. Mu 2022, hongeweho amarushanwa ku bakinnyi bafite ubumuga bwohejuru, ariko IPC yakuyeho icyiciro cya LL-1 cy\u2019abagore kubera ibura ry\u2019abakinnyi muri iryotsinda. Abobakinnyi babanje kubuzwa nagato kwitabira irushanwa kugeza ubwo Brenna Huckaby womuri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika yatsinze mu rubanza rwo \"guhangana\" n\u2019itsinda rya LL-2.\nUrutonde rw'imikino Paralempike.\nHari igihe imikino itandukanye yagiye iba igice cya gahunda ya Paralympic.\nImbonerahamwe y'imidari y'ibihe byose.\nDukurikije amakuruyemewe ya Komite Mpuzamahanga y\u2019Imikino y\u2019Abamugaye. Iyi mbonerahamwe igaragaza ibihugu 20 byambere, hakurikijwe umubare wazahabu, hanyuma ifeza, hanyuma umuringa.\nUrutonde rw'imikino ya Paralympic y'itumba.\nInkomoko: "}
{"id": "21665", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21665", "title": "Akamaro k'ibiribwa", "text": "AKAMARO K'UTUREMANGINGO\nUturemangingondodo cyangwa Fibres mu ndimi z\u2019amahanga ni ubwoko bw\u2019ibiribwa bibarirwa mu binyamasukari, bikaba ari ingenzi mu mubiri w\u2019umuntu kuko bifasha igogora ry\u2019ibiryo ndetse no kugabanya ibyago byo kurwara indwara zitandukanye zirimo iz\u2019umutima, diyabete, kanseri ndetse n\u2019izindi ndwara zangiza amara..\nAbahanga mu by\u2019ubuzima bagaragaza ko utu turemangingondodo cyangwa Fibres zigabanijemo ibice bibiri ari byo: Uturemangingondodo tuyenga mu mazi (Fibres Soluble) dufasha mu kugabanya ingano ya Cholesterol igihe yabaye nyinshi mu mubi, n\u2019uturemangingondodo tutayenga ni ukuvuga tutivanga mu mazi tugafasha ibindi biryo guca mu rwungano ngogozi tugasukura amara ndetse tukanayarinda kwangirika kwa hato na hato.\nUshobora kwibaza ingano y\u2019utu turemangingondodo ukwiye gufata ku munsi, dore igisubizo:\nAmakuru dukesha ikigo cy\u2019abahanga mu by\u2019ubuvuzi Institute of medicine avuga ko nibura: Abagore bagomba gufata garama g 25 ku munsi, Abagabo bagomba gufata g 38, Abana bari hagati y\u2019imyaka 5-11 bagomba gufata g 20, Abana bari hagati y\u2019imyaka 12-16 bagomba g25 naho guhera ku myaka 16 kuzamura bagomba gufata g30. \nEse utu turemangingondodo wadukurahe?\nHamwe mu ho abashakashatsi bagaragaje hashobora kuboneka fibre ni: Inkeri, amacunga, indimu, imineke, inanasi, pome, karoti, ibijumba, ibirayi, amashu, amashaza n\u2019ibishyimbo, Soya, ibigori, ubunyobwa, amapera n\u2019imboga. Abashakashatsi bavuga ko uramutse ufashe ibi biribwa neza ntaho ushobora guhurira n\u2019ikibazo cy\u2019impatwe, indwara zifata amara, diabete n\u2019izindi."}
