{"id": "21671", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21671", "title": "Forever living products", "text": "Forever Living Products In Rwanda.\nForever Living Products (FLP) is a U.S.-based multi-level marketing (MLM) company founded in 1978 by Rex Maughan. The company is best known for its aloe Vera\u2013based health, wellness, and skincare products.\nForever Living Products is a multi-level marketing company which was founded in 1978 in Tempe, Arizona by Rex Maughan. The company has reported a network of 9.3 million distributors and revenue of $4 billion in 2021, and in 2006 they reported having 4,100 employees.\nHistory.\nForever Living was founded in 1978 in Tempe, Arizona by Rex Maughan. By the 1990s, Rex Maughan had purchased the Texas company Aloe Vera of America, with Aloe Vera of America selling its products to Forever Living for distribution. Some journalists have likened the multi-level marketing business model of Forever Living's distribution system to that of a pyramid scheme.\nIn 1983, the company was named No. 6 on \"Inc. Magazine\"'s annual Inc. 500 list of the fastest-growing private companies in the United States.\nHere in Rwanda Forever Living Products (FLP) was officially launched on Thursday, April 20, 2006. The launch event was held at the Hotel Novotel Umubano in Kigali by a regional team from Kenya and the UK\nThe company currently operates through a network of independent distributors known as Forever Business Owners (FBOs) across all provinces, including major hubs in Kigali, Musanze, and Huye\nhe launch was part of the company's expansion into East Africa, providing Rwandans with access to its range of health and beauty products, primarily based on. By 2010, the company had established a significant presence in the country, though it faced some early leadership transitions. \nToday, the company continues to operate in the region through its Forever East Africa hub, which manages distribution and business opportunities for members across Rwanda. \nImportance of Aloe Vera.\nFirst of all Aloe vera is a succulent plant renowned for its thick, fleshy leaves containing a soothing, nutrient-rich gel primarily used to treat burns, skin conditions, and wounds. Rich in antioxidants and vitamins, it serves both medicinal and cosmetic purposes, often applied topically for sunburns or consumed in products for potential digestive benefits.\nKey Uses and Benefits:\nImportant Safety Information:\nHow to Register as a Distributor.\nYou can join as a Forever Business Owner (FBO) through two primary methods: \nYou can find these at the Kicukiro office or through the official online shop:"}
{"id": "21672", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21672", "title": "Dominique Ngoga Sebalinda", "text": "Dominique Ngoga Sebalinda n'Umunyarwanda wavutse mu 1962. Sebalinda Yari umukinnyi wu Mukino wamaboko mu Rwanda (volleyball).\nDominique Ngoga Sebalinda yishwe muri Genocide Yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994,Yiciwe Mu murenge wa Cyatwa,Butare mu ntara yamagepfo.\nAmakipe Dominique yakiniye.\n1.P.S KAbgayi\n2.Group Scolaire de Butare\n3.Kaminuza nkuru y'urwanda(UR)\n4.Foudres Na Muzinga z'Iburundi\nKandi Sebalinda yakiniye ikipe y'igihugu y'urwanda yumukino wamaboko (volleyball) Kuva mu 1986 kugeza 1994.\nAho Sebalinda yakoze.\nDominique Ngoga Sebalinda Mbere yokwicwa muri Jenoside Yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 yakoze muri National University of Rwanda \nIbirushijeho.\nhttps://www.kigalitoday.com/imikino/volleyball/article/volleyball-amakipe-yo-muri-uganda-na-kenya-mu-yazitabira-irushanwa-ryo-kwibuka"}
{"id": "21673", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21673", "title": "Roger Milla", "text": "Albert Roger Miller (wavutse kuya 20 Gicurasi 1952), uzwi kwizina rya Roger Milla, ni Umunyakameruni wahozari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru wabigizumwuga wakinnye nk'umukinnyi wa mbere. Yari umwe mu bakinnyi ba mbere b'Abanyafurika babaye icyamamare gikomeye ku rwego mpuzamahanga. Yakinnye mu bikombe bitatu by'isi mwikipe y'igihugu ya Kameruni.\nYageze kurwegompuzamahanga afitimyaka 38, iyomyaka abakinnyibenshi barutahizamu bagiye mukiruhuko cy'izabukuru, atsindibitego bine mugikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cyo mu 1990, aba umukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi mu mateka y'igikombe cy'isi icyo gihe. Yafashije Kameruni kuba ikipe ya mbere y'Afurika kugera murikimwe cyakane cy'irushanwa ry'igikombe cy'isi. Nyuma y'imyaka ine, afitimyaka 42, Milla yatsinze agahigoke nk'umukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi mu gikombe cy'isi ubwo yatsindaga Uburusiya mugikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cyo mu 1994. \nMilla yakundaga kwishimira ibitego yiruka kwibendera ry'imfuruka akanabyina imbyino isa n'iya lambada. Mu 2004, Pel\u00e9 yashyizwe kurutonde rwa FIFA rw'abakinnyi 100 bakomeye kwisi. Mu 2007, Ishyirahamwe ry'Umupira w'Amaguru muri Afurika ryashyizeho Milla nk'umukinnyi mwiza w'umunyafurika mumyaka 50 ishize. Mugihecyogusezera, yafatwaga nk'umukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi mukarere k'Afurika mu mikino yanyuma y'igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA aho yatsinze ibitego bitanu, kandagahigo kekaza gusimburwa n'umukinnyi wa Ghana Asamoah Gyan.\nUbuzima bw'umuntu.\nIcyemezo cye cy'amavuko ndetse na pasiporo yebigaragaza koyitwa Roger Miller bitewe n'ikosa ry'umwanditsi nokutumvikana. Ababyeyibe bashakaga kumuhizina ry'umuryango wa nyirarume 'Milla' ubwo yavukaga. Yakundaga kwitwa Miller igihecyose yagaragaye mumikino mpuzamahanga ikomeye, impapuro z'ibarurishamibare zimuvugaho ubwo Miller yavugaga byinshi kuburyo izina ryeryari ryaravuzwe nabikandi rikamenyekana nabi mumiryango mpuzamahanga. Umuryangowe wimukiye i Douala afitimyaka 11. \nSe yakoraga kumihanda yagariyamoshi, naho Milla agiramahirwe yokuzenguruka igihugucyose inshuro nyinshi mubwanabwe. Yakuriye mumihanda ya Yaound\u00e9 kandiyakomokaga mumuryango usanzwe w\u2019abantu bomucyiciro cy\u2019abakene kuburyo ababyeyibe bashoboye kumuha uburere buhagije. Ariko, ababyeyibe ntibashimishijwenokubonako Milla arimogushakumupira w\u2019amaguru, maze batangira kwanga kwemera ko umuhungu wabo akina umukino w\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru. \nYize ubuhanga bwogukinumupira w'amaguru atambayinkweto arikumwe n'abandi banamu mihanda y'igitaka nomumihanda, kandakenshi yakinagafite agacupa k'umuhondo cyangwa agacupa nk'uburyo bwo gusimbura umupira. Yari afite kandi akamenyero ko gutera indimu n'udutambaro dufatanye mumipira. We n'abandi bana bagombaga gukinira mu bibuga byuzuye ivumbi kubera ko muri Kameruni nta mashuri y'abana yari yarashinze amashuri makuru y'umupira w'amaguru icyo gihe kandi muri Kameruni ntabibuga byiza byari bifite kandi nta n'ubushobozi bwo kugira abatoza bafite uburenganzira bwo kugira. Byagaragayeko Milla yakinagumupira w'amaguru murwegorwo kwidagaduragusa, kwishimisha no kwidagadura kandi ko atatekereje cyane kubigira umwuga we, maze akomeza kunoza ubuhanga bwe mumupira w'amaguru mubiruhuko by'ishuri. \nRoger Milla ubweyavuzeko yarangije amashuri yisumbuye arikibyoyavuze byanenzwe nabamwe mubanditsi bomuri Kameruni. Afite abavandimwe batatu bafite amazina atandukanye nka Joseph Debouba, Jacques Edjanque na Alexandre Diboussi. Yagiye kureka siporo nyuma y'urupfu rwa nyina mu rugo mu gihe yakinaga umupira w'amaguru mukibuga cyakure ndetse nokubera ko umugorewe yaratwite ubwo aba bombi bari bategereje umwana wabo wa kabiri. \nUmwuga w'ikipe.\nImyaka yo mu ntangiriro.\nYakiniyikipe y\u2019abanabatoya Eclair de Douala afitimyaka 13, yitabira amarushanwa y\u2019ishuri gusa. Nyumayaje kwemeza ababyeyibe nyumayo kwitwara neza mumikino y\u2019imyaka.\nYakinnye bwambere mwikipe y\u2019abakuruya Eclair de Douala mucyiciro cyakabiri cya shampiyona ya Kameruni afitimyaka 15. Nyuma y\u2019imyakibiri, afitimyaka 17, yabayumukinnyi wa shampiyona yogusimbuka cyane mumashuriyo muri Kameruni. Yasinyamasezerano mwikipe y\u2019icyiciro cya mbere ya L\u00e9opard Douala mu 1970 afite imyaka 18, amaherezo yegukana ibikombe bitatu bya shampiyona ya Kameruni muriyokipe. Yanatsinze ibitego 89 mumikino 116 yakinnye muri L\u00e9opard Douala mu gihe cy\u2019imyaka ine. Nyuma y\u2019aho yerekeje muri Tonnerre Yaound\u00e9 mu 1974 nyuma y\u2019imyaka ine amaze akinaneza muri L\u00e9opard Douala. Yatwayigikombe cy'Afurika cy\u2019abatsinze ibikombe muri Tonnerre Yaound\u00e9, naho mu ikipe ya Tonnerre Yaound\u00e9 atsinda ibitego 69 mu mikino 87.\nKwimukira mu Bufaransa.\nYimukiye mu Bufaransa afitimyaka 25 mu 1977 ahoyamaze imyaka 12 akiniramakipe atandukanye. Mu 1977, yakuruwe n'ikipe yomu Bufaransa ya Valenciennes ajya i Burayi. Aho yatsinzibitego 6 mumikino 28 ya shampiyona mumyakibiri. Mu 1979, yinjiye muri AS Monaco, aho yatwaye igikombe cy'Ubufaransa mu 1980 anatsinda ibitego 5 mumikino 25 ya shampiyona n'igikombe. Yari yaragize ibibazo byinshi by'imvune mugihegito yamazemuri shampiyona, maze abayobozi b'ikipe ye bahitamo kumurekura mu mpera z'umwaka w'imikino. Umwaka wakurikiyeho, yinjiye muri Bastia, aho yamaze imyaka ine. Milla yatsinze ibitego 42 mu mikino 133 y'amarushanwa kandi yagize uruhare runini mu gufasha ikipe gutwara igikombe cy'Ubufaransa mu 1981.\nNyuma y\u2019ahoyerekeje muri Saint-Etienne mu 1984, abumunyamuryango ukomeyew\u2019iyikipe, yari irimo gukiranyuma y\u2019ikibazo gikomeye cya ruswa mu 1982 ndetse no kumanuka mu cyiciro cya 2, nyuma yo kugurisha abakinnyi benshi bambere. Murirusange yakinnyimikino 69 muriyi kipe atsinda ibitego 36, anagira uruhare mugufasha iyikipe kongerakwinjira mucyiciro cyambere. Hanyuma yakinnye muri Montpellier kuva mu 1986 kugeza mu 1989, aho Milla yaje kuba umwe mu batoza b\u2019iyi kipe nyuma yo gusezera mumupira w\u2019amaguru mu Bufaransa. [\"Bikenewe\"] Mu mwakawe wambere w'imikino, Milla yatsinze ibitego 18 mumikino 33 isanzwe y'umwaka, byafashije Montpellier kugaruka mu cyiciro cya 1. Muri rusange, yatsinze ibitego 41 mu mikino 103 yakinnye muri Montpellier. \nImyaka ya nyuma.\nMilla yavuye mumupira w'amaguru w'Abafaransa afitimyaka 37 mu 1989 ajya i R\u00e9union mu Nyanja y'Abahinde ahoyakiniye JS Saint-Pierroise. Nyumayogutsinda mugikombe cy'isi, yasubiye i Tonnerre muri Kameruni mugihe cy'imyaka ine. Yarangije iminsiye akina mumakipabiri muri Indoneziya nyuma y'igikombe cy'isi cyomu 1994, asezerera muri uyu mukino mu mpera z'umwaka w'imikino wo mu 1996. Umubare w'ibitego yatsinze muri shampiyona yomuri Indoneziya warenze umubarew'imikino yari yarakinnye muri iryo rushanwa, aho ibitego 41 byabonetse mumikino 35 gusa mugihe cy'imyaka ibiri.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMilla yakiniyikipe y'igihugu inshuro 77, atsinda ibitego 43. Milla yakinnye bwambere muri Kameruni mu 1973 ubwo yakinaga na Zaire mumukino wogushaka itike yogukina igikombe cy'isi. \nYakinnye imikino yeyambere mugikombe cy'isi mugikombe cy'isi gifatwa nk'icya mbere mwikipe ya Kameruni ubwoyegukanaga igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cyo mu 1982 nyuma yo gutsinda imikino yombi ya nyuma bakina na Maroc mumikino yo guhatanira itike yo kujya mu gikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cyo mu 1982 mu karere ka Afurika. Milla yagize uruhare runini mugufasha Kameruni kwegukana itike yo kujya mu gikombe cy'isi cyo mu 1982, atsinda amanotamenshi mumikino yo guhatanira itike yokujya mugikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cyomu 1982 mumarushanwa yo guhatanira itike yo kujya mu karere ka Afurika. Yahuye n'amarangamutima atandukanye mugikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cyo mu 1982, igitego cyatsinzwe na Peru mumukinowabo wambere. Kameruni yatsinzwe imikino itatu mu mikino itatu yomucyiciro cyambere. Nyuma y'imyakibiri, yarimwikipe yahatanaga mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi yo mu 1984 i Los Angeles, muri California. [\"Icyitonderwa kirakenewe\"]\nMilla yarumukinnyi w\u2019ingenzi mwikipe ya Kameruni yegukanye igikombe cya Afurika cyo mu 1984 aho Kameruni yatsinze Nijeriya ibitego 3-1 ku mukino wa nyuma bituma Kameruni yegukana igikombecyambere cy\u2019umugabane. Yarumukinnyi ukomeye mwikipe ya Kameruni yaje ku mwanya wa kabiri nyuma ya Misiri ku mukino wa nyuma w\u2019igikombe cya Afurika cyo mu 1986, kandi yahawe igihembo cy\u2019umukinnyi mwiza muri iryo rushanwakuko yatsinze ibitego byinshi n\u2019ibitego 4. Yanatoranyijwe mu ikipe y\u2019igikombe cy'Afurika cyomu 1986. Yanabaye umukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi mugikombe cy'Afurika cyo mu 1988, atsinda ibitego 2 hamwe na Lakhdar Belloumi wo muri Alijeriya, Abdoulaye Traor\u00e9 wo muri Ivory Coast na Gamal Abdelhamid wo muri Misiri. Yongeye kugira uruhare runini mu gutsinda kwa Kameruni mugikombe cya Afurika cyo mu 1988, kandi kubera uburyo yitwaye neza muri iryo rushanwa, yagizwe umukinnyi w\u2019irushanwa, ndetse anashyirwa mwikipe y\u2019igikombe cy'Afurika cyomu 1988.\nMu 1988, afitimyaka 36, Milla yizihije ikiruhuko cyecyogusezera kumupira w'amaguru mpuzamahanga, yizihiza yubile muri Kameruni. Ariko, mu 1990, yahamagawe na Perezida wa Kameruni Paul Biya, wamwinginze ngwavemukiruhuko cy'izabukuru mpuzamahanga agaruke mu ikipe y'igihugu. Yarabyemeye, maze ajya mu Butaliyani mu ikipe ya \"Indomitable Lions\" mu gikombe cy'isi cyo mu 1990, aho yateraga igitangaza. Byagaragaye ko Paul Biya yashakaga ko Milla akina mu gikombe cy'isi nyuma yo kureba Milla akina mumukino w'urukundo wabereye i Douala aho Milla yatsinze ibitego bibiri. Nyumayogushimangira kwa Perezida wa Kameruni, Milla yahisemo kugaruka mu mupira w'amaguru mpuzamahanga atanga itangazo ku mugaragaro muri Gicurasi 1990. \nBivugwa kandiko abenshi mubakinnyi bakinana muri Kameruni ndetse n'umutoza mukuru w'igihugu Valery Nepomnyashchy ukomokamu Burusiya batashakaga ko Milla aba mu gikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cyo mu 1990. Biya yatanze itegeko rimuhamagarira kugaruka mu ikipe y'igihugu maze Biya asinya ku mugaragaro itegeko risaba kandi rihatira umutoza kumutoranya mwikipe y'igikombe cy'isi. Byavuzwe kandiko abanyamakuruba siporo bazwi muri Kameruni hamwe n'abafana batangiye gahunda yo gusubiza Milla mwikipe y'igihugu nyuma y'uko Kameruni yitwaye nabimu gikombe cya Afurika cyo mu 1990 muri Alijeriya aho Kameruni yavaga mumatsinda itsindwa na Gambia na Senegal. \nIgikombe cy'Isi cyo mu 1990.\nMilla yatsinze ibitegobye binebyose muririrushanwa nk'umusimburubwo yatangiragaburi mukino w'irushanwa kuntebe y'abasimbura. Yatangiye mugice cya kabiri mumikino inemuri itanu y'igikombe cy'isi, anagaragara mugice cyambere inshurimwe. Ibitegobyebibiri by'ingenzi yatsinze mu gice cya kabiri cy'umukino yakinnye na Rumaniya mu minota ibirigusa muminota y'inyongera aho yongeye kugaragara nk'umusimbura, maze akurikira ubuhanga bwe, afatwank'intwari muri Kameruni. Umutoza Valery Nepomnyashchy ni we wahisemo kuzana Milla mberegato y'umukino yakinnye na Rumaniya azi neza ko intsinzi izaha Kameruni umwanya mu cyiciro cya 16, maze umutoza nyuma yemeza akamaro ka Milla nyuma yo gutsinda bikomeye Kameruni mu mukino watsinzwe cyane na Argentine, ikipe ya Argentina. Yarumukinnyi mukurucyane wakiniraga hanze mu gikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cyo mu 1990, kandiyari umukinnyi wa kabiri mukuru mu irushanwa nyuma ya Peter Shilton w'Umwongereza.\nMilla w'imyaka 38 y'amavuko yabayumwe mubakinnyi bakomeye mwirushanwa. Yatsinze ibitego binemu Butaliyani, yishimira burikimwe abyina azungurukibendera ry'imfuruka, ibibikaba byarakunze gukundwa kuva icyo gihe. Ibitego bibiri yatsinze Rumaniya mu mukino wa kabiri wa Kameruni, n'ibindi bibiri yatsinze mu minota 16 y'inyongera yatsinze Kolombiya mu mikino 16 ya nyuma, bituma Kameruni igera muri kimwe cyakane cy'irangiza, ikipe ya Afurika yari yageze kure mu gikombe cy'isi (Senegal na Ghana byahuye n'iki gikombe mu 2002 na 2010, mu gihe Maroc yayirenze igera muri kimwe cya kabiri cy'irangiza mu 2022). Mumukino wa kimwe cyakane cy'irangiza n'Ubwongereza, Milla yemeje ko ari umukinnyi w'icyamamare cyane mugice cya kabiri cy'irushanwa, Kameruni irushwa igitego 1-0, inganya penaliti, hanyuma ishyiraho igitego cya Ekeke, bituma Kameruni ibona amanota 2-1, mberey'uko Ubwongereza butsinda penaliti ebyiri, maze butsinda 3-2 nyuma y'iminota y'inyongera. Bitewe n'uko yakinnye mu Butaliyani, yongeye kugirwa umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'umwaka muri Afurika. [\"Icyitonderwa kirakenewe\"]\nIgitego cyecyakabiricyo kwishimirikipe ya Kolombiya cyabaye icyamamare ku isiyose kandi cyakoreshejwe na Coca-Cola nk'uko bigaragara mumatangazo nka Coca-Cola yo mu gikombe cy'isi cyo mu 2010. \nIgikombe cy'Isi cyo mu 1994.\nMilla yagarutse mugikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cyomu 1994 afitimyaka 42, akaba ariwemukinnyi ukuzwecyane kurushabandibose bakinnye mu gikombe cy'isi kugeza mu irushanwa rya 2014 ubwo Faryd Mondrag\u00f3n womuri Kolombiya yinjiye mu mukino w'amatsinda n'Ubuyapani ubwo yari afite imyaka 43 n'iminsi 3. Agahigo ka Mondragon katsinzwe na Essam El Hadary mu 2018. Kameruni yakuwe mu matsinda; icyakora, Milla yatsinze igitego mu ikipe y'Uburusiya, ashyiraho agahigo ko kuba umukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi mwirushanwa ry'igikombe cy'isi, asesa agahigo yari yashyizeho mu 1990. Yakinnye umukino mpuzamahanga bwa nyuma mu mukino wa gicuti na Afurika y'Epfo mu Ukuboza 1994. \nUmwuga nyuma yo gukina.\nUbunintumwa y\u2019ingenzi mubikorwa by'Afurika. Anakora nk\u2019umukorerabushake mu matsinda atandukanye arimo n\u2019Ikigega Mpuzamahanga cyita ku Bidukikije. Yanafunguye amasosiyete abiri yo kongera gukoresha iplastike mumabuye yomumuhanda. Mu 2004, yashyizwe mwrushanwa rya FIFA 100, urutonde rw\u2019abakinnyi 125 b\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru bakomeye batoranyijwe na Pel\u00e9 mu birori byokwizihiza isabukuru y\u2019imyaka ijana ya FIFA.\nYatoje Montpellier kuvamu 2001 kugezamu 2007. Yanabaye umutoza wa Tonnerre mugihe cy'imyaka ine hagatiya 2007 na 2011. \nUmurage.\nYagizwe perezida w\u2019icyubahiro w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru rya Kameruni muri Werurwe 2008. Ariko, yakuwekuruwomwanya w\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019icyubahiro muri Gicurasi 2012 nyumayokunenga abayobozi bakuru b\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru rya Kameruni ku bijyanye n\u2019ihagarikwa ry\u2019igihekirekire rya Samuel Eto'o. \nKwitariki ya 24 Ugushyingo 2022, yahawicyubahiro na FIFA kubw'ibyo yagezehubwo Perezida wa FIFA Gianni Infantino yamushyikirizaga icyapambere gato y'uko umukino w'amatsinda utangira hagatiya Kameruni n'Ubusuwisi mu gikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cyo mu 2022 kuri sitade ya Al Janoub, Milla nawe yatumiwe kumugaragaro nk'umushyitsi wihariye na Perezida wa FIFA kugirango arebe uwomukino. \nIbirori bye by\u2019ubuhanga muburyo bw\u2019imbyino ya Makossa mugace k\u2019ibendera ry\u2019imfuruka mu gikombe cy\u2019isi cya FIFA cyo mu 1990 byahinduye uko abantu batangiye kubona umupira w\u2019amaguru muri Afurika muburyo bwiza. Ibirori bye byafashwe nk\u2019ibyakunzwe ako kanya kandi byateraga imbaraga nziza kubarebaga mugikombe cy\u2019isi. Yabayikiganiro cy\u2019abantubenshi mu mujyi nomwirushanwa mugikombe cy\u2019isi cya FIFA cyo mu 1990 bitewe ahanini n\u2019ubuhanga bwe mu kibuga, ibirori byokubyina nokubera ubuhangabwe. Nyuma yaje kwitwa \"Umwami w\u2019Ibendera ry\u2019imfuruka\". \nMu 2020, wehamwe n'abakinnyi bagenzibebo muri Kameruni bahawamazu atatuyokuraramo nk'impano zogushimira igihebatsinze nezamugikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cyo mu 1990. Ariko, byabaye ngombwa ko bategereza imyaka 30 kugirangobahabwe iyompanonubwo Perezida Paul Biya yari yarabisezeranye mberemu 1990. Uyumushinga watinzecyane nyuma y'impungenge zijyanye na ruswa n'imikoreremibi kurutonde rw'abagenerwabikorwa 44. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo bya Kameruni ni byo bya mbere, inkingi y'amanota igaragaza amanota nyuma ya buri gitego cya Milla.\"\nIbyubahiro.\nUmukinnyi.\nLeopards Douala\nTonnerre Yaound\u00e9\nMonaco\nBastia\nMontpellier\nKameruni\nUmuntu ku giti cye.\nAmabwiriza"}
{"id": "21674", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21674", "title": "Darko Balaban", "text": "Darko Balaban (; yavutse ku wa 22 Nzeri 1989) ni umukinnyi wa umukino wa basketball w\u2019umunyaseribiya wabigize umwuga.\nUmwuga we w\u2019umukino.\nBalaban yakuriye muri KK Sport Key yo mu aho yakinnye kuva mu 2003 kugeza mu 2007 ubwo yimukiraga muri Partizan. Mu 2010 yimukiye muri Crvena zvezda aho yamaze umwaka umwe.\nMu mwaka w\u2019imikino wa 2011\u201312 yasinyiye aho yagize umwaka mwiza cyane maze yitwa umukinnyi mwiza (MVP) wa shampiyona ya basketball ya Serbia.\nMuri Werurwe 2012 yasinyiye mu Serbian Super League ariko yakinnye imikino icyenda gusa ahita ava mu ikipe. Mu mwaka wakurikiyeho yatangiriye muri T\u00e2rgu Mure\u015f ariko ayivamo mu Ukuboza 2012.\nMu Ukwakira 2013 yasinyiye Vr\u0161ac. Yayivuyemo amaze gukina imikino ibiri gusa asinya muri. Muri Gashyantare 2014 yasubiye muri Serbia asinyira ikipe ye ya mbere Smederevo.\nMuri Nzeri 2014 yasinyiye ikipe yo muri Hongiriya Naturtex SZTE-Szede\u00e1k mu mwaka w\u2019imikino wa 2014\u201315.\nKu wa 1 Ukwakira 2015 yasinyiye ikipe yo mu Bugereki PAOK. Nyuma yaje kuyivamo muri uko kwezi amaze gukina imikino ibiri ya shampiyona yo mu Bugereki n\u2019imikino itatu ya. Ku wa 2 Ukuboza 2015 yasinyiye ikipe yo muri Romania Dinamo Bucure\u0219ti kugeza shampiyona ya 2015\u201316 irangiye.\nKu wa 16 Ugushyingo 2017 yasinyiye Borac \u010ca\u010dak kugeza umwaka w\u2019imikino wa 2017\u201318 urangiye. Ku wa 18 Kanama 2018 yasinyiye Melilla yo muri LEB Oro.\nMu mwaka w\u2019imikino wa 2021\u201322 yakiniye Kouchin Amol yo muri Iranian Basketball Super League.\nMuri Nyakanga 2022, Balaban yinjiye mu ikipe yo mu Rwanda APR ikina muri Shampiyona ya Basketball mu Rwanda (RBL)."}
{"id": "21676", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21676", "title": "Integrated Polytechnic Regional College Ground", "text": "Ikibuga cya Kaminuza ya Polytechnic ni ikibuga cya cricket kiri i Kigali, mu Rwanda. \nMu Kwakira 2021,iki kibuga ni cyo cyabereye imikino yo mu itsinda A mu majonjora yo guhatanira itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy'isi cyo muri 2021 muri ICC mu gikombe cy'isi cya Afurika cyitabiriwe n'amakipe y'ibihugu ya Cricket mu bagabo nka Eswatini, Gana, Lesoto, Malawi, Seyishele, Uganda ndetse n'u Rwanda rwakiriye. Mbere yuko amarushanwa atangira, ikibuga cya ravuguruwe kugirango kigere ku rwego rwo kwemerwa na ICC."}
{"id": "21678", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21678", "title": "Rwanda Cricket Association", "text": "Rwanda Cricket Association cyangwa se ni Ishyirahamwe ry'umukino wa Cricket mu Rwanda ni urwego cyangwa urugaga rukuru ruyobora siporo ya Cricket mu Rwanda. Icyicaro cyayo giherereye mu karere ka Kicukiro mu mujyi wa Kigali.\nUmukino.\nIshyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wa Cricket mu Rwanda ni ryo rihagarariye u Rwanda mu Nama Mpuzamahanga ya Cricket, rikaba n\u2019umunyamuryango wungirije, rikaba rimaze igihe rikorera muri iryo shyirahamwe kuva muri 2003. Ndetse ni n\u2019umunyamuryango w\u2019Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Umukino wa Cricket muri Afurika. \nIkibuga.\nSitade ya Cricket ya Gahanga hamwe n'ikibuga cya Cricket cya IPRC ni byo bibuga by'ingenzi bya Cricket mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "21679", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21679", "title": "Rwanda national cricket team", "text": "Rwanda national cricket team ni ikipe y'igihugu ya Cricket mu Rwanda ihagararira u Rwanda mu mikino mpuzamahanga. yabaye umunyamuryango w\u2019inama mpuzamahanga ya Cricket (ICC) muri 2003 ndetse ni n\u2019umunyamuryango wungirije muri 2017.\nAmateka.\nRwanda national cricket muri 2004 yitabira amarushanwa yo mu karere ndetse no ku rwego mpuzamahanga, ku nshuro yabo ya mbere. Muri Shampiyona nyafurika ikina mu 2004, aho yarangije ku mwanya wa karindwi muri Afurika y'Epfo. Muri 2006 barushanijwe mu cyiciro cya gatatu mu karere ka Afurika muri Shampiyona y\u2019isi ya Cricket, batezimbere imikorere yabo barangiza ku mwanya wa gatandatu. Bagumye mu cyiciro cya gatatu mu 2008."}
{"id": "21680", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21680", "title": "Rwandan women's cricket team in Nigeria in 2018\u201319", "text": "Ikipe y'abagore ya Cricket y'u Rwanda yazengurutse ikina muri nijeriya muri Mutarama 2019 kugira ngo ikine imikino y'aginshuti n'amakipe itanu y'abagore muri Twenty20 International (WT20I) (nyuma ryaje kwitwa irushanwa rya cricket rya Nigeria. Iyi ni yo mikino ya mbere ifite urwego rwa WT20I yakinwe n'impande zombi, nyuma y'uko Inama Mpuzamahanga ya Cricket itangaje ko imikino yose ikinwa hagati y'amakipe y'abagore kuva kuya tariki ya 1 Nyakanga 2018 izaba ifite urwego rwuzuye rwa T20I. Ahabereye imikino yose ni muri Sitade y'Igihugu i Abuja. \nAmarushanwa.\nNijeriya yatsinze U Rwanda uruhererekane rw'amaseti 3-2. Irushanwa ryahaye amakipe yombi imyiteguro yayo mbere y'irushanwa rya ICC Women's Qualifier Africa ryo muri 2019, ryabereye muri Zimbabwe muri Gicurasi 2019. "}
{"id": "21681", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21681", "title": "Least developed countries", "text": "Igihugu gishobora gushyirwa mucyiciro cy\u2019ibihugu bikiri munzira y\u2019amajyambere iyocyujuje ibi bikurikira bitatu: \nKugeza mu Ukuboza 2024, ibihugu 44 byaribikiri mucyiciro cya LDC, mugihe umunani byarangije hagatiya 1994 na 2024. Umuryango Mpuzamahanga w\u2019Ubucuruzi (WTO) wemeyurutonde rwa Loni kandi uvugako \"Ingamba zafashwe murwego rwa WTO zishobora gufasha LDC kongera ibyo zohereza mu mahanga kubindibihugu bigize WTO nogukurura ishoramari. Mubihugu byinshi biri munzira y\u2019amajyambere, amavugurura ashyigikira isoko yashishikarije iterambere ryihuse, gukwirakwiza ibicuruzwa byoherezwa mumahanga, nokugira uruhare rugaragara mu bucuruzi bw\u2019ibihugu byinshi.\" \nIncamake.\nIbipimo ngenderwaho bya LDC bisuzumwa burimyaka itatu na Komite ishinzwe Politiki y'Iterambere (CDP) y'Inama y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye ishinzwe Ubukungu n'Imibereho Myiza (ECOSOC). Ibihugu bishobora gukurwa mucyiciro cya LDC iyibipimo birengeje ibibipimo mu isuzuma rikurikiranye inshuro eshatu. Ibiro by'Umuryango w'Abibumbye by'Intumwa Nkuru y'Ibihugu Bikiri mu Majyambere, Ibihugu Bidakora ku Nyanja n'Ibihugu Bikiri mu Majyambere Bito (UN-OHRLLS) bihuzinkunga ya Loni kandibigatanga serivisi z'ubuvugizi kubihugu Bikiri mu Majyambere Myiza. Icyiciro (as of December\u00a02024) ireba ibihugu 44. \nMunama yakane ya Loni kubihugu bya LDCs, yabaye muri Gicurasi 2011, intumwa zemeye intego igamije kuzamura nibura kimwe cya kabiri cy'ibihugu bya LDCs biriho ubumumyaka icumi iri imbere. Kugeza mu 2018, ibihugu icumi cyangwa birenga byari byitezwe kobizarangiza mu 2024, muri Bangladesh byaribyujuje ibisabwa byose mu 2018. \nNtagihugu cyujujibisabwa ubukandi haribihugu bitatu byaribyujuje ibisabwa kugirango bibe LDC, arikobyanze gushyirwa murutonde, bibaza nibamakuru ya CDP afitukuri cyangwukuri: Ghana (ntikibyujuje ibisabwa kuvamu 1994), Papua Nouvelle-Guin\u00e9e (ntikibyujuje ibisabwa kuva mu 2009), na Zimbabwe (ntikibyujuje ibisabwa kuva mu 2018). \nImikoreshereze n'amagambo ahinnye.\nIbihugu bikiri munzira y'amajyambere bishobora gutandukanywa n'ibihugu bikiri munzira y'amajyambere, \"ibihugu bikiri munzira y'amajyambere\", \"ibihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere\", cyangwa andi magambo asa nayo.\nIjambo \"igihugu kidateye imbere cyane\" (LEDC) naryo rikoreshwa murikigihe. Arikokugira ngo hirindwe urujijo hagati y'\"igihugu kidateye imberecyane\" n'\"igihugu kidateye imbere cyane\" (bishobora gusobanurwa mu magambo ahinnye nka LDC), nokugirango hirindwurujijo n'igihugu kidateye imbere kidakora kunyanja (bishobora gusobanurwa mu magambo ahinnye nka LLDC), \"igihugu kidatera imbere\" gikoreshwa cyane kuruta \"igihugu kidateyimberecyane\".\nMwisuzuma ry\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye mu 2018, Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye wasobanuye ko ibihugu bitagira ingano mubihugu bya LDC byujuje ibipimo bitatu, kimwemuribyo kikabacyari ikigereranyo cy\u2019imyaka itatu cy\u2019umusaruro mbumbe w\u2019igihugu (GNI) kuri burimuturage kirimunsi y\u2019amadolari y\u2019Amerika 1,025. \nInama za Loni.\nHabayeho inameshanu z\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye kubihugu bya LDC, zibaburimyaka icumi. Ebyiri za mbere zabereye i Paris, mu 1981 na 1991; iyagatatu yabereye i Buruseli mu 2001.\nInamaya kane ya Loni ku bihugu bikiri mu nzira y\u2019amajyambere (LDC-IV) yabereye i Istanbul muri Turukiya, ku ya 9-13 Gicurasi 2011. Yitabiriwe na Ban Ki-moon, umuyobozi wa Loni, hamwe n\u2019abaminisitiri b\u2019intebe n\u2019abakuru b\u2019ibihugu bagera kuri 50. Iyi nama yemeje intego yogukura kimwe cyakabiri cy\u2019ibihugu bikiri munzira y\u2019amajyambere mucyiciro cya LDC mu 2022. Kimwe n\u2019amasezerano y\u2019iterambere ya Seoul yateguwe mu 2010, hashyizwe imbaragacyane mukongera ubushobozi bwo gukora umusaruro n\u2019ibikorwa remezo bifatika, ahwimiryango myinshi itegamiye kuri leta itishimiye imbaraga zishyirwa kurwego rw\u2019abikorera. \nInama ya Gatanu y\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye kubihugu bikiri munzira y\u2019amajyambere (LDC-V) yagabanyijwemo ibice bibiri mugihe kingana n\u2019umwaka, hagatiy\u2019icyicaro gikuru cya Loni i New York ku ya 17 Werurwe 2022 na Doha kuya 5-9 Werurwe 2023. \nUbucuruzi.\nIbibazo bijyanye n'amategeko agengubucuruzi mpuzamahanga na za LDC byakuruye itangazamakuru na politiki cyanebitewe n'ibiganiro bya Doha Round of World Trade Organization (WTO) byasenyutse vuba ahabyitwaga uruzinduko rw'iterambere. Mugihe cya Minisitiri wa Hong Kong wa WTO, hemejwe ko za LDC zishobora kubona 100% by'inyungu kumasoko y'Amerika mu gihe uruzinduko rwarangiye. Ariko isesengura ry'amasezerano yakozwe n'imiryango itegamiye kuri leta ryagaragaje ko inyandiko y'amasezerano ya LDC yari yatanzwe yari ifite icyuhokinini gishobora gutuma ubwishingizi buke kuruta 100% by'inyungu ku masoko y'ibihugu bikize, ndetse bishobora no gusiba uburyo bumwe na bumwe bwa LDCs bwokugera kumasoko y'ibihugu bikize mu buryo budafite imisoro. Kutanyurwa n'ibi cyuho byatumye bamwe mu bahanga mu by'ubukungu basaba ko amasezerano ya Hong Kong avugururwa. [\"Icyitonderwa kirakenewe\"]\nChiedu Osakwe, kuvamu 2001, Umuyobozi w\u2019Ishami ry\u2019Ubufatanye mubya Tekiniki mu Bunyamabanga bwa WTO, akaba n\u2019umujyanama w\u2019Umuyobozi Mukuru kubibazo by\u2019ibihugu bikiri mu nzira y\u2019amajyambere, yagizwe Umuhuzabikorwa wihariye wa WTO kubihugu bikiri mu nzira y\u2019amajyambere kuva mu 1999. Yakoranye bya hafi n\u2019izindi nzego eshanu hamwe na WTO zigize Urwego rw\u2019ibikorwa bihuriweho ku bihugu bikiri mu nzira y\u2019amajyambere. Baganiriye ku bibazo byokubona isoko, ingingo zihariye n\u2019izitandukanye kubihugu bikiri munzira y\u2019amajyambere, uruhare rw\u2019ibihugu bikiri munzira y\u2019ubucuruzi bw\u2019ibihugu byinshi, n\u2019ibibazo by\u2019iterambere, cyane cyane inyungu z\u2019ibihugu bikiri munzira y\u2019amajyambere muri politiki y\u2019ipiganwa. Munama ya 28 ya G8 yabereye i Kananaskis, muri Alberta, Minisitiri w\u2019Intebe wa Kanada Jean Chr\u00e9tien yatanze igitekerezo kandi ashyira mu bikorwa gahunda yo kubona isoko, kugira ngo ibihugu 48 bikiri munzira y\u2019ubucuruzi bishobore kungukira mu \"bucuruzi butari inkunga\". Byongeye kandi, Intego ya 14 y\u2019Iterambere Rirambye ry\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye ishyigikira ko LDC zifatwa muburyo bwihariye kandi butandukanye nk\u2019igice cy\u2019ingenzi cy\u2019ibiganiro byo gutanga inkunga kuburobyi muri WTO. \nIbyifuzwa byo kugera ku isoko.\nIbihugu byinshibiha uburenganzira bwokugera kubihugu bikiri munzira y\u2019amajyambere. Urugero, Umuryango w\u2019Ubumwe bw\u2019u Burayi washyize mubikorwa gahunda ya Everything but Arms, mu gihe Ubusuwisi buha uburenganzira bwo kugera kwisoko ry\u2019ibicuruzwa byose ku bihugu bikirimu nzira y\u2019amajyambere. Kugera kwisoko ry\u2019u Buyapani na byonubuntu kubihugu bikiri munzira y\u2019amajyambere. \nGuhera kwitarikiya 1 Ukuboza 2024, Ubushinwa bwakuyeho imisoro kubicuruzwa byinjizwaga mu bihugu byose Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye ushyira mubyiciro ko bitaratera imbere kandi Ubushinwa bufitanye umubano wa dipolomasi. Ibihugu mirongo itatu na bitatu bizungukira muri aya masezerano biri mur'Afurika nahibihugu bitari iby'Afurika bihabwa imisorontamisoro ni Yemeni, Kiribati, Ibirwa bya Salomo, Afuganisitani, Bangladesh, Kamboje, Lawosi, Miyanimari, Nepali, na Timoru y\u2019Iburasirazuba. \nUrutonde rw'ibihugu.\nIbihugu 44 bikurikira bikurikira byashyizwe kurutonde nk\u2019ibihugu cyanen\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye guhera mu Kuboza 2024:\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b.\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\nHakurikijwe umugabane cyangwa akarere.\nHari ibihugu 32 byashyizwe mu cyiciro cy\u2019ibihugu bidakize cyane mur'Afurika, 8 muri Aziya, 3 muri Oseyaniya, nakimwe mur'Amerika.\nUrutonde rw' \"ibihugu bidateye imberecyane\" nk'uko Umuryango w'Abibumbye ubivuga, bimwe muribyo bikaba biri mubihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere bidakora kunyanja n'ibihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere byo mubirwa bito: \nAfurika\nAmerika\nAziya\nOseyaniya\nIbipimobitatu (umutungo w\u2019abantu, ibibazo by\u2019ubukungu n\u2019umusaruro mbumbe w\u2019igihugu kuri buri muturage) bigenzurwa na Komite ishinzwe Politiki y\u2019Iterambere buri myaka itatu. Ibihugu bigomba kuzuza bibiri muribitatu mwisuzuma rikurikiranye ry\u2019imyaka itatukugira ngo bisuzumwe mbere yo kurangiza amasomo. Komite ishinzwe Politiki y\u2019Iterambere yohereza inama zayo zo kwemeza Inama y\u2019Ubukungu n\u2019Imibereho Myiza (ECOSOC). \nNyuma yogutangiza icyiciro cya LDC, ibihugu umunani byarangije kugera kurwego \"rw'igihugu gikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere\". Igihugu cyambere cyarangije kugera kurwego rw'ubukungu ni Botswana mu 1994. Igihugucyakabiri cyari Cape Verde mu 2007. Maldives yarangije kugera ku rwego \"rw'igihugu gikiri munzira y'amajyambere\" muntangiriro za 2011, Samoa mu 2014, Guin\u00e9e Equatorial mu 2017, Vanuatu mu Ukuboza 2020, Bhutan mu Ukuboza 2023, na S\u00e3o Tom\u00e9 na Pr\u00edncipe mu Ukuboza 2024. \nIbihugu bikurikira ntibikiri mu itsinda ry\u2019 \"ibihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere\":"}
{"id": "21682", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21682", "title": "Tchoukball", "text": "Tchoukball / / \u02c8t\u0283u\u02d0kb\u0254\u02d0l / CHOOK - ball CHOOK numukino w\u2019ikipe yomunzu, ukinirwa n\u2019amakipe y\u2019abakinnyi 7. Wakorewe mu Busuwisi mumyaka ya 1970, kandi ukunzwecyane muri Singapuru, Ubusuwisi na Tayiwani, arikowabaye umukinompuzamahanga ufite amashyirahamwe y\u2019ibihugumu bihugu birenga 60. Uyoborwa n\u2019Ishyirahamwe Mpuzamahanga rya Tchoukball (FITB), ryashinzwe mu 1971.\nUbusanzwe ukinwumupira urimukibuga cyomunzu ufite agapira gato kogukubita umupira kumpera zose. Amakipe atsinda igitego atsinda umupira kuri rebounder hanyuma akawutera gukubita hasi mukibuga adafatiwe n'ikipe irikuruhande. Uyumukino wagenewe kugabanya imvune, kandi birabujijwe gukoranaho n'abakinnyi.\nAmateka.\nTchoukball yashinzwe mu Busuwisi na Hermann Brandt, waruhangayikishijwe n'imvune nyinshi zikomeye mu bakinnyi zikomoka kumikino ikunda guterubukana nogukorakora kumubiri. Yizeraga ko siporo idakwiye kuba iy'abatsinze gusa, ahubwo ikanagira uruhare mukurema umuryango mwiza kandi w'ubumuntu. Yashushanyije tchoukball kugirangibirimo ibice bya handball (ikinwa n'amaboko, kandi imipira ikoreshwa isa), volleyball (kuko ikipe irinda igomba gukumira umupira kugwa) na squash (kubera ko hari rebound).\nInkomoko y'umwimerere.\nIzina rya tchoukball (rizwi nka \"choukball\", hamwe na \"t\" ituje) rikomoka kwijwi ry'umupira \"tchouk\" umupira ukora iyuvuye kugitereko. \nAmategeko y'ibanze.\nAmakipe ashobora kubagizwe n'abakinnyi 12, ariko 7 gusa nibobashobora kuba barimukibuga igihe icyo ari cyo cyose. \nGukoranaho n'abakinnyi birabujijwe, kandi bamyugariro ntibashobora kugeragezagufata imipira y'ikipe irigutera. Abakinnyi bashobora guterintambwe eshatu n'umupira, bagafata umupira mugihe cy'amasegonda atatu. Amakipe ntashobora kurenza inshuro eshatu mbereyokurasa rebounder.\nUrukiko\nBitewe n'icyiciro cy'abakinnyi (Abagabo, Abagore, Urubyiruko), inganozitandukanye z'imipira zirakoreshwa. Iyi mipira iri hagati ya metero 54 n'umuzenguruko.\u00a0\u2013 60\u00a0cm n'uburemere kuvakuri 325 kugeza 475\u00a0garama.\nAmanota\nAmakipe abiri y\u2019abakinnyi 7 burikimwe (abagabo cyangwa abagore) arahatanira kubonamanota, ikipifite amanotamenshi kumusozo igatsinda umukino. Iyikipe ibonye inota, kugenzurumupira bihabwa indikipe.\nImyanya.\nBurikipe igizwe n'ibi bikurikira: Abashoferi 2 b'iburyo cyangwa iburyo; Abashoferi 2 b'ibumoso cyangwa ibumoso; Abakinnyi 2 cyangwa 3 b'inyuma cyangwumupira wimbere; Umupira 1 wo hagati cyangwa umupirawohagati (cyangwa nta n'umwe nibahakoreshejwe abakinnyi 3 b'inyuma).\nBuriruhande rw'ikibuga rugizwe n'umurashe ibumoso, umurashiburyo n'umwunganizi umwe cyangwa babiri, mugihe hagati akenshibahafi y'ikibuga hagati iyohakoreshejwe iyi fome. Abarashe muri rusange nibo bashinzwe kurasa nubwo rimwe na rimwe umwunganizi ashobora no gufata ishoti. Ababunganizi bashinzwe guhuza umurongo wa mbere w'ubwugarizi mu gihe fome yo hagati iyobora umurongo wa kabiri w'ubwugarizi. Arikwizindi fomesiyo zirimo kudakoresha fome yo hagati, ikipe yanyura hagati igatera umupira wose ku barashi/imbere. Ibibiha undimwunganizi wo ku murongo wa mbere cyangwa undi mwunganizi wo ku murongo wa kabiri wihariye.\nGukina umukino.\nAbakinnyi bafitumupira bashobora gutera intambwe zitarenze 3, bagafata umupira mugihe kitarenze amasegonda 3. Gusimbuka umupirantibyemewe.\nIyumupira utararangiye (umupira ukozehasi cyangwurenze imbibi), indikipe ifatuburenganzira bwo kuwutsinda.\nIkipirinda ntishobora kubangamira uteramugihe cyoguhanumupira.\nKwikipe itangamanota, kwinjira mugace kabujijwe n'umupira ntibyemewe. Umupirugomba kurekurwa mbereyuko umukinnyi agwa mugace kabujijwe.\nUretsumupira wa tchouk usanzwe womunzu, harikandi umupira wa tchouk wokumucanga n'umupira wa tchouk wo ku ntebe y'abamugaye, ufite amategeko atandukanye gato. Hariho kandi imikino y'urubyiruko na za kaminuza, itandukanye n'imikino ifunguye.\nIshyirahamwe Mpuzamahanga rya Tchoukball (FITB).\nFITB, yashinzwe mu 1971, ifite icyicaro i Gen\u00e8ve mu Busuwisi. Kugeza mu 2021, igizwe n'amashyirahamwe 50 y'abanyamuryango n'ibihugu 22 (15+7) bifitUhagarariye FITB wagenwe. Ishyigikira kandi ikagira inama amashyirahamwe y'ibihugu n'abantu kugiti cyabobiteguye gukwirakwiza tchoukball muturere dushya. Urugero, tchoukball iherutse gushyirwa murigahunda y'amashuri y'uturere tumwe na tumwetwa Senegali. FITB yari siporo y'imyigaragambyo mu mikino y'Isi yomu 2009, yabereye i Kaohsiung muri Tayiwani.\nKurwego rw'isi, tchoukball yiganjemo amakipe yomuri Tayiwani kuvamu 1980. Kuvicyogihe batsinzwe gusa nimu 2004 ubwo batsindwaga n'Ubusuwisi kumukino wanyuma w'abagabo, nomu 2023, ubwo Ubutaliyani bwabatsindaga muri kimwe cyakabiri cy'irangiza cy'abagore.\nIbibera ku isi.\nShampiyona y'Isi y'Urubyiruko rwa Tchoukball.\nShampiyona ya 6 ya FITB y'urubyiruko rwa Tchoukball 2023\nIbirori byo mu karere.\nShampiyona y'ingimbi za Aziya Pacific Tchoukball.\nIshyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru wa Aziya-Pasifika - APYTC\nMu 2014, Shampiyona ya 3 y'urubyiruko rwa Aziya Pacific Tchoukball yabereye muri Singapuru. Mu 2016, Shampiyona ya 4 y'urubyiruko rwa Aziya Pacific Tchoukball yabereye muri Taoyuan, muri Tayiwani.\nShampiyona ya 7 y'abakiri bato ba Aziya Pacific Tchoukball 2024, kuva ku ya 19 Nyakanga kugeza ku ya 21 Nyakanga 2024, i Johor Bahru muri Maleziya."}
