{"id": "21684", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21684", "title": "Afro-Germans", "text": "Abadage-Abadage (German) cyangw'Abadage b'Abirabura (German) nabaturage b'Abadage bafitinkomoko ikomoka mumokoyose y'abirabura yomur'Afurika.\nImijyi nka Hamburg na Frankfurt, yahoze arahantu haninihatuwe n\u2019abantu benshi nyuma y\u2019Intambara ya Kabiri y\u2019Isi Yose n\u2019abimukira baherutse, ifite imiryango myinshi y\u2019Abadage n\u2019Abanyafrika. Hamwe n\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019abimukira banone, imiryango nka Frankfurt, Berlin, Munich, na Cologne ifite umubare ugenda wiyongera w\u2019Abadage b\u2019Abanyafrika. Ibarura ry\u2019Abadage ntirikoresha ubwoko nk\u2019icyiciro. Umubare w\u2019abantu \"bafite amateka maremare y\u2019abimukira\" (\"mit Migrationshintergrund im weiteren Sinn\", bivuze kobafite niburanyogokuru umwewavukiye hanze y\u2019Ubudage), bivugwa ko barenga miliyoni 1.000.000. \"Umuryango Schwarzer Deutscher\" (\u201cAbirabura b\u2019Abadage Initiative\u201d) uvugako Abadage bosebafite inkomoko mur' Afurika barenga miliyoni 1.000.000. \nMurirusange, nibura abantu 711 000 bafitinkomoko mur'Afurika yomuri Subsharan.\nAmateka.\nImibanire y'Abanyafurika n'Abadage kuva mu 1600 kugeza mu mpera za 1800.\nMu myaka ya 1720, Anton Wilhelm Amo wavukiye muri Gana yatewinkunga n'umutware w'Umudage kugira ngo abe Umunyafurika wa mbere wize kaminuza y'i Burayi; amaze kurangiza amasomo ye, yigishaga kandi yandika muri filozofiya. Nyuma, Abanyafurika bazanywe nk'abacakara baturutse ku nkombe y'iburengerazuba bwa Afurika aho imirima myinshi y'Abadage yashinzwe, cyane cyane ku Nkombe ya Zahabu. Nyumay'aho Umwami Friedrich Wilhelm wa I wa Prussia agurishije imirima ye ya Ghana Gro\u00df Friedrichsburg muri Afurika mu 1717, aho abantu bageraku 30.000 bari baragurishijwe muri Dutch East India Company, ba nyirayo bashya bategetswe n'amasezerano yo \"kohereza abahungu 12 b'abirabura, batandatu muribobari bambaye iminyururu ya zahabu,\" kumwami. Abana b'abacakara bajyanywe i Potsdam na Berlin. \nImibanire y'Abanyafurika n'Abadage hagati ya 1884 na 1945.\nMunama yabereye i Berlin muri Kongo mu 1884, yitabiriwe n'ibihugu bikomeye byose by'icyo gihe, ibihugu by'i Burayi byagabanyije Afurika mo ibice by'ingenzi byagenzuraga. Ubudage bwagenzuraga koloni mukarere k'ibiyaga bigari bya Afurika na Afurika y'Iburengerazuba, aho Abanyafurika benshi bimukiye mu Budage bwa mbere. Ubudage bwashyizeho inzobere mu miyoborere n'ubukungu by'abakoloni, kandi urubyiruko rwinshi rw'Abanyafurika rwagiye mu Budage kwigishwa. Bamwe bahawe amashuri makuru mumashuri na za kaminuza z'Abadage, ariko abenshi bahuguwe mubigo by'amahugurwa y'ubutumwa n'amahugurwa y'abakoloni nk'abayobozi cyangwa abarimu b'ubutumwa bw'imbere mugihugu. Abanyafurika bakunzekuba abasemuzi b'indimi nyafurika mubigo by'ubushakashatsi by'Abadage n'Abanyafurika, ndetseno mu buyobozi bw'abakoloni. Abandi bimukiye mu Budage nk'abahoze ari abasirikare bashinzwe kurinda Abadage, Askari. [\"Icyitonderwa kirakenewe\"]\nAkarere ka Afrikanisches Viertel ka Berlin nako numurage w\u2019igihe cy\u2019ubukoloni, ahwimihanda myinshi n\u2019ibibuga by\u2019amakuru byitiriwe ibihugu n\u2019ahantu bifitanye isano n\u2019ubwami bw\u2019Abadage bwakolonijwe. Ubuniho harigice kinini cy\u2019abaturage b\u2019i Berlin bafitumurage w\u2019Abanyafurika.\nAbashakanye b\u2019amoko atandukanye bomuturere twa koloni bashyizwemo igitutu gikomeye mu bukangurambaga bwo kurwanya ihohoterwa rishingiye kugitsina, birimogutesha agaciro ishyingiranwa, gutangaza ko abana b\u2019amoko atandukanye aribirarane, nokubambura ubwenegihugu bw\u2019Ubudage. Mugihe cy\u2019itsembatsemba ry\u2019Abanama mu 1907 n\u2019Ubudage, umuyobozi w\u2019Abadage ushinzwe ibibazo by\u2019ubukoloni, Bernhard Dernburg, yavuzeko \"amwe mu moko kavukire, kimwe n\u2019inyamaswa zimwenazimwe, agomba kurimburwa\". \u00a0\nRepubulika ya Weimar.\nMugihe cy'Intambara ya Mbere y'Isi Yose, Ababiligi, Abongereza n'Abafaransa bigaruriye koloni z'Ubudage mur'Afurika. Imiterere y'abakoloni b'Abanyafurika mu Budage yarahindutse muburyo butandukanye. Urugero, Abanyafurika bari bafite ikarita y'indangamuntu y'Abadage ya gikoloni bari bafite uburenganzira bwo gufatwa nk' \"abanyamuryango b'uturere twahoze dukingirwa \". Nyuma y'Amasezerano ya Versailles (1919), Abanyafurika bashishikarijwe kubabaturage b'ibihugu bategetswe, arikwabenshi bahitamo kugumahobari. Mubusabe bwinshi (bwanditswe nezakuri Togoland y'Abadage na P. Sebald na Kameruni na A. R\u00fcger), bagerageje kumenyesha abaturage b'Abadage ukwibintu byaribimeze muri koloni, kandibakomeje gusabubufasha n'inkunga by'Abadage. [\"Icyitonderwa kirakenewe\"]\nAbanyafurika bashinze ikinyamakuru kivuga kundimi ebyiri cyasohotse mu Kidage no mu kidage: \"Elolombe ya Kameruni\" (Izuba rya Kameruni). Itsinda rya politiki ry\u2019Abadage b\u2019Abirabura ryashinze ishami ry\u2019Abadage ry\u2019umuryango uharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu ufiticyicaro i Paris, Ligue de d\u00e9fense de la race n\u00e8gre (Icyongereza: League for the Defense of the Negro Race) nk\u2019ikinyamakuru \"Liga zur Verteidigung der Negerrasse\", ku ya 17 Nzeri 1929. \nUbudage bwa Nazi.\nImitererey\u2019Abadage b\u2019Abanyafrika mu Budage yarushijeho kuba mibi mu gihe cy\u2019Abanazi. Abadage b\u2019Abanyafrika batakaje pasiporo zabo. Imiterere y\u2019akazi n\u2019ingendo byagoranye cyane ku bahanzi b\u2019Abadage b\u2019Abanyafrika, abakoramunjyana zitandukanye, abakora mumyitozo ya sirkisi cyangwa filime. Kubera politiki y\u2019Abanazi, abakoresha ntibashoboye kugumana cyangwa guha akazi abakozi b\u2019Abadage b\u2019Abanyafrika. \nAbadage b\u2019aba-Afro-Udage mu Budage baribaragizwe akato mumuryango kandibabujijwe gukoranimibonano mpuzabitsina nogushyingiranwa n\u2019Aba-Aryan n\u2019amategeko ya Nuremberg. Mwihohoterwa ryakomeje gukorwa kubitwaga aba-Rhineland, abayobozi b\u2019Abanazi bashyize abana b\u2019aba-Afro-Udage bagera kuri 500 bo muri Rhineland mukato. Abadage b\u2019aba-Afro-Udage bafatwaga nk\u2019 \"abanzi b\u2019igihugu gishingiye ku bwoko\", hamwe n\u2019Abayahudi n\u2019Abaromani. Abanazi babanje gushaka gukuraho Abayahudi n\u2019Abaromani mugihugu cy\u2019Ubudage binyuze mukwirukana (nomunyuma bagakurwaho), mugihe Abadage b\u2019aba-Afro-Udage bagombaga gukurwaho burundu kandamaherezo bagakurwaho binyuze mukato. \nBamwe mu Badage b'abirabura babayeho muriicyogihe nyumabanditse kubyobanyuzemo. Mu 1999, Hans Massaquoi yasohoye igitabo \"cyitwa Destined to Witness\" kivuga kubuzimabwe mu Budage ku ngoma ya Nazi, naho mu 2013 Theodor Wonja Michael, wari n'umutangabuhamya mukurumuri filime filime filime \"Pages in the Factory of Dreams\", yasohoye igitabo kivuga kubuzima bwe, \"Deutsch Sein und Schwarz dazu.\" \nKuva mu 1945.\nIrangira ry'Intambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose ryazanyingabo z'ibihugu by'Abongereza n'Abafaransa mu Budage. Ingabo z'Abanyamerika, Abongereza n'Abafaransa zarizirimo abasirikare benshi b'Abanyamerika b'Abanyafurika, Abanyakarayibe cyangwa Abanyafurika, kandi bamwe muri bo babyaranye abana n'abagore b'Abadage. Icyo gihe, izi ngabo muri rusange zakurikizaga amategeko yokudahuza abavandimwe kandizabuzaga ishyingiranwa ry'abasivili n'abasirikare. Abana bagera ku 5,000 murabobana b'Abanyakariyabeti b'amoko abiri bavutse nyuma y'intambara mu 1955. Ababyeyi benshi b'Abadage b'abagore bonyine babyaye \"abana b'umukara\", ariko ibihumbi n'ibihumbi barerwaga n'imiryango y'Abanyamerika kandi bakurira muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika. Akenshi ntibamenyaga inkomoko yabo kugeza bageze mukigero cy'imyaka mikuru.\nKugeza kwiherezo ry\u2019Intambara y\u2019Ubutita, Leta Zunze Ubumwe z' Amerika zagumanye abasirikare ba Amerika barenga 100.000 ku butaka bw\u2019Ubudage. Mugihecy\u2019aho, ababagabo bashinze ubuzimabwabo mu Budage. Akenshibazanaga imiryango cyangwa bagashinga indimishya ifite abagore n\u2019abana b\u2019Abadage bomubwoko bw\u2019Abadage. Guverinoma y\u2019Ubudage bw\u2019Iburengerazuba yashyizeho politiki yo gushyira mukato cyangwa gukura mu Budage abobana yitaga \"abana b\u2019abazungu b\u2019amoko atandukanye\". \nAudre Lorde, umwanditsi w\u2019umwirabura w\u2019Umunyamerika akaba n\u2019umurwanizi, yamazimyaka kuva mu 1984 kugeza mu 1992 yigisha muri Kaminuza yigenga ya Berlin. Mugihe yamazemu Budage, akenshi hitwaga \"Imyaka ya Berlin,\" yafashije mu gutuma ijambo \"Afro-German\" rishyirwa mu itsinda ryibanda ku guhuza amoko, igitsina n\u2019imibonano mpuzabitsina. Yashishikarijabagore b\u2019abirabura b\u2019Abadage nka May Ayim na Ika H\u00fcgel-Marshall kwandika nogusohora imivugo n\u2019amateka y\u2019ubuzima bwabo kugirango bamenyekane. Yakurikiranye ubugore bw\u2019ibihugu kwisi kandakora nk\u2019umuvugizi w\u2019iryo tsinda mu Budage. [\"Icyitonderwa kirakenewe\"]\nAbimukira.\nKuvamu 1981, Ubudage bwabonye abimukira baturutse mubihugu by'Afurika, cyanecyane Nijeriya, Eritereya na Gana, bashakaga ubuhungiro bwa politiki, akazi cyangwa amasomo muri za kaminuza zomu Budage.\nHasihari amatsinda manini cyane yomur'Afurika (yo munsi y'ubutayu bwa Sahara) mu Budage. [\"Icyitonderwa kirakenewe\"]\nIvanguramoko n'urwego rw'imibereho.\nUbushakashatsi bwakozwe n'Ikigo cy'Umuryango w'Ubumwe bw'u Burayi gishinzwe Uburenganzira bw'ibanze, bukorerwa ubushakashatsi ku bimukira barenga 16.000, barimo abantu barenga 6.700 bavukiye mur'Afurika yomunsi y'ubutayu bwa Sahara. Nk'ukubushakashatsi bubivuga, igipimo cy'ivangura cyavuzwe cyane mumyaka ishize cyari mu Burayi buvuga Ikidage, cyane cyane mu Budage - aho 54% batangaje kobahuye n'ihohoterwa rishingiye ku ivanguramoko, hejuru cyane y'impuzandengo ya 30% y'Umuryango w'Ubumwe bw'u Burayi \nAbadage bazwi cyane mu Budage bw'iki gihe.\nUbuhanzi, umuco na muzika.\nUbuzima bw'umuco bw'Abanyafurika-Abadage burangwa n'uburyo butandukanye n'uburyo bugoye. Nyuma yo kugaragara kwa MTV na Viva, gukundwa kw'umuco wa pop w'Abanyamerika kwatumye Abanyafurika-Abadage bahagararirwa mu itangazamakuru n'umuco w'Abadage.\nMay Ayim (1960-1996), yari umusizi w\u2019umudage ukomoka muri Afurika, umurezi akaba n\u2019umurwanashyaka. Yari umwanditsi wungirije w\u2019igitabo \"Farbe bekennen\", aho ubuhinduzi bwe mu Cyongereza bwasohotse nka \"Showing Our Colors: Afro-German Women Speak Out\".\nAbahanzi bazwi cyane bakomoka mu Budage barimo:\nFilime na televiziyo.\n\"SFD - Schwarze Filmschaffende in Deutschland\" (\"Abakora Filimi b'Abirabura mu Budage\") ni ishyirahamwe ry'abanyamwuga rikorera i Berlin rigenewe abayobozi ba filime, abatunganya filime, abanditsi ba filime, n'abakinnyi b'ikinamico b'Abadage bakomoka muri Afurika cyangwa abirabura batuye mu Budage. Bateguye urukurikirane rwa \"New Perspectives\" mu Iserukiramuco Mpuzamahanga rya Filime rya Berlin. \nAbanyafurika b'Abadage bazwi cyane muri filime na televiziyo barimo:"}
{"id": "21685", "revid": "19155", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21685", "title": "Jose Chameleone", "text": "Joseph Mayanja (wavutse kuya 30 mata 1979), uzwicyane kwizina ry'ubuhanzi rya Jose Chameleone, numuhanzi akaba n'umucuranzi w'umunya -Uganduririmba injyana ya AfroBeat. Aririmba mu rurimi rw'Ikiganda, Icyongereza n'Igiswahili.\nUbuzima bwa mbere n'uburezi.\nJoseph Mayanja yavutse kuya 30 Mata 1979 kuri Gerald na Prossy Mayanja mukarere ka Kampala, akabumwana wa kane mubana umunani. \nYize mwishuri ribanza rya Nakasero, mwishuri ryisumbuye rya Mengo, mwishuri ryisumbuye rya Kawempe Muslim, mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Katikamu rya karindwi ry\u2019abadivantisiti, no mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Progressive Senior. \nYahimbye indirimbo y\u2019ishuri ryisumbuye rya Kawempe Muslim. Niumwe mubagize Kiliziya Gatolika y\u2019i Roma muri Uganda.\nUmwuga w'umuziki.\nInjyana ya Chameleone nuruvange rw'indirimbo gakondo zomuri Uganda, rhumba yo muri Afurika yo Hagati, zouk, na reggae. \nUmwuga wewatangiye mu 1996 nk'umu DJ muri Missouri night club i Kampala. Yatangiye gukora nk'umucuranzi mu 1998 muri Kenya arikumwe n'itsinda rya Ogopa Deejays, icyogihe rikaba ryari irya Kenya, ryasohoye indirimbo yeyambere, \"Bageya\", yari irimo umuhanzi w'umunyakenya Redsan. \nChameleone yashyizahagaragara alubumu yeyambere, \"Mama Mia\", mu 2000. Kugeza mu 2013, yari amaze gushyira ahagaragara alubumu 13 zose, zirimo \"Kipepeo\", \"Shida za dunia\", \"Valu valu\", \"Bayuda\", \"Badilisha\", \"Banana nziza\" na \"Nyampinga\". \nNubwumuzikiwe ukunzwe hiryanohino kumugabane w' Afurika, abafana be benshi/abamwumva bakomoka cyane cyane mu gice cyo hagati cya Afurika (Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, u Rwanda, u Burundi, Kenya, Uganda, na Tanzaniya). \nYaririmbye imbere y'abantu benshi cyane kuri sitade ya Lugogo Cricket Oval i Kampala.\nChameleone yakoreye ibitaramo mpuzamahanga, harimo muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, Kanada, Ubwongereza, Suwede, Ububiligi, Maleziya, Ubushinwa, Afurika y'Epfo, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Zambiya, Malawi, Sudani y'Epfo, Ubudage, n'Ubusuwisi. [\"Icyitonderwa kirakenewe\"]\nYazengurutse Ositaraliya mu 2017 no muri Werurwe 2023. \nMuri Gashyantare 2023, Chameleone yakozigitaramo cyiza cyitwa \"Gwanga Mujje\", bisobanura \"reka igihugu cyose kizitabire\". Ikigitaramo cyabereye i Lugogo Cricket Oval i Kampala. Igitaramo cyari giteganyijwe mbere y'itariki, cyasubitswe kuberimvura nyinshi maze cyimurirwa kuya 24 Gashyantare 2023. \nChameleone yateguye igikorwa cy\u2019urukundo cyagurishijwe cyanecyitwa \"One Man, One Million\" muri Victoria Hall i Kampala. Ikigikorwa cyashyigikiwe na Madamu wa Perezida wa Uganda, Janet Museveni, kandi abitabiriye basabwaga kwishyura miliyoni imwe y\u2019amashilingi ya Uganda kugira ngo bitabire. \nIkirango cy'umuziki.\nChameleone ni Umuyobozi Mukuru w\u2019inzu y\u2019umuziki ya Leone Island. Abahanzi bafitanye isano n\u2019iyi nzu barimo nyakwigendera Mosey Radio, Weasel, nyakwigendera AK 47 Mayanja, King Saha, Papa Cidy, Pallaso, Melody Uganda, Yung Mulo na Big Eye. \nIbindi bikorwa.\nUwahoze ari Perezida w\u2019Inteko Ishinga Amategeko ya Uganda, Rebecca Kadaga, yagennye Chameleone kuba Ambasaderi wa Busoga Tourism Initiative.\nAnayobora Chameleone Foundation, igamije guteza imbere ubumenyi n'impano mu rubyiruko rudafite amahirwe. \nChameleone ni umwe mu bagize ihuriro ry'abahanzi bakoresha icyamamare cyabo n'ubutunzi bwabo mu gufasha kugabanya ubukene no gukora ubukangurambaga ku cyorezo cya SIDA. \nYiyamamarije umwanya wa Meya wa Kampala mu 2021. "}
{"id": "21686", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21686", "title": "BRICS Games", "text": "Imikino ya BRICS+ nirushanwa ryaburi mwaka rihuza imikino myinshi ritegurwa n'ibihugu bya BRICS. Irirushanwa murirusange ritegurwa n'igihugu kiyobora itsinda muri uwomwaka. \nInyuma.\nNyumay'uko irushanwa ry'ibanze ry'umupira w'amaguru ry'abari munsiy'imyaka 17 ryabereye i Goa mu 2016, irushanwa ryambere rya BRICS ryabereye i Guangzhou mu Bushinwa mu 2017. Imikino yambereyarigizwe na volleyball, wushu, na taolu.\nImikinoyakurikiyehoyabereye i Johannesburg mu 2018, igizwe na volleyball y'abagabo n'abagore ndetse n'umupira w'amaguru w'ishyirahamwe ry'abagore.\nNtibyakozwemu 2019 na 2020, kubericyorezo cya COVID-19. \nImikino ya BRICS yomu 2021 yagombagagutegurwa n'Ubuhinde, kandiyagombaga guhuzwa n'imikino ya Khelo India yariteganyijwe muriuwomwaka. Iritangazoryatanzwe na Minisitiri w'Ubuhinde wa Siporo n'Urubyiruko, Kiren Rijiju, mu nama y'Abaminisitiri ba Siporo bomu bihugu bya BRICS. Ubuhinde bwabaye umuyobozi w'itsinda mpuzamahanga ryigenga ry'ibihugu bitanu mu 2021. Imikino yagombaga kubera mugihekimwe nahantu hamwe n'imikino ya Khelo India 2021, ariko amaherezibintibyakomeje. \nIkigikorwa cyomu 2022 cyateguwe n'Ubushinwa, arikonticyashoboraga kubera imbonankubone bitewe na politiki y'akarere yerekeye icyorezo cya coronavirus. \nIki gikorwa cya 2023 cyateguwe na Afurika y'Epfo mu Kwakira kibera i Durban. [bikenewe kuvugururwa] \nUburusiya bwakoreye irushanwa rya 2024 i Kazan. \nInyandiko zasohotse.\nInkomoko: "}
{"id": "21687", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21687", "title": "Umuziki isoko y'ubuzima", "text": "Umuziki waje kugaragara nka zimwe mu mpamvu zatuma umuntu abaho yishimye cyangwa se zikaba zafashwa mu kuzamura ibyiyumviro byiza kuri buri muntu wese.\nAbashakashatsi bagaragaza ko umuziki ufite mu mimaro imwe n'imwe ikurikira:\n. Uwo bita Daniyeli levitini(Daniel levitin).Uyu ni umushakashatsi mu by\u2019ubwonko (neuroscientist) akaba n'umwanditsi w\u2019igitabo cyitwa \"\u201cThis Is Your Brain on Music.\u201d\" uyu mushakashatsi yerekanye ko umuziki ugabanya umusemburo wa cortisol utera stress kandi ugatuma umubiri ukora dopamine ituma umuntu ayumva amerewe neza.\n. Undi mushakashatsi twavuga bamwita Dr sylvain Moreno akaba akorera ubushakashatsi bwe muri kaminuza ya New york(USA) yerekanye ko 90% by\u2019abana bigishijwe umuziki mu gihe cy\u2019ukwezi kumwe gusa bagaragaje kwiyongera kw\u2019ubwenge (verbal intelligence) no gusobanukirwa amagambo vuba.\n. undi mushakashatsi twavugaho ni Nina Kraus ari umuyobozi w'ishami ryitwa Auditory neuroscience akaba yarerekanye ko kwiga gukoresha ibicurangisho bituma ubwonko bumenya gutandukanya amajwi neza, bigafasha mu kwiga indimi no mu mibanire n\u2019abandi.\nIbi ni bimwe mu bigaragaza akamaro k'umuziki kandi akaba ari nawo ukunzwe cyane cyane ko ukoreshwa mu buzima bwacu bwa buri munsi."}
{"id": "21688", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21688", "title": "Ririmba", "text": "Umuhanzi Ririmba (izina rye ryiteka ni Gisa Cy'Ingozo) ni umwe mu bahanzi bakomeje kwigarurira imitima y'urubyiruko mu Rwanda, cyane cyane binyuze mu njyana ya n'iyitwa Kinyatrap.\nDore ibintu by'ingenzi wamenya kuri we:\nInjyana n'Imiterere ().\nRirimba azwiho ijwi ririmo \"\" ikoreshejwe mu buryo bw'umwimerere ndetse n'amagambo (lyrics) akunze kugaruka ku buzima bwo mu muhanda, urukundo, n'icyizere cy'ejo hazaza. Ni umwe mu bagize itsinda rya LoudSound Music, ririmo n'abandi bahanzi bakomeye nka Bushali na Slum Drip.\nIndirimbo ze zakunzwe.\nRirimba amaze gusohora indirimbo nyinshi zakoze ku mitima y'abantu, zimwe muri zo harimo:\nAkamaro ke muri Kinyatrap.\nRirimba afatwa nk' \"Imbaraga zihishe\" (The hidden gem) muri Kinyatrap. Mu gihe Bushali azwiho imbaraga nyinshi ku rubyiniro (energy), Ririmba we azwiho kuzana injyana ituze, irimo amarangamutima (melodic vibes) ituma indirimbo zabo zirushaho kuryoha.\nIcyitonderwa.\nHari igihe abantu bamwitiranya na Gisa cy'Ingozo (umuhanzi w'ijwi rirangurura wamenyekanye mu myaka yo hambere), ariko uyu Ririmba ni undi muhanzi mushya w'ikiragano gishya (New School)."}
{"id": "21689", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21689", "title": "Solange Nyiraneza", "text": "Solange Nyiraneza (wavutse kuya 28 Kamena 1996) numukinnyi w\u2019umunyarwanda wa Volleyball ukinira Sitting ukinamarushanwa ya Volleyball. Yahatanye mumikino Paralympic yomumpeshyi ya 2016, 2020 na 2024. \nUbuzima bwite.\nAbabyeyi ba Nyiraneza, baribavanze n\u2019Abahutu n\u2019Abatutsi, bishwe mubujura ubwo yari afite amezi atatu, mushikiwe mukuru na murumunawe baramureraga. Solange amazimyaka itanu, yagiye gukina hanzenamurumunawe agwa avunika patella, ahisha igikomerecye mugihe cy\u2019icyumweru kugirango mushiki we atamurakarira. Bamujyanye kwamuganga gupimwa ubucucike bw\u2019amagufwa, nyumabiza kugaragarako Nyiraneza yari afite kanseri y\u2019amagufwa, yaciwe ukuguru kwekw\u2019ibumosomunsi y\u2019ikibuno. "}
{"id": "21690", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21690", "title": "Rwanda at the 2004 Summer Paralympics", "text": "U Rwanda rwitabiriye irushanwa rya Paralympic ryo mu mpeshyi ryabereye i Atene mu Bugereki mu 2004. Ikipeyaririmo umugabo umwe n'umugorumwe. Abakinnyi baturutse mu Rwanda begukanye umudari umwe wa bronze barangiza kumwanya wa 73 ku rutonde rw'imidari. "}
{"id": "21691", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21691", "title": "Rwanda at the 2012 Summer Paralympics", "text": "U Rwanda rwitabiriye amarushanwa ya Paralympic yo mu mpeshyi ya 2012 yabereye i Londres mu Bwongereza, kuva kuya 29 Kanama kugeza kuya 9 Nzeri 2012. \nIkipe.\nDominique Bizimana yabaye Perezida wa Komite y'Igihugu y'Imikino y'Abamugaye mu Rwanda mu 2012, ndetse nokubumwe mubagizikipe y'igihugu y'abagabo ya sitting volleyball. Itsinda ry'abahagarariye itsinda ryacumbitse muri Cavesson House mumudugudu w'abamugaye. \nVolleyball.\nIrushanwa ry'abagabo.\nIyikipe niyo yambere yomur'Afurika yomunsi y'ubutayu bwa Sahara yitabiriye imikino ya Paralempike. Benshi mu bagize ikipe bagiye i Londres barokotse cyangwa bafite imiryango yarokotse jenoside yakorewe mu Rwanda. Babiri mu bagize ikipe y'igihugu batakaje amaguru n'amaboko barwana n'abakoze jenoside yakorewe mu 1992. Umwemurabo bagizikipe watakaje ukuguru ni Dominique Bizimana. "}
{"id": "21692", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21692", "title": "Rwanda at the 2020 Summer Paralympics", "text": "U Rwanda rwitabiriye amarushanwa ya Paralympic yomumpeshyi ya 2020 yabereye i Tokyo mu Buyapani, kuva kuya 24 Kanama na 5 Nzeri 2021. Uyuwari umunsi wagatandatu rwitabiriye amarushanwa ya Paralympic yomumpeshyi kuva mu 2000.\nVolleyball yo kwicara.\nIkipe y'abagore yomu Rwanda ya sitting volleyball yegukanye itike yokwitabira imikino ya Paralympic yomumpeshyi ya 2020 nyumayogutsinda imikino ya ParaVolley Africa Zonal Championships yomu 2019. "}
{"id": "21693", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21693", "title": "Rwanda at the 2024 Summer Paralympics", "text": "U Rwanda rwitabiriye irushanwa rya Paralympic ryo mumpeshyi ya 2024 ryabereye i Paris mu Bufaransa, kuva kuya 28 Kanama kugeza kuya 8 Nzeri 2024. Ryarirushanwa rya karindwi ryikurikiranya ry\u2019igihugu muri Paralympic zomumpeshyi, kuvaho igihugucyatangiriye mu 2000.\nAbarushanwa.\nUrutonde rw'abahatana muri iyi mikino rukurikira.\nSiporo.\nEmmanual Niyibizi yegukanye itike nyumayo gutsindira umudari wa zahabu muri Grand Prix y'isi ya Dubai 2024 kuya 15 Gashyantare 2024. \nVolleyball yo kwicara.\nIkipe y'igihugu y'abagore y'u Rwanda yinjiye mumikino Paralempike bitewe n'umudari wa zahabu yatsindiye, mwirushanwa ry'Afurika rya Sitting Volleyball ryomu 2024 ryabereye i Lagos muri Nijeriya. \nIbura ry'umukinnyi.\nKwitarikiya 27 Kanama 2024, Claudine Bazubagira womwikipe ya sitting volleyball yaburiwe irengero na Komite Olempike y'u Rwanda, nyuma y'uko batari bakimubona kuvabavuye mu nkambi y'ikipe i Courbevoie kwitariki ya 20 Kanama. "}
