{"id": "21695", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21695", "title": "Rwanda at the 2010 Summer Youth Olympics", "text": "U Rwanda rwitabiriye imikino Olempike y\u2019urubyiruko yo mumpeshyi ya 2010, imikino Olempike y\u2019urubyiruko ya mbere, yabereye muri Singapuru kuva kuya 14 Kanama kugeza kuya 26 Kanama 2010."}
{"id": "21696", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21696", "title": "Rwanda at the 2014 Summer Youth Olympics", "text": "U Rwanda rwitabiriye imikino Olempike y'ingimbi yomumpeshyi ya 2014, i Nanjing, mu Bushinwa kuva kuya 16 Kanama kugeza kuya 28 Kanama 2014.\nSiporo.\nU Rwanda rwabonye abakinnyi bane. \nVolleyball yo ku mucanga.\nU Rwanda rwatsinze ikipe y'abahungu n'abakobwa binyuze mu kwitwara neza mu irushanwa rya CAVB Qualification Tournament. \nKugendera ku igare.\nU Rwanda rwahawe ikipe y'abakobwa kugira ngo ihiganwe na komisiyo y'ibihugu bitatu. \nKoga.\nU Rwanda rwabonye itike yo koga umwe. "}
{"id": "21697", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21697", "title": "Rwanda at the 2018 Summer Youth Olympics", "text": "U Rwanda rwitabiriye imikino Olempike y'ingimbi y'impeshyi ya 2018 i Buenos Aires, muri Argentine kuva kuya 6 Ukwakira kugeza kuya 18 Ukwakira 2018. "}
