{"id": "21700", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21700", "title": "Kwibuka T20 Tournament", "text": "Kwibuka T20 Tournament cyangwa se irushanwa ryo Kwibuka T20, ni irushanwa rikorwa n\u2019abagore mu mukino wa Cricket ribera mu Rwanda buri mwaka kuva muri 2014. Iri rushanwa mbere ryabanje kwitwa irushanwa rya Kwibuka Cricket for Peace, rigamije kwibuka abazize jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994. Mu mikino ya mbere, iri rushanwa ryitabiriwe n\u2019ibihugu byo muri Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba, ariko ryagiye rikura mu myaka yakurikiyeho rigera ku makipe yo hirya no hino muri Afurika no hanze yayo. \nAmateka.\nImikino ya mbere yabaye muri Kamena 2014 ku kibuga cya Kicukiro, kizwi nka Sitade Mpuzamahanga ya Cricket ya Gahanga i Kigali, ndetse yakiriye irushanwa ry'imikino itanu hagati y'u Rwanda na Uganda, ryatsinzwe n'Abagande ku bitego 4-1. Iyi mikino ya 2015, Kenya yiritabiriye hamwe nu Rwanda na Uganda. Abanyakenya batsinze imikino yabo yose kugira ngo begukane igikombe, mu gihe abari bakiriye iyi mikino bananiwe gutsinda. Kenya yikuye mu irushanwa rya 2016, bituma u Rwanda na Uganda bakina umukino wa 2016, maze abashyitsi batsinda ku bitego 4-0. Uganda nayo yatsinze irushanwa rya 40-overs umunsi umwe nyuma y'uko imikino ya T20 irangiye. "}
{"id": "21701", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21701", "title": "Skol Adrien Cycling Academy", "text": "Skol Adrien Cycling Academy cyangwa se ishuri rya Skol ry'adrien Cycling Academy, ni ikipe yababigize umwuga ibarizwa mu Rwanda, basiganwa ku magare mu muhanda. Iyi kipe yashinzwe muri 2020 n\u2019uwahoze ari umukinnyi w\u2019amagare Adrien Niyonshuti Adrien kugira ngo ifashe guteza imbere abakiri bato b\u2019abasiganwa ku magare bo mu Rwanda ibarizwa mu makipe yo ku rwego rwa afurika. "}
{"id": "21702", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21702", "title": "Adrien Niyonshuti", "text": "Adrien Niyonshuti (yavutse ku ya 2 Mutarama 1987) ni Umunyarwanda wahoze asiganwa ku magare wa bigize umwuga, yakinnye mu ikipe ya Team Dimension Data yo muri afurika y'epfo kuva mu 2009 kugeza 2017.Mu 2021, yakoraga nk'umuyobozi wa siporo mu ikipe ya UCI Continental Team Skol Adrien Cycling Academy.. Muri 2023, aza ku yobora ikipe y'igihugu yo gusiganwa ku magare muri B\u00e9nini yitegura imikino ya Shampiyona y'isi yari kubera mu Rwanda muri 2025.\nAdrien yari afite abavandimwe batandatu gusa bishwe muri jenoside yakorewe mu Rwanda muri 1994. Nilyonshuti yatangiye gutwara igare yahawe na nyirarume akiri ingimbi ubwo yamenyaga uwahoze ari umunyegare wabigize umwuga Jacques Boyer muri 2006 mu irushanwa rya mbere rya Wooden Bike Classic. \nUmwuga.\nNiyonshuti yavukiye i Rwamagana, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba, mu Rwanda, yatangiye gusiganwa ku magare y'abatarabigize umwuga afite imyaka cumi n'itandatu. Muri 2006, yamenyanye n'uwahoze ari umukinnyi w'amagare w'umwuga, Jacques Boyer, wari umunyamerika wa mbere wagiye mu irushanwa rya Tour de France, yakoreraga mu Rwanda mu mushinga wo gutumiza amagare y'imizigo ku bahinzi ba kawa. Boyer yanabaye umutoza w'ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda ishinzwe gusiganwa ku magare, anashaka Niyonshuti ngo ajye mu isiganwa. Niyonshuti yagize umusaruro mwiza mu masiganwa yo mu gace nka Tour of Rwanda, aho yarangije mu myaka icumi ya mbere yikurikiranya kandi atsinda kuva 2006 na 2008. "}
{"id": "21703", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21703", "title": "Rwanda Cycling Federation", "text": "Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019amagare mu Rwanda ni urwego ruyobora umukino wa magare mu Rwanda. ni umunyamuryango w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wo gusiganwa ku magare muri Afurika ndetse n\u2019ubumwe bwamagare ku isi.\nUbuyobozi.\nPerezida wa federatiyo mu Rwanda yari Murenzi Abdallah, wahoze ari umuyobozi w'Akarere ka Nyanza, watowe ku ya 22 Ukuboza 2019. Murenzi yasimbuye Aimable Bayingana, weguye mu ntangiriro z'uku kwezi kubera ibirego bya ruswa n'ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina, \nIkigo.\nKomite ishinzwe imiyoborere ya federatiyo igizwe na perezida, ba visi perezida babiri, umunyamabanga mukuru, umubitsi n'abajyanama batatu, bose bakaba ari imyanya yatowe. "}
{"id": "21704", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21704", "title": "Police Women Volleyball club", "text": "Police Women Volleyball club nikipe yabagore ikina umukino wamaboko volleyball mu Rwanda \nNikipe yashinzwe na Police y'urwanda hagamijwe guteza imbere volleyball y'abagore no gutuma Police y'urwanda Igira uruhare muri Siporo.\nIbyo yagezeho.\nYegukanye shampiyona y\u2019uRwanda mu bagore inshuro zitandukanye.\nYagiye igera kenshi ku mikino ya nyuma (finals) ya shampiyona n\u2019andi marushanwa.\nyagiye ihagararira uRwanda mu marushanwa y\u2019amakipe ya Afurika nka African Women\u2019s Club Volleyball Championship."}
{"id": "21705", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21705", "title": "Murenzi Abdallah", "text": "Murenzi Abdallah ni umuyobozi w'ikipe ya Rayon sprots fc akaba yarahoze ari umuyobozi wa federatiyo y'amagare mu Rwanda, ndetse ya yoboye akarere ka Nyanza.\nUbuzima.\nMurenzi Abdallah ni umugabo ubarizwa m'ubamusiramu, ufie umugore n'abana, ise nawe akaba yarakinnye mu ikipe ya rayon sprots fc."}
{"id": "21706", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21706", "title": "Aimable Bayingana", "text": "Aimable Bayingana (yavutse ku ya 14 Nyakanga 1970) yari umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019imikino mu Rwanda. \nBayingana yabaye perezida w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019amagare mu Rwanda hagati ya 2007 na 2019. Kuva mu Kwakira 2018 kugeza mu Ukuboza 2019, yayoboye nk\u2019umuyobozi w'ishyirahamwe ry\u2019amagare rihuza ibihugu 33 bivuga igifaransa. \nUbuzima.\nBayingana yavutse ku ya 14 Nyakanga 1970, i Gatsibo, Intara y'Iburasirazuba, mu Rwanda. Afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu by'ubugeni yakuye muri Kaminuza ya Lom\u00e9, muri Togo. \nUmwuga.\nKu ya 5 Ukuboza 2007, mu gikorwa cyabereye kuri Sitade Amahoro, Bayingana yatorewe kuba perezida w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abahoze ari abasiganwa mu magare mu Rwanda, ubu akaba ari FERWACY asimbuye Hon. Kamanda Charles wari umuyobozi kuva muri 2002, yayoboye uyu mwanya kugeza mu Ukuboza 2019. Kuva mu 2009 kugeza mu Ukuboza 2019, yari Perezida wa Komite Ishinzwe Gutegura Tour Du Rwanda. \nKuva mu 2013 kugeza mu 2019, Bayingana yabaye umwe mu bagize komite nshingwabikorwa barindwi b\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abasiganwa ku magare muri Afurika, muri uyu mwanya yatorewe kuyobora shampiyona y\u2019umugabane w\u2019Afurika y\u2019amagare yabereye i Sharm El Sheikh, mu Misiri. \nBayingana yari na perezida w'amagre w'abavuga ififaransa kuva mu Kwakira 2018 kugeza Ukuboza 2019. Muri uyu mwanya yateguye Kigali Union Cycliste Internationale Junior Race muri Gicurasi 2019, irushanwa mpuzamahanga ry\u2019imikino y\u2019amagare ry\u2019urubyiruko ryabereye i Kigali ryateguwe na Union Francophone de Cyclisme ku bufatanye na FERWACY na Association Internationale des maires Francophones. \nIbyagezweho.\nMuri 2009, Bayingana yafashije kwandika tour du Rwanda mu cyiciro cya 2.2 cy'amasiganwa, yazamuwe igera ku cyiciro cya 2.1 kuva muri 2019. \nBayingana mu gihe cye, u Rwanda rwateguye amarushanwa ya Afurika yo gusiganwa ku magare mu muhanda ku nshuro ya mbere muri 2010, ndetse no ku nshuro ya kabiri mu 2018. U Rwanda rwanateguye amarushanwa ya Afurika yo gusiganwa ku magare mu misozi ku nshuro ya mbere mu 2015. Muri Nzeri 2019, u Rwanda rwohereje ubusabe bwemewe bwo kwakira amarushanwa y\u2019isi yo gusiganwa ku magare mu 2025. \nMuri 2018, ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda yo gusiganwa ku magare na Areruya Joseph begukanye irushanwa ry'amagare rya Tropicale Amissa Bongo (Tour du Gabon), ryari ku nshuro ya mbere ikipe ya Afurika iba ku rutonde rw'amakipe y'afurika atwara iri rushanwa. Mu gihe yamaze ku buyobozi, abakinnyi b'amagare b'u Rwanda begukanye Tour du Rwanda inshuro eshanu, 2014, 2015, 2016, 2017, na 2018. \nIbihembo.\nKu ya 18 Gashyantare 2018, Bayingana yahawe igihembo cy'ishimwe na Dr Mohamed Wagih Azzam perezida w'ishyirahamwe ry'abasiganwa ku magare muri Afurika kubera akazi gakomeye yakoze mu guteza imbere umukino w'amagare mu Rwanda no muri Afurika. "}
{"id": "21708", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21708", "title": "Rwandan National Road Race Championships", "text": "Shampiyona ya magare yo mu muhanda mu Rwanda iba buri mwaka kugira ngo hamenyekane abakinnyi batsinze mu isiganwa ryo mu muhanda, mu byiciro bitandukanye. Iyi shampiyona yabanje kuba muri 2010, kuva mu 2015 irimo icyiciro cy\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 23."}
{"id": "21709", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21709", "title": "2014 Kagame Interclub Cup", "text": "Kagame cecafa muri 2014 ryari irya 39, ritegurwa na CECAFA. Ribera i Kigali, mu Rwanda kuva ku ya 8 kugeza ku ya 24 Kanama. U Rwanda ruri kwakira iri rushanwa ku nshuro ya kane kuva ryatangira muri 1974.\nItangazamakuru.\nikinyamakuru cyo muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo witwa super sporti wabonye uburenganzira bwo kwerekana imikino yose yakinwe muri iryo rushanwa. \nAbitabiriye.\nKu ya 11 Nyakanga 2014, tombola y'uko amakipe azitabira irushanwa yashyizwe ahagaragara kuri Sitade Amahoro, imwe mu mbuga za cecafa mu Rwanda. Perezida w'u Rwanda Paul Kagame, umuterankunga w'irushanwa, yiyemeje gutanga amadorari ya Amerika 60.000 ku gihembo, mu gihe andi madorari ya Amerika 15.000 yemewe mu gutegura irushanwa. Yanga yari iteganijwe nk'uhagarariye Tanzaniya ariko yakuweho na CECAFA kuko ikipe yahisemo gushyiramo ikipe ya kabiri muri iri rushanwa, binyuranyije n'amategeko agenga irushanwa, maze isimburwa na Azam. Kimwe n'ikipe yatwaye igikombe cy'Uburundi Flambo y'ubrasirazuba yasimbuwe na Atl\u00e9tico olempike n'ikipe ya Ethiopian kofi yasimbuwe na Adama. \nAmakipe 14 akurikira yitabiriye irushanwa:\nmu majonjora.\nIcyiciro cy'amatsinda cyarimo amakipe cumi n'ane, aho amakipe atanu mu itsinda rya A na B n'amakipe ane mu itsinda rya C. Amakipe atatu mu itsinda rya A na B n'amakipe abiri mu itsinda rya C yageze ku cyiciro cya 16."}
{"id": "21710", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21710", "title": "Rwandan National Time Trial Championships", "text": "Shampiyona y\u2019igihugu y\u2019amagare basiganwa ni gihe iba buri mwaka kugira ngo hamenyekane abakinnyi batwara igikombe mu mukino w\u2019amagare mu byiciro bitandukanye basiganwa n'igihe. Iyi shampiyona yabanje kuba muri 2014, kuva mu 2015 irimo icyiciro cy\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 23."}
{"id": "21711", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21711", "title": "Electrogaz FC", "text": "Electrogaz FC ni ikipe ikina umupira w'amaguru muri yabarizwaga muri shampiyona y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru y'u Rwanda. Iyi kipe yashinzwe muri 2008. Yitiriwe ikigo cy'amashanyarazi n'amazi cyo mu Rwanda cyitwa Electrogaz. Muri 2010 birukanywe muri shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere kuko abakinnyi batari bahembwa. "}
{"id": "21712", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21712", "title": "Rwanda women's national cricket team", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore ya criket y'u Rwanda ihagararira u Rwanda mu mukino mpuzamahanga w'abagore wa criket.\nAmateka.\nIkipe y'abagore y'u Rwanda yakinnye bwa mbere muri 2007, bakinnye imikino ibiri na Uganda mu Kuboza uwo mwaka, mbere yo kwitabira Shampiyona y'abagore yo mu Karere ka Afurika y'Iburasirazuba yo muri 2008-09. Kuva muri 2014, iyi yitabiriye irushanwa rya Kwibuka T20 buri mwaka.\nMuri Mata 2018, Inama Mpuzamahanga ya Cricket yahaye uburenganzira bwose abagore mu mikino mpuzamahanga ya Twenty20 ku banyamuryango bayo bose, imikino yose ya Twenty20 yakinwe hagati y'abagore b'u Rwanda n'abandi banyamuryango ba ICC kuva ku ya 1 Nyakanga 2018 yari WT20Is yuzuye. \nU Rwanda Rwaje kwakira umukino warwo wa mbere wa WT20I ku ya 26 Mutarama 2019, mu mikino itanu rwakinnye na Nigeriya. \nMu bihembo bya 2019, bishimira iterambere rya siporo mu bihugu bifitanye isano n\u2019ibifitanye isano, u Rwanda rwahawe ibihembo bibiri muri bitandatu byatanzwe Gahunda y\u2019Umwaka y\u2019Abagore, n\u2019Umuco w\u2019Abagore b\u2019Umwaka. "}
{"id": "21713", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21713", "title": "Rwanda women's national volleyball team", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore ya Volleyball yu Rwanda ihagararira i igihugu Rwanda mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Volleyball y'abagore n'imikino ya gicuti. \nIkipe yitabirye imikino ya shampiyona y'abagore ya Volleyball muri Afurika yo muri 2001, 2007 na 2021.\nMuri 2008, byatangajwe ko ikipe yagerageje gushaka umutoza w\u2019umunyakenya Paul Bitok abe umutoza wabo w\u2019igihugu, ariko yanze kuza maze ajya i Budapest kwiga. Bitok yaje kugaruka mu Rwanda yatangije imyitozo kuva akiri muto. Hashinzwe ingando mu ntara aho abakinnyi bakiri bato bashoboraga gutezwa imbere. Ubwo yavagayo mu 2020, u Rwanda rwari rufite amakipe yahatanaga ku rwego mpuzamahanga mu byiciro byose by\u2019imyaka kandi ikipe y\u2019igihugu ni yo yatwaye igikombe cya Afurika. \nGuhera muri 2021, umutoza mukuru w'ikipe yari Paulo de Tarso. "}
{"id": "21714", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21714", "title": "Rwanda Women's Basketball League", "text": "Shampiyona y'abagore ya Basketball mu Rwanda ni shampiyona iteura irushanwa rya Basketball mu bagore ryo ku rwego rwo hejuru mu Rwanda. Ritegurwa na FERWABA, ishyirahamwe ry'igihugu rya Basketball mu Rwanda.\nIkipe ifite ibikombe byinshi mu mateka ya shampiyona ni APR WBBC.\nAmakipe.\nAmakipe agize RWBL mu mwaka w'imikino wa 2024 ni aya:"}
{"id": "21715", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21715", "title": "Assouma Uwizeye", "text": "Assouma Uwizeye (Yavutse ku ya 6 Mata 1996) ni umukinnyi w'umukino wa maboko wa Basketball w'Umunyarwanda, akina mu ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore y'u Rwanda. \nUmwuga.\nUwizeye yahagarariye u Rwanda mu gikombe cya shampiyona y'abagore ya FIBA muri 2022, aho yatsinze amanota 9.3 hamwe na rebandi zigera kuri 8.8 kuri buri mukino. \nMu gihe cy'amajonjora ya 2023 Fiba y'abagore mu cyiciro cya gatanu cya AfroBasket, Uwizeye yamenyekanye nk'umwe mu bitwaye neza hamwe na Odile Tetero na Marie Imanizabayo, bavuye ku ntebe y'abasimbura batsinda amanota 15 ndetse batsinda impuzandengo ya rebounds 5. Yanitabiriye kandi Afrobasket y'abagore ya 2023 aho yatsinze amanota 6 na rebandi 2 mu gice cya mbere cy'umukino. "}
{"id": "21717", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21717", "title": "Ineza Sifa", "text": "Ineza Sifa (yavutse ku ya 14 Werurwe 2002) ni umukinnyi w'umukino w'amaboko wa Basketball w\u2019Umunyarwanda, akina nkuzibira mu ikipe ya Middle Tennessee Blue Raiders ndetse no mu ikipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019abagore ya Basketball yu Rwanda.\nAmateka.\nSifa yize muri Greenforest Christian Academy i Decatur, muri Jeworujiya, aho yakinaga umukino wa Basketball.\nKu itariki ya 17 Ugushyingo 2021, Sifa Ineza Joyeuse yiyemeje gukina basketball muri kaminuza muri FIU mu gihe cyo gusinya amasezerano. Yimukiye muri Tennessee yo Hagati nyuma y'umwaka w'imikino. \nIkipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda.\nSifa yahagarariye u Rwanda bwa mbere muri 2018 ubwo yahamagarwaga mu ikipe y'igihugu y'abatarengeje imyaka 18 kugira ngo akine shampiyona y'abagore ya FIBA U-18. Yongeye guhamagarwa mu ikipe y'igihugu y'abakuze mu gihe cy'amarushanwa ya Afrobasket y'abagore ya 2019, Afrobasket y'abagore ya 2021 ya FIBA-Amarushanwa ya Afrobasket y'abagore ya 2023. "}
{"id": "21719", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21719", "title": "Janai Cromes", "text": "Janai Croom Robertson (yavutse ku ya 23 Kamena 1999) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa Basketball akaba ari umunyarwanda ukomoka ariko ukomoka muri Amerika. \nUbuzima bwa mbere.\nCroom yavutse ku ya 23 Kamena 1999 i Cranston, muri Rhode Island, avukana na John Crooms ndetse na Lisa Robertson. Yize mu ishuri rya Mutagatifu Andereya i Barrington, muri Rhode Island, aho yakiniga mu ikipe ya Basketball yaho. \nUmwuga wa kaminuza.\nCroom yakiniye Ohio State Buckeyes mu gihe cy'imyaka ibiri (2018 kugeza 2020), Michigan State Spartans kuva mu 2020 kugeza 2021 mbere yo kujya muri Providence Friars mu gihe cy'imyaka ibiri (2021 kugeza 2023). Nk'umukinnyi wa kabiri muri Ohio State mu 2019-20, yakinnye imikino 32, yatangiriyeho imikino 10, atsinda amanota 6.8 kuri buri mukino. \nMuri 2022, ubwo yari mu itsinda rya Providence Friars, yabonye ibihembo ari kumwe na Kylee Sheppard. \nUmwuga w'ikipe y'igihugu.\nCroom yakiniye u Rwanda mu irushanwa rya AfroBasket ry\u2019abagore rya FIBA ryo muri 2023 aho yatsinze amanota 13.6, agace ka 5.6 atera imipira ndetse n\u2019imipira ivamo ibitego 2.8 kuri buri mukino mu irushanwa. "}
{"id": "21720", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21720", "title": "Kubwimana Kazingufu Ali", "text": "Kubwimana Kazingufu Ali (yavutse 29 Ukuboza 1995) ni umukinnyi wamaboko wa basketball w'abigize umwuga, ukinira REG ndeste nu Rwanda. Guhagarara kuri 1.80\u00a0m, akina nk'umuzamu w'inyuma.\nUbuzima bwa mbere.\nAli ni umukinnyi w\u2019umuzamu uzwi cyane kubera umuvuduko we, nkuko bamwe mu bafana bakunze kumwita Umuntu ufite ibihaha bine; ashobora kandi gukoreshwa nk'Umurinzi wo Gushotora, kandi ni umuhanga mu gushotora amanota atatu. Yakinnye n'abandi banyamwuga benshi bazwi nka Shime (gutsinda muri IPRC Kigali Basketball club); Sani Eric (hagati muri IPRC South Basketball club) na Marc Rushagaza (muri Patriots BBC).\nAli yakiniye ikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball y'u Rwanda kuva muri 2014."}
{"id": "21721", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21721", "title": "Kendall Gray", "text": "Kendall Lamar Gray (yavutse ku ya 5 Gicurasi 1992) ni umukinnyi ukoresha amaboko ukina Basketball, ni umunyarwanda wavukiye muri Amerika, ubu akaba akinira REG BBC. Yakinnye Basketball ari muri kaminuza ya Delaware State, aba umukinnyi w\u2019umwaka mu mikino yo hagati mu burasirazuba bwa 2014-15.\nUbuzima bwa mbere.\nGray yavukiye i Merced, muri Californiya gusa yakuriye i Dover, muri Delaware. Yatsindiye amanota atatu ya kaminuza ubwo yakinaga mu ishuri rikuru rya Polytech i Woodside, muri Delaware. Muri 2010, yabonye ikipe mu irushanwa ry'omu majyepfo Mu mwaka wa nyuma w\u2019imikino ya Gray yatsinze amanota 15, rebandi 12, na bloke 11 kuri buri mukino. Hanyuma yiyemeje gukinira ikipe ya Delaware Sitate muri kaminuza.\nUmwuga.\nNyuma yo kudakinira mu irushanwa rya NBA ryo muri 2015, Gray yasinye amasezerano na Medi Bayreuth yo muri Basketball Bundesliga ku ya 23 Nyakanga 2015. Ku ya 18 Mutarama 2016, yatandukanye na Medi Bayreuth. Ku ya 31 Werurwe, yaguzwe na Iowa Energy yo muri NBA ariko ntiyayikinira.\nKu ya 23 Kanama 2016, Gray yasinye amasezerano na MKS D\u0105browa Gornicza wo muri shampiyona ya Polonye. "}
{"id": "21723", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21723", "title": "Ntore Habimana", "text": "Ntore Habimana (wavutse ku ya 15 Kanama 1997) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa Basketball yavukiye muri canada, ukinira APR muri Shampiyona ya Basketball mu Rwanda. Ni umwe mu bagize ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda. \nUbuzima.\nHabimana yavukiye Mississauga, muri Ontario kwa se w'u Rwanda na nyina w'Abarundi, bari barimukiye muri canada muri 1994. Akiri umwana, yasengaga ibigirwamana cyitwa Vince Carter."}
{"id": "21725", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21725", "title": "Prince Ibeh", "text": "Igikomangoma Chinenye Ibeh (yavutse ku ya 3 Kamena 1994) ni umukinnyi wa Basketball w\u2019umunyamerika ufite inkomoko mu Rwanda, akaba yaranakiniye ikipe ya Patriots yo muri shampiyona ya basketall yu Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nIbeh yakinnye basketball muri kaminuza muri Texasi kuva mu 2012 kugeza 2016. Ibeh yatsindiye amanota 17, afata ribandi 10 ndetse anatera amashoti atanu mu mukino batsinze amanota 71-54 ku ya 26 Mutarama 2016. Nku mukinnyi wo mu cyiciro cya kabiri, yinjiye mu mwanya munini kubera imvune ya Cameron Ridley. Yatsinze amanota 4.1, ribandi 5.0, na bloki 2.0 kuri buri mukino, atera 57.8%. Yagizwe umukinnyi w'umwaka w'abakinnyi 12 bakomeye mu 2016, atoranywa mu ikipe ya 12 bakomeye mu myitozo. \nUmwuga w'ubunyamwuga.\nInzitiramubu zo mu birwa bya Isilande (2017\u20132018).\nLong Island Nets, ishami rya NBA rya Brooklyn, yasiniye Ibeh muri Gashyantare 2017. Mu mukino we wa kabiri na Nets, Ibeh yatsinze amanota 3 na rebounds 6 mu minota hafi 15. "}
{"id": "21727", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21727", "title": "Prosper Karangwa", "text": "Prosper Karangwa (yavutse ku ya 17 Gicurasi 1978) ni Umunyakanada ufite ubwenegihugu bwu Rwanda, wahoze akina umukino wa Basketball w'abigize umwuga, akaba n\u2019umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019ibiro bya Visi Perezida w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wa Basketball, afite inshingano z\u2019umuyobozi mukuru wa delaware.\nUmwuga.\nKarangwa mu mashuri y'isumbuye yize ubuforomo ndetse akaba n'umuhanga mu by'imiti, yabanje gukurira mu Burundi yimukira i Montreal n'umuryango we afite imyaka icyenda. Yakinnye umukino wa Basketball mu Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019imikino ngororamubiri ryo muri Siena College imyaka ine (1999\u20132003)."}
{"id": "21728", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21728", "title": "Kami Kabange", "text": "Kami Kabange (yavutse ku ya 2 Nyakanga 1984) ni umukinnyi w\u2019umunyarwanda wavukiye muri Kongo wahoze akinira basketball. Ureshya na metero 2.03, akina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati. Yamaze imyaka 12 mu ikipe zitandukanye zo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba akina. Yavukiye muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, afite ubwenegihugu bw'u Rwanda kandi yahagarariye ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda. \nUbuzima bwa mbere.\nKabange yavukiye i Likasi, yatangiye gukina basketball akiri muto, abifashijwemo n'abavandimwe be. Afite imyaka 17, Lubumbashi Sporti yamubonye, imuha kujya gukina muri shampiyona ya Kongo. \nUmwuga w'ubunyamwuga.\nNyuma yo gukina umwaka umwe muri Lubumbashi Sport, Kabange yakinnye umwaka ibiri muri Besa Mazembe.\nKabange yatangiye umwuga we mu Rwanda muri APR bbc, ayobowe n'umutoza mukuru Cliff Owuor. Mu mwaka we wa mbere w'imikino, yafashije ikipe ye kwegukana ibikombe bya shampiyona y'igihugu ya Rwanda."}
{"id": "21729", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21729", "title": "Darryl Nganji Nkurikiyimana", "text": "Darryl Nganji NKURIKIYINKA ni Umunyarwanda ufite ubwenegihugu bw' ububirigi, akaba ari umukinnyi w' umupira w' amaguru. Darryl yavutse kuwa 24 gicurasi, 2005 kugeza ubu akinira ikipe ya standard de liege mu bubirigi ndetse agakinira n' ikipe y' igihugu y' u Rwanda amavubi. "}
{"id": "21730", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21730", "title": "Ellis Kayijuka", "text": "Thiago Cordeiro ku ya 30 Mata 1981 wavukiye i Nyamirambo, mu Rwanda ni umukinnyi wa Basketball ukomoka muri Burezili wakiniye mu ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda ya Basketball mu irushanwa rya FIBA Africa Championship ryo muri 2009. Yakiniye Dayton Flyers basketball y'abagabo mu mwaka wa 2007-08. \nKayijuka yiyongereye mu ikipe y\u2019u Rwanda mu irushanwa rya FIBA rya Afurika ryo muri 2009 nyuma y\u2019uko abakinnyi babiri b\u2019u Rwanda bavuye mu irushanwa ibyumweru bitatu mbere y\u2019uko umukino utangira wari uteganyijwe. Nubwo byari bimeze bityo, Kayijuka yatsinze amanota 5.8 ya PPG, 5 RPG, na 1.6 BPG mu gihe yafatanyaga na Robert Thomson, mu afasha Abanyarwanda kurangiza ku mwanya wa 9 ndetse no kwitwara neza kugeza ubu mu irushanwa rya Afurika. "}
{"id": "21731", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21731", "title": "Matthew Miller", "text": "Matthew Miller (yavutse ku ya 11 Ukuboza 1982) ni umukinnyi wa Basketball w'Umunyamerika ufite ibyangombwa by'u Rwanda, wakiniye ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda ya Basketball mu irushanwa rya shampiyona nyafurika muri 2007 na 2009. \nAmateka.\nMiller wavukiye i Aurora, muri Ilino, ni umunyamerika kavukire wakinnye basketball muri kaminuza ya Belarimine. Miller ni umwe mu bakinnyi benshi bashinjwa kuba umucanshuro w\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya Basketball y\u2019u Rwanda kuko gifite umuco muto wa Basketball cyabaye kimwe mu makipe akomeye muri Afurika. Miller, hamwe na Robert Thomson, bagiranye impaka ku irushanwa rya FIBA Africa Championship ryo muri 2009 ubwo ikipe ya Maroke yahanganye hafi kwanga gukina umukino wo gufungura nyuma yo gushinja aba bombi kuba abacanshuro b\u2019u Rwanda, nubwo bombi bakinnye n\u2019u Rwanda kuva muri 2007., Miller yari umwe mu bakinnyi bakomeye b\u2019u Rwanda muri iri rushanwa, aho yakuyemo impuzandengo ya 13.2 mu ikipe. "}
{"id": "21732", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21732", "title": "GUKORESHA IBIKORESHO BY'IKORANABUHANGA MU MASHURI", "text": "Ikoranabuhanga ni iritugeza ku majyambere. Tugomba kurikoresha mu bintu byubaka kandi biteza imbere Igihugu, ubwo wiyibagije igihombo wigeze kugira kubera ko utari wakamenya mudasobwa? Ubika amakuru ku mpapuro, mwakwimura ibintu ukayoberwa aho urupapuro umukiriya yari yarabasinyiye aguza miriyoni yose rwagiye! Ntiwayishyuye se da! Mwumvaneza: Yego di! No kohererezanya amafaranga ubu bisigaye ari nk\u2019ubufindo? Munyawera:Unteye kwibuka n\u2019ikindi. Uzi ko wa mubyara wange uba i Bwotamasimbi nange yanyoherereje ku madorari? Mwumvaneza:Barayankase ariko! Munyawera:Yego ariko ikibazo kigakemuka. Wowe uracyakinisha ikoranabuhanga! Uzansure ariko nkwereke ya nzu nshaka kubaka uko imeze. Mwumvaneza:Nawe noneho uri umuti w\u2019amenyo! Urayinyereka utari wanasiza ikibanza? Munyawera: Ni rya koranabuhanga nakubwiraga nyine rya mudasobwa! Igishushanyo cyayo kiri muri mudasobwa nyine! Tanga nibura ingero enye z\u2019ibyiza by\u2019ikoranabuhanga rikoresha mudasobwa byagaragajwe mu mwandiko."}
{"id": "21733", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21733", "title": "Axel Mpoyo", "text": "Axel Mpoyo (yavutse ku ya 5 Mutarama 1997) ni umukinnyi wa Basketball w\u2019Umunyarwanda ukinira ikipe ya APR muri shampiyona y\u2019umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda na Basketball ny'afurika yitwa BAL ndetse anakinira ikipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019u Rwanda.\nUbuzima bwa mbere.\nMpoyo yavukiye i Kinshasa muri RDC, kuri se w\u2019Umunyekongo akaba na nyina w\u2019Umunyarwanda. Afite abavandimwe babiri na mushiki we. Yavuye mu gihugu akiri muto ajya muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, yiga mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya meridiane muri Idaho. Muri Meridiane, yanagerageje umupira w\u2019amaguru n\u2019imikino yo kwiruka, mbere yo guhitamo gukomeza basketball amaze gukura. \nUmwuga wa kaminuza.\nMpoyo yakinnye muri kaminuza ya Grambling Sitate University, akinira ikipe ya basketball ya Tigers.\nUmwuga w'ubunyamwuga.\nMu mwaka we mushya, Mpoyo yakiniye ikipe ya shipure yitwa APOEL mu cyiciro cya mbere cya Basketball cya shipure. Ntiyarangije shampiyona ari kumwe n'iyi kipe, kuko yimukiye muri KB Trep\u00e7a muri Kosovo hagati mu mwaka w'imikino.\nMpoyo yakinnye n'ikipe y'u Rwanda REG bbc kuva mu mwaka w'imikino wa 2021-22. Yafashije REG kwegukana igikombe cya shampiyona cya 2021-22, anahabwa umwanya wa MVP. yakinnye nayo muri Basketball nyafurika ya BAL mu mwaka w'imikino wa 2023 na 2024. \nMu Ukwakira 2022, Mpoyo yinjiye mu ikipe y'u Rwanda ya APR muri shampiyona y'umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda (RBL). Yayifashije kwegukana igikombe cya RBL mu 2023 na 2024.\nMuri shampiyona ya 2023-24, Mpoyo yakinnye muri Arigentine mu ikipe ya Pico FC. \nKu itariki ya 13 Kamena 2025, Mpoyo yatsinze ibitego 10 by'amanota atatu mu mukino wa gatatu mu mwaka wa 2025 wa BAL, ashyiraho agahigo gashya ka Basketball nyafurica ya BAL. Yarenze agahigo kashyizweho na Will Perry, wari watsinze ibitego icyenda by'amanota atatu. Imikinire ya Mpoyo yafashije APR gutsinda umukino, ishyiraho agahigo ka shampiyona mu manota menshi mu mukino ifite amanota 123, irangiza iri ku mwanya wa gatatu. \nUmwuga w'ikipe y'igihugu.\nMpoyo yahagarariye ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda, kandi yakinnye n'ikipe muri FIBA Afro Basket muri 2021, ndetse no mu yandi marushanwa yo kwitegura. "}
{"id": "21734", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21734", "title": "KANSERI Y IBIHAHA", "text": "Kanseri y ibihaha.\nKanseri y\u2019ibihaha ni imwe mu ndwara zitandura zizahaje umubare munini w\u2019abatuye Isi, aho zinatwara ubuzima bw\u2019abatagira ingano buri mwaka. Binavugwa ko iyi kanseri ari imwe mu ziganje mu bantu kurusha izindi kuko iza ku mwanya wa kabiri\nImibare yatangajwe n\u2019Umuryango Mpuzamahanga ushinzwe kurwanya Kanseri, ugaragaza ko nko mu mwaka wa 2020 ku isi hose habonetse abarwayi ba kanseri basaga miliyoni 2.2, kikavuga ko gukoresha itabi cyangwa kurinywa byongera ibyago byo kwandura iyi ndwara ihangayikishije ubuzima rusange.\nIshami ry\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye ryita ku Buzima rivuga ko hafi umuntu umwe muri batanu bicwa n\u2019ubwoko butandukanye bwa kanseri baba bambuwe ubuzima na kanseri y\u2019ibihaha. Nubwo iri ku kigero kimwe n\u2019icy\u2019abandura kanseri y\u2019ibere, kanseri y\u2019ibihaha yo yica abantu baruta abicwa n\u2019iy\u2019ibere, iy\u2019amara ndetse n\u2019iya Prostate ubateranyije.\nUbuyobozi w\u2019Ishami rishinzwe kurwanya indwara zitandura mu Kigo cy\u2019Igihugu cy\u2019Ubuzima (RBC) bwatangaje ko abanywi b\u2019itabi baba bafite ibyago byikubye inshuro zisaga 22 zo kurwara kanseri y\u2019ibihaha mu buzima bwabo, bakagira ibyago byo kurwara umutima ndetse n\u2019uruhu rugasaza vuba.\nUbuyobozi bwa RBC, mu butumwa bwanyujije ku mbuga nkoranyambaga, bwagize buti: \u201cIyemeze kurivaho kugira ngo ubeho ubuzima buzira umuze.\u201d\nAbahanga mu by\u2019ubuzima bavuga ko iyi kanseri ihera mu bihaha ifata mu moko abiri y\u2019ingenzi ari yo yiswe mu rurimi rw\u2019amahanga \u201cnon-small cell lung cancer\u201d na \u201csmall cell lung cancer\u201d.\nUretse abashobora kwandura banyoye itabi, binavugwa ko n\u2019abakunda kwegera aho banywera itabi bashobora kwandura iyo kanseri, kimwe n\u2019abashobora guhumeka ubwoko bw\u2019uburozi bwo mu muryango umwe n\u2019uwo mu itabi.\nBimwe mu bimenyetso by\u2019ibi kanseri harimo inkorora idakira akenshi ukorora agacira amaraso, gutakaza ibilo no guhungetwa, kubabara mu gatuza, kubura ikiryi, kunanirwa guhumeka n\u2019ibindi. Ibyinshi muri ibyo bimenyetso bigaragara iyo kanseri yatangiye kurenga umuntu.\nBumwe mu buvuzi bushobora guhabwa uwayirwaye harimo kumutera imiti, kumubaga, kumushiririza, kumuha imiti igabanya ibibazo bimwe na bimwe ndetse no kumwongerera ubudahangarwa bw\u2019umubiri."}
{"id": "21735", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21735", "title": "Aristide Mugabe", "text": "Aristide Mugabe (yavutse ku ya 11 Gashyantare 1988) yahoze ari umukinnyi wa Basketball w\u2019Umunyarwanda ubu ni umutoza wa Kepler BBC wo muri shampiyona y\u2019umukino wa Basketball y\u2019u Rwanda (RBL). Yakinnye imyaka 11 mu ikipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019u Rwanda. Afatwa nk'umwe mu bakinnyi beza mu mateka ya Basketball y\u2019u Rwanda. \nAtangiye umwuga we muri Rusizi, Mugabe yasinye amasezerano muri Espoir muri 2009, afasha ikipe ye kwegukana ibikombe bine bya RBL ndetse atwara ibihembo bibiri bya MVP. Muri 2015, yerekeje muri Patriots aho yatwaye ibindi bikombe bine. Mugabe ni umwe mu bakinnyi bafite ibihembo byinshi mu mateka ya Basketball yo mu Rwanda.\nKu ruhande rw'u Rwanda, Mugabe yakinnye amarushanwa atatu ya afurika.\nUbuzima bwa mbere.\nMugabe yavukiye mu inkambi ya yoborwaga na Habiryayo na Veneranda Mukamurehe i Maraba, umurenge wo mu Karere ka Huye mu Rwanda, akaba yari uwa kabiri mu muryango w'abahungu batatu. Yakuze akina umupira w'amaguru n'abandi bana bo mu gace atuyemo. \nMuri 1994, ubwo Mugabe yari afite imyaka itandatu, se, bakuru be n'abandi bato, n'abandi bene wabo bishwe n'umutwe w'Interahamwe muri jenoside yo mu Rwanda. Nyuma y'urupfu rwabo, baza kwimuka kugira ngo ahunge Interahamwe. we na nyina bimuriwe mu Burundi n'umuryango we. \nUmwuga w'ubunyamwuga.\nMuri 2007, Mugabe yakinnye bwa mbere muri shampiyona y'igihugu ya Basketball (NBL), shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere mu Rwanda, ari kumwe na Rusizi BBC. Nyuma y'imyaka ibiri, yinjiye mu ikipe y'u Rwanda ya Espoir BBC. Mugabe yanakinnye mu mikino yo gushaka itike ya Shampiyona ya FIBA Afurike muri 2009 ndetse no muri Cericle Siporitifu ya Kigali (CSK) muri 2010. Muri 2012, Mugabe yayoboye Espoir muri shampiyona yayo ya mbere ya Zone V, itike yo kujya mu gikombe cya 2012 cya igikombe FIBA afurika, ndetse yagizwe n'umukinnyi mwiza wa Basketball nyuma yo kwegukana igikombe gisanzwe cy'umwaka n'igikombe gitangira shampiyona. Mu 2013, yongeye kuba umukinnyi mwiza nyuma yo gufasha Espoir BBC kwegukana igikombe gisanzwe cy'umwaka n'igikombe \nUmwuga w'ikipe y'igihugu.\nMugabe yakiniye ikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball y'u Rwanda imyaka 11, akaba yaranabaye kapiteni muri iyo mikino myinshi. Yakinnye muri Basketball ya afurika mu 2011, 2013, na 2017. Mugabe yatangaje ko agiye gusezera mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru mu 2021. \nUbuzima bwite.\nMu ntangiriro za 2014, Mugabe yarangije muri Kaminuza y\u2019Abadivantisiti b\u2019Abalayiki ya Kigali (UNILAK) i Kigali afite impamyabumenyi y\u2019icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu by\u2019imari. Yakoreye muri Banki ya Kigali, nyuma aza no kuba umucungamari wa sosiyete y\u2019umutekano yo mu Rwanda ISCO. "}
{"id": "21736", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21736", "title": "Sport in Kenya", "text": "Siporo nikintu cy'ingenzi mu muco wa Kenya. Siporo gakondo zitandukanye zaranzwe mumuco wa Kenya kuva mu mateka yayo ya kera. Imwemumikino gakondo n'imikino yamenyekanye muri Kenya kuva kera harimo imikino yo gusiganwa, imyitozo ngororamubiri yogusiganwa, imirwano y'inkoni, guhiga (gukoresha amacumu n'imyambi), imikino yokukibaho, imikino y'ibimasa n'imbyino. \nImikino myinshi igezweho muri Kenya yatangiye mu gihe cy'ubukoloni bw'Abongereza. Amakipe y'abahanga mu buryo bw'amatsinda yateguwe n'abimukira b'Abongereza bakolonijwe n'abafatanyabikorwa b'Abanyaziya kuva mu 1922, mbere y'uko amashuri yemewe ashingwa. Siporo yatangijwe mumashuri mu 1925. Gahunda yokwigisha siporo binyuze mumyitozo ngororamubiri mumashuri (ibikorwa byo hanze y'amasomo) yateguwe mu 1935. Umupira w'amaguru na siporo (gusiganwa ku maguru) niyo mikino ya mbere yateguwe muburyo bw'umwuga.\nMurikigihe, imikinomyinshi ikunzwe muri Kenya, ikorwa haba muburyo bw'umwuga ndetse nomu kwidagadura. Umukino ukunzwe cyane muri Kenya numupira w'amaguru. Imikino ikinirwa muri Kenya murikigihe irimo siporo (gusiganwa kumaguru n'ibindi bikorwa byo kwiruka), cricket, hockey yo mu kibuga, imikino yo gutwara imodoka, umupira w'amaguru w'ishyirahamwe, rugby union, volleyball, basketball, koga no kwibira, umupira w'intoki w'ikipe, netball, rounders, baseball, kurasa, softball, gusiganwa ku magare, imikino yo kurwana (iteramakofe, karate ya Shotokan, karate ya Goju Ryu, karate ya Shorin Ryu, kickboxing, judo, Mantis kenPo na taekwondo), Tennis yo mu gasozi, Tennis yo ku meza, Squash, Badminton, Golf, Canoeing, Chess, Goal Ball, Kugendera ku mafarashi/Equestrianism, Polo, Kuterura ibiremereye, Gukina, Kurasa imiheto, Roller Sports, Hockey yo mu rubura na Siporo yo mu misozi - Kenya.\nKwisi yose, Kenya izwi cyane cyane kubera kwiganza mu masiganwa yo hagati n'ay'intera ndende. \nSiporo (imikino yo gusiganwa ku maguru no kwiruka).\nSiporo (gusiganwa ku maguru) yari imwe mu mikino ibiri igezweho (hamwe n'umupira w'amaguru) yateguwe ku mugaragaro muri Kenya. Kenya yagiye itanga igikombe cy'imikino Olempike na Commonwealth mu mikino itandukanye yo kwiruka, cyane cyane mu myaka 800 ishize.\u00a0m, 1,500\u00a0m, 3,000\u00a0m steeplechase, 5,000\u00a0m, 10.000\u00a0m na marato. Abakinnyi ba Kenya (cyane cyane Kalenjin) bakomeje kwigarurira isi yo kwiruka intera ndende, nubwo amarushanwa ya Maroc na Etiyopiya yagabanyije ubu buhanga. Abakinnyi bazwi cyane muri Kenya barimo Catherine Ndereba wegukanye Marato ya Boston inshuro enye mubagore, akaba n'uwatwaye igikombe cy'isi inshuro ebyiri, Paul Tergat wahoze afite agahigo kwisi muri Marato, na John Ngugi. Ikibazo cy'impamvu Abanyakenya aribobitwaye cyane mukwiruka intera ndende cyatumye habaho ibisobanuro bitandukanye bijyanye n'imiterere y'ubutaka, cyangwa imiterere y'amagufwa, cyangwa indyo. \nKurikirana ibikorwa.\nKipchoge Keino, wegukanye igikombe cya Olempike n'imikino ya Commonwealth mukiruhuko cy'izabukuru, yafashije mugutangiza ingoma ya Kenya yomumyakaya 1970, hanyuma akurikirwa na Henry Rono, wegukanye igikombe cya Commonwealth, watsinze agahigo k'isi.\nKenya yegukanye imidari myinshi mumikino Olempike ya Beijing, imidari 6 ya zahabu, imidari 4 ya feza n'imidari 4 ya bronze, bitumibigihugu cyatsinzecyane mur'Afurika mumikino Olempike yo mu 2008. Abakinnyi bashya bakunze kwitabwaho, nka Pamela Jelimo, wegukanyumudari wa zahabu mubagore wa metero 800 watsindiye igihembo cya Golden League, na Samuel Wanjiru wegukanye marathon y'abagabo.\nIbirori byo mu kibuga.\nJulius Yego yabayumukinnyi wambere w\u2019umunyakenya utsindiyumudari wa zahabu mumikino ya Commonwealth ubwoyegukanagigikombe cyogusiganwa kumacumu mwirushanwa rya 2014 ryabereye i Glasgow (umunyakenya mugenzi we John Makaya yari yatwaye umudari wa bronze mu irushanwa nk\u2019iryo imyaka mirongo ine mbereyaho mumarushanwa ya Commonwealth yo mu 1974 i Christchurch). Umwaka wakurikiyeho yatwaye umudari wambere wa zahabu mu irushanwa rya shampiyona y\u2019isi ya Kenya mwirushanwa rya shampiyona y\u2019isi ya 2015 mu mikino ngororamubiri i Beijing, aho yashyizeho agahigo gashya ka miliyoni 92.72 mugihe yaragiye gutsinda. \nInzira y'amaguru.\nAbakinnyi b'abanyakenya bitwaye neza mwirushanwa rya IAAF World Cross Country Championship mumyaka 25 ishize, bakomeje gutsindira Etiyopiya; kuvamu 1986 kugeza 2011, umwaka ushize iryo siganwa ryabaga burimwaka, ikipey'abagabo ya Kenya yegukanye ibikombe 24 by'isi, harimo 18 byikurikiranya kugeza Etiyopiya yegukanye mu 2004-05. Ikipey'abagabo bato yegukanye ibikombe 23 kuva mu 1988, nahwikipe y'abagore yegukanye ibikombe bine byikurikiranya kuvamu 2009. Abanyekenyabato ba Kenya begukanye ibikombe 15 by'isi. Inshuro eshanu - mu 1991 (Ububiligi), 1993 (Esipanye), 1995 (Ubwongereza), 1996 (Afurika y'Epfo) na 2010 (Polonye) - Kenya yagize igikombe mu marushanwa y'abagabo n'abagore y'abakuze n'abato.\nAbagabo batatubo muri Kenya nibobonyine begukanye ibikombe by'isi byogusiganwa kumaguru kurwego rw'abagabo, kandibabiri muribobegukanye amakamba menshi. John Ngugi yabayuwa mbere wegukanye igikombe cy'isi inshureshanu (1986\u201389, 1992). Paul Tergat, ukina mugihugu, yabaye uwa mbere wegukanye ibikombe bitanu yikurikiranya (1995\u20131999). Edith Masai yegukanye isiganwa rigufi ry'abagore rya kilometero 4 inshuro eshatu zikurikiranya (2003\u20132004).\nMarato.\nAbasiganwa baturutse muri Kenya birutse inshuro zirindwi munshuro 10 zihutacyane mukwiruka ibirometero 26.2. Banabaye bamwe mubatsinzecyane mwisiganwa rya Marato ku isi: Boston, New York, Londres, Berlin, Chicago na Tokyo. Umubare udasanzwe w\u2019abatsinze marato ni Kalenjin.\nMarato ya Boston.\nIbrahim Hussein yegukanyintsinzi yambere muntsinzi eshatu za Marato ya Boston mu 1988, mu gihekitarenze umwakumwe nyumayogutsinda Marato ya New York City. Hussein yatsinze intsinzi zikurikiranye i Boston mu 1991-92. Abagabo b'Abanyakenya baciye agahigo muri Marato ya Boston inshuro 20 kuvamu 1988, hariminshuro 10 zikurikiranya kuvamu 1991 kugezamu 2000. Abagore b'Abanyakenya batsinze i Boston inshuro 10, enye murizo zigatsindwa n'umugore umwe. Abatsinze bazwi:\nMarato yo mu Mujyi wa New York.\nIntsinzi ya Hussein muri Marato ya New York City mugihe cy'impeshyi ya 1987 yari iya mbere yakozwe n'umwirutsi ufite inkomoko mur'Afurika muri iri rushanwa. Nyuma y'imyaka itatu, Douglas Wakiihuri yatsinzisiganwa ritangirira muri Staten Island rigaca muri Queens, Brooklyn na Bronx, rigasozwa muri Pariki Nkuru ya Manhattan. Abagabo b'Abanyakenya batsinze irisiganwa inshuro umunani, naho abagore b'Abanyakenya batsinda batandatu mucyiciro cyabose. Muri bo:\nMarato ya London.\nDouglas Wakiihuri yatsinzisiganwa mu 1989; byarigufata imyaka 15 mberey'uko undimunya Kenya witwa Evans Rutto atsinda i Londres. Martin Lel yatsinze intsinzi eshatu muriirirushanwa kandi yashyizeho agahigo kogukoresha iminota 2:05:15 mu 2008. Mary Keitany yatwaye ibikombe bikurikirana mu 2011-12.\nMarato ya Chicago.\nMarato ya Chicago yabaye bwambere mu 1977. Abasiganwa baturutse muri Kenya batsinze irushanwa ry\u2019abagabo inshuro 12, harimo icyenda zikurikiranya kuvamu 2003 kugeza 2011.\nMarato ya Berlin.\nAbagabo b'Abanyakenya batsinze amasiganwa atatu ashize ya Marathon ya Berlin (kuvamu 2012) n'andi 12 murirusange, harimintsinzi zirindwi zikurikiranya kuvamu 1999 kugeza 2005. Patrick Makau Musyoki yatsinze mumyaka yikurikiranya mu 2010 na 2011, ayayanyuma akaba yarayatsinze mu gihe cy'amasaha 2 n'iminota 3 n'iminota 38 ku isi.\nMarato ya Tokyo.\nIrushanwa rishya rya Marato y'Isi, Marato ya mbere ya Tokyo yabayemu 2007. Daniel Njenga yatsinzisiganwa ryambere akoresheje iminota 2:09:45. Abakinnyi b'Abanyakenya batsinze iri siganwa inshuro enye, harimo na Dennis Kimetto watwaye igikombe cya 2013, washyizeho agahigo ko kwiruka (2:06:50).\nImikino Olempike.\nSamuel Wanjiruyabaye umunyakenya wambere wabayumukinnyi wambere mumikino Olempike muri marathon ubwoyirukaga agahigo k'imikino Olempike kunshuro ya 2:06:32 atsindirumudari wa zahabu i Beijing mu 2008.\nImpinduka mu bwenegihugu.\nMuminsi ishize, habayehimpaka mumakipe y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri ya Kenya, aho abakinnyi benshi ba Kenya bagiye guhagararira ibindi bihugu, cyanecyane Bahrain na Qatar. Minisiteri ya Siporo ya Kenya yagerageje guhagarika abakinnyi bashya, ariko bakomeje, Bernard Lagat ari we uheruka, ahitamo guhagararira Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Ibyinshi muri ibi bishya bibaho bitewe n\u2019ubukungu cyangwa amikoro, arikobamwe mubakinnyi b\u2019abahanga ba Kenya badashobora kwinjira mwikipe ikomeye y\u2019igihugu cyabonabo biroroshye kuzuzibisabwa binyuze mukwiyamamariza ibindibihugu.\nSiporo y'umupira.\nUmupira w'amaguru w'ishyirahamwe.\nUmupira w'amaguru numukino ukunzwecyane muri Kenya. Kenya yarigihugu gikomeye mukarere k'umupira w'amaguru, arikimbaragazayo zarasenyutse kuberamakimbirane arimu Ishyirahamwe ry'Umupira w'Amaguru rya Kenya. Ibibyatumye FIFA ihagarikwa muri Werurwe 2007. Umupira w'amaguru muri Kenya ubu ugenzurwa n'Ishyirahamwe ry'Umupira w'Amaguru rya Kenya. Kombii Betty Nanjalah umwe mubashinze Ishyirahamwe ry'Urubyiruko rwa Siporo rya Mathere (MYSA) - Kenya, Urugendo rwambere muri Noruveje mu 1991, arikumwe n'itsinda ry'abakinnyi 16 baturutse mumihanda ya Nairobi. Yatojwe nk'umusifuzi w'Umupira w'Amaguru.\nIshyirahamwe ry'abakina rugby.\nKenya irimo kwihesha izina mwikipe ya rugby. Irakunzwe cyane muri Kenya cyanecyane mu irushanwa rya Safari Sevens ngarukamwaka. Ikipe ya Kenya sevens yaje kumwanya wa 9 mu mikino y\u2019isi ya IRB Sevens mu mwaka wa 2006.\nreba kandi:\nVolleyball.\nKenya kandiyabaye ikipikomeye muri Volleyball y'abagore mur'Afurika, ahwamakipe yomuri Kenya yegukanye amarushanwa 13 y'Afurika, kandi ikipe y'igihugu iyoboye shampiyona y'umugabane w'Afurika ifite ibikombe 9 kuva mu 1991. Ikipey'abagore nayoyagiyeyitabira imikino Olempike na Shampiyona y'Isi ariko nta ntsinzi igaragara yatsinze. \nUmupira w'amaguru.\nUmukino wa Basketball numukinukunzwecyane muri Kenya, cyane cyane murubyiruko. Iki gihugu gisanzwe gicumbikiye abakinnyi benshi batsinze ba NCAA yomur'Amerika, ifatwa nk'itsinda rikomeye ku isi rya basketball ku banyeshuri ba Kaminuza na Kaminuza. Abakinnyi bazwi cyane barimo Joel Awich (Cal Poly), Tylor Ongwae (LA-Monroe) na Tom Wamukota (State ya Wichita). Nyamara, umubare w'Abanyakenya bakina nk'ababigize umwuga mu makipe akomeye mu Burayi no muri Aziya uracyari muto.\nIkipey'igihugu ya Kenya yagizimyaka myizacyane hagatiya za 80 na 90 ubwoyemererwaga kwitabira Shampiyona ya Basketball y'Afurika inshuro nyinshindetse inagera nomuri Final Four mu 1993 ubwo i Nairobi yakiraga irirushanwa.\nMuri Mutarama 2021, Liz Mills yafashe ikipey'igihugu ya Kenya y'abagabo. Iyobowe na Mills, Kenya yegukanye igikombe cyayo cya mbere cya AfroBasket mumyaka 28. Mumarushanwa ya AfroBasket 2021, Kenya yatsinze Angola yatwayigikombe cy'Afurika inshuro 11 kunshuro ya mberemumateka. Mumakipe ya 2021 FIBA AfroBasket Kenya yarangije irikumwanya wa 9 muri 16. \nCricket.\nCricket nundimukino ukunzwe kandutsindacyane mwikipe. Kenya yitabiriye igikombe cy'isi cya Cricket kuvamu 1996. Yatsinze amwe mumakipe akomeye kwisi ndetse igera murikimwe cya kabiri cy'irushanwa ryomu 2003. Yanatsinze igikombe cyambere cy'isi cya Cricket League cyabereye i Nairobi ndetseyitabira imikino ya T20 y'isi. Guhera muri Mutarama 2018, kapiteni wabo ni Rakep Patel.\nHoki yo mu kibuga.\nHockey yomu kibuga nayikinirwa muri Kenya. Ikipe y'igihugu ya Hockey y'abagabo ya Kenya yagize amanota meza cyane mu gikombe cy'isi cya Hockey mu 1971, ubwoyarangizaga ku mwanya wa kane.\nIyikipe kandiyitabiriye imikino Olempike y'impeshyi inshurondwi, irangiza kumwanya wa 6 mu 1964. Ikipibarizwa muri sitade ya City Park Hockey i Nairobi. Umukino wa Hockey muri Kenya ugenzurwa n'Ishyirahamwe ry'Umukino wa Hockey rya Kenya (KHU). \nLacrosse.\nGuhera muri Mata 2021, Kenya nimwe mubihugu bine by'Afurika bigize Ishyirahamwe Mpuzamahanga rya Lacrosse ririmogukuravuba. \nKunshuro yambere, Kenya izakina n'ikipe y'igihugu mwirushanwa rya Lacrosse ry'isi ry'abatarengeje imyaka 19 ryo mu 2022. \nUmupira wa baseball.\nIshyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wa Baseball muri Kenya (BFK) na Kenya Little League (KLL) byakomeje guteza imbere umukino wa baseball muri Kenya kuva mu 1992 na 2010. Uyumukino wakomeje guterimbere mumyaka ya za 90 mbereyokugabanuka mumyaka ya za 2000. Kenya yarimaze kwitabira imikino ya All Africa Games, imikino ya Kenko muri Zambiya, n\u2019iserukiramuco ry\u2019abana rya Baseball kwisi mu Buyapani (inshuro 4). Kenya yakiriye imikino yoguhatanira itike y\u2019igikombe cy\u2019isi cya Afurika y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 18 muri kaminuza ya Meru y\u2019ubumenyi n\u2019ikoranabuhanga (MUST) kuva kuya 15 kugeza ku ya 20 Ukuboza 2014. Uyumukino ukunzwe cyane i Nairobi, Meru, Migori na Makueni. Ukinwa mumashuri abanza n\u2019ayisumbuye, muriza kaminuza na za kaminuza biyobowe na MUST. Solomon Gacece niwe wari perezida umaze igihe kinini, naho George Mahinda akaba Umunyamabanga Mukuru.\nIkipe ya Kenya Little League yashinzwe na Little League Baseball i Williamsport, muri leta ya Pennsylvania muri Amerika mu 2010, ikaba yarakoreraga i Meru mbereyuko ikwirakwira i Nairobi na Mombasa. Ubu Uturere tugera kuri 24 dufite baseball, naho Akarere ka Meru kitwa kwari ko gatuye Baseball muri Afurika.\nUmukino wa Baseball urimogutangira mubihugu by'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba nka Kenya, Uganda, Tanzaniya, Etiyopiya n'u Rwanda. Shampiyona ngarukamwaka y'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba yabereye i Migori ku nshuro yambere kandi byitezwe kwizongera kuba. Kenya yitabiriye imikino Olempike yabereye mu Buyapani mu 2020.\nUmupira wa Softball.\nIshyirahamwe ry\u2019imikino ya softball rya Kenya Little League ririmogutezimbere imikinoya softball usibye baseball muturere nka Meru, Nairobi na Mombasa, naho Nairobi ikabari indimikino ya softball ikunzwecyane.\nIshyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wa Softball muri Kenya ririguteza imbere uyumukino cyanecyane muri za kaminuza.\nSiporo y'imodoka.\nSiporo y'imodoka muri Kenya iyoborwa n'Ishyirahamwe ry'Imikino y'Amamodoka rya Kenya (KMSF). KMSF ifitanyisano n'inzego zitandukanye zigenga siporo y'imodoka kwisi zirimo Ishyirahamwe Mpuzamahanga ry'Abatwara Moto (FIM) rigenga isiganwa rya moto, n'Ishyirahamwe Mpuzamahanga ry'Abatwara Moto (FIA) rigenzura amashyirahamwe y'abatwara imodoka, abakoresha imodoka, kandirikanategura Shampiyona y'Isi y'Amarushanwa y'Amamodoka (WRC). \nGuterana.\nSiporo yambere y\u2019ababigize umwuga mugutwara imodoka muri Kenya, East African Coronation Safari, yateguwe murwego rwokwizihiza ishingwa ry\u2019Umwamikazi Elizabeth wa II ku ya 2 Kamena 1953. Irirushanwa ngarukamwaka ryahinduriwe izina rya East African Safari Rally kuva mu 1954 kugeza mu 1975, na Safari Rally kuva mu 1975 kugezubu. Safari Rally ifitibyiciro 13 yashyizwe mu irushanwaryambere ryateguwe na FIA World Rally Championships (WRC) nk'icyiciro cya kane mu byiciro 13 byari bigize igihembwe cya WRC mu 1973. Ian Duncan niwe Munyakenya wenyine watsinze irushanwa rya WRC, Safari Rally mu 1994.\nIrushanwa ry'Afurika ry\u2019Imikino y\u2019Amagare (ARC) nikigo cy\u2019akarere cya FIA kandi gikoresha ibihembo ngarukamwaka by\u2019imikino y\u2019amagare, ahwimikino y\u2019amarushanwa ibumunani mubihugu umunani (Zimbabwe, Afurika y\u2019Epfo, Zambiya, Kenya, Uganda, Tanzaniya, u Rwanda na Madagasikari) kuvamuri Werurwe kugeza Ugushyingo, uretse mu Ukwakira. Safari Rally yemejwe nk'imwe mu mikino ikomeye kwisi. Umunyakenya w\u2019icyamamare, Shekhar Mehta / Nissan, yegukanye igihembwecyambere cya ARC (1981) mu gihe Davis Horsey / Peugeot ari we Munyakenya wa nyuma wegukanye ARC mu 1984.\nMugace ka Kenya, umukinnyi wa Kenya National Rally Champion atoranywa mumanota yakusanyijwe mu byiciro byinshi byatewe inkunga na KCB. Ian Duncan ni we watwaye igikombe cya KNR cya 2011. Patrick Njiru /David Williamson niwe mushoferi wambere w\u2019umunyafurika wegukanye igikombe cya Kenya National Rally Championship. Yakinnye muburyo buheruka mu 2002 mbere yo gusezera mu marushanwa. Ariko Njiru yakomeje guteguranokwitabira amarushanwa y\u2019abagiraneza. Ian Duncan ni we mushoferi watsinze cyane muri Kenya ukomeje kugaragara mu marushanwa atandukanye y\u2019imodoka kugezubu. Urupapuro rwerw'ibanze ni uru rukurikira: 1) Umunyakenya wenyine watsinzirushanwa rya WRC (Trust Bank Safari Rally ya 42, 1994), 2) Yatwaye Kenyan Rally Championship inshuro esheshatu (1987, 1988, 1989, 1991, 2000, na 2011), 3) Yatwaye East African Classic Safari Rally mu 2009 (yasiganwaga mwirushanwa rimwemu Ugushyingo 2011), 4) Yatwaye Guru Nanak Rally Championship inshuro 11, na 5) Yatwaye umukinnyi w\u2019imikino wa Motorsport w\u2019umwaka wa 2010!\nAbashoferi b'ibyamamare bavukiyemuri Kenya murururukurikirane rwa WRC: Joginder Singh (1973\u20131980), Shekhar Mehta (1973\u20131987), Patrick Njiru (1983\u20131998), na Ian Duncan (1983\u20131999).\nAbandibashoferi bakomeyebatwara imodoka muri Kenya uyumunsi: Carl Tundo, Azar Anwar, Lee Rose, Jas Mangat, na Ben Muchemi.\nBamwemubashoferi ba KNRC bafitibizigabibiri: James Kirimi, Patrick Kibara, Joe Muchiri, Adnan Suhail, na Niaz Bashir.\nMotocross.\nMuri Kenya, motocross ifititsinda rinini ry\u2019abakinnyi mumikino yose y\u2019imodoka. Haribyiciro bitandatu muri motocross: MX50, MX65, MX85, MX125, MX2, n\u2019icyiciro cy\u2019abasohoka, MX1. Bamwe mu bakinnyi bakomeye ba Kenya Motocross barimo Shivam Vinayak, Charles Mugo, Cruze Muigai, Anthony Nielsen, Mohammed Anwar, na Tutu Maina. Shivam niwemukinnyi wa motocross ufite imitako myinshi muri Kenya, afite ibikombe nka MXI National Champion, FIM Central African Motocross Champion, na Kenyan Motorcycle Cross Champion. Ku ya 28 Kanama 2011, ubwo habaga shampiyona ya FIM Africa Motocross i Harare, muri Zimbabwe, Kenya yari ihagarariwe n'abakinnyi batatu (Tutu Maina (MX125), Dekker Kihara (MX50), na Rolf Kihara (MX65) kandi yarangije ari iya 4 mu bihugu bitandatu byari bihagarariwe. Kuva kuya 14 kugeza ku ya 16 Ukwakira 2011, Kenya yakiriye shampiyona ya FIM Africa Cross Country Bike na Quad Team muri Soysambu Conservancy nziza cyane i Nakuru. \nEnduros na cross country.\nKenya ifitamarushanwa ya Enduro burimwaka nka Shampiyona y'Igihugu ya Enduro, JCB/Ganatra Plant and Equipment Cross Country Rally Challenge. Kenya kandiyitabira amarushanwa ya FIM Africa Enduro Championships. Shivam Vinayak numwe mubakinnyi b'amagare bakomeye ba Enduro muri Kenya, akabanakina muri motocross. Amarushanwa ya Enduro kandakurura amagare ane y'amapine ane azwi nka All Terrain Vehicles (ATV) afitabakinnyi b'abahanga nka Shazar Anwar, Murage Waigwa, Abid Ganatra, na Gurraj Singh. Enduro kandi ishimira Buggy Racing ikurura abashoferi b'inararibonye nka Ian Duncan na Samir Khan. \nAutocross.\nImodoka zombi zitwarabantu n'imodoka zitwara abagenzi zirushanwa mur'Autocross muri Kenya. Shampiyona ikomeye ni Shampiyona y'Igihugu ya Autocross. Keith Henrie ni we watwaye igikombe cya National Autocross mu 2011. Abandi bakinnyibakina autocross muri Kenya barimo Charles Mugo, Samir Khan, na Rajbir Rai. Abashoferi ba Rally nka Ben Muchemi w'icyamamare na bagenzi be Stella Macharia na Onkar Rai bakunze kwitabira irushanwa rya Autocross. \nGrand Prix karting.\nIkinicyo cyiciro cyanyuma cy\u2019amasiganwa y\u2019imodoka muri Kenya. Isiganwa rya Grand Prix rya Kenya rikoresha go-karts mumasiganwa yokwidagadura, irushanwa rya metero 500. Abategura Karting bakira abantu kugiticyabo, ibigo, n\u2019amashuri mumarushanwa atandukanye. Ariko muri Kenya, gutembera mumagare hibandwa cyane kukwishimisha nokubunararibonye bw\u2019amasiganwa y\u2019imodoka. \nSiporo yo mu mazi.\nKoga no koga.\nKenya yagizintsinzi ikomeye mukoga ukurikije ko ari umukino w\u2019umuntu kugiticye.\nGutembera mu bwato.\nIbikorwa byogusiganwa mubwato bwa Canoe-kayak byatangiriye muri Kenya munsi y\u2019ishyirahamwe rya Kenya Rowing and Canoe Association, nyumayokwinjira mwishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga rya Canoe (ICF) mu 2003 nyuma y\u2019uko Seifudin Patwa yitabiriye icyicaro gikuru cya ICF mu 2003 i Madrid, muri Esipanye.\nGutwara ubwato.\nUbucuruzi bwokumazi bwashinzwe muri Kenya mugihe cy'ubukoloni, ubwo Mombasa Rowing Club yashingwaga mu myaka ya 1930 i Liwatoni, Mombasa. Iyi Club yakoraga nk'ikipe y'imyidagaduro, rimwe na rimwe irushanwa ry'amato y'intambara yazaga mu mazi cyane cyane British Navy, nyuma ifatanyije na Kenya Navy, ariko iyi Club n'ibikorwa byo ku mazi byahagaze mu 1991 kubera amakimbirane y'ubutaka n'ikigo cy'uburobyi cyari hafi aho. Ubushake bwongeye kubyutswa muntangiriro za 1995, ubwohashingwaga ishyirahamwe ry'abarobyi bokumazi rya Kenya, urwego rw'igihugu rwarirushinzwe, rwashinzwe na Seifudin Patwa na Alisdair Macdonald, rwari rufitanye isano n'ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga ry'abarobyi bokumazi (FISA) na Komite y'igihugu y'imikino Olempike n'ibikorwa byo ku mazi byatangiye gushyamirana muri Tudor Creek, Mombasa.\nUbushake bwo gutemberera mumazi bwaragarutse muri Kenya Navy mugihe Mombasa Rowing Club yimukiye muri Tudor Creek. Mu 2000, ikipeya The Rowing yahatanye bwa mbere hanze ya Kenya mu irushanwa rya 4th Africa Rowing Championship ryabereye i Pretoria mur'Afurika y'Epfo n'abasare 8, bose baturutse muri Kenya Navy. Mu 2003, Canoeing yongeweho nk'igikorwa mu ishyirahamwe ry'igihugu ryaje guhinduka Kenya Rowing and Canoe Association nyumayokuba yari ifitanye isano n'ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga ry'abasare (ICF) muruwomwaka.\nMu 2003, Kenya yegukanyitike yambere mwirushanwa ryogusiganwa kumazi (Rowing) mu mikino Olempike yabereye i Athens mu mwaka wa 2004 mu cyiciro cya Single Scull binyuze kuri Ibragim Githiga, umusirikare wo mu ngabo za Kenya. Nubwo umusaruro wewanyuma utarimwiza cyane, wari intambwe nziza mwiterambere ry\u2019abasiganwa ku mazi muri Kenya. Kenya yongeye kwegukana itike ya Single scull mumikino Olempike ya Beijing mu 2008.\nSiporo yo kurasa.\nGurasa intego.\nNubwo Kenya yohereje abarashe mumikino Olempike kuva mu 1956 (hamwe n'ibibazo), iki gikorwa cyakomeje kuba umukino w'abantu bake. Kuva mumyaka ya 1970, abarashe muri Kenya ubu babarirwa muri kimwe cya kabiri cy'Abanyafurika n'igice cy'Abahinde. Abakinnyi bazwi cyane mu mateka ya kera n'abatsinze Olempike ni John Harun Mwau (ubunumunyapolitiki) n'uwarashe imbunda zomubwoko bwa pistolet Shuaib Adam. Uwarashe imbunda zomubwoko bwa ISSF muri Kenya yagaragaye mu mahanga mu mikino ya Commonwealth Games 2010 nomumikino ya Afurika 2011. Uyumukino ufite ibibazobyo kudatera inkunga, kubura amakipe, kuburabatoza n'itegeko rishaje ryo kugaba intwaro, arikufite urwegorugezweho i Nairobi, n'impano zikomeye zitaratera imbereneza.\nUbusasu bwo kurasa.\nMuri Kenya, gukoresha imiheto byakoreshejwe muburyo bwa gakondo. Byakoreshejwe muguhiga, muntambara nomumikino. Mu 2002, ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abarashibo muri Kenya ryafunguwe kugira ngorikemure ikibazo cy\u2019aho abarashi bashobora gukinira mumikino mpuzamahanga cyari kiri kwiyongera. Ibibyaje nogushinga itsinda ry\u2019abarashi bomuri Kenya.\nSiporo zo mu misozi.\nSiporo yomu misozi niyo siporo nshya muri Kenya. Nimikino ihuriweho ifitanyisano n'abantu ku giti cyabo n'ikipe irimo kwiruka intera ndende, Ishuri ry'Imigozi miremire, Kuzamuka imisozi no Kumanuka mu ishyamba, byose bikorerwa mwishyamba. Ishuri ry'Ubukerarugendo n'Ubuyobozi rya Mt. Kenya (KESAL) ryakoze Siporo yo mu misozi ku ya 22 Ukwakira 2011. Abatsinze mu irushanwa rya mbere ni Benard Waweru \u2013 Abagabo 21\u00a0km Isiganwa ry'ishyamba ry'abakuze mu gihe 21 z'abagore bakuze\u00a0km yegukanwe n'umukinnyi w'umuhanga mukwiruka mumuhanda witwa Pauline Wangui. Sammy Ndungu yegukanye igihembo cya Sky Marathon naho Kaminuza ya Methodiste ya Kenya (KEMU) yegukana igihembo cya Extreme Adventure. Reba kwipaji ya Mountain Sport-Kenya kugira ngo umenye byinshi.\nIndi mikino ku giti cye.\nIteramakofe.\nWaruinge Nakayama numwe mubakinnyi b'iteramakofe bakomeye muri Kenya. Yavukiye muri Philip Warunige, yahinduye izinarye nyumayo kwimukira mu Buyapani. Wairunge yegukanye umudari wa feza nk'umukinnyi wa Bantamweight mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi yo mu 1972 yabereye i Munich mu Budage nk'umukinnyi utarabigize umwuga, mbere y'uko atangira umwuga wabigize umwuga watumye hafiyegukana igikombe cy'isi, atsindwa kabiri, kugikombe cy'isi cya WBC cya Super-Bantamweight akina na Rigoberto Riasco, ndetse nyuma, kugikombe cy'isi cya Bantamweight ikina na Carlos Zarate. Yanatwaye kandi shampiyona y'igihugu y'Ubuyapani ya Super-Bantamweight.\nKugendera ku igare.\nUyumukinnyi w\u2019amagare wavukiye muri Kenya, Chris Froome, yagaragaye muntangiriro za 2010 nk'umwe mu bakinnyi b\u2019amagare bakomeye ku isi, atsinda irushanwa rya Vuelta a Espagne ryo mu 2011 na Tour de France yo mu 2012 mbereyokwegukana umudari wa bronze mu irushanwa ry\u2019igihe mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2012 na Tour de France yo mu 2013, aba umukinnyi wa mbere w\u2019umunyafurika wavukiye muri Afurika wegukanye iri siganwa. Froome yatwaye igare nk\u2019umunyakenya mbere yo guhindura ubwenegihugu bwe kugira ngahagarariye Ubwongereza mbere ya Tour de France yo mu 2008. Yatwayirushanwa ryeryakabiri rya Tour mu 2015 n\u2019irya gatatu mu mwaka wakurikiyeho, akurikirwa n\u2019irindi rushanwa rya bronze mumikino Olempike yo mu 2016. Froome yatojwe n\u2019umunyakenya w\u2019umwuga w\u2019amagare witwa David Kinjah mumyaka yeyambere. \nIkipe y\u2019abasiganwa kumagareyo muri Kenya, Kenyan Riders, yashinzwe mu 2009 n\u2019umufotozi w\u2019umunya-Singapur Nicholas Leong nyuma yokubona abasiganwa b\u2019amagare bo muri Kenya bigaruriye isiganwa rya Marathon rya Singapore. Mu 2016, Kenyan Riders yifatanyije n\u2019ikipe y\u2019abahanga muri Downunder bakora Kenyan Riders Downunder, ikipe yambere ya UCI Continental yiyandikishije mur'Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba. Ren\u00e9 van Velhuijzen yateje imbere 1000\u00a0Urugendo rw'amagare rushingiye kuri Safari km, bityorukururabanyamagare bomu misozi muri Kenya kugira ngobagire ubuzimabwiza. Urugendo rw'amagare rwo muri Kenya. Archived \nSiporo yo mu bwoko bwa roller.\nSiporo yogusiganwa kumaguru, cyanecyane gusiganwa kumaguru muri Kenya, iyoborwa n\u2019ishyirahamwe rya Roller Sports Kenya (RSKF). Irishyirahamwe ryashinzwe mu 1997, ritegura ibyiciro bitandukanye by\u2019amasiganwa nko gusiganwa kumaguru ku maguru, no gusiganwa ku maguru ku maguru. KSKF ifitanye isano n\u2019ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga rya siporo yo gusiganwa ku maguru. Amasiganwa/ibikorwa by\u2019ishyirahamwe biberacyane cyane muri Moi International Sports Complex, Kasarani. Hariho amarushanwa 3 kugeza kuri 4 buri mwaka harimo n\u2019ayo ishyirahamwe rikoreramo, abera i Bomet, Rift Valley (2011). \nReba kandi:\nIkigo cy'igihugu cy'imikino.\nMinisiteri ya Siporo, Umuco n'Ubuhanzi niyifite urwegorwo hejuru mumiterere y'imikino muri Kenya. Minisitiri wa Siporo ashyira mubikorwa politiki zijyanye n'iterambere rya siporo, kandi akaganira ku mishinga y'amategeko ya siporo munteko ishinga amategeko. Komiseri wa siporo, muri Minisiteri ya Siporo, akora nk'umujyanama wa leta kubibazo bya siporo, agashushanya kandi agasuzuma politiki, kandi agakomeza amahame ngenderwaho mwishami rya siporo. Burikarere gafite abahagarariye guverinoma bashinzwe siporo muri guverinoma.\nInama y'Igihugu ya Siporo ya Kenya ishyirwaho n'abanyamuryango batowe baturutse mu mikino yose muri Kenya kugirango barebe kwimikino yose ingana mu iterambere, mu kuzamura no guhagararirwa mu marushanwa akomeye, haba mugihugu nomumahanga ndetse nomu yindi mirimo. Komite y'Igihugu ya Olempike ya Kenya (NOCK) itegura abakinnyi ba Kenya bazitabira imikino Olempike kandi ikorana n'izindi nzego za siporo muguteza imbere noguteza imbere imikino muri icyo gihugu.\nUmuryango w'imikino muri kaminuza.\nIshyirahamwe ry\u2019imikino ya za Kaminuza za Kenya niryo shyirahamwe riyoboramashuri makuru na za kaminuza muri Kenya.\nIkigo cy'imikino y'amashuri.\nIshyirahamwe ry\u2019imikino y\u2019amashuri abanza ya Kenya (KPSA) n\u2019Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imikino y\u2019amashuri yisumbuye ya Kenya ni zonzego ziyobora imikino mumashuri abanza (icyiciro cya 1 kugeza kucya 8) n\u2019amashuri yisumbuye (icyiciro cya 1 kugeza kucya 4)\nSiporo y'urubyiruko.\nIterambere ry\u2019amashyirahamwe y\u2019urubyiruko mumikino muri Kenya ryakurikiye itsindwa ry\u2019uburezi bw\u2019imyitozo ngororamubiri mumashuri. Gahunda yambere y\u2019urubyiruko mumikino, Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Urubyiruko mu mikino ya Mathare ryashinzwe mu 1987. Kuva icyo gihe, inzego za leta, imiryango itari iya leta (imiryango itegamiye kuri leta), n\u2019amatsinda mpuzamahanga nka Loni, yakomeje gushyiraho gahunda z\u2019urubyiruko mumijyi ituwe cyane, bihabanabenshi bo muri Kenya amahirweyo kwitabira siporo. "}
{"id": "21737", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21737", "title": "Carlos Mugabo", "text": "Carlos Monroe (yavutse ku ya 5 Gicurasi 1987 i Philadelphia, muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ariko u Rwanda ruza kumuha ubwenegihugu akina nku mukinnyi wu RWanda kumazin ya Carlos Mugabo wavutse ku ya 12 Kanama 1986 i Nyarugenge) ni umukinnyi wa Basketball w'Umunyamerika wari mu ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda ya Basketball mu irushanwa rya FIBA afurike ryo mu 2009. Yakiniye ikipe ya Basketball y'abagabo ya Folorida Atelantike Owls kuva muri 2005 kugeza muri 2009. \nUmwuga.\nMugabo yinjiye mu ikipe y\u2019u Rwanda mu irushanwa rya FIBA rya Afurika ryo muri 2009 nyuma y\u2019uko abakinnyi babiri b\u2019u Rwanda bavuye mu irushanwa ibyumweru bitatu mbere y\u2019uko umukino utangira wari uteganyijwe. yatsinze amanota 10.6 ya PPG, 5.8 ya RPG, na 2.0 ya SPG kugira ngo afashe Abanyarwanda kurangiza ku mwanya wa 9 ndetse no kwitwara neza kugeza ubu mu irushanwa rya Afurika. "}
{"id": "21739", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21739", "title": "Gisubizo merci", "text": "Gisubizo Merci ni Umunyarwanda ukina umukino w'amaboko uzwi nka volleyball mu Rwanda. Wavutse ku wa 23/12/2004 yavukiye Kandi akurira mu rwanda.Arinaho yatangiye kugaragariza impano ye yogukina umukino wamaboko volleyball.\nAmakipe yakiniye.\nMu makipe yakiniye harimo APR VC kuva mu mwaka wa 2021 ubwo yayisinyiraga amasezerano y\u2019imyaka ibiri avuye mu ikipe ya Don Bosco Gatenga aho yari amaze kuyihesha igikombe cya shampiyona yo mu cyiciro cya kabiri,kandi yakiniye amakipe atandukanye y\u2019abato ndetse yanayoboye bagenzi be batarengeje imyaka 21 mu ikipe y\u2019igihugu mu mikino yabereye mu gihugu cya Tuniziya muri 2022.\nEkipe akinira ubu.\nubu gisubizo merci akinira ikipe ya REG VC aka ari ikipe ya bagabo ishingiye ku kigo cy'igihugu cya mashanyarazi."}
{"id": "21740", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21740", "title": "Jean-Victor Mukama", "text": "Jean-Victor Mukama (yavutse ku ya 24 Kanama 1994) ni umukinnyi wa Basketball w\u2019abigize umwuga w\u2019umunyarwanda ukomoka muri canada. Afite 203\u00a0cm, ni umukinnyi ukina imbere asatira.\nUmwuga.\nMu Ukwakira 2019, Mukama yakinnye amarushanwa ya Raptors 905 maze yongerwa ku rutonde rw'abakinnyi bakina ariko aza kurekurwa mbere yo gutangira imikino.\nMu Ukuboza 2019, Mukama yasinye amasezerano na Patriots BBC yo mu Rwanda kugira ngo akine amarushanwa yo guhatanira itike ya BAL yo muri 2020.. Mu mukino wa nyuma w\u2019amarushanwa yo guhatanira itike bakinnye na GNBC, Mukama yatsinze amanota 18. \nUmwuga w'ikipe y'igihugu.\nMu Gushyingo 2020, Mukama yatoranyijwe mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball y'u Rwanda mu mikino yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina Afurika Basketball yo muri 2021. \nUbuzima bwite.\nMukama yavukiye i Quebec, yimukiye mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda muri 2003, amarayo imyaka ine mbere yo gusubira muri canada. "}
{"id": "21741", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21741", "title": "Ndizeye Dieudonn\u00e9", "text": "Dieudonn\u00e9 Ndayisaba Ndizeye (yavutse ku ya 14 Ukwakira 1996) ni umukinnyi wa Basketball w'umunyarwanda, ukinira APR BBC muri Shampiyona ya Basketball mu Rwanda (RBL) n'ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda. yabaye umukinnyi mwiza muri RBL inshuro eshatu ndetse yatwayee shampiyona inshuro imwe muri 2019. Ndizeye yakinnye ishuro bibiri BAL ari muri REG.\nUbuzima.\nNdizeye yatangiye umwuga wa basketball ari muri IPRC-Kigali muri Shampiyona y'igihugu ya Basketball mu 2015. Muri 2017, Ndizeye yinjiye muri Patriot BBC. Yahawe igihembo cya shampiyona y'igihugu MVP muri shampiyona ya 2018\u201319.Mu Gushyingo 2021, yinjiye mu ikipe ya Cobra Sport yo muri Sudani y'Amajyepfo kugira ngo abakinire mu marushanwa yo gushaka itike ya BAL 2022. Yafashije Cobra kuza BAL kunshuro y'ambere."}
{"id": "21742", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21742", "title": "Ntanteteri Ivan Crispin", "text": "Ntanteteri Ivan Crispin Umunyarwanda ukina umukino wamaboko volleyball wavutse23 Ugushyingo2001Afite uburebure bwa 187 cm, bimumarira akamaro mu mikino itandukanye.\nUrugendo rwe muri Volleyball.\nYatangiye kugaragara cyane akina muri Police Volleyball club yo mu rwanda.\nkubera ubuhanga bwe mugutanga imipira n'uburyo bwo gutegura imipira ivamo ibitego kuri bagenzi be mukibuga.\nMuri 2025, REG Volleyball Club (REG VC) yamugiriye ikizere asinyira iyi kipe, abaye umwe mu bakinnyi bakomeye baje kongerera abandi imbaraga ikipe mugushaka kwegukana ibikombe.\nNtanteteri Ivan Crispin yanahamagawe mw'ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya volleyball y\u2019u Rwanda mumarushanwa akomeye kumugabane w'Afurika harimo Shampiyona ya Afurika yabereye i Cairo muri Misiri mu mwaka wa 2023, aho yari mu bakinnyi 14 batoranyijwe ku ruhande rw\u2019abagabo. "}
{"id": "21743", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21743", "title": "Kanamugire prince", "text": "Kanamugire prince Umunyarwanda ukina umukino wamaboko volleyball mu rwanda.\nWavukiye Kandi akurira mu rwanda muburasirazuba, Ngoma \nAmakipe ya volleyball yakiniye.\nAPR VOLLEYBALL CLUB,nikipe y'igihugu y'urwanda yumukino wamaboko volleyball \nIbikombe yegukanye.\n\ud83c\udfc6Shampiyona y\u2019umukino wa volleyball (2024/25).\n\ud83c\udfc6CAVB Zone V Club Championship (2025).\n\ud83c\udfc6Nyerere International / Nyerere Cup (2024).\n\ud83c\udfc6Taxpayers\u2019 Appreciation Volleyball Tournament."}
{"id": "21744", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21744", "title": "William Robeyns", "text": "William Robeyns (yavutse ku ya 23 Gashyantare 1996) ni umukinnyi wa basketball ufite ubwenegihugu bw\u2019ababiligi n'u Rwanda, uheruka gukinira ikipe Li\u00e8ge ya Basket muri shampiyona ya BNXT. Ahagarariye kandi ikipe y'igihugu ya basketball yu Rwanda.\nRobeyns yakiniye Phoenix Brussels kuva muri 2018 kugeza 2021. Mu mwaka wa shampiyona wa 2020-21, yatsinze amanota 9.0 buri mukino. Ku itariki ya 20 Gicurasi 2021, Robeyns yasinye amasezerano na Liege ya Basket. \nMu mwaka wa 2022 mu kiruhuko, Robeyns yakiniye APR bbc muri shampiyona ya Basketball y'u Rwanda. Ku ya 4 Gicurasi 2024, Robeyns yakinnye bwa mbere muri shampiyona ya Basketball afurike (BAL) ari kumwe na APR, atsinda amanota 6 na ribandi 5 mu mukino batsinze US Monastir mu minota y'inyongera. \nUmwuga w'ikipe y'igihugu.\nMuri Kanama 2021, Robeyn yongerewe ku rutonde rw'abakinnyi bakina umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda. Ku itariki ya 25 Kanama 2021, Robeyn yakinnye umukino we wa mbere ku munsi wa mbere w'irushanwa maze atanga amanota 24 ku ntsinzi ya DR Congo ku manota 81 - 68. \nYatsindiye umudari mu irushanwa rya FIBA afurike ryo mu 2023 ryabereye muri Angola, rikaba ari ryo rya mbere igihugu cyarangije ku mwanya wa mbere mu irushanwa mpuzamahanga. "}
{"id": "21745", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21745", "title": "Robert Thomson", "text": "Robert Thomson (yavutse ku ya 28 Mutarama 1982) Ni umwe mu bagize ikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball y'abagabo yu Rwanda. Thomson yavukiye muri Penesilivaniya, yarangije amashuri yisumbuye i Valey, muri Penesilivaniya. Yakinnye basketball muri kaminuza ya Fairfield.\nUmwuga.\nThomson yimukiye mu Rwanda mu 2006 nyuma yo kurangiza muri Fairfield no gukina imyaka ibiri ya basketball y'ababigize umwuga muri Hongiriya no mu Butaliyani. Thomson yaje kubona pasiporo yu Rwanda aba umwe mu bagize ikipe y\u2019u Rwanda, yarangirije kumwannya wa cyenda muri Shampiyona y\u2019Afurika ya FIBA \u200b\u200b2009 ndetse na 2007."}
{"id": "21747", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21747", "title": "Sehirwa Ildephonse", "text": "Ildephonse Sehirwa ni umunyarwanda akabari umugabo wiruka intera ndende ya Marato. Sehirwa yitabiriye marato y'abagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1992."}
{"id": "21748", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21748", "title": "Dusabe Telesphore", "text": "Telesphore Dusabe (yavutse ku ya 15 Gicurasi 1965) ni umukinnyi w\u2019umunyarwanda wiruka intera ndende muri marato. Yitabiriye marato y\u2019abagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi yo mu 1988. "}
{"id": "21749", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21749", "title": "J. Cole", "text": "Jermaine Lamarr Cole (yavutse ku ya 28 Mutarama 1985) ni umuraperi ukomoka muri umunyamerika akaba atunganya amajwi y'indirimbo. Yavukiye mu kigo cya gisirikare mu Budage akurira i Fayetteville, muri Carolina y\u2019Amajyaruguru, Cole yatangiye kumenyekana nk\u2019umuraperi nyuma yo gusohora indirimbo za mbere, mu ntangiriro za 2007. Agamije gukomeza umwuga we wa muzika, yasinye amasezerano na Roc Nation ya Jay-Z muri 2009 anasohora izindi ndirimbo ebyirii.\nUmwuga wa Basketball.\nCole yakinnye basketball mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Terri Saniforde muri Carolina y'Amajyaruguru. yagerageje kujya muri Kaminuza ya St. John kandi yari umwe mu bakinnyi 10 bahamagawe mu mwaka we wa kabiri. Mu 2012, Cole yakiniye ikipe y'Iburasirazuba mu mukino w'ibyamamare wa NBA. Mu 2013, Cole yabwiye \"Sports Illustrated\" ati: \"Siporo nibwo yatangira kuri njye. Ijyanye n'ubuzima bwanjye. Rap ni ikintu gikunda amarushanwa. Niyo mpamvu ntagomba kureka siporo. Ngomba gukomeza. Ni ubuzima bwanjye mu bundi buryo. \nMu Rwanda yaje gukinira Patriots BBC ubwo yari mu marushanwa ya shampiyona yu Rwanda, ndetse na marushamwa nyafurika ya bale \nMu 2014, mu kiganiro na Angie Martinez, Cole yashyize Tupac, The Notorious BIG, Nas, na Jay- Z mu baraperi be bane ba mbere mu bihe byose, naho Andr\u00e9 3000 na Eminem bazamuka ku mwanya wa gatanu. "}
{"id": "21750", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21750", "title": "Brandon Costner", "text": "Brandon Jay Costner (yavutse ku ya 21 Nyakanga 1987) ni umunyamerika wahoze ari umukinnyi wa Basketball w'aba bigize umwuga, ubu akaba ari mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru. Aherutse gukinira amakipe yo muri Porito Rico nka Grises ya Humaca na Santerosi y'aguada yo muri Baloncesto nacional. Yakiniye basketball ya kaminuza muri NC.\nUmwuga.\nMuri Mutarama 2018, Costner yasinye amasezerano na Champe vile yo muri Libani Basketball. \nMuri Gicurasi 2021, yinjiye mu ikipe y'u Rwanda ya Patriots BBC kugira ngo akine mu mwaka w'imikino wa shampiyona wa 2021 muri BAL. "}
{"id": "21751", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21751", "title": "Chris Crawford", "text": "Marcus Christopher Crawford (yavutse ku ya 30 Nzeri 1992) ni umukinnyi wa Basketball w\u2019umunyamerika w'abigize umwuga muri Paisasi wo muri Baloncesito Colombiano. Yakinnye Basketball muri Kaminuza ya Memphis, kandi yakinnye nk'umunyamwuga mu makipe yo mu Burayi, Afurika na Amerika y'Epfo. Yatoranyijwe inshuro ebyiri mu ikipe ya mbere ya BAL kuko yabarizwa mu ikipe ya Patriots BBC muri ayo marushanwa.\nmu Rwanda.\nKu ya 17 Gicurasi 2022, Crawford yinjiye muri Al Wahda Damascus yo muri shampiyona ya Basketball ya Siriya. \nKu ya 23 Kanama 2022, yinjiye muri Patriots BBC yo muri shampiyona y'umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda. Ku ya 26 Kanama, Crawford yatsinze amanota 8 mu mukino we wa mbere ubwo yatsindaga Tigers BBC amanota 91-45. Patriots yatsinzwe na REG bbc mu mikino ya nyuma ya shampiyona, bityo iba iya kabiri."}
{"id": "21752", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21752", "title": "Michael Dixon", "text": "Michael Andre Dixon Jr. (yavutse ku ya 1 Ukuboza 1990) ni umukinnyi w'umunyamwuga wa basketball yavukiye muri Jeworujiya, ubu akaba akinira ikipe Clubu Afurike yo muri shampioyna pro a. Yakinnye basketball ya kaminuza muri Misuri na Memphis.\nDixon Jr. yegukanye igikombe cya BAL muri 2022 ari kumwe na US Monastir, anaba umukinnyi mwiza wirushanwa.\nubunyamwuga.\nPatriots (2023).\nMuri Kanama 2023, Dixon yinjiye mu ikipe yo mu Rwanda ya Patriots BBC yo muri shampiyona y'umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda (RBL). Yakinnye umukino wa mbere ku ya 12 Kanama, atsinda amanota 20 niyo menshi mu mukino batsinze ahanganye APR BBC. \nAPR (2024).\nMu Ukuboza 2023, Dixon yinjiye muri APR BBC, ikipe yatwaye igikombe cy'igihugu cy'u Rwanda. "}
{"id": "21753", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21753", "title": "Ater Majok", "text": "Ater James Majok (yavutse ku ya 4 Nyakanga 1987) ni umukinnyi ukina basketball w'abigize umwuga, ukina muri Rajawali Medane wo muri shampoyona ya indoneziya Basketball (IBL). Yavukiye muri Sudani akurira muri Ositaraliya, Majok ahagararira Libani ku rwego mpuzamahanga. Yatoranyijwe na Los Angeles ya lakazi mu mukino wa NBA wo muri 2011, aza ku mwanya wa 58 muri rusange.. Majok afite uburebure bwa metero 2.11, ahanini agaragara cyane mu bijyanye n'ubuhanga bwe mubwugarizi. Yabaye umukinnyi w'umwaka mu 2022 urinda muri BAL.\nubunyamwuga.\numwaka wa 2022\u201323.\nMuri Werurwe 2023, Majok yasinye amasezerano n'ikipe yo muri Angola yitwa Petro ya Luanda, ikipe ya Monastir yahanganye nayo mu mukino wa nyuma wa BAL w'umwaka ushize., maze barangiza ari aba kane hamwe na Petro.\nMuri Kanama 2023, Majok yinjiye mu ikipe yo mu Rwanda ya Patriots BBC mu gihe cy'imikino ya shampiyona y'umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda (RBL). "}
{"id": "21754", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21754", "title": "Guibert Nijimbere", "text": "Joe Guibert Nijimbere (yavutse ku ya 26 Ukuboza 1996) ni umukinnyi wa basketball ukomoka i Burundi ukinira ikipe Kepler BBC n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball.\nUbuzima bwa mbere.\nNijimbere yavutse ku ya 26 Ukuboza 1996 i Mutanga. ni umwana wa kabiri mu bana 9. Yakuriye mu mikino ya basketball hamwe na se ndetse hamwe na barumuna be batatu, bose bakaba baraje gukina uwo mukino. \nUmwuga.\nMuri 2019, yinjiye muri Patriots BBC kandi yari mu ikipe yabashije kwitabira shampiyona yo muri 2020 BAL. Yatorewe kuba umukinnyi mwiza w'irushanwa ryo kwibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi rya 2019, anatsinda irushanwa ry'amanota atatu mu mukino. \nYinjiye muri Dynamo mu Kwakira 2023 mbere y'irushanwa rya BAL ryo mu 2024. Muri Mata 2024, Nijimbere yasinye amasezerano na Kepler BBC yo muri shampiyona y'umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda. "}
{"id": "21756", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21756", "title": "A'Darius Pegues", "text": "A'Darius Lamar Pegues (yavutse ku ya 21 Werurwe 1988) ni umukinnyi ukina Basketball ukomoka umugand wavukiye muri Amerika, akaba yarakiniye Patriots BBC mu ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda. Afite metero\u00a02.08, akina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati. \nUmwuga.\nMu Gushyingo 2019, Pegues yasinye amasezerano n'ikipe yo mu Rwanda ya Patriots BBC kugira ngo akine mu irushanwa ryo gushaka itike yo gukina imikino ya Basketball muri afurike (BAL). Pegues na Patriots babana itike.\nPegues yahagarariye Uganda mu irushanwa rya afurika Basket ryo muri 2017 ryabereye muri Tuniziya na Senegal, aho yatsinze ibitego byinshi mu ikipe. "}
{"id": "21757", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21757", "title": "Will Perry", "text": "William Kiah Perry (yavutse ku ya 11 Ukwakira 1994) ni umukinnyi wa Basketball w'umunyamerika ubarizwa mu babigize umwuga. Areshya na metero 1.83. Perry akina nk'umuzamu w'inyuma. Yahoze ari umukinnyi muri kaminuza ya Lenoir, amaze imyaka myinshi akina umukino wa Basketball mu Burayi no muri afurika. Perry yari afite agahigo ko gutsinda amanota menshi mu mukino umwe wa BAL, ni umukinnyi wakinnye mu ikipe ya mbere y'abakinyi beza ba BAL inshuro imwe ndetse akaba n'umukinnyi wegukanye igihembo cy'umugabo mwiza muri BAL inshuro ebyiri.\nUmwuga.\nKigali Titans (2023).\nKu ya 8 Mutarama 2023, Perry yinjiye muri Kigali Titans yo muri shampiyona y'umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda (RBL) ku masezerano y'ukwezi kumwe. "}
{"id": "21758", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21758", "title": "2018 Rwandan Cup", "text": "Igikombe cy'u Rwanda cyo muri 2017\u201318 nigihembwe cya 36 cy'irushanwa ry'igikombe cy'umupira w'amaguru mu Rwanda. Irirushanwa ritegurwa n'Ishyirahamwe ry'Umupira w'Amaguru mu Rwanda (RAF) kandi rifunguye kumakipe yose yomu Rwanda.\nIcyiciro cya mbere.\nIcyiciro cy\u2019ibanze kizakinwa kuya 30 Mutarama 2018. \nIcyiciro cya nyuma cy'umukino wa nyuma.\nImikino ya Play-off izakinwa kuya 3 Gashyantare 2018. \nIcyiciro cya 32.\nIcyiciro cya 32 kizakinwa kuya 6 na 7 Gashyantare 2018, imikino yakabiri izakinwa kuya 21 na 22 Gashyantare 2018. \n\"Igitego 1-0 ku giteranyo. Sorwathe FC yananiwe kugaragara ku mukino\".\"Amagaju yatsinze ibitego 4-1 ku mukino rusange\".\"AS Kigali yatsinze ibitego 6-1 ku mukino rusange\".\"2\u20132 ku giteranyo. Marines yemerewe kw itegeko ry'igitego cyo hanze\".\"Police yatsinze ibitego 3-1 kumukino rusange\".\"Bugesera yatsinze ibitego 2-0 kumukino wose\".\"Musanze yatsinze kubitego 8-1 kumukino rusange\".\"Kiyovu Sports yatsinze kumanota 11-3 kumukino wose\".\"Mukura Victory Sports yatsinze ibitego 3-0 kumukino rusange\".\"Pepiniere yatsinze ibitego 4-1 k mukino rusange\".\"AS Muhanga yatsinze ibitego 2-1 kumukino rusange\".\"Etincelles yatsinze ibitego 4-0 kumukino wose\".\"Sunrise yatsinze kubitego 3-0 kubusa, nyuma y'uko Miroplast ananiwe kugaragara mumukino\".\"0\u20130 kuri rusange. La Jeunesse yatsinze 5\u20134, nyuma yapenariti\".\nIcyiciro cya 16.\nAmaguru ya Mbere\n[Ku ya 2 Mata]\nMukura 3-2 AS Kigali\nPepini\u00e8re 0-1 Marines\nEspoir 2-1 Sunrise\n[Ku ya 3 Mata]\nLa Jeunesse 0-3 APR\nAS Muhanga 2-1 Amagaju\nMusanze 2-1 Police\n[Ku ya 4 Mata]\nKiyovu Sports 1-1 Bugesera\n[Ku ya 25 Mata]\nEtincelles 1-1 Rayon Sports\nAmaguru ya Kabiri\n[5 Mata]\nAS Kigali 1-2 Mukura\nSunrise 2-0 Espoir\nMarines 1-0 Pepini\u00e8re\n[Ku ya 6 Mata]\nPolice 3-0 Musanze\nBugesera 0-0 Kiyovu Sports\nAPR 0-0 La Jeunesse\nAmagaju 1-0 AS Muhanga\n[Ku ya 23 Gicurasi]\nRayon Sports 2-0 Etincelles\nImikino ya kimwe cya kane.\nAmaguru ya Mbere\n[20 Nyakanga]\nSunrise 2-0 Bugesera\nMukura 1-0 Amagaju\nPolice 0-0 APR\n[21 Nyakanga]\nMarines 0-1 Rayon Sports\nAmaguru ya Kabiri\n[23 Nyakanga]\nAmagaju 0-0 Mukura\nBugesera 1-0 Sunrise\n[24 Nyakanga]\nRayon Sports 3-1 Marines\n[26 Nyakanga]\nAPR 3-0 Police\nIgice cya kabiri.\nAmaguru ya Mbere\n[3 Kanama]\nMukura 0-0 APR\n[Ku ya 6 Kanama]\nSunrise 2-1 Rayon Sports\nAmaguru ya Kabiri\n[8 Kanama]\nAPR 1-1 Mukura\n[9 Kanama]\nRayon Sports 2-0 Sunrise\nUmukino wo guhatanira umwanya wa gatatu.\n[12 Kanama]\nIzuba Rirashe 0-1 APR\nUmusozo.\n[12 Kanama]\nMukura Intsinzi Imikino 0-0 (aet, ikaramu 3-1) Rayon Sport "}
{"id": "21759", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21759", "title": "1999 CECAFA Cup", "text": "Igikombe cya CECAFA cyo mu 1999 cyaricya 23 cyirushanwa. Cyabereye mu Rwanda, kandi cyatsinzwe n'ikipe yakabiri y'u Rwanda. Imikino yakinwe hagati ya 24 Nyakanga na 7 Kanama.\nU Rwanda rwohereje amakipe abiri: Rwanda A na Rwanda B.\nIcyiciro cy'itsinda.\nItsinda D.\n\"Rwanda B yarangije ku mwanya wakabiri kugiceri cyashyizwe kumwanya wambere.\"\nAmareferensi.\nUbubiko bwa RSSSF"}
{"id": "21760", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21760", "title": "2001 CECAFA Cup", "text": "Igikombe cya CECAFA cyo muri 2001 cyarirushanwa rya 25 ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru ryahuje amakipe yomuri Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba n\u2019iyo Hagati. Iyimikino yakinwe mu Rwanda, rwari rwaherukaga kwakira irirushanwa imyaka ibiri mbere yaho, mu 1999. Imikino yose muriri rushanwa yakinwe kuva kuya 8 Ukuboza 2001, ubwo u Rwanda rwatsindaga Somalia, kugeza ku ya 22 Ukuboza 2001, ubwo habaga imikino yo guhatanira umwanya wanyuma n\u2019uwa gatatu. Mbere y\u2019irushanwa, Sudani yakuyemo ubwitabire bwayo, bityo ihagarikwa mumarushanwa yose ya CECAFA mugihe kitazwi. Ariko, guhagarikwa kwakuweho igihe cyokwitabira igikombe cya CECAFA cyo mu 2002. \nAmakipe cumi n'umwe yinjiye muriri rushanwa, abiri arenga ayoyari yahatanye mu irushanwa ryabanje. Icyakora, haribihugu icumi gusa byahatanye mu gikombe cya 2001, kuko u Rwanda rwakiriye irirushanwa, rwinjiye mu Rwanda (A) na Rwanda (B). Ubwo u Rwanda rwaherukaga kwakira irirushanwa, mu 1999, nabwo bwinjiye mumakipe abiri: u Rwanda (A) rwarangije ku mwanya wagatatu, rutsinda u Burundi kumwanya wa gatatu, naho u Rwanda (B) rutsinda iri rushanwa, rutsinda Kenya 3 - 1 ku mukino wa nyuma. Hari amahirwe amwe mugikombe cya CECAFA cya 2001 ku Rwanda, ubwo amakipe yombi yatsindiraga mumatsinda yabo kumwanya wa kabiri, imiterere y'iri rushanwa bivuze ko amakipe yombi yo mu Rwanda ashobora guhangana kumukino wanyuma aramutse akomeje kugeza ubu, nk'uko amakipe yombi yomuri Uganda yabigenje mw irushanwa rya 2000. Nubwo Tanzania na Uganda zombi zatsinzwe muri kimwe cya kane cy\u2019irangiza n\u2019u Rwanda mu 2001, muri kimwe cya kabiri cy\u2019irangiza, u Rwanda rwatsinzwe na Etiyopiya, na Kenya, ikipe Rwanda (A) yari yatsinze muwi 1999 itwara igikombe. Bityo, amakipe yombi y\u2019u Rwanda yahuriye mumukino woguhatanira umwanya wa gatatu mu 2001, kandi nyuma yo kurangiza ari 1 - 1 nyuma y\u2019igihe gisanzwe, u Rwanda (A) rwatsinze 5 - 3 muri penaliti. Amakipe abiri kumukino wanyuma, Kenya na Etiyopiya, yombi yatsinze amatsinda yayo (itsinda A n\u2019itsinda C uko bikurikirana). 2001 wari umwaka mwiza kuri Etiyopiya, ntiyatsinze Kenya 2 - 1 gusa kumukino wanyuma wa CECAFA Cup, ahubwo yanatsinze ikipe yabo y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 20 yatsindiye igikombe cya FIFA cy\u2019isi cy\u2019ingimbi cyabereye muri Argentine mu 2001, iyini yonshuro ya mbere Etiyopiya yemerewe kwitabira iri rushanwa. Ubwo bageraga kumukino wa nyuma, Etiyopiya ntiyari yarigeze itsindwa umukino wanyuma wa CECAFA nyuma yogukina umukino umwe mbere y\u2019uwo mukino, ariko kugeza nan\u2019ubu Etiyopiya ntiratsindwa ubwo yageraga kumukino wanyuma, ikintu cyabaye inshuro enye. Gusenya Djibouti na Uganda 10 - 1 nibyo byatsinze byinshi mumateka y\u2019igikombe cya CECAFA. \nInyuma.\nIgikombe cya CECAFA gifatwa nk'irushanwa ryakera cyane muri Afurika ry'umupira w'amaguru, kandi rihuriwemo n'amakipe yomuri Afurika yo Hagati n'Amajyepfo. Irirushanwa ryabanje kwitwa Gossage Cup, ryahatanirwaga n'ibihugu bine bya Kenya, Uganda, Tanganyika (Tanzania y'ubu), na Zanzibar, kuva mu 1929 kugeza muwi 1965. Muwi 1967, ikigikombe cyahindutse igikombe cy'amakipe y'abakuru bo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba n'iyo Hagati, gikunze kugabanywamo igikombe cy'imikino, cyahatanirwaga imyaka itanu, kugeza muwi 1971, mbere y'uko igikombe cya CECAFA gitangira mu 1973. Ikipe yatwaye igikombe cya 2000 yari Uganda (A), muri 2001 Uganda yatsinze itsinda ryayo iriku mwanya wa gatatu arinawo wanyuma wo gushaka itike; yari inyuma y'Uburundi amanota 3 n'ikirenge cya Tanzania amanota 6, ariko nyuma yaho yakuwemo murikimwe cyakane cy'irangiza ihanganye n'u Rwanda (A). Ethiopia, ikipe yatwaye igikombe cya 2001, yakuwemo muri kimwe cyakabiri cya 2000 na Uganda (B), nubwo yatsinze u Rwanda igera kumwanya wa gatatu. \nAbitabiriye.\nAmakipe 11 yo mubihugu 9 yahatanye, amakipe ane yo mw' irushanwa rya mbere (usibye Tanganyika, yahinduye amazina ubu yitwa Tanzaniya), harimo n'ibihugu byose 8 byahatanye mugikombe cya CECAFA cyo muri 2000 hiyongereyeho Tanzaniya na Zanzibar. \nIcyiciro cy'itsinda.\nIcyiciro cy'amatsinda cyatangiye kuya 8 Ukuboza kirangira ku ya 15 Ukuboza, umukino wanyuma w'itsinda A wahuje u Rwanda (A) na Kenya, n'umukino wanyuma w'itsinda C wahuje u Rwanda (B) na Etiyopiya. Mu mpera z'icyiciro cy'amatsinda, amakipe yarangije ari kumwanya wanyuma mw' itsinda ryabo yasezerewe, hamwe n'ikipe yarangije iriku mwanya wagatatu ibona amanota menshi ugereranije n'andi makipe yabaye ayagatatu mu andi matsinda. Kubera kohari umubare udasanzwe w'amakipe, itsinda C ryari rifite ikipe imwe ibura, hamwe n'amakipe atatu, bityo gahunda ikaba yagabanutse, yakira imikino itatu gusa kumatsinda atandatu ya A na B. Iyamakipe abiri cyangwa menshi angana kumanota nyuma y\u2019uko imikino y\u2019amatsinda irangiye, ibi bikurikira birakurikizwa kugira ngohamenyekane urutonde (muburyo bwo kumanuka):\nItsinda A.\n----\u00a0\n----\u00a0\n----\u00a0\nItsinda B.\n----\u00a0\n----\u00a0\n----\u00a0\nItsinda C.\n----\u00a0\nIcyiciro cyo gukubita.\nImikino ya kimwe cya kane.\n----\u00a0\n----\u00a0\nIgice cya kabiri.\n----\u00a0\nImibare y'amakipe.\nAmakipe akurikiranwa hakurikijwe ibipimo bimwebyo kunganya nkuko bigenda mu matsinda, usibye amakipe aneya mbere. "}
{"id": "21761", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21761", "title": "2005 CECAFA Cup", "text": "Igikombe cya CECAFA cyo muri 2005 cyaricya 29 cy'irushanwa. Cyabereye mu Rwanda, kandi cyatsinzwe na Ethiopia. Imikino yakinwe hagatiya 26 Ugushyingo kugeza 10 Ukuboza. Imikino yos yakinwe muri Stade Amahoro i Kigali.\nKenya yasezerewe kuberakunanirwa kwishyura amafarangaya CECAFA.\nIcyiciro cy'itsinda.\nItsinda A.\n----\u00a0\n----\u00a0\n----\u00a0\n----\u00a0\nItsinda B.\n----\u00a0\n----\u00a0\n----\u00a0\n----\u00a0\n----\u00a0\nIcyiciro cya Knockout.\nIgice cya kabiri.\n----\u00a0\nAmareferensi.\nUbubiko bwa RSSSF"}
{"id": "21762", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21762", "title": "2009 African Youth Championship", "text": "Irushanwa ry\u2019ingimbi za Afurika ryo muri 2009 ni irushanwa ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru ry\u2019abakinnyi bari munsi y\u2019imyaka 20. Ryabereye mu Rwanda kuva kuya 18 Mutarama kugeza kuya 1 Gashyantare 2009. Ryanabaye irushanwa ry\u2019amanota yokwitabira igikombe cy\u2019isi cya FIFA cy\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 20 cyo mu 2009.\nImpamyabushobozi.\nIcyiciro cya mbere.\nUmukino wambere wakinwe kuya 18, 19 cyangwa 20 Mata 2008. Umukino wakabiri wabereye ku ya 2, 3 cyangwa 4 Gicurasi 2008. Abatsinze berekeje mucyiciro cyambere.\nKongo, Nijeriya, Zambiya, Gambia, C\u00f4te d'Ivoire, Misiri, Kameruni, Benin, Maroc, Tuniziya, Mali, Gana, Angola, Gabon, Afurika y'Epfo na Burkina Faso byose byatsindiye amahirwe yokwitabira icyiciro cyambere.\nIcyiciro cya mbere.\nImikino y'icyiciro cya mbere yabereye kumatariki ya 27, 28 na 29 Kamena 2008. Imikino yakabiri yabereye kumatariki ya 11, 12 na 13 Nyakanga 2008. Abatsinze bemerewe kujya mucyiciro cyakabiri.\nIcyiciro cya kabiri.\nImikino yambere yakinwe kw' itariki ya 26, 27 na 28 Nzeri. Imikino yakabiri yakinwe kw' itariki ya 11, 12 na 13 Ukwakira. Abatsinze bemerewe kujya mumikino yanyuma.\nAmatsinda.\nAmakipe akurikira yinjiye mw' irushanwa:\nIcyiciro cy'itsinda.\nItsinda A.\n----\u00a0\n----\u00a0\n----\u00a0\nItsinda B.\n----\u00a0\u00a0\n----\u00a0\nIcyiciro cya Knockout.\nIgice cya kabiri.\n----\u00a0\nImikino yo kwerekeza mu gikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cy'abatarengeje imyaka 20.\nAmakipe ane yitwaye neza kurusha ayandi yegukanye itike yo kwitabira igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cy'abatarengeje imyaka 20 cyo mu 2009."}
{"id": "21763", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21763", "title": "2011 African U-17 Championship", "text": "Shampiyona y'Afurika y'abatarengeje imyaka 17 yomuri 2011 yarirushanwa ry'umupira w'amaguru ryateguwe n'Ishyirahamwe ry'Umupira w'Amaguru muri Afurika (CAF). Irirushanwa ryabereye mu Rwanda. Amakipe ane yambere yabashije kwitabira Igikombe cy'Isi cya FIFA cy'Abatarengeje imyaka 17 cyo mu 2011.\nIcyiciro cy'itsinda.\nItsinda A.\n----\u00a0\n----\u00a0\nItsinda B.\n----\u00a0\n----\u00a0\n----\u00a0"}
