{"id": "21765", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21765", "title": "Rwanda women's national under-17 football team", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore y'abatarengeje imyaka 17 y'u Rwanda nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru y'urubyiruko ikorera munsi y'ubuyobozi bw'ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru mu Rwanda. Inshingano yayo y'ibanze niterambere ry'abakinnyi murwego rwo kwitegura ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore y'abakuze y'u Rwanda. "}
{"id": "21766", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21766", "title": "Rwanda women's national under-20 football team", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore y'u Rwanda y'umupira w'amaguru y'abatarengeje imyaka 20 ihagarariye u Rwanda mumarushanwa mpuzamahanga yumupira w'amaguru w'abangavu nabagore.\nIkipe yitabiriye irushanwa ry\u2019abagore ba Afurika batarengeje imyaka 20 ryomu 2022 idashoboye kwitabira igikombe cyisi cya FIFA cy\u2019abagore batarengeje imyaka 20 cyomuri 2022. "}
{"id": "21767", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21767", "title": "Rwanda women's national football team", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore y'u Rwanda ihagarariye u Rwanda mu mupira w'amaguru w'abagore kandi igenzurwa nishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru ry'u Rwanda. Kugeza ububyari biteganyijwe ko izitabira irushanwa rimwe rikomeye, irushanwa ryambere ry'abagore ryabereye i Zanzibar muKwakira 2007, ariko iryo rushanwa ryajeguhagarikwa. Amaherezo ryatangiye gukinwa na Kenya muri Gashyantare 2014. Iyikipe yitwa \"The She-Amavubi\" (mu Kinyarwanda bisobanura \"The She-Wasps\").\nKugeza ubu kuya 16 Kanama 2024, ikipey'igihugu y'abagore y'u Rwanda iriku mwanya wa 167 kw' isi n'amanota 874.81. \nAmateka.\nInyuma.\nIterambere ry'umupira w'amaguru w'abagore muri Afurika rihura n'ibibazo byinshi, birimo kubona uburezi buke, ubukene mubagore muri sosiyete murirusange, n'ubusumbane bw'ibanze burimuri iyo sosiyete butuma rimwe narimwe habaho ihohoterwa ry'uburenganzira bwamuntu kubagore. Muri icyo gihe, iyabagore bafite impano mumupira w'amaguru bavutse, benshi bahitamo kujya mumahanga kugira ngo bongere amahirwe yogukina. Kubura inkunga bibangamira iterambere ry'umupira w'amaguru w'abagore mukarere kuko inkunga nyinshi zigenerwa ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore zituruka kuri FIFA, ntabwo zituruka kw' ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru ry'igihugu. \nMu Rwanda, gahunda yambere y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru w\u2019abagore yashyizweho muri 2000. \"Kicking for Reconciliation\" yashinzwe mumpera z\u2019imyaka ya 2000, kandi yahuje abakinnyi bakiri bato barenga 100 murwego rwo \"gukiza igihugu cyabonye jenoside mbicyane kuvamu Ntambara ya Kabiri y\u2019Isi Yose\" binyuze murisiporo. Iyigahunda yari ifunguye ku Batutsi n\u2019Abahutu. Mu 2008, ibi byarimo amarushanwa y\u2019amashuri naza kaminuza. Umupira w\u2019amaguru w\u2019abagore washyigikiwe n\u2019umukozi umwe w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019igihugu ryihariye muri 2006. Siporo y\u2019abagore, harimo n\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru, ntiyatangajwe cyane mw' itangazamakuru ryo mu Rwanda. Shampiyona y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru y\u2019abagore yashinzwe mu 2008, kandi igihugu nicyo cyonyine muri aka karere gifite shampiyona ihamye, ariko kiracyafite imbogamizi zijyanye nogutera inkunga amakipe, aho inkunga nyinshi ituruka kuri FIFA. Grace Nyinawumuntu yabaye umusifuzi wa mbere w\u2019umugore ku rwego rw\u2019ikirenga mu Rwanda muri 2004, ndetse aba umugore wambere utoza ikipe y\u2019ababigize umwuga mugihugu muri 2009. Ikipe ye y\u2019abagore b\u2019abahanga yakomeje kwegukana igikombe cyashampiyona kubuyobozi bwe. Kubura amahirwe y gukina umupira w\u2019amaguru yo kurwego rwohejuru muri Uganda byatumye bamwe mu bakinnyi bava ahobajya mu Rwanda gushaka amahirwe yogukina muri shampiyona y\u2019ababigize umwuga yo muri icyo gihugu. \nAmahugurwa mpuzamahanga yerekeye abagore nimake mu Rwanda. Hagati ya 1991 na 2010, nta masomo y\u2019akarere ya FIFA FUTURO III yagenewe gutoza abagore, ntanama y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru w\u2019abagore yabereye mugihugu, kandi ntamasomo ya FIFA MA yabereye kumupira w\u2019amaguru w\u2019abagore n\u2019urubyiruko. Kurwego mpuzamahanga, mu 2007, intumwa y\u2019igihugu yitabiriye inama y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru w\u2019abagore yatewe inkunga na FIFA mu Bushinwa. Felicite Rwemarika ni umuyobozi w\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru w\u2019abagore muricyo gihugu. Ashimirwa guteza imbere siporo mugihugu ashinga Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Abagore muri Kigali mumupira w\u2019amaguru n\u2019ibindi. \nYahagaritswe kwitabira mu 2007.\nIgikombe cy\u2019irushanwa ry\u2019abagore mu nama y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru y\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba n\u2019iyo Hagati (CECAFA) cyagombaga kubera i Zanzibar mu Ukwakira 2007, igikorwa u Rwanda rwari ruteganya kohereza ikipe y\u2019igihugu kwitabira, ariko irushanwa ryarahagaritswe. Irushanwa ryagombaga guterwa inkunga n\u2019Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Umupira w\u2019Amaguru muri Afurika. Umunyamabanga w\u2019Inama y\u2019Umupira w\u2019Amaguru muri Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba niyo Hagati, Nicholas Musonye, yavuze kuriki gikorwa ati: \"CAF irashaka guteza imbere umupira w\u2019amaguru w\u2019abagore muraka karere murwego rwo kuzirikana intambwe CECAFA yagezeho mumyaka yashize. CAF irashima ibyo CECAFA yakoze nubwo ishyirahamwe ryanyuzemo mu ngorane, kuva kubibazo by\u2019amafaranga kugeza kumiterere mibi yapolitiki mubihugu bigize umuryango n\u2019imicungire mibi y\u2019amashyirahamwe. Ibihugu bigize umuryango mu karere ka CECAFA ntibyigeze bifata umupira w\u2019amaguru w\u2019abagore nk\u2019ikintu gikomeye. CAF ubu irashaka gutera inkunga gahunda y\u2019igihe kirekire yo gukurura abagore bomuri akakarere mumukino.\" \nSitade yo mu rugo.\nIkipe y'igihugu y'abagore y'u Rwanda irakinira imikino yayo yanyuma ku kibuga cy'imikino cya Nyamirambo. \nIkipe y'igihugu y'abakuru.\nNubwo ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore y'u Rwanda y'umupira w'amaguru y'abagore bari munsi y'imyaka 20 yari ihari kandi ikina imikino kugeza muri 2009 mumikino yo gushaka itike y'igikombe cy'isi cy'abagore cya FIFA U-20 mu 2010, ikipe y'igihugu y'abakuru ntabwo yitabiriye imikino yomu myaka ya 2010. Ntakipe y'abakuru yitabiriye shampiyona y'abagore ya Afurika yomu 2010 mumikino ibanza cyangwa imikino yose ya Afurika yo muri 2011. Muri Werurwe 2012, iyikipe ntiyashyizwe kurutonde rw'isi na FIFA kandi nta kipe y'igihugu y'abakuru yari ihari. Ariko, ikipe y'igihugu y'abakuru yakinnye umukino wayo wambere kumugaragaro kuya 16 Gashyantare 2014.\nShe-Amavubi yatangiye gukina kuya 16 Mutarama 2014, mucyiciro cyambere cyogushaka itike yo gukina shampiyona y'abagore ya Afurika mu 2014, bakinnye na Kenya muri Stade R\u00e9gional Nyamirambo i Kigali. Batsinze igitego 1-0 kugitego cyatsinzwe na Alice Niyoyita kumunota wa 29 mu mukino wa mbere. Mumukino wakabiri wabereye kuri sitade ya Kenyatta, Machakos, muri Kenya batsinzwe ibitego 2-1 igitego kimwe cyatsinzwe na Jeanne Nyirahatashima. U Rwanda rwinjiye mu cyiciro cya kabiri hakurikijwe itegeko ry'ibitego byo hanze nyuma yokurangiza 2-2 ku giteranyo cy'ibitego, rukina na Nijeriya. Umukino wabo wagatatu wemewe waranzweho impaka kuya 13 Gicurasi 2014 na Zambia maze urangira batsinzwe ibitego 3-0, biba ari ubwa gatatu batsinzwe. Bahanganye mumukino wakabiri wo gushaka itike yogukina shampiyona y'abagore ya Afurika mu 2014 na Nijeriya ku ya 24 Gicurasi 2014, batsindwa ibitego 4-1. Igitego cyatsinzwe na Clementine Mukamana kumunota wa 53. Mumukino wa kabiri, wongeye guhatana na Nijeriya ku ya 7 Kamena 2014, ikipe ya She-Amavubi yatsinzwe ibitego 8-0, bituma itagera mu irushanwa rya Afurika ry'abagore ryo mu 2014 kubitego 12-1.\nGloria Nibagwire abaye capitaine wambere wa She-Amavubi. \nU Rwanda rwitabiriye shampiyona ya CECAFA y'abagore ya 2016, rutsindwa imikinoyombi ku manota 3-2, rutsinzwe na Tanzania na Etiyopiya.\nIshyirahamwe ry\u2019abagore mu Rwanda ryakiriye shampiyona ya CECAFA y\u2019abagore ya 2018. Sitade y\u2019akarere ka Nyamirambo yakiriye imikino yose 10 mw' irushanwa rya round robin. U Rwanda rwatsinze Tanzania (iyabaye iyambere) 1-0 ariko rurangiza arurwa nyuma rufite amanota 4 mu mikino 4 rwakinnye. \nUmupira w'amaguru w'abagore mu Rwanda - ikipe ya 'She-Wasps' yasezereye Kenya mucyiciro cyambere cy'irushanwa rya Afurika ry'abagore (AWC) ryo muri 2014. \nIbisubizo n'imikino.\nUrutonde rw'ibyavuye mumikino mumezi 12 ashize, hamwe n'imikino yose izaza yateganijwe.\nAgahigo kuri buri muhanganye.\nImbonerahamwe ikurikira igaragaza agahigo k'u Rwanda kurwego mpuzamahanga rw'ibihe byose kuriburi mukinnyi uhanganye:\nAbakinnyi.\nAbahamagawe vuba aha.\nAbakinnyi bakurikira bahamagawe mw'ikipe y'u Rwanda mumezi 12 ashize."}
{"id": "21768", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21768", "title": "Tom Wamukota", "text": "Tom Wamukota (yavutse ku ya 28 Nzeri 1993) ni umukinnyi ukora Basketball ubikora nk'uwabigize umwuga ukomoka muri kenya ukinira ikipe ya APR BBC ikorera mu ishyirahamwe ry'umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda. akaba yarakiniye ikipe y'igihugu ya Kenya.\nkaminuza.\nWamukota yakinnye imyaka ibiri mu ikipe ya basketball y'abagabo ya Wichita sitate. Ni we mukinnyi wa mbere w'Umunyakenya wakinnye muri Suwet 16 y'irushanwa rya NCAA. \nubunyamwuga.\nMu mpeshyi ya 2018, yakiniye ikipe ya aguilas ya durango muri megizike. Mu mwaka w'imikino wa 2018-19, yakinnye n'ikipe ya mas yo muri maroke.\nMuri 2019, Wamukota yakiniye muri Tuniziya muri Monastir ya amerika ndetse na nyuma yaho akinira JS Kairouan. \nYabaye umwe mu bagize ikipe y'igihugu ya Kenya mu irushanwa rya afurike basketball ya 2021 ryabereye i Kigali mu Rwanda. "}
{"id": "21769", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21769", "title": "Carlton Bragg Jr.", "text": "Carlton Edward Bragg Jr. (yavutse ku ya 14 Ukuboza 1995) ni umukinnyi w\u2019umukino wa Basketball, ukomoka muri amerika ukina nk' uwabigize umwuga ukina muri APR shampiyona ya basketball yu Rwanda (RBL) na shampiyona nyafurika ya Basketball (BAL). Yakinnye kandi mui basketball ya kaminuza muri New Mexico Lobosi na Kansas.\nUmwuga.\nKu ya 5 Kanama 2021, Carlton Edward Bragg Jr yasinyanye amasezerano na Belediye wo muri Shampiyona ya mbere ya Basketball ya Turukiya (TBL). Ku ya 8 Ukuboza 2025, Bragg yatangajwe nk'umukinnyi mushya wa baye uwa mbere m\u2019u Rwanda, muri APR BBC muri shampiyona ya basketbal yu Rwanda (RBL) na shampiyona nya furika ya Basketball (BAL)."}
{"id": "21770", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21770", "title": "Aliou Diarra", "text": "Aliou Fadiala Diarra (yavutse ku ya 31 Ukuboza 2001) ni umukinnyi ukora umukino basketball ukomoka muri mali wa bigize umwuga, wakinaga mu ikipe ya Virtus Bologna yo mu cyiciro cya mbere cya Lega (LBA). Diarra yashyizwe mu makipe yo hanze nka Sitade mali kandi ntiyari azwi mu ma kipe ya basketball y\u2019a babigize umwuga kugeza ubwo yamenyekanye mu 2023 kubera uburyo yitwaye muri shampiyona nyafurika ya Basketball (BAL). Mu mwaka we wa mbere, yatorewe kuba umukinnyi w\u2019umwaka mu bw'ugarizi ukina muri BAL ndetse anashyirwa mu ikipe ya mbere ya bakinnyi beza ba BAL. Yatsindiye igihembo cya kabiri nka nyugariro muri BAL yo muri 2025. Ku rwego mpuzamahanga, Diarra yakinnye bwa mbere mu ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya Mali muri 2023 maze abageza ku mudari wa feza muri shampiyona ya FIBA y'afurika 2025.\nAPR (2024\u20132025).\nKu itariki ya 17 Nyakanga 2024, Diarra yasinye amasezerano y'umwaka umwe na APR BBC yatwaye igikombe m'u Rwanda muri shampiyona y'umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda (RBL). Yatwaye ibikombe bibiri bya RBL n'igikombe cy'u Rwanda mu mwaka wa mbere mu ikipe ya Lions. "}
{"id": "21771", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21771", "title": "Jackson Niyomugabo", "text": "Jackson Niyomugabo (wavutse ku ya 18 Mata 1988) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wo koga mu mikino ya Olempike w\u2019u Rwanda. Akomoka i Kibuye mu karere k\u2019uburengerazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda. Yakuriye koga mu mazi y\u2019ikiyaga cya Kivu ku mupaka uhuza u Rwanda na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Se yapfuye akiri muto, naho Jackson ahabwa imbaraga na nyina, uhinga agace gato k\u2019umuryango mu misozi iri hejuru y\u2019ikiyaga cya Kivu.\nKuba Niyomugabo yari umuntu uciye bugufi ntibyamuhaye amahirwe yo guhugurwa cyane mu mwuga. Yize koga ndetse anakunda umukino wo koga kuko yasomye igitabo yahawe n'umwarimu wo mu mashuri yisumbuye. Yubatse kwihangana no kwihangana mu koga hagati y'ibirwa byo mu misozi miremire mu kiyaga, kandi rimwe na rimwe yemererwaga koga muri hoteli y'ubukerarugendo mu murwa mukuru, Kigali.\nNiyomugabo yitabiriye irushanwa ry\u2019isi rya Aquatics ryabereye muri Ositaraliya mu 2007, nubwo atagize amahirwe yo gutsindira umudari. Yahagarariye Repubulika y\u2019u Rwanda mu koga mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi ya 2008 n\u2019imikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi ya 2012. "}
{"id": "21772", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21772", "title": "Rolly Fula Nganga", "text": "Rolly Fula Nganga (yavutse ku ya 2 Gashyantare 1993) ni umukinnyi w'abigize umwuga muri Basketball ukomoka muri Congo, w'akiniye ikipe nka APR BBC, Bangui Sporting Club n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. areshya na metero 198, akina nk'arutahizamu. \nUmwuga.\nMu Gushyingo 2022, yari ku rutonde rw'abakinnyi b'akinira ikipe ya Bangui Siporutinge mu gihe cy'urugendo rugana BAL rwo muri 2023.\nMuri Mutarama 2023, Fula Nganga yasinye amasezerano muri APR BBC ikina muri shampiyona y'umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda (RBL). Yatwaye igikombe cya shampiyona ya RBL yo muri 2023, igikombe cya mbere cua APR BBC imaze imyaka 14. "}
{"id": "21773", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21773", "title": "Dario Hunt", "text": "Dario Nathan Henry Hunt (yavutse ku ya 2 Gicurasi 1989) ni umukinnyi ukora Basketball w'abigize umwuga ukomoka muri amerika. Yakinnye imyaka ine muri kaminuza ya Nevada, yakinnye inshuro eshatu mu ikipe ya wac, ndetse anahabwa igihembo cya kabiri muri wac inshuro ya 2. \nHunt yakinnye mu Burayi, nko muri Ukerene, Otirishiya, Ubutaliyani, Ubufaransa, n\u2019Ububiligi no muri Ositaraliya.\nUbuzima bwa mbere.\nHunt ni umuhungu ukomoka kubabyeyi b'abasirikare babiri bahoze mu ngabo zirwanira mu kirere, yavukiye i Tampa, muri leta ya Folorida. Yakuriye mu Buyapani no muri Turukiya. Yize amashuri abanza atanu atandukanye n'amashuri yisumbuye abiri. \nMuri Mutarama 2024, Hunt yasinye amasezerano n'ikipe ya APR BBC yo mu Rwanda mu mwaka wa 2024 muri shampiyona ya Basketball mu Rwanda na shampiyona nyafurika ya Basketball. "}
{"id": "21774", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21774", "title": "Cedric Isom", "text": "Cedric Wesley Isom (yavutse ku ya 6 Kamena 1984) ni umukinnyi ukora umukino Basketball ukomoka muri amerika wa kiniraga ikipe ya APR muri shampiyona y\u2019igihugu ya Basketball y\u2019u Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nYavukiye i Newton muri Texasi arangiza mu ishuri rya Texasi muri 2006. Isom yakinnye muri Islande, Rwanda, Angola, Porutugali no muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Abarabu. Yatwaye igikombe cya Shampiyona ya Angola muri 2011, 2013 na 2016. \nikipe y'igihugu.\nMuri 2013, Isom yinjiye mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball y'u Rwanda kugira ngo yitegure irushanwa rya shampiyona nyafurika muri Basket muri 2013, ariko ntabwo yari mu rutonde rwa nyuma rw'abakinnyi. "}
{"id": "21775", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21775", "title": "Alphonse Munyeshyaka", "text": "Alphonse Munyeshyaka ni umukinnyi ukomoka akanakinira ikipe wo mu Rwanda wiruka intera yo hagati mu mikino Olempike. Yahagarariye igihugu cye mu kwiruka metero 1500 mu bagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi yo mu 1996. Igihe cye cyari 3:58.75. "}
{"id": "21776", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21776", "title": "2016 African Nations Championship qualification", "text": "Amarushanwa yoguhatanira itike yo kwitabira shampiyona y'ibihugu bya Afurika yo muri 2016 yari irushanwa ry'umupira w'amaguru ry'abagabo ryahisemo amakipe yitabiriye shampiyona y'ibihugu bya Afurika yo muri 2016. Abakinnyi b'ikipe y'igihugu bakinaga muri shampiyona y'igihugu cyabo nibo bonyine bemerewe kwitabira irirushanwa. \nAmakipe cumi n'atandatu yujuje ibisabwa kugira ngakine irushanwa ryanyuma, harimo n'u Rwanda rwujuje ibisabwa muburyo bwikora nk'urwakira imikino. \nAmakipe.\nAmakipe y'igihugu 42 y'abanyamuryango ba CAF yinjiye mucyiciro cyogushaka itike, agabanyijemo uturere hakurikijwe amakipe y'uturere. \nImiterere.\nMuri Zone y'Amajyaruguru, amakipe yakinnye hagati yayo kuburyo bwo gusiganwa ku maguru abiri. Amakipe yashyizwe ku rutonde hakurikijwe amanota (amanota 3 kintsinzi, inota 1 ku banganyije, amanota 0 ku itsindwa). Iyamanota angana, amanota yakoreshwaga muburyo bukurikira: \nMuyandi matsinda yose, imikino yogushaka itike yakinwe muburyo bwo kwishyura, umukino ukinwa murugo nohanze. Iyamanota yose yanganaga nyuma y'umukino wakabiri, itegeko ryo gutsinda ibitego hanze ryakurikizwaga, kandi niba bingana, gutera penaliti byakoreshwaga kugira ngo hamenyekane uwatsinze (nta mwanya w'inyongera wakinwaga). \nAmakipe abiri yambere muri Zone y'Amajyaruguru n'andi 13 yatsinze mucyiciro cyambere mutundi turere twose niyo yabashije kwitabira irushanwa ryanyuma.\nGahunda.\nTombola yabaye kuya 5 Mata 2015, saa 16h00 UTC+2, kucyicaro gikuru cya CAF i Cairo, muri Misiri. \nGahunda y'imikino yogushaka itike yari ikurikira. \nAkarere ka Ruguru.\nIcyitonderwa: Libiya yakinnye imikino yayo yanyuma muri Maroc na Tuniziya kubera impungenge z'umutekano.\n----\u00a0\n----\u00a0\u00a0\nAkarere k'Iburengerazuba bwa A.\nIcyiciro cya mbere.\n\"Mali yatsinze ibitego 4-2 kumukino rusange.\"\n\"Mauritania yatsinze ibitego 4-1 kumukino rusange.\"\n\"Guin\u00e9e yatsinze ibitego 4-2 kumubare wose.\"\n\"Senegal yatsinze ibitego 4-1 kugiteranyo cyose.\"\nIcyiciro cya mbere.\nAbatsinze bemerewe kwitabira shampiyona y'ibihugu bya Afurika ya 2016.\n\"Mali yatsinze ibitego 3-2 kumukino rusange.\"\n\"3\u20133 murirusange. Guin\u00e9e yatsinze ibitego byo hanze.\"\nAkarere k'Iburengerazuba bwa B.\nIcyiciro cya mbere.\nAbatsinze bemerewe kwitabira shampiyona y'ibihugu bya Afurika ya 2016.\n\"2\u20132 muri rusange. Ivory Coast yatsinze ibitego byohanze.\"\n\"Nijeriya yatsinze ibitego 2-0 kumukino rusange.\"\n\"Niger yatsinze ibitego 3-1 kumukino rusange.\"\nAkarere ko Hagati.\nIcyiciro cya mbere.\nAbatsinze bemerewe kwitabira shampiyona y'ibihugu bya Afurika yo muri 2016.\n\"DR Congo yatsinze ku mukino wabereye kuruhande rw'ikipe.\"\n\"Kameruni yatsinze igitego 1-0 kugiteranyo cyose.\"\n\"Gabon yatsinze ibitego 2-1 kumukino rusange.\"\nAkarere ko Hagati-Iburasirazuba.\n\"Uganda yatsinze ibitego 4-1 kumukino rusange.\"\n\"Uburundi bwatsinze ibitego 4-1 kumukino rusange.\"\n\"Ethiopia yatsinze ibitego 2-0 kumukino rusange.\"\nIcyiciro cya mbere.\nAbatsinze bemerewe kwitabira shampiyona y'ibihugu bya Afurika ya 2016.\n\"Uganda yatsinze ibitego 4-0 kumukino wose.\"\n\"Ethiopia yatsinze ibitego 3-2 kumukino rusange.\"\nAkarere k'Amajyepfo.\nIcyiciro cya mbere.\n\"Zimbabwe yatsinze ibitego 2-0 kumukino wose.\"\n\"1\u20131 ku giteranyo. Lesotho yatsinze kubitego byohanze.\"\n\"3\u20133 kugiteranyo. Zambia yatsinze kuri penaliti.\"\n\"Mozambike yatsinze ibitego 9-1 kugiteranyo cyose.\"\n\"Afurika y'Epfo yatsinze ibitego 5-0 kumukino rusange.\"\n\"Angola yatsinze ibitego 4-2 kumukino rusange.\"\nIcyiciro cya mbere.\nAbatsinze bemerewe kwitabira shampiyona y'ibihugu bya Afurika ya 2016.\n\"Zimbabwe yatsinze ibitego 4-2 kumukino rusange.\"\n\"Zambia yatsinze ibitego 4-1 kumukino rusange.\"\n\"Angola yatsinze ibitego 3-2 kumukino rusange.\"\nAmakipe yujuje ibisabwa.\nAmakipe 16 akurikira niyo yabashije kwitabira irushanwa ryanyuma. \n 1 Inyuguti ikoze mu nyuguti zitukura igaragaza umukinnyi watwaye igikombe muruwo mwaka. \"Inyuguti ikoze munyuguti zitukura\" igaragaza uwakiriye igikombe muruwo mwaka."}
{"id": "21777", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21777", "title": "Rwanda national under-20 football team", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda y'umupira w'amaguru y'abatarengeje imyaka 20 ihagarariye u Rwanda mu mupira w'amaguru kuriyi myaka kandi igenzurwa n'ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru ry'u Rwanda. Iyikipe ihatanira igikombe cya Afurika cy'abatarengeje imyaka 20, kiba buri myaka ibiri, ndetse n'igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cy'abatarengeje imyaka 20.\nIkipe iriho ubu.\nAbakinnyi bakurikira bahamagawe mumikino yo gushaka itike yo gukina igikombe cya Afurika cy'abatarengeje imyaka 20 bazakina na Sudani y'Epfo muri 2015. "}
{"id": "21778", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21778", "title": "Rwanda national under-17 football team", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda y'umupira w'amaguru y'abatarengeje imyaka 17 ihagarariye u Rwanda mu mupira w'amaguru kurwego rw'imyaka irimunsi y'imyaka 17, ikaba igenzurwa n'ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru ry'u Rwanda. Iyikipe yitabira igikombe cya Afurika cy'ibihugu by'abatarengeje imyaka 17 n'igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cy'abatarengeje imyaka 17, byombi biba burimyaka ibiri.\nURwanda rwitabiriye igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cy'abatarengeje imyaka 17 kunshuro yambere muri 2011, nyuma yoku mwanya mu gikombe cya Afurika cy'abatarengeje imyaka 17 cyabereye mu Rwanda mu 2011. Ariko, basezerewe mumatsinda nyuma yogutsindwa n'Ubwongereza na Uruguay, ndetse bakina banganyije na Kanada.\nIyi kipe ubitozwa na Richard Tardy womu Bufaransa, wahoze atoza ikipeya Aris yo mu Bugereki ya Super League ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Libani.\nAgahigo ko guhatana.\nAgahigo k'igikombe cya Afurika cy'ibihugu by'abatarengeje imyaka 17.\n1. Imikino yatombola irimo imikino yogukubitana yagenwe na penaliti.\nAbakinnyi.\nAbakinnyi bakurikira nibo batoranyijwe mw'ikipe y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 17 mu gikombe cy\u2019isi cya FIFA cyo mu 2011. Amakipe niyo yatoranyijwe kuya 18 Kamena 2011.\nInyandiko y'abantu bose.\nImbonerahamwe ikurikira igaragaza agahigo k'u Rwanda mumikino y'igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA ku batarengeje imyaka 17."}
{"id": "21779", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21779", "title": "Oliver Mbekaka", "text": "Oliver Amani Mbekeka (wavutse kuya 22 Kanama 1979) ni umutoza w'umupira w'amaguru akaba n'umukinnyi wahoze akina imbere. Yahoze arumukinnyi w'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda na DR Congo, akaba n'umugore wambere wayoboye ikipe y'abagabo nk'umutoza mukuru muri Uganda. \nUmwuga w'ikipe.\nMbekaka yakiniye Kampala Women, City Stars naShe Corporate muri Uganda, Source de Kivu na OCL City muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo ndetse na APR FC yomu Rwanda. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMbekaka yakiniye Uganda kurwego rwo hejuru mugihe cy'irushanwa rya Afurika ry'abagore ryo mu 2000 ndetse nomu ijonjora rya Afurika ry'abagore ryo mu 2002. Yakinnye imikino mpuzamahanga 12. \nIntego mpuzamahanga.\n\"Amanota n'ibisubizo bya Uganda nibyo byambere mugutsinda ibitego\"\nImpaka.\nNyuma y'uko Uganda ivuye mu marushanwa yo guhatanira itike yo kujya mu gikombe cy'Afurika cy'abagore mu 2004 mbere y'imikino y'ibanze yakinnye na Malawi, Mbekeka namugenzi we w'umupira w'amaguru w'Umugande Annet Nakimbugwe bimukiye mumahanga. Kubera kobari muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi yaKongo, bagizwe abakinnyi nka Oliva Amani na Annette Nshimire, kandi bahagarariye igihugu mu irushanwa ry'isi rya FIFA ry'abagore batarengeje imyaka 20 ryo mu 2006. Yaje gukinira Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi yaKongo kurwego rwo hejuru mu irushanwa rya Afurika ry'abagore ryo mu 2006. \nUmwuga w'ubuyobozi.\nMbekaka yatoje Lady Doves Masindi muriUganda ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore y'abatarengeje imyaka 20 ya Uganda. \nOliver Mbekaka niUmutoza Mukuru akaba n'Umuyobozi w'agateganyo wa Lugazi FC. "}
{"id": "21780", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21780", "title": "Annet Nakimbugwe", "text": "Annet Nakimbugwe n' umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru ukina hagati. Yabaye umwemu bakinnyi b'ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore ya Uganda ndetse nikipe ya DR Congo y'abatarengeje imyaka 20. \nUmwuga w'ikipe.\nNakimbugwe yakiniye Source de Kivu muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi yaKongo, muri APR FC mu Rwanda nomuri Buikwe SheRed Stars muri Uganda. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nNakimbugwe yakiniye Uganda kurwego rwo hejuru mw' irushanwa rya Afurika ry'abagore ryo mu 2000 ndetse nomu irushanwa rya Afurika ry'abagore ryo muri 2002. \nIntego mpuzamahanga.\n\"Amanota n'ibisubizo bya Uganda nibyo bya mbere mugutsinda ibitego\"\nImpaka.\nNyuma y'uko Uganda ivuye mu marushanwa yo gushaka itike yo kujya mu gikombe cy'Afurika cy'abagore muri 2004 mbere y'imikino y'ibanze yakinnye na Malawi, Nakimbugwe namugenzi we w'umupira w'amaguru w'Umugande Oliver Mbeka bagiye mumahanga. Kubera kobari muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, bagizwe abakinnyi basanzwe nka Annette Nshimire na Oliva Amani, ndetse bahagararira igihugu mw' irushanwa ry'isi rya FIFA ry'abagore batarengeje imyaka 20 ryo mu 2006. Yanakinnye icyiciro cyakurikiyeho muri 2008.\nUbuzima bwite.\nUmukobwa wa Nakimbugwe, Hasifah Nassuna, nawe ni umupira w'amaguru kandi bombibahuye mumikino ya shampiyona y'abagore ya Uganda. "}
{"id": "21781", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21781", "title": "Danielita Favour Nambatya", "text": "Danielita Favour Nambatya (wavutse kuya 14 Ugushyingo 2000) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'abagore womuri Uganda, akabakina nk'umukinnyi wa mbere mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru y'abagore yomu Rwanda yitwa Apaer Women's Football Club ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore yo muri Uganda. \nUbuzima bwa mbere.\nYavukiye mu bitaro bya Mulago, Kampala, avukana na Peruth Onuonga, akaba n'umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru wahoze arimu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru Mathias Ssonko. Mushiki we Precious Najjemba nawe yigeze kuba umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru muri Kaminuza ya Mutesa I Royal mumuryango w'abantu 6. \nNambatya yatangiye gukina umupira w'amaguru afite imyaka irindwi ubwo yigaga mumwaka wa gatatu w'amashuri abanza muri By Pass Standard Academy i Kyebando, nyuma ajya mw' ishuri ribanza rya Old Mulago. Muminsi ya mbere yatojwe muri All Stars Sports Academy iyobowe n'umutoza Muyitale, maze agaragara mw' ishuri ribanza rya Old Mulago kurwego rw'amashuri abanza. Nambatya yahoze ari umukinnyi mu ishuri rikuru rya Masaka ryahoze ari Agha Khan, aho yize kugeza mumwaka wa gatatu w'amashuri abanza hamwe n'umutoza Jimmy Kisekka, nyuma yinjiye muri ST Mary's Kitende mumwaka wa kane w'amashuri abanza na Kawempe Muslim SS mu cyiciro cya mbere hamwe n'umutoza Moses Nkata na Ayub Khalifa, Ishuri ry'Ubucuruzi rya Kaminuza ya Makerere na Kaminuza ya Royal ya Muteesa I. \nUmwuga w'ikipe.\nKawempe Muslim WFC.\nNambatya yinjiye muri Kawempe Muslim LFC avuye muri Kawempe Muslim SS ubwo yazamurwaga muntera akina muri FUFA Women Elite League, shampiyona y\u2019abagore ya Uganda yari shampiyona ikomeye y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru w\u2019abagore icyarimwe. Nambatya yakinnye muri Kawempe mugihe cy\u2019imyaka itatu kuva muri 2015 kugeza mumpera za 2018, atsinda ibitego 27 bya shampiyona muricyo gihe. Mu mwaka wa mbere w\u2019imikino wa 2015 yatsinze ibitego 6 bya shampiyona, 8 muri 2015/16 na 13 muri 2016/17. \nMuteesa I Royal University WFC..\nAvuye i Kawempe, Nambatya yinjiye muri Kaminuza ya Muteesa I Royal mucyiciro cyakabiri cya kaminuza mubukerarugendo nogucunga amahoteli, maze arangiza akinirayo umwaka n'igice akina muri FUFA Women Elite League kugeza mumwaka w'imikino wa 2018-2019. \nIshuri ry'Ubucuruzi rya Kaminuza ya Makerere (MUBS).\nNambatya yavuye i Muteesa muri 2019 ajya muri MUBS mw' isomo rya siyansi mu bijyanye no kwamamaza. \nShe Corporate FC.\nNambatya yinjiye muri She Corporate mu 2020 kandi yari mw' ikipe yegukanye igikombe cya FUFA Women Super League mumwaka wa 2021-22. Favour yari uwa kabiri mubatsinze ibitego muri shampiyona n'ibitego 10 ubwo Fazila Ikwaput na Hasifah Nassuuna basangiraga inkweto. Mumwaka wa 2022/23 arikumwe na She Corporate, Nambatya yatsinze ibitego bitandatu muri CAF Women Champions League (CECAFA Zone Qualifiers). \nApear Women FC.\nKu itariki ya 25 Mutarama 2023, Nambatya yasinye amasezerano y'igihe gito na Apear Women Fc yomu Rwanda ikina muri shampiyona y'abagore mu \nUburyo bwo gukina.\nNambatya afite umugisha wogukora kumupira ku nshuro yambere, kandi nimukinnyi w'ikipe kandi agatera imipira mu byiciro byose. Mugihe cy'umukino, Nambatya kandi akomeza kugira ishusho nk'iy'umukinnyi uhiga igitego kugira ngo arangize hafi y'aho atera imipira akoresheje imbaraga nyinshi n'imitwe ikomeye. Nubwo yari umuhanga mukugenzura imipira hafi, gutera umutwe, gutera imipira, gutera imipira nokuyitera neza. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMu 2012, yahamagawe bwambere n'ikipe ye kugira ngahagararire ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore ya Uganda. Kandi yahamagawe n'amakipe y'igihugu arenga atanu. Nambatya yari mubakinnyi ba CAF U-20 mubagore bahamagawe na Uganda muri 2017, batsinze Sudani y'Epfo ibitego 22-0 nubwo yatakaje icyiciro gikurikiraho kubera amafaranga. \nIbyubahiro.\nInkomoko: "}
{"id": "21782", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21782", "title": "Grace Nyinawumuntu", "text": "Marie Grace Nyinawumuntu (wavutse kuya 16 Ukuboza 1982) numuyobozi w\u2019umupira wamaguru mu Rwanda akaba yarahoze arumupira wamaguru. \nUbuzima bwa mbere.\nNyinawumuntu yakuriye mumikino ya siporo hamwe na babyara be b'abahungu. \nUburezi.\nNyinawumuntu yitabiriye Lyc\u00e9e de Kigali mu Rwanda. Yabonye impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu myigire y\u2019umubiri na siporo ndetse n\u2019icyiciro cya kaminuza mubucuruzi bw\u2019ubucuruzi. \nUmwuga wo gukina.\nNyinawumuntu yakiniye umujyi wa Kigali, aho yasobanuwe ko \"imikinire yitangaje yamuhesheje umwanya mw' ikipe y'igihugu\". \nUburyo bwo gukina.\nNyinawumuntu yakoraga cyane nkamyugariro wo hagati. \nUmwuga w'ubuyobozi.\nNyinawumuntu numusifuzi wambere wumugore wu Rwanda numutoza wambere wumupira wamaguru wumugore wu Rwanda. Nyinawumuntu yitabiriye amahugurwa yabatoza muBudage muri 2008. Yayoboye ikipe yu Rwanda AS Kigali, afasha iyikipe gutwara shampiyona. \nUbuzima bwite.\nSe wa Nyinawumuntu yapfuye muri jenoside yo mu Rwanda. Yashakanye n'umunyamategeko. "}
{"id": "21783", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21783", "title": "AS Kigali Women F.C.AS Kigali Women F.C.AS Kigali Women F.C.", "text": "AS Kigali Women's Football Club nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru y'abagore yomu Rwanda yitabira shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru y'abagore yo mu Rwanda. Iyikipe ifite icyicaro mumujyi wa Kigali kandi ikinira imikino yayo yanyuma kuri sitade ya Kigali iherereye i Nyamirambo. \nAmateka.\nAS Kigali, ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru yashinzwe muri 2008, iterwa inkunga n'Umujyi wa Kigali. Ifite intsinzi nyinshi z'igikombe kuva muri 2009 kugeza 2018.\nMumwaka w'imikino wa 2017-2018, intsinzi ikomeye yatsinzwe na Scandinavia WFC 1-0 kumukino wanyuma yatumye AS Kigali yegukana igikombe cyacumi yikurikiranya. Ariko, umwaka wakurikiyeho wabayemo ibintu bitunguranye ubwo Kigali yananirwaga gutwara igikombe, bikaba ari ibihe by'amateka mumateka y'iyi kipe. \nMuri shampiyona ya 2021-2022, AS Kigali yagaragaje imbaraga zayo ubwo yatsindaga imikino 15. Nubwo yatsinzwe kumunsi wa nyuma washampiyona, ikipe yabashije kwegukana ikindi gikombe cyashampiyona. Ibibyatumye ihabwa icyubahiro cyoguhagararira u Rwanda muri CAF Women's Champions League ya 2022. Ariko, urugendo rwabo rwarangiye muri 1/2 cy'irangiza mu mikino ya CECAFA y'abagore ya CAF, batsindwa na Simba Queens. Nubwo bimeze bityo, Kigali yakomeje gutsinda ubwo yatsindaga mugikombe cy'amahoro, itsinda Kamonyi FC intsinzi ikomeye ku bitego 4-0.\nMuri 2023, AS Kigali yahuye n'ibibazo bikomeye by'amafaranga, bituma badashobora guhaza ibyifuzo by'abakinnyi babo kumushahara. Umuterankunga w'iyi kipe yagize uruhare mukubakiza ibibazo by'ubukungu. Ubu bufasha bwabaye ingenzi cyane ubwo AS Kigali yegukanaga igikombe cya 12 cya shampiyona y'u Rwanda, bigaragaza imbaraga n'ubwitange bwabo muruyu mukino. "}
{"id": "21784", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21784", "title": "Samuel Gueulette", "text": "Samuel L\u00e9opold Marie Gueulette (wavutse kuya 19 Gicurasi muri 2000) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'u Rwanda wabigize umwuga ukina hagati mw' ikipe ya La Louvi\u00e8re yo mu Bubiligi ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda.\nUmwuga w'ubunyamwuga.\nGueulette yatangiye umwuga wewo mucyiciro cya kabiri mw' ikipe ya Tubize yomu Bubiligi, mbere yo kwerekeza muri Roeselare kuya 27 Nyakanga 2020. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nGueulette yavukiye mu Rwanda kuri se w'Umubiligi akaba nanyina w'Umunyarwanda, yimukiye mu Bubiligi akiri muto. Yahagarariye ikipe y'Urwanda y'abatarengeje imyaka 20 mumikino ibiri yo guhatanira itike yo gukina Igikombe cya Afurika cy'Abatarengeje imyaka 20 cya 2019 muri 2018. Yanahamagawe mu ikipe y'Urwanda y'abatarengeje imyaka 23 mumukino wo guhatanira itike yo gukina Igikombe cya Afurika cy'Abatarengeje imyaka 23 cya 2019 muri 2018. Yabanje mu ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda mumukino wagicuti batsinze Repubulika ya Centre Africa ibitego 2-0 kuya 3 Kamena 2021. "}
{"id": "21785", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21785", "title": "Patrick Sibomana", "text": "Patrick Sibomana (wavutse kuya 15 Ukwakira 1996) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'u Rwanda wabigize umwuga ukina hagati mw' ikipe ya Al-Wahda Tripoli. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo bigaragaza amanota y'u Rwanda ku isonga.\" "}
{"id": "21786", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21786", "title": "Israel Otobo", "text": "Israel Oyoro Otobo (yavutse ku ya 31 Gicurasi 2004) ni umukinnyi ukina Basketball w'abigize umwuga ukomoka muri Nijeriya ubu akinira ikipe ya City Oil. Akinira mu kibuga hagati, anakinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Nijeriya kuva muri 2023.\nUmwuga.\nMu Gushyingo 2024, yinjiye mu ikipe ya APR BBC avuye mu ikipr yo muri Uganda. "}
{"id": "21787", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21787", "title": "Eloi Maniraguha", "text": "Eloi Maniraguha (yavutse kuya 1 Mutarama 1995), mberewitwaga Eloi Imaniraguha, numukinnyi wokoga mumikino Olempike w\u2019u Rwanda. Yahagarariye igihugucye nka Eloi Imaniraguha mumikino Olempike y\u2019impeshyi ya 2016 mwirushanwa ry\u2019abagabo ryo kwiruka metero 50 ahoyari kumwanya wa 68 akoresheje amasegonda 26.43. Ntiyageze mu irushanwa rya 1/2. Yanitabiriye kandi nka Eloi Maniraguha mumikino Olempike y\u2019impeshyi ya 2020 mwirushanwa ry\u2019abagabo ryo kwiruka metero 50 nomumikino ya Commonwealth ya 2022 mumikino y\u2019abagabo yokwiruka metero 50 n\u2019iy\u2019abagabo yo kwiruka metero 100. "}
{"id": "21788", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21788", "title": "Jean-Claude Gasigwa", "text": "Jean-Claude Gasigwa (8 Nyakanga 1983 \u2013 8 Mutarama 2015) yarumukinnyi wa tennis w\u2019umwuga w\u2019Umunyarwanda. Yarumwe mubagize ikipe ya Rwanda Davis Cup mberey\u2019uko apfa mu 2015. Yatwaye Kenya Open mu 2008, Tanzania Open mu 2011 na Uganda Open mu 2009, 2012 na 2013. \nUrupfu.\nGasigwa yaguye mukantu mazapfa ubwo yarimu myitozo muri Cercle Sportif de Kigali. Yari afite imyaka 31."}
{"id": "21789", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21789", "title": "Joseph Biziyaremye", "text": "Joseph Biziyaremye (wavutse 1 Mutarama 1988) numunyarwanda wahozatwara amagare. "}
{"id": "21790", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21790", "title": "Seraphin Mugabo", "text": "Seraphin Mugabo (wavutse kuya 8 Gashyantare 1968) numukinnyi w\u2019Umunyarwanda wiruka interandende. Yitabiriye isiganwa rya metero 5000 mu bagabo mumikino Olempike yomu mpeshyi yomu 1992. "}
{"id": "21791", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21791", "title": "Samuel Mugisha", "text": "Samuel Mugisha (wavutse kuya 5 Ukuboza 1997) numunyarwanda ukina kwigare, ubakaba atwarikipe ya UCI Continental ProTouch. Yatsindiye Tour of Rwanda mu 2018. \nMuri Nzeri 2022, Mugisha yagiye muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika mwirushanwa rya Maryland Cycling Classic rya 2022. Ariko, nyumayo kugera kukibuga cy'indege ntiyageze kuri hoteli kandi nyuma y'umunsi umwe ntabwo yari muntangiriro z'isiganwa, nyumikipeye yatangaje koyaburiwe irengero. Amashusho ya kamera yavuye kukibuga cy'indege yerekanaga Mugisha anyura mu igenzura rya pasiporo yinjira mumodoka arikumwe n'abantu babiri \"yarazineza\". \n Igeragezwa rya 8, Shampiyona y'igihugu y'abana bato mu muhanda\n Iya mbere Urutonde rw'imisozi, Urugendo rw'u Rwanda\n Igeragezwa rya 3 ry'ikipe, shampiyona y'imihanda ya Afurika\n Iya mbere Urugendo rusange rw'u Rwanda\n Iya mbere Icyiciro cy'abakinnyi bakiri bato\n Icyiciro cya 1 cya 2\n Irushanwa rya 1st Espoir ryo mu cyiciro cya 3\n Iya mbere Gutondekanya imisozi, Giro della Valle d'Aosta\n Shampiyona y'igihugu y'umuhanda\n Igeragezwa rya gatatu\n Isiganwa rya 4 ry'umuhanda\n Irushanwa rya 6 rusange rya Grand Prix Chantal Biya\n Iya mbere Ishyirwa mu byiciro ry'imisozi\n Igeragezwa rya kabiri, Shampiyona y'igihugu y'imihanda"}
{"id": "21792", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21792", "title": "Ildephonse Sehirwa", "text": "Ildephonse Sehirwa numukinnyi w'Umunyarwanda wiruka interandende. Yitabiriye marato y'abagabo mumikino Olempike yomumpeshyi yomu 1992. "}
{"id": "21793", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21793", "title": "Leonce Sekama", "text": "Leonce Sekama (wavutse kuya 17 Ugushyingo 1980) ni umunyarwanda wahoze ari umunyeshuri wo koga, akaba yari umuhanga mumikino yokwiruka muburyo bwa freestyle. Sekama yujuje ibisabwa mu mikino yo kwiruka mu buryo bwa freestyle ya metero 50 mu bagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi yabereye i Athens mu 2004, ahabwa umwanya wa Universality na FINA mu gihe cyo kwinjira ari 30.57. Yahanganye n'abandi bakinnyi barindwi bo koga mu cyiciro cya kabiri, barimo Malique Williams w'imyaka 15 womur'Antigua na Barbuda. Yavuguruye umupira w'amasegonda 30 maze atsinda amanota 28.99 mubuzimabwebwose, bituma abona umwanya wa kane arusha Anderson Bonabart wo muri Micronesia watsinze amasegonda 2.24. Sekama yananiwe kugera murikimwe cya kabiri cy'irushanwa, kuko yaje kumwanya wa mirongo irindwi n'umunani muri rusange mu boga 86 mu mikino ibanza. "}
{"id": "21794", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21794", "title": "Robert Thomson (umupira w'amaguru)", "text": "Robert Thomson (wavutse kuya 28 Mutarama 1982) numukinnyi wa Basketball w\u2019Umunyarwanda ufitinkomoko mur'Amerika ubukinira ikipe ya CS Gaz Metan Media\u015f yo muri Romanian Basketball League. Ni umwe mu bagize ikipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019abagabo ya Basketball y\u2019Urwanda.\nThomson yavukiye muri Pennsylvania, arangiza amashuriye mwishuri ryisumbuye rya Saucon Valley i Hellertown, muri Pennsylvania. Yakinnye umukino wa basketball muri kaminuza ya Fairfield. \nThomson yimukiye mu Rwanda mu 2006 nyuma yokurangiza i Fairfield nogukina imyaka ibiri ya Basketball y'umwuga muri Hongiriya no mu Butaliyani. Nyuma Thomson yabonye pasiporo y'u Rwanda kandi yarumwe mubagize ikipe y'u Rwanda yaje kumwanya wa cyenda muri Shampiyona ya Afurika ya FIBA yo mu 2009 ndetse no mu 2007 yegukanye igikombe cya mbere cya Afurika mu mateka y'u Rwanda. Thomson yayoboye abakinnyi bose mugusiganwa kumaguru n'iminota kuri burimukino mwirushanwa rya 2009. "}
{"id": "21795", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21795", "title": "Fred Yannick Uwase", "text": "Fred Yannick Uwase (wavutse kuya 16 Gicurasi 1994 i Paris) numukinnyi wa Judo w\u2019Umunyarwanda. Yitabiriyirushanwa ry\u2019abagabo ripima ibiro 73 mumikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi ya 2012, maze asezererwa na Bruno Mendonca mucyiciro cya kabiri. "}
{"id": "21796", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21796", "title": "2024 Rwanda Challenger \u2013 Doubles", "text": "Iriryari irushanwa ryambere. \nMax Houkes na Cl\u00e9ment Tabur begukanye igikombe nyumayogutsinda Pruchya Isaro na Christopher Rungkat 6\u20133, 7\u20136 (7\u20134) kumukino wanyuma."}
{"id": "21797", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21797", "title": "2024 Rwanda Challenger II \u2013 Doubles", "text": "Max Houkes na Cl\u00e9ment Tabur nibobatwaye igikombe arikobahisemo kutarwanira igikombe cyabo.\nThomas Fancutt na Hunter Reese begukanye igikombe nyumayogutsinda SD Prajwal Dev na David Pichler kumukino wanyuma kumanota 6-1, 7-5."}
{"id": "21798", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21798", "title": "Esp\u00e9rance FC (Rwanda)", "text": "Esp\u00e9rance Football Club niikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ifiticyicaro i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Ubu irushanwa muri shampiyona y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru mu Rwanda, kandikinira imikino yayoyanyuma kuri Stade Mumena. [\"Icyitonderwa kirakenewe\"]"}
{"id": "21799", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21799", "title": "Espoir FC (Rwanda)", "text": "Espoir Football Club nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ikorera i Rusizi, mu Rwanda. Iyikipe ubiri mu irushanwa rya Azam Rwanda Premier League, kandikina imikino yayo yanyuma kuri sitade ya Rusizi."}
{"id": "21800", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21800", "title": "Ikipe ya Etincelles FC", "text": "Etincelles Football Club nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ifiticyicaro i Gisenyi mu Rwanda. Ubu irakina muri shampiyona y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru y'u Rwanda kandi ikinimikino yayo yaberaga murugo kuri sitade y'umuganda ifitubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 5,000. \n 1988 "}
{"id": "21801", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21801", "title": "Gicumbi FC", "text": "Gicumbi Football Club ni club yumupira wamaguru i Byumba, mu Rwanda. Kugezubu barushanwe mucyiciro cyakabiri cy'u Rwanda, bakinimikino yabomurugo kuri Stade Gicumbi.\nNyuma yokurangiza kumwanya wanyuma nokumanuka mucyiciro cyambere mu 2022, Gicumbi yabuze amahirwe yo kuzamuka muri shampiyona y'u Rwanda ya 2023/24. "}
{"id": "21802", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21802", "title": "Igikombe cy'Intwari (Rwanda)", "text": "Igikombe cy'Intwari, kizwi kandinka Irushanwa ry'Umunsi w'Intwari, nirushanwa ngarukamwaka ry'igikombe cya basketball kumakipe akomeye mu Rwanda. Amarushanwa y'Igikombe cy'Intwari ategurwa n'amashyirahamwe yabo kubufatanye n'Ishami rishinzwe Intwari, Imidari y'Igihugu n'Imidari y'Icyubahiro (CHENO). Umukino wanyuma w'igikombe ukinwa buri mwaka ku Munsi w'Intwari z'Igihugu kuya 1 Gashyantare.\nKuva mu 2024, amakipe y'abagabo yomu Rwanda afitirindi rushanwa ryateguwe na FERWABA mugikombe cya Basketball cy'u Rwanda."}
{"id": "21803", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21803", "title": "Simba FC (Rwanda)", "text": "Simba FC nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ikomoka mu Rwanda.\nIyi kipubu ikinamu cyiciro cya kabiri cy'u Rwanda."}
{"id": "21804", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21804", "title": "Junior Ndagano", "text": "Ndagano Junior (wavutse kuya 25 Ukwakira 1985) numukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'Umubiligi wavukiye mu Rwanda, ubakaba arangije amasezerano ye.\nNdagano numukinnyi ukina imbere cyangwa myugariro ukoresha uruhande rw'ibumoso. Yatangiye umwuga we mw' ikipe y'ingimbi ya KV Turnhout mbere yuko asinyishwa na KRC Genk afite imyaka 16. Nyuma y'imyaka ibirimuri Genk yerekeje muri KV Mechelen ariko ntiyashoboye kwinjira mw' ikipe yambere. Kuva icyo gihe yakiniye amakipe atandukanye yoku mugabane w'i Burayi, harimo n'igihe yamaze muri Paris FC, igihe cyegihoraho cyane arimuri Dessel Sport mu cyiciro cyakabiri.\nMuri 2011 Ndagano Junior yatoranyijwe mw' itsinda ry'abakinnyi b'i Burayi bafite inkomoko mu Rwanda kugira ngobaze mu Rwanda muburyo bwa gicuti. Ibibyatumye ahamagarwa mu ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda. "}
{"id": "21805", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21805", "title": "Nyanza FC", "text": "Ikipeya Nyanza Football Club yarishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru rifiticyicaro i Nyanza mu Rwanda. Iyikipe yakiniraga imikino yayo yanyuma kuri sitade ya Nyanza.\nMu 2012, iyikipe yaguzwe na Rayon Sports, nayikorera mumujyi wa Nyanza. "}
{"id": "21806", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21806", "title": "Michel Ndahinduka", "text": "Michel Ndahinduka (wavutse kuya 3 Werurwe 1990) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'u Rwanda ukina imbere. Yanabaye umukinnyi usanzwe mw' ikipe y'igihugu kuva muri 2013. Ndahinduka w'imyaka 24 afite agahigo kokuba umukinnyi wambere watoranyijwe mu ikipe y'igihugu nkuru (Amavubi stars) avuye mw' ikipe yomu cyiciro cyakabiri.\n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo bigaragaza amanota y'u Rwanda kw' isonga.\" "}
{"id": "21807", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21807", "title": "Jean-Luc Ndayishimiye", "text": "Jean-Luc Eric Bakame Ndayishimiye (wavutse kuya 25 Gicurasi 1991) numukinnyi mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru w'u Rwanda ukina nk'umunyezamu. Kuva muri Gashyantare 2010, akinira APR FC kandi amaze gukinira ikipeye inshuro esheshatu. Jean Luc yasinye amasezerano na Rayons Sport kuva muri 2013 kandi aherutse gusinya amasezerano azatuma akomeza gukina Rayon indi myaka 2."}
{"id": "21808", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21808", "title": "Jean-Claude Ndoli", "text": "Jean Claude Ndoli (wavutse kuya 7 Nzeri 1986 i Kibungo) numukinnyi w\u2019umupira wamaguru wavukiye mu Rwanda, kurubu ukinira Musanze Butare muri Shampiyona y\u2019u Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nYasinye amasezerano muri APR FC muri 2006, avuye muri Polisi ya Rwanda. Yakinnye umukino wewa mbere muri APR FC mumukino wambere w'umwaka wa shampiyona y'u Rwanda ya 2006 ubwo bakinaga na SC Kiyovu Sport. \nYakinnye na APR FC kuva muri 2005 kugeza 2016, Ndoli yatwaye ibikombe 10 bya Shampiyona y'Urwanda n'ibikombe 7 by'Urwanda. Yagabanyije imirimo ye, anatoza abazamu mugihe yamaze muri APR FC. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nNdoli numukinnyi usanzwe ukina mw' izamu nk'umunyezamu wambere mu ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru y'u Rwanda, akaba yarakinnye inshuro 16 mw' ikipe ya \"Wasps\". Yatangiriye mu izamu ubwo u Rwanda rwatsindwaga umukino wanyuma wa CECAFA Cup mu 2009 na Uganda ibitego 2-0. Ndoli yaherukaga guhamagarwa muri 2016. "}
{"id": "21809", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21809", "title": "U Rwanda mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi ya 2004", "text": "U Rwanda rwitabiriyimikino Olempike yomumpeshyi ya 2004 yabereye i Atene mu Bugereki, kuva kuya 13 kugeza kuya 29 Kanama 2004.\nSiporo.\nAbakinnyi b'u Rwanda kugeza ububageze kubipimo by'ibizamini mumarushanwa akurikira ya siporo (hafabakinnyi 3 muriburi rushanwa kuri 'A' Standard, na 1 kuri 'B' Standard). "}
{"id": "21810", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21810", "title": "Hegman Ngomirakiza", "text": "Hegman Ngomirakiza (wavutse kuya 25 Werurwe 1992) numupira wamaguru mpuzamahanga wu Rwanda ukinira APR.\n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo bigaragaza amanota y'u Rwanda ku isonga.\" \nIbyubahiro.\nUwatsinze"}
{"id": "21811", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21811", "title": "U Rwanda mu irushanwa ry'isi rya 2017 mu mikino ngororamubiri", "text": "U Rwanda rwitabiriye amarushanwa y\u2019isi mu mikino ngororamubiri yabereye i Londres mu Bwongereza kuva kuya 4 kugeza kuya 13 Kanama 2017. "}
{"id": "21812", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21812", "title": "Salomon Nirisarike", "text": "Salomon Nirisarike (wavutse kuya 23 Werurwe 1993) numukinnyi mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru w'umunyarwanda ukina nk'umukinnyi w'inyuma.\nUmwuga w'ikipe.\nNirisarike wavukiye i Gisenyi, ubuzima bwebwa mbere yakoranye na Isonga, Royal Antwerp, Sint-Truidense na Tubize. Kuya 1 Nzeri 2019, Nirisarike yasinyiye FC Pyunik, yongerera amasezerano na Pyunik kuya 2 Ukuboza 2019. \nKuya 19 Gashyantare 2021, Nirisarike yinjiye muri FC Urartu. Kuya 2 Kamena 2022 Nirisarike yavuye muri Urartu amasezerano yarangiye. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nNirisarike yakinnye umukino wewa mbere mpuzamahanga mu Rwanda muri 2012, kandi yakinnye imikino yo ushaka itike y gukina igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA. "}
{"id": "21813", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21813", "title": "Olivier Niyonzima", "text": "Olivier Niyonzima (wavutse kuya 1 Mutarama 1993) ni umukinnyi wo hagati mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru y'u Rwanda ubu ukinira ikipe ya AS Kigali. Yari mw' ikipe yatwaye igikombe cya CECAFA cya 2017 n'igikombe cya Afurika cy'ibihugu cya 2020. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo bigaragaza amanota y'u Rwanda kw' isonga.\" "}
{"id": "21814", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21814", "title": "Ramadhani Nkunzingoma", "text": "Ramadhani Nkunzingoma (wavutse kuya 2 Nzeri 1977) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'Umunyarwanda. Yakinnye imikino 22 mw' ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru y'Urwanda kuva muri 2002 kugeza muri 2007. Yanatoranyijwe mw' ikipe y'u Rwanda yitabiriye irushanwa rya Afurika ryo mu 2004. "}
{"id": "21815", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21815", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagabo y'abatarengeje imyaka 18 ya Basketball y'u Rwanda", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagabo y'u Rwanda ya Basketball y'abatarengeje imyaka 18 ni ikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball y'u Rwanda, iyoborwa na \"F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Rwandaise de Basketball Amateur\". Ihagarariyigihugu mumarushanwampuzamahanga y'abagabo ya Basketball y'abatarengeje imyaka 18."}
{"id": "21816", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21816", "title": "Imran Nshimiyimana", "text": "Imran Nshimiyimana (wavutse 18 Kanama muwi 1994) numupira wamaguru wumupira wamaguruwu Rwanda ukinira AS Kigali, nkumukinnyi wo hagati.\nUmwuga.\nNshimiyimana wavukiye i Kigali, yakiniye AS Kigali na Polisi. \nYakinnye umukino wewa mbere mpuzamahanga mw' ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda muri 2012, kandi yanakinnye mumikino yo gushaka itike yogukina igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA. "}
{"id": "21817", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21817", "title": "Dominique Savio Nshuti", "text": "Dominique Savio Nshuti (yavutse 1 Mutarama mwi 1997) numupira wamaguru wu Rwanda.\n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo bigaragaza amanota y'u Rwanda ku isonga.\" "}
{"id": "21818", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21818", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore y'umukino wa Basketball y'u Rwanda y'abagore bari munsi y'imyaka 18", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore y'u Rwanda ya Basketball y'abatarengeje imyaka 18 nikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball y'u Rwanda, iyoborwa na F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Rwandaise de Basketball Amateur. Ihagarariye igihugumumarushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Basketball y'abagore batarengeje imyaka 18."}
{"id": "21819", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21819", "title": "Ishyirahamwe ry'umukino wa Rugby mu Rwanda", "text": "Ihuriro ry\u2019u Rwanda (French) nurwego ruyobora ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru mu Rwanda. Numunyamuryango w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru mur'Afurika (CAR), uburizwi nka Rugby Africa kandi rikaba rimaze kubumunyamuryango wuzuye wa Rugby ku Isi kuva mu Ukuboza 2015. [\"Icyitonderwa kirakenewe\"]"}
{"id": "21820", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21820", "title": "Innocent Nshuti", "text": "Innocent Nshuti (wavutse kuwa 31 Mutarama mu 1998).numupira wamaguru wumupira wamaguru wu Rwanda ukina nkumukinnyi ukinira ikipe ya ES Zarzis yomuri Tuniziya.\nNyuma yogufasha APR gutwara ibikombe bine bya Shampiyona y'Urwanda byikurikiranya, Nshuti Innocent yerekeje mw' ikipe ya American USL League One One Knoxville muri Mutarama 2024. Yasezerewe na Knoxville nyuma y'umwaka wabo womuri 2024. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo bigaragaza amanota u Rwanda rwatsinze mbere, inkingi y'amanota igaragaza amanota nyuma ya buri gitego cya Nshuti.\""}
{"id": "21821", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21821", "title": "Elias Ntaganda", "text": "Elias Ntaganda (wavutse kuya 1 Mutarama muwi 1982 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'Umunyarwanda wahoze ari umukinnyi w'ikipe ya APR FC uherutse gukinira ikipeye. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nNtaganda yari umwe mubagize ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru y'u Rwanda yatsindiye itike yokujya mu gikombe cya Afurika cyo mu "}
{"id": "21822", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21822", "title": "Mutatsimpundu Denise", "text": "Mutatsimpundu Denise Umunyarwanda ukina umukino wamaboko volleyball Yavutse ku itariki ya 27 Gicurasi 1993 kandi ni umukinnyi wa volleyball / beach volleyball.\nDenise yatangiye gukina volleyball akiri muto mu marushanwa y\u2019amashuri no mu makipe y\u2019abato mu Rwanda.\nUko yakomezaga kugaragaza impano, yaje kugera ku rwego rw\u2019amakipe akina shampiyona y\u2019igihugu.\nAmakipe akomeye yakiniye.\nYamenyekanye cyane akina muri Rwanda Revenue Authority Women Volleyball Club (RRA WVC), imwe mu makipe akomeye muri shampiyona ya volleyball mu Rwanda.\nDenise yagiye ahamagarwa mu ikipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019u Rwanda y\u2019abagore muri volleyball.\nAmarushanwa yegukanye.\nYagize uruhare runini mu guhesha urwanda igikombe cy\u2019Afurika cya beach volleyball hamwe na Charlotte Nzayisenga mu 2017 Maputo, Mozambique. "}
{"id": "21823", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21823", "title": "Alex Nduwayo", "text": "= Alex Nduwayo =\nAlex Nduwayo ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'Umunyarwanda ukina ku mwanya wa myugaririro muri APR FC yamuguze mu mpeshyi ya 2025 imukuye muri Gasogi United. Azwi mu marushanwa y\u2019imbere mu gihugu cy\u2019u Rwanda no mu bikorwa by\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru byateguwe na FERWAFA. \nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere.\nAlex Nduwayo yavukiye mu Rwanda ku wa (shyiramo itariki niba ihari). Yatangiye gukina umupira w\u2019amaguru akiri muto mu makipe y\u2019abato, aho yagaragaje impano yihariye mu (shyiramo umwanya akinaho cyangwa irushanwa yigaragajemo).\nUmwuga we mu makipe.\nYakinye mu makipe atandukanye arimo:\nMu gihe yakinaga muri APR FC, afitemo amasezerano y' imyaka ine aho azajya ahembwa ibihumbi 900k buri kwezi. yitabiriye amarushanwa nka Shampiyona y\u2019u Rwanda, Igikombe cy\u2019Amahoro, nayandi. \nIkipe y\u2019igihugu.\nNiba yarahamagawe mu ikipe y\u2019igihugu, andika gutya:\nNduwayo yahamagawe mu Ikipe y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019u Rwanda, izwi nka Amavubi, mu mwaka wa 2025. Yitabiriye irushanwa rya CECAFA."}
{"id": "21824", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21824", "title": "U Rwanda mu mikino ya Commonwealth yo mu 2010", "text": "U Rwanda rwatangiye gukina imikino ya Commonwealth mu mikino ya Commonwealth yo mu 2010 yabereye i Delhi, mu Buhinde, kuva ku ya 3 Ukwakira kugeza ku ya 14 Ukwakira 2010. U Rwanda rwemewe mu Muryango w\u2019Ibihugu by\u2019Ubumwe mu Gushyingo 2009, ruhinduka igihugu cya kabiri kigize Umuryango w\u2019Ibihugu by\u2019Ubumwe kidafite aho gihuriye n\u2019Ubukoloni cyangwa n\u2019Itegeko Nshinga n\u2019Ubwongereza. \nMu kwitabira kwayo bwa mbere Imikino ya Commonwealth, u Rwanda rwatangirijwe n\u2019itsinda rigizwe n\u2019abakinnyi barenga 22, barushanwaga mu mikino ngororamubiri, iteramakofe, gusiganwa ku magare, koga ndetse na tenisi. \nIkipe nta mudari yatsindiye. muriryo Rushanywa "}
{"id": "21825", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21825", "title": "Sa\u00efd Makasi", "text": "Sa\u00efd Abed Makasi (wavutse kuya 20 Kanama 1982) yahoze arumukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru wabigize umwuga wakinaga nka rutahizamu. Yavukiye muri Zaire, akinira ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda kurwego mpuzamahanga.\nUmwuga w'ikipe.\nKw' itariki ya 29 Nyakanga 2011, Makasi yasinye amasezerano y'umwaka umwe n'ikipe ya Primus National Football League Rayon Sports. wowe\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMakasi yahoze arimukinnyi w'ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda."}
{"id": "21826", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21826", "title": "Patrick Mafisango", "text": "Patrick Mutesa Mafisango (9 Werurwe 1980 - 17 Gicurasi 2012) yarumukinnyi mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru w'Umunyarwanda wakinaga nk'umukinnyi wo hagati.\nUmwuga.\nMafisango yavukiye i Kinshasa muri Zaire, yakinnye umupira w'amaguru mumakipe muri Congo, mu Rwanda nomuri Tanzaniya mu makipe ya TP Mazembe, APR, ATRACO, Azam na Simba. Yatwaye igikombe cya shampiyona ya Tanzaniya yo muRI 2011-12 ari kumwe na Simba, nyuma yokuva mw' ikipe ye ya Azam muri Gicurasi 2011. \nYakiniye u Rwanda imikino 23 kurwego mpuzamahanga rw\u2019ikirenga, ayitsindamo ibitego bibiri, hagati ya 2006 na 2011. Yanakinnye imikino icumi yogushaka itike yogukina igikombe cy\u2019isi cya FIFA. \nUrupfu.\nYapfiriye munzira ajyanwa kwamuganga nyuma yogukora impanuka y'imodoka kuya 17 Gicurasi 2012. \nIbyubahiro.\nSimba"}
{"id": "21827", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21827", "title": "Jean Lomami", "text": "Jean Lomami (wavutse kuya 27 Nyakanga 1982) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'Umunyarwanda. Yakinnye imikino 26 mw' ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru y'Urwanda kuva muri 2003 kugeza muri 2009. Yanatoranyijwe mw' ikipe y'u Rwanda yitabiriye irushanwa rya Afurika ryo mu 2004. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo bigaragazwa n'umubare w'ibitego by'u Rwanda mbere, inkingi y'amanota igaragaza amanota nyuma yaburi gitego cya Lomani.\""}
{"id": "21828", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21828", "title": "Andre Lomami", "text": "Andr\u00e9 Lomami (wavutse kuya 6 Kanama 1987) numukinnyi mpuzamahanga w\u2019umupira wamaguru mu Rwanda ukinana Polisi FC Kibungo.\nUmwuga.\nYari yarahagarariye amakipe yomu Rwanda ya Police FC Kibungo, APR FC na ATRACO FC, kandi mugice cyambere cy'umwaka w'imikino wa 2010-11 yakinnye na FK \u0160kendija muri shampiyona ya mbere ya Macedonia. \nHagati yo muri 2005 na 2008 yatwaye shampiyona y'u Rwanda inshuro 4 yikurikiranya, ndetse aba n'umukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi muri shampiyona mu 2006. \nIkipe y'igihugu.\nYakinnye umukino umwe muri 2006 mu ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru y'u Rwanda.\nIbyubahiro.\nIkipe:\nUmuntu ku giti cye:"}
{"id": "21829", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21829", "title": "Michel Kamanzi", "text": "Michel Kamanzi (wavutse kuya 29 Nzeri 1979) numukinnyi wahoze ari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'Umunyarwanda, uzwiho kuba yarakinnye hagati mu ikipe ya TuSpo Richrath.\nUmwuga.\nKamanzi yimukiye mu Budage abisabwe n'umwe mubanyagihugu be. \nMuri 2004, Kamanzi yasinye amasezerano n'ikipe yomu cyiciro cyakane cy'Ubudage nyuma yo gukinira ikipe ya SG Betzdorf mu cyiciro cyagatanu cy'Ubudage."}
{"id": "21830", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21830", "title": "Karim Kamanzi", "text": "Karim Kamanzi (wavutse kuya 18 Werurwe muwi 1983) ni rutahizamu w'umupira w'amaguru w'Umunyarwanda wasezerewe. Yatorewe kuba umukinnyi w'ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru y'Urwanda mu gikombe cya Afurika cyo mu 2004. "}
{"id": "21831", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21831", "title": "Claude Kalisa", "text": "Claude Kalisa (wavutse kuya 6 Kamena 1977)) ni umunyarwanda wahoze arimyugariro w'umupira w'amaguru wabigize umwuga. Afatanyije na mugenzi we D\u00e9sir\u00e9 Mbonabucya, Kalisa yabaye inkingi y'umugongo y'ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda yitabiriye Igikombe cya Afurika cy'Ibihugu cya 2004.\nUmwuga.\nKalisa yatangiye gukina umupira w'amaguru w'ababigize umwuga mu Bushinwa mu ikipe ya Yanbian Century, kandi yamaze ibihembwe bitandatu byanyuma by'umwuga wemu Bubiligi mu ikipe ya K. Sint-Truidense VV. Yasezeye kukazi kubera imvune yomu ivi muri 2007. \nUmuntu ku giti cye.\nSe wa Kalisa yishwe mu ntambara y\u2019abenegihugu mugihugu cyecy\u2019u Rwanda. "}
{"id": "21832", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21832", "title": "Djihad Bizimana", "text": "Djihad Bizimana (wavutse ku ya 12 Ukuboza 1996) afite uburebure bwa metero imwe na centimetero mirongwinani (1,80m) Akaba yaravukiye mugihugu cy'u Rwanda muntara y'uburengerazuba (Gisenyi)ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru mugihugu cy'u Rwanda wabigize umwuga ukina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati mu ikipe ya CS Constantine yo muri Alijeriya ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda.\nUmwuga w'ikipe.\nBizimana Djihad yakinnye mu ikipe y'urubyiruko ya Etincelles kuva afite imyaka 15, akaba yaratangiye gukina muri Rayon sport Fc. Ku ya 26 Mata 2018, Bizimana yinjiye muri Waasland-Beveren avuye mu ikipe ya APR FC yo mu Rwanda. Bizimana yakinnye bwa mbere mu ikipe ya Waasland-Beveren mu mukino wahuje ikipe ya SV Zulte Waregem yo mu cyiciro cya mbere mu Bubiligi, aho yakinnye na SV Zulte Waregem ibitego 2-2 ku ya 28 Nyakanga 2018. \nKu itariki ya 28 Gicurasi 2021, yemeye kujya muri Deinze mu cyiciro cya mbere cy'Ububiligi. \nKu itariki ya 26 Nyakanga 2023, yinjiye mu ikipe ya FC Kryvbas yo muri Ukraine muri shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere ku masezerano y'imyaka ibiri. Yakinnye umukino we wa mbere muri iyi kipe mu mukino wahuje ikipe ya Oleksandriya na Oleksandriya, aza gusimbuza ku munota wa 46. \nKu ya 6 Gashyantare 2025, Bizimana Djihad yasinye amasezerano y'imyaka ibiri na Al Ahli SC ku giciro kitatangajwe hejuru. \nKu itariki ya 31 Mutarama 2026, yinjiye mu ikipe ya CS Constantine yo muri Alijeriya. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nBizimana Djihad yari umukinnyi mpuzamahanga w\u2019ingimbi mu ikipe y\u2019u Rwanda. Yabanje mu ikipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019u Rwanda mu mukino wa gicuti batsinzwemo na Zambia ibitego 2-0 ku ya 29 Gicurasi 2015. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo bigaragaza amanota y'u Rwanda ku isonga.\" \nIbyubahiro.\nU Rwanda"}
{"id": "21833", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21833", "title": "Honore Kabongo", "text": "Joseph Honor\u00e9 Kabongo (yavutse 1 Mutarama muwi 1985 i Brazzaville\u00a0) numukinnyi wahoze ari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka mu Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nYatangiye gukina muri Renaissance Kigali, mbere yokujya muri Patro Maasmechelen muri Nyakanga 2004. Kabongo yavuye mw' ikipe nyuma y'amezi 6 mu Bubiligi ajya muri Sakaryaspor muri Turukiya muri Mutarama 2005, yakinnye imikino 5 mbere yokujya muri Hakoah Ramat-Gan muri Nyakanga 2006. Than yasubiye muri APR FC muri Mutarama 2007, nyuma y'umwaka umwe muri Gashyantare 2008 ava muri APR ajya muri Somaliya gusinya amasezerano na Goldogob FC. Ikipe yomuri Tayilande yitwa Samut Songkhram FC yamuguze muri Nyakanga 2008, ariko muruyu mwaka w'imikino wa Nyakanga 2009 yakiniye Tanzania Champions Young Africans FC. \nMpuzamahanga.\nYakinnye kuva muri 2005 kugeza mu 2007 mu ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru y'u Rwanda. Kabongo yanahawe ikamba ryerya mbere k ya 27 Werurwe 2005 ubwo yakinaga n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Algeria. Yanabaye mw' ikipe y'abatarengeje imyaka 17 yo muri Kongo.."}
{"id": "21834", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21834", "title": "Jean-Claude Iranzi", "text": "Jean-Claude Iranzi (wavutse kuya 5 Ukwakira 1990) numukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'u Rwanda wabigize umwuga, akaba aherutse gukinira ikipe ya Rayon Sports yo mu cyiciro cya mbere cy'u Rwanda. \nUmwuga w'ikipe.\nKiyovu Sport.\nIranzi yavukiye i Kigali. Yatangiye umwuga we muri 2004 muri SC Kiyovu Sport, azamurwa mu ntera mw' ikipe ya shampiyona y'u Rwanda yo muri 2006. Yakinnye bwa mbere muri Kiyovu Sport muri Kamena 2006.\nIkipe ya APR FC.\nMu Ukuboza 2008, Iranzi yasinye amasezerano na APR FC, ikipe yambere yatwaye igikombe cya shampiyona y'u Rwanda. Yakinnye umukino wewa mbere wa APR FC mumukino wagicuti wateguwe n'ikipe ya Police FC. Afatanyije na APR, Iranzi yegukanye igikombe cya shampiyona y'u Rwanda cyomu 2009-10, bityo abona umwanya muri CAF Champions League yo mu 2011, aho APR yasezerewe mucyiciro cyambere na Club Africain yomuri Tuniziya ku manota 2-6. APR yongeye kuba igikombe cya shampiyona y'Ubwongereza muri 2010-11, bityo ikina muri CAF Champions League yo mu 2012.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nIranzi yakinnye shampiyona y'ingimbi z'abatarengeje imyaka 20 yabereye mu Rwanda. Yakinnye umukino we wa mbere mw' ikipe ya \"Wasps\" ku ya 21 Kamena 2008 mu mukino wo gushaka itike yo gukina igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cya 2010 yakinnye n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Maroc. Igitego cyambere mpuzamahanga cya Iranzi cyabonetse kuya 26 Werurwe 2011 murwego rwo gushaka itike yo gukina igikombe cya Afurika cya 2012. Iki gitego cyatsinzwe ku munota wa 44, cyatumye u Rwanda rutsinda Burundi igitego 1-0. U Rwanda rwatsinze umukino kumanota 3-1. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo bigaragaza amanota u Rwanda rwatsinze mbere, inkingi y'amanota igaragaza amanota nyuma yaburi gitego cyaIranzi.\"\nIbyubahiro.\nIkipe ya APR FC"}
{"id": "21835", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21835", "title": "Emmanuel Imanishimwe", "text": "Emmanuel Imanishimwe (wavutse kuya 2 Gashyantare 1995) numukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'u Rwanda wabigize umwuga ukina inyuma y'ibumoso mw' ikipe ya AEL Limassol n'ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda. \nUmwuga w'ikipe.\nMuri Kanama 2021, yinjiye mw' ikipe ya AS FAR yomuri Maroc ku masezerano y'imyaka itatu ku giciro cyamiliyoni 130 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda. "}
{"id": "21836", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21836", "title": "Muhadjiri Hakizimana", "text": "Hakizimana Muhadjiri (wavutse kuya 13 Kanama 1994) uzwi kandi ku izina rya \"HD\" ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'u Rwanda wabigize umwuga ukinira ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nIkipe.\nKw' itariki ya 26 Kamena 2022, Hakizimana yinjiye mw' ikipe ya Al-Kholood yomuri Arabiya Sawudite. \nMpuzamahanga.\nYatangiye gukina kurwego mpuzamahanga kuya 3 Ugushyingo 2016 mumikino yo guhatanira itike yo kujya mu gikombe cya Afurika cya 2017, anatsinda igitego cye cyambere ubwo bakinaga na Ghana banganyaga igitego 1-1.\nMumikino yo guhatanira itike yo gukina igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cyo mu 2022, yatsinze ibitego bibiri muriburi mukino mumikino ibiri yikurikiranya yatsinzemo ikipe ya Seychelles.\n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo bigaragaza amanota y'u Rwanda kw' isonga.\""}
{"id": "21837", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21837", "title": "Jean-Pierre Mabula Hakiri", "text": "Jean-Pierre Mabula Hakiri (wavutse kuya 15 Nyakanga 1987) numukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'Umunyarwanda uzwiho kuba yarakiniye imikino Olempike ya Sydney muri Ositaraliya muri 2016.\nYitabiriye imikino itatu yokwitegura na Sydney Olympic muri Ositaraliya mumpeshyi ya 2016, Hariri yari amaze gukora imyitozo nabo kuya 3 Nyakanga kandi yagombaga gusinya amasezerano y'imyaka 2, yatangiye ubwo Olympic yatsindwaga na Rockdale City Suns ibitego 0-2, agaragaza imbaraga nyinshi nubwo yakuyemo ikarita itukura kumunota wa 75. \nUbuzima bwite.\nUyu munyarwanda ni umukirisitu kandi yashatse mu 2015. "}
{"id": "21838", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21838", "title": "Jean-Paul Habyarimana", "text": "Jean-Paul Habyarimana (wavutse kuya 17 Kanama 1982) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'Umunyarwanda. Yakinnye imikino itatu mw' ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru y'Urwanda kuva muri 2002 kugeza mu 2004. Yanatoranyijwe mw' ikipe y'u Rwanda yitabiriye irushanwa rya Afurika ryo mu 2004. "}
{"id": "21839", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21839", "title": "Steven Godfroid", "text": "Steven Emmanuel Godfroid Kunduma (wavutse kuya 16 Werurwe 1990) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru ukinira ikipe ya KSV Temse yomu Bubiligi nk'umukinnyi wo hagati. Yavukiye mu Bubiligi, ahagararira u Rwanda kurwego mpuzamahanga.\nUmwuga.\nGodfroid yakinnye umupira w'amaguru mumakipe yo mu Bubiligi mw' ikipe ya Charleroi, Jeunesse Turque na Saint-Gilloise. Godfroid yinjiye muri KSV Temse mbere y'umwaka w'imikino wa 2019-20. \nYakinnye umukino wewa mbere mpuzamahanga mu Rwanda muri 2012, kandi yakinnye imikino yogushaka itike yogukina igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA. "}
{"id": "21840", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21840", "title": "Eric Gasana", "text": "Eric Gasana (wavutse kuya 15 Gicurasi 1986) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'Umunyarwanda ukina inyuma kuruhande rw'iburyo. Yitabiriye igikombe cya Afurika cya 2012 arikumwe n'ikipe y'igihugu y'Urwanda. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo bigaragazwa n'umubare w'ibitego by'u Rwanda, inkingi y'amanota igaragaza amanota nyuma yaburi gitego cyaGasana.\""}
{"id": "21841", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21841", "title": "Fritz Emeran", "text": "Fritz Emeran Nkusi (wavutse kuya 28 Werurwe muwi 1976) yahoze ari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru wabigize umwuga wakinaga nk'umukinnyi w'inyuma w'iburyo. Yavukiye i Guadeloupe, akinira ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda.\nUmwuga w'ikipe.\nNkusi wavukiye muri Les Abymes, Guadeloupe, yakiniye Monaco B, Saint-L\u00f4, Rennes B, Stade Poitevin, Saint-Denis Saint-Leu, KV Mechelen, Genk, Fortuna Sittard, Gueugnon, FC Bruxelles, La Louvi\u00e8re, Asteras Tripolis, Levadiakos, Saint-Leventiakos. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nEmeran yavukiye i Guadeloupe mu Bufaransa, yashakanye n'umunyarwandakazi wahawe ubwenegihugu bw'u Rwanda. Yatsindiye u Rwanda imipira 6 hagati yo muri 2005 na 2007. \nUbuzima bwite.\nNi e w'umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'umufaransa Noam Emeran. "}
{"id": "21842", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21842", "title": "Andrew Buteera", "text": "Andrew Buteera (wavutse kuya 3 Ukwakira 1994) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'Umunyarwanda ukina hagati mw' ikipe ya APR n'ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru y'Urwanda.\nUmwuga w'ikipe.\nButeera yavukiye i Kampala, Buteera yatangiye umwuga wemuri Proline muri Uganda muri 2011 mbere yokujya muri APR ku masezerano y'imyaka ibiri muri 2012. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nButeera yakinnye umukino wewa mbere mpuzamahanga mw' ikipe y'u Rwanda kuya 3 Nzeri 2011 ubwo batsindwaga na Ivory Coast ibitego 5-0 mu mikino yo guhatanira itike yo kujya mu gikombe cya Afurika cya 2012. "}
{"id": "21843", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21843", "title": "Bobo Bola", "text": "Boba Bola (wavutse kuya 2 Ukwakira 1985) yahoze arumukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru wabigize umwuga wakinaga nk'umukinnyi wa mbere. Yavukiye muri Zaire, ahagararira ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda kurwego mpuzamahanga.\nUmwuga wa Cub.\nBola yinjiye muri Landskrona BoIS muri 2005, avuye muri APR FC. Yari hafi gutizwa mu ikipe yo muri Suwede yitwa IF Limhamn Bunkeflo ariko urukundo ntirwagenze neza, ahubwo yatijwe muri Bodens BK. Yakinnye imikino 26 atsinda ibitego 3 muri Landskrona BoIS, mbere yuko agenda kuya 22 Ukuboza 2008. Yazamuwe nyuma y'umwaka wa 2008 mw' ikipe y'abasimbura ya Landskrona BoIS kandi yari mu igeragezwa muri Motala AIF. Mumpeshyi ya 2009 n'igice cy'umwaka muri Landskrona BoIS II yasinye amasezerano muri Syrianska IF Kerburan. Muri Werurwe 2010, nyuma yokurekurwa na Syrianska IF yasinye muri Panellinios IF. Muri Kanama 2010 yasinye amasezerano muri Finnish Atlantis FC. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nBola yavukiye muri Zaire, yahagarariye ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda kurwego mpuzamahanga kandi yari umukinnyi ukomeye mw' ikipe ya \"Amavubi\". "}
{"id": "21844", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21844", "title": "Labama Bokota", "text": "Bokota Kamana Labama (wavutse kuya 6 Mata 1985 i Kinshasa) numukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'umunyarwanda ukomoka mugihugu cya Rayon Sport.\nUmwuga w'ikipe.\nBokota yakinnye mbere muri Rayon Sport na Arm\u00e9e Patriotique Rwandaise FC. [\"Bikenewe\"] Yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'umwaka wa SMS Media ubwo yatangiraga gukina na Rayon. \nBokota yahawe igihano cy'umwaka umwe n'ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru rya Rwanda mu 2009, maze yerekeza muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya congo gukinira amakipe yomuri ako gace FC Les Stars na DC Motema Pembe. Muri Kanama 2011, yasinye amasezerano y'imyaka ibiri muri Rayon Sport, atangira gukinira ikipe yomu Rwanda. \nKuya 8 Kanama 2012, rutahizamu waAmavubi Bokota Labama yinjiye muri Kiyovu Sports ku masezerano y'umwaka umwe. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nBokota ubu n' umwe mubagize ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru y'u Rwanda. Igihugu yavukiyemo ni Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo bigaragaza amanota y'u Rwanda ku isonga.\" "}
{"id": "21845", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21845", "title": "Canesius Bizimana", "text": "Canesius Bizimana (wavutse kuya 15 Mutarama 1984) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'Umunyarwanda. Yakinnye imikino itatu mw' ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru y'Urwanda muri 2003 na 2004. Yanatoranyijwe mw' ikipe y'u Rwanda yitabiriye irushanwa rya Afurika ryo mu 2004. "}
{"id": "21846", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21846", "title": "L\u00e9andre Bizagwira", "text": "L\u00e9andre Bizagwira (wavutse kuya 15 Gicurasi 1977) yahoze ari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'Umunyarwanda. Yakinnye imikino 14 mw' ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru y'Urwanda kuva muri 2000 kugeza muri 2004. Yanatoranyijwe mw' ikipe y'u Rwanda yitabiriye irushanwa rya Afurika ryo mu 2004. "}
{"id": "21847", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21847", "title": "Jean R\u00e9my Bitana", "text": "Jean R\u00e9my Bitana (wavutse kuya 5 Gicurasi 1984) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'Umunyarwanda wakinnye imikino itanu mw' ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru y'Urwanda muri 2003 na 2004, harimo itatu mw' irushanwa rya Afurika ryo mu 2004. "}
{"id": "21848", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21848", "title": "Biramahire Abeddy", "text": "Biramahire Abeddy (yavutse kw' itariki 4 Ukwakira 1998) numupira wamaguru wumupira wamaguru mu Rwanda. \nUmwuga w'ikipe.\nBiramahire yavukiye i Kigali, mu Rwanda, maze atangira gukina umupira w'amaguru mucyiciro cya kabiri, asinya amasezerano na Heroes Football Club. Imikinire ya Biramahire yatumye yimurirwa muri Bugesera FC, uburyo yitwaye bwamuhesheje umwanya mw' ikipe y'igihugu y'abana b'abatarengeje \"imyaka 20.\" \nBiramahire yateye imbere mumupira w'amaguru mu Rwanda nyuma yo gusinya amasezerano na Police Fc mu 2017, mumwaka wa shampiyona ya 2016/2017 ya shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere cy'u Rwanda. Kumyaka 20, yahawe igihembo cy'umukinnyi mwiza ukiri muto utanga icyizere kubera ubuhanga bwe n'ubwitange bwe mukibuga, ibi byanamuhesheje ishimwe no guhabwa umwanya mw' ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda Amavubi mw' ikipe ya CHAN (African Nations Championship) yabereye muri Maroc muri 2018. \nBiramahire yagize uruhare runini mukurangiza neza kumwanya wakabiri muri uyu mwaka w'imikino, nyuma yo kubura igikombe cya shampiyona muri APR FC. Muri 2018, yerekeje muri Club Sportif Sfaxien nyuma yokongera gusimbuza u Rwanda na Tunisia na Nshuti Innocent avuye muri APR FC ajya muri Stade Tunisien muri uwomwaka. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo bigaragaza amanota y'u Rwanda ku isonga.\" "}
{"id": "21849", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21849", "title": "RYAN GIGGS", "text": "RYAN Joseph OBE GIGGS wo mu gihugu cya wales yari umukinnyi w'umupira wamaguru wavutse mu kwezi kwa cumi na kumwe mu gihumbi kimwe na magana cyenda mirongo irindwi na gatatu akaba yaravuye mu gukina bitewe nuko imyaka ye yaritakimwemerera ariko, Ubungubu Ryan giggs asigaye akora ibyerekeranye na business ye yakoze ariko bitavanyemo ko akiba mubuzima bwumupira w'amaguru kuko ikipe ya Salford city."}
{"id": "21850", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21850", "title": "Teafale Lenard", "text": "Teafale Marquise Lenard Jr. (yavutse ku ya 21 Nyakanga 2002) ni umukinnyi ukina Basketball akaba umunyamerika w'abigize umwuga wakiniye ikipe ya APR ya mu mikino ya shampiyona nya furika ya Basketball (BAL).\nunyamwuga.\nTeafale yakinnye bwa mbere mu ikipe ya Texas muri NBA, aho yinjiye mu mwaka w'imikino wa 2023-24. Yatsinze amanota 10.2 na ribandi 3.9 mu myaka ibiri yamaze muri iyo kipe. \nLenard yinjiye mu ikipe ya Afurika y'Epfo ya MBB mu mwaka wa 2025 wa shampiyona nya furika ya Basketball (BAL). Ku ya 20 Gicurasi 2025, yatsinze amanota 39 menshi cyane mu ikipe ya MBB ubwo yatsindwaga na Al Ahli. Yatsinze shampiyona mu gutsinda amanota 22.7 kuri buri mukino, ndetse no mu kwiba amanota 3.5 kuri buri mukino. Yanatsinze impuzandengo ya 7.3 rebounds na 2.7 blocks kuri buri mukino. Ku ya 14 Kamena, Lenard yashyizwe mu ikipe ya kabiri ya sitari ba BAL. \nMuri Gashyantare 2026, Lenard yinjiye mu ikipe ya APR yo mu Rwanda mbere y'umwaka w'imikino wa shampiyona ya BAL wa 2026. \nLenard ni umuhungu wa Ashley Lenard na Teafale Lenard, Sr., kandi afite abavandimwe babiri. Umukinnyi akunda cyane ni Kobe Bryant. "}
{"id": "21851", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21851", "title": "Dane Miller Jr.", "text": "Dane Miller Jr. (yavutse ku ya 10 Gicurasi 1990) ni umukinnyi ukina basketball ukomoka muri amerika wa kiniye APR BBC yo muri shampiyona nyafurika ya Basketball (BAL). Yatoranyijwe mu ikipe ya mbere ya bakinnyi beza muri 2023, ubwo yakiniraga ikipe ya SLAC.\nkaminuza.\nMiller Jr. yakiniye mu ikipe ya Rutgers mugihe cy'imyaka ine. Yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Big Rookie muri 2010. \nUmwuga.\nKu ya 15 Kanama 2020, Miller yasinye amasezerano na Sn\u00e6fell wo muri shampiyona y a Icelande. \nMuri Gicurasi 2025, Miller yinjiye muri APR BBC mu mwaka w'imikino wa shampiyona wo muri 2025 wa BAL, umwaka we wa kane wikurikiranya wa BAL. "}
{"id": "21852", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21852", "title": "Isaiah Miller", "text": "Isaiah Miller Jr. (yavutse ku ya 9 Ugushyingo 1997) ni umukinnyi w\u2019umunyamerika w abigize umwuga mu ikipe ya Austin yo muri shampiyona ya basketbal ya NBA. Yakinnye Basketball yo muri kaminuza mu ikipe ya Greensboro Spartans.\nUmwuga.\nAPR (2024).\nKu ya 31 Nyakanga 2024, Miller yasinye amasezerano na APR muri shampiyona ya Basketball y'u Rwanda na ndetse aza gukina na shampiyona nyafurika ya Basketball. Muri Kanama, APR yegukanye igikombe cya mbere cya Basketball y'u Rwanda bari kumwe, nyuma y'uko Miller yatsinze amanota 43 ku mukino wa nyuma bahanganye na REG BBC. \nKu ya 23 Nzeri 2024, Miller na APR begukanye igikombe cya RBL nyuma yo gutsinda Patriots ku mukino wa 6. Miller yatorewe kuba umukinnnyi mwiza w'irushanwa mu mikino ya nyuma. "}
{"id": "21853", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21853", "title": "Youssou Ndoye", "text": "Youssou Ndoye (yavutse ku ya 15 Nyakanga 1991) ni umukinnyi w'abigize umwuga ukomoka muri Senegal. Yakinnye Basketball muri Kaminuza mu ikipe ya Bonaventure iwabo. Anakinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Senegali ndetse yabaye na Kapiteni wayo.\nmu mashuri yisumbuye.\nNdoye yakinnye basketball mu m'amashuri yisumbuye muri cademi y'i Lee, mu gihe cy'imyaka ibiri. yatsinze mesnhi kuri buri mukino, yashyizwe mu byiciro by'amashuri abanza mu ishuri rye ajya muri kaminuza. \nUmwuga.\nAPR (2025\u2013ubu).\nKu ya 23 Mata 2025, Ndoye yinjiye mu ikipe ya APR BBC yo mu shampiyona ya basketbal yu Rwanda (BAL). Ndoye yafashije APR kurangiza ku mwanya wa gatatu mu mwaka wa 2025, gusa yashyizwe mu ikipe ya kabiri ya nziza. Yatsinze amanota 9 na ribandi 6.8 muri shampiyona. Ku ya 18 Kamena. \nKu ya 12 Nyakanga 2025, Ndoye yegukanye igikombe cya shampiyona ya Basketball mu Rwanda (RBL) ari kumwe na APR, nyuma yo gutsinda REG BBC mu mukino wa nyuma. Yatsinze amanota 26 menshi, ndetse na ribandi 7 na n'imipira 3 mu mukino wa 5 ukomeye, nyuma yaho barangije batsinze. Ndoye yagizwe umukinnyi w\u2019indashyikirwa mu iryo rushanwa. \nIkipe y'igihugu.\nNdoye akinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Senegal, ndetse no muri shampiyona ya furika muri 2017 na 2021, yegukana umudari, ndetse no mu gikombe cy'isi cya Basketball cy o muri 2019. "}
{"id": "21855", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21855", "title": "Obadiah Noel", "text": "Obadiah Arthur Noel (yavutse ku ya 28 Kamena 1999) ni umukinnyi w\u2019umunyamerika w'abigize umwuga ukina mu APR BBC ya shampiyona nyafurika ya Basketball (BAL) na shampiyona yu Rwanda ya Basketball (RBL). Yakinnye Basketball ya kaminuza ya umass.\nubunyamwuga.\nNoel yatangiriye mu ikipe ya Tampa mu rwego rwo kwitegura imikino ya NBA yo muri 2021. Yashyizwe mu ikipe ya beza nyuma yo gutsinda amanota 14, imipira ribandi 2.8. \nAPR (2024).\nKu ya 19 Mata 2024, Noel yasinye amasezerano na APR bbc yo muri shampiyona ya Basketball y'u Rwanda ba kinana na shampiyona nyafurika ya Basketball. Noel yakinnye bwa mbere muri kimwe cya kabiri cy'irushanwa ryo kwibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi maze atsinda amanota 26, imipira 7 yo kwiruka n'imipira 3 yo gupagasa REG. "}
{"id": "21856", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21856", "title": "Nuni Omot", "text": "Anunwa Nuni Omot (yavutse ku ya 3 Ukwakira 1994) ni umukinnyi w'abigize umwuga ukomoka muri Sudani y'Epfo ukina mu ikipe ya Beirut yo muri shampiyona Lebanese. Yakinnye kandi muri Basketball ya kaminuza muri Bayilore nyuma y'imyaka ibiri ajya muri Kaminuza ya Concorudiya.\nUmwuga.\nAPR (2025).\nMuri Gicurasi 2025, Omot yinjiye muri APR BBC aho yatwaye igikombe cy'u Rwanda mbere y'imikino ya nyuma ya BAL yo mu 2025, yongera gusubira muri shampiyona nyafurika ya Basketball, nyuma y'umwaka umwe atakiyikinamo. "}
{"id": "21857", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21857", "title": "Fiacre Ntwari", "text": "Fiacre Ntwari yavutse ku ya 25 Nzeri 1999, avukira i Kigali ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'Umunyarwanda ukina nk'umunyezamu akaba afite uburebure bungana na 1.94m. Kuva mu 2023, yakiniye TS Gaxy FC.\nMu kibuga.\nNtwari Fiacre yatangiye umupira w'amaguru muri Intare FC, Mu mwaka wa 2016, yakinnye bwa mbere mu cyiciro cya kabiri cy'u Rwanda. Mu 2017, yerekeje muri APR FC yo mu cyiciro cya mbere. Muri 2017/2018 na 2019/2020, yatwaye igikombe cy'u Rwanda ari kumwe nabo, naho mu mwaka wa 2018/2019, aba uwa kabiri muri shampiyona y'u Rwanda. Mu 2020, yinjiye muri Marines FC, naho mu 2021 yinjiye muri AS Kigali FC. Mu mwaka wa 2021/2022, yatwaye igikombe cy'u Rwanda ari kumwe na AS Kigali. Mu 2023, yerekeje muri TS Galaxy FC.\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nFiacre Ntwari yitabiriye umukino we wa mbere mu ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda ku ya 15 Ugushyingo 2021, ubwo yatsindwaga na Kenya ibitego 1-2 mu mikino yo guhatanira itike yo gukina igikombe cy'isi cya 2022, yabereye i Nairobi muri Kenya."}
{"id": "21858", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21858", "title": "Chasson Randle", "text": "Chasson Randle (yavutse ku ya 5 Gashyantare 1993) ni umukinnyi ukina basketball ukomoka muri amerika w'abigize umwuga mu ikipe ya Rodou wo muri shampiyona ya Basketball y\u2019Abagereki. Yakinnye basketball muri kaminuza muri Sitanforode. Ari mu mwaka wa nyuma w\u2019amashuri yisumbuye mu 2014-15, yafatwaga nk'umwe mu bakinnyi bakomeye mu gihugu.\nubunyamwuga.\nStockton Kings (2024\u20132025).\nKu ya 30 Ukuboza 2024, Randle yagurishijwe muri sitoke Kingi mu irushanwa ry\u2019amakipe atatu ryahuje Isilande Nete, Iowa ihabwa Amari Bailey wo muri Long Island naho Long Island igura Timme wo muri sitoke. \nAPR (2025).\nKu ya 23 Mata 2025, Randle yasinye amasezerano na APR BBC muri Rwanda, aho yinjiye muri shampiyona nyafurika ya basketball (BAL). "}
{"id": "21859", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21859", "title": "Jean Jacques Boissy", "text": "Jean Jacques Boissy (yavutse ku ya 28 Mutarama 2000) ni umukinnyi ukinaumukino wa Basketball wo muri Senegal. Akina muri garde, yarangije muri academe ya Afurika yakinnye nk'umukinnyi w'abigize umwuga kuva muri 2021. Boissy yegukanye shampiyona y'afurika ya BAL muri 2025, akaba yari MVP muri uwo mwaka. Yanabaye umukinnyi w\u2019ikipe ya mbere nziaza ya BAL inshuro ebyiri. Ku rwego mpuzamahanga, Boissy akinira ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya Senegali kuva muri 2022, ndetse ayobora ikipe ye itwara umudari muri shampiyona ya furika 2025.\nubunyamwuga.\nREG (2025).\nMuri Mutarama 2025, Boissy yasinye amasezerano na REG BBC yo muri shampiyona y'umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda, agaruka muri shampiyona ku nshuro ya mbere mu myaka ine. Ku ya 22 Werurwe 2025, yatsinze amanota 32, hamwe na rebounds 7 na assists 6, atsinda Patriots mu gihembwe gisanzwe cya RBL. Ku ya 30 Mata 2025, Boissy yatsinze amanota 37 menshi cyane mu gihembwe batsinze Orion. "}
{"id": "21860", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21860", "title": "Cleveland Thomas", "text": "Cleveland Joseph Pancake Thomas Jr. (yavutse ku ya 2 Ukuboza 1993) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa Basketball ukomoka muri amerika w'abigize umwuga muri shampiyona ya Basketball y\u2019u Rwanda.\nubunyamwuga.\nMuri Nyakanga 2023, yinjiye mu ikipe ya Dorados yo muri mexike. \nMuri Gushyingo 2023, Thomas yinjiye kuri Pazi BBC muri Tanzaniya. \nUbuzima bwite.\nThomas yakuye izina rya Pancake arikura kuri nyirakuru, wavuze ko inda ya nyina yari imeze nk'ipapayi mu gihe yari atwite. Ni umuntu ukunda ku ndwara umutwe kandi ashyigikira abantu ku bijyanye no kwiheba "}
{"id": "21861", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21861", "title": "Keanau Post", "text": "Keanau Dennis Post (yavutse ku ya 4 Nzeri 1992) ni umukinnyi ukora basketball ukomoka mu gihugu cya Canada. Yakinnye basketball muri kaminuza ndetse no mu ikipe ya Ilinoyise.\nmashuri yisumbuye.\nPost yatangiriye amashuri yisumbuye mu ishuri rikuru rya Oak Bay aho yakiniraga umutoza mukuru Josh Elsdon. Yatsinze amanota 12.5 mu mikino ya shampiyona muri Oak Bay, anayobora ikipe ye mu irushanwa rya Regionale shampiyona ryo muri 2009-10, ahita ahabwa umwanya wa mwiza mu irushanwa. Mu mwaka we wa nyuma w'amashuri yisumbuye, yimukiye muri Westwind Academy. \nubunyamwuga.\nMuri Nzeri 2021, Post yinjiye muri REG BBC yo mu shamiyona ya basketball yu Rwanda. Yafashije ikipe kwegukana shampiyona yabo ya kabiri.\nKu ya 23 Gashyantare 2022, Post yinjiye muri Taiwan ya Beer muri shampiyona ya basketball ya super. "}
{"id": "21863", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21863", "title": "Pitchou Kambuy Manga", "text": "Pitchou Kambuy Manga (yavutse ku ya 12 Ukuboza 1988) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa Basketball ukomoka muri Congo ukinira ikipe ya Tigers BBC iri muri shampiyona yu Rwanda ya Basketball. Anakinira ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya Basketball y\u2019abagabo ya repubulika iharanira demukarasi ya Kongo.\nubunyamwuga.\nKuva muri 2011, Kambuy Manga yakiniye Mazembe kandi yakinnye inshuro nyinshi mu gikombe cya afurika ari kumwe niyi kipe. \nMuri Gashyantare 2022, yinjiye muri REG BBC ya shampiyona ya Basketball y'u Rwanda Yashyizwe mu ikipe ya mbere ya mberenziza mu mwaka w'imikino wa 2021-22. Afatanyije na REG, Kambuy Manga yakinnye bwa mbere muri shampiyona ya Basketball yu Rwanda. Ku ya 14 Werurwe 2022, akaba yaratsinze amanota 16. "}
{"id": "21864", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21864", "title": "Abdoulaye N'Doye", "text": "Abdoulaye N'Doye (yavutse ku ya 9 Werurwe 1998) ni umukinnyi ukora umukino wa Basketball w'abigize umwuga ukomoka m'ubufaransa wakiniraga ikipe ya basketball ya sartehe.\nubunyamwuga.\nMonaco (2020\u20132021).\nKu itariki ya 5 Kanama 2020, N'Doye yasinye amasezerano na ikipe ya Monaco muri Pro. \nBCM (2021\u20132022).\nKu itariki ya 29 Nzeri 2021, yasinye amasezerano na BCM muri shampiyona ya LNB Pro. \nREG (2022).\nMuri Gicurasi 2022, N'Doye yinjiye mu ikipe y'u Rwanda ya REG BBC kugira ngo ayifatanye mu mikino nyafurika ya shampiyona ya BAL yo muri 2022. "}
{"id": "21865", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21865", "title": "Muhoroni Youth F.C.", "text": "Ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru y'urubyiruko ya Muhoroni ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ikomoka muri Muhoroni, muri Kenya, ariko ikina imikino yayo yanyuma kuri sitade y'igihugu ya Nyayo i Nairobi. Ubirahatanira shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere cya Kenya, aho yazamuwe nyuma yogutsinda shampiyona ya shampiyona ya KFF Nationwide ya 2011.\nIngimbi za Muhoroni zegukanye igikombe cya mbere muri 2016."}
{"id": "21866", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21866", "title": "Admiral F.C.", "text": "Admiral Football Club nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ifite icyicaro i Mombasa muri Kenya. Iyikipe irushanwa muri FKF Division One kandi ikinira imikino yayo yomu rugo kuri Apostle Grounds."}
{"id": "21867", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21867", "title": "Afghan cricket team in Kenya in 2010\u201311", "text": "Ikipe ya cricket yo muri Afuganisitani yakoreye uruzinduko muri Kenya kuva kuya 2 kugeza kuya 11 Ukwakira 2010. Urugendo rwari rugizwe n'umukino umwe w'igikombe cya Intercontinental na ODI eshatu. Kenya yatsinze Afghanistan 2-1 mumukino wa ODI. "}
{"id": "21868", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21868", "title": "Afraha Stadium", "text": "Sitade ya Afraha ni sitade ifite intego nyinshi i Nakuru, muri Kenya. Ikoreshwa cyane cyane mu mikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandini sitade ya Nakuru AllStars yo muri Shampiyona y'Ubwongereza ya Kenya na Ulinzi Stars yomuri Shampiyona y'Ubwongereza ya Kenya. Iyi sitade yakira abantu 8.200 yafunguwe muwi 1948."}
{"id": "21869", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21869", "title": "Bandari F.C. (Kenya)", "text": "Bandari Football Club ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru yomuri Kenya ifite icyicaro i Mombasa. Iyi kipe ikinira imikino yayo ya mbere kukibuga cya Mbaraki Sports Club na sitade ya Mombasa County (iyi yanyuma ifite imyanya y'imyanya ingana inshuro enye), kandi ubu iri mw' irushanwa rya shampiyona ya Kenya nyuma yokurangiza shampiyona ya FKF Division One ya 2012 nk'ikipe yatwaye igikombe cya Zone A.\nIyikipe yakinnye kuva muwi 1960 kugeza muwi 1978 yitwa LASCO Football Club, ikurikirwa n'imyaka umunani yitwa Cargo Football Club. Muwi 1985, iyi kipe yifatanyije n'ikipe ya Kenya Ports Authority maze ishinga Bandari FC. \nIyi kipe yari yarakinnye mbere muri shampiyona ya Kenya, ariko yamanukaga nyuma y\u2019umwaka w\u2019imikino wi 1997. Bandari yabaye iyakabiri mumakipe yambere ya KPL 2017, 2018, inatwara igikombe cya KPL SportPesa Supercup 2018, bituma ibona umwanya wokujya mucyiciro cya CAF CONFEDERATION CUP.\nIkipe ya Dockers yakinnye na Al Ahly Shendi yomuri Sudani maze banganya 0-0 ku kibuga cyayo mbere yo kunganya na Shendi 1-1 mukibuga cyayo muri Sudani, bakuraho ikipe ifite icyicaro muri Sudani. Mu cyiciro cya kabiri, bashyizwe hamwe na US Ben Guardane womuri Tuniziya, maze bayikuraho muburyo nk'ubwo Ikipe yasezerewe muwi 1999. Yongeye kubyutswa mu 2004, iva mu makipe yohasi isubira muri shampiyona y'icyiciro cyambere. Iyikipe yageze kumukino wa nyuma mu gikombe cya Kenya muwi 1986 ariko itsindwa na Gor Mahia (yabashije kwegukana igikombe cya Afurika cy'abatsinze inatsinda irushanwa). \n 2015\n 2016\n 2019\n 2016"}
{"id": "21870", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21870", "title": "Maasai Football Federation", "text": "Ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru rya Maasai (MFF), rizwi kandi kw' izina ry'ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru rya Maasai, niryo shyirahamwe riyobora umupira w'amaguru mu baturage b'Abamasai bomuri Kenya na Tanzaniya. Icyicaro gikuru cyaryo kiri i Kiserian, muri Kenya.\nIshyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru ryashinzwe muwi 2006, ryabaye umunyamuryango w\u2019Inama Nshya y\u2019Amashyirahamwe y\u2019Umupira w\u2019Amaguru muri Werurwe uwomwaka. Perezida waryo ubu ni Godfrey Ole Ntapatia, naho Solomon Kisemei Ntooki akaba umunyamabanga mukuru waryo. \nIkipe y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru ya MFF igenzura ikipe y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru ihagarariye Abamasai, ikoresha Sitade ya Talek nk\u2019ikibuga cyayo cyambere, itarakina umukino uwari wowose mpuzamahanga, cyangwa ngoyinjire mu gikombe cy\u2019isi cya Viva. Iyikipe yagombaga kwitabira iki gikombe cyayo cyo mu 2008, ariko ntiyashoboye kubikora kubera impamvu zitazwi. "}
{"id": "21871", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21871", "title": "Mahakama F.C.", "text": "Mahakama Football Club nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru i Nairobi, muri Kenya. Yakinnye murwego rwo hejuru rw'umupira w'amaguru w'ababigize umwuga muri Kenya, shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere cya Kenya, ariko yamanukaga muri 2008. Yashinzwe muri 2000 kandi ni iy'Ubucamanza bwa Kenya (\"Mahakama\" ni Igiswahili mu \"gifaransa\"). \nMuri 2009 ikipe yatwaye igikombe cya Nationwide League, yongera kuzamurwa muri Premier League. "}
{"id": "21872", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21872", "title": "Mara Sugar", "text": "Mara Sugar Football Club nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ifite icyicaro mu Karere ka Narok, muri Kenya. Iyikipe ubiri mu irushanwa rya shampiyona ya Kenya, ikinira imikino yayo yambere ku kibuga cya sitade ya Sony Awendo Green kandi iterwa inkunga na Transmara Sugar Company. "}
{"id": "21873", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21873", "title": "Mathare United F.C.", "text": "Mathare United Football Club nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru y'umwuga ikorera i Nairobi, muri Kenya. Iyi kipe yakinnye muri Shampiyona y'Icyiciro cya Mbere cya Kenya (icyiciro cyohejuru cya shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru ya Kenya), ariko muri 2023, iyikipe yamanuriwe mucyiciro cyakabiri, National Super League. Yashinzwe muwi 1994, Mathare United yegukanye igikombe cyayo cya mbere cya shampiyona mu mwaka wa 2008. Iyi kipe ikina imikino yayo yanyuma mu kigo mpuzamahanga cya siporo cya Moi i Kasarani.\n 2008\n 1998, 2000\n 2009 - Icyiciro cy'ibanze\n 2002 - Icyiciro cya mbere\n 1999 - Icyiciro cya Kabiri\n 2001 - Icyiciro cya mbere\nMathare Youth FC.\nMathare Urubyiruko F.C. yabaye ikipigaburira Mathare United kugeza yazamuwe muri Premier League, ahoyabaye mukeba. Muri Kanama 2012, itsinda ryasheshwe. Shampiyona yiyi kipe yatewe inkunga na Triple5Bet, isosiyete ikora siporo muri Kenya.\nIhuriro ry'abagore.\nIyikipe ifite kandi ishami ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru w\u2019abagore ryitwa Mathare United Ladies' Football Club, ubikaba irushanwa muri shampiyona y\u2019abagore ya Kenya."}
{"id": "21874", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21874", "title": "Mathare Youth F.C.", "text": "Ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru y'urubyiruko ya Mathare yari ikipe ifite icyicaro i Nairobi muri Kenya. Yakinnye muri Shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere cya Kenya ariko imanuka muri 2008. Yaherukaga kwitabira shampiyona ya FKF, icyiciro cyagatatu cy'umupira w'amaguru muri Kenya.\nIyikipe yari iy'ishyirahamwe ry'urubyiruko rwa siporo rya Mathare. Iyikipe yarikipe ifasha Mathare United, kugeza igihe Mathare Youth yazamuwe muri Premier League.\nKw' itariki ya 31 Kanama 2012, ikipe yarasenyutse bityo ivamu cyiciro cya mbere cya FKF mu 2012, hanyuma ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru muri Kenya rifata icyemezo cyo gusesa ibyavuye mu cyiciro cya kabiri byose. Ibi bivuze kamakipe yose yakinnye nayo yakuweho amanota cyangwa agasubizwa amanota yayo, bitewe n\u2019ibyavuye mumikino, kandi imikino yose yari iteganyijwe yasubitswe."}
{"id": "21875", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21875", "title": "Mean Machine RFC", "text": "Mean Machine RFC nikipe y\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abakina umupira w\u2019amaguru i Nairobi muri Kenya. Ni uruhande ruhagarariye Kaminuza ya Nairobi kandi yashinzwe muwi 1977 mu gihe ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abakina umupira w\u2019amaguru muri Kenya ryakinwaga cyane n\u2019abazungu n\u2019abanyamahanga. Iyi kipe irimo abanyeshuri beza muri Kenya binjira muriyi kaminuza kandi baturuka mubigo bitandukanye bya Kaminuza nka Main Campus, Chiromo Campus, Parklands Campus, Lower Kabete Campus, Upper Kabete Campus, Kenya Science Campus ndetse na Mombasa Campus. Mumwaka wabo wambere, batwaye igikombe cya Kenya. Mean Machine yanatwaye shampiyona ya KRU inshuro ebyiri, muri 2018 na 2022 ndetse inatwara shampiyona yambere ya Varsity Cup League. Mumyaka ya 1980, iyi kipe yahatiwe gufungwa kubera igitutu cya politiki nyuma y\u2019igerageza rya coup d'\u00e9tat ryo mu 1982, kandi abakinnyi benshi bagombaga gukinira andi makipe. "}
{"id": "21876", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21876", "title": "Modern Coast Rangers F.C.", "text": "Mombasa United Fc nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ifite icyicaro i Mombasa muri Kenya. Iyikipe ubu iri mw' irushanwa rya shampiyona y'igihugu ya Kenya. \nAmateka.\nIyikipe yahoze yitwa Magongo Rangers, yaguze izina ryayo ubu muri 2013 nyuma y'amasezerano y'ubuterankunga na The Modern Coast Company. \nSitade.\nIkipe ubu ikinira imikino yayo yanyuma ku kibuga cya Refinery."}
{"id": "21877", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21877", "title": "Mombasa Municipal Stadium", "text": "Sitade ya Municipal ni sitade ifite intego nyinshi i Mombasa, muri Kenya. Ikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi yakirabantu 10.000. "}
{"id": "21878", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21878", "title": "Mt Kenya United F.C.", "text": "Mt Kenya United Football Club ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru y'ababigize umwuga i Nairobi muri Kenya. Iyikipe ubu iri mw' irushanwa rya shampiyona ya Kenya nyuma yogutsindira itike yokuva muri Kenyan National Super League iriku mwanya wakabiri inyuma ya Posta Rangers. \nIyikipe yahinduye izina ryayo iva kuri Nakumatt ijya kuri Mt Kenya United mu Gushyingo 2018. "}
{"id": "21879", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21879", "title": "Muhoroni Stadium", "text": "Sitade ya Muhoroni yahoze yitwa \"Sitade ya Biafra\" ni sitade ifite intego nyinshi i Muhoroni, muri Kenya. Yakoreshwaga cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi nisitade y'ikipe ya Muhoroni Youth yomuri Shampiyona y'Ubwongereza kuva muri 2012.\nIyisitade icumbikira abantu 20.000 kandi niya \"Muhoroni Youth Football Club\". Umufatanyabikorwa wa Clubs Champion ni Muhoroni Sugar Company yatanze ubutaka kubaturage. Nubwo iyi sosiyete mugucunga ubwishingizi bw'amasosiyete nuruganda rukora \"Brown Sugar\" rukomokamo \"isukari ya Muhoroni\"."}
{"id": "21880", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21880", "title": "Nemanja Milo\u0161evi\u0107", "text": "Nemanja Milo\u0161evi\u0107 (yavutse ku ya 4 Nyakanga 1987) ni umukinnyi wa basketball ukina nku wabigize umwuga muri mu gihugu cya Montenegine ndetse akaba yarakiniye na ikipe ya UGB BBC yo mu Rwanda.\nUmwuga w'ubunyamwuga.\nMilo\u0161evi\u0107 yatangiye umwuga we mu gihugu cye cy'amavuko, mu ikipe ya Podigorica ndetse banatwarana igikombe cya shampiyona.\nMu 2012, yasinye amasezerano na Mornar Bar. Mu Gushyingo 2012, yavuye i Mornar asinya amasezerano muri Bulugariya. \nKu ya 28 Nyakanga 2017, Milo\u0161evi\u0107 yasinye amasezerano n'ikipe yo muri Rumaniya yitwa ya CSM mu mwaka w'imikino wa 2017-18. "}
{"id": "21881", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21881", "title": "Patrick Rembert", "text": "Patrick Ronald Rembert (yavutse ku ya 9 Mata 1990) ni umukinnyi w\u2019abigize umwuga wa Basketball ukomoka muri amerika wakiniye ikipe ya United Generation Basketball (UGB BBC) muri Shampiyona y\u2019a basketaball Rwandakandi yakinnye basketball ya kaminuza muri UC kuva 2007 kugeza 2011.\nUmwuga wa kaminuza.\nNyuma yo kurangiza amasomo, ku ya 7 Kanama 2011, Rembert yasinye amasezerano na \u0160entjur wo muri shampiyona A yo solovakiya. Ubwo yari mu cyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza muri UC mu mwaka wa 2011-12, Rembert yatsinze amanota 12.2, agatsinda 3.3 na 3.3 byatanze imipira mu minota 33.1 mu mikino 32 yakinnye. \nubunyamwuga.\nKu ya 12 Ukuboza 2017, Rebert yatsinze amanota 45 mu mukino batsinzwemo na Tadamon Zouk ku manota 110-93. Ku ya 4 Kanama 2018, yasinye amasezerano na Lukoil Levski. "}
{"id": "21882", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21882", "title": "Rwanda Basketball Cup", "text": "Rwanda Basketball Cup ni igikombe cya Basketball mu Rwanda ahanini ni amarushanwa ya basketball mu ma kipe y'abagabo mu Rwanda. Iri rushanwa rigizwe n'amakipe yo muri shampiyona ya Basketball mu Rwanda ndetse n'icyiciro cya cyiciro cya 2 cya basketball mu Rwanda. Iri rushanwa ryatangijwe mu 2024 na FERWABA, naho APR BBC ni yo yatsinze ku nshuro ya mbere.\nAbatwaye iri rushanwa bemerewe kujya mu gikombe cya Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, irushanwa ryateguwe na FIBA.\nImiterere.\nRWanad Basketball Cup ni irushanwa ry'igikombe ritangirana n'itsinda ry'amakipe yo muri shampiyona ya Basketball mu Rwanda ndetse n'icyiciro cya cyiciro cya 2 cya basketball mu Rwanda noneho uwatsinze buri tsinda akomeza imikino yo kwishyura, ikinwa mu buryo bwo gukuranamo. Imikino ya kimwe cya kabiri ndetse n'isoza ikorwa muri wikendi imwe, kandi umukino wa gatatu urakinwa."}
{"id": "21884", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21884", "title": "Siporo y'urubyiruko muri Afurika", "text": "Siporo y'urubyiruko nurwego rurimo gukura muri Afurika, harimo no mu bihugu nka Nijeriya na Senegali.\nHockey yo mu kibuga.\nIshyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wa Hockey mur'Afurika ryagizigikombe cy'Afurika cy\u2019abagabo n\u2019icy\u2019abagore kuva mu 1988.\nUmupira w'intoki.\nAmakipe menshi y'igihugu y'Afurika y'abakiri bato n'ingimbi yitabiriyamarushanwa mpuzamahanga. Ayomarushanwa arimo:"}
{"id": "21885", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21885", "title": "Lutte Traditionnelle", "text": "Lutte Traditionnelle (mururimi rw'umwimerere \"rw'Umukino wo Gusiganwa kuMagurugakondo\") ni ubwoko bw'imikino yogusiganwa kumaguru yomur'Afurika y'Iburengerazuba, izwinka Laamb muri Senegali no muri Gambia, Evala muri Togo, na KoKowa / Kokawa mu turere twa Hausa muri Nijeriya na Nijeriya, cyangwa \"Lutte Traditionnelle\" gusa, muri Nijeriya na Burkina Faso. Irushanwa mpuzamahanga riba mu gihe cya Jeux de la Francophonie na.\nImpinduka.\nKuvamumyaka ya 1950, imigenzo myinshi yomur' Afurika y'Iburengerazuba yashyizwe muri Lutte Traditionnelle kuko yabaye imikino ikomeye y'abareba n'ibirori by'umuco. Itandukaniro rikomeye ryabaye Laamb, cyangwa imikino yo gusiganwa muri Senegal, yemerera gutera ibipfunsi (\"frappe\"), ari yo yonyine mu mico yo muri Afurika y'Iburengerazuba yabikoze. Kuberakwishyirahamwe rinini n'ubukombe bya Lutte Traditionnelle byateye imbere kuva mu myaka ya 1990, abarwanyi ba Senegal ububakora imyitozoyombi, yitwa \"Lutte Traditionnelle sans frappe\" (kuri verisiyo mpuzamahanga) na \"Lutte Traditionnelle avec frappe\" kuri verisiyo ikomeye. \nMuri Nijeriya, nomuturere twa Hausa muri Nijeriya, Kokawa yahindutse iyemewe kurwego rwa Afurika y'Iburengerazuba. Ahoniho igice cyoguterana cyashyizwe mwirushanwa ryihariye ryitwa Dambe. Byombi bikinirwa kumpande imwegakondo, nubwo Dambe yabaye ububiko bw'amatsinda y'abarwanyi bagenda. \nIntego.\nAbarwanyi babiribarushanwa muruziga, mubirori byemewe bihambiriwe n'imifuka y'umucanga. Buri murwanyi agerageza gusohora undimuruziga, nubwo bashobora gutsinda bakubita undihasi cyangwa bakamutera imipira ine. \nUmuryango mpuzamahanga.\nLutte Traditionnelle yakomeje kwiyongera mumiterere nogukundwa mubice byinshi by'Afurika y'Iburengerazuba kuvamumyaka ya 1980. Hamwe n'amarushanwa y'ibihugu mu bihugu byinshi, imiryango myinshi yateguye amarushanwa mpuzamahanga, ibyo bikaba byarasabye guhuza amategeko. Amarushanwa mpuzamahanga abamugihe cya Jeux de la Francophonie kandi kuva mu 2000, agenzurwa n'urwego ruhuza amakipe rutegura. Mu 2008, Umuryango w'Ubukungu w'Ibihugu bya Afurika y'Iburengerazuba (ECOWAS) wateguye shampiyona mpuzamahanga ya mbere ya Lutte Traditionnelle i Dakar, utumira amakipe aturutse mu bihugu cumi n'umwe: Senegal, Mali, Nijeri, Nijeri, Burkina Faso, Gineya, Gambia, Guin\u00e9e Bissau, Togo, Liberiya na La C\u00f4te d'Ivoire. Nijeria yatsinze irushanwa, ari na ryo rya mbere igihugu cy'Abongereza (hanze ya Gambia) gitsindiye irushanwa rikomeye rya Lutte. \nInzirayokwimukira muri Kanada yatumye abangavu b'abimukira bamenyera imikinoyogusiganwa muri Senegali, Mali na Mauritaniya mu mikino yo gusiganwa muri Kanada, ifite aho ihuriye n'imikino yo ku mugabane w'Amerika. "}
{"id": "21886", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21886", "title": "Urutonde rw'imikino gakondo muri Afurika", "text": "Harimikino gakondo itandukanye mur'Afurika. Irimubwoko butandukanye bwogusiganwa ku maguru, gusimbuka, kurwana inkoni, kubyina, imikino y\u2019ukwezi n\u2019imihango, koga, gusiganwa ku mafarashi, no gukirana, ndetse n\u2019imikino yo ku kibaho n\u2019imikino y\u2019urusimbi.\nInkomoko n'ubwoko bwayo.\nMugihecyambere y\u2019ubukoloni, abitabiraga imikinongororamubiri bashoboraga kugiricyubahiro, umwirondoro, n\u2019ububasha. Harubwoko bumweburimo gusiganwa kumaguru, gusimbuka, kurwana inkoni, kubyina, urumuri rw\u2019ukwezi n\u2019imikino y\u2019imihango, koga, gusiganwa ku mafarashi, no gusiganwa ku maguru. Murikigihe cyanyuma, abitabiriye bakundaga guhagararira umudugudu wabo cyangwa akarere kabo, bitoza kuva bakiri bato ibikorwa binini by\u2019umuryango. Ubuhanga mu mikorere bwakunze kujyana no guhiga, imirimo yo kuragira, gukusanya ibiryo, n\u2019abarwanyi. Mu bice bimwe na bimwe by\u2019umugabane siporo yafatwaga nk\u2019iy\u2019ingenzi cyane, mu bindi bitari ibyo, urugero muri Setswana umukino wa hafi bivuze \"umukino utari uw\u2019ingenzi\". Gusiganwa ku bwato byari bikunze kugaragara ku ruzi rwa Ubangi muri Afurika yo Hagati, kandi abarwanyi bakoraga imiheto, gutera amacumu, no gusiganwa ku nka. Siporo yari isanzwe ari iy\u2019abagabo, kandi ahanini yabuzaga abagore, uretse mu mbyino, no mu bihe bimwe na bimwe gusiganwa ku maguru.:\u200a41\u200aAriko imikino myinshi gakondo ntiyanditswe neza kandi yatsinzwe. \nUrusimbi rwarirusanzwe kandirwakunze gukinwa kuburyo bukomeye, ahwimikino yasobanurwaga muburyo bujyanye n'ikirere. Uturere twakunzwe cyane ninkombe za Guin\u00e9e na Afurika yo Hagati, ariko ubusanzwe rwarangwaga n'ibanga.:\u200a47\u20138\u200a\nUbutegetsi bw\u2019abakoloni bwabonaga kwaguka kwa siporo z\u2019i Burayi nk\u2019ingenzi ku \" butumwa bwazo bwo guteza imbere umuco \", kandimikino myinshigakondo yarazimye. Inzego z\u2019uburezi bw\u2019abakoloni zashyizeho gahunda yo kwigisha siporo zomu Burengerazuba bw\u2019isi, byatekerezwaga ko zishyira imbere \"imico myiza\", mugihe siporo gakondo yafatwaga nk' \"iya kera, iy\u2019ubusambanyi, kandi irwanya Ubukristo\". Hari aho amashuri y\u2019ivugabutumwa yashyigikiraga imikino gakondo yarifite amakipe y\u2019i Burayi yahafi. Irushanwa ry\u2019abatutsi \"ryo\" gusimbuka hejuru ryarubahwaga n\u2019abakoloni. Imikino y\u2019urusimbi nka \"abbia\" muri Kameruni yarahagaritswe.:\u200a50\u200a\nMugihe cyanyuma y\u2019ubukoloni, imikinoyomu Burengerazuba yashyizwe imberecyanekurusha imikino gakondo. Uburezi bw\u2019imyitozo ngororamubiri murikigihe buracyashingiye ahanini ku buryo bw\u2019ubukoloni/ubw\u2019iburengerazuba, kandi imikino gakondo ntabwo ikunze gushyirwa mu nteganyanyigisho. Ntamikino gakondo ibaho mumikino y'Afurika. Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Imikino gakondo n\u2019Imikino muri Afurika (ATSGC), ishami ry\u2019Inama Mpuzamahanga y\u2019Imikino gakondo n\u2019Imikino (ICTSG), rigamije kurinda imikino gakondo muri Afurika, kandi imikino gakondo ya mbere muri Afurika iteganijwe kubera i Swakopmund, muri Namibiya muri Kamena 2026. \nImikino itari iyo gukora imyitozo ngororamubiri.\nMancala yakinwe kugabane wose, kandi ifite amazina n'uburyo butandukanye, ku buryo yitwa \"umukino w'igihugu wa Afurika\".:\u200a17\u200a"}
