{"id": "21888", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21888", "title": "Komisiyo ya Siporo ya Leta ya Lagos", "text": "Komisiy'ishinzwe siporo ya Leta ya Lagos (LSSC) n'ikigo cy\u2019ingenzi cya leta gishinzwe iterambere n\u2019imicungire ya siporo muri Leta ya Lagos, muri Nijeriya. \nAmateka.\nKomisiyo ya Siporo ya Leta ya Lagos yashyizweho binyuze mu'itegeko (EO/AA01) kuya 17 Kamena 2015 na Akinwunmi Ambode, Guverineri wa Leta ya Lagos. Komisiyo yavuye mubiro bya siporo bya Minisiteri y'Urubyiruko, Siporo n'Iterambere ry'Imibereho Myiza (MYSSD) n'Inama Njyanama ya Siporo ya Leta ya Lagos. Amategeko agenga iyikomisiyo yashyizweho ubwo Guverineri yashyiragaho umukono kwitegeko riyigenga kuya 1 Gashyantare 2017. Ku ya 2 Gashyantare 20204, Guverineri wa Leta ya Lagos, Babajide Sanwo-Olu, yashyizeho Lekan Fatodu nk'umuyobozi mukuru wa Komisiyo ya Siporo ya Leta ya Lagos. \nIbikoresho bya siporo.\nStadia.\nInkomoko: \nAmashyirahamwe y'imikino.\nKomisiyigenzura amashyirahamwe 44 y\u2019imikino, ashinzwe cyanecyane iterambere ry\u2019imikino yo mu nzego z\u2019ibanze. "}
{"id": "21889", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21889", "title": "Gutera amacandwe ku matuza ya Kudu", "text": "Kudu dung-spitting (Bokdrol Spoeg mururimi rw'ikinyafurika) ni siporo ikorwa n'umuryango w'aba-Afrikaner mur'Afurika y'Epfo. Muri iryo rushanwa, uduce duto tw'amase y'impala zo mu bwoko bwa kudu turavurwa, aho intera ya kure cyane ari yo itsinda.\nGutera amacandwe kumatungo ya Kudu birakunzwe cyane kuburyo habahirushanwa ry\u2019isi ngarukamwaka, aho siporo yemewe yatangiye mu 1994. Amarushanwa abera mumasoko amwe n\u2019amwe y\u2019abaturage, mu maserukiramuco y\u2019imikino cyangwa mu birori by\u2019ubukerarugendo mu bihuru, Natal na Cape y\u2019Iburasirazuba. Bitandukanye n\u2019imikino myinshi isa nayo, intera ipimwa uhereye ku kimenyetso ugera aho amacandwe ahagarara, aho kuba aho yatangiriye kugwa. \nAgahigo k'isi muri uyumukino ni yashyizweho as of 2006 na Shaun van Rensburg wo muri Addo. Agahigo k'abagabo mu Bwongereza gafitwe na Dave Marshall kuri miliyoni 11.7 mu 2022, umukobwa we Harri akaba ari we wongeye kugiragahigo k'abagore kuri miliyoni 8.3 mu 2022. Bivugwa ko abahigi batangiye gukoresha utu duti mu marushanwa yo gucira amacandwe kugira ngo \"bihorere\" kumuhigo wabo, kuko kudu arinyamaswa isanzwe igoyeguhiga, kandi izwiho gusiga inzira y'utundi duti mugihe yashoboraga guhungumuhigi. \nSiporo \"zisa\".\nHarikandi inyandiko zigaragaza uburyo bwogutema amacandwe mu biti bya cherry, gutema imbuto z'imvura, gutema amacandwe mu biti bya prune, gutema amacandwe mu biti bya cricket y'umukara no gutema amacandwe mu mutobe w'itabi. Mu 2015, hashyizwehamarushanwa yogutema amacandwe y'intama mu Iserukiramuco rya Lady of The Lake ryabereye muri County Fermanagh muri Irilande y'Amajyaruguru. "}
{"id": "21890", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21890", "title": "Hockey yo mu rubura muri Afurika", "text": "Harahantu henshi hogukinira murubura mubihugu by'Afurika hakoreshwa muri hockey yomu rubura. Abakunda imikino bagiye bashinga amakipe y'ibihugu mu bihugu bitandukanye kandi hateganijwe igikombe cya mbere cy'ibihugu bya Afurika cya hockey yo mu rubura mu 2009. [\"Hakenewe isoko itari iy'ibanze\"] Igikombe cya mbere cya Afurika cya Hockey ku rubura cyari giteganyijwe kubera muri Afurika y'Epfo hagati ya 19-26 Nzeri 2009. Imikino ya shampiyona yagombaga gukinirwa ku kibuga cy'urubura cya \"Festival Shopping Centre\" i Kempton Park. Ibihugu bihanganye byagombaga kuba Afurika y'Epfo, Maroc na Alijeriya. Ariko, irushanwa ryasubitswe kubera ko ibihugu byatumiwe bitakiriye neza kandi ntibyigeze bikina. \nMu 2014, abakinnyi b'Abanyamisiri ba Anubis Ice Hockey Team, ikipe yambere ya hockey yomu Misiri yatangiye gukina igikombe cya mbere cy' Afurika hamwe n'ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru rya Royal Moroccan Ice Hockey Federation. Mu 2016, igikombe cya mbere cya Afurika cya Hockey Clubs Cup cyabereye i Rabat muri Maroc hagati ya tariki ya 24 na 31 Nyakanga. Shampiyona yakinwe hagati y'amakipe 6 yomu Misiri, Maroc, Tuniziya na Alijeriya. Amakipe ya Kenya, Libiya n'Afurika y'Epfo nayo yari yatumiwe ariko ntiyitabira. Iki gikombe cyatsinzwe n'ikipe ya Tuniziya.\nAfurika y'Amajyepfo.\nAfurika y'Epfo.\nMur'Afurika y'Epfo, uyumukino uyoborwan'Ishyirahamwe ry'Umukino wa Hockey ku Rubura muri Afurika y'Epfo. Ikipe y'igihugu ya Hockey ku Rubura muri Afurika y'Epfo yabayumunyamuryango w'Ishyirahamwe Mpuzamahanga rya Hockey ku Rubura (IIHF) kuva mu 1937 kandi ishobora kuba ari yo gihugu cya mbere cya Hockey ku Rubura kuri uyu mugabane aho abakinnyi bayo benshi banakina Hockey ku Rubura muri Amerika. Afurika y'Epfo yakinnye bwambere kurwego mpuzamahanga itsindwa na Yugoslavia ibitego 12-3 mu itsinda rya C mu irushanwa ry'Isi rya Hockey ku Rubura ryo mu 1961. Amakipe ya Super League yo mur'Afurika y'Epfo arimo Johannesburg Wildcats, Pretoria Capitals na Cape Town Kings. \nAfurika y'Amajyaruguru.\nAlijeriya.\nAlijeriya yabayabanyamuryango ba IIHF ku ya 26 Nzeri 2019. Mur'Alijeriya hari ikibuga kimwe cy\u2019urubura. Hockey yo mu rubura muri Alijeriya iyoborwa na Hockey muri Alijeriya. Alijeriya ubu ifite ikipe imwe ya Hockey, HC Alger Corsaires mur'Algiers n\u2019ishuri rya Hockey muri Setif.\nMisiri.\nMisiri ifitahantu 11 hokurira urubura mumijyi 6 muntara esheshatu zitandukanye. [\"Hakenewe isoko ritari iry'ibanze\"]\nMaroke.\nIgihugu cya Maroc cyomumajyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bw'Afurika gifitamakipe menshi ya hockey yomurubura nka Capitals, Ifis na Falcons bakoresha ikibuga cy'ubucuruzi mwiduka rinini i Rabat. Hockey yomurubura iyoborwa muri Maroc n'ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru rya Royal Moroccan, kugeza ubu rikaba ari umunyamuryango wungirije wa IIHF kuva mu 2010. Ikipe y'igihugu ya Maroc ya hockey yo mu rubura yahagarariye igihugu cyabo mugikombe cy'igikombe cya Hockey yo mu barabu cyo mu 2008, i Dubai. \nTuniziya.\nIkibuga cyambere cya Tuniziya cyogukinira kurubura kiri kukibuga cya Blue Ice muri resort ya Yasmine Hammamet. Ikipe y'igihugu ya Tuniziya ya Hockey irigushingwa n'umukinnyi wa Hockey wo mu Bufaransa witwa Ihab Ayed, kandi iyoborwa n'ishyirahamwe rya Hockey yo mu Rubura rya Tuniziya Ikipe ya Tuniziya 'Carthage Eagles' niyo yatwaye igikombe cyambere cya Afurika.\nAfurika y'Iburasirazuba.\nKenya.\nMu 2005, ikibuga cy'urubura cy'izuba cyafunguwe muri Hoteli ya Panari i Nairobi, muri Kenya. [\"Hakenewe isoko ritari iry\u2019ibanze\"] Amashuri menshi yomuri Kenya yagaragajeko ashishikajwe no gushinga amakipe ya hockey yomurubura. Abakinnyi ba hockey bo muri Djibouti bazwiho kwitabira imikino imwe n\u2019imwe ya hockey yo mu rubura mu bindi bihugu bya Afurika. "}
{"id": "21891", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21891", "title": "Ghana Badminton", "text": "Ghana Badminton n'urwego rw'igihugu ruyobora badminton muri Ghana. Bashinzwe guhagararira, guhuza, kuyobora, kwamamaza no guteza imbere siporo kubufatanye bwa hafi n'inzego zifitanye isano. Ishyirahamwe rya Ghana Badminton ryibanda ku marushanwa yo mu nzego z'ibanze ndetse no guteza imbere Abanya-Ghana kugira ngo bajye mu marushanwa mu mikino Olempike, imikino ya Commonwealth, n'imikino Paralempike. Ishyirahamwe ry'igihugu ryashinzwe mu 1962, rikorana n'abaterankunga b'ibigo kugira ngo bategure ibirori mugace batuyemo no guteza imbere abakinnyi b'abahanga, abayobozi ba tekiniki, n'abatoza.\nIshyirahamwe ry'Igihugu n'umunyamuryango washinze Ishyirahamwe ry'Umukino wa Badminton muri Afurika, rikaba n'umunyamuryangushamikiye ku Ishyirahamwe ry'Isi rya Badminton (BWF). Murwego rwoguteza imbere uyumukino, ritanga gahunda z'amashuri abanza, ayisumbuye, n'ayisumbuye, badminton y'inararibonye itangwa n'amashuri, amakipe y'abaturage n'ay'uturere, iterambere ry'ubutoza ku rwego rw'igihugu, n'ibikorwa by'ingenzi.\nBa Perezida.\nKuva ryashingwa mu 1962, Ishyirahamwe rya Badminton ryo muri Ghana rimaze kugira abaperezida barindwi. "}
{"id": "21892", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21892", "title": "ESPN Afurika", "text": "ESPN Africa (izina rya ESPN) n'umuyoboro w\u2019imikino wa televiziyo yishyurwa muri Afurika ufitwe na ESPN Inc., ikigo gihuriweho na The Walt Disney Company (ifitimigabane ingana na 80%) na Hearst Communications (ifite 20%) isigaye, cyatangijwe mu 2008 nka Setanta Sports gisubizwa izina muri Kanama 2014 nka Fox Sports, gisimbura Setanta Sports na Setanta Action. Uyu muyoboro ukorera mur'Afurika yomunsi y\u2019ubutayu bwa Sahara mu Cyongereza n\u2019Igifaransa. Mbere yaho wabonekaga mugihegito mu 2016 mu Giporutugali.\nIyi channel ikomoka ku sosiyete itanga uburenganzira bwogukina yashinzwe n'umunyamakuru wa siporo womur'Afurika y'Epfo Barry Lambert, wahoze ari TVAfrica, yitwa LIM Africa, yajekwitwa Setanta Africa nyuma y'amasezerano na Setanta yabahaye uburenganzira bwo gukoresha ikirango ndetse banashinga urubuga rwomur'Afurika muri Kanama 2008. Iyi channel yakabiri, Setanta Action, yatangiye mu Gushyingo 2012, itangaza indi mikino cyane cyane imikino yo kurwana. Iyi channels yaguzwe na Fox International Channels mu Gushyingo 2013, naho muri Kanama 2014, Setanta Africa iba Fox Sports naho Setanta Action iba Fox Sports 2. Ku ya 30 Kanama 2019, amezi menshi nyuma y'uko Disney iguzumutungo munini wa Fox wo mu kinyejana cya 21, iyi channels n'urubuga byashyizwe munsi y'ikirango cya ESPN. \nGahunda zayo zibanda cyanecyane kumupira w'amaguru womuri Eredivisie, Premiership ya Ecosse, Belgian Pro League na English Football League. Uyumuyoboro wamazigihe kinini utangaza amarushanwa yomur'Amerika y'Epfo ya Copa Libertadores na Copa Sudamericana muri Afurika kugeza ubwo uburenganzira bwemejwe mu 2017. [\"Icyitonderwa kirakenewe\"]\nNanonibiganiro: NBA, NFL, NHL, MLB, NCAA, PFL, NRL rugby league na Basketball Africa League.\nMbereyaho, nk'ikigocya Setanta Africa cyarigifitwe n'Abanya-Irlande, ikigo cyatangazaga umupira w'amaguru wa GAA, hamwe n'umupira w'amaguru wa League of Ireland.\nMuri Kanama 2019, byatangajwe kururubuga ruzahindura izina rukamenyekana nka ESPN Africa ku ya 30 Kanama 2019, bitewe n'uko Disney yaguze sosiyete ya 21st Century Fox. \nPorogaramu.\nUmupira w'amaguru.\nInkomoko: "}
{"id": "21893", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21893", "title": "Siporo muri Cape Verde", "text": "Mumyaka yashize, Cape Verde yazamutse cyane mubice byinshi by'imikino.\nAmateka.\nUmukino wambere watangiriye ku kirwa cya S\u00e3o Vicente mu ntangiriro z'ikinyejana cya 20, umwe mu mikino ya mbere yazanywe kuri icyo kirwa warumukino wa tenisi na golf wazanywe n'Abongereza n'abagenzi banyura muri Cape Verde. Nyuma wageze i Santiago ahumurwamukuru w'abakoloni wari uherereye na Sal.\nGukoresha umupira w'amaguru n'uw'ingufu mu kuzunguza mukirere (Windsurfing) byarushijeho kwiyongera mugukoreshwa nogukundwa muri Cape Verde muri iki gihe.\nUmupira w'amaguru.\nUmupira w'amaguru niwomukino ukunzwe cyane muri Cape Verde kandumaze imyakamyinshi ubaho. Muri iki gihe ni kimwe mubihugu bike bidakoresha uburyobusanzwe bwokugabana amakipe (urugero: Gambia, ikindi gihugu gito gikoresha uburyo bw'igihugu bwo kugabana amakipe kandi gifite amakipe y'icyiciro cya mbere n'icya kabiri), ikindi gihugu gito ni S\u00e3o Tom\u00e9 na Pr\u00edncipe gikoresha uburyo bumwe na Cape Verde, ariko uburyo Cape Verde yakoresheje kugeza mu myaka ya 1990 ifitimikino ya shampiyona y'igihugu gusa, uwatsinze buri kirwa yitabira shampiyona y'igihugu, rimwe na rimwe iyo uwatsinze ikirwayatwaye shampiyona kukoyatwaye igikombe cy'igihugu mu mwaka ushize w'imikino, ikipe ya kabiri yitabira, uwatsinze irushanwa ry'igihugu yitabira mu mwaka ukurikiyeho w'imikino. Icya mbere cyabaye mu 1953 kandi ni Shampiyona y'Abakoloni yabaye kugeza mu 1974 ubwo Cape Verde yari iyobowe na Porutugali. Nyuma y'uko Cape Verde yigenga mu 1975, yakoze icya mbere mu 1976, amarushanwa atatu ya shampiyona yarahagaritswe, icya mbere cyari ikibazo cyokubona uwatsinze uturutse muri Sotavento, muruwo mwaka, ibindi birwa byitabiriye shampiyona y'igihugu. Mindelense kandi niyifite ibikombe byinshi by\u2019igihugu aho ifite 12.\nShampiyona y\u2019akarere ya mbere yari S\u00e3o Vicente, iyambere yabaye mu 1938. Mindelense yegukanye ibikombe byinshi bigera kuri 48, ikaba ariyo shampiyona y\u2019akarere kanini kurusha izindi zose ku isi. Shampiyona ya Santiago Island ni iya kabiri ishampiyona ya kera cyane kandi kuva mu 2001 no kumugaragaro kuva mu 2003, yagabanyijwemo ibice bibiri. Harishampiyona 11 mu birwa 9, bibiri biri mu turere tw\u2019Amajyaruguru n\u2019Amajyepfo. Cape Verde ifite amakipe y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru arenga 100. Shampiyona y\u2019ingimbi ibera mubirwa byinshi.\nIgihugugifite kandi igikombe, igikombe cya super cup n'irushanwa rifungura muri buri karere, Santiago North Zone ntabwo ifite aya marushanwa. Ikigocya Cape Verdean Cup cyabaye ku nshuro ya mbere mu 2007, cyabaye inshuro enye kugeza mu 2012, nyuma kirahagarikwa. Uwatwaye igikombe muri buri kirwa yakinnye. Maio yakinnye kabiri naho Brava yakinnye rimwe. Santiago North ntiyigeze irushanwa. Haramarushanwa 11 y'ibikombe, Santiago North ntayifite, Santo Ant\u00e3o ifite Zone zombi zombi zomumajyaruguru n'Amajyepfo kandi kuva mu 2016, ku rwego rw'akarere.\nIrushanwa rya Cape Verdean Super Cup ryabaye mu 2013, rikaba ryarabaye kunshuro yambere, shampiyona yariifitigikombe cyatwaye, Sporting Praia yegukana igikombe cyayocyonyine, nyuma y'umwaka umwe shampiyona yahuye n'igikombe cya super cup cyatwaye umwaka ushize, Mindelense yegukana igikombe cyayo cyonyine mu mwaka uheruka wa 2014.\nIkipe yambere yahatanye kurwego rw'Afurika ni Sporting Praia mu 1993, nyuma y'imyaka myinshi Cape Verde ibaye umunyamuryango wa CAF. Amakipe atanu yitabiriye harimo Sporting Praia, Mindelense, FC Derby, Boavista Praia na Travadores, ikipe imwegusa ya SC Atl\u00e9tico ni yo yakuwe mu ikipe mu 1992 bitewe nuko ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru ritavuzezina ry'uwayitabiriye kugihe.\nMindelense niyo kipe yakera cyane muri Cape Verde. Ifitekandi ikipe yomuburengerazuba bwa Afurika yose yitwa Tarrafal de Monte Trigo, ikipentoya n'iyindi nshya yitabiriye Santo Ant\u00e3o South Zone mu mwaka wa shampiyona wa 2013-14.\nAmarushanwa yogutangiza (Igikombe cy\u2019ishyirahamwe mubirwa bimwe na bimwe) agirigice kimwe n\u2019ikipe ihura rimwe, andi agira ibyiciro bitatu cyangwa bine kurusha umukino wa nyuma.\nHanohari ibibugabyinshi byumupira wamaguru, Est\u00e1dio da V\u00e1rzea muri Praia, umurwamukuru niwo ukoreshwa cyane, uwa kabiri ni Mindelo wa Est\u00e1dio Municipal Ad\u00e9rito Sena niwo wa kabiri ukoreshwa cyane. Santiago ifitibibuga byumupira wamagurucyane. Boa Vista, Maio na Brava bafite ikibuga kimwegusa.\nUmupira w'amaguru.\nUmukino wa Basketball niwomukino wa kabiri ukunzwe cyane mu gihugu, ukumenyekana gukomeje kwiyongera muri iki gihe. Uyumunsi nikimwe mubihugubike bidakoresha uburyo busanzwe bwo gutandukanya amakipe, ikindi gihugu gito ni S\u00e3o Tom\u00e9 na Pr\u00edncipe gikoresha uburyo bumwe na Cape Verde, ariko uburyo Cape Verde yakoresheje kugeza mu myaka ya 1990 bufite umukino wa shampiyona y'igihugu gusa, uwatsinze burikirwa yitabira shampiyona y'igihugu, rimwe na rimwe iyuwatsinze ikirwa yatwaye igikombe ubwoyatwaraga igikombe cy'igihugu mu mwaka ushize w'imikino, ikipe ya kabiri irushanwa, uwatsinze irushanwa ry'igihugu arushanwa mu mwaka ukurikira.\nShampiyona yabanje kubanyuma y'ubwigenge.\nADESBA niyoyonyine yatwaye igikombe kurwego rw'umugabane w'Afurika mu 2015. \nIndorerwamo zo mu mazi n'umuyaga.\nGukinamafi ntibikorerwa muri Kapu-Verde. Indimikino ifitanye isano nka kite na wind surfing ikunze kugaragara muri Kapu-Verde. Yatangijwe mu gihe cy'ubwigenge kandi yari yiganje cyane mu kirwa cya S\u00e3o Vicente. Nyuma y'intambwe z'ikinyejana cya 20, ubu bwoko bw'imikino bwari bukomeje kwiyongera mu bindi birwa cyane cyane Sal na Boa Vista bifitumucanga mwinshi n'ibirunga by'imisozi hamwe n'imiterere yabyo isa n'ubutayu. Abenshi muribo bari bamukerarugendo. Gukundwa kwayo kwakomeje kwiyongera mu myaka yashize mubirwa bibiribyo muburasirazuba ahanini n'abakerarugendo. Byatumye Sal na Boa Vista biba ibisanzwe mu gukina amafi na wind surfing mugihugu kandi kugeza na n'ubu.\nFutsal.\nFutsal, siporo yavukiye muri Brezili, ikomejegukundwa cyane muri Cape Verde.\nGolf.\nIkibuga gitocya golf giherereye hafi 3\u00a0km mumajyepfo ya Mindelo mukirwa cya S\u00e3o Vicente kandi ni cyo cya mbere cyabaye muri Cape Verde. Hateganijwe andimakipe ya golf cyane cyane mu kirwa cya Sal ndetse hafi ya Salamansa.\nVolleyball.\nVolleyball nundi mukino ubera muri Cape Verde.\nCape Verde yari ifitikipe y'igihugu y'abagore mumukino wa volleyball yokumucanga yitabiriye igikombe cya CAVB Beach Volleyball Continental Cup 2018\u20132020. \nIndi mikino.\nIndimikino ikoreshwa murikigihugu ni Tennis na Cricket. Tennis iri kugenda ikundwa cyane n'abakinnyi mu myaka ya vuba aha. Indirimbo zizwi cyane muri iki gihugu ni i Praia's V\u00e1rzea mu burengerazuba n'indi i Mindelo. Badminton muri Cape Verde ntabwo ikunzekugaragara.\nCricket ni ndi siporo, imwe mumikino yambere yazanywe muri Cape Verde mukirwa cya S\u00e3o Vicente. Icyo gihe, yakundwaga cyane n'Abongereza mu mpera z'ikinyejana cya 19 no mu myaka ya 1900 ubwo ubwato bwari bumaze gushya no kongeramo lisansi muri Porto Grande Bay. Cricket iracyakunzwe na n'uyu munsi ariko ntabwo ikunzwe cyanenkomuri icyogihe, igice kinini cy'iyi siporo kiri ku kirwa cya S\u00e3o Vicente, ikipe ya cricket iriho ubu ni GS Castilho."}
{"id": "21894", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21894", "title": "Urutonde rw'ibibuga bya sitade byo muri Afurika hakurikijwe ubushobozi bwabyo", "text": "Urutonde rw'ibibuga by'imikino mur'Afurika rukurikira. Biteguwe hakurikijwe ubushobozi bwabyo, ni ukuvuga umubare ntarengwa w'abareba sitade ishobora kwakira. Ibibuga byinshi binini muri Afurika bikoreshwa mu mupira w'amaguru (umupira w'amaguru), bimwe binakoreshwa mu mikino ngororamubiri na rugby. Ibibuga byo mur' Afurika bifitubushobozi bwo kwakira abantu 30.000 cyangwa barenga birimo. Soccer City i Johannesburg ubu niyo sitade nini muri Afurika kuva aho ubushobozi bwayo bwongerewe bukagera ku bantu 94.700 mu gikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cyo mu 2010. Iki gikorwa, cyabaye muri Kamena-Nyakanga, nibwo bwambere igihugu cy'Afurika cyakiriye igikombe cy'isi. Imikino Olempike ntiyigeze ibera mur'Afurika. "}
{"id": "21895", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21895", "title": "Siporo muri Afurika", "text": "Siporo mur'Afurika irateguwe, imikinomyinshi ifite shampiyona z\u2019umwuga. Umupira w\u2019amaguru (uzwi kandi kwizina rya ruhago) niwomukino ukunzwe cyane mu bihugu hafi ya byose bya Afurika. Ibihugu bimwe bya Afurika, nka Kenya na Etiyopiya, byiganje cyane mukwiruka intera ndende, mu gihe ibihugu bya Afurika y\u2019Amajyaruguru nka Alijeriya, Misiri, Maroc na Tuniziya byiganje mu mukino wa handball. Rugby na golf bikunzwe cyane mu bihugu bike bya Afurika, nubwo rugby ikunzwe cyane mur'Afurika y\u2019Epfo. \nSiporo gakondo yasuzugurwaga cyane mugihe cy'ubukoloni, kandimyinshi irimogupfa cyangwa yarazimye kubera igitutu cyo kuvugurura, ariko nyinshi ziracyakunzwe nubwonta burenganzira cyangwa inkunga bya leta bifite.:\u200a193\u2013194\u200aMu 2010, Afurika y'Epfo yabaye igihugu cya mbere cya Afurika cyakiriye igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA. \nAmateka.\nAfurika ifiteamateka maremare y\u2019imikino gakondo. Ubukoloni bw\u2019i Burayi kuvamumpera z\u2019ikinyejana cya cumi n\u2019icyenda bwazanye imikino yo mu Burengerazuba bw\u2019isi ku mugabane, mu gihe bwagabanyaga imikorere y\u2019imikino yomugace, Abanyaburayi babonaga nk\u2019imikino ishaje kandi irwanya Abakristo. \nSiporo mur'Afurika mbere y\u2019ikinyejana cyamakumyabiri hagati yakinwaga cyane cyane n\u2019Abanyaburayi. Ibi byakoreshejwe mu gukomeza gutandukanya ibyiciro by\u2019imibereho by\u2019amoko yombi. Uburezi rusange bwa siporo bwashyizwe mu bikorwa mumijyi y\u2019uturere tw'Afurika kugira ngo \"bube heza\" kandi bunoze umusaruro w\u2019abaturage b\u2019Abanyaburayi. Uko urubyaro rw\u2019abahanga b\u2019i Burayi n\u2019abasangwabutaka bakurikiranaga uburezi, bamenyekanye mu mikino yari yaragenewe abimukira b\u2019i Burayi. Aho ngaho, benshi muri bo babaye indashyikirwa maze baba \"Inyenyeri za Siporo z\u2019Abanyaburayi\" kandi bubahwaga kubera ubwitange bwabo bwiza. Abo bakinnyi bashyizwe mu makipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019Ubwongereza n\u2019Ubufaransa kuko hari ubushobozi bwo kugaragaza ubuhanga bwabo mu mikino. Kuvicyogihe, uturere tw'Afurika twari twarakolonijwe twahagarariwe mu ruhando mpuzamahanga rwa siporo. Abakinnyi b\u2019abahanga muturere twa Afurika tuvuga Icyongereza n\u2019Igifaransa bitwaga \"abasadukayo b\u2019indashyikirwa.\" Akenshi babaga abana b\u2019abasirikare bo muri Senegali bitwaga tirailleurs cyangwa abasirikare.\nNyuma y'Intambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose, nomugihe cyogusana imipaka y'Uburayi, Ubwongereza n'Ubufaransa byagoranye kugumana koloni zabo, cyane cyane bitewe n'ubwikunde bw'igihugu. Nyuma y'uko Umuryango w'Ibihugu ushingwa, Ubwongereza n'Ubufaransa byiyemeje gukurikiza amahame y'ubutegetsi bwiza, yavugaga ko abaturage bafituburenganzira bwo kwihitiramo ubuyobozi bwabo. Mbere y'Intambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose irangiye, Afurika yafashe iya mbere kugira ngo yigenge ku burere bwa gikolonize bwashyizweho n'Ubwongereza n'Ubufaransa. Gushyira siporo mu mahanga byashingiye cyane ku bikorwa byo kwirukana ubukoloni, hamwe no kwinjizwa mu mikino Olempike. Afurika yakoresheje siporo nk'uburyo bwo kurwanya ivanguramoko no kurandura ivanguramoko rishingiye ku mwanya w'abaturage. Ubwo \"abagome b'abanyacyubahiro\" bagendaga bakundwa, abanyacyubahiro b'Abanyafurika bakoresheje aya mahirwe yo kurwanya ivanguramoko no guteza imbere siporo zomur'Afurika gusa, ahubwo no gushushanya ishusho ya Afurika nshya yigenga.\nIgihe cya none.\nMu 1956, umupiraw'amaguru waranzwe n'iterambere muri Afurika ubwo hashingwaga ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru mur'Afurika. Ubumwe bw'Afurika bwagaragajwe binyuze mu mikino, ariko bwagenzurwaga n'amashyirahamwe y'imikino yo mu Burengerazuba nka FIFA. Nyamara, mu mikino Olempike ya Roma yomu 1960, abakinnyi b'abirabura b'Abanyafurika bagize icyo bageraho mu nzego zabo, ndetse banatsinda imyanya ikomeye mumpera z'irushanwa. Siporo yatumy'Afurika irushaho gushakubwigenge, kandi muriki gih'Afurika izwicyane mumikino myinshi, cyane cyane mu mupira w'amaguru. \nIbikorwaremezo.\nKutagira icyo bivuzemur'Afurika mumikino mpuzamahanga biterwa no kutagira ibikorwa remezo. [\nSiporo y'ikipe.\nIshyirahamwe ry'Umupira w'Amaguru.\nUmupira w'amaguru w'ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru (uzwi kandi ku izina rya football) ni wo mukino ukunzwe cyane muriburigihugu cya Afurika. Amakipe y'amakipe yomur'Afurika yitabira igikombe cya CAF Champions League na CAF Confederation Cup. Amakipe y'ibihugu by'Afurika yitabira igikombe cya Afurika ndetse no mu irushanwa ry'ibihugu bya Afurika kumakipe yomugace.\nUmupira wa baseball.\nBaseball ntabwigaragara cyane mur'Afurika. Ariko, Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Isi rya Baseball Softball ryatangije Baseball5, ubwoko bwa baseball bwomumuhanda, hamwe n\u2019ibihugu icyenda byashinze, [a] mu rwego rwo kumenyekanisha uyumukino kumugabane. \nUmupira w'amaguru.\nUmukino wa Basketball nawukunzwe kumugabane wose, ahowagaragaye cyanemuri Nijeriya, Tuniziya, Misiri, Senegali, Ivory Coast, Kameruni na Angola, ndetse no muri Cape Verde na Sudani y'Epfo. \nUmunya-Nigeria Hakeem Olajuwon (watwayigikombe cya NBA inshurebyiri mwikipe ya Houston Rockets) n'umwe mubakinnyi b'abanyamahanga beza mumateka ya NBA kandafatwa nk'ingenzi mu guteza imbere nogukurura umupira wa Basketball muri Afurika.\nCricket.\nCricket n'umukino ukunzwe cyanemu Bwongereza kandiwoherejwe mubindibice by'ubwami bwahoze ari Ubwongereza. Cricket ifitinkomoko mumajyepfo y'uburasirazuba bw'Ubwongereza. Ikunzwe cyane mu Bwongereza na Pays de Galles, no mu bice by'Ubuholandi, no mu bindi bice by'isi, cyane cyane mumajyepfo y'Afurika, Ositaraliya, Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande no ku mugabane w'Ubuhinde. Ikinwa kugira ngo igerageze urwego rwa Cricket muri Afurika y'Epfo na Zimbabwe, kandi umusaruro ugaragara muri Kenya na Namibiya.\nHoki yo mu kibuga.\nUmukino wa Hockey wo mu kibuga ukunzwe muturere twahoze arutw\u2019Ubwongereza mur'Afurika, ukaba waragaragaye cyane muri Misiri, Nijeriya, Gana, Kenya, Namibiya, Botswana, Zimbabwe cyane cyane muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo.\nHockey yo mu rubura.\nHockey yomurubura n'umukino w\u2019abantu bake mur'Afurika, ahwibihugu bike by'Afurika byitabira. \nIshyirahamwe ry'abakina rugby.\nIshyirahamwe ry\u2019abakina rugby rikunzwe cyane mur'Afurika y'Epfo (inshuro 4 z'abatwaye igikombe cy'isi mu 1995, 2007, 2019 na 2023) kandi ibindi bihugu bifite umusaruro ugaragara nka Maroc, Namibiya, Zimbabwe na Ivory Coast. Irushanwa rikomeye ku mugabane ni Igikombe cya Afurika kirimo amakipe yokurwego rwambere rwa rugby mur'Afurika, naho Igikombe cy\u2019iterambere rya Afurika kirimo amakipe yokurwego rwa kabiri. Ikipe ya rugby yo muri Afurika y'Epfo ni yo yonyine yitabira irushanwa mpuzamahanga, The Rugby Championship. Inyandiko ya Albert Grundlingh ivuga kungaruka siporo yagizekubwenegihugu, cyanecyane uburyo rugby yahinduye imiterere y\u2019aba-Afrikaner kurugero runaka. Kaminuza ya Stellenbosch yasobanuwe nk'\"ikipe ikomeye\" ya rugby yo muri Afurika y'Epfo yari irwanya kaminuza zivuga Icyongereza zigaragaza \"umuzi wa Afrikandom\". \nIndi mikino.\nUmupira w'intoki na volleyball birakunzwe cyane cyane mur'Afurika y'Amajyaruguru. Indimikino yo mumakipe nka polo yomumazi, hockey yo mubwoko bwa roller na netball nayikunzwe mubihugu bimwe na bimwe byo mu Burasirazuba n'Amajyepfo byo muri Afurika.\nSiporo ku giti cy'umuntu ku giti cye.\nSiporo kugiti cy\u2019umuntu kugiti cye nayoningenzi cyane. Afurika ifitirushanwa rikomeye ry\u2019imikino myinshi ryitwa All-Africa Games ryatangiye mu 1965 ryabereye i Brazzaville, Repubulika ya Kongo.\nSiporo.\nSiporo ni rimwe mumarushanwa akomeye mur'Afurika. Irirushanwa ryabaye igice cy\u2019imikino ya Afurika kuvamu 1965. Shampiyona ya Siporo mur'Afurika yabanje kuba kabiri mumwaka kuva mu 1979. Shampiyona ya Afurika yo gusiganwa ku maguru yabanje kuba mu 1985 nyuma yaho kuva mu 2011. Shampiyona ya Afurika yo kwiruka mu misozi yabanje kuba kuva mu 2009.\nByongeye kandi, amarushanwa menshi ya IAAF World Cross Country Championships yabereye muri Afurika. Irushanwampuzamahanga rya Meeting International Mohammed VI d'Athl\u00e9tisme de Rabat ryabereyemuri Maroc kuvamu 2008 nk'igice cya IAAF World Challenge na IAAF Diamond League. Mbereyaho, Meeting Grand Prix IAAF de Dakar yarigice cya IAAF Grand Prix na IAAF World Challenge. Marathon ya Cape Town yabayirushanwa rya IAAF Silver Label mu 2014 n'irushanwa rya IAAF Gold Label mu 2017.\nKenya na Etiyopiya byagaragaye cyane mumikino ngororamubiri mumikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi kuva mumyaka ya 1960, cyane cyane mu kwiruka intera yo hagati n'iy'intambwe ndende.\nKugendera ku igare.\nIrushanwa ry\u2019amagare ryomumuhanda rya UCI Africa Tour ryatangiye kuba kuva mu 2005.\nIkipe ya Dimension Data, yahoze ari MTN\u2013Qhubeka, niyokipe yambere y\u2019Abanyafurika yinjiye muri Grand Tours mu 2015. Abagize ikipe bazwi barimo Jacques Janse van Rensburg na Youcef Reguigui.\nKenya n'u Rwanda biri kwiyongera mu gusiganwa ku magare ku isi. \nGolf.\nGolf numukino ukunzekugaragara mur'Afurika. The Sunshine Tour ifite icyicaro mur'Afurika y'Epfo ariko inasura ibindi bihugu by'abaturanyi. Amarushanwa menshi yemejwe n'irushanwa ry'i Burayi, nka South African Open, South African PGA Championship, Alfred Dunhill Championship, Nedbank Golf Challenge, Africa Open, Joburg Open, Tshwane Open,\nAbakinnyi ba golf bazwi cyane mur'Afurika barimo Bobby Locke, wegukanyigikombe cya British Open inshurenye mu 1949, 1950, 1952 na 1957; Gary Player, wegukanye igikombe cya British Open mu 1959, 1968 na 1974, The Masters mu 1961, 1974 na 1978, PGA Championship mu 1962 na 1972 na US Open mu 1965; Ernie Els, wegukanye igikombe cya US Open mu 1994, 1997 na British Open mu 2002 ; Nick Price, wegukanye igikombe cya PGA Championship mu 1992 na 1994 na British Open mu 1994; Retief Goosen ; Trevor Immelman ; Louis Oosthuizen na Charl Schwartzel.\nSiporo y'imodoka.\nSiporo y'imodoka ikunzwecyane mur'Afurika y'Epfo. Ikigihugu cyakiriye amasiganwa mpuzamahanga menshi, nka Grand Prix yo muri Afurika y'Epfo (Formula One), Grand Prix yo muri Afurika y'Epfo (Grand Prix) yo gusiganwa ku magare ya moto, n'ibindi. Grand Prix yo muri Maroc ni yo Grand Prix ya mbere mur'Afurika yakiriye Formula 1 mu 1958.\nSafari Rally yarimwemu marushanwa y\u2019isi ya Rally kuvamu 1973 kugezamu 2002, mbereyo kugaruka mu 2021. Mbere Rallye C\u00f4te d'Ivoire nayo yaberaga nk'irushanwa rya WRC kuva mu irushanwa ry\u2019isi rya Rally ku bashoferi n'abakora kuva mu 1977 kugeza mu 1992. Isiganwa rya Dakar Rally ryabereye mur'Afurika y'Amajyaruguru kuva mu 1979 kugeza mu 2007, harimo inzira ya Ruguru-Amajyepfo mu 1992 n'inzira ya Iburengerazuba-Iburasirazuba mu 2000.\nJody Scheckter niwemushoferi wenyine w\u2019imodoka ukomoka mur'Afurika wegukanye Formula 1 mu 1979, mu gihe Tony Maggs na John Love batsinze ibitegobyinshi. Giniel de Villiers yegukanye Dakar Rally mu 2009. Muri Motos, Afurika y'Epfo yari ifite/ifite abakinnyi bazwi nka Kork Ballington, Jon Ekerold, ubu akaba na Brad Binder, mu gihe abashoferi bo muri Rhodes barimo Ray Amm na Jim Redman.\nTenisi.\nTenisi numukino w\u2019abantu bake mur'Afurika. \nAbakinnyi bazwibarimo Kevin Anderson, Irene Bowder Peacock, Jaroslav Drobn\u00fd, Cliff Drysdale, Kevin Curren, Wayne Ferreira, Johan Kriek, Brian Norton, Sandra Reynolds, Eric Sturgess, Ian Vermaak, Amanda Coetzer na Kevin Anderson.\nIrushanwa rya South African Open ryari mwirushanwa rya Grand Prix kuvamu 1972 kugeza mu 1989 ndetse n'irushanwa rya ATP Tour kuva mu 1990 kugeza mu 2011.\nSiporo yo mu mazi.\nSiporo zomumazi zikunzwe cyane mubihugu byokunkombe z'inyanja, kunkengero z'ibiyaga bigari n'imigezi. Gutembera mubwato, gukaraba, gukaraba mumazi ni ubwoko burikwiyongera muri Kenya, Afurika y'Epfo, Zambiya, u Rwanda na Uganda. Ishobora kwishimirwa haba nk'umukino ndetse n'uburyo bw'ubukerarugendo bukora, bwagenewe amatsinda y'abitabiriye imikino itandukanye n'urwego rw'imyitozo.\nSiporo yo kurwana.\nHariho kandamarushanwa akomeye y\u2019imikino yo kurwana n\u2019imikino yo kurwana kumugabane.\nIteramakofe.\nLouis Phal niwewabaye umukinnyi wambere w\u2019umunyafurika watwaye igikombe cy\u2019isi cy\u2019iteramakofe. Hari indi myaka 40 yagombaga gutsindira undimukinnyi watwaye igikombe cy\u2019isi cy\u2019iteramakofe mu ishusho ya Richard Ihetu. Hagati aho, nta buryo bwo kuyobora imikino y\u2019iteramakofe bwabigize umwuga bwari buhari muri Afurika kugeza mu 1973, ubwo abahagarariye ibihugu icyenda bya Afurika bashingaga Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019iteramakofe mur'Afurika. Kuya 30 Ukwakira 1974, Muhammad Ali na George Foreman barwaniye igikombe cy\u2019abaremereye muri Zaire cyaje kwitwa Rumble in the Jungle.\nAfurika imazegutsindira igikombe cy\u2019isi cya shampiyona nyinshi, Azumah Nelson akaba ariwe uzwi cyane. [[\nJudo.\nAfurika ntabwirabona umuntu utsinda muri Judo kwisi. Shampiyona ya Judo mur'Afurika niyo marushanwa akomeye ya Judo muri Afurika.\nKarate.\nKarate yatangijwe bwambere mur'Afurika mumyaka ya 1960. Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Abanyafurika ry\u2019Ishyirahamwe rya Karate niryo rishinzwe karate muri Afurika.\nUbumenyi bw'imirwano buvanze.\nAbahanzi bakomeye bomur'Afurika barimo Israel Adesanya, umukinnyi wa UFC muburebure bwo hagati, Kamaru Usman, umukinnyi wa UFC muburebure bwohagati, na Francis Ngannou, umukinnyi wa UFC mu burebure bwo hejuru.\nIrushanwa rya Extreme Fighting Championship (ryahoze ryitwa EFC Africa) nikigo cy'Afurika y'Epfo cyashinzwe mu 2009. Niryo shyirahamwe ryambere ry\u2019imikino yo kurwana ivanze ku mugabane w'Afurika. \nEFC Africa 19, yabereye muri Carnival City i Johannesburg kuya 19 Mata 2013, yayoboyizindi mikino mur'Afurika aho yarebwe abantubarenga miliyoni 1.8, aho 31.3% by'abareba televiziyo muri Afurika y'Epfo (SABC, e.tv na DStv byose hamwe) byashyizwe hamwe. Aya niyo manota menshi mu mateka ya EFC, arenga agahigo ka EFC Africa 12 kokurebwa abantu miliyoni 1.6 na 25.9% by'abareba. EFC 85 yasubitswe kubera icyorezo cya COVID-19.\nTaekwondo.\nTaekwondo irimo gukuruko abantubenshi bitabira imikino Olempike. Afurika irimo kuzamuka nk'ikipe ikomeye muri Taekwondo. Taekwondo iyoborwa n'Ishyirahamwe ry'Abanyafurika rya Taekwondo.\nIbirori.\nAfurika y'Epfo yakiriye igikombe cy'isi cya Rugby cyo mu 1995, igikombe cy'isi cya Cricket cyo mu 2003 n'igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cyo mu 2010. Afurika yakiriyimikino ya Pan Arab esheshatu n'imikino ya Mediterane esheshatu. Durban, Afurika y'Epfo yatangajwe nk'iyakiriye imikino ya Commonwealth yo mu 2022 mu 2015, arikoyangiwe kwakirimikino muri 2017. \nAmarushanwa akomeye kumugabane w'Afurika nimikino y'Afurika, Igikombe cy'Ibihugu bya Afurika, CAF Champions League, Shampiyona ya Afurika mu mikino ngororamubiri, Shampiyona ya Afurika mu marushanwa ya Rally na Sunshine Tour.\nIbirori byo mu karere.\nAfurika y'Iburasirazuba.\nIcyiciro cya mbere cy'imikino y'Umuryango w'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba (EACoG) (2018). \nOlempike y'imbeho.\nAbantu benshi bo mu bihugu by'Afurika bahagarariye ibihugu by'Afurika mu mikino Olempike y'itumba. "}
{"id": "21896", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21896", "title": "Ibihugu byo mu turere dushyuha mu mikino Olempike y'itumba", "text": "Ibihugu byinshi byomu turere dushyuha byitabiriye imikino Olempike y'itumba nubwonta kirere gifite cyokuyikoresha mugihe cy'itumba. Impamvu imwe nuko ibyobitabiriye ari inkuru zishishikaje abantu mu gihe cy'imikino. \nIgihugu cyambere cy\u2019ubushyuhe, arikokitari icy\u2019ubushyuhe bwuzuye, cyitabiriye imikino Olempike y\u2019itumba ni Megizike. Igice kinini cya Megizike kiri mumajyaruguru y\u2019Uburengerazuba bwa Tropic of Cancer, kandi igice kinini cy\u2019igihugu gifite ikirere cy\u2019imisozi miremire cyangwa ikirere cy\u2019ubushyuhe, bityo si igihugu cy\u2019ubushyuhe gusa. Nubwo bimezebityo, Megizike yakinnye imikino Olempike y\u2019itumba mu mikino Olempike y\u2019itumba yo mu 1928 ifite ikipe y\u2019abakinnyi batanu ba bobsleigh, yarangije ari iya cumi n\u2019imwe murimakumyabiri na batatu bitabiriye. Megizike ntiyagarutse mu mikino y\u2019itumba kugeza ku mikino Olempike y\u2019itumba yo mu 1984. \nIgihugu cyambere cy\u2019ubushyuhe cyitabiriye imikino Olempike y\u2019itumba ni Filipine, yohereje abasiganwa babiri bomumisozi miremire mumikino Olempike y\u2019itumba yo mu 1972 yabereye i Sapporo, mu Buyapani. Ben Nanasca yaje ku mwanya wa 42 mugusiganwa ku rubura nini cyane (mu bitabiriye 73), naho Juan Cipriano ntiyarangije. Mugusiganwa ku rubura, nta n'umwe mu basiganwa bo mu misozi washoboye kurangiza. Costa Rica yabaye igihugu cya kabiri cyo mu turere dushyuha cyitabiriye imikino y\u2019itumba, mu mikino Olempike y\u2019itumba yo mu 1980 yabereye i Lake Placid, New York, aho Arturo Kinch yanitabiriye imikino yogusiganwa ku rubura. Kinch yazakomeza guhatanira Costa Rica mu yindi mikino itatu y\u2019itumba, harimo n\u2019imikino Olempike y\u2019itumba yo mu 2006 afite imyaka 49. Aho niho yarangije ari uwa 96 mu myaka 15\u00a0Irushanwa ryo gusiganwa ku rubura mu misozi miremire ya km, ribanziriza Prawat Nagvajara yo muri Tayilande gusa, ikindi gihugu gishyuha. \nOlempike y'itumba yomu 1988 yabereye i Calgary, Alberta, muri Kanada yakuruye ibihugu byinshi byo mu turere dushyuha, birimo Kosita Rika, Fiji, Guam, Gwatemala, Jamayika, Antilles zo mu Buholandi, Filipine, Porto Rico, n'Ibirwa bya Virgin bya Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Ikipe ya bobsleigh ya Jamayika yakunze abafana muriyimikino ndetse nyumayaho yajekuba intandaro ya filime \"Cool Runnings\" yomu 1993. Mumikino Olempike y'itumba yo mu 1994 nyuma y'imyaka itandatu, umukinnyi wa Jamayika witwa four-man sled yabonye umwanya wa cumi n'ine, imbere ya Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika n'Uburusiya, mu gihe Lascelles Brown wavukiye muri Jamayika yatsindiye Canada umwenda wa feza mu 2006.\nOlempike y'itumba yomu 2006 yabereye i Turin mu Butaliyani niyoyabaye iyambere mumikino y'itumba muri Etiyopiya na Madagasikari. Olempike y'itumba yo mu 2010 yabereye i Vancouver, British Columbia, muri Kanada niyo yabaye iya mbere mu birwa bya Cayman, Kolombiya, Peru, na Ghana. Olempike y'itumba yo mu 2014 niyoyabaye iyambere mu mikino ya Dominica, Paraguay, Timor-Leste, Togo, Tonga, na Zimbabwe. Olempike y'itumba yo mu 2018 niyo yabaye iya mbere mumikino ya Ekwateri, Eritrea, Maleziya, Nijeriya, na Singapuru. Olempike y'itumba yo mu 2022 niyo yabaye iya mbere muri Hayiti. Olempike y'itumba yo mu 2026 niyo yabaye iya mbere muri Benin na Guinea-Bissau.\nKuya 14 Gashyantare 2026, umukinnyi womumisozi miremire witwa Lucas Pinheiro Braathen, wavukiye muri Noruveje ku mubyeyi w\u2019Umunyabrezili akaba na se w\u2019Umunyanoruveje, yabaye umukinnyi wa mbere wo muri Amerika y\u2019Epfo, Amerika y\u2019Epfo na Brezili ndetse n\u2019umukinnyi wa mbere uhagarariye igihugu icyo aricyo cyose gishyuha watsindiye umudari mumikino Olempike y\u2019itumba afite zahabu mwirushanwa rikomeye ry\u2019abagabo rya slalom. Pinheiro Braathen ni Umunyabezili na Noruveje kandi yahoze ahatanira Noruveje, ariko nyuma azakwerekeza muri Brezili. \nUrutonde rw'ibihugu bishyuha byitabiriye.\nUrurutonde rw'ibihugu rurimo ibinyoma byose cyangwa byiganjemo muturere dushyuha kandi bifite ikirere gishyuha cyanecyane hakurikijwe uburyo bwa K\u00f6ppen bwogushyira mu byiciro ikirere. Haragaragazwa ubwitabire bw'imyaka ya Olempike y'itumba.\nIbindibihugu bishyushye (biherereye muturere dushyuha, urugero) byitabiriye imikino y'itumba birimo Ositaraliya (ifite akarere gashyuha cyane mumajyaruguru, ikabayarabaye igihugu cya mbere cyo mu majyepfo y'isi cyatsindiye umudari wa zahabu mumikino Olempike y'itumba mu 2002), Bermuda, Taipei y'Ubushinwa, Eswatini, Hong Kong, Ubuhinde, Mexique, Afurika y'Epfo, Uruguay n'ibindi bihugu byinshi byo muri Afurika y'Amajyaruguru birimo Alijeriya, Misiri na Maroc.\nTonga yashatse kugaragara mumikino Olempike y'itumba mumikino Olempike yo mu gihe cy'itumba yo mu 2010 yinjiza umukinnyi umwe mu irushanwa, bikurura abantu bamwe mu itangazamakuru, ariko yaguye mucyiciro cyanyuma cy'amajonjora. Nyuma y'imyaka ibiri, yongeye gukurura abantu mu itangazamakuru ubwo byagaragaraga koyahinduye izinarye aryiyita umwe mu baterankunga be, ikigo cy'imyenda y'imbere, nk'umucuruzi. Icyogihe yari mumyitozo yo kugerageza kwinjira mu mikino Olempike y'itumba yo mu 2014. \nImikino ya Paralempike y'itumba.\nKugezamu 2022, ibihugu bitatu byomuturere dushyuha ni byo byahagarariwe mu mikino ya Paralympic y'itumba. Tofiri Kibuuka womuri Uganda yitabiriye umukino wo gusiganwa ku rubura mu mikino ya Paralympic y'itumba mu 1976 no mu mikino yo mu 1980. Nyuma y'uko Kibuuka abonye ubwenegihugu bwa Noruveje, yatangiye guhatanira Noruveje mu mikino Paralympic kuvamu 1984, atsindira imidari myinshi mu mikino ngororamubiri mu mikino Paralympic y'impeshyi. Brezili yohereje abakinnyi babiri mumukino wayo wa mbere muri Paralympic y'itumba ya 2014. Porto Rico yohereje umukinnyi umwemumukino wayo wa mbere muri Paralympic y'itumba ya 2022. El Salvador na Haiti biteganijwe kugaragara muri Paralympic y'itumba ya 2026, buri mukinnyi umwe, bikongeraho ibihugu bine byomuturere dushyuha, byinshi kugezubu.\nImikino Olempike y'ingimbi n'abangavu mu gihe cy'itumba.\nIbihugu bitanubyo muturere dushyuha byahagarariwe mumikino Olempike yambere y'urubyiruko mu gihe cy'itumba yabereye muri Innsbruck, muri Otirishiya.\nMumwaka wa 2020, Diego Amaya womuri Kolombiya yegukanye umudari wa feza mwirushanwa ryo gusiganwa ku maguru ry\u2019abahungu. Nubwambere mumateka umukinnyi womugihugu gishyuha n\u2019umunyamerika y\u2019Epfo begukanye umudari mu irushanwa rya Olempike ry\u2019itumba. Nyuma y\u2019imyaka ine, Agnese Campeol womuri Tayilande yegukanye umudari wa feza mu irushanwa ry\u2019abagore rya bobsleigh, naho Zion Beth\u00f4nico wo muri Brezili yegukana umudari wa bronze mwirushanwa ry\u2019abagabo ryo gusiganwa kurubura. "}
